any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose any target, then choose another target for each time this spell was kicked. Comet Storm deals X damage to each of them.', 'Multikicker {1} (You may pay an additional {1} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nChoose target creature, then choose another target creature for each time this spell was kicked. Put X +1/+1 counters on each of them.', 'Mutate {1}{B}{G}{U} (If you cast this spell for its mutate cost, put it over or under target non-Human creature you own. They mutate into the creature on top plus all abilities from under it.)\\nTrample\\nWhenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, return target creature card with mutate from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Mutate {3}{G} (If you cast this spell for its mutate cost, put it over or under target non-Human creature you own. They mutate into the creature on top plus all abilities from under it.)\\nTrample\\nWhenever this creature mutates, destroy target noncreature permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', "Mutate {4}{B} (If you cast this spell for its mutate cost, put it over or under target non-Human creature you own. They mutate into the creature on top plus all abilities from under it.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever this creature mutates, exile the top card of each opponent's library face down. You may look at and play those cards for as long as they remain exiled.", 'Mutate {5}{U} (If you cast this spell for its mutate cost, put it over or under target non-Human creature you own. They mutate into the creature on top plus all abilities from under it.)\\nFlying\\nWhenever this creature mutates, gain control of target noncreature artifact.', 'Myriad Landscape enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Myriad Landscape: Search your library for up to two basic land cards that share a land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Mystic Monastery enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}, {R}, or {W}.', 'No more than one creature can attack each combat.\\nNo more than one creature can block each combat.', 'Nomad Outpost enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}, {W}, or {B}.', 'Opulent Palace enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}, {G}, or {U}.', 'Oran-Rief, the Vastwood enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each green creature that entered the battlefield this turn.', "Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Orzhov Basilica enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {W}{B}.", 'Partner with Brallin, Skyshark Rider\\nFlying\\nWhenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Shabraz, the Skyshark and you gain 1 life.\\n{W/U}: Target Human gains flying until end of turn.', "Partner with Cazur, Ruthless Stalker (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Cazur into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nUkkima, Stalking Shadow can't be blocked.\\nWhen Ukkima leaves the battlefield, it deals X damage to target player and you gain X life, where X is its power.", "Partner with Haldan, Avid Arcanist\\nHaste\\nWhenever Pako, Arcane Retriever attacks, exile the top card of each player's library and put a fetch counter on each of them. Put a +1/+1 counter on Pako for each noncreature card exiled this way.", "Partner with Nikara, Lair Scavenger\\nVigilance\\nWhen Yannik, Scavenging Sentinel enters the battlefield, exile another creature you control until Yannik leaves the battlefield. When you do, distribute X +1/+1 counters among any number of target creatures, where X is the exiled creature's power.", 'Partner with Pako, Arcane Retriever (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Pako into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nYou may play lands and cast noncreature spells from among cards you exiled that have fetch counters on them, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast those spells.', 'Partner with Shabraz, the Skyshark (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Shabraz into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever you discard a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Brallin, Skyshark Rider and it deals 1 damage to each opponent.\\n{R}: Target Shark gains trample until end of turn.', 'Partner with Silvar, Devourer of the Free (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Silvar into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if you attacked this turn, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token.', 'Partner with Trynn, Champion of Freedom (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Trynn into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nMenace\\nSacrifice a Human: Put a +1/+1 counter on Silvar, Devourer of the Free. It gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'Partner with Ukkima, Stalking Shadow (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Ukkima into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Partner with Yannik, Scavenging Sentinel (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Yannik into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nMenace\\nWhenever another creature you control leaves the battlefield, if it had one or more counters on it, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Path of Ancestry enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. When that mana is spent to cast a creature spell that shares a creature type with your commander, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom.)", 'Play with the top card of your library revealed.\\nYou may cast instant and sorcery spells from the top of your library.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell from your library, copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Prophetic Bolt deals 4 damage to any target. Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Psychosis Crawler's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in your hand.\\nWhenever you draw a card, each opponent loses 1 life.", "Put target nonland permanent into its owner's library just beneath the top X cards of that library.", "Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{R}.", 'Reach\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, mill two cards.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Exile Nyx Weaver: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Remote Isle enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Return an instant card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\\nRebound (If you cast this spell from your hand, exile it as it resolves. At the beginning of your next upkeep, you may cast this card from exile without paying its mana cost.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield. Each of those creatures is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types. Put Ever After on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Reveal the top X cards of your library. Put all land cards from among them onto the battlefield tapped and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\nSpell mastery — If there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard, untap those lands.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. You may put a creature or land card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', 'Reveal the top seven cards of your library. Choose from among them a card with flying, a card with first strike, and so on for double strike, deathtouch, haste, hexproof, indestructible, lifelink, menace, reach, trample, and vigilance. Put one of the chosen cards onto the battlefield, the other chosen cards into your hand, and the rest into your graveyard.', 'Rupture Spire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rupture Spire enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sacrifice Sakura-Tribe Elder: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Sandsteppe Citadel enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}, {B}, or {G}.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal those cards, put one onto the battlefield tapped and the other into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", "Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Simic Growth Chamber enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{U}.", 'Slice and Dice deals 4 damage to each creature.\\nCycling {2}{R} ({2}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Slice and Dice, you may have it deal 1 damage to each creature.', 'Smoldering Crater enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Soaring Seacliff enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Soaring Seacliff enters the battlefield, target creature gains flying until end of turn.\\n{T}: Add {U}.', "Split second (As long as this spell is on the stack, players can't cast spells or activate abilities that aren't mana abilities.)\\nDestroy target artifact or enchantment.", 'Starstorm deals X damage to each creature.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Strive — This spell costs {1}{W} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target opponents. Create X 1/1 white Human Soldier creature tokens, where X is the number of creatures those opponents control.', 'Target opponent exiles the top X cards of their library. You may cast any number of spells with mana value X or less from among them without paying their mana costs.', "The owner of target permanent shuffles it into their library, then reveals the top card of their library. If it's a permanent card, they put it onto the battlefield.", "Trample\\nSplinterfright's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, mill two cards.", 'Vastwood Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhen Vastwood Hydra dies, you may distribute a number of +1/+1 counters equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on Vastwood Hydra among any number of creatures you control.', "Vigilance, haste\\nKelsien, the Plague gets +1/+1 for each experience counter you have.\\n{T}: Kelsien deals 1 damage to target creature you don't control. When that creature dies this turn, you get an experience counter.", "Vigilance, trample\\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Vigilance\\nAs Riders of Gavony enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nHuman creatures you control have protection from creatures of the chosen type.', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Cataclysmic Gearhulk enters the battlefield, each player chooses an artifact, a creature, an enchantment, and a planeswalker from among the nonland permanents they control, then sacrifices the rest.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Sun Titan enters the battlefield or attacks, you may return target permanent card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Vigilance\\n{5}{W}{W}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Kalemne's Captain becomes monstrous, exile all artifacts and enchantments.", "Vigilance\\n{T}, Sacrifice Bounty Agent: Destroy target legendary permanent that's an artifact, creature, or enchantment.", 'When Abzan Ascendancy enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.\\nWhenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', "When Banisher Priest enters the battlefield, exile target creature an opponent controls until Banisher Priest leaves the battlefield. (That creature returns under its owner's control.)", "When Deadbridge Chant enters the battlefield, mill ten cards.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, choose a card at random in your graveyard. If it's a creature card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", "When Disciple of Bolas enters the battlefield, sacrifice another creature. You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is that creature's power.", "When Jirina Kudro enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token for each time you've cast a commander from the command zone this game.\\nOther Humans you control get +2/+0.", 'When Kathril, Aspect Warper enters the battlefield, put a flying counter on any creature you control if a creature card in your graveyard has flying. Repeat this process for first strike, double strike, deathtouch, hexproof, indestructible, lifelink, menace, reach, trample, and vigilance. Then put a +1/+1 counter on Kathril for each counter put on a creature this way.', 'When Masked Admirers enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, you may pay {G}{G}. If you do, return Masked Admirers from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When New Perspectives enters the battlefield, draw three cards.\\nAs long as you have seven or more cards in hand, you may pay {0} rather than pay cycling costs.', 'When Reclamation Sage enters the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Satyr Wayfinder enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them into your hand. Put the rest into your graveyard.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', "When Thalia's Lieutenant enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each other Human you control.\\nWhenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Thalia's Lieutenant.", "When Together Forever enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\n{1}: Choose target creature with a counter on it. When that creature dies this turn, return that card to its owner's hand.", 'When Wort, the Raidmother enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red and green Goblin Warrior creature tokens.\\nEach red or green instant or sorcery spell you cast has conspire. (As you cast the spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose new targets for the copy.)', 'When you cast this spell, reveal the top X cards of your library. You may put a nonland permanent card with mana value X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Then shuffle the rest into your library.\\nGenesis Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.', "Whenever Etali, Primal Storm attacks, exile the top card of each player's library, then you may cast any number of spells from among those cards without paying their mana costs.", 'Whenever Nascent Metamorph attacks or blocks, target opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. Nascent Metamorph becomes a copy of that card until end of turn. Then that player puts all cards revealed this way on the bottom of their library in a random order.', 'Whenever Xathrid Necromancer or another Human creature you control dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever Zulaport Cutthroat or another creature you control dies, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever a Human enters the battlefield under your control, Vigilante Justice deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Whenever a creature you control attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking creature that shares a creature type with it.', "Whenever a player casts a spell, if it's not their turn, that player draws a card.", 'Whenever a player cycles a card, you may pay {1}. If you do, Lightning Rift deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Whenever a player discards a card, you may pay {W}. If you do, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Whenever one or more creatures attack one of your opponents or a planeswalker they control, those creatures gain menace until end of turn.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue Bird Illusion creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, you may copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Whenever you cast an instant spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast your first instant spell each turn, if Kalamax, the Stormsire is tapped, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\\nWhenever you copy an instant spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Kalamax.', "Whenever you cast your first spell each turn, reveal the top card of your library. You may cast it without paying its mana cost if it's a spell with lesser mana value. If you don't cast it, put it into your hand.", "Whenever you cycle Astral Drift or cycle another card while Astral Drift is on the battlefield, you may exile target creature. If you do, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\\nCycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Whenever you cycle a card, you may have Crystalline Resonance become a copy of another target permanent until your next turn, except it has this ability.', 'Whenever you cycle or discard a card, you may pay {1}. If you do, create a 2/2 blue Drake creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you discard a creature card, put a +1/+1 counter on Surly Badgersaur.\\nWhenever you discard a land card, create a Treasure token. (It\'s an artifact with "{T}, Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color.")\\nWhenever you discard a noncreature, nonland card, Surly Badgersaur fights up to one target creature you don\'t control.', 'Whenever you draw a card, you may put a hoofprint counter on Hoofprints of the Stag.\\n{2}{W}, Remove four hoofprint counters from Hoofprints of the Stag: Create a 4/4 white Elemental creature token with flying. Activate only during your turn.', 'You draw three cards and you lose 3 life.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "You may cast spells that have a cycling ability from your graveyard.\\nIf a card that has a cycling ability would be put into your graveyard from anywhere and it wasn't cycled, exile it instead.", 'You may pay {0} rather than pay the cycling cost of the first card you cycle each turn.\\nWhenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 2/2 red and white Dinosaur Cat creature token.', '[+1]: Create two 3/1 red Elemental creature tokens with haste. Exile them at the beginning of the next end step.\\n[0]: Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards plus one.\\n[−X]: Chandra, Flamecaller deals X damage to each creature.', "[+1]: Until your next turn, whenever a creature an opponent controls attacks, it gets -1/-0 until end of turn.\\n[−2]: Reveal the top three cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other on the bottom of your library in any order.\\n[−8]: For each player, search that player's library for a nonland card and exile it, then that player shuffles. You may cast those cards without paying their mana costs.", '[+2]: Reveal the top three cards of your library. Put all nonland permanent cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\n[−2]: Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.\\n[−9]: Put five +1/+1 counters on each creature you control and five loyalty counters on each other planeswalker you control.', "[+2]: Scry 2.\\n[0]: Look at the top card of your library. If it's a land card or a creature card with mana value less than or equal to the number of loyalty counters on Nissa, Steward of Elements, you may put that card onto the battlefield.\\n[−6]: Untap up to two target lands you control. They become 5/5 Elemental creatures with flying and haste until end of turn. They're still lands.", '[+2]: You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\\n[−2]: Exile target enchantment, tapped artifact, or tapped creature.\\n[−8]: Search your library for an artifact or creature card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle. It gains haste. Return it to your hand at the beginning of the next end step.', '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{U}.', '{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Magus of the Wheel: Each player discards their hand, then draws seven cards.', '{3}{R}: Gain control of target creature an opponent controls until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}, Put a soul counter on Netherborn Altar: Put your commander into your hand from the command zone. Then you lose 3 life for each soul counter on Netherborn Altar.', '{T}, Tap two untapped Humans you control: Exile target artifact or enchantment.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{4}, {T}: Each player who controls a permanent named Bonder's Ornament draws a card.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\nBasic landcycling {1} ({1}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Move a counter from target permanent you control onto another target permanent. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, Exile a land card from your graveyard: Hostile Desert becomes a 3/4 Elemental creature until end of turn. It's still a land.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice a Desert: Exile all graveyards.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile target creature you control.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Endless Sands: Return each creature card exiled with Endless Sands to the battlefield under its owner's control.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Llanowar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Yavimaya Coast deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Battlefield Forge deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Caves of Koilos deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +X/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', "{T}: Add {R}{R}.\\nAt the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player may put a doom counter on Lavabrink Floodgates or remove a doom counter from it. Then if it has three or more doom counters on it, sacrifice Lavabrink Floodgates. When you do, it deals 6 damage to each creature.", '{T}: Create a 1/1 white Human creature token.\\nFateful hour — As long as you have 5 or less life, other creatures you control get +2/+2.', '{T}: Draw two cards. Target opponent gains control of Humble Defector. Activate only during your turn.', '{T}: Untap another target permanent.\\nCycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Vizier of Tumbling Sands, untap target permanent.', "{U}, {T}: Draw two cards.\\n{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Mercurial Chemister deals damage to target creature equal to the discarded card's mana value."]
flavor: ['"Aim for an eye. Better they never see you."', '"Animals commune with their environment without the need for language. Theirs is a fundamental connection that surpasses flimsy words."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"As a boulder diverts a stream, the crystals bend life around them."\\n—Rielle, the Everwise', '"Beauty determines value, and we determine beauty."', '"Better the dead depart utterly than be enslaved."', '"By Avacyn\'s decree, we shall cleanse these relics of their demonic past."', '"Captain, your units are the tip of our spear. There is zero room for failure."\\n—Jirina Kudro', '"Conquering your first world is the hardest, after all. My power grew as I moved from world to world, taking anything that would make the next taking easier."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"Eldrazi? Ha! Try walking through Zulaport at night with your pockets full. Now *that\'s* dangerous."', '"Fate is not as fixed as you might think."', '"Fear holds no place in faith\'s battle plan."', '"Found families deserve a family crest too."\\n—Kinnan, bonder prodigy', '"From shards and splinters I call forth my living horde."\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcerer', '"Give up these unnatural weapons, these scrolls. Heart and mind and fist are enough."\\n—Zyd, Kamahlite druid', '"Greet death with sword in hand."', '"Have you ever held a Boros signet? There\'s a weight to it that belies its size—a weight of strength and of pride."\\n—Agrus Kos', '"Hunt somewhere else. This is your only warning."\\n—Gavi, nest warden', '"I can no longer sit in my workshop and ignore the events outside. My hammers strike for the people of Ghirapur."', '"I don\'t have anything against Snapdax. I\'m just more of a dog person."', '"I love what they\'ve done with the place."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"I serve only justice. But through that duty, I serve all of Ravnica."', '"I teach the cubs how to kill the two-legs quickly, and why it\'s best for the pride."', '"I\'m pleased this world has learned the moon affects more than the tides."\\n—Tamiyo, the Moon Sage', '"If that brain can\'t figure out the secret of the serum, then add more brains."\\n—Rhmir, Hand of the Augur', '"If you don\'t break camp as you leave, you\'ll return to find it broken for you."\\n—Jonald, mission naturalist', '"If you think you\'ve killed one, guess again."\\n—Thalia, Knight-Cathar', '"If you want to truly test your survival skills, walk the Obelisk Path when the drakes are feeding."\\n—Etha, initiate of Rhet crop', '"Inspiration is found by looking outward."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, sage lifecrafter', '"It generates power by harnessing the nature of possibility itself."\\n"But will it work?"\\n". . . Possibly."', '"It has been my experience that disasters like to strike in pairs."', '"It is hope, hooved and winged."\\n—Cymede, queen of Akros', '"It is the nature of souls that they burn more brightly together than apart."\\n—Vessifrus, flamekin demagogue', '"It was a strange morning. When we awoke, we found our trees transformed. We didn\'t know whether to water them or polish them."\\n—Pulan, Bant orchardist', '"Jealous of storms, Vadrok took lightning from the sky and buried it deep under the earth. It still rumbles there, longing to escape."\\n—*Tales of the Ozolith*', '"Lately I\'ve seen the biggest bounties of my career—and for the biggest names."', '"Lord Bolas has shown me how each miserable little life holds untold resources."', '"Many must die for the one who should not have perished."', '"Monster or human, my rate\'s the same."', '"Monsters dwell in every heart. We only think civilization tames them." ―Euphemia, Nexus watcher', '"My commands shall echo forever in their dusty skulls."', '"My specialty is theoretical universal limits and ways to circumvent them."', '"Never forget our ancestors. They have not forgotten us."\\n—Mikaeus, the Lunarch', '"Oathbreaker, I cast you out!"', '"Oh, you fellas are going to love the lockup. Excellent gruel. Very low ceilings."\\n—Libuse, Boros sergeant', '"Only the weak imprison themselves behind walls. We live free under the wind, and our freedom makes us strong."\\n—Zurgo, khan of the Mardu', '"Rage can be heard throughout the world, but wisdom comes at a whisper."\\n—Rielle, the Everwise', '"Rich" is a relative term.', '"Strength is what keeps us alive. Compassion is what keeps us human."', '"Swarms of the unhallowed claw at Thraben\'s gates! Do you still deny the end approaches?"', '"The answers are here. This is the way through the trial."', '"The cost of your opposition will be extracted from your wits."\\n—Nekusar, the Mindrazer', '"The land grows only where the kami will it."\\n—Dosan the Falling Leaf', '"The most powerful dreams visit those who shelter in a dragon\'s skull."\\n—Chianul, Who Whispers Twice', '"The predator knows the true way of the world. Life is conflict. Only the strong survive."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"The protective wards of the church have weakened, and no one can tell us why. It\'s time to look to our own defenses."\\n—Gregel, militia leader', '"The seas are vast, but the skies are even more so. Why be content with one kingdom when I can rule them both?"', '"The tiniest mouse speaks louder to me than all the festival crowds on Tin Street."', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"They say nothing lasts forever. I say everything lasts forever, just not in the form you may be accustomed to."\\n—Vraska', '"Time is like the Luxa River—though it flows in one direction, it can be diverted."', '"Violence is the food it craves. Feed it if you dare."\\n—Doriel, mentor of Mistral Isle', '"Walls crack. Buildings fall. Always the wilds return."\\n—Domri Rade', '"We are all decaying, always in a state of near-death. One moment without breath and we begin to break down."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"We sail. We plunder. Then we dance."', '"We\'ll distract them. The rest of you, get out of here!"\\n—Alux, Skysail defender', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"When gods become apathetic, the people will worship anyone who answers their pleas."\\n—Kiora', '"Wrath is no vice when inflicted upon the deserving."', '"You may enter, but leave those lifeless things of your world behind."\\n—Modruni, maro-sorcerer', '"You were once Mardu, so your body and will are strong. Now we must train your mind."\\n—Houn, Jeskai elder', '"Zendikar will not surrender, and neither can we."', 'A blazing sun that never sets.', 'A lonely sentinel facing gales, hurricanes, and tides of homicidal spirits.', "A mother's love transcends species.", 'Above the cries, a phrase rang out: "You will all be saved."', 'After lightning struck the cliffs, the ore became iron, the iron became steel, and the steel became greaves. The lightning never left.', 'All crave the Blessed Sleep. Few receive it.', 'All seeds share a common bond, calling to each other across infinity.', 'All suns must set.', 'Alone in the charred desolation of her kingdom, she regretted many things—most of all not acting sooner.', 'Although long since dead, the banished dissenters finally took their vengeance.', "Amonkhet's desiccated land thirsts for blood.", 'Archmage attacks are little more than annoyances to Kalamax.', 'As brilliant as a cut diamond, and with just as cruel an edge.', "As the Eldrazi spread, no secret that could give Zendikar's defenders an advantage was considered too dangerous to seek.", 'As they fought the Eldrazi, many vampires learned to live among humans. Others were unable to make the adjustment.', 'Atarka conquered Qadat, the Fire Rim, long ago, winning over its efreet with a promise to spread the glory of fire to all the world.', 'Cyclical and spiral patterns are the specialty of the Gyre Clade, which seeks to revitalize the cycles of nature.', 'Dappled coats become armored hides. Soft jaws become razor tusks. Nestling play becomes the fight for survival.', 'Do not fear the lightning. Fear the one it obeys.', "Dwarves have an instinct for repair, an inherent understanding of how systems work, and a reputation for fearlessness. They're perfect candidates for the Fair's emergency response team.", "Ever since the disaster, the city's survivors viewed the star-strewn sky with dread.", 'Fortunately, the reanimation spell just missed the long-dead colony of dung scorpions.', 'Fragments of thought refract and multiply, surging in a geyser of dizzying insight.', 'From Otaria, the sun above meets the sea below at a glittering horizon.', 'Gold buys death. Death earns gold.', 'Golgari reclaimers resent the gorgons, begrudging the loss of so many fine nutrients locked away in stone.', 'Held aloft by metabolized magic, trygons are ravenous for sources of mystic fuel.', 'In a world of bright, cloudless skies, she is the dark storm on the horizon.', 'In their final moments, the demons gazed upon grace in its purest form.', 'It begins as a whisper and ends with the red roar of fire.', 'It fears no sword and leaves no bones behind.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It is spoken of only in whispers, visited only by the desperate.', 'It lurks in the spaces between moments.', 'It started as a mere drop of water. The Magic Mirror crystallized it into much more.', 'It took the banning of temporal manipulation at Tolaria West to teach its students the value of time.', 'Its mood changes with the weather, and vice versa.', 'Liliana whispered to whatever consciousness Oketra and Bontu had left. "You are the gods. He is the usurper. You know what to do."', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Lush growth spreads like a ferocious blaze across the Otarian hillsides.', 'Made of bone and boiled in blood, a Rakdos signet is not considered finished until it has been used as a murder weapon.', 'Murky Otarian tides hide the forgotten treacheries of the Phyrexian war.', 'No spot in nature is truly barren.', 'On Otaria, peace and harmony are rare. Places that provide both are cherished.', 'On the continent of Tazeem, rushing waters plunge through narrow canyons into mist-cloaked lakes.', 'On the volcanic continent of Akoum, bizarre vegetation clusters around gas vents, and jagged mountain peaks rise high into the air.', 'Once guarded by the Knights of the Reliquary, the tower stands now protected only by its own remoteness, its dusty treasures open to plunder by anyone.', "Once you've been dragged down the currents of time, you'll never quite trust your own permanence again.", 'Otrimi was disappointed at how quickly its new friend got tired and stopped playing.', 'Rumors float through the city like crows, alighting on citizens seemingly at random.', 'Rumors quickly spread among thieves about a labyrinth without walls and a prize beyond all measures of worth.', 'Scholars say that arbiters exist on every world, created by an unknown hand to enforce justice.', 'She cares little for leaders or loyalties, so long as the battle rages on.', 'She follows the old tributaries built when merrows still shaped the tides.', 'Studying the journals of the necromage Nevinyrral leaves disciples gripped with the urge to exercise his draconian judgment.', 'That which endures, survives.', 'The Abzan turn to this spell only as a last resort, for its inevitable result is what they most dread: to be alone.', 'The Izzet signet is redesigned often, each time becoming closer to a vanity portrait of Niv-Mizzet.', "The Locust God's children were numberless, relentlessly eating away every trace of the city's protection.", 'The carnage of conflicts long past still stains the Otarian soil.', 'The continent of Guul Draz is a geothermal swampland reeking of heat and decay.', 'The continent of Murasa lies beneath a blanket of dense vegetation, its enormous branches tangled so thickly that some inhabitants never see the ground.', 'The continent of Ondu is a vast plateau crisscrossed by deep trenches and meandering rivers.', 'The dense jungle surrenders to a lush and lavish expanse. At its center uncoil the spires of Qarsi Palace.', 'The first satyr to wake after a revel must search for the site of the next one.', "The form of the sigil is just as important as the sigil itself. If it's carried on a medallion, its bearer is a master. If it's tattooed on the body, its bearer is a slave.", 'The magic of the River Heralds is so great that even a single shaman can fend off a pirate landing party.', 'The maze-like design embodies the core of Azorius law—strict structure designed to test wills and stall change.', 'The mind is a beautiful bounty encased in an annoying bone container.', 'The most beautiful souls shine even in death.', 'The sky takes flight and the earth trembles.', 'The storm rages and the earth breaks.', 'There is no gift more precious or more perilous than fire.', 'There may exist powers even greater than Phyrexia.', 'There were no tombstones in orochi territory. Slain warriors were buried with a tree sapling, so they would become a part of the forest after death.', "To consult a sphinx is a test in patience. Perhaps that's the point.", 'To the Golgari, anything buried is treasure.', "Travelers' tales claim that hydras bite off their own heads to make themselves deadlier.", 'Understanding is a matter of perspective.', 'What some see as "distracted" is really "fathoming the unfathomable."', 'When a werewolf changes for the first time, that first howl is said to echo through the wilds till moonset.', 'When asked how many paths reach enlightenment, the monk kicked a heap of sand. "Count," he smiled, "and then find more grains."', 'When defeat is near and guidance is scarce, all eyes look in one direction.', "When the alarm crystals flash, Drannith's finest answer the call.", 'When the last scrap of flesh is scoured away, the Curse of Wandering ends. Then the dead may sleep.', 'When the winds blow out of the abyss, death is the only harvest.', 'Whether hunter or hunted, Kathril chooses when it is seen.', "Zendikar's elves have developed innovative methods to mitigate the effects of the Roil."]
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Alayna Danner', 'Aleksi Briclot', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Antonio José Manzanedo', 'Bartłomiej Gaweł', 'Brian Valeza', 'Campbell White', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Carl Frank', 'Carmen Sinek', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Ciruelo', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Cristi Balanescu', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Fortune', 'Erica Yang', 'Even Amundsen', 'Evyn Fong', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heather Hudson', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Ilse Gort', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Zapata', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Josh Hass', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Leesha Hannigan', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Lindsey Look', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Maciej Kuciara', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Manuel Castañón', 'Mark Brill', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Sass', 'Mila Pesic', 'Min Yum', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Monte Michael Moore', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Omar Rayyan', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Wright', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Shreya Shetty', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stephan Martiniere', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Sung Choi', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Uriah Voth', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne England', 'Wesley Burt', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yohann Schepacz', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zezhou Chen', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
