rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are multiple attacks in a turn, then you have to pay for each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there is more than one Propaganda on the battlefield, the cost is cumulative.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Paying this cost is not an instant or any other kind of ability, it is an additional cost on the declaration of the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The payment is made during the declare attackers step at the same time you are declaring the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This spell is countered and you get no Saprolings if the artifact is an illegal target on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'Fumiko’s ability doesn’t force an opponent to pay for effects in order to be able to attack with their creatures (such as Ghostly Prison, for example).'}, {'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'Fumiko’s ability doesn’t force tapped creatures or creatures with summoning sickness to attack.'}, {'date': '2005-02-01', 'text': 'X is variable. The bushido bonus is calculated each time Fumiko’s bushido trigger resolves, based on the number of attackers at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell that already has replicate while you have this creature on the battlefield, the spell will have two replicate abilities: one with a replicate cost as printed on it, and one with a replicate cost equal to its mana cost. (In this set, both costs are always the same.) You may use either ability, or both abilities, to replicate the spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell that has {X} in its mana cost, the value of X in the spell\'s replicate cost will be the same as the value of X you chose for its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if you declared three different creatures as attackers at any point in the turn. A creature declared as an attacker in two different attack phases counts only once. A creature that entered the battlefield attacking (such as a token created by Militia\'s Pride) doesn\'t count because you never attacked with it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the last ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if a player who is currently your opponent, or a player who was your opponent at the time they left the game, has been dealt 7 damage over the course of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how the opponent was dealt damage or by whom, as long as the total damage is 7 or more. You don\'t specify an opponent when you activate the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "You\'ll get to play the card even if Spinerock Knoll wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the 7 damage was dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads “[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped,” and they now have hideaway 4.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Hideaway N” means “When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains ‘The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\'”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability has you draw multiple cards, Hoofprints of the Stag\'s ability triggers that many times."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "The value chosen for X applies to each X in the spell\'s effect. You pay {X} only once."}]', "[{'date': '2007-10-01', 'text': 'Cairn Wanderer’s ability looks at all cards in all graveyards. It gains any landwalk abilities and any protection abilities.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, only creatures you control trigger the ability and get the bonus, but your teammate\'s attacking creatures are included in the calculation of those bonuses."}, {\'date\': \'2008-04-01\', \'text\': \'This ability counts creatures, not creature types. For example, if you attack with five creatures — an Elf Shaman, an Elf Warrior, a Goblin Shaman, an Elemental, and a creature with all creature types — the ability will trigger five times. Those creatures will get +3/+0, +2/+0, +2/+0, +1/+0, and +4/+0, respectively.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Effects that cause you to pay more or less to cast a spell will cause you to pay that much more or less while casting it for its evoke cost, too. That’s because they affect the total cost of the spell, not its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Evoke doesn’t change the timing of when you can cast the creature that has it. If you could cast that creature spell only when you could cast a sorcery, the same is true for cast it with evoke.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If a creature spell cast with evoke changes controllers before it enters the battlefield, it will still be sacrificed when it enters the battlefield. Similarly, if a creature cast with evoke changes controllers after it enters the battlefield but before its sacrifice ability resolves, it will still be sacrificed. In both cases, the controller of the creature at the time it left the battlefield will control its leaves-the-battlefield ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t use its evoke ability.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'When you cast a spell by paying its evoke cost, its mana cost doesn’t change. You just pay the evoke cost instead.'}, {'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'Whether evoke’s sacrifice ability triggers when the creature enters the battlefield depends on whether the spell’s controller chose to pay the evoke cost, not whether they actually paid it (if it was reduced or otherwise altered by another ability, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Reveillark’s ability may target zero, one, or two creature cards in your graveyard. Each target must have power 2 or less.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "Knight of the White Orchid\'s triggered ability has an “intervening ‘if\' clause.” That means (1) the ability won\'t trigger at all unless any one of your opponents controls more lands than you, and (2) the ability will do nothing if you control at least as many lands as each of your opponents by the time it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The Plains you search for doesn\'t have to be basic. For example, you could put a Sacred Foundry onto the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Plainscycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Plainscycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Plainscycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Plainscycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Plains card. After you find a Plains card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Plains land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Plains card in your library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s second ability affects all permanents that are green creatures that entered the battlefield this turn, not just the ones you control."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oran-Rief\'s third ability cares about permanents\' characteristics at the time the ability resolves, not their characteristics at the time they entered the battlefield. For example, if a blue creature enters the battlefield, then is turned green by a spell or ability, then Oran-Rief\'s second ability resolves, you\'ll put a +1/+1 counter on that creature."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Casting a Trap by paying its alternative cost doesn’t change its mana cost or mana value. The only difference is the cost you actually pay.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Effects that increase or reduce the cost to cast a Trap will apply to whichever cost you chose to pay.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You can target any two creatures, not just ones that entered the battlefield this turn.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You may ignore a Trap’s alternative cost condition and simply cast it for its normal mana cost. This is true even if its alternative cost condition has been met.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'You must target two creatures as you cast Whiplash Trap. If you can’t (because just one creature is on the battlefield, perhaps), you can’t cast the spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'As long as any of its targets are legal at the time Comet Storm resolves, Comet Storm will deal X damage to each of those legal targets.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'Each target you choose must be different.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "For example, if you want Comet Storm to deal 4 damage to each of three different targets, that means X is 4 and you\'re kicking the spell twice. You\'ll pay a mana cost of {4}{R}{R}, plus a kicker cost of {1}, plus another kicker cost of {1}, for a total of {6}{R}{R}."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The number of targets you choose for Comet Storm is one more than the number of times it\'s kicked. First you declare how many times you\'re going to kick the spell (at the same time you declare the value of X), then you choose the targets accordingly, then you pay the costs. No player can respond between the time you declare how many times you\'ll kick the spell and the time you choose the targets."}]', "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'As long as any of its targets are legal at the time Strength of the Tajuru resolves, you’ll put X +1/+1 counters on each of those legal targets.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'Each target you choose must be different.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'For example, if you want to put four +1/+1 counters on each of three different targets, that means X is 4 and you’re kicking the spell twice. You’ll pay a mana cost of {4}{G}{G}, plus a kicker cost of {1}, plus another kicker cost of {1}, for a total of {6}{G}{G}.'}, {'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The number of targets you choose for Strength of the Tajuru is one more than the number of times it’s kicked. First you declare how many times you’re going to kick the spell (at the same time you declare the value of X), then you choose the targets accordingly, then you pay the costs. No player can respond between the time you declare how many times you’ll kick the spell and the time you choose the targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card’s type (if it’s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn’t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won’t get to cast it again next turn.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won’t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won’t go back to exile.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent’s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won’t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel).'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn’t put into your graveyard. Rather, it’s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have multiple instant cards in your graveyard with the same name, and one of them is being targeted by another spell on the stack or is enchanted (with Spellweaver Volute, for example), you must differentiate them so you know which one (if any) is chosen at random. In that case, it may be better to use dice or another method that allows you to differentiate between the instant cards to choose one at random.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you have only one instant card in your graveyard as Surreal Memoir resolves, that’s the one you’ll return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving cards printed earlier than the _Urza’s Saga_ set, you may not reorder your graveyard. In this case, you need to be more careful when selecting an instant card at random, perhaps by using dice, writing the names of the instant cards on slips of paper and choosing one of them randomly, or carefully noting the existing graveyard order so you can reestablish it after performing the method suggested above, for example.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'If you’re playing a format involving only cards from the _Urza’s Saga_(TM) set and later, you may change the order of your graveyard at any time. That means the easiest way to choose an instant card at random from your graveyard is to take all the instant cards in your graveyard, turn them face down, shuffle them, and pick a card. Then you just put the rest back.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don’t cast them from your hand.'}, {'date': '2010-06-15', 'text': 'Surreal Memoir isn’t targeted. You don’t choose an instant card at random from your graveyard until it resolves. Once you randomly select a card, it’s too late for players to respond.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The second ability destroys each creature that\'s tapped at the time it resolves, including creatures you control. If Sunblast Angel has become tapped by the time its ability resolves, it will be destroyed too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the exiled card will trigger when the token is put onto the battlefield. Any "as [this permanent] enters the battlefield" or "[this permanent] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the exiled card will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "Exiling the card as the first ability resolves is optional. If you choose not to exile it, or you can\'t exile it because the card has somehow left the graveyard before the ability resolves, the ability simply doesn\'t do anything as it resolves. Any card currently exiled by Mimic Vat remains exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If Mimic Vat\'s second ability is activated during a turn\'s end step, the token will be exiled at the beginning of the following turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If multiple nontoken creatures are put into their owners\' graveyards from the battlefield at the same time, the imprint ability will trigger that many times. You put the triggered abilities on the stack in any order, so you\'ll determine in which order they resolve. However, since exiling those cards is optional, and choosing to exile a card this way causes the previously exiled cards to return to their owners\' graveyards, the order generally doesn\'t matter: You\'ll wind up with at most one of those cards exiled, and the rest will be in the appropriate graveyards."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost (such as Protean Hydra), X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the token is a copy of a noncreature card, it will still have haste, though that won\'t matter unless that token somehow becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the token isn\'t exiled when the delayed triggered ability resolves (due to Stifle, perhaps), it remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It continues to have haste."}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The imprint ability will trigger whenever a nontoken creature is put into any graveyard from the battlefield, not just your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The token created by the second ability will be a copy of whatever card is exiled with Mimic Vat at the time the ability resolves. This might not be the same card that was exiled with Mimic Vat at the time the ability was activated. It also might not be a creature card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'The token is exiled at the beginning of the next end step regardless of who controls it at that time, whether the exiled card is still exiled at that time, or whether Mimic Vat is still on the battlefield at that time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'You may activate the second ability even if no card has been exiled with Mimic Vat. If no card has been exiled with Mimic Vat by the time the ability resolves, no token will be created.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "You may exile a noncreature card with Mimic Vat\'s first ability. For example, if a nontoken artifact that\'s become a creature is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, Mimic Vat\'s first ability triggers and you may exile that card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If a melded permanent dies and triggers Mimic Vat\'s triggered ability, both of its component cards are exiled. As Mimic Vat\'s second ability resolves, its controller chooses one of those cards to make a token copy of."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the creature that dies is an instant or sorcery card that\'s been manifested, Mimic Vat may have a nonpermanent card exiled. You can\'t create a token that\'s a copy of a nonpermanent card. No token is created in this case."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'A creature whose toughness is being increased by Thraben Doomsayer’s fateful hour ability loses that bonus as soon as its controller has 6 or more life (or as soon as Thraben Doomsayer leaves the battlefield). If damage marked on that creature is greater than or equal to its toughness after the fateful hour ability stops applying, the creature is destroyed and put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'If Thraben Doomsayer’s activated ability resolves while you have 5 or less life, the creature token will be 3/3 as it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-01-22', 'text': 'Each time a creature dies, check whether Predator Ooze had dealt any damage to it at any time during that turn. If so, Predator Ooze’s ability will trigger. It doesn’t matter who controlled the creature or whose graveyard it was put into.'}]", "[{'date': '2011-06-01', 'text': 'If an effect causes you to draw multiple cards, Psychosis Crawler will trigger that many times.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "In most cases, when determining whether a creature entering the battlefield under your control should get a +1/+1 counter, you\'ll simply look at what the creature will looklike on the battlefield. You\'ll consider any effects affecting a creature entering the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The effect is cumulative. Human creatures you control will enter the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter for each Dearly Departed in your graveyard.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', "[{'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'If Splinterfright’s controller has only one card in their library, they put that card into their graveyard.'}, {'date': '2011-09-22', 'text': 'The ability that defines Splinterfright’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield. If Splinterfright is in your graveyard, it will count itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing _Magic_ creature type, such as Zombie or Warrior. Card types such as artifact can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The decision to pay {1} is made when the triggered ability resolves. It’s not an additional cost of the instant spell.'}, {'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability will go on the stack on top of the instant spell and resolve before it.'}]", "[{'date': '2012-05-01', 'text': 'You can tap any two untapped Humans you control, including ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Devout Chaplain’s activated ability. You must have controlled Devout Chaplain continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, however.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': \'All blocking declarations must still be legal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature block and you choose for that creature to block, its controller can choose to pay that cost or not. If that player decides to not pay that cost, you must propose a new set of blocking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "You can decide that a creature won\'t block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "For each library, the search is complete only when you explicitly say it is. For example, you can look through one player\'s library, set that library down, look at another player\'s library, choose a nonland card in the first library, then choose a nonland card in the second library. Don\'t reveal any cards from those libraries to any other player until you exile them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast one, it will remain exiled. Jace\'s ability won\'t allow you to cast it later."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "Jace\'s first ability creates a delayed triggered ability that triggers whenever a creature an opponent controls attacks. It doesn\'t matter which player or planeswalker that creature is attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'Piles can be empty. If one of the piles is empty, you choose to put all the revealed cards in your hand or on the bottom of your library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When casting a card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this card] only during combat,” must be followed."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "When resolving Jace\'s third ability, you search each player\'s library (including yours) and exile the nonland cards before casting any of them."}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards by putting them on the stack one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-10-01\', \'text\': "You pick one of your opponents when Jace\'s second ability resolves. The ability doesn\'t target that opponent. All players may see the revealed cards and offer opinions. You (not your opponent) choose which pile is put into your hand and which pile is put on the bottom of your library."}]', "[{'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the discarded card has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it’s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0.'}, {'date': '2012-10-01', 'text': 'If the discarded card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "Once a battalion ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter how many creatures are still attacking when that ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'The effects of battalion abilities vary from card to card. Read each card carefully.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The three attacking creatures don\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Creatures that come under your control after Frontline Medic\'s battalion ability resolves will not be granted indestructible by this effect."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Because the last ability doesn’t target any card in your graveyard, any card put into your graveyard in response to the ability may be chosen.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Each card in your graveyard must have an equal chance of being chosen. Assigning them each a number and rolling a die is an easy way to do this. In formats that allow you to rearrange your graveyard—including Standard, Modern, and Return to Ravnica block Limited formats, you may also shuffle your graveyard face down and choose a card at random.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The card is chosen at random as the ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, the value of that X is 0.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The mana value of a creature token is 0 unless that token is a copy of another creature, in which case it copies that creature’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the spell being copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Debt to the Deathless has), the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the spell being copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can’t choose a different one.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If the top card of your library changes while you’re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, the new top card won’t be revealed until you finish doing so.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Instant and sorcery cards with miracle allow a player to cast a card immediately upon drawing it. If you cast a spell this way, you’re casting it from your hand, not your library. Melek’s ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Melek doesn’t affect the timing rules associated with when you can cast the card. If it’s a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Melek’s last ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell you cast from your library, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The top card of your library isn’t in your hand, so you can’t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'When the last ability resolves, it creates a copy of the spell. You control the copy. That copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger. The copy will then resolve like a normal spell, after players get a chance to cast spells and activate abilities.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You still pay all costs for that spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs, such as overload costs. Although you can’t pay additional costs for the copy that’s created, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too. For example, if a player sacrifices a 3/3 creature to cast Fling, and you copy it, the copy of Fling will also deal 3 damage to its target.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won\'t affect the copies."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "Spells cast from zones other than a player\'s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren\'t cast and won\'t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Masked Admirers will return to your hand before the creature spell you cast resolves.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The second triggered ability triggers only if Masked Admirers is in your graveyard when you cast a creature spell.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Banisher Priest\'s ability causes a zone change with a duration, a new style of ability that\'s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Oblivion Ring. However, unlike Oblivion Ring, cards like Banisher Priest have a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the creature when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to the battlefield immediately after Banisher Priest leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If Banisher Priest leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If a creature token is exiled, it ceases to exist. It won\'t be returned to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Banisher Priest\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Banisher Priest leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions. The two creatures aren\'t on the battlefield at the same time. For example, if the returning creature is a Clone, it can\'t enter the battlefield as a copy of Banisher Priest."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If Xathrid Necromancer dies at the same time as another Human creature you control, its ability will trigger twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If an effect gives Magus of the Disk indestructible or regenerates it, it won’t be destroyed by its ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'In some unusual cases, Vastwood Hydra will have enough -1/-1 counters put on it to make its toughness 0 or less. If this happens, the ability will still distribute a number of +1/+1 counters equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on Vastwood Hydra before the -1/-1 counters were put on it. For example, if Vastwood Hydra has two +1/+1 counters on it and three -1/-1 counters are put on it, two +1/+1 counters will be distributed.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The ability that triggers when Vastwood Hydra dies doesn’t target any of the creatures. You can choose to put counters on a creature with protection from green, for example.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'You choose how the counters will be distributed when the ability resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'Hybrid mana symbols, monocolored hybrid mana symbols, and Phyrexian mana symbols do count toward your devotion to their color(s).\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If an activated ability or triggered ability has an effect that depends on your devotion to a color, you count the number of mana symbols of that color among the mana costs of permanents you control as the ability resolves. The permanent with that ability will be counted if it\'s still on the battlefield at that time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Mana symbols in the text boxes of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Numeric mana symbols ({0}, {1}, and so on) in mana costs of permanents you control don\'t count toward your devotion to any color."}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature card with bestow for its bestow cost, it becomes an Aura spell and not a creature spell. Karametra\'s last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can use the last ability to put any land card with the subtype Forest or Plains onto the battlefield, not just ones named Forest or Plains.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Karametra enters the battlefield, your devotion to green and white will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply. Because replacement effects are considered before Karametra is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Counters put on Karametra remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Karametra is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Karametra stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes Karametra to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Karametra\'s abilities function as long as it\'s on the battlefield, regardless of whether it\'s a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make Karametra not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "When Karametra enters the battlefield, your devotion to green and white will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield. The mana symbols in Karametra\'s own mana cost are counted when determining this."}]', "[{'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'Once the triggered ability resolves, the attacking Humans will continue to have flying even if Cavalry Pegasus leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-09-15', 'text': 'The attacking Humans gain flying before blockers are declared.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'Exiling the Soul from your graveyard is part of the last ability’s activation cost. A player can’t remove the Soul in response to prevent you from activating the ability.'}, {'date': '2014-07-18', 'text': 'You can activate the last ability only if the Soul is in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "If you choose the third mode, you choose how the counters will be distributed as you cast the spell. Notably, if you choose to put one +1/+1 counter on each of two target creatures, and one of those creatures becomes an illegal target in response, the +1/+1 counter that would have been put on that creature is lost. It can\'t be put on the remaining legal target."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You decide which creature to spare as Duneblast resolves. This choice doesn\'t target the creature. If you don\'t choose a creature, then all creatures will be destroyed."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Crackling Doom doesn’t target any player or creature. For example, a creature with protection from black could be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a player controls two or more creatures tied for the greatest power among creatures they control, that player chooses one of them to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, each opponent, starting with the active player and proceeding in turn order, chooses which creature they will sacrifice and then all creatures are sacrificed at the same time. Each successive player will know what the players before them chose to sacrifice.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The sacrifice is not dependent on the damage being dealt. It doesn’t matter if that damage is prevented or redirected.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the first mode was chosen and either target is an illegal target when Temur Charm tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the first mode was chosen and just the creature you control is an illegal target when Temur Charm tries to resolve, it won’t get +1/+1 until end of turn. If the creature you control is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, the creature you control will get +1/+1 until end of turn.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If the third mode was chosen, creatures with power 3 or less that enter the battlefield after Temur Charm resolves also can’t block. A creature whose power was 4 or greater when Temur Charm resolved but is 3 or less as the declare blockers step begins also can’t block.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You can’t cast Temur Charm choosing the first mode unless you target both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Creature cards that have abilities that grant the listed keyword abilities to themselves won’t count. For example, exiling a Battle Brawler (a creature with “As long as you control a red or white permanent, Battle Brawler gets +1/+0 and has first strike”) with Soulflayer’s delve ability won’t cause Soulflayer to have first strike, even if you control a red or white permanent.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You can’t exile more cards from your graveyard than you’d need to pay Soulflayer’s generic mana requirement. In most situations, this means you can’t exile more than four cards, even if you want to exile more to give it extra abilities.'}, {'date': '2020-01-24', 'text': 'If one of those creature cards has one or more variants of the listed keywords (for example, hexproof from white), this creature gains those specific variants.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Each Siege will have one of the two listed abilities, depending on your choice as it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Each of the last two abilities is linked to the first ability. They each refer only to the choice made as a result of the first ability. If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of one of the Sieges, its controller will make a new choice for that Siege. Which ability the copy has won\'t depend on the choice made for the original permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a noncreature card is manifested and then leaves the battlefield while face down, the “Dragons” ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card using the “Khans” ability, you may play that land only if you have any available land plays. Normally, this means you can play the land only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The card exiled by the “Khans” ability is exiled face up. Playing a card exiled with the “Khans” ability follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if it\'s a creature card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'The words “Khans” and “Dragons” are anchor words, connecting your choice to the appropriate ability. Anchor words are a new rules concept. “[Anchor word] — [Ability]” means “As long as you chose [anchor word] as this permanent entered the battlefield, this permanent has [ability].” Notably, the anchor word “Dragons” has no connection to the creature type Dragon.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t play will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Playing a card this way follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Under normal circumstances, you can play a land card exiled with Commune with Lava only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Check to see if there are two or more instant and/or sorcery cards in your graveyard as the spell resolves to determine whether the spell mastery ability applies. The spell itself won’t count because it’s still on the stack as you make this check.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If the spell mastery ability applies, you untap only the lands put onto the battlefield with Animist’s Awakening.'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'If you have X or less cards in your library, you’ll reveal all the cards from your library, put all land cards from among them onto the battlefield tapped, and then put the rest of the cards back in your library in a random order. (This is effectively the same as shuffling your library, although it’s still not technically a shuffle.)'}, {'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'No player will know the order of the cards put on the bottom of your library. Practically speaking, the cards should be shuffled (although this is not the game action of “shuffling”).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can\'t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can\'t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Skullwinder\'s enters-the-battlefield ability targets only the card in your graveyard. If that card is an illegal target as the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No cards will be returned to any player\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'You choose the opponent as the ability is resolving. You may choose an opponent with no cards in their graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "Skullwinder\'s enters-the-battlefield ability targets only the card in your graveyard. If that card is an illegal target as the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No cards will be returned to any player\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'The chosen opponent gets to choose which card to return from their graveyard to their hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "You choose the target card as you put Skullwinder\'s triggered ability on the stack, but you don\'t choose an opponent until after you have returned the card to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'You may choose an opponent with no cards in their graveyard. In that case, they will not get to return anything.\'}]', "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won’t trigger if that creature isn’t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Monstrous isn’t an ability that the creature has. It’s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it continues to be monstrous.'}, {'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can’t become monstrous again. If Kalemne’s Captain is already monstrous, the activated ability won’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2015-11-04', 'text': 'Creatures that aren’t destroyed this way (perhaps because they regenerated or have indestructible) don’t count toward the life lost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way goes to a zone other than exile or a graveyard, perhaps because one of its abilities says to put it into its owner\'s hand, it won\'t be exiled. This is true even if the card would be put into a graveyard later that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way is countered, it will be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If the instant or sorcery card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the target instant or sorcery card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast it, it will remain in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay alternative costs such as surge costs. You can pay additional costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-01-22\', \'text\': \'You cast the card during the resolution of the enters-the-battlefield ability, not later in the turn. If it\\\'s a sorcery card, ignore the timing restrictions based on it being a sorcery card. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}]', "[{'date': '2016-01-22', 'text': 'You can activate Chandra’s second ability while you have an empty hand. If you do, you’ll draw one card.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'For Chandra’s second ability, it doesn’t matter if the cards don’t go to your graveyard because of a replacement effect. For example, cards with madness discarded this way will still count toward the number of cards you discarded.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Because you consider only the characteristics of a double-faced card\'s front face while it\'s not on the battlefield, the types of its back face won\'t be counted for delirium."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If one of those creatures was enchanted, its Aura won\'t be put into a player\'s graveyard until after Descend upon the Sinful has finished resolving. If the controller of Descend upon the Sinful owned the Aura, it won\'t be in the graveyard in time to be counted for the delirium ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you have three non-sorcery card types among cards in your graveyard at the time Descend upon the Sinful resolves, you won\'t get an Angel token. Descend upon the Sinful isn\'t put into your graveyard until after it\'s finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "In some rare cases, you can have a token or a copy of a spell in your graveyard at the moment that an object\'s delirium ability counts the card types among cards in your graveyard, before that token or copy ceases to exist. Because tokens and copies of spells are not cards, even if they are copies of cards, their types will never be counted."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The card types in Magic are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal (a card type that appears on some older cards). Supertypes (such as legendary and basic) and subtypes (such as Human and Equipment) are not counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The number of card types matters, not the number of cards. For example, Wicker Witch (an artifact creature) along with Catalog (an instant) and Chaplain\'s Blessing (a sorcery) will enable delirium."}]', "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If Thalia’s Lieutenant enters the battlefield at the same time as another Human, each of Thalia’s Lieutenant’s abilities will trigger. You’ll put a +1/+1 counter on both cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If a targeted creature card is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It won’t be both black and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If the artifact or creature put onto the battlefield with Nahiri’s third ability leaves the battlefield before the next end step, it won’t be returned to your hand from its new zone.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'If you find a noncreature artifact with Nahiri’s third ability, it will still gain haste, even though it won’t be meaningful unless that artifact becomes a creature.'}, {'date': '2016-04-08', 'text': 'You can activate Nahiri’s first ability with no intention of discarding a card just to add loyalty to Nahiri.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of any of the abilities Odric can grant your creatures are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Odric\'s ability triggers at the beginning of each combat, not just combat on your turn, whether or not any creatures you control have any of the listed abilities. If a creature gains one of the listed abilities before Odric\'s triggered ability resolves, perhaps due to another ability that triggered at the beginning of combat, then creatures you control will gain that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Odric\'s ability and how they are affected is determined as the ability resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain any abilities or cause creatures to gain new abilities, and the abilities gained won\'t change even if every creature that normally had the abilities leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If one of those creatures has one or more variants of the listed keywords (for example, hexproof from white), creatures you control gain those specific variants.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "As Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability resolves, it creates a copy of a spell on the stack. The copy isn\'t cast, so abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "Dualcaster Mage\'s triggered ability can target (and copy) any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets. It doesn\'t matter who controls it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the copy says that it affects "you," it affects the controller of the copy, not the controller of the original spell. Similarly, if the copy says that it affects an "opponent," it affects an opponent of the copy\\\'s controller, not an opponent of the original spell\\\'s controller.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Earthquake does), the copy has the same value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'If the spell is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode. You can\\\'t choose a different one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional or alternative costs paid for the targeted spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}]', "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If there are fewer than X cards in that player’s library, put that permanent on the bottom of that library.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If you choose 0 as the value for X, put that permanent on top of its owner’s library.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-07-13', 'text': 'If multiple effects say that a creature doesn’t untap during its controller’s next untap step, those effects all apply during one untap step. For example, if you cast two instants in one turn and target the same creature twice with Niblis of Frost’s ability, that creature will only spend one untap step without untapping.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield attacking were never declared as attackers, so they won\'t count toward melee\'s effect. Similarly, if a creature with melee enters the battlefield attacking, melee won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how many creatures you attacked a player with, only that you attacked a player with at least one creature. For example, if you attack one player with Wings of the Guard and another player with five creatures, Wings of the Guard will get +2/+2 until end of turn."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Melee will trigger if the creature with melee attacks a planeswalker. However, the effect counts only opponents (and not planeswalkers) that you attacked with a creature when determining the bonus.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "You determine the size of the bonus as the melee ability resolves. Count each opponent that you attacked with one or more creatures. It doesn\'t matter if the attacking creatures are still attacking or even if they are still on the battlefield. It also doesn\'t matter if the opponent you attacked is still in the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value. For cards in your library with {X} in their mana costs, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Rashmi\'s ability resolves and the spell that caused it to trigger has been countered, use that spell\'s mana value as it last existed on the stack to determine whether or not you may cast the top card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is a land card, you put it into your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, those must be paid to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you cast the top card of your library, you do so as part of the resolution of Rashmi\'s ability. You can\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”) are not."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi has to be on the battlefield at the moment you cast your first spell. If that spell is Rashmi itself, Rashmi\'s ability can\'t trigger. If that spell causes Rashmi to leave the battlefield as an additional cost to cast it, Rashmi\'s ability can\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi\'s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. If you cast a spell using the ability, it will also resolve before the initial spell."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Rashmi\'s ability triggers when you cast your first spell each turn, not just on your turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A permanent with more than one type may be chosen as either of the types or both. For example, an artifact creature may be chosen as the artifact, the creature, or both. Choosing the same permanent twice this way has the same result as choosing it once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Cataclysmic Gearhulk will be sacrificed to its own ability if you don\'t choose it as your artifact or your creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'First the player whose turn it is chooses permanents they control, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. All of the unchosen nonland permanents are then sacrificed simultaneously.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control any permanents of one of the types, you\'ll still choose the permanents of the types you do control."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Lands can\'t be chosen and won\'t be sacrificed, even if they have other types (such as an artifact land)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "All cards in the Aether Revolt set with triggered revolt abilities use an intervening “if” clause. A permanent you controlled must have left the battlefield earlier in the turn in order for these abilities to trigger; otherwise they do nothing. In other words, there\'s no way to have the ability trigger if no permanent you controlled has left the battlefield that turn, even if you intend to have one do so in response to the triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Energy counters aren\'t permanents. Paying {E} won\'t satisfy a revolt ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities check only whether a permanent you controlled left the battlefield this turn or not. They don\'t apply multiple times if more than one permanent you controlled left the battlefield. They don\'t check whether the permanent that left the battlefield is still in the zone it moved to."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Revolt abilities don\'t care why the permanent left the battlefield, who caused it to move, or where it moved to. They\'re equally satisfied by an artifact you sacrificed to pay a cost, a creature you controlled that was destroyed by Murder, or an enchantment you returned to your hand with Leave in the Dust."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Tokens that leave the battlefield will satisfy a revolt ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability will resolve even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The draw step is after the upkeep step, so you\'ll scry 1 before you draw for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While resolving Lifecrafter\'s Bestiary\'s second triggered ability, you can\'t pay {G} multiple times to draw multiple cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The amount of life gained from Ajani\'s second ability is equal to power of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If a spell gains a second instance of conspire from Wort’s ability, you may choose to pay for one, both, or none of those abilities. Each conspire ability triggers only if you tap two creatures specifically for that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Fiery Justice does), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Bonfire of the Damned does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell for its flashback cost, you can’t pay another alternative cost (such as an overload cost or a Trap’s alternative cost) instead. You may pay additional costs, such as conspire.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Some spells instruct you to sacrifice a creature as an additional cost to cast that spell. If you sacrifice Wort to pay that cost, that spell won’t have conspire at the moment it becomes cast, so conspire won’t trigger, even if you tapped two creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn\'t give you permission to discard cards. You\'ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If Hostile Desert becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can\'t attack with it or tap it for mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn’t give you permission to discard cards. You’ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Drake Haven’s triggered ability, you can’t pay {1} multiple times to get multiple Drakes.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Cast Out leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if Cast Out’s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to the battlefield. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn’t an ability that goes on the stack, it won’t cease to exist along with the leaving player’s spells and abilities on the stack.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Cast Out leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. New Perspectives gives these abilities an alternate activation cost as well.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If you choose to pay New Perspectives’s alternate activation cost, you still discard the card with cycling to activate the ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'The card you wish to cycle counts when determining whether you have seven or more cards in hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you exile a creature that isn’t a creature card with the second ability of Endless Sands (such as a token creature or a land that has become a creature), the third ability won’t return that token or card from exile.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The last ability of Endless Sands returns only creature cards exiled by that card. If Endless Sands leaves the battlefield before you activate that ability, the exiled creatures are lost in the dunes forever.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If Nissa leaves the battlefield while her second ability is on the stack, use her last known loyalty to determine whether you may put the top card of your library onto the battlefield. If Nissa left the battlefield because she took enough damage to reduce her loyalty to 0, then her last known loyalty is 0.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'If X is 0, Nissa enters the battlefield with no loyalty and is put into her owner’s graveyard before you can activate her abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Nissa’s last ability sets the base power and toughness of the lands to 5/5. Any +1/+1 or -1/-1 counters that were on those lands will apply to those values.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Once Nissa’s second ability begins to resolve, no player may take actions until it’s done. Notably, players can’t try to change Nissa’s loyalty once you look at the card or choose to put it onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'While resolving Nissa’s second ability, if you can’t or don’t put the card onto the battlefield, it remains on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Abilities that create replacement effects, such as a permanent entering the battlefield tapped or with counters on it, can’t be targeted. Abilities that apply “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” are also replacement effects and can’t be targeted.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keyword abilities, such as equip and eternalize, are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If you counter a delayed triggered ability that triggers at the beginning of the “next” occurrence of a specified step or phase, that ability won’t trigger again the following time that phase or step occurs.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Mana abilities can’t be targeted. An activated mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool as it resolves, doesn’t have a target, and isn’t a loyalty ability. A triggered mana ability is one that adds mana to a player’s mana pool and triggers on an activated mana ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities, such as prowess and afflict, are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at” in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2017-04-18', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability doesn’t resolve (due to being countered with Disallow, for example, or if the triggered ability’s targets have become illegal), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "A token permanent with cycling will go to your graveyard before ceasing to exist. It won\'t be exiled. Similarly, a nontoken permanent that lost cycling while it was on the battlefield will also go to your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Abandoned Sarcophagus doesn\'t grant you permission to do anything with those cards except cast them. For example, you can\'t cycle nonland cards with cycling from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Certain older cards have variants of cycling, such as basic landcycling or Wizardcycling. Abandoned Sarcophagus\'s effect lets you cast these cards and exiles them if they weren\'t discarded for their cycling variant\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you cycle an instant card, you may cast it from your graveyard right away before any player may take any other action. If you do, that spell will resolve before the cycling ability. If you cycle a noninstant card without flash, you can\'t cast it until after the cycling ability has resolved."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” The Locust God\'s first triggered ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If this creature dies but leaves your graveyard before the next end step, it will remain in its new zone.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The “next end step” refers to the next end step that occurs, not the end step of the next turn. If this creature dies before a turn\'s end step (for example, during combat), it will be returned to its owner\'s hand at the beginning of that turn\'s end step."}]', "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If a creature gains one of the listed abilities before Majestic Mryiarch’s triggered ability resolves, perhaps due to another ability that triggered at the beginning of combat, Majestic Myriarch will gain that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Majestic Myriarch’s first ability applies in all zones. While it’s on the battlefield, it counts itself, so it’ll be at least 2/2.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Majestic Myriarch’s second ability triggers at the beginning of each combat, not just combat on your turn, whether or not any creatures you control have any of the listed abilities.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of any of the abilities Majestic Myriarch can gain are redundant.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Which abilities Majestic Myriarch gains is determined as the ability resolves. They won’t change even if every other creature that has the abilities leaves the battlefield or if creatures enter the battlefield or gain abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Chandra’s Pyrohelix), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Torment of Hailfire does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'Swarm Intelligence can copy the spell even if it’s countered before Swarm Intelligence’s triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The controller of a copy can’t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as Swarm Intelligence’s own ability) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2017-07-14', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can’t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'"Artifact" isn\\\'t a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Compare the revealed cards to the creature as it last existed before it died, not to the creature card as it exists in its owner\'s graveyard, to determine which one you put into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If Heirloom Blade leaves the battlefield at the same time that the equipped creature dies, its triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature has no creature type, no card can share a creature type with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card that shares a type with the creature that died, you\'ll just reveal and randomize your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You\'ll reveal cards until you find one that shares at least one creature type with the creature that died. For example, if a Cat Wizard dies, you\'ll stop if you reveal a Human Wizard or Cat Soldier."}]', "[{'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If an ability targets something controlled by the “defending player” of an attacking creature and the defending player for that creature changes before that ability resolves, the ability won’t resolve because its target has become illegal.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'If you reselect which player or planeswalker an attacking creature is attacking, that creature is still considered to have attacked the player or planeswalker as declared, but it is now attacking the new player or planeswalker.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Reselecting which player or planeswalker a creature is attacking doesn’t cause “whenever this creature attacks” abilities to trigger. Notably, the Curses in this set (such as Curse of Vitality) won’t trigger while Portal Mage’s ability is resolving.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'Reselecting which player or planeswalker a creature is attacking ignores all requirements, restrictions, and costs associated with attacking.'}, {'date': '2017-08-25', 'text': 'You may cast Portal Mage outside of a declare attackers step. If Portal Mage enters the battlefield outside of a declare attackers step, its ability simply doesn’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Slice in Twain resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card. If, on the other hand, the target is a legal target but isn’t destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you’ll draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can target and gain control of an untapped creature this way.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If Heroes\' Bane\'s power is less than 0 when its second ability resolves, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined using the power of Heroes\' Bane when the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Genesis Hydra\'s first ability will resolve before Genesis Hydra does. Notably, if you put an Aura card onto the battlefield this way, it can\'t enchant Genesis Hydra."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If "the rest" is zero cards, either because X was 0 or because X was 1 and that card was put onto the battlefield, the library is still shuffled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura onto the battlefield this way, you choose what it enchants as it enters the battlefield. This doesn\'t target any permanent or player, but it must be able to enchant that permanent or player. For example, you could put a green Aura onto the battlefield enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, but not one with protection from green."}]', "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random as it’s returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Because the first ability doesn’t target the instant or sorcery card, any instants or sorceries put into your graveyard in response to that ability may be returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'The instant or sorcery card returned to your hand is chosen at random as Charmbreaker Devils’s first ability resolves. If any player responds to the ability, that player won’t yet know what card will be returned.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'Creatures may be dealt damage greater than their toughness. For example, if a source deals 5 damage to Illusory Ambusher, you’ll draw five cards.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'If Illusory Ambusher blocks a creature with trample, that creature’s controller can assign any amount of damage from 1 to that creature’s power to Illusory Ambusher. Excess damage doesn’t have to be assigned to the defending player.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature with double strike and trample destroys all of its blocking creatures with first-strike combat damage, all of its normal combat damage is assigned to the player or planeswalker that creature\'s attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'To choose a creature type, you must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Knight. You can\\\'t choose multiple creature types, such as "Vampire Knight." Card types such as artifact can\\\'t be chosen, nor can subtypes that aren\\\'t creature types, such as Jace, Vehicle, or Treasure.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to draw multiple cards, Niv-Mizzet\'s ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If dealing 1 damage to a permanent or player causes you to draw a card, perhaps because Niv-Mizzet is enchanted by Curiosity, you\'ll continue this loop until the loop is interrupted, perhaps by a player losing the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If each player has fewer than seven cards in their library as Magus of the Wheel\'s ability resolves, the game ends in a draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to find one basic land card with Myriad Landscape\'s last ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {8}{W}{W} to cast Decree of Justice.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If a creature without counters receives enough -1/-1 counters to reduce its toughness to 0 or less, Together Forever\'s ability can\'t be activated before state-based actions put that creature into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'If a spell with support has other abilities that target creatures, those abilities and the support ability can target the same creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "If some, but not all, targets for a spell become illegal, the remaining targets are affected as appropriate. If all of a spell\'s targets become illegal, that spell doesn\'t resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': \'Support can target a creature another player controls.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "Together Forever\'s activated ability checks whether the target creature has a counter on it as the ability is activated and as the ability resolves. If the creature loses its counters later in the turn, the delayed triggered ability will still return it to its owner\'s hand when it dies."}, {\'date\': \'2018-06-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t put more than one +1/+1 counter on any one target using the support action."}]', "[{'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'The enters-the-battlefield effect of Archon of Valor’s Reach is a replacement effect that doesn’t use the stack. No player can cast spells or activate abilities after it has entered the battlefield but before you choose a card type.'}, {'date': '2018-06-08', 'text': 'Whether it’s legal to cast a spell is determined before its costs are paid. This means that if Archon of Valor’s Reach has sorcery as the chosen type, you can’t cast Morbid Curiosity, even if you wish to sacrifice Archon of Valor’s Reach to do so.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Murmuring Mystic\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'A spell cast using jump-start will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it’s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If a card with jump-start is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If an effect allows you to pay an alternative cost rather than a spell’s mana cost, you may pay that alternative cost when you jump-start a spell. You’ll still discard a card as an additional cost to cast it.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using jump-start only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Finality affects only creatures on the battlefield at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won’t get -4/-4.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'Finality doesn’t target the creature to receive +1/+1 counters. You can cast it even if you control no creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'If any exiled cards you own are face down, they have no characteristics. If they’re normally instants or sorceries, they won’t be counted.'}, {'date': '2018-10-05', 'text': 'The ability that defines Crackling Drake’s power works in all zones.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Which creature cards to return to your hand is determined as Garna\'s triggered ability resolves. If Garna somehow finds its way into your graveyard before that, perhaps due to the “legend rule,” it will be returned to your hand."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card (such as Spirit Cairn’s ability) trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'You can’t pay {W} multiple times to create more than one token each time you resolve Spirit Cairn’s triggered ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Frantic Search is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "You choose which lands to untap as the spell resolves. They aren\'t targeted, and they don\'t have to be lands that you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Growth Spiral\'s effect doesn\'t count as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if it\'s not your turn or if you\'ve already played your land for the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Deathsprout tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You don’t search for a land card. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do search.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Astral Drift’s triggered ability resolves before the cycling ability does. You won’t draw until after you choose the target and choose whether to exile the creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cycle a card during a player’s end step, the exiled creature will remain exiled until the next turn’s end step.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "A copy is created even if the spell that caused Kalamax\'s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player copies a spell resolves before the copy. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If Kalamax becomes tapped as a cost to cast your first instant spell in a turn, its first ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a card rather than a spell (such as that of God-Eternal Kefnet), this doesn\'t cause Kalamax\'s last ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an instant spell multiple times, Kalamax\'s last ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has damage divided as it was cast, the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy created by Kalamax\\\'s first ability will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Kalamax\'s first ability considers the entire turn. If you cast an instant spell before Kalamax becomes tapped, its first ability won\'t trigger when you cast your second."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The copies that Kalamax\\\'s first ability creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy created by Kalamax\'s first ability. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Any target opponents that are no longer legal targets by the time Call the Coppercoats resolves won\'t have their creatures counted when determining how many tokens you create."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional cost for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If this spell is copied and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The mana value of a strive spell doesn\'t change no matter how many targets it has."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "As Agitator Ant\'s ability resolves, first you choose which creature you control, if any, to put two +1/+1 counters on, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then each chosen creature receives its +1/+1 counters and becomes goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature can\'t have +1/+1 counters put on it, its controller can\'t choose it just to have it become goaded. If it can have counters put on it but replacement effects cause it not to receive +1/+1 counters, it doesn\'t become goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If each creature the defending player controls can\'t block for any reason (such as being tapped), then the enchanted creature isn\'t blocked. If there\'s a cost associated with blocking the enchanted creature, the defending player isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to be blocked in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Only one creature is required to block the enchanted creature. Other creatures may also block it and are free to block other creatures or not block at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If you are the attacking creature\'s controller, you lose 2 life and gain 2 life. You won\'t lose the game if your life total is 0 in between these two events."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Parasitic Impetus causes you to gain life, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Psychic Impetus causes you to scry 2, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Creatures your opponents control attacking one of your opponents will cause Frontier Warmonger\'s ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If Slippery Bogbonder\'s triggered ability puts a hexproof counter on a creature an opponent controls, you can still move counters onto that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can\'t move counters from the target creature to itself."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose which counters to move as Slippery Bogbonder\'s triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may choose to move zero counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You may move counters from any number of other creatures you control, not just from one.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If X is 0, the 0/0 Hydra token will die immediately after the ability\'s done resolving unless something else is raising its toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If an effect, such as that of Parallel Lives, causes Zaxara\'s ability to create multiple Hydra tokens, they each receive X +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If the spell you cast has {X}{X} in its mana cost, the token gets only X counters, not twice X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'The Hydra token enters the battlefield as a 0/0 creature. Any abilities that modify or trigger on this event apply. After the token is on the battlefield but before any player can take actions, +1/+1 counters are put onto the token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The value of X in Zaxara\'s last ability is the value of X of the spell you cast."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes an opponent to put cards into their hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it\'s not a card drawn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the amount of damage Xyris deals is greater than the number of cards in your library and the number of cards in that player\'s library, you both lose the game at the same time. It doesn\'t matter if one of you had more cards in library than the other. If there are no other players left in the game, the game is a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the amount of damage Xyris deals is greater than the number of cards in your library but causes the defending player\'s life total to become 0 or less, that player loses the game before Xyris\'s ability causes you to draw cards. If there are no other players left in the game, you win the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If an effect copies a card rather than a spell (such as that of God-Eternal Kefnet), this doesn\'t cause an additional copy to be created."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Mythos of Vadrok), the division can\'t be changed, although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy will have the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can\'t be chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you have a second Twinning Staff, copying a spell results in two additional copies. If you have a third, you get three additional copies, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The controller of a copy can\'t choose to pay any alternative or additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any alternative or additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The copy is created on the stack, so it\'s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\'t trigger. It will resolve before the original spell does."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, you can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Twinning Staff\'s last ability can copy any instant or sorcery spell you control, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'You choose whether the additional copy is put onto the stack before or after the original copy. If a spell is being copied more than once, you can even have the additional copy put onto the stack in between the original copies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You may choose new targets for the additional copy, even if you can\'t choose new targets for the original copy or copies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you play a land from the top of your library and it has a replacement effect that requires you to make a decision (such as that of Temple Garden), you must make that decision without knowing the next card of your library."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Verge Rangers doesn\'t allow you to play additional lands."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Verge Rangers lets you look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you begin casting this spell, players can\'t take any other actions until you\'re done casting it. Notably, they can\'t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Shiny Impetus causes you to create a Treasure token, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature card that you exiled with a fetch counter on it may be cast as a noncreature spell if a rule or effect (such as that of adventurer cards) allows you to do so.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Haldan doesn’t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Haldan’s ability applies only while it’s on the battlefield. You’ll be able to play cards you exiled with fetch counters before Haldan entered the battlefield, and if Haldan leaves, you won’t be able to play cards that were exiled with fetch counters until Haldan returns.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control that Pako fetched are exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You exile cards and put +1/+1 counters on Pako all while Pako’s last ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Yannik leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you won’t exile any creature you control. Yannik’s reflexive triggered ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature with +1/+1 counters on it receives an equal number of -1/-1 counters and this causes it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, Nikara’s last ability triggers. That’s because the ability checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature with counters on it leaves the battlefield at the same time as Nikara, Nikara’s ability triggers for that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield. It will still let the ability distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If one of the target creatures becomes an illegal target in response to the reflexive triggered ability, the +1/+1 counters that would have been put on that creature are lost. They can’t be put on another legal target.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Nikara’s last ability causes you to draw only one card and lose only 1 life, no matter how many counters or kinds of counters that creature had on it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many +1/+1 counters to distribute.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Yannik can be the target of its own reflexive triggered ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Yannik’s triggered ability doesn’t target the creature you control. That creature is chosen as the triggered ability resolves. After it’s exiled, the reflexive triggered ability triggers and targets are chosen to receive the counters.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose how the counters will be distributed as you put the reflexive triggered ability onto the stack. Each target creature must be assigned at least one counter.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You may choose zero target creatures for Yannik’s reflexive triggered ability. If you do, no creature receives +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Brallin’s middle ability deals 1 damage to each opponent even if you can’t put a +1/+1 counter on Brallin, most likely because Brallin has left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Brallin’s middle ability gives it only one +1/+1 counter each time it resolves, no matter how many opponents are dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you discard a card as a cost to cast a spell or activate an ability, Brallin’s middle ability resolves before that spell or ability but after you’ve chosen targets for it. If you discard a card while a spell or ability is resolving, that spell or ability finishes resolving before Brallin’s triggered ability does.’'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Shabraz’s middle ability has you gain 1 life even if you can’t put a +1/+1 counter on Shabraz, most likely because Shabraz has left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target player is an illegal target by the time Ukkima’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Ukkima is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the last ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use Ukkima’s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals and how much life you gain. If that number is negative, it deals no damage and you gain no life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Trynn’s ability checks only whether you declared an attacking creature during the turn. It doesn’t trigger once for each such creature, and it doesn’t check whether any attacking creatures dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can activate Silvar’s last ability even if it already has indestructible. It’ll still get a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A mana cost of {X}{X} means that you pay twice X. If you want X to be 3, you pay {6} to cast Cryptic Trilobite.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon, such as Cryptic Trilobite’s activated mana ability and its last activated ability. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities (such as cycling) and will have colons in their reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can spend the two colorless mana produced by Cryptic Trilobite on two different activated abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. Manascape Refractor won’t gain triggered abilities (which start with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”).'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Manascape Refractor gains an activated ability that’s normally linked to a non-activated ability of the card it came from, the ability Manascape Refractor has isn’t linked to any ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Manascape Refractor gains an activated ability that’s normally linked to another activated ability of the card it came from, those two abilities Manascape Refractor gains are linked for as long as that card remains on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Lands with a basic land type have an intrinsic activated mana ability corresponding to their basic land type. Manascape Refractor has those abilities, too.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Activating Sanctuary Blade’s equip ability targeting the creature it’s already attached to won’t let you choose a new color.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Sanctuary Blade is somehow attached to a creature without a color having been chosen for it, it doesn’t grant a protection ability to the creature. The creature doesn’t gain protection from colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'After Ethereal Forager’s triggered ability resolves, players will have priority to cast spells (such as the card you returned to your hand, if it’s legal to do so) before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Ethereal Forager leaves the battlefield while its triggered ability is on the stack, that ability can still find the cards exiled with Ethereal Forager’s delve ability.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Although the new creature is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won’t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Any effects that say that the new creature can’t attack (such as that of Propaganda, or if you get a creature with defender) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won’t stop the creature you find from entering the battlefield attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you exile your entire library without exiling a creature card, you put the library back in a random order and continue. You won’t return the exiled attacking creature. Oops.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You choose which player or planeswalker the new creature is attacking. It doesn’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Fireflux Squad or the exiled creature was attacking.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If the nontoken creature leaves the battlefield before Molten Echoes\'s triggered ability resolves, the token that\'s created uses the creature\'s last known information from before it left."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what is printed on the creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and/or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As Dredge the Mire resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses a creature card in their graveyard, then each other opponent in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen cards are returned at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Dredge the Mire are exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'As the Decoy Gambit resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, the opponent whose turn it is) chooses whether you’ll draw a card or return their creature that was targeted to its owner’s hand, then each other opponent in turn order does so knowing the choices made before them. After all choices are made, you draw the appropriate number of cards. After you’ve drawn, the appropriate creatures are all simultaneously returned to their owners’ hands.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'For each opponent, if you didn’t choose a target creature they control or if that creature has become an illegal target, that player can’t choose for you to draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature targeted by Decoy Gambit changes controller, it’s no longer a legal target.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Because the activated ability doesn’t target the permanent card in your graveyard, you may choose one of the three cards you put there from your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can remove any three counters to activate Tayam’s last ability, not just vigilance counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can’t cast it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Mindleecher are exiled, and any cards remaining in exile remain face down indefinitely. No player may look at them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Mindleecher doesn’t change when you can cast the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can play lands this way only if you have remaining land plays available for the turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You may look at and play those cards even if Mindleecher leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Mindleecher, that player can’t look at or play the cards, and you still can.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You pay the costs for the exiled cards if you cast them. You may pay alternative costs such as mutate rather than a card’s mana cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Creatures that player controls can still attack you or planeswalkers you control, but the damage they would deal will be prevented.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Protection from a player means that you and each planeswalker you control have protection from each object controlled by that player. If an object has no controller (such as a card in a graveyard), its owner is considered its controller for this purpose.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Crystalline Resonance copies the printed values of the target permanent, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on that permanent or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won’t copy effects that made the target permanent become a creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Crystalline Resonance’s copy effect wears off immediately before your next turn begins.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance becomes a copy of a legendary permanent you control, you’ll put one of them into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance becomes a copy of a planeswalker, it won’t receive loyalty counters for that planeswalker’s starting loyalty. Unless it already has loyalty counters on it somehow, it will be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance becomes a copy of an Aura, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard unless it’s somehow attached to an appropriate object or player already. If it becomes a copy of an Equipment and is attached to a creature, it’ll become unattached when it becomes an enchantment again.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance becomes a copy of an object with a set of linked abilities (for example, one ability that exiles a card and another that refers to the card “exiled with” the object), that link only lasts as long as Crystalline Resonance is copying that object. If it stops being a copy of that object and then becomes a copy again later, the link is lost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance becomes a creature the same turn it enters the battlefield, you can’t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (if it gains any) unless it has haste.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance copies a permanent that’s copying something else, it will become whatever the target is copying.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Crystalline Resonance’s ability triggers multiple times in a turn, then each time one of those abilities resolves, it will overwrite whatever Crystalline Resonance is copying. Crystalline Resonance will wind up as a copy of the permanent targeted by the last ability to resolve. As your next turn begins, all instances of the ability will wear off at the same time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect begins to apply to Crystalline Resonance before it becomes a copy of another permanent, that effect will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If another permanent becomes a copy of Crystalline Resonance, it will become whatever Crystalline Resonance is copying and it will also have its ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Each time Kelsien’s last ability resolves, it creates a separate delayed triggered ability. If you untap Kelsien and activate its last ability multiple times in one turn, they’ll each trigger when the appropriate creature or creatures die.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Kelsien leaves the battlefield, you keep any experience counters you’ve received.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target of Kelsien’s last ability dies before the ability resolves, you won’t get an experience counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'For each applicable keyword, the appropriate counter may be put on any creature you control, including Kathril. The counters don’t need to all be put on the same creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once Kathril’s ability begins resolving, no player may take other actions until it’s done and you’ve put +1/+1 counters on Kathril.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You check once for each keyword. If you have two creature cards with flying in your graveyard, you put just one flying counter on a creature you control, not two.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If cards in your graveyard have multiple hexproof abilities (such as hexproof, hexproof from white, and hexproof from black), a counter of each variant kind will be put onto a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Gavi’s first ability considers the entire turn. If you cycle a card then have Gavi come under your control, you can’t pay {0} to cycle your second card.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a cycling cost includes {X} and you pay an alternative activation cost of {0} instead, X is 0.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” it’s not a card drawn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability can trigger only once each turn. It doesn’t matter Gavi was on the battlefield when the first card was drawn. If it’s not on the battlefield when the second card is drawn, the ability can’t trigger at all that turn. It won’t trigger when the third or fourth card is drawn.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Cartographer’s Hawk leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, you can’t return it to its owner’s hand from its new zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Daring Fiendbonder can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, the player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Jirina is your commander, the number of times you cast it includes the time you cast Jirina just before it entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Jirina’s last ability gives +2/+0 to all Humans you control other than Jirina, including the Human tokens created by its triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Nascent Metamorph becomes a copy of a legendary card with the same name as a legendary permanent you control, you’ll put one of them into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Nascent Metamorph becomes a copy of an object with a set of linked abilities (for example, one ability that exiles a card and another that refers to the card “exiled with” the object), that link only lasts as long as Nascent Metamorph is copying that object. If it stops being a copy of that object and then becomes a copy again later, the link is lost.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect begins to apply to Nascent Metamorph before it becomes a copy, that effect will continue to apply.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If another permanent becomes a copy of Nascent Metamorph, it will become whatever Nascent Metamorph is copying. It remains a copy when Nascent Metamorph’s effect ends.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target opponent has no creature cards in their library, Nascent Metamorph doesn’t become a copy of anything. The cards are returned to that library in a random order.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The creature card that Nascent Metamorph becomes a copy of is put onto the bottom of the library along with any other cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Netherborn Altar leaves the battlefield while its ability is on the stack, the amount of life you lose is determined by the number of soul counters it had on it immediately before it left the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you have two commanders in the command zone, Netherborn Altar’s ability puts one of your choice into your hand, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your commander isn’t in the command zone (or if you’re not playing the Commander variant), Netherborn Altar only makes you lose life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Putting a soul counter onto Netherborn Altar is part of the cost to activate its ability, and counting the number of soul counters is done as the ability resolves. Players may take actions between those times to change the number of soul counters, perhaps by removing them all so that you lose no life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The “commander tax” increases based on how many times a commander was cast from the command zone. Casting a commander from your hand doesn’t require that additional cost, and it doesn’t increase what the cost will be the next time you cast that commander from the command zone.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Otrimi deals combat damage to a player at the same time that it’s dealt lethal damage, Otrimi (or any other creature card with mutate that was merged with it) can be the target of its triggered ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Species Specialist happens to have the chosen creature type, its ability triggers when it dies.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature of the chosen type dies at the same time as Species Specialist, its ability triggers for that creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Human or Warrior. Card types such as artifact and supertypes such as legendary can’t be chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a card has more than one of the listed keywords, you pick which keyword you’re choosing it for. For example, if you choose a card with flying and first strike, you may choose it as the card with flying and choose another card with first strike, or you may choose it as the card with first strike and choose another card with flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If a creature dies while Titan Hunter’s triggered ability is on the stack, Titan Hunter won’t deal damage to that player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Titan Hunter’s triggered ability triggers at the beginning of each player’s end step, including yours, if no creatures died during that turn.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Titan Hunter to pay the cost of its activated ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If an effect says that an opponent may cast a spell during your turn, Tidal Barracuda’s restriction overrules that permission.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once a player announces that they’re casting a spell, players can’t try to remove Tidal Barracuda to make it so that spell couldn’t be cast at that time. Spells cast as though they had flash will still resolve if able, even if Tidal Barracuda is no longer on the battlefield at that time.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Tidal Barracuda’s abilities apply only while Tidal Barracuda is on the battlefield. Notably, its first ability doesn’t apply to Tidal Barracuda as you’re casting it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Tidal Barracuda’s first ability doesn’t grant flash to any objects. It just changes when spells can be cast.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Your opponents can still activate abilities during your turn.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If either permanent becomes an illegal target, no counter is removed or put.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "The two target permanents don\'t have to share a type, which can result in some counters on permanents that would not occur normally, such as loyalty counters on creatures or +1/+1 counters on lands. Keyword counters will grant the permanent that keyword even if it\'s meaningless (such as trample on an enchantment); +1/+1 counters won\'t affect the permanent unless it\'s a creature; and many named counters (such as soul counters) won\'t have an effect unless the recipient permanent refers to them in some way."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'To move a counter from one creature to another, the counter is removed from the first permanent and put on the second. Any abilities that care about a counter being removed from or put onto a permanent will apply.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You choose the two target permanents as Nesting Grounds\'s second ability is put onto the stack. You choose which kind of counter to move as that ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If one player controls more than one Bonder’s Ornament, that player draws just one card while resolving its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If some of the targets become illegal for Ravenous Gigantotherium’s ability, the original division of damage still applies, but the damage that would have been dealt to illegal targets isn’t dealt at all.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Ravenous Gigantotherium can’t devour creatures entering the battlefield at the same time as it.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Static abilities, such as that of Glorious Anthem, modify Ravenous Gigantotherium’s power before its triggered ability is put onto the stack. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can’t raise its power in time to change the value of X.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The creatures targeted by Ravenous Gigantotherium’s ability deal damage back to Ravenous Gigantotherium before dying if they’re dealt lethal damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The value of X is locked in as you divide the damage while putting Ravenous Gigantotherium’s ability onto the stack. Changing Ravenous Gigantotherium’s power after that time won’t change how much damage is dealt.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You divide the damage as Ravenous Gigantotherium’s triggered ability is put onto the stack, not as it resolves. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage. You can’t choose more than X targets and assign 0 damage to a target.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You may choose zero targets. If you do, Ravenous Gigantotherium deals no damage and is dealt no damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Surly Badgersaur’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. If it’s a legal target but Surly Badgersaur is no longer on the battlefield when the ability resolves, the target creature won’t deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you discard a card as a cost to cast a spell or activate an ability, Surly Badgersaur’s triggered ability resolves before that spell or ability but after you’ve chosen targets for it. If you discard a card while a spell or ability is resolving, that spell or ability finishes resolving before Surly Badgersaur’s triggered ability does.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Surly Badgersaur’s abilities are triggered abilities, not activated abilities. They don’t allow you to discard a card whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of discarding a card, such as a cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target noncreature permanent is an illegal target by the time Sawtusk Demolisher’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. No player will create a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target spell has a variable number of targets, you can’t change how many targets it has.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Mythos of Vadrok), the division can’t be changed although the targets receiving that damage still can. The same is true of spells that distribute counters.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you choose new targets for the target spell, the new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you begin casting this spell, players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting it. Notably, they can’t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you reselect which player an attacking creature is attacking, that creature is still considered to have attacked the player as declared, but it is now attacking the new player.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Reselecting which player a creature is attacking doesn’t cause “whenever this creature attacks” abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Reselecting which player a creature is attacking ignores all requirements, restrictions, and costs associated with attacking.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The player Capricopian becomes attacking may activate its ability, perhaps sending Capricopian right back towards its original destination.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The player Capricopian is attacking can’t reselect it to attack a planeswalker instead. If Capricopian is attacking a planeswalker, no player may activate its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If you somehow cycle a card, return it to your hand, and cycle it a second time in one turn, Spellpyre Phoenix’s last ability counts each time you cycled it and returns to your hand.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Spellpyre Phoenix’s last ability checks the entire turn. Cards you cycled before Spellpyre Phoenix was put into your graveyard count.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whose commander you control. Any one will do. If you have two commanders, you just need to control one of them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once you begin casting this spell, players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting it. Notably, they can’t try to remove the commander you control to make you pay its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Lavabrink Floodgates is sacrificed for having three or more doom counters on it only while its ability is resolving. If you put a third counter on it some other way, it won’t be immediately sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Lavabrink Floodgates’s reflexive triggered ability triggers and deals damage only if you sacrifice it while resolving its triggered ability. It won’t trigger if you sacrifice it for any other reason.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The player whose upkeep it is may put a doom counter on Lavabrink Floodgates, remove one from it, or do nothing.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Monstrous isn’t an ability that a creature has. It’s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature, loses its abilities, or loses its +1/+1 counters, it will continue to be monstrous.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can’t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once Souvenir Snatcher has snatched a noncreature artifact, you’ll continue to control that artifact if it becomes an artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The control-change effect of Souvenir Snatcher lasts indefinitely. It doesn’t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn’t expire if Souvenir Snatcher leaves the battlefield. In a multiplayer game, it does expire if you leave the game. If the artifact’s owner leaves the game, that artifact leaves with them.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren’t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won’t affect them.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won’t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The ability that defines Boneyard Mycodrax’s power and toughness works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The number of counters given by Boneyard Mycodrax’s scavenge ability is its power as it last existed in your graveyard before exiling it. Players can’t change how many counters it gives out after you’ve activated the ability by changing what’s in your graveyard.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you control at least one other creature when the ability resolves, you must sacrifice one. If you don\'t control any other creatures at that time, the ability won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield is the amount of life you gain and the number of cards you draw."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Humble Defector\'s ability can be activated any time during your turn, including in response to a spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Humble Defector is controlled by a player other than its owner, and its controller leaves the game, the effect giving that player control of Humble Defector ends. Humble Defector will return to the control of the player still in the game who most recently controlled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector isn\'t on the battlefield as its ability resolves, but the target player is still a legal target, the ability will resolve. You\'ll draw two cards, even though the player doesn\'t gain control of Humble Defector."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector\'s owner leaves the game, Humble Defector humbly leaves the game along with that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Alesha\'s triggered ability checks the card\'s power only in your graveyard. The creature will still be tapped and attacking if its power is greater than 2 after it\'s on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Although the returned creature is an attacking creature, it was never declared as an attacking creature. This means that abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks won\'t trigger when it enters the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any effects that say that the returned creature can\'t attack (such as that of Propaganda, or if the creature has defender) affect only the declaration of attackers. They won\'t stop the returned creature from entering the battlefield attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "While resolving Alesha\'s triggered ability, you can\'t pay the cost multiple times to return more than one creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the returned creature is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker Alesha is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile. They can\'t be cast on later turns, even if Etali attacks again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature cast this way can\'t attack during the same combat as Etali, even if it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast any of the exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing permissions based on a card\'s type are ignored, and the spells resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one of the exiled cards, you choose the order in which to cast them. A spell you cast this way can be the target of a later spell you cast this way. However, permanent spells cast this way won\'t resolve until you\'re done casting spells, so the permanents they become can\'t be the target of spells cast this way. For example, if you exile Twincast and Lightning Strike, you can cast Lightning Strike and then cast Twincast targeting it; but if you exile a creature card and an Aura card, you can\'t cast that Aura targeting that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Etali\'s ability are exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Shriekmaw\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Shriekmaw."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'After a spell with split second resolves (or otherwise leaves the stack), players may again cast spells and activate abilities before the next object on the stack resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Casting a spell with split second won\'t affect spells and abilities that are already on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the resolution of a triggered ability involves casting a spell, that spell can\'t be cast if a spell with split second is on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players may turn face-down creatures face up while a spell with split second is on the stack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Players still get priority while a card with split second is on the stack; their options are just limited to mana abilities and certain special actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Split second doesn\'t stop triggered abilities from triggering, such as that of Chalice of the Void. If one does, its controller puts it on the stack and chooses targets for it, if any. Those abilities will resolve as normal."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If another creature you control dies at the same time as Zulaport Cutthroat, its ability triggers for that creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if you leave the game, the Forest you own leaves as well. If instead another player who received your Forest from Yavimaya Dryad leaves the game, that land is exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can be the target of Yavimaya Dryad’s triggered ability.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn’t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you’ll draw a card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can’t cast Crop Rotation without sacrificing a land, and you can’t sacrifice additional lands.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You choose the target when Lightning Rift’s ability is put on the stack, but you choose whether to pay the mana as the ability resolves. Once you make that choice, no player may take actions until the damage is dealt and the ability has finished resolving.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Any cards you don’t cast this way will remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You cast the spells one at a time as Villainous Wealth is resolving, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last spell you cast will be the first one to resolve. Ignore timing restrictions based on the spells’ types. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose which spells (if any) to cast as Villainous Wealth resolves. If you do, you do so as part of the resolution of Villainous Wealth. You can’t wait to cast them later in the turn.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Bolas\' Schülerin", \'text\': "Wenn Bolas\' Schülerin ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine andere Kreatur. Du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst X Karten, wobei X gleich der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur ist.", \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Fürst Bolas hat mir gezeigt, welch wertvolle Rohstoffe noch im kleinsten Lebewesen stecken."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5996109-220f-49be-9ce4-d1bae47dd642\', \'multiverseId\': 483011}, \'multiverseid\': 483011}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Discípulo de Nicol Bolas entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica otra criatura. Ganas X vidas y robas X cartas, donde X es la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi Señor Nicol Bolas me ha mostrado que cada pequeña y miserable vida tiene sus recursos ocultos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9c23b3-763f-4791-ae1c-2481c2a73c84\', \'multiverseId\': 483262}, \'multiverseid\': 483262}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quand la Disciple de Bolas arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez une autre créature. Vous gagnez X points de vie et vous piochez X cartes, X étant la force de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le Seigneur Bolas m\'a montré comment chaque petite vie misérable renferme des ressources considérables. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483513&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c01b975-6a8f-4cbd-a14f-7819685d864b\', \'multiverseId\': 483513}, \'multiverseid\': 483513}, {\'name\': \'Discepola di Bolas\', \'text\': "Quando la Discepola di Bolas entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica un\'altra creatura. Guadagni X punti vita e peschi X carte, dove X è la forza di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Lord Bolas mi ha mostrato come ogni piccola vita miserabile contiene risorse inaudite."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cfcca91-fcb9-4acb-9c3b-a7b26ccc3969\', \'multiverseId\': 483764}, \'multiverseid\': 483764}, {\'name\': \'ボーラスの信奉者\', \'text\': \'ボーラスの信奉者が戦場に出たとき、他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。あなたはＸ点のライフを得てカードをＸ枚引く。Ｘはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「ボーラス卿は私に、哀れな小さき生命がどれほどの価値を秘めているかを教えてくれました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de1d84c-c842-47f5-90a3-4da0000ae427\', \'multiverseId\': 484015}, \'multiverseid\': 484015}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo de Nicol Bolas\', \'text\': \'Quando Discípulo de Nicol Bolas entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique outra criatura. Você ganha X pontos de vida e compra X cards, sendo X o poder daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O Senhor Nicol Bolas me mostrou como cada vida miserável encerra incríveis recursos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe9db05-dfe2-4d0d-bc6d-05b3e7025ec7\', \'multiverseId\': 484266}, \'multiverseid\': 484266}, {\'name\': \'Приверженец Боласа\', \'text\': \'Когда Приверженец Боласа выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте другое существо. Вы получаете X жизней и берете X карт, где X — сила того существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Повелитель Болас показал мне, что в каждой никчемной и жалкой жизни есть скрытые возможности».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afade43d-5509-43a9-833f-4d5f04220b1f\', \'multiverseId\': 484517}, \'multiverseid\': 484517}]', "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483186&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '374752a0-5be1-4250-8d79-94ecc745b3c7', 'multiverseId': 483186}, 'multiverseid': 483186}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483437&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4390df4-3fb4-488d-9f8f-532f3ae3825f', 'multiverseId': 483437}, 'multiverseid': 483437}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483688&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6c7160c-d6ef-444e-b1c6-983fcd0a806a', 'multiverseId': 483688}, 'multiverseid': 483688}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483939&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dc5c67c-64fa-424c-bb46-059649f518cf', 'multiverseId': 483939}, 'multiverseid': 483939}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484190&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53cceb58-e418-4632-b37c-6b41c070aeb4', 'multiverseId': 484190}, 'multiverseid': 484190}, {'name': 'Estepe Remota', 'text': 'Estepe Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484441&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b577c81-5e63-40b3-ae73-f1428c3901ac', 'multiverseId': 484441}, 'multiverseid': 484441}, {'name': 'Далекая Степь', 'text': 'Далекая Степь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\nЦикл {W} ({W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484692&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fec3556f-a58b-42ae-9fa2-5f97976ebced', 'multiverseId': 484692}, 'multiverseid': 484692}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abwehrender Schlag\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nDu kannst neue Ziele für einen Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit deiner Wahl bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Angriffe der Erzmagier waren für Kalamax nichts weiter als kleine Ärgernisse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484948&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13a5858-eb04-4cf6-9c07-ef5343ae2771\', \'multiverseId\': 484948}, \'multiverseid\': 484948}, {\'name\': \'Golpe desviador\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nPuedes elegir nuevos objetivos para el hechizo o la habilidad objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los ataques de los archimagos no son más que molestias para Kálamax.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd2b4abd-69ee-4f89-b01a-11ecce668efe\', \'multiverseId\': 484999}, \'multiverseid\': 484999}, {\'name\': \'Claque déflectrice\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nVous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour le sort ciblé ou la capacité ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour Kalamax, les attaques des archimages ne sont tout au plus qu\'un léger agacement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41ce973-1605-4d82-98c1-1091d58e0ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 485050}, \'multiverseid\': 485050}, {\'name\': \'Falciata Deviante\', \'text\': "Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nPuoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per una magia o un\'abilità bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli attacchi degli arcimaghi sono poco più che una seccatura per Kalamax.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f51464-f04b-45ad-9daa-bcd2786f9229\', \'multiverseId\': 485101}, \'multiverseid\': 485101}, {\'name\': \'偏向はたき\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n呪文１つか能力１つを対象とする。あなたはそれの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'大魔導師の攻撃は、カラマックスにとっては鬱陶しい程度のものだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e23ecd4-164f-4261-baf1-3c4bf833a3c1\', \'multiverseId\': 485152}, \'multiverseid\': 485152}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Defletor\', \'text\': \'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nVocê pode escolher novos alvos para a mágica ou habilidade alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Para Kalamax, os ataques de arquimagos não passam de estorvos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b1650cc-6274-4ee7-a47f-2288f9e77685\', \'multiverseId\': 485203}, \'multiverseid\': 485203}, {\'name\': \'Отражающий Хлопок\', \'text\': \'Если у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете разыграть это заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\\nВы можете выбрать новые цели для целевого заклинания или способности.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Атаки архимагов раздражают Каламакса, и не более.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2be2562-af92-4199-aea4-15337cf4b695\', \'multiverseId\': 485254}, \'multiverseid\': 485254}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abzan-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 3 oder mehr ins Exil.\\n• Du ziehst zwei Karten und verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte.\\n• Verteile zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine oder zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483078&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6e928a-8452-4a53-bb78-dc0ecbcc7223\', \'multiverseId\': 483078}, \'multiverseid\': 483078}, {\'name\': \'Sortilegio abzano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 3 o más.\\n• Robas dos cartas y pierdes 2 vidas.\\n• Distribuye dos contadores +1/+1 entre una o dos criaturas objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bab132-62aa-4c80-80b5-2f9dd1d68df0\', \'multiverseId\': 483329}, \'multiverseid\': 483329}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'Abzan", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée avec une force supérieure ou égale à 3.\\n• Vous piochez deux cartes et vous perdez 2 points de vie.\\n• Répartissez deux marqueurs +1/+1 entre une ou deux créatures ciblées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483580&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6fc38f-1f35-408a-874e-e844e1ac9317\', \'multiverseId\': 483580}, \'multiverseid\': 483580}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Abzan\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 3.\\n• Pesca due carte e perdi 2 punti vita.\\n• Distribuisci due segnalini +1/+1 tra una o due creature bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a8241a-5096-4089-bad2-6dcbb39ea3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 483831}, \'multiverseid\': 483831}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• パワーが３以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n• あなたはカードを２枚引き、あなたは２点のライフを失う。\\n• クリーチャー１体か２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を望むように割り振って置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94985d29-66c1-47fc-8d3e-1bd37a587cda\', \'multiverseId\': 484082}, \'multiverseid\': 484082}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Abzan\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Exile a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 3.\\n• Você compra dois cards e perde 2 pontos de vida.\\n• Distribua dois marcadores +1/+1 entre uma ou duas criaturas alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ae0f10-ea74-47c6-8ba6-04d16ebc30e7\', \'multiverseId\': 484333}, \'multiverseid\': 484333}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Абзана\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Изгоните целевое существо с силой не менее 3.\\n• Вы берете две карты и теряете 2 жизни.\\n• Распределите два жетона +1/+1 между одним или двумя целевыми существами.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f7cf5db-ef91-4d02-88ca-b28da7405157\', \'multiverseId\': 484584}, \'multiverseid\': 484584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Adriana, Hauptmann der Stadtwache\', \'text\': \'Tumult (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jeden Gegner, den du in diesem Kampf mit einer Kreatur angegriffen hast.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Tumult. (Hat eine Kreatur mehrfach Tumult, wird jedes Vorkommen einzeln ausgelöst.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483079&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49c35f9f-69c9-4597-9a06-398929b5b805\', \'multiverseId\': 483079}, \'multiverseid\': 483079}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, capitana de la guardia\', \'text\': \'Reyerta. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada oponente al que atacaste con una criatura este combate.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de reyerta. (Si una criatura tiene varias copias de reyerta, cada una se dispara por separado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a4ffd9c-d382-44ac-afb7-4e55b2a2a3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 483330}, \'multiverseid\': 483330}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, capitaine de la garde\', \'text\': "Mêlée (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque adversaire que vous avez attaqué avec une créature pendant ce combat.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la mêlée. (Si une créature a plusieurs occurrences de mêlée, chacune d\'elles se déclenche séparément.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5ef8519-ac29-41a5-b619-868011b7d243\', \'multiverseId\': 483581}, \'multiverseid\': 483581}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, Capitana della Guardia\', \'text\': \'Mischia (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni avversario che hai attaccato con una creatura in questo combattimento.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno mischia. (Se una creatura ha più istanze di mischia, ognuna si innesca separatamente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c3ba7a-ecf7-49c3-be79-74c72551755f\', \'multiverseId\': 483832}, \'multiverseid\': 483832}, {\'name\': \'護衛隊長、アドリアナ\', \'text\': \'会戦（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これはこの戦闘であなたがクリーチャーで攻撃した対戦相手１人につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは会戦を持つ。（クリーチャー１体に複数の会戦があるなら、それぞれ別個に誘発する。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01f9e5ec-a8ea-4cbe-bec4-f082de706da8\', \'multiverseId\': 484083}, \'multiverseid\': 484083}, {\'name\': \'Adriana, Capitã da Guarda\', \'text\': \'Embate (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada oponente que você atacou com uma criatura neste combate.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm embate. (Se uma criatura tem ocorrências múltiplas de embate, cada uma é desencadeada separadamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6a5f00-7562-49de-a1fd-4120d05e88db\', \'multiverseId\': 484334}, \'multiverseid\': 484334}, {\'name\': \'Адриана, Капитан Стражи\', \'text\': \'Потасовка (Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждого оппонента, которого вы атаковали существом в этом бою.)\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем имеют Потасовку. (Если у существа есть несколько способностей Потасовки, каждая из них срабатывает отдельно.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29969f34-b037-470d-b549-156c8f6f8827\', \'multiverseId\': 484585}, \'multiverseid\': 484585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani der Unnachgiebige\', \'text\': \'+2: Decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm alle bleibenden Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden und die keine Länder sind, auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−2: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\\n−9: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, fünf +1/+1-Marken und auf jeden anderen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, fünf Loyalitätsmarken.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483080&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2954515b-f29b-4689-b34b-2d8b8f66cc4c\', \'multiverseId\': 483080}, \'multiverseid\': 483080}, {\'name\': \'Ajani implacable\', \'text\': \'+2: Muestra las primeras tres cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de permanente que no sean tierra mostradas de esta manera en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\n-2: Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\\n−9: Pon cinco contadores +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas y cinco contadores de lealtad sobre cada uno de los otros planeswalkers que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7acdc61-4da6-4013-bc0c-e2e0bf223d0b\', \'multiverseId\': 483331}, \'multiverseid\': 483331}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'inflexible", \'text\': "+2: Révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de permanent non-terrain révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n-2: Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\\n-9: Mettez cinq marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez et cinq marqueurs « loyauté » sur chaque autre planeswalker que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483582&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1af7db2-2785-405c-8c94-606b2869ab99\', \'multiverseId\': 483582}, \'multiverseid\': 483582}, {\'name\': "Ajani l\'Inflessibile", \'text\': \'+2: Rivela le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte permanente non terra rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\n-2: Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\\n-9: Metti cinque segnalini +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli e cinque segnalini fedeltà su ogni altro planeswalker che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93fc23b3-ac0c-4ee6-a794-0d228e119f31\', \'multiverseId\': 483833}, \'multiverseid\': 483833}, {\'name\': \'不撓のアジャニ\', \'text\': \'+2：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚公開する。これにより公開された、土地でないパーマネント・カードをすべてあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n-2：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n−9：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ５個と、他の、あなたがコントロールしている各プレインズウォーカーの上に忠誠カウンターをそれぞれ５個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c2d25e1-095c-493d-8012-bdf82f453cd0\', \'multiverseId\': 484084}, \'multiverseid\': 484084}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, o Inabalável\', \'text\': \'+2: Revele os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de permanente que não sejam terrenos revelados dessa maneira em sua mão e os demais no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\n−2: Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder.\\n−9: Coloque cinco marcadores +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla e cinco marcadores de lealdade em cada outro planeswalker que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34f1cf42-7917-4e1d-b060-31adac8abeb7\', \'multiverseId\': 484335}, \'multiverseid\': 484335}, {\'name\': \'Аджани Неколебимый\', \'text\': "+2: покажите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите все показанные таким образом карты не являющихся землями перманентов в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\n−2: изгоните целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок получает количество жизней, равное его силе.\\n—9: положите пять жетонов +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем и пять жетонов верности на каждого другого planeswalker\'а под вашим контролем.", \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650021b7-9a8b-4157-8ef2-f3bcc5b34e94\', \'multiverseId\': 484586}, \'multiverseid\': 484586}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akim der Windgleiter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen oder mehrere Spielsteine erzeugst, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Vogel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}: Kreaturenspielsteine, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484733&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad24536-1ef6-4224-8adb-22bbb5c42e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 484733}, \'multiverseid\': 484733}, {\'name\': \'Akim, el Planeador\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que crees una o más fichas por primera vez cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ave blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}: Las fichas de criatura que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d09778-a1aa-4014-894e-1ef87c50ec48\', \'multiverseId\': 484753}, \'multiverseid\': 484753}, {\'name\': \'Akim, le Vent ascendant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous créez au moins un jeton pour la première fois à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W} : Les jetons de créature que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : oiseau et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe6e10aa-4c69-42b1-bf0c-c72827d175c9\', \'multiverseId\': 484773}, \'multiverseid\': 484773}, {\'name\': \'Akim, il Vento Aleggiante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta crei una o più pedine per la prima volta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Uccello 1/1 bianca con volare.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}: Le pedine creatura che controlli hanno doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dinosauro Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa2d1e4c-ce1d-4a2a-a39a-0684b7ed2339\', \'multiverseId\': 484793}, \'multiverseid\': 484793}, {\'name\': \'飛翔する風、アキーム\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n各ターン内で初めてあなたがトークンを１つ以上生成するたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー・トークンは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・恐竜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8a0f078-7333-4153-a960-1154c4138c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 484813}, \'multiverseid\': 484813}, {\'name\': \'Akim, o Vento Ascendente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você criar uma ou mais fichas pela primeira vez a cada turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Ave com voar.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}: As fichas de criatura que você controla ganham golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Ave Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4591e81-200a-40b8-a814-90417382f96b\', \'multiverseId\': 484833}, \'multiverseid\': 484833}, {\'name\': \'Аким, Парящий Ветер\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы создаете одну или несколько фишек в первый раз в каждом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белая Птица с Полетом.\\n{3}{U}{R}{W}: фишки существ под вашим контролем получают Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Птица Динозавр\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88fdf9d1-4f58-4d93-b837-7e90dedb3cd7\', \'multiverseId\': 484853}, \'multiverseid\': 484853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroma, Engel des Zorns\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Erstschlag, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile, Schutz vor Schwarz und vor Rot\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Zorn ist kein Laster, wenn er sich gegen die richtet, die ihn verdienen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f49489fa-f1f5-48db-9433-6db09721206c\', \'multiverseId\': 482952}, \'multiverseid\': 482952}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, ángel de ira\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña primero, vigilancia, arrolla, prisa, protección contra negro y contra rojo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"La ira no es moralmente incorrecta cuando se inflige a aquellos que la merecen".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80395045-519d-4a3d-99d2-5d16f92b4377\', \'multiverseId\': 483203}, \'multiverseid\': 483203}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, ange de la Colère\', \'text\': \'Vol, initiative, vigilance, piétinement, célérité, protection contre le noir et contre le rouge\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ange\', \'flavor\': \'« La colère est justifiée si on la déchaîne sur ceux qui le méritent. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7883b7ae-7afb-4e14-a026-cc28aab80ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 483454}, \'multiverseid\': 483454}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, Angelo della Distruzione\', \'text\': \'Volare, attacco improvviso, cautela, travolgere, rapidità, protezione dal nero e dal rosso\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"La collera non è un vizio quando inflitta a chi lo merita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae00cb25-af16-4546-8219-1e650c24efff\', \'multiverseId\': 483705}, \'multiverseid\': 483705}, {\'name\': \'怒りの天使アクローマ\', \'text\': \'飛行、先制攻撃、警戒、トランプル、速攻、プロテクション（黒）、プロテクション（赤）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「報いられるべき者に対する怒りは悪ではない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b71efe-74ab-48ba-babe-2f64dbd6e103\', \'multiverseId\': 483956}, \'multiverseid\': 483956}, {\'name\': \'Akroma, Anjo da Ira\', \'text\': \'Voar, iniciativa, vigilância, atropelar, ímpeto, proteção contra o preto, proteção contra o vermelho\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"A ira não é pecado quando voltada contra os que a merecem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2167d8e7-b6a7-4af7-bf8e-2a571bfbc491\', \'multiverseId\': 484207}, \'multiverseid\': 484207}, {\'name\': \'Акрома, Ангел Ярости\', \'text\': \'Полет, Первый удар, Бдительность, Пробивной удар, Ускорение, Защита от черного и от красного\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'«Гнев — это не грех, когда он обращен на тех, кто этого заслуживает».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f150505-1bca-469c-a26f-079a6ab7ea76\', \'multiverseId\': 484458}, \'multiverseid\': 484458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akromas Rache\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Artefakte, Kreaturen und Verzauberungen.\\nUmwandlung {3} ({3}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele müssen für den Einen sterben, der nicht hätte umkommen sollen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29c67028-c4db-499c-96ab-24f86d73a085\', \'multiverseId\': 482953}, \'multiverseid\': 482953}, {\'name\': \'Venganza de Akroma\', \'text\': \'Destruye todos los artefactos, criaturas y encantamientos.\\nCiclo {3}. ({3}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muchos deben morir por aquella que no debería haber muerto".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4eeb50-b2c1-4725-9e1d-b88914514db5\', \'multiverseId\': 483204}, \'multiverseid\': 483204}, {\'name\': \'Vengeance selon Akroma\', \'text\': \'Détruisez tous les artefacts, toutes les créatures et tous les enchantements.\\nRecyclage {3} ({3}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Beaucoup doivent mourir pour celle qui n\'aurait pas dû périr. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1a33a4d-41e9-4056-b26a-c124b20e81b5\', \'multiverseId\': 483455}, \'multiverseid\': 483455}, {\'name\': \'Vendetta di Akroma\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutti gli artefatti, le creature e gli incantesimi.\\nCiclo {3} ({3}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"In molti devono morire per colei che avrebbe dovuto restare in vita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204149ae-1055-43e8-9026-acc85f05b40b\', \'multiverseId\': 483706}, \'multiverseid\': 483706}, {\'name\': \'アクローマの復讐\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトとクリーチャーとエンチャントをすべて破壊する。\\nサイクリング{3}（{3}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「殺されるはずのなかったあの方のために、大勢が死なねばならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca18df4-1b4f-4d7a-a6b5-78063d22d83b\', \'multiverseId\': 483957}, \'multiverseid\': 483957}, {\'name\': \'Vingança de Akroma\', \'text\': \'Destrua todos os artefatos, criaturas e encantamentos.\\nReciclar {3} ({3}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Muitos precisam morrer por aquela que não deveria ter perecido."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6d42492-92f7-4f6e-b8cd-fc9032b54b97\', \'multiverseId\': 484208}, \'multiverseid\': 484208}, {\'name\': \'Месть Акромы\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все артефакты, существа и чары.\\nЦикл {3} ({3}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Многие должны умереть ради той, что не должна была погибнуть».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26960fcd-62d2-4e25-ba0f-08fb42a5913a\', \'multiverseId\': 484459}, \'multiverseid\': 484459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alesha, Verachterin des Todes\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn Alesha, Verachterin des Todes, angreift, kannst du {W/B}{W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof getappt und angreifend ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Begegne dem Tod mit dem Schwert in der Hand."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d31363-73fe-4eff-9f06-4a11a4338a86\', \'multiverseId\': 483022}, \'multiverseid\': 483022}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, la que sonríe a la muerte\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que Alesha, la que sonríe a la muerte ataque, puedes pagar {W/B}{W/B}. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada y atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluda a la muerte con una espada en la mano".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5affbdc-299f-4a33-8571-a688c4f1ea9b\', \'multiverseId\': 483273}, \'multiverseid\': 483273}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, Celle-qui-sourit-devant-la-mort\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Alesha, Celle-qui-sourit-devant-la-mort attaque, vous pouvez payer {W/B}{W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée de force inférieure ou égale à 2, engagée et attaquante.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Saluez la mort une épée à la main. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c8e4bf-3a68-44cc-9eb5-c4e366fe2db8\', \'multiverseId\': 483524}, \'multiverseid\': 483524}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, Che Sorride alla Morte\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta Alesha, Che Sorride alla Morte attacca, puoi pagare {W/B}{W/B}. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2 TAPpata e attaccante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Saluta la morte impugnando la spada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4740be66-17a7-44df-98a6-58ad0e58fe6b\', \'multiverseId\': 483775}, \'multiverseid\': 483775}, {\'name\': \'死に微笑むもの、アリーシャ\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n死に微笑むもの、アリーシャが攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地からパワーが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは{W/B}{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「手に剣を持って死を迎えよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7ea4ff5-22ba-40ea-bc6a-fcd5414d1572\', \'multiverseId\': 484026}, \'multiverseid\': 484026}, {\'name\': \'Alesha, a Que Sorri Para a Morte\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Alesha, a Que Sorri Para a Morte, ataca, você pode pagar {W/B}{W/B}. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 2 do seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado e atacando.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cumprimente a morte com uma espada em punho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae98e442-dc1f-4891-abad-99261135a253\', \'multiverseId\': 484277}, \'multiverseid\': 484277}, {\'name\': \'Алиша, Улыбнувшаяся Смерти\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Алиша, Улыбнувшаяся Смерти атакует, вы можете заплатить {W/B}{W/B}. Если вы это делаете, верните целевую карту существа с силой 2 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутой и атакующей.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Встречай смерть с мечом в руке».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83901a03-a7d3-46cb-aba8-bf29f7cfd353\', \'multiverseId\': 484528}, \'multiverseid\': 484528}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar der Unterwelt\', \'text\': \'{T}, Lege eine Seelenmarke auf den Altar der Unterwelt: Bringe deinen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone auf deine Hand. Dann verlierst du für jede Seelenmarke auf dem Altar der Unterwelt 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Über ihn wird nur geflüstert, und ihn besuchen nur die Verzweifelten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc713eb7-5844-4e97-bfde-0f39afbd62b6\', \'multiverseId\': 484943}, \'multiverseid\': 484943}, {\'name\': \'Altar del submundo\', \'text\': \'{T}, poner un contador de alma sobre el Altar del submundo: Pon a tu comandante en tu mano desde la zona de mando. Luego pierdes 3 vidas por cada contador de alma sobre el Altar del submundo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Solo se habla de él en susurros y solo lo visitan los desesperados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a568c093-f146-41d4-aa7c-b215e1272a86\', \'multiverseId\': 484994}, \'multiverseid\': 484994}, {\'name\': \'Autel né des enfers\', \'text\': "{T}, mettez un marqueur « âme » sur l\'Autel né des enfers : Mettez votre commandant dans votre main depuis la zone de commandement. Puis vous perdez 3 points de vie pour chaque marqueur « âme » sur l\'Autel né des enfers.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "On ne l\'évoque qu\'à voix basse, et seuls les désespérés le visitent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6694f53-66f4-4e54-881f-11a7b7ca1d23\', \'multiverseId\': 485045}, \'multiverseid\': 485045}, {\'name\': \'Altare degli Inferi\', \'text\': "{T}, Metti un segnalino anima sull\'Altare degli Inferi: Aggiungi il tuo comandante alla tua mano dalla zona di comando. Poi perdi 3 punti vita per ogni segnalino anima sull\'Altare degli Inferi.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Viene nominato solo nei sussurri e visitato solo dai disperati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'717949bc-395a-4c6d-b738-f6425add2413\', \'multiverseId\': 485096}, \'multiverseid\': 485096}, {\'name\': \'冥界生まれの祭壇\', \'text\': \'{T}, 冥界生まれの祭壇の上に魂魄カウンターを１個置く：あなたの統率者を統率領域からあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたは冥界生まれの祭壇の上に置かれている魂魄カウンター１個につき３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'囁きのみが噂し、決死の者のみが訪れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93bd4a2-2b1d-4e5a-bc30-4ee49285f6ad\', \'multiverseId\': 485147}, \'multiverseid\': 485147}, {\'name\': \'Altar do Submundo\', \'text\': \'{T}, coloque um marcador de alma em Altar do Submundo: Coloque seu comandante em sua mão da zona de comando. Em seguida, você perde 3 pontos de vida para cada marcador de alma em Altar do Submundo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Mencionado apenas em sussurros. Visitado apenas pelos desesperados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a7cc51-56cd-4536-ada6-3575492e5b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 485198}, \'multiverseid\': 485198}, {\'name\': \'Алтарь Преисподней\', \'text\': \'{T}, положите один жетон души на Алтарь Преисподней: положите вашего командира из зоны командования в вашу руку. Затем вы теряете 3 жизни за каждый жетон души на Алтаре Преисподней.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'К нему обращаются лишь шепотом и приходят лишь отчаявшиеся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec980b33-b493-41bb-816c-8c0bcb7780ab\', \'multiverseId\': 485249}, \'multiverseid\': 485249}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett der Evolution\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\\n• Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483050&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de67e52-a8ea-46e5-8b4d-e5aecb873f77\', \'multiverseId\': 483050}, \'multiverseid\': 483050}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de evolución\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49162791-4fdb-421f-9717-af1339037ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 483301}, \'multiverseid\': 483301}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'évolution", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\n• Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n• La créature ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1220cdca-185a-405d-bb3b-8f7d5488fd9a\', \'multiverseId\': 483552}, \'multiverseid\': 483552}, {\'name\': "Monile dell\'Evoluzione", \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\\n• Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3c9fb79-08a4-4934-8384-66256ffc0877\', \'multiverseId\': 483803}, \'multiverseid\': 483803}, {\'name\': \'進化の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\\n• あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d60f408-4e3a-4183-964c-37dd7348bb45\', \'multiverseId\': 484054}, \'multiverseid\': 484054}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão da Evolução\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n• A criatura alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0379588-3a9a-4b0b-bb77-b4cfd37aae8b\', \'multiverseId\': 484305}, \'multiverseid\': 484305}, {\'name\': \'Медальон Развития\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\\n• Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n• Целевое существо получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a168c9b1-eea4-4007-8e3a-778a47ce868d\', \'multiverseId\': 484556}, \'multiverseid\': 484556}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anstachler-Ameise\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments kann jeder Spieler zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur legen, die er kontrolliert. Stachele alle Kreaturen an, auf die auf diese Weise Marken gelegt wurden. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'518c9157-0e11-47d5-9280-4f5c3c0da525\', \'multiverseId\': 484947}, \'multiverseid\': 484947}, {\'name\': \'Hormiga agitadora\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, cada jugador puede poner dos contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controla. Incita a cada criatura sobre la que se hayan puesto contadores de esta manera. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas atacan cada combate si pueden y atacan a un jugador que no seas tú si pueden.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7294074-20a2-4e92-bb29-740ae1789691\', \'multiverseId\': 484998}, \'multiverseid\': 484998}, {\'name\': \'Fourmi agitatrice\', \'text\': "Au début de votre étape de fin, chaque joueur peut mettre deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature qu\'il contrôle. Incitez chaque créature sur laquelle des marqueurs ont été mis de cette manière. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db120b8e-0423-42f6-be14-cb37456263b3\', \'multiverseId\': 485049}, \'multiverseid\': 485049}, {\'name\': \'Formica Sobillatrice\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, ogni giocatore può mettere due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura che controlla. Sprona ogni creatura che ha ricevuto segnalini in questo modo. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a869e4-37bd-47c6-92b1-e4d5f7b0efe7\', \'multiverseId\': 485100}, \'multiverseid\': 485100}, {\'name\': \'扇動する蟻\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置いてもよい。これによりカウンターが置かれた各クリーチャーをそれぞれ使嗾する。（あなたの次のターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62c4b8bb-6972-4a82-bc9e-199d9543c5a3\', \'multiverseId\': 485151}, \'multiverseid\': 485151}, {\'name\': \'Formiga Agitadora\', \'text\': \'No início de sua etapa final, cada jogador pode colocar dois marcadores +1/+1 em uma criatura que ele controla. Atice cada criatura que tenha recebido marcadores dessa forma. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas e atacam um jogador que não seja você se estiverem aptas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b642eb-5336-4999-86a2-3be0e178bb1d\', \'multiverseId\': 485202}, \'multiverseid\': 485202}, {\'name\': \'Муравей-Подстрекатель\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага каждый игрок может положить два жетона +1/+1 на существо под своим контролем. Разъярите каждое существо, на которое были положены жетоны таким образом. (До вашего следующего хода те существа атакуют в каждом бою, если могут, и атакуют не вас, а другого игрока, если могут.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a52f60e-93ff-4247-b9dc-bc7e3f105036\', \'multiverseId\': 485253}, \'multiverseid\': 485253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Archon der Arena der Tapferkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nSowie der Archon der Arena der Tapferkeit ins Spiel kommt, bestimme Artefakt, Verzauberung, Spontanzauber, Hexerei oder Planeswalker.\\nSpieler können keine Zaubersprüche des bestimmten Typs wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483081&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c144255d-d411-4c12-8c49-0c86f06d30e1\', \'multiverseId\': 483081}, \'multiverseid\': 483081}, {\'name\': "Arconte de Valor\'s Reach", \'text\': "Vuela, vigilancia, arrolla.\\nEn cuanto la Arconte de Valor\'s Reach entre al campo de batalla, elige artefacto, encantamiento, instantáneo, conjuro o planeswalker.\\nLos jugadores no pueden lanzar hechizos del tipo elegido.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39708456-0a1e-4acc-b3b5-06b0db7d1fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 483332}, \'multiverseid\': 483332}, {\'name\': \'Archonte de la Lice de la Bravoure\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance, piétinement\\nAu moment où l\'Archonte de la Lice de la Bravoure arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez artefact, enchantement, éphémère, rituel ou planeswalker.\\nLes joueurs ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts du type choisi.", \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483583&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283b55df-8d7c-4717-aa56-89e2b53a3a06\', \'multiverseId\': 483583}, \'multiverseid\': 483583}, {\'name\': \'Arconte di Frontiera del Valore\', \'text\': "Volare, cautela, travolgere\\nMentre l\'Arconte di Frontiera del Valore entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli artefatto, incantesimo, istantaneo, stregoneria o planeswalker.\\nI giocatori non possono lanciare magie del tipo scelto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9809403d-8b50-4323-bbbe-a940aae8ad65\', \'multiverseId\': 483834}, \'multiverseid\': 483834}, {\'name\': \'武勇の場の執政官\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、トランプル\\n武勇の場の執政官が戦場に出るに際し、アーティファクトかエンチャントかインスタントかソーサリーかプレインズウォーカーを選ぶ。\\nプレイヤーはその選ばれたタイプの呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f850344-8076-4c6c-98f4-71d27f25e920\', \'multiverseId\': 484085}, \'multiverseid\': 484085}, {\'name\': \'Arconte do Coliseu da Bravura\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, atropelar\\nConforme Arconte do Coliseu da Bravura entrar no campo de batalha, escolha entre artefato, encantamento, mágica instantânea, feitiço ou planeswalker.\\nOs jogadores não podem conjurar mágicas do tipo escolhido.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1142df2a-e798-4e56-b783-e20f31781318\', \'multiverseId\': 484336}, \'multiverseid\': 484336}, {\'name\': \'Архонт Предела Доблести\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность, Пробивной удар\\nПри выходе Архонта Предела Доблести на поле битвы выберите артефакт, чары, мгновенное заклинание, волшебство или planeswalker.\\nИгроки не могут разыгрывать заклинания выбранного типа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e317803-0799-4f52-a979-664c564c5dcf\', \'multiverseId\': 484587}, \'multiverseid\': 484587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483116&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b974d962-bdf6-48f0-8706-c7b2668ad1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 483116}, \'multiverseid\': 483116}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5500a4-64b4-4c3b-b38b-d2724b767436\', \'multiverseId\': 483367}, \'multiverseid\': 483367}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483618&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c00108-88d1-4655-b98a-cac8b60ea71d\', \'multiverseId\': 483618}, \'multiverseid\': 483618}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77759bc-34cc-4f87-b4b8-b82c68ac947e\', \'multiverseId\': 483869}, \'multiverseid\': 483869}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af236d90-d620-4b8f-8202-3e9824d94766\', \'multiverseId\': 484120}, \'multiverseid\': 484120}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': "Começou como uma simples gota d\'água. O Espelho Mágico a cristalizou em algo muito maior.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46779fd5-ee96-49ab-b7d5-ca6e3c93ab82\', \'multiverseId\': 484371}, \'multiverseid\': 484371}, {\'name\': \'Магическая Печать\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва это была простая капля воды. Волшебное Зеркало превратило ее в нечто большее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86691d75-6e78-4860-a16d-c9c15ad2a703\', \'multiverseId\': 484622}, \'multiverseid\': 484622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Artefaktmutation\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Es kann nicht regeneriert werden. Erzeuge X 1/1 grüne Saproling-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich den umgewandelten Manakosten des Artefakts ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Aus Splittern und Scherben rufe ich meine lebendige Horde empor."\\n—Molimo, Maro-Hexer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483082&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0ae55be-d30f-4116-a3f2-367780ecf471\', \'multiverseId\': 483082}, \'multiverseid\': 483082}, {\'name\': \'Mutación de artefacto\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo. No puede ser regenerado. Crea X fichas de criatura Saprolín verdes 1/1, donde X es el coste de maná convertido de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"De fragmentos y astillas origino mi horda viviente".\\n—Molimo, hechicero maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86a267d5-b61a-4dac-b407-80e7aae01120\', \'multiverseId\': 483333}, \'multiverseid\': 483333}, {\'name\': "Mutation d\'artefact", \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée. Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte, X étant le coût converti de mana de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Épines et échardes, je t\'appelle, horde vivante. »\\n—Molimo, maro-sorcier", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483584&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33070942-cacc-4e9e-8b10-51d74aa830dc\', \'multiverseId\': 483584}, \'multiverseid\': 483584}, {\'name\': \'Mutazione degli Artefatti\', \'text\': "Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerato. Crea X pedine creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verdi, dove X è il costo di mana convertito di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dai frammenti e dalle schegge, io evoco la mia orda vivente."\\n—Molimo, stregone maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'274955f8-466a-4cf1-ae5d-6dbca8e92f67\', \'multiverseId\': 483835}, \'multiverseid\': 483835}, {\'name\': \'秘宝の突然変異\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘは、そのアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「破片やかけらから、私は生きている部下たちを呼び返すのです。」\\n――マローの魔術師モリモ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90078bd0-d828-451f-bfde-2c87ca6812a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484086}, \'multiverseid\': 484086}, {\'name\': \'Mutação de Artefato\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo. Ele não pode ser regenerado. Crie X fichas de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Saprófita, sendo X o custo de mana convertido daquele artefato.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"De estilhaços e fragmentos eu conclamo minha horda viva."\\n— Molimo, feiticeiro maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af046a5-a05e-4ee4-9140-d489db7f4dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 484337}, \'multiverseid\': 484337}, {\'name\': \'Мутация Артефакта\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт. Он не может быть регенерирован. Создайте X фишек существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг, где X — конвертированная мана-стоимость того артефакта.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Из щепок и осколков я призываю свою живую орду».\\n— Молимо, маро-волшебник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac6cc34-92d3-419f-9fd8-b86f91be62b5\', \'multiverseId\': 484588}, \'multiverseid\': 484588}]', "[{'name': 'Aschenödnis', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {1} ({1}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483134&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d4f79d0-01a1-4cee-8031-9faf564b257c', 'multiverseId': 483134}, 'multiverseid': 483134}, {'name': 'Yermos humeantes', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {1}. ({1}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483385&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd142964d-f402-4c4f-872a-23458efaa3d0', 'multiverseId': 483385}, 'multiverseid': 483385}, {'name': 'Landes cendreuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {1} ({1}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483636&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1029bcc1-9781-44e7-b90b-92ceed8c5b92', 'multiverseId': 483636}, 'multiverseid': 483636}, {'name': 'Distese di Polvere', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\nCicloterra base {1} ({1}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala, aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483887&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '296b4b20-0e57-4d2a-a549-8c6ecf349d29', 'multiverseId': 483887}, 'multiverseid': 483887}, {'name': '灰のやせ地', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n基本土地サイクリング{1}（{1}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484138&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84804b80-63ef-4a0c-a31e-70be7bef7fb5', 'multiverseId': 484138}, 'multiverseid': 484138}, {'name': 'Desolação Fumegante', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\nReciclar terreno básico {1} ({1}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484389&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71454b14-43cf-4749-a345-10f0038bd362', 'multiverseId': 484389}, 'multiverseid': 484389}, {'name': 'Бесплодное Пепелище', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\nЦикл базовых земель {1} ({1}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484640&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2333dc2-9379-4687-9e28-4476890ec510', 'multiverseId': 484640}, 'multiverseid': 484640}]", '[{\'name\': \'Astrale Wanderung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du die Astrale Wanderung umwandelst oder eine andere Karte umwandelst, während sich die Astrale Wanderung im Spiel befindet, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W} ({2}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54cd3c27-34e0-4bf5-8d54-7628d41370c0\', \'multiverseId\': 482955}, \'multiverseid\': 482955}, {\'name\': \'Deriva astral\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives la habilidad de ciclo de la Deriva astral o de otra carta mientras la Deriva astral está en el campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo. Si lo haces, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nCiclo {2}{W}. ({2}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff358a88-0454-497a-99c3-16fdbcbce069\', \'multiverseId\': 483206}, \'multiverseid\': 483206}, {\'name\': \'Dérive astrale\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous recyclez la Dérive astrale ou que vous recyclez une autre carte pendant que la Dérive astrale est sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler la créature ciblée. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nRecyclage {2}{W} ({2}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483457&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4edf52-472c-4daa-977f-f77dacf3ca37\', \'multiverseId\': 483457}, \'multiverseid\': 483457}, {\'name\': \'Deriva Astrale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta cicli la Deriva Astrale o cicli un\'altra carta mentre la Deriva Astrale è sul campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una creatura bersaglio. Se lo fai, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nCiclo {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cb269d7-a5d7-424c-a3d4-28c4b0e5a00b\', \'multiverseId\': 483708}, \'multiverseid\': 483708}, {\'name\': \'霊体の横滑り\', \'text\': \'あなたが霊体の横滑りをサイクリングするか、霊体の横滑りが戦場にある間に他のカードをサイクリングするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nサイクリング{2}{W}（{2}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5060ffd-a2f2-4aae-a762-ffbeb5b229c3\', \'multiverseId\': 483959}, \'multiverseid\': 483959}, {\'name\': \'Deriva Astral\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você reciclar Deriva Astral ou reciclar qualquer outro card enquanto Deriva Astral estiver no campo de batalha, você poderá exilar a criatura alvo. Se fizer isso, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\\nReciclar {2}{W} ({2}{W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cfe7b4-0e4b-46ce-bfbe-010f516512e8\', \'multiverseId\': 484210}, \'multiverseid\': 484210}, {\'name\': \'Астральный Полет\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл Астрального Полета или совершаете Цикл другой карты, пока Астральный Полет находится на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать целевое существо. Если вы это делаете, верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\nЦикл {2}{W} ({2}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2c2fc3-d610-4ec4-939c-d3fc75bc64cf\', \'multiverseId\': 484461}, \'multiverseid\': 484461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufleuchten der Hieroglyphen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Antworten sind da. Man muss nur die Augen öffnen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89531452-53fe-4ff7-8f5f-8c1957dfb247\', \'multiverseId\': 482991}, \'multiverseid\': 482991}, {\'name\': \'Iluminación jeroglífica\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las respuestas están aquí. Esta es la forma de superar la prueba".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbfb28ed-7a36-43cc-90cf-101696d1d996\', \'multiverseId\': 483242}, \'multiverseid\': 483242}, {\'name\': \'Illumination hiéroglyphique\', \'text\': \'Piochez deux cartes.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Toutes les réponses sont ici. Voici comment surmonter les épreuves. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c7880d-97f5-42da-9b0d-c06cd97b495e\', \'multiverseId\': 483493}, \'multiverseid\': 483493}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Geroglifica\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le risposte si trovano qui. Questo è il cammino per superare l\\\'ordalia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695ce8b3-3c59-4aa0-9578-c4bef962c83b\', \'multiverseId\': 483744}, \'multiverseid\': 483744}, {\'name\': \'ヒエログリフの輝き\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引く。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「答えがここにある。試練を抜ける道だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d15eddc-759e-4851-8a4b-dd0944c4bdd5\', \'multiverseId\': 483995}, \'multiverseid\': 483995}, {\'name\': \'Iluminação Hieroglífica\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As respostas estão aqui. Esse é o caminho para superar a prova."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692e54f6-273d-4bb7-99d1-ffa2217ecce9\', \'multiverseId\': 484246}, \'multiverseid\': 484246}, {\'name\': \'Светящиеся Иероглифы\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Все ответы здесь. Вот он — путь через испытание».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b7d89fd-81b6-4b23-a73e-22a82d2cca70\', \'multiverseId\': 484497}, \'multiverseid\': 484497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerte Hydra\', \'text\': \'Die Ausgehungerte Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nDie Ausgehungerte Hydra kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Ausgehungerten Hydra Schaden zugefügt wird, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marke auf sie. (Sie muss den Schaden überleben, um die Marken zu erhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483056&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da0edfc1-8b06-4a45-9c5d-0615e4ed8182\', \'multiverseId\': 483056}, \'multiverseid\': 483056}, {\'name\': \'Hidra hambrienta\', \'text\': \'La Hidra hambrienta entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nLa Hidra hambrienta no puede ser bloqueada por más de una criatura.\\nSiempre que la Hidra hambrienta reciba daño, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. (Debe sobrevivir al daño para recibir los contadores.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d20fa41-73da-41a8-a21a-4d18db54e961\', \'multiverseId\': 483307}, \'multiverseid\': 483307}, {\'name\': \'Hydre affamée\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre affamée arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nL\'Hydre affamée ne peut pas être bloquée par plus d\'une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Hydre affamée subit des blessures, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. (Elle doit survivre aux blessures pour gagner les marqueurs.)", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7362ea13-f837-4c91-86d8-a21789a9b8f7\', \'multiverseId\': 483558}, \'multiverseid\': 483558}, {\'name\': \'Idra Affamata\', \'text\': "L\'Idra Affamata entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nL\'Idra Affamata non può essere bloccata da più di una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno all\'Idra Affamata, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. (Deve sopravvivere al danno per ottenere i segnalini.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d967de-6962-4d24-8234-a0bfd4c60e17\', \'multiverseId\': 483809}, \'multiverseid\': 483809}, {\'name\': \'飢餓ハイドラ\', \'text\': \'飢餓ハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n飢餓ハイドラは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n飢餓ハイドラがダメージを受けるたび、これの上にその点数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。（カウンターを得るには、そのダメージを受けた後でこれが戦場に残っている必要がある。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f1b36b-187f-4d14-90ef-91546c234968\', \'multiverseId\': 484060}, \'multiverseid\': 484060}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Faminta\', \'text\': \'Hidra Faminta entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nHidra Faminta não pode ser bloqueada por mais de uma criatura.\\nToda vez que Hidra Faminta sofrer dano, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 nela. (Ela precisa sobreviver ao dano para receber os marcadores.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43ea507-203d-461c-bcc2-778dd42d67cb\', \'multiverseId\': 484311}, \'multiverseid\': 484311}, {\'name\': \'Изголодавшаяся Гидра\', \'text\': \'Изголодавшаяся Гидра выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\nИзголодавшаяся Гидра не может быть заблокирована более чем одним существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда Изголодавшейся Гидре наносятся повреждения, положите на нее такое же количество жетонов +1/+1. (Она должна пережить повреждения, чтобы получить жетоны.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3dddbb5-0f4b-420a-8bba-cd669bb59d33\', \'multiverseId\': 484562}, \'multiverseid\': 484562}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483135&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31b94e1-ab9d-40e0-a760-52cad09dfc8d\', \'multiverseId\': 483135}, \'multiverseid\': 483135}, {\'name\': \'Tribunal azorio\', \'text\': \'El Tribunal azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Tribunal azorio entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a60e48b-85a6-42d9-918e-7a2622bb6eed\', \'multiverseId\': 483386}, \'multiverseid\': 483386}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483637&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9191892-efcc-4102-9a5f-a868db3f50ae\', \'multiverseId\': 483637}, \'multiverseid\': 483637}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716bc55c-8683-47da-b1f0-cbc72ef09a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 483888}, \'multiverseid\': 483888}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba18b25c-acb4-430a-929e-26295078277a\', \'multiverseId\': 484139}, \'multiverseid\': 484139}, {\'name\': \'Chancelaria Azorius\', \'text\': \'Chancelaria Azorius entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Chancelaria Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ba5f1a-e2f9-4888-a8fb-37af72d0492e\', \'multiverseId\': 484390}, \'multiverseid\': 484390}, {\'name\': \'Архив Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Архив Азориусов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Архив Азориусов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bccf350-9b3f-4096-a7ab-136cdfd07052\', \'multiverseId\': 484641}, \'multiverseid\': 484641}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist wie ein Labyrinth gestaltet und verkörpert damit die Rechtsprechung der Azorius — eine feste Struktur, die viel aushalten kann und Veränderungen verhindern soll.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483117&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d884d5-a7fb-4aa1-8425-dbd7a3c15a36\', \'multiverseId\': 483117}, \'multiverseid\': 483117}, {\'name\': \'Sello azorio\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El diseño, similar a un laberinto, representa el corazón de la ley azoria; una estructura rígida diseñada para desafiar voluntades y retrasar el cambio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a3b55b-d89e-483e-99a1-365857b117c2\', \'multiverseId\': 483368}, \'multiverseid\': 483368}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Azorius", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le motif labyrinthique représente la base de la loi d\'Azorius — une structure stricte conçue pour briser les volontés et nuire à l\'évolution.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483619&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfc46bc-06ac-4d1a-80de-bdc6789d231b\', \'multiverseId\': 483619}, \'multiverseid\': 483619}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Lo stile labirintico rappresenta l\'essenza della legge Azorius: una rigida struttura progettata per mettere alla prova la determinazione e per impedire i cambiamenti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055a1c4c-07b2-43f1-a57f-dbe3e69c14c2\', \'multiverseId\': 483870}, \'multiverseid\': 483870}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'迷路のような文様は、アゾリウスの法の中核を具現化している。意志を試し、変化を止める厳格な構造だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e36ddf-2468-4950-b668-2a00e922a4a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484121}, \'multiverseid\': 484121}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Azorius\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu desenho labiríntico expressa os fundamentos da lei Azorius — uma estrutura rígida projetada para testar a determinação e procrastinar mudanças.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc787dfc-a23c-4725-bb8c-70a03f62a22e\', \'multiverseId\': 484372}, \'multiverseid\': 484372}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Азориусов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Этот узор в виде лабиринта воплощает суть дома Азориусов — законопослушной структуры, которая испытывает волю и препятствует переменам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22114ef4-795a-4951-bc4d-43fad5e89979\', \'multiverseId\': 484623}, \'multiverseid\': 484623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannende Priesterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Bannende Priesterin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis die Bannende Priesterin das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Eidbrecher, ich verstoße dich!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d92ed0d2-72b9-4227-a082-8cf18ce569ef\', \'multiverseId\': 482956}, \'multiverseid\': 482956}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotisa desterradora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sacerdotisa desterradora entre al campo de batalla, exilia la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta que la Sacerdotisa desterradora deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Perjuro, yo te destierro!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e4552b-5002-4c38-858b-d899a533563f\', \'multiverseId\': 483207}, \'multiverseid\': 483207}, {\'name\': \'Prêtresse bannisseuse\', \'text\': "Quand la Prêtresse bannisseuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Prêtresse bannisseuse quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Parjure, je te bannis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ec9ed7-e0f3-410a-be03-63fe3542431c\', \'multiverseId\': 483458}, \'multiverseid\': 483458}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdotessa Esiliatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Sacerdotessa Esiliatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario finché la Sacerdotessa Esiliatrice non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Spergiuro, io ti bandisco!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8bd78cb-d051-4608-9dcd-f7c88196c1b7\', \'multiverseId\': 483709}, \'multiverseid\': 483709}, {\'name\': \'放逐する僧侶\', \'text\': \'放逐する僧侶が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。放逐する僧侶が戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「誓い破りめ、失せろ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1dd31cc-77d8-4d7f-9463-0f3ec50da5f9\', \'multiverseId\': 483960}, \'multiverseid\': 483960}, {\'name\': \'Sacerdote Banidor\', \'text\': \'Quando Sacerdote Banidor entrar no campo de batalha, exile a criatura alvo que um oponente controla até que Sacerdote Banidor deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu o exilo, ser perjuro!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbfb826b-91a0-4b44-bc1f-85852eb3c827\', \'multiverseId\': 484211}, \'multiverseid\': 484211}, {\'name\': \'Изгоняющая Жрица\', \'text\': \'Когда Изгоняющая Жрица выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевое существо под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Изгоняющая Жрица не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Преступивший клятву да будет изгнан!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7650feb-f3af-46c4-a4a6-3601275017fb\', \'multiverseId\': 484462}, \'multiverseid\': 484462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483143&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc44f03-5e99-4aa5-95fe-7bce5f2e3768\', \'multiverseId\': 483143}, \'multiverseid\': 483143}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fdd40db-134a-4bf8-b3eb-3751d6ad2f19\', \'multiverseId\': 483394}, \'multiverseid\': 483394}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483645&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfeae871-f7d7-40c2-8f8b-6014f3050a18\', \'multiverseId\': 483645}, \'multiverseid\': 483645}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la sconfitta si avvicina e manca la guida, tutti gli occhi guardano in una sola direzione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0332b7db-b1e0-4ca1-b457-9fe5ca8dd7e7\', \'multiverseId\': 483896}, \'multiverseid\': 483896}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1aca9d1-3ded-4c99-b3d1-2f4df8a6af90\', \'multiverseId\': 484147}, \'multiverseid\': 484147}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando a derrota está próxima e as orientações são escassas, todos os olhos miram uma direção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a283fe-1581-4dcb-923f-2a889b90bb74\', \'multiverseId\': 484398}, \'multiverseid\': 484398}, {\'name\': \'Командная Башня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Когда поражение близко, а командовать некому, все взгляды обращаются в одном направлении.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2051fe16-7f85-4b4e-b187-589a6fd7debe\', \'multiverseId\': 484649}, \'multiverseid\': 484649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinschienen des Blitzes\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Blitz in die Klippen einschlug, wurde Erz zu Eisen, Eisen zu Stahl und Stahl zu Beinschienen. Der Blitz blieb für immer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483124&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e28d16da-ad7d-49f6-b3e8-a670e64fe1c3\', \'multiverseId\': 483124}, \'multiverseid\': 483124}, {\'name\': \'Grebas relámpago\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que el relámpago golpeó los acantilados, el mineral se transformó en hierro, el hierro se convirtió en acero y el acero se convirtió en grebas. El relámpago nunca se fue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'734e0e53-1d1c-4ff9-803c-90868c3c0e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 483375}, \'multiverseid\': 483375}, {\'name\': "Jambières d\'éclair", \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la célérité et le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'éclair frappa les falaises, le minerai devint du fer, le fer de l\'acier, et l\'acier, des jambières. Jamais l\'éclair ne partit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483626&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bcab4a-3a8d-4a7c-a003-1af586d7f48d\', \'multiverseId\': 483626}, \'multiverseid\': 483626}, {\'name\': \'Schinieri dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità e velo. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nEquipaggiare {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Dopo che il fulmine colpì i dirupi, il minerale divenne ferro, il ferro divenne acciaio e l\'acciaio divenne uno schiniere. Il fulmine non se ne andò mai.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfdf06cf-21a1-4ced-952f-cac41de7d899\', \'multiverseId\': 483877}, \'multiverseid\': 483877}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のすね当て\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻が崖を打った後、鉱石は鉄となり、鉄は鋼となり、鋼はすね当てとなった。稲妻はそこに残ったままだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2792d478-6fd3-4f9d-9f70-ecf0a207fb4c\', \'multiverseId\': 484128}, \'multiverseid\': 484128}, {\'name\': \'Grevas Faiscantes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem manto e ímpeto. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que o relâmpago atingiu os penhascos, o minério fez-se ferro, o ferro fez-se aço e o aço fez-se grevas. E o relâmpago jamais as deixou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d3b367-82e7-41ab-be1b-600f152f4f94\', \'multiverseId\': 484379}, \'multiverseid\': 484379}, {\'name\': \'Поножи Молний\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Ускорение и Пелену. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей.)\\nСнарядить {0}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'После того как в утес ударила молния, из руды выплавили железо, из железа изготовили сталь, из стали выковали поножи. А молния никуда не делась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6a8997-d1aa-417e-90c6-3cd5169e8fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 484630}, \'multiverseid\': 484630}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beispielloses Manöver\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Hauptmann, Eure Einheiten sind die Speerspitze. Sie können sich keine Fehler erlauben."\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e3103ab-990e-4465-979b-9e66625b4d03\', \'multiverseId\': 484924}, \'multiverseid\': 484924}, {\'name\': \'Maniobra sin igual\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nLas criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitán, sus unidades son la punta de nuestra lanza. El fracaso no tiene cabida".\\n—Jirina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ee2ef0-3b20-4a20-985b-b2ade08f5155\', \'multiverseId\': 484975}, \'multiverseid\': 484975}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre irréprochable\', \'text\': "Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Capitaine, vos unités sont notre fer de lance. Vous n\'avez pas droit à l\'erreur. »\\n—Jirina Koudro", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485026&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395e03cf-4d68-4ce4-832b-77ed7d61a6db\', \'multiverseId\': 485026}, \'multiverseid\': 485026}, {\'name\': \'Manovra Impeccabile\', \'text\': \'Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nLe creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitano, le sue unità sono la punta della nostra lancia. Non c\\\'è spazio per il fallimento."\\n—Jerina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dcd43d5-dc7f-4f72-af4a-2b9d4907cdc5\', \'multiverseId\': 485077}, \'multiverseid\': 485077}, {\'name\': \'完璧な策略\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「隊長、あなたの部隊は私たちの槍の穂先よ。失敗の余地はないわ。」\\n――ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7386f3e-08de-4cbf-a39d-7b0e1c9b4c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 485128}, \'multiverseid\': 485128}, {\'name\': \'Manobra Impecável\', \'text\': \'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nAs criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Capitão, suas unidades são a ponta de nossas lanças. Não há margem para o fracasso."\\n— Jirrina Kudro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23ee023-8bea-455e-817e-17bad0f93ed6\', \'multiverseId\': 485179}, \'multiverseid\': 485179}, {\'name\': \'Безупречный Маневр\', \'text\': \'Если у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете разыграть это заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\\nСущества под вашим контролем получают Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Капитан, ваши войска — острие нашего копья. Права на ошибку нет».\\n— Джирина Кудро\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'586dafd4-5f30-4e37-b577-ea7103ea2a18\', \'multiverseId\': 485230}, \'multiverseid\': 485230}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerung des Außenpostens\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Belagerung des Außenpostens ins Spiel kommt, wähle Khane oder Drachen.\\n• Khane — Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schickst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du sie spielen.\\n• Drachen — Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt, fügt die Belagerung des Außenpostens einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4af62a-6308-4738-a4cf-67e2b326a352\', \'multiverseId\': 483036}, \'multiverseid\': 483036}, {\'name\': \'Asedio al destacamento\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Asedio al destacamento entre al campo de batalla, elige kans o dragones.\\n• Kans — Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\n• Dragones — Siempre que una criatura que controlas deje el campo de batalla, el Asedio al destacamento hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2ae958-bf96-4eb1-97bb-9495f3ebbe33\', \'multiverseId\': 483287}, \'multiverseid\': 483287}, {\'name\': "Siège de l\'avant-poste", \'text\': "Au moment où le Siège de l\'avant-poste arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez Khans ou Dragons.\\n• Khans — Au début de votre entretien, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\n• Dragons — À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille, le Siège de l\'avant-poste inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'182a443b-0716-47e6-bae3-f993c3e38417\', \'multiverseId\': 483538}, \'multiverseid\': 483538}, {\'name\': "Assedio dell\'Avamposto", \'text\': "Mentre l\'Assedio dell\'Avamposto entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli Khan o Draghi.\\n• Khan — All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\\n• Draghi — Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli lascia il campo di battaglia, l\'Assedio dell\'Avamposto infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b3ba1c2-7f0a-493c-8d84-1b95c617b879\', \'multiverseId\': 483789}, \'multiverseid\': 483789}, {\'name\': \'前哨地の包囲\', \'text\': \'前哨地の包囲が戦場に出るに際し、カンか龍かを選ぶ。\\n• カン ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n• 龍 ― あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体戦場を離れるたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。前哨地の包囲はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a05c1ac-fe66-4b92-a8b7-8698ff640b8c\', \'multiverseId\': 484040}, \'multiverseid\': 484040}, {\'name\': \'Cerco ao Posto Avançado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cerco ao Posto Avançado entra no campo de batalha, escolha Khans ou Dragões.\\n• Khans — No início de sua manutenção, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você poderá jogar aquele card.\\n• Dragões — Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla deixa o campo de batalha, Cerco ao Posto Avançado causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'523eae90-6a89-4105-bcb6-295e36cf9f48\', \'multiverseId\': 484291}, \'multiverseid\': 484291}, {\'name\': \'Осада Аванпоста\', \'text\': \'При выходе Осады Аванпоста на поле битвы выберите Ханов или Драконов.\\n• Ханы — В начале вашего шага поддержки изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть ту карту.\\n• Драконы — Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем покидает поле битвы, Осада Аванпоста наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7a9977-a54f-4e37-b5db-b2a4b1654b82\', \'multiverseId\': 484542}, \'multiverseid\': 484542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestienflüsterer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich verstehe die kleinste Maus deutlicher als all die Stimmen der Massen auf der Zinnstraße."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd008f11-2dba-43c0-8586-aea25626b1b7\', \'multiverseId\': 483046}, \'multiverseid\': 483046}, {\'name\': \'Encantador de bestias\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El ratoncillo más diminuto me habla más alto que todas las multitudes de la calle Hojalata".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76c8f33-a529-4b30-9788-72930f07fd4e\', \'multiverseId\': 483297}, \'multiverseid\': 483297}, {\'name\': \'Chuchoteur de bête\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Pour moi, la plus petite souris s\'exprime plus clairement que tous les badauds du festival de la Rue d\'étain. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ee2f2f-d074-4c88-a00a-aab3e5a037b1\', \'multiverseId\': 483548}, \'multiverseid\': 483548}, {\'name\': \'Sussurratore delle Bestie\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Alle mie orecchie, il topolino più minuscolo risuona più chiaro delle folle alla fiera di Via Latta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f971a182-5c4a-45ca-a1ad-a3200a04e146\', \'multiverseId\': 483799}, \'multiverseid\': 483799}, {\'name\': \'獣に囁く者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ちっぽけなネズミでも、その声はブリキ通りの祭騒ぎよりも大きく聞こえる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1582b1f-69f9-4955-927e-329fe5f595ec\', \'multiverseId\': 484050}, \'multiverseid\': 484050}, {\'name\': \'Encantador de Feras\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de criatura, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouço melhor um minúsculo camundongo do que toda a multidão do festival da Rua do Estanho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b994ec-4dad-426e-be08-8c7c6dc2ab9d\', \'multiverseId\': 484301}, \'multiverseid\': 484301}, {\'name\': \'Заклинатель Зверей\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Самая крохотная мышка говорит со мной громче, чем вся толпа гуляк на улице Жестянщиков».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4884428-0171-40d2-bdac-cea7ebc63dfa\', \'multiverseId\': 484552}, \'multiverseid\': 484552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beutegreifender Schlamm\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nImmer wenn der Beutegreifende Schlamm angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, der in diesem Zug vom Beutegreifenden Schlamm Schaden zugefügt wurde, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Beutegreifenden Schlamm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483064&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2337ccce-cf8d-4293-bba1-41db19da31ba\', \'multiverseId\': 483064}, \'multiverseid\': 483064}, {\'name\': \'Cieno depredador\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nSiempre que el Cieno depredador ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre él.\\nSiempre que una criatura que haya recibido daño del Cieno depredador este turno muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cieno depredador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e923033f-6375-4e38-9197-adf95f3ceff3\', \'multiverseId\': 483315}, \'multiverseid\': 483315}, {\'name\': \'Limon prédateur\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nÀ chaque fois que le Limon prédateur attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature blessée par le Limon prédateur ce tour-ci meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Limon prédateur.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48575407-cbe2-4dd6-8f68-8bd5323a4e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 483566}, \'multiverseid\': 483566}, {\'name\': \'Melma Predatrice\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nOgniqualvolta la Melma Predatrice attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nOgniqualvolta muore una creatura a cui la Melma Predatrice ha inflitto danno in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Melma Predatrice.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7e0ade-5d2f-4955-ad3f-c4e8937fb7e6\', \'multiverseId\': 483817}, \'multiverseid\': 483817}, {\'name\': \'捕食者のウーズ\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n捕食者のウーズが攻撃するたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nこのターンに捕食者のウーズからダメージを受けたクリーチャーが死亡するたび、捕食者のウーズの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7716f34c-71b8-48dd-8ac3-eb3c6207ef72\', \'multiverseId\': 484068}, \'multiverseid\': 484068}, {\'name\': \'Lodo Predador\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nToda vez que Lodo Predador atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que tiver sofrido dano de Lodo Predador neste turno morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Lodo Predador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e4cee9-be01-4d1e-81b2-353d879eeb37\', \'multiverseId\': 484319}, \'multiverseid\': 484319}, {\'name\': \'Хищная Тина\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nКаждый раз, когда Хищная Тина атакует, положите на нее один жетон +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо, которому Хищная Тина нанесла повреждения в этом ходу, умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Хищную Тину.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eafd8b3-9515-4ccc-8fad-1bf79bb0d6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 484570}, \'multiverseid\': 484570}]', "[{'name': 'Bewässertes Ackerland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDas Bewässerte Ackerland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483161&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3ebd645-be32-4180-918e-d169c44764c4', 'multiverseId': 483161}, 'multiverseid': 483161}, {'name': 'Cultivos irrigados', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nLos Cultivos irrigados entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483412&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ed22761-b3f0-4152-9e11-be9b7a170289', 'multiverseId': 483412}, 'multiverseid': 483412}, {'name': 'Terres arables irriguées', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLes Terres arables irriguées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483663&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f26cf50-a2d7-43bc-bffa-68eeabf9ec47', 'multiverseId': 483663}, 'multiverseid': 483663}, {'name': 'Colture Irrigate', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nLe Colture Irrigate entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483914&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50f879a8-2645-43b1-a90d-49f737d24437', 'multiverseId': 483914}, 'multiverseid': 483914}, {'name': '灌漑農地', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\n灌漑農地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484165&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '220c2aea-7c81-4b2f-8bd7-b71f6cadf54c', 'multiverseId': 484165}, 'multiverseid': 484165}, {'name': 'Fazendas Irrigadas', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.)\\nFazendas Irrigadas entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484416&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0aabc85-d18b-4942-9ef4-1f75e77d69ea', 'multiverseId': 484416}, 'multiverseid': 484416}, {'name': 'Орошаемые Поля', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {W} или {U}.)\\nОрошаемые Поля выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля — Равнина Остров', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484667&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e768194-943b-4025-b60f-44cbf0455526', 'multiverseId': 484667}, 'multiverseid': 484667}]", '[{\'name\': \'Biotronisches Bestiarium\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments wendest du Hellsicht 1 an.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kannst du {G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Inspiration findet man, wenn man nach außen sieht."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, weise Biotronikerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7428eefe-2ed6-4d64-9182-28f95a0779a9\', \'multiverseId\': 483123}, \'multiverseid\': 483123}, {\'name\': \'Bestiario del fraguavidas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, adivina 1.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, puedes pagar {G}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"La inspiración se encuentra mirando al exterior".\\n—Oviya Pashiri, fraguavidas sabia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aead6897-ca98-4e8c-80a7-b4be9553b629\', \'multiverseId\': 483374}, \'multiverseid\': 483374}, {\'name\': \'Bestiaire du façonneur de vie\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, regard 1.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, vous pouvez payer {G}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« L\'inspiration se trouve à l\'extérieur. »\\n—Oviya Pashiri, sage façonneuse de vie", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483625&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1e6f28-9a42-49e2-ae6d-025b4307a647\', \'multiverseId\': 483625}, \'multiverseid\': 483625}, {\'name\': \'Bestiario del Forgiavita\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, profetizza 1.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, puoi pagare {G}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ispirazione si trova guardando ciò che si ha di fronte."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, saggia forgiavita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2354e932-101a-44ac-9488-4ef52c9312d6\', \'multiverseId\': 483876}, \'multiverseid\': 483876}, {\'name\': \'造命師の動物記\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、占術１を行う。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「発想というものは外部を見つめることから得られるのです。」\\n――造命の賢者、オビア・パースリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7685bd43-ff13-4667-bb7a-6c2a8cf6a473\', \'multiverseId\': 484127}, \'multiverseid\': 484127}, {\'name\': \'Bestiário do Vivideiro\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, use vidência 1.\\nToda vez que conjura uma mágica de criatura, você pode pagar {G}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"A inspiração é encontrada através da observação do mundo exterior."\\n— Oviya Pashiri, sábia vivideira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ec2594-7038-465b-8777-11a04e58aef1\', \'multiverseId\': 484378}, \'multiverseid\': 484378}, {\'name\': \'Зверинец Жизнетворца\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки предскажите 1.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, вы можете заплатить {G}. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Вдохновение можно найти, если смотреть вдаль».\\n— мудрая Овия Пашири, жизнетворец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99ceee8-891c-4499-89ea-4b7cb4a2daf0\', \'multiverseId\': 484629}, \'multiverseid\': 484629}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483140&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b15a6d-09b2-41c3-979a-798caa25145d\', \'multiverseId\': 483140}, \'multiverseid\': 483140}, {\'name\': \'Panorámica de la enramada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.)\\nLa Panorámica de la enramada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'El continente de Murasa se oculta bajo una espesa capa de vegetación. Las enormes ramas que lo cubren están tan enredadas que algunos de sus habitantes jamás llegan a ver el suelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bedf149-1785-46c8-9bbe-4269288ed64b\', \'multiverseId\': 483391}, \'multiverseid\': 483391}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483642&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d118196-7f6b-45db-8538-056a33f28cd3\', \'multiverseId\': 483642}, \'multiverseid\': 483642}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nIl Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Murasa giace sotto una coltre di fitta vegetazione, dagli enormi rami aggrovigliati così strettamente che alcuni dei suoi abitanti non vedono mai il suolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831a8206-7808-4e31-98d7-7dad7cb94b90\', \'multiverseId\': 483893}, \'multiverseid\': 483893}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが基本土地を２つ以上コントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59be2949-e599-4d50-afde-49a9ad4e0b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 484144}, \'multiverseid\': 484144}, {\'name\': \'Vista do Dossel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.)\\nVista do Dossel entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'O continente de Murasa fica sob um manto de densa vegetação, seus galhos enormes tão densamente emaranhados que alguns habitantes jamais veem o chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dd94c40-ddd3-401d-a576-3e90fb086731\', \'multiverseId\': 484395}, \'multiverseid\': 484395}, {\'name\': \'Дорога Среди Крон\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.)\\nДорога Среди Крон выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Лес Равнина\', \'flavor\': \'Весь континент Мураса покрывают дремучие леса. Огромные ветви деревьев переплетаются так плотно, что некоторые обитатели крон живут и умирают, ни разу не увидев земли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2340c25-7ffb-4e60-b364-0212f3996aab\', \'multiverseId\': 484646}, \'multiverseid\': 484646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483138&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b04d7a-edac-4a79-b10c-bb8e43589694\', \'multiverseId\': 483138}, \'multiverseid\': 483138}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3c63e0-87c4-4961-b926-06f48cef7564\', \'multiverseId\': 483389}, \'multiverseid\': 483389}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière du joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483640&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0960dd4c-4aff-4342-8eee-404e604dba28\', \'multiverseId\': 483640}, \'multiverseid\': 483640}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6567b2f0-79e3-4f40-9019-6af9e10f7d40\', \'multiverseId\': 483891}, \'multiverseid\': 483891}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地からカードをすべて追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1aa14a6-9e65-4e88-942f-448114fd30f9\', \'multiverseId\': 484142}, \'multiverseid\': 484142}, {\'name\': \'Pântano de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Pântano de Bojuka entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Pântano de Bojuka entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cefc4b-ef03-4088-86a9-75c9453f48f0\', \'multiverseId\': 484393}, \'multiverseid\': 484393}, {\'name\': \'Боджукское Болото\', \'text\': \'Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eb84e83-2d5b-42d0-ad56-41b6da11b14f\', \'multiverseId\': 484644}, \'multiverseid\': 484644}]', "[{'name': 'Boros-Garnison', 'text': 'Die Boros-Garnison kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Boros-Garnison ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483139&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c164b6a8-a836-4d29-890f-9be2d5855de2', 'multiverseId': 483139}, 'multiverseid': 483139}, {'name': 'Fuerte boros', 'text': 'El Fuerte boros entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Fuerte boros entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483390&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe23365f-3c70-4dc3-8217-2a3cb4a2f359', 'multiverseId': 483390}, 'multiverseid': 483390}, {'name': 'Garnison de Boros', 'text': 'La Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Garnison de Boros arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483641&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d31fc8f-bdf8-426b-b9fc-bde12bbc5682', 'multiverseId': 483641}, 'multiverseid': 483641}, {'name': 'Presidio Boros', 'text': 'Il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Presidio Boros entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483892&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5183dfd9-38e4-4346-8b0a-635f6041ff3b', 'multiverseId': 483892}, 'multiverseid': 483892}, {'name': 'ボロスの駐屯地', 'text': 'ボロスの駐屯地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボロスの駐屯地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484143&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f2175e8-c15a-4e4a-b0d3-00f7c1149a2b', 'multiverseId': 484143}, 'multiverseid': 484143}, {'name': 'Guarnição Boros', 'text': 'Guarnição Boros entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Guarnição Boros entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484394&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '881b9944-a835-4add-9a25-f0c1539e405e', 'multiverseId': 484394}, 'multiverseid': 484394}, {'name': 'Гарнизон Боросов', 'text': 'Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Гарнизон Боросов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484645&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23dcc9c3-3b70-4779-9d86-d2089b587d06', 'multiverseId': 484645}, 'multiverseid': 484645}]", '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Hattest du schon einmal ein Boros-Petschaft in der Hand? Man wundert sich, dass es bei seiner Größe so schwer sein kann — ein Gewicht von Stolz und Stärke."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483118&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc36c25-d1db-4dd6-97cc-e6a2104d0288\', \'multiverseId\': 483118}, \'multiverseid\': 483118}, {\'name\': \'Sello boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Has sostenido alguna vez un sello boros? Tiene un peso que no se corresponde con su tamaño: el peso de la fuerza y el orgullo".\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8121f1d-4b57-4766-ba00-67b2c22c7da7\', \'multiverseId\': 483369}, \'multiverseid\': 483369}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Avez-vous déjà eu en main le cachet de Boros ? Il est bien plus lourd qu\'on pourrait le croire — il a le pesant de la force et de la fierté. »\\n—Agrus Kos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483620&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'913cdeee-42e2-4b86-aaeb-47ac2fb67d83\', \'multiverseId\': 483620}, \'multiverseid\': 483620}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai mai tenuto in mano un sigillo Boros? Il suo peso stupisce in rapporto alle dimensioni: è il peso della forza e dell\\\'orgoglio."\\n—Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4aeac6a-679f-4847-b2f2-f915883378fc\', \'multiverseId\': 483871}, \'multiverseid\': 483871}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「ボロスの印鑑を手にしたことがあるか？その重さは見た目以上だ。力と誇りの重みなのだ。」\\n――アグルス・コス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7643acc4-8af3-465f-b0a1-725ddebf1cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 484122}, \'multiverseid\': 484122}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Boros\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Você já segurou um sinete Boros? Seu peso não corresponde ao seu tamanho, é o peso da força e do orgulho."\\n— Agrus Kos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d22e50e9-1783-4a23-aada-80f8e4aea1c1\', \'multiverseId\': 484373}, \'multiverseid\': 484373}, {\'name\': \'Печать Боросов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Вы когда-нибудь держали в руках печать Боросов? Она невероятно тяжелая для своего размера. Ей придают вес сила и гордость».\\n— Агрус Кос\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d67c58-0548-4f0c-9353-6c85564d5d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 484624}, \'multiverseid\': 484624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bottich der Nachäffung\', \'text\': \'Einprägen — Immer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du sie ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, lege alle anderen Karten, die mit dem Bottich der Nachäffung ins Exil geschickt wurden, auf die Friedhöfe ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\n{3}, {T}: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie einer mit dem Bottich der Nachäffung ins Exil geschickten Karte ist. Er erhält Eile. Schicke ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483125&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96f8d2e3-7fa6-4220-8d33-85083eefabf7\', \'multiverseId\': 483125}, \'multiverseid\': 483125}, {\'name\': \'Tanque mímico\', \'text\': \'Estampa — Siempre que una criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes exiliar esa carta. Si lo haces, regresa cada una de las otras cartas exiliadas con el Tanque mímico al cementerio de su propietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Crea una ficha que es una copia de una carta exiliada con el Tanque mímico. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb984eb2-7d15-4ee8-9091-98814bcea409\', \'multiverseId\': 483376}, \'multiverseid\': 483376}, {\'name\': \'Cuve de mimétisme\', \'text\': "Empreinte — À chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez exiler cette carte. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez chaque autre carte exilée par la Cuve de mimétisme dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.\\n{3}, {T} : Créez un jeton qui est une copie d\'une carte exilée par la Cuve de mimétisme. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483627&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fe79dee-a1d7-44e8-a415-01a3f99e8e46\', \'multiverseId\': 483627}, \'multiverseid\': 483627}, {\'name\': \'Vasca del Mimic\', \'text\': "Imprimere — Ogniqualvolta una creatura non pedina muore, puoi esiliare quella carta. Se lo fai, fai tornare ogni altra carta esiliata con la Vasca del Mimic nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\\n{3}, {T}: Crea una pedina che è una copia di una carta esiliata con la Vasca del Mimic. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc7bb77c-3e15-4ebb-98ab-640c022b2ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 483878}, \'multiverseid\': 483878}, {\'name\': \'ミミックの大桶\', \'text\': \'刻印 ― トークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたはそのカードを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、他の、ミミックの大桶によって追放されている各カードをオーナーの墓地に戻す。\\n{3}, {T}：ミミックの大桶によって追放されているカード１枚のコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67e53f2b-199e-4b1a-9a47-151733fe3d12\', \'multiverseId\': 484129}, \'multiverseid\': 484129}, {\'name\': \'Barril de Mímica\', \'text\': \'Estampar — Toda vez que uma criatura que não seja ficha morrer, você poderá exilar aquele card. Se fizer isso, devolva cada outro card exilado com Barril de Mímica ao cemitério de seu dono.\\n{3}, {T}: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de um card exilado com Barril de Mímica. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f65c75-c801-4059-aebd-f97e2a9884bb\', \'multiverseId\': 484380}, \'multiverseid\': 484380}, {\'name\': \'Чан Подражания\', \'text\': \'Отпечаток — Каждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо умирает, вы можете изгнать ту карту. Если вы это делаете, верните каждую другую карту, изгнанную Чаном Подражания, на кладбище ее владельца.\\n{3}, {T}: создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией карты, изгнанной Чаном Подражания. Она получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56bd1634-cc3b-49f3-90bc-f3bb0db46894\', \'multiverseId\': 484631}, \'multiverseid\': 484631}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brallin, Himmelshai-Reiter\', \'text\': \'Partner von Shabraz dem Himmelshai (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Shabraz aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte abwirfst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Brallin, Himmelshai-Reiter. Er fügt jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{R}: Ein Hai deiner Wahl verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a596984-877e-400f-84b8-fdc10b7e7bdb\', \'multiverseId\': 484731}, \'multiverseid\': 484731}, {\'name\': \'Brallin, jinete del Aerotiburón\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Shábraz, el Aerotiburón (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Shábraz en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nSiempre que descartes una carta, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Brallin, jinete del Aerotiburón y él hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\\n{R}: El Tiburón objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e149fd3-a323-402a-aa17-313fb48957d4\', \'multiverseId\': 484751}, \'multiverseid\': 484751}, {\'name\': \'Brallin, chevaucheur de squale céleste\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Shabraz, le squale céleste (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Shabraz dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Brallin, chevaucheur de squale céleste et il inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.\\n{R} : Le requin ciblé acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'367ee952-9433-4da3-9218-d87d310b66da\', \'multiverseId\': 484771}, \'multiverseid\': 484771}, {\'name\': "Brallin, Cavalcante dell\'Aerosqualo", \'text\': "Partner di Shabraz, l\'Aerosqualo (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Shabraz alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Brallin, Cavalcante dell\'Aerosqualo ed esso infligge 1 danno a ogni avversario.\\n{R}: Uno Squalo bersaglio ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88c134f1-8cfa-44ce-9424-3d583990a279\', \'multiverseId\': 484791}, \'multiverseid\': 484791}, {\'name\': \'空鮫の乗り手、ブラーリン\', \'text\': \'空鮫、シャーブラズとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから空鮫、シャーブラズを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたがカードを１枚捨てるたび、空鮫の乗り手、ブラーリンの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、これは各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\\n{R}：サメ１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148f86fc-cf93-432f-9bc9-1427f37acc1a\', \'multiverseId\': 484811}, \'multiverseid\': 484811}, {\'name\': \'Brallin, Ginete de Tubarão-celeste\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Shabraz, o Tubarão-celeste (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Shabraz na própria mão do próprio cemitério e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nToda vez que você descartar um card, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Brallin, Ginete de Tubarão-celeste e ele causa 1 ponto de dano a cada oponente.\\n{R}: O Tubarão alvo ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8702cd5-b4c4-4ee9-8aa9-243fc5f7924b\', \'multiverseId\': 484831}, \'multiverseid\': 484831}, {\'name\': \'Браллин, Наездник Небесной Акулы\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Шабраз, Небесной Акулой (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Шабраз в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Браллина, Наездника Небесной Акулы, и он наносит 1 повреждение каждому оппоненту.\\n{R}: целевая Акула получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81118cc6-84e8-411f-ae72-f80dbc646644\', \'multiverseId\': 484851}, \'multiverseid\': 484851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandrodung\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Fleck der Erde ist wirklich unfruchtbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483053&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6f4340-beb8-4940-a319-7f58d8945ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 483053}, \'multiverseid\': 483053}, {\'name\': \'Gradar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'En la naturaleza no hay lugares del todo yermos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71742387-5353-4bfb-a5f0-ee936364945a\', \'multiverseId\': 483304}, \'multiverseid\': 483304}, {\'name\': \'Hersage\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La nature ne renonce jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483555&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02512192-3c36-4473-b393-352d9b4d3d90\', \'multiverseId\': 483555}, \'multiverseid\': 483555}, {\'name\': \'Erpice\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una terra.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'In natura nessun luogo è realmente spoglio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bcb93b-0c5f-4bb7-8484-1c30d8892fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 483806}, \'multiverseid\': 483806}, {\'name\': \'砕土\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然の中には、真の意味で不毛の地などはないのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36714580-925d-4736-9f0d-1841e1638af3\', \'multiverseId\': 484057}, \'multiverseid\': 484057}, {\'name\': \'Estorrar\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique um terreno.\\nProcure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhum lugar na natureza é verdadeiramente estéril.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'548d0a2e-b243-4b8c-bebb-188f966e07c5\', \'multiverseId\': 484308}, \'multiverseid\': 484308}, {\'name\': \'Боронение\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте землю.\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Ни одно место в природе не бывает по-настоящему бесплодным.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36dbb74-cd2d-4c8d-b86b-642c16cb8ce0\', \'multiverseId\': 484559}, \'multiverseid\': 484559}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutgründe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Bewege eine Marke von einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, auf eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Scheckige Pelze werden zu gepanzerten Häuten. Weiche Kiefer werden zu messerscharfen Stoßzähnen. Friedliches Spiel wird zum Kampf ums Überleben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df31f2b-8f56-4289-a307-d2bd253d36d7\', \'multiverseId\': 484969}, \'multiverseid\': 484969}, {\'name\': \'Tierras de anidación\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Mueve un contador del permanente objetivo que controlas a otro permanente objetivo. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los pelajes veteados se convierten en pieles blindadas. Las fauces suaves, en colmillos afilados. Los juegos de los polluelos, en luchas por sobrevivir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0be83c8-6578-4bf3-b655-5621f67251e0\', \'multiverseId\': 485020}, \'multiverseid\': 485020}, {\'name\': \'Terrains de nidification\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Déplacez un marqueur d\'un permanent ciblé que vous contrôlez sur un autre permanent ciblé. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les pelages tachetés deviennent d\'épaisses cuirasses. Les mâchoires inoffensives deviennent des défenses tranchantes. Les jeux innocents deviennent une lutte pour la survie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184103c4-9d7a-4d84-be80-47da36a1896b\', \'multiverseId\': 485071}, \'multiverseid\': 485071}, {\'name\': \'Territorio di Nidificazione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Sposta un segnalino da un permanente bersaglio che controlli a un altro permanente bersaglio. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Piumaggi maculati diventano mantelli corazzati. Dentature delicate diventano fauci affilate. I giochi nel nido diventano una lotta per la sopravvivenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8050f3b-1972-49e2-88c1-26f290d3f804\', \'multiverseId\': 485122}, \'multiverseid\': 485122}, {\'name\': \'巣ごもりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているパーマネント１つと、他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。その前者の上からカウンター１個を、その後者の上に移動する。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'まだら模様の毛は強固な毛皮となる。弱い歯は鋭い牙となる。仔の遊びは生の戦いとなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb35efa4-8c7b-439b-a864-2c98c114c2dd\', \'multiverseId\': 485173}, \'multiverseid\': 485173}, {\'name\': \'Zona de Nidificação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Mova um marcador de uma permanente alvo que você controla para outra permanente alvo. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As pelugens malhadas tornam-se couraças. As mandíbulas delicadas tornam-se presas pontiagudas. As brincadeiras do ninho tornam-se uma luta pela sobrevivência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c9e3fc-f09c-4822-bdb7-3080537c3511\', \'multiverseId\': 485224}, \'multiverseid\': 485224}, {\'name\': \'Край Гнездовий\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: переместите один жетон с целевого перманента под вашим контролем на другой целевой перманент. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Пестрый мех сменяется на бронированную шкуру. Ленивые челюсти превращаются в острые как бритва клыки. Игры детенышей становятся битвой за выживание.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24a4c15d-858e-4f4d-a2d3-77f1ad202db8\', \'multiverseId\': 485275}, \'multiverseid\': 485275}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bynder-Ornament\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{4}, {T}: Jeder Spieler, der eine bleibende Karte namens Bynder-Ornament kontrolliert, zieht eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Neu gegründete Familien verdienen auch ein Familienwappen."\\n—Kinnan, Bynder-Naturtalent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1d2e5fd-01c7-4ac7-9b35-07b88183f8b8\', \'multiverseId\': 484965}, \'multiverseid\': 484965}, {\'name\': \'Adorno de vinculador\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{4}, {T}: Cada jugador que controla un permanente llamado Adorno de vinculador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las familias no consanguíneas también se merecen un blasón familiar".\\n—Kinnan, el Vinculador Prodigioso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a23d0bc-4ec1-4105-ad67-c08f3a01e891\', \'multiverseId\': 485016}, \'multiverseid\': 485016}, {\'name\': \'Ornement de brideur\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{4}, {T} : Chaque joueur qui contrôle un permanent appelé Ornement de brideur pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les familles de cœur aussi ont droit à leurs armoiries. »\\n—Kinnan, prodige brideur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684de3f0-83b1-4c3b-8d1c-79fe86b20288\', \'multiverseId\': 485067}, \'multiverseid\': 485067}, {\'name\': \'Ornamento del Vincolatore\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{4}, {T}: Ogni giocatore che controlla un permanente chiamato Ornamento del Vincolatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche le famiglie trovate per caso meritano uno stemma che le rappresenti."\\n—Kinnan, vincolatore prodigio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e75f4e0-14b2-4cc9-8759-e26bb8cf5a81\', \'multiverseId\': 485118}, \'multiverseid\': 485118}, {\'name\': \'眷者の装飾品\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：「眷者の装飾品」という名前のパーマネントをコントロールしている各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「選んだ家族にだって紋章があっていい。」\\n――眷者の神童、キナン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551ca0f6-dddc-4575-9a92-f48914d83f44\', \'multiverseId\': 485169}, \'multiverseid\': 485169}, {\'name\': \'Ornamento dos Vinculadores\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{4}, {T}: Cada jogador que controla uma permanente chamada Ornamento dos Vinculadores compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Famílias adotivas também merecem seus brasões."\\n— Kinnan, vinculador prodígio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce347f33-9a38-4eb0-b07a-a68fc5ef2638\', \'multiverseId\': 485220}, \'multiverseid\': 485220}, {\'name\': \'Украшение Узоманта\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{4}, {T}: каждый игрок, контролирующий перманент с именем Украшение Узоманта, берет карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«У обретенных семей тоже должен быть фамильный герб».\\n— Киннан, одаренный узомант\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b928d06-3b5f-4019-bef3-7057e1c13e2a\', \'multiverseId\': 485271}, \'multiverseid\': 485271}]', '[{\'name\': \'Capricopius\', \'text\': \'Der Capricopius kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{2}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Capricopius. Dann kannst du neu bestimmen, welchen Spieler der Capricopius angreift. Nur der Spieler, den der Capricopius angreift, kann diese Fähigkeit aktivieren, und auch nur im Angreifer-deklarieren-Segment. (Er kann nicht seinen Beherrscher angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ziege, Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feea4cb2-20ba-4a22-b553-bb580de137df\', \'multiverseId\': 484956}, \'multiverseid\': 484956}, {\'name\': \'Caprabero\', \'text\': \'El Caprabero entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\n{2}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Caprabero, luego puedes volver a elegir a qué jugador está atacando el Caprabero. Solo el jugador al que esté atacando el Caprabero puede activar esta habilidad y solo durante el paso de declarar atacantes. (No puede atacar a su controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra cabra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde637c3-fc62-4bac-be10-92831f3ed1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 485007}, \'multiverseid\': 485007}, {\'name\': \'Capricope\', \'text\': "Le Capricope arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{2} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Capricope, puis vous pouvez re-sélectionner quel joueur le Capricope attaque. Seul le joueur que le Capricope attaque peut activer cette capacité et que pendant l\'étape de déclaration des attaquants. (Il ne peut pas attaquer son contrôleur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chèvre et hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd7bfc6a-bffc-46b5-91e7-b559627988f7\', \'multiverseId\': 485058}, \'multiverseid\': 485058}, {\'name\': \'Capricopia\', \'text\': \'La Capricopia entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\n{2}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Capricopia, poi puoi cambiare il giocatore che la Capricopia sta attaccando. Solo il giocatore che la Capricopia sta attaccando può attivare questa abilità e solo durante la sottofase di dichiarazione delle creature attaccanti. (Non può attaccare il suo controllore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra Capra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b4a5d1-debb-4103-acfa-5b563f077cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 485109}, \'multiverseid\': 485109}, {\'name\': \'多頭山羊\', \'text\': \'多頭山羊は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}：多頭山羊の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。その後あなたは多頭山羊が攻撃するプレイヤーを選び直してもよい。この能力は、多頭山羊が攻撃しているプレイヤーのみが、攻撃クリーチャー指定ステップ中にのみ、起動できる。（これはこれのコントローラーを攻撃できない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヤギ・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be2da51-9e66-4909-98a8-3315c1dd9487\', \'multiverseId\': 485160}, \'multiverseid\': 485160}, {\'name\': \'Capricópio\', \'text\': \'Capricópio entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\n{2}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Capricópio. Em seguida, você pode selecionar novamente qual jogador Capricópio está atacando. Somente o jogador que Capricópio está atacando pode ativar esta habilidade, e somente durante a etapa de declaração de atacantes. (Ele não pode atacar o próprio controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bode Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b1e0e6-0759-4eb9-bc63-0a58e3547d75\', \'multiverseId\': 485211}, \'multiverseid\': 485211}, {\'name\': \'Каприкопий\', \'text\': \'Каприкопий выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\\n{2}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Каприкопия, затем вы можете изменить то, какого игрока атакует Каприкопий. Эту способность может активировать только игрок, которого атакует Каприкопий, и только во время шага объявления атакующих. (Он не может атаковать контролирующего его игрока.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Коза Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9959a585-0613-4ea6-a84c-c784265a752c\', \'multiverseId\': 485262}, \'multiverseid\': 485262}]', '[{\'name\': \'Cazur, skrupelloser Jäger\', \'text\': \'Partner von Ukkima, dem schleichenden Schatten (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Ukkima aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b26bab-7e33-44de-a159-aabe2663b060\', \'multiverseId\': 484732}, \'multiverseid\': 484732}, {\'name\': \'Cazur, acechador despiadado\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Ukkima, sombra acechadora (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Ukkima en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46f978ec-a109-49a6-9787-f8470daf9d98\', \'multiverseId\': 484752}, \'multiverseid\': 484752}, {\'name\': \'Cazur, pisteur impitoyable\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Ukkima, ombre en chasse (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Ukkima dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484772&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acd5fcb-895b-4c84-b143-ce41ddc148a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484772}, \'multiverseid\': 484772}, {\'name\': \'Casur, Cacciatore Spietato\', \'text\': \'Partner di Ukkima, Ombra Cacciatrice (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Ukkima alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9c9cbb-ea6b-4bd3-afce-b2608d7a865e\', \'multiverseId\': 484792}, \'multiverseid\': 484792}, {\'name\': \'無情な追跡者、カズル\', \'text\': \'追跡する影、ウキーマとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから追跡する影、ウキーマを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37635373-7632-4b3f-8ea2-08056114354b\', \'multiverseId\': 484812}, \'multiverseid\': 484812}, {\'name\': \'Cazur, Espreitador Impiedoso\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Ukkima, Sombra Espreitadora (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Ukkima na própria mão do próprio cemitério e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 naquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7b70226-e4b5-4645-bc4f-e954b01e98f8\', \'multiverseId\': 484832}, \'multiverseid\': 484832}, {\'name\': \'Казур, Беспощадный Следопыт\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Уккимой, Хищной Тенью (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Уккиму в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите один жетон +1/+1 на то существо.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4d8c494-4766-4df7-a68d-9b57a04c3b07\', \'multiverseId\': 484852}, \'multiverseid\': 484852}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chandra die Flammenruferin\', \'text\': \'+1: Erzeuge zwei 3/1 rote Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\\n0: Wirf alle Karten aus deiner Hand ab und ziehe dann entsprechend viele Karten plus eine.\\n−X: Chandra die Flammenruferin fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483024&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6634c05-78a7-4ec5-8564-f1c70d60519f\', \'multiverseId\': 483024}, \'multiverseid\': 483024}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Invocallamas\', \'text\': \'+1: Crea dos fichas de criatura Elemental rojas 3/1 con la habilidad de prisa. Exílialas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\n0: Descarta todas las cartas en tu mano. Luego, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas más una.\\n−X: Chandra, Invocallamas hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a68d455-b895-4ce5-bbc0-76c8d09a0f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 483275}, \'multiverseid\': 483275}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, meneuse de flammes\', \'text\': \'+1: Créez deux jetons de créature 3/1 rouge Élémental avec la célérité. Exilez-les au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\n0: Défaussez-vous de toutes les cartes de votre main, puis piochez autant de cartes plus une.\\n-X: Chandra, meneuse de flammes inflige X blessures à chaque créature.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483526&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c4cf991-0286-41c0-b84f-c6fb4386ea59\', \'multiverseId\': 483526}, \'multiverseid\': 483526}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Evocatrice di Fiamme\', \'text\': "+1: Crea due pedine creatura Elementale 3/1 rosse con rapidità. Esiliale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\n0: Scarta tutte le carte della tua mano, poi pesca altrettante carte più una.\\n-X: Chandra, Evocatrice di Fiamme infligge X danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435dc555-09bf-43e8-82f1-26618117c1cd\', \'multiverseId\': 483777}, \'multiverseid\': 483777}, {\'name\': \'炎呼び、チャンドラ\', \'text\': \'+1：速攻を持つ赤の３/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを追放する。\\n0：あなたの手札にあるカードをすべて捨て、その後その枚数に１を足した枚数のカードを引く。\\n-X：炎呼び、チャンドラは各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — チャンドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3e22d2-5932-4ab2-a8c1-e1be4da9e7a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484028}, \'multiverseid\': 484028}, {\'name\': \'Chandra, Invocadora do Fogo\', \'text\': \'+1: Crie duas fichas de criatura vermelha 3/1 do tipo Elemental com ímpeto. Exile-as no início da próxima etapa final.\\n0: Descarte todos os cards da sua mão e depois compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards mais um.\\n−X: Chandra, Invocadora do Fogo, causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Chandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb60d73-43a0-4f31-beb7-902618606601\', \'multiverseId\': 484279}, \'multiverseid\': 484279}, {\'name\': \'Чандра, Заклинательница Огня\', \'text\': \'+1: создайте две фишки существа 3/1 красный Элементаль с Ускорением. Изгоните их в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\n0: сбросьте все карты в вашей руке, затем возьмите столько же карт плюс одну.\\n−X: Чандра, Заклинательница Огня наносит X повреждений каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Чандра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4562879-549d-4922-9852-9698d932c87f\', \'multiverseId\': 484530}, \'multiverseid\': 484530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt sie in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483025&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'039dfac0-89a7-4958-baa2-479191affe99\', \'multiverseId\': 483025}, \'multiverseid\': 483025}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d643467-0d04-49a6-b920-db3e1a234cba\', \'multiverseId\': 483276}, \'multiverseid\': 483276}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire du permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483527&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78329431-221d-4164-8ed6-388021e8cb79\', \'multiverseId\': 483527}, \'multiverseid\': 483527}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7444c35-8ff2-4e02-a30d-33c317c7d14d\', \'multiverseId\': 483778}, \'multiverseid\': 483778}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2cd20e-6a9e-4c84-ae30-0bf7b2070ead\', \'multiverseId\': 484029}, \'multiverseid\': 484029}, {\'name\': \'Distorção Caótica\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo a embaralha no próprio grimório e depois revela o card do topo do próprio grimório. Se for um card de permanente, ele o coloca no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96e0638-b954-4c17-9e4e-b320903b1269\', \'multiverseId\': 484280}, \'multiverseid\': 484280}, {\'name\': \'Искривление Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Владелец целевого перманента втасовывает его в свою библиотеку, затем показывает верхнюю карту своей библиотеки. Если это карта перманента, он кладет ее на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86c6ae4-9d94-40bf-97fb-6f71a158642f\', \'multiverseId\': 484531}, \'multiverseid\': 484531}]', "[{'name': 'Dampfender Krater', 'text': 'Der Dampfende Krater kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483192&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5bb1433d-2dc7-4278-b6f7-83e388723828', 'multiverseId': 483192}, 'multiverseid': 483192}, {'name': 'Cráter ardiente', 'text': 'El Cráter ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483443&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dbc24ce-1852-4dbc-a47b-339f54442c5c', 'multiverseId': 483443}, 'multiverseid': 483443}, {'name': 'Cratère fumant', 'text': 'Le Cratère fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483694&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '075f19bf-9f7f-40ee-a93b-338efc8f6cfe', 'multiverseId': 483694}, 'multiverseid': 483694}, {'name': 'Cratere Fumante', 'text': 'Il Cratere Fumante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483945&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cacab8ef-10bf-449b-b586-94aba980595b', 'multiverseId': 483945}, 'multiverseid': 483945}, {'name': '薄煙の火口', 'text': '薄煙の火口はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484196&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6e8c169-4c6d-47a7-a75a-dbef10da676a', 'multiverseId': 484196}, 'multiverseid': 484196}, {'name': 'Cratera Fumegante', 'text': 'Cratera Fumegante entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484447&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1027a150-31ad-44e0-9224-070163e54207', 'multiverseId': 484447}, 'multiverseid': 484447}, {'name': 'Тлеющий Кратер', 'text': 'Тлеющий Кратер выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484698&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d4f686f-6184-4648-bb83-534e795afa8c', 'multiverseId': 484698}, 'multiverseid': 484698}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dann leben sie noch heute\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Jede der Kreaturen ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie. Lege Dann leben sie noch heute unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc68b03-eb43-4455-97fb-743a5988defa\', \'multiverseId\': 483012}, \'multiverseid\': 483012}, {\'name\': \'Para siempre\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Cada una de esas criaturas es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos. Pon Para siempre en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3d00c9e-e9c3-467b-ac05-8e529a3be52e\', \'multiverseId\': 483263}, \'multiverseid\': 483263}, {\'name\': \'À tout jamais\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Chacune de ces créatures est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types. Mettez À tout jamais au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff201839-8a3b-4976-8caf-809422fac184\', \'multiverseId\': 483514}, \'multiverseid\': 483514}, {\'name\': \'Finché Morte Non Vi Separi\', \'text\': \'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a due carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Ognuna di quelle creature è uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori. Metti Finché Morte Non Vi Separi in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e949cd9-7ade-4407-9daf-194422b18a41\', \'multiverseId\': 483765}, \'multiverseid\': 483765}, {\'name\': \'末永く\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。それらの各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それの他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。末永くをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd76149-1762-427a-9149-6fcd1cf35c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 484016}, \'multiverseid\': 484016}, {\'name\': \'Para Sempre\', \'text\': \'Devolva até dois cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Cada uma daquelas criaturas é um Zumbi preto além de suas outras cores e tipos. Coloque Para Sempre no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f214c8b7-8c10-441b-ad88-8cc235a0be8d\', \'multiverseId\': 484267}, \'multiverseid\': 484267}, {\'name\': \'Долго и Счастливо\', \'text\': \'Верните не более двух целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Каждое из тех существ является черным Зомби в дополнение к своим другим цветам и типам. Положите Долго и Счастливо в низ библиотеки владельца.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91867c91-2dbc-434b-81e6-76ce6693ce3b\', \'multiverseId\': 484518}, \'multiverseid\': 484518}]', "[{'name': 'Dekret der Gerechtigkeit', 'text': 'Erzeuge X 4/4 weiße Engel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W} ({2}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret der Gerechtigkeit umwandelst, kannst du {X} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482964&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f2920ba-0e0a-4e4e-9606-f786dcf60ee4', 'multiverseId': 482964}, 'multiverseid': 482964}, {'name': 'Decreto de justicia', 'text': 'Crea X fichas de criatura Ángel blancas 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {2}{W}. ({2}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de justicia, puedes pagar {X}. Si lo haces, crea X fichas de criatura Soldado blancas 1/1.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483215&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f57cc775-d777-427b-9834-db5329973ff3', 'multiverseId': 483215}, 'multiverseid': 483215}, {'name': 'Décret de justice', 'text': 'Créez X jetons de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nRecyclage {2}{W} ({2}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de justice, vous pouvez payer {X}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483466&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd24ad5a3-aa6e-4d06-a624-732471044fd0', 'multiverseId': 483466}, 'multiverseid': 483466}, {'name': 'Decreto della Giustizia', 'text': 'Crea X pedine creatura Angelo 4/4 bianche con volare.\\nCiclo {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Decreto della Giustizia, puoi pagare {X}. Se lo fai, crea X pedine creatura Soldato 1/1 bianche.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483717&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eaaa6c36-ebf4-4d73-b2ff-b8f0b7fa94f5', 'multiverseId': 483717}, 'multiverseid': 483717}, {'name': '正義の命令', 'text': '飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。\\nサイクリング{2}{W}（{2}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが正義の命令をサイクリングしたとき、あなたは{X}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483968&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2fa00d8-6f56-4ac5-a8f5-d1ddb2689d93', 'multiverseId': 483968}, 'multiverseid': 483968}, {'name': 'Decreto de Justiça', 'text': 'Crie X fichas de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar.\\nReciclar {2}{W} ({2}{W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Decreto de Justiça, você pode pagar {X}. Se fizer isso, crie X fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484219&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '059f5d13-822f-40ae-a369-1c8efefdb65b', 'multiverseId': 484219}, 'multiverseid': 484219}, {'name': 'Декрет о Правосудии', 'text': 'Создайте Х фишек существа 4/4 белый Ангел с Полетом.\\nЦикл {2}{W} ({2}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Декрета о Правосудии, вы можете заплатить {X}. Если вы это делаете, создайте X фишек существа 1/1 белый Солдат.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484470&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '559ba13e-ca45-4dff-85cb-9ae646e83b1b', 'multiverseId': 484470}, 'multiverseid': 484470}]", '[{\'name\': \'Demütige Überläuferin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe zwei Karten. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl übernimmt die Kontrolle über die Demütige Überläuferin. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst warst du eine Mardu, dein Körper und dein Wille stark. Jetzt müssen wir noch deinen Geist unterweisen."\\n—Houn, Jeskai-Ältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483033&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3396af4-7376-48f0-9dc4-27fdd657fcf2\', \'multiverseId\': 483033}, \'multiverseid\': 483033}, {\'name\': \'Desertora humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba dos cartas. El oponente objetivo gana el control de la Desertora humilde. Activa esta habilidad solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuiste mardu una vez, por lo que tu cuerpo y tu voluntad son fuertes. Ahora debemos entrenar tu mente".\\n—Hun, anciana jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9db3f18-4e27-4df2-ba15-7e0f6244e39b\', \'multiverseId\': 483284}, \'multiverseid\': 483284}, {\'name\': \'Humble défecteur\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez deux cartes. L\'adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Humble défecteur. N\'activez cette capacité que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu étais un Mardu, ton corps et ta volonté sont robustes. Nous devons maintenant entraîner ton esprit. »\\n—Houn, doyen jeskaï\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cadae012-56f4-49de-ab85-47cd0e186c09\', \'multiverseId\': 483535}, \'multiverseid\': 483535}, {\'name\': \'Disertrice Umile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca due carte. Un avversario bersaglio prende il controllo della Disertrice Umile. Attiva questa abilità solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un tempo eri un Mardu, perciò il tuo corpo e la tua volontà sono forti. Ora dobbiamo allenare la tua mente."\\n—Houn, anziano Jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95eb429f-e6f7-4842-b6a5-083c69a4870e\', \'multiverseId\': 483786}, \'multiverseid\': 483786}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な離反者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カードを２枚引く。そのプレイヤーは謙虚な離反者のコントロールを得る。この能力は、あなたのターンの間にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お主はかつてマルドゥであった、故に体と意志は鍛えられている。これからはその精神を鍛えよう。」\\n――ジェスカイの長老、フーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581d508e-a9b1-4c74-af84-91b832c2f613\', \'multiverseId\': 484037}, \'multiverseid\': 484037}, {\'name\': \'Desertora Humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre dois cards. O oponente alvo ganha o controle de Desertora Humilde. Ative esta habilidade apenas durante o seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Você foi Mardu um dia, seu corpo e sua força de vontade são fortes. Agora precisamos treinar sua mente."\\n— Houn, ancião Jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e26c19f3-37e6-435f-a3fa-4246f4fc05c9\', \'multiverseId\': 484288}, \'multiverseid\': 484288}, {\'name\': \'Смиренный Отступник\', \'text\': \'{T}: возьмите две карты. Целевой оппонент получает контроль над Смиренным Отступником. Активируйте эту способность только во время вашего хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Раньше ты был из клана Марду, и поэтому твои тело и дух уже сильны. Теперь же мы будем упражнять твой разум».\\n— Хун, старейшина джескайцев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b947001e-0ef6-4af5-988a-2acaeb680be6\', \'multiverseId\': 484539}, \'multiverseid\': 484539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Heuschrecken-Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen und roten Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\nWenn Die Heuschrecken-Gottheit stirbt, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483098&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f83589d-2e5f-40c3-8bd6-b97982e1a9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 483098}, \'multiverseid\': 483098}, {\'name\': \'El Dios Langosta\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto azul y roja 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y prisa.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\nCuando El Dios Langosta muera, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bdbc86-0500-4485-8ce7-16f2d42df613\', \'multiverseId\': 483349}, \'multiverseid\': 483349}, {\'name\': \'Le Dieu-Sauterelle\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue et rouge Insecte avec le vol et la célérité.\\n{2}{U}{R} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nQuand Le Dieu-Sauterelle meurt, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483600&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ebfbe2-98cc-4d20-a27f-bae1ac4c0b05\', \'multiverseId\': 483600}, \'multiverseid\': 483600}, {\'name\': \'La Locusta Divina\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, crea una pedina creatura Insetto 1/1 blu e rossa con volare e rapidità.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\nQuando La Locusta Divina muore, falla tornare in mano al suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425ef88b-ac60-47a1-8170-19093dff0b28\', \'multiverseId\': 483851}, \'multiverseid\': 483851}, {\'name\': \'蝗の神\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、飛行と速攻を持ち青であり赤である１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{2}{U}{R}：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\n蝗の神が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ec2252-eb44-45f9-b8cc-6f50b6e55933\', \'multiverseId\': 484102}, \'multiverseid\': 484102}, {\'name\': \'O Deus Gafanhoto\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você comprar um card, crie uma ficha de criatura azul e vermelha 1/1 do tipo Inseto com voar e ímpeto.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\nQuando O Deus Gafanhoto morrer, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3dbcc3d-01bb-4aaf-ba10-6276375a9022\', \'multiverseId\': 484353}, \'multiverseid\': 484353}, {\'name\': \'Бог-Саранча\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синее и красное Насекомое с Полетом и Ускорением.\\n{2}{U}{R}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\\nКогда Бог-Саранча умирает, верните его в руку его владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e379e74-0fb6-44de-97e5-175f3a323d21\', \'multiverseId\': 484604}, \'multiverseid\': 484604}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In jedem Herzen lebt ein Monster. Wir bilden uns nur ein, dass die Zivilisation es zähmt."\\n―Euphemia, Beobachterin des Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483047&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c46cb1f7-a497-4d36-8999-cf36c420e10a\', \'multiverseId\': 483047}, \'multiverseid\': 483047}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los monstruos habitan en todos los corazones. Solo creemos que la civilización los domestica".\\n—Eufemia, vigilante del nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cbd0f05-b7e1-4d74-8918-21c5b50185fc\', \'multiverseId\': 483298}, \'multiverseid\': 483298}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un monstre se cache dans chaque cœur. Nous croyons seulement qu\'il est dompté par la civilisation. »\\n—Euphemia, gardienne du Nexus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483549&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8fcb30-8d3a-4ee5-ae63-1a45dbb5b364\', \'multiverseId\': 483549}, \'multiverseid\': 483549}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"In ogni cuore risiedono mostri. L\\\'idea che la civiltà li addomestichi è una mera illusione."\\n—Eufemia, guardiana del Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2248633c-0e6c-4643-8458-78faff42b01c\', \'multiverseId\': 483800}, \'multiverseid\': 483800}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物はあらゆる者の心の奥底に潜んでいる。それらを飼い慣らしているのが文明であると我々は考える。」\\n――生息地の見張り、ユーフェミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89dc4809-a8d7-4744-a7a9-61d86df5e191\', \'multiverseId\': 484051}, \'multiverseid\': 484051}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os monstros habitam todos os corações. Nós só achamos que a civilização os doma."\\n― Euphemia, vigia do Nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c383e69b-f484-482e-a436-3283da772705\', \'multiverseId\': 484302}, \'multiverseid\': 484302}, {\'name\': \'Зверь Внутри\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом из нас кроется чудовище. Мы ошибочно полагаем, что цивилизация сумела его укротить».\\n— Эвфемия, страж Ядра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b54b3f-73e1-4fba-83d8-201f18b89d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 484553}, \'multiverseid\': 484553}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee211770-9932-42a3-b2fd-6409ebe78464\', \'multiverseId\': 483149}, \'multiverseid\': 483149}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc041508-eb74-47c8-87a3-f66232ec6fec\', \'multiverseId\': 483400}, \'multiverseid\': 483400}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483651&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4965b5a7-c830-4378-b7df-1250728eae0a\', \'multiverseId\': 483651}, \'multiverseid\': 483651}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55b5364-cdde-4ae5-8bd9-fd4945232c05\', \'multiverseId\': 483902}, \'multiverseid\': 483902}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'262846e6-3bcd-4ad0-b25f-8e8ebfbfda25\', \'multiverseId\': 484153}, \'multiverseid\': 484153}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduto Dimir\', \'text\': \'Aqueduto Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Aqueduto Dimir entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2963afcf-7fc4-489b-85d0-27ffa63a192c\', \'multiverseId\': 484404}, \'multiverseid\': 484404}, {\'name\': \'Акведук Димиров\', \'text\': \'Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a740b9-d30d-4b74-9a77-17baaf9832d5\', \'multiverseId\': 484655}, \'multiverseid\': 484655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0c96a9-99ff-4ee2-91e8-215d6adfb1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 483144}, \'multiverseid\': 483144}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las lóbregas mareas otarianas esconden las traiciones olvidadas de la guerra pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81cfeec-8e78-4c4b-915f-cdac46dff5ca\', \'multiverseId\': 483395}, \'multiverseid\': 483395}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483646&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c34ed4-2485-467d-9bcb-b64001f06a85\', \'multiverseId\': 483646}, \'multiverseid\': 483646}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le fosche maree di Otaria celano allo sguardo i tradimenti dimenticati della guerra di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c608991f-b16e-4dd9-bcc8-6b76a7ffb2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 483897}, \'multiverseid\': 483897}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアの濁った潮流が、ファイレクシア戦の古い裏切り行為を覆い隠しているんだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b6d600-d3f0-4ae4-8e25-82fd6b6285d6\', \'multiverseId\': 484148}, \'multiverseid\': 484148}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas de Darkwater\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As lodosas marés otarianas ocultam as traições esquecidas da guerra phyrexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4f88a5-f298-45e6-9a5c-b9d065e76f16\', \'multiverseId\': 484399}, \'multiverseid\': 484399}, {\'name\': \'Катакомбы Темноводья\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'В мутной воде Отарии скрываются забытые предательства фирексийской войны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'640a8894-1b9d-49d5-8306-7d0056c145fc\', \'multiverseId\': 484650}, \'multiverseid\': 484650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünensturm\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu eine Kreatur. Zerstöre den Rest.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Abzan wenden diesen Zauber nur im äußersten Notfall an, denn er führt unausweichlich zu dem, was sie am meisten fürchten: allein zu sein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483090&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ffbee98-68cf-421c-abbe-a2a4e7560c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 483090}, \'multiverseid\': 483090}, {\'name\': \'Dunas estruendosas\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta una criatura. Destruye el resto.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los Abzan solo utilizan este hechizo como último recurso a causa de su resultado inevitable, que es su mayor temor: quedarse solos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f074e969-16f9-4c60-a121-bfc80f3aeec3\', \'multiverseId\': 483341}, \'multiverseid\': 483341}, {\'name\': \'Salve des dunes\', \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à une créature. Détruisez le reste.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les Abzans n\'utilisent ce sort qu\'en dernier recours, car il les confronte à leur pire crainte : la solitude.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483592&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ac7bdd-4255-4fd0-80f0-0dfa5c00309f\', \'multiverseId\': 483592}, \'multiverseid\': 483592}, {\'name\': \'Spazzadune\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a una creatura. Distruggi le altre.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli Abzan ricorrono a questo sortilegio solo come ultima risorsa, perché la sua inevitabile conseguenza è ciò che più temono: rimanere soli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9c1c466-c4ce-4dcd-8a74-2c6487449fae\', \'multiverseId\': 483843}, \'multiverseid\': 483843}, {\'name\': \'砂塵破\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー最大１体を選ぶ。残りを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'アブザンはこの呪文を最終手段としてしか使うことがない。なぜなら、それがもたらす不可避な結果は、彼らが最も恐れていること――孤独になること――に他ならないからである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90326381-3ecd-402e-998f-37007462cad2\', \'multiverseId\': 484094}, \'multiverseid\': 484094}, {\'name\': \'Explosão de Duna\', \'text\': \'Escolha até uma criatura. Destrua o restante.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os Abzan só usam esta mágica como último recurso, pois ela inevitavelmente resulta no que eles mais temem: a solidão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed09dc3-ad22-4b4e-a449-0d343b6bf864\', \'multiverseId\': 484345}, \'multiverseid\': 484345}, {\'name\': \'Песчаный Взрыв\', \'text\': \'Выберите не более одного существа. Уничтожьте все остальные.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Абзаны обращаются к этому заклинанию лишь тогда, когда иного выхода нет. Прочитавший его воплощает в жизнь самый главный страх абзанов — остаться в одиночестве.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703f68d5-36c2-419f-acf4-08fb6b1447e7\', \'multiverseId\': 484596}, \'multiverseid\': 484596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblick des Chemisters\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten.\\nKatalyse (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Karte abwirfst. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Spezialität sind theoretische Universalgrenzen und Wege, diese zu umgehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae07684-54c3-45ff-9af5-f3a6b6117ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 482987}, \'multiverseid\': 482987}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de la quimista\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas.\\nRecargar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta además de pagar sus otros costes. Luego, exilia esta carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi especialidad son los límites universales teóricos y las formas de sortearlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad660fb-bbe6-4805-83a2-0b39a353a5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 483238}, \'multiverseid\': 483238}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité du chimiste\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes.\\nRelancez (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte en plus de payer ses autres coûts. Puis exilez cette carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je me spécialise dans les limites universelles théoriques et les manières de les contourner. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483489&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8faf45d-684d-4ded-8f2a-cc33ca62574a\', \'multiverseId\': 483489}, \'multiverseid\': 483489}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione della Chimimaga\', \'text\': "Pesca due carte.\\nCarica d\'avvio (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta oltre a pagare i suoi altri costi. Poi esilia questa carta.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La mia specialità è l\\\'analisi dei limiti teorici universali e dei metodi per aggirarli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cef61b7-e114-4f6f-8773-aa14b83f9b1e\', \'multiverseId\': 483740}, \'multiverseid\': 483740}, {\'name\': \'薬術師の眼識\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引く。\\n再活（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のこれのコストの支払いに加えてカード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。その後、このカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私の専門は理論的万有制約と、その回避方法よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1e1ed3-9c66-45b5-9e4f-e400f7ed5a4d\', \'multiverseId\': 483991}, \'multiverseid\': 483991}, {\'name\': \'Visão da Quimiomante\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards.\\nRecarregar (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério descartando um card além de pagar seus outros custos. Depois, exile este card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Minha especialidade são limites universais teóricos e maneiras de contorná-los."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40863c85-c0cd-48c0-8613-c5dbb8695f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 484242}, \'multiverseid\': 484242}, {\'name\': \'Озарение Химика\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты.\\nИмпульс (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища, сбросив карту в дополнение к оплате других ее стоимостей. Затем изгоните эту карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Моя специальность — теоретические пределы мироздания и способы их обойти».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b13ad51-4be5-408f-b2d4-a5e477e88ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 484493}, \'multiverseid\': 484493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblicke des Jägers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Immer wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug einem Spieler oder einem Planeswalker Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Raubtier weiß, wie die Welt funktioniert. Leben bedeutet Konflikt. Nur die Starken überleben."\\n—Garruk Wildsprecher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483057&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf9c8ef-998d-42f3-adb7-b1aed5ad5a80\', \'multiverseId\': 483057}, \'multiverseid\': 483057}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia del cazador\', \'text\': \'Elige la criatura objetivo que controlas. Siempre que esa criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador o planeswalker este turno, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El depredador conoce el verdadero rostro del mundo. La vida es un conflicto. Solo los fuertes sobreviven".\\n—Garruk Portavoz Salvaje\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22b2e7-260e-4674-96ef-e2e89a491be6\', \'multiverseId\': 483308}, \'multiverseid\': 483308}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité du chasseur\', \'text\': \'Choisissez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur ou à un planeswalker ce tour-ci, piochez autant de cartes.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Le prédateur sait comment fonctionne vraiment le monde. La vie n\'est que conflit. Seuls les plus forts survivent. »\\n—Garruk Languebestion", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483559&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867aa084-7485-4dd5-a6ae-ec604861da62\', \'multiverseId\': 483559}, \'multiverseid\': 483559}, {\'name\': \'Intuito del Cacciatore\', \'text\': \'Scegli una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Ogniqualvolta quella creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore o a un planeswalker in questo turno, pesca altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il predatore sa come funziona in realtà il mondo. La vita è conflitto. Solo i forti sopravvivono."\\n—Garruk Lingua Selvaggia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a8bb6c-893e-4071-b8a5-529754036183\', \'multiverseId\': 483810}, \'multiverseid\': 483810}, {\'name\': \'狩人の眼識\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、そのクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「捕食者は世界の真のあり方を知っている。生命とは戦いだ。強いものだけが生き残る。」\\n――野生語りのガラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec6c6fd-8fec-4ddd-a38e-fc5cc52c0d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 484061}, \'multiverseid\': 484061}, {\'name\': \'Percepção do Caçador\', \'text\': \'Escolha uma criatura alvo que você controla. Toda vez que aquela criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador ou a um planeswalker neste turno, compre uma quantidade equivalente de cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O predador conhece o mundo como ele é. A vida é um conflito. Apenas os fortes sobrevivem."\\n— Garruk Falabravo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75357561-7928-495c-9f0a-1836e910f284\', \'multiverseId\': 484312}, \'multiverseid\': 484312}, {\'name\': \'Проницательность Охотника\', \'text\': "Выберите целевое существо под вашим контролем. Каждый раз, когда то существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker\'у в этом ходу, возьмите столько же карт.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Хищник знает истинный порядок в мире. Жизнь — это борьба. Выживают лишь сильные».\\n— Гаррук Дикоречивый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4415026-ada8-460f-b548-0426e0982b76\', \'multiverseId\': 484563}, \'multiverseid\': 484563}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483166&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb1be0e8-358b-4cbb-b2d2-1c6f22417246', 'multiverseId': 483166}, 'multiverseid': 483166}, {'name': 'Banco de arena solitario', 'text': 'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483417&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af8d361f-65a6-4db3-af01-97e8e1526ae9', 'multiverseId': 483417}, 'multiverseid': 483417}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483668&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30d6f2d6-e2cc-4b7e-ace6-51da0efdf2ff', 'multiverseId': 483668}, 'multiverseid': 483668}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483919&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08d1ea8f-b6e2-4862-af74-d251c5b645ac', 'multiverseId': 483919}, 'multiverseid': 483919}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484170&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6782b78d-b9d7-49b0-85d6-5710186a8b96', 'multiverseId': 484170}, 'multiverseid': 484170}, {'name': 'Banco de Areia Isolado', 'text': 'Banco de Areia Isolado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484421&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '584f3ed0-c7c8-481f-9b1c-cd0a185de0f6', 'multiverseId': 484421}, 'multiverseid': 484421}, {'name': 'Одинокая Отмель', 'text': 'Одинокая Отмель выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484672&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3173340b-211d-4c28-a11a-c5c3281a7912', 'multiverseId': 484672}, 'multiverseid': 484672}]", "[{'name': 'Endlose Sande', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere die Endlosen Sande: Bringe alle mit den Endlosen Sanden ins Exil geschickten Kreaturenkarten unter der Kontrolle ihrer Besitzer ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483151&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5898c9a-1b53-46da-aaa3-21379ad445d1', 'multiverseId': 483151}, 'multiverseid': 483151}, {'name': 'Arenas interminables', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar las Arenas interminables: Regresa cada carta de criatura exiliada con las Arenas interminables al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483402&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fcb2dd7-30e7-4488-84bc-d120d0aeda37', 'multiverseId': 483402}, 'multiverseid': 483402}, {'name': 'Sables infinis', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sables infinis : renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire, chaque carte de créature exilée par les Sables infinis.', 'type': 'Terrain : désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483653&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9218cd66-bb01-4a29-a0da-b34572fb3d5e', 'multiverseId': 483653}, 'multiverseid': 483653}, {'name': 'Sabbie Sconfinate', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica le Sabbie Sconfinate: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia ogni carta creatura esiliata con le Sabbie Sconfinate sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Terra — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483904&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54f6abb0-1768-42b7-a519-d253b5d76d9d', 'multiverseId': 483904}, 'multiverseid': 483904}, {'name': '終わりなき砂漠', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n{4}, {T}, 終わりなき砂漠を生け贄に捧げる：終わりなき砂漠によって追放された各クリーチャー・カードをそれぞれオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484155&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a316ee41-bb93-4c91-bd2c-2ad9aa86b77b', 'multiverseId': 484155}, 'multiverseid': 484155}, {'name': 'Areias Infinitas', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Exile a criatura alvo que você controla.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifique Areias Infinitas: Devolva cada card de criatura exilado com Areias Infinitas ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.', 'type': 'Terreno — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484406&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3fd6465e-a8eb-46ea-be1e-a2d669848f15', 'multiverseId': 484406}, 'multiverseid': 484406}, {'name': 'Бескрайние Пески', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: изгоните целевое существо под вашим контролем.\\n{4}, {T}, пожертвуйте Бескрайние Пески: верните каждую карту существа, изгнанную Бескрайними Песками, на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.', 'type': 'Земля — Пустыня', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484657&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f29602c4-4d79-474a-a2de-0e2a4c4553ca', 'multiverseId': 484657}, 'multiverseid': 484657}]", '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Endgültigkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Endgültigkeit ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Toten sollten besser für immer Abschied nehmen, als versklavt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'791e1c6f-e34b-484b-a25d-f0b39b2efac2\', \'multiverseId\': 482954}, \'multiverseid\': 482954}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de irrevocabilidad\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de irrevocabilidad entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Mejor que los muertos se marchen del todo a que sean esclavizados".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c0eff5-a03c-42eb-a1c0-dec5d6c1e405\', \'multiverseId\': 483205}, \'multiverseid\': 483205}, {\'name\': \'Ange de la fatalité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de la fatalité arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière du joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Mieux vaut être mort définitivement qu\'asservi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65097ae9-1239-42ed-9bfe-1b4e63f883c3\', \'multiverseId\': 483456}, \'multiverseid\': 483456}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Ineluttabilità", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Ineluttabilità entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per i morti, è meglio una dipartita completa che la schiavitù."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05227096-dc39-4b96-b7be-686de77a25cc\', \'multiverseId\': 483707}, \'multiverseid\': 483707}, {\'name\': \'決断の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n決断の天使が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地からカードをすべて追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「死者にとっても隷属の身とされるより、完全に消し去られた方が本望であろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11747c68-acc3-4e07-aa85-5881652e2544\', \'multiverseId\': 483958}, \'multiverseid\': 483958}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Finalidade\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Finalidade entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"É melhor os mortos partirem para sempre do que serem escravizados."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36df67a-523c-468b-8858-91b1574af20d\', \'multiverseId\': 484209}, \'multiverseid\': 484209}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Окончательности\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Окончательности выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'«Мертвым лучше покинуть нас навсегда, чем быть порабощенными».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7c7b5e-fec5-4f9f-aed3-572394afe6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 484460}, \'multiverseid\': 484460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entlegene Insel\', \'text\': \'Die Entlegene Insel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483181&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2156e1f5-30ea-43a1-80ee-e2bd22b51c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 483181}, \'multiverseid\': 483181}, {\'name\': \'Isla remota\', \'text\': \'La Isla remota entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c3fcad-7a3b-49de-b151-78bbe36a2705\', \'multiverseId\': 483432}, \'multiverseid\': 483432}, {\'name\': \'Île lointaine\', \'text\': "L\'Île lointaine arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483683&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0768a0a1-1ea7-4c09-9b3d-a73d76c9876f\', \'multiverseId\': 483683}, \'multiverseid\': 483683}, {\'name\': \'Isola Sperduta\', \'text\': "L\'Isola Sperduta entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f64c6b-aa3f-4778-a49e-2fcadba89c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 483934}, \'multiverseid\': 483934}, {\'name\': \'離れ島\', \'text\': \'離れ島はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c64a75-b4c3-459e-8c1f-24da2cd490cb\', \'multiverseId\': 484185}, \'multiverseid\': 484185}, {\'name\': \'Ilha Remota\', \'text\': \'Ilha Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d26989be-d6f7-4301-b8d3-f58c76f7f0d6\', \'multiverseId\': 484436}, \'multiverseid\': 484436}, {\'name\': \'Далекий Остров\', \'text\': \'Далекий Остров выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b259b6ad-cbb4-4f0b-956d-e2703c68eeb4\', \'multiverseId\': 484687}, \'multiverseid\': 484687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entzweischneiden\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Magie der Flussherolde ist so mächtig, dass selbst ein einzelner es mit einer ganzen Piratencrew aufnehmen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483069&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd8d0da-3fb2-483a-a833-9e012fd1ca65\', \'multiverseId\': 483069}, \'multiverseid\': 483069}, {\'name\': \'Partir en dos\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La magia de los Heraldos del Río es tan grande que un solo chamán puede desbaratar el ataque de un barco pirata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0cc7e2-5b5f-4443-90f8-e54b4ba5f255\', \'multiverseId\': 483320}, \'multiverseid\': 483320}, {\'name\': \'Couper en deux\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La magie des Hérauts de l\'onde est si puissante qu\'un seul shamane suffit à repousser un débarquement pirate.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483571&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6ce34b-80b5-4f23-aa47-1c560fbf1a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 483571}, \'multiverseid\': 483571}, {\'name\': \'Tagliare in Due\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La magia degli Araldi del Fiume è così formidabile che persino uno sciamano da solo può scacciare un manipolo da sbarco di pirati.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12bb41ac-487d-4f6e-b3db-21278511b949\', \'multiverseId\': 483822}, \'multiverseid\': 483822}, {\'name\': \'真っ二つ\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'川守りの魔力は強大であり、シャーマン一人で海賊の上陸隊を阻止できる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7f7d15-02e4-4c09-ae30-2cf3509d457d\', \'multiverseId\': 484073}, \'multiverseid\': 484073}, {\'name\': \'Partir em Dois\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A magia dos Arautos do Rio é tão forte que mesmo um único xamã é capaz de rechaçar uma incursão pirata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac589ac-70f7-43f8-8b23-929eb4b998cf\', \'multiverseId\': 484324}, \'multiverseid\': 484324}, {\'name\': \'Рассечь Надвое\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Магия Речных Вестников настолько сильна, что один-единственный шаман способен дать отпор разбойничьему отряду пиратов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851231cf-80bd-4fa0-a19f-00217117cde0\', \'multiverseId\': 484575}, \'multiverseid\': 484575}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483132&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6980e5ff-5d84-41a1-9223-1ea183309b00', 'multiverseId': 483132}, 'multiverseid': 483132}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483383&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99a99957-c68b-42fd-9de6-9a14b4e5b106', 'multiverseId': 483383}, 'multiverseid': 483383}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483634&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b2d8ae0-9ecc-4e52-bb25-1c3094ca2c22', 'multiverseId': 483634}, 'multiverseid': 483634}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483885&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6c87315-20f3-4ce1-badb-0a18b33dbebe', 'multiverseId': 483885}, 'multiverseid': 483885}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484136&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c55ab914-7428-484e-bcfb-cee1feb1435c', 'multiverseId': 484136}, 'multiverseid': 484136}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solene', 'text': 'Quando Simulacro Solene entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\nQuando Simulacro Solene morre, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484387&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d9a46ac-8384-49c4-bbcc-01509c81515e', 'multiverseId': 484387}, 'multiverseid': 484387}, {'name': 'Величественный Симулякр', 'text': 'Когда Величественный Симулякр выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\nКогда Величественный Симулякр умирает, вы можете взять карту.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Голем', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484638&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3824820-072a-439d-9ba6-a3a819155e8a', 'multiverseId': 484638}, 'multiverseid': 484638}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erleuchteter Dschinn\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, haben Reproduktion. Die Reproduktionskosten sind gleich den Manakosten des Zauberspruchs. (Wenn du ihn wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du seine Reproduktionskosten bezahlst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dschinn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483089&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd5fad19-07fa-4dd1-a6e8-0a22904418b3\', \'multiverseId\': 483089}, \'multiverseid\': 483089}, {\'name\': \'Djinn Illuminatus\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCada hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que lances tiene la habilidad de reproducir. Su coste de reproducir es igual a su coste de maná. (Cuando lo lances, cópialo por cada vez que pagaste su coste de reproducir. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Djinn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3f93f3-be30-41ae-b55d-c9d6915c343c\', \'multiverseId\': 483340}, \'multiverseid\': 483340}, {\'name\': \'Illuminatus djinn\', \'text\': "Vol\\nChaque sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez a la duplication. Le coût de duplication est égal à son coût de mana. (Quand vous le lancez, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez payé son coût de duplication. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)", \'type\': \'Créature : djinn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483591&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ddc0630-e3da-44f7-94f5-6c8ee41e63c3\', \'multiverseId\': 483591}, \'multiverseid\': 483591}, {\'name\': \'Genio Illuminato\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgni magia istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci ha replicare. Il costo di replica è pari al suo costo di mana. (Quando la lanci, copiala per ogni volta che hai pagato il suo costo di replica. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Genio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db106dd6-65d8-4eec-b379-d3261cdbd3da\', \'multiverseId\': 483842}, \'multiverseid\': 483842}, {\'name\': \'啓発のジン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが唱える、インスタントやソーサリーである各呪文はそれぞれ複製を持つ。その複製コストは、それのマナ・コストに等しい。（あなたがそれを唱えたとき、あなたがそれの複製コストを支払った回数１回につき１つ、それをコピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'462237b7-ab8e-4622-acf2-d9dc386fa4d8\', \'multiverseId\': 484093}, \'multiverseid\': 484093}, {\'name\': \'Gênio Iluminado\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nCada mágica instantânea e feitiço que você conjurar terá replicar. O custo de replicar é igual ao seu custo de mana. (Quando a conjurar, faça uma cópia dela para cada vez que tiver pago seu custo de replicar. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gênio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10bbbd2c-8e7b-4f11-a3b6-1e96c69cc368\', \'multiverseId\': 484344}, \'multiverseid\': 484344}, {\'name\': \'Джинн-Толкователь\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждое разыгрываемое вами мгновенное заклинание и заклинание волшебства имеет Копию. Стоимость Копии равна мана-стоимости того заклинания. (Когда вы его разыгрываете, скопируйте его столько раз, сколько раз вы уплатили его стоимость Копии. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для тех копий.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Джинн\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f252fb1-9883-4e0f-b509-dcbf93a847ff\', \'multiverseId\': 484595}, \'multiverseid\': 484595}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ernste Rekrutin\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nRebellion — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls in diesem Zug eine bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle das Spiel verlassen hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Ernste Rekrutin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kann nicht länger in meiner Werkstatt sitzen und ignorieren, was draußen passiert. Meine Hämmer schlagen für das Volk von Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf89029b-ae53-46d8-8957-b12d96c14a63\', \'multiverseId\': 482978}, \'multiverseid\': 482978}, {\'name\': \'Recluta solemne\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nRevuelta — Al comienzo de tu paso final, si un permanente que controlabas dejó el campo de batalla este turno, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Recluta solemne.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano guerrero\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedo seguir sentada en el taller e ignorar lo que está ocurriendo fuera. Mis martillos golpean por el pueblo de Ghirapur".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa53715-1d02-48b6-a73d-e294e8969953\', \'multiverseId\': 483229}, \'multiverseid\': 483229}, {\'name\': \'Recrue solennelle\', \'text\': \'Double initiative\\nRévolte — Au début de votre étape de fin, si un permanent que vous contrôliez a quitté le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Recrue solennelle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne peux plus rester assise dans mon atelier, étrangère au cours des événements. Mes marteaux s\'abattent pour le peuple de Ghirapur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483480&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35575ed1-7244-4ed0-bcab-8c6a85318f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 483480}, \'multiverseid\': 483480}, {\'name\': \'Recluta Solenne\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nRivolta — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se un permanente che controllavi ha lasciato il campo di battaglia in questo turno, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Recluta Solenne.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non posso più restarmene in laboratorio ignorando quanto accade fuori. I miei martelli battono per il popolo di Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df80978a-e89f-43eb-9ddb-b2fac1a81709\', \'multiverseId\': 483731}, \'multiverseid\': 483731}, {\'name\': \'生真面目な補充兵\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n紛争 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントが戦場を離れていた場合、生真面目な補充兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「これ以上、作業場に閉じこもって世間の出来事から目を背け続けることはできない。この槌をギラプールの人々のために使うことにするわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead07d56-89aa-4f27-a7e0-c85cf4922835\', \'multiverseId\': 483982}, \'multiverseid\': 483982}, {\'name\': \'Recruta Solene\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nRevolta — No início de sua etapa final, se uma permanente que você controlava deixou o campo de batalha neste turno, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Recruta Solene.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não consigo mais ficar em minha oficina e ignorar os eventos do lado de fora. Os golpes de meus martelos servirão o povo de Ghirapur."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6d27a3-fd4b-4cc9-a2f1-883a81133d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 484233}, \'multiverseid\': 484233}, {\'name\': \'Серьезный Новобранец\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nБунт — В начале вашего заключительного шага, если находившийся под вашим контролем перманент покинул поле битвы в этом ходу, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Серьезного Новобранца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не могу больше сидеть в своей мастерской, не обращая внимания на то, что творится за окном. Мои молоты будут сражаться за людей Гирапура».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5faa8b17-1714-46da-9ad0-5c3c6b5629a9\', \'multiverseId\': 484484}, \'multiverseid\': 484484}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erwachen der Animistin\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bringe davon alle Länderkarten getappt ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nZauberkunst — Falls sich zwei oder mehr Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexerei-Karten in deinem Friedhof befinden, enttappe jene Länder.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483045&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfc76096-f976-41dd-83e0-dbeab6e58c07\', \'multiverseId\': 483045}, \'multiverseid\': 483045}, {\'name\': \'Despertar de la animista\', \'text\': \'Muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas de tierra que se encuentren entre ellas en el campo de batalla giradas y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nDominio de hechizos — Si hay dos o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio, endereza esas tierras.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e17096-b841-4521-9ca0-eac411cfd9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 483296}, \'multiverseid\': 483296}, {\'name\': "Éveil de l\'animiste", \'text\': "Révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes de terrain parmi elles sur le champ de bataille, engagées, et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nMaîtrise de sort — S\'il y a au moins deux cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière, dégagez ces terrains.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638ed610-71f4-461a-8660-239948690476\', \'multiverseId\': 483547}, \'multiverseid\': 483547}, {\'name\': "Risveglio dell\'Animista", \'text\': \'Rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Metti tutte le carte terra tra di esse sul campo di battaglia TAPpate e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nArte magica — Se nel tuo cimitero ci sono due o più carte istantaneo e/o stregoneria, STAPpa quelle terre.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5328da8-667d-433e-9f9b-adf4c7f45c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 483798}, \'multiverseid\': 483798}, {\'name\': \'精霊信者の覚醒\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚公開する。その中から土地・カードをすべてタップ状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\\n魔巧 ― あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーであるカードが２枚以上あるなら、それらの土地をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f30b9e-f043-4ace-9efe-4cf5be7a7a82\', \'multiverseId\': 484049}, \'multiverseid\': 484049}, {\'name\': \'Despertar da Animista\', \'text\': \'Revele os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards de terreno no campo de batalha virados e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nMaestria em magia — Se houver dois ou mais cards de mágica instantânea ou feitiço no seu cemitério, desvire aqueles terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debe0ecb-3260-41b1-b038-8ecbce321e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 484300}, \'multiverseid\': 484300}, {\'name\': \'Пробуждение Анимиста\', \'text\': \'Покажите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Положите все находящиеся среди них карты земель на поле битвы повернутыми, а остальные в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nМастерство заклинаний — Если на вашем кладбище есть не менее двух карт мгновенных заклинаний и/или волшебства, разверните те земли.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86b8f33-cb09-4073-b9a5-b0a9b003e90f\', \'multiverseId\': 484551}, \'multiverseid\': 484551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Etali der Ursturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Etali der Ursturm angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Nichtland-Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Der Sturm tobt und das Erdreich bricht auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483030&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fca194a-b4ae-478d-9885-888fc9684ba1\', \'multiverseId\': 483030}, \'multiverseid\': 483030}, {\'name\': \'Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia ataque, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador. Luego puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de cartas que no sean tierra exiliadas de esta manera sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio anciano\', \'flavor\': \'La tormenta arrecia y la tierra se abre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e0c8d8-ad32-45bb-9856-2ab50864776a\', \'multiverseId\': 483281}, \'multiverseid\': 483281}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempête primordiale\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Etali, Tempête primordiale attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur, puis vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de cartes non-terrain exilées de cette manière sans payer leurs coûts de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'La tempête fait rage et la terre se brise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483532&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a8e13af-1b00-467a-9b8c-ddda3be39c54\', \'multiverseId\': 483532}, \'multiverseid\': 483532}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempesta Primordiale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Etali, Tempesta Primordiale attacca, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore, poi puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di carte non terra esiliate in questo modo senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'La tempesta infuria e la terra si sgretola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7234576-50b9-4918-b41d-65726c7ae8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 483783}, \'multiverseid\': 483783}, {\'name\': \'原初の嵐、エターリ\', \'text\': \'原初の嵐、エターリが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードをそれぞれ追放する。その後あなたは、これにより追放されていて土地でない望む枚数のカードを、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'嵐が怒り大地が裂ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e07bde3-9d19-4f71-8d08-e4a04d7bad0a\', \'multiverseId\': 484034}, \'multiverseid\': 484034}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tormenta Primordial\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Etali, Tormenta Primordial, atacar, exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador. Em seguida, você pode conjurar qualquer número de cards que não sejam terrenos exilados dessa forma sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro Ancião\', \'flavor\': \'À fúria da tormenta, a terra fende-se.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8edcf5-00db-40f7-887b-4b598e83256e\', \'multiverseId\': 484285}, \'multiverseid\': 484285}, {\'name\': \'Этали, Первозданная Буря\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Этали, Первозданная Буря атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту из библиотеки каждого из игроков, затем вы можете разыграть любое количество не являющихся землями карт, изгнанных таким образом, без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Динозавр\', \'flavor\': \'Бушует буря, и земля разверзается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87263d45-045a-4af2-b7a2-67dadc3a3980\', \'multiverseId\': 484536}, \'multiverseid\': 484536}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewiger Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{W}{W}: Bringe den Ewigen Drachen aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Versorgungssegments.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62430a91-465f-4645-92c5-85cc321fdd25\', \'multiverseId\': 482967}, \'multiverseid\': 482967}, {\'name\': \'Dragón eterno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{W}{W}: Regresa el Dragón eterno de tu cementerio a tu mano. Activa esta habilidad solo durante tu mantenimiento.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego, baraja tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa0033d-03a6-43f9-9d24-81b66709928a\', \'multiverseId\': 483218}, \'multiverseid\': 483218}, {\'name\': \'Dragon éternel\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{W}{W} : Renvoyez le Dragon éternel depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. N\'activez cette capacité que pendant votre entretien.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1577f215-7fe9-447e-b870-1609140265a6\', \'multiverseId\': 483469}, \'multiverseid\': 483469}, {\'name\': \'Drago Eterno\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{W}{W}: Riprendi in mano il Drago Eterno dal tuo cimitero. Attiva questa abilità solo durante il tuo mantenimento.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala, aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a863ce-9e72-4f67-94dc-283788849a73\', \'multiverseId\': 483720}, \'multiverseid\': 483720}, {\'name\': \'永遠のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{W}{W}：あなたの墓地から永遠のドラゴンをあなたの手札に戻す。この能力は、あなたのアップキープの間にのみ起動できる。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598d58d5-0d6e-4fb5-8e67-c690ef69f0ac\', \'multiverseId\': 483971}, \'multiverseid\': 483971}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Perpétuo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{W}{W}: Devolva Dragão Perpétuo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Ative esta habilidade apenas durante a sua manutenção.\\nReciclar planície {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd22140c-d660-4238-bcc8-20fba52ccae0\', \'multiverseId\': 484222}, \'multiverseid\': 484222}, {\'name\': \'Вечный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{3}{W}{W}: верните Вечного Дракона из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Активируйте эту способность только во время вашего шага поддержки.\\nЦикл Равнин {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9bfb199-87f3-4d55-9809-223aabdeb98a\', \'multiverseId\': 484473}, \'multiverseid\': 484473}]', "[{'name': 'Exhumierungsrituale', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende {3}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Alle sehnen sich nach dem Heiligen Schlaf. Nur wenigen ist er vergönnt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483018&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ff6f6c5-ad3d-4179-8b91-eea4b2922149', 'multiverseId': 483018}, 'multiverseid': 483018}, {'name': 'Ritos de desentierro', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Todos desean el Sueño Bendito. Pocos lo reciben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483269&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62ecdb0d-b7d4-4c55-bef7-cb173762f28b', 'multiverseId': 483269}, 'multiverseid': 483269}, {'name': 'Sacres de déterrement', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-le ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Tous désirent le Sommeil béni. Peu le reçoivent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483520&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4dc11419-baa2-43cd-bc56-1224a21218c5', 'multiverseId': 483520}, 'multiverseid': 483520}, {'name': 'Rituali di Esumazione', 'text': 'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Tutti bramano il Sonno Benedetto. Ben pochi lo ricevono.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483771&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c43a5820-518b-4809-87f7-6968fb1db946', 'multiverseId': 483771}, 'multiverseid': 483771}, {'name': '掘葬の儀式', 'text': 'あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '誰もが祝福された眠りを切望する。それを得られる者はほとんどいない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484022&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3051179-d454-4a5a-9e1d-00015b9f73fe', 'multiverseId': 484022}, 'multiverseid': 484022}, {'name': 'Ritos de Desenterro', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nRecapitular {3}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Todos anseiam pelo Sono Abençoado. Mas poucos o recebem.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484273&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8827e398-7c99-46ff-b8f1-fd4f3e561623', 'multiverseId': 484273}, 'multiverseid': 484273}, {'name': 'Обряд Раззахоронения', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\nВоспоминание {3}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Все жаждут забыться Благословенным Сном, но лишь немногие получают такую роскошь.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484524&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f678cd9-28b8-42a9-a647-35a7bbaaaafc', 'multiverseId': 484524}, 'multiverseid': 484524}]", '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483152&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be3afce1-c9a4-43b0-ab17-1723b225ba0c\', \'multiverseId\': 483152}, \'multiverseid\': 483152}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d30c2e8-98ea-4078-bbf3-2006390599e8\', \'multiverseId\': 483403}, \'multiverseid\': 483403}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur qu\'un terrain que votre adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483654&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debc3a76-b27b-4e0f-a03b-dfd8b2881f41\', \'multiverseId\': 483654}, \'multiverseid\': 483654}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7077bcb3-7d71-4831-a15d-80a073818392\', \'multiverseId\': 483905}, \'multiverseid\': 483905}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9155433-5f26-4323-9b6c-97e509528d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 484156}, \'multiverseid\': 484156}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi uma manhã estranha. Quando acordamos, nossas árvores haviam sido transformadas. Não sabíamos se deveriam ser regadas ou polidas."\\n— Pulan, pomareiro de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973c323f-446c-43f6-ac22-130509b78f91\', \'multiverseId\': 484407}, \'multiverseid\': 484407}, {\'name\': \'Экзотический Сад\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета, которую может производить земля под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Утро было странное. Когда мы проснулись, то обнаружили, что деревья вокруг полностью преобразились. Мы даже не знали, поливать их или полировать».\\n— Пулан, бэнтский садовник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'055057d3-7b6a-4235-953d-4a0c6a571d76\', \'multiverseId\': 484658}, \'multiverseid\': 484658}]', "[{'name': 'Falke des Kartenzeichners', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Falke des Kartenzeichners einem Spieler, der mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, Kampfschaden zufügt, bringe ihn auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück. Falls du dies tust, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484922&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51289a49-0c69-4ee3-a022-d3e701c3250f', 'multiverseId': 484922}, 'multiverseid': 484922}, {'name': 'Halcón de cartógrafo', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Halcón de cartógrafo haga daño de combate a un jugador que controla más tierras que tú, regrésalo a la mano de su propietario. Si lo haces, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484973&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6693a22-5c9e-4c5d-b1b6-f475e0cd3861', 'multiverseId': 484973}, 'multiverseid': 484973}, {'name': 'Faucon de cartographe', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Faucon de cartographe inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur qui contrôle plus de terrains que vous, renvoyez-le dans la main de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485024&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a49be055-2415-479c-8b2e-3a4d897146c7', 'multiverseId': 485024}, 'multiverseid': 485024}, {'name': 'Falco del Cartografo', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Falco del Cartografo infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore che controlla più terre di te, fallo tornare in mano al suo proprietario. Se lo fai, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Uccello', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485075&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c519543-f53a-418e-a37a-67cd0696b2e6', 'multiverseId': 485075}, 'multiverseid': 485075}, {'name': '地図作りの鷹', 'text': '飛行\\n地図作りの鷹が、土地をあなたよりも多くコントロールしているプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これをオーナーの手札に戻す。そうしたなら、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485126&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a6a2b1a-434d-41bf-b89f-ad6ceecd473c', 'multiverseId': 485126}, 'multiverseid': 485126}, {'name': 'Falcão do Cartógrafo', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Falcão do Cartógrafo causar dano de combate a um jogador que controla mais terrenos que você, devolva-o para a mão de seu dono. Se fizer isso, você pode procurar em seu grimório um card de Planície, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485177&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29c13c0a-e156-4cc6-9a5e-a0d4e2648ed6', 'multiverseId': 485177}, 'multiverseid': 485177}, {'name': 'Ястреб Картографа', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Ястреб Картографа наносит боевые повреждения игроку, контролирующему больше земель, чем вы, верните его в руку его владельца. Если вы это делаете, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Существо — Птица', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485228&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '206ba624-49a7-420e-82cb-e0dcd7895e3e', 'multiverseId': 485228}, 'multiverseid': 485228}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feindliche Wüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, schicke eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Die Feindliche Wüste wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/4 Elementarwesen-Kreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Amonkhets Wüsten dürstet es nach Blut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4e6e5c4-dfab-4165-9469-c3f6e524ff45\', \'multiverseId\': 483160}, \'multiverseid\': 483160}, {\'name\': \'Desierto hostil\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, exiliar una carta de tierra de tu cementerio: El Desierto hostil se convierte en una criatura Elemental 3/4 hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'Las tierras áridas de Amonkhet están sedientas de sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03dd81ff-a0df-4bf3-aab6-95c94341e24f\', \'multiverseId\': 483411}, \'multiverseid\': 483411}, {\'name\': \'Désert hostile\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, exilez une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière : Le Désert hostile devient une créature 3/4 Élémental jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "La terre desséchée d\'Amonkhet a soif de sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483662&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af7a0b74-5d75-4800-a82c-915fe9bb3055\', \'multiverseId\': 483662}, \'multiverseid\': 483662}, {\'name\': \'Deserto Ostile\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, Esilia una carta terra dal tuo cimitero: Il Deserto Ostile diventa una creatura Elementale 3/4 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'La terra riarsa di Amonkhet ha sete di sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebab9c96-8f92-45e9-b3b0-4ecd74eccdf5\', \'multiverseId\': 483913}, \'multiverseid\': 483913}, {\'name\': \'敵意ある砂漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, あなたの墓地から土地・カード１枚を追放する：ターン終了時まで、敵意ある砂漠は３/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'アモンケットの乾いた大地は血に飢えている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e8fbeb-f0d6-42d3-bc81-b7a4aff69633\', \'multiverseId\': 484164}, \'multiverseid\': 484164}, {\'name\': \'Deserto Hostil\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, exile um card de terreno de seu cemitério: Deserto Hostil torna-se uma criatura 3/4 do tipo Elemental até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'A terra seca de Amonkhet tem sede de sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'561b94f7-29a0-4ee8-a71e-baaff1642671\', \'multiverseId\': 484415}, \'multiverseid\': 484415}, {\'name\': \'Враждебная Пустыня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, изгоните карту земли из вашего кладбища: Враждебная Пустыня становится существом 3/4 Элементаль до конца хода. При этом она остается землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': \'Иссушенная земля Амонхета жаждет крови.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b512972-e758-480c-8ea0-19c83e7e8ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 484666}, \'multiverseid\': 484666}]', "[{'name': 'Feldschmiede', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483136&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '425e9cf6-df3e-4dcc-a478-7d8e16c1cfdc', 'multiverseId': 483136}, 'multiverseid': 483136}, {'name': 'Forja del campo de batalla', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483387&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '534f9806-2561-41e8-9d6b-ecde35ee0e9d', 'multiverseId': 483387}, 'multiverseid': 483387}, {'name': 'Forge de campagne', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483638&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7e6c639-cdad-48bf-babd-b2ee07835499', 'multiverseId': 483638}, 'multiverseid': 483638}, {'name': 'Forgia da Campo', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {W}. La Forgia da Campo ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483889&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c0f2909-1c33-469e-b488-81d92f35d31e', 'multiverseId': 483889}, 'multiverseid': 483889}, {'name': '戦場の鍛冶場', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484140&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25d8dfac-4389-466a-ac34-7c7048670e94', 'multiverseId': 484140}, 'multiverseid': 484140}, {'name': 'Forjaria do Campo de Batalha', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {W}. Forjaria do Campo de Batalha causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484391&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '684c8248-afbc-478c-82c6-0abb7723fa0c', 'multiverseId': 484391}, 'multiverseid': 484391}, {'name': 'Кузница на Поле Боя', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {W}. Кузница на Поле Боя наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484642&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8160128f-f07f-4293-a3c9-34200e44460b', 'multiverseId': 484642}, 'multiverseid': 484642}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fesselndes Crewmitglied\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Enttappe die Kreatur. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir segeln, wir plündern und dann feiern wir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b59117-c43e-4267-a8d0-6f4349973762\', \'multiverseId\': 483023}, \'multiverseid\': 483023}, {\'name\': \'Tripulación cautivadora\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Gana el control de la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Navegamos, saqueamos y, por último, bailamos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b89dfed-982f-4ad9-bb21-956ecf14409a\', \'multiverseId\': 483274}, \'multiverseid\': 483274}, {\'name\': \'Équipage captivant\', \'text\': "{3}{R} : Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': \'« On vogue. On pille. Et puis on danse. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e99c2d69-dc7b-4f14-befa-489b21483d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 483525}, \'multiverseid\': 483525}, {\'name\': \'Marinaio Seducente\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Salpiamo, deprediamo e poi balliamo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c196d7fc-f58b-4b8d-a2ac-f3740b92d360\', \'multiverseId\': 483776}, \'multiverseid\': 483776}, {\'name\': \'蠱惑的な船員\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「航海して、略奪して、踊るのさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594a2db8-58da-41ba-bff2-84027430fc1f\', \'multiverseId\': 484027}, \'multiverseid\': 484027}, {\'name\': \'Tripulação Cativante\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo que um oponente controla até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': \'"Navegamos. Pilhamos. E depois dançamos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22dfe9e-91c6-4bd4-a0cc-561f9ebdbd10\', \'multiverseId\': 484278}, \'multiverseid\': 484278}, {\'name\': \'Пленительная Команда\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: получите контроль над целевым существом под контролем оппонента до конца хода. Разверните то существо. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы выходим в море. Мы грабим. А потом мы пляшем».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b5eb580-9837-4d26-959a-2173495cf20b\', \'multiverseId\': 484529}, \'multiverseid\': 484529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuer der Vorhersehung\', \'text\': \'Das Feuer der Vorhersehung fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu. Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine der Karten auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483106&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4652497-18dd-44cf-bc34-3268b2097cee\', \'multiverseId\': 483106}, \'multiverseid\': 483106}, {\'name\': \'Rayo profético\', \'text\': \'El Rayo profético hace 4 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo. Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de esas cartas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a069144a-7399-41c2-943f-ed494c68afd8\', \'multiverseId\': 483357}, \'multiverseid\': 483357}, {\'name\': \'Éclair prophétique\', \'text\': "L\'Éclair prophétique inflige 4 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible. Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une de ces cartes dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483608&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c803f5db-7f42-48c4-9b28-3e14f012a7b5\', \'multiverseId\': 483608}, \'multiverseid\': 483608}, {\'name\': \'Fulmine Profetico\', \'text\': \'Il Fulmine Profetico infligge 4 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano una di quelle carte e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163100e5-eac3-43d5-894e-2038a125afc0\', \'multiverseId\': 483859}, \'multiverseid\': 483859}, {\'name\': \'予言の稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。予言の稲妻はそれに４点のダメージを与える。あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見る。それらのカードのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0679a1a-363c-4bee-b1e1-7e4fceb05afb\', \'multiverseId\': 484110}, \'multiverseid\': 484110}, {\'name\': \'Raio Profético\', \'text\': \'Raio Profético causa 4 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo. Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Coloque um daqueles cards na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71efc652-4791-4f2c-b806-a8a1f06f624b\', \'multiverseId\': 484361}, \'multiverseid\': 484361}, {\'name\': \'Пророческий Разряд\', \'text\': \'Пророческий Разряд наносит 4 повреждения любой цели. Посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из тех карт в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7620ffc5-4d9a-45a4-9e21-36e16a76bce0\', \'multiverseId\': 484612}, \'multiverseid\': 484612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerflusstrupp\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn der Feuerflusstrupp angreift, kannst du eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst. Bringe die Karte getappt und angreifend ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484949&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff53a54f-8ab3-4c55-a39c-f583c0850906\', \'multiverseId\': 484949}, \'multiverseid\': 484949}, {\'name\': \'Brigada de flujofuegos\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que la Brigada de flujofuegos ataque, puedes exiliar otra criatura atacante objetivo que controlas. Si lo haces, muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y atacando y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ff8c21-d8ad-4a77-bf41-59b002117a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 485000}, \'multiverseid\': 485000}, {\'name\': \'Escouade pyroflux\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Escouade pyroflux attaque, vous pouvez exiler une autre créature attaquante ciblée que vous contrôlez. Si vous faites ainsi, révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille, engagée et attaquante, et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2635b99b-cbfc-4d53-9468-f2d4d0bcb2e3\', \'multiverseId\': 485051}, \'multiverseid\': 485051}, {\'name\': \'Squadrone Accerchiato dal Fuoco\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta lo Squadrone Accerchiato dal Fuoco attacca, puoi esiliare un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio che controlli. Se lo fai, rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e attaccante e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad83c95d-1135-404f-8eae-e34690dccb12\', \'multiverseId\': 485102}, \'multiverseid\': 485102}, {\'name\': \'炎渦の部隊\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n炎渦の部隊が攻撃するたび、他の、あなたがコントロールしている攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c525c271-75cf-4684-82a3-8b9d14524fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 485153}, \'multiverseid\': 485153}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão do Fluxo de Fogo\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nToda vez que Esquadrão do Fluxo de Fogo ataca, você pode exilar outra criatura atacante alvo que você controla. Se fizer isso, revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e atacando e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdc377a-f298-4611-9d23-5e7884655642\', \'multiverseId\': 485204}, \'multiverseid\': 485204}, {\'name\': \'Отряд Сердца Пожара\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Отряд Сердца Пожара атакует, вы можете изгнать другое целевое атакующее существо под вашим контролем. Если вы это делаете, показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту существа. Положите ту карту на поле битвы повернутой и атакующей, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d78441f-7192-442b-9a45-546dc7f3849e\', \'multiverseId\': 485255}, \'multiverseid\': 485255}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fliegender Ersthelfer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit, Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Zwergen wird das Verständnis komplexer Mechaniken in die Wiege gelegt und das Reparieren liegt ihnen im Blut. Dies und ihr Ruf, furchtlos zu sein, macht sie zu perfekten Notfallhelfern bei der Messe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d6995a-f250-418c-ace6-ea49206003f4\', \'multiverseId\': 482951}, \'multiverseid\': 482951}, {\'name\': \'Servicio de intervención aérea\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia, vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Enano soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Los enanos tienen un instinto de reparación, entienden al instante el funcionamiento de un sistema y se dice que no conocen el miedo. Son los candidatos perfectos para el equipo de emergencias de la Feria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19eb0a85-e126-4ec1-ab20-a07c473e1652\', \'multiverseId\': 483202}, \'multiverseid\': 483202}, {\'name\': \'Secoureur aérien\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance, lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : nain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Les nains ont un don inné pour les réparations, une compréhension instinctive du fonctionnement des systèmes et un caractère intrépide. Ce sont des candidats idéaux pour l\'équipe de premiers secours de la Foire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4f815f-e941-4378-8b40-3f68e40146bb\', \'multiverseId\': 483453}, \'multiverseid\': 483453}, {\'name\': \'Soccorritore Aereo\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela, legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Nano\', \'flavor\': \'I nani hanno un talento istintivo per le riparazioni, una comprensione innata del funzionamento dei sistemi e una fama di temerari. Sono i candidati perfetti per la squadra di pronto intervento della Fiera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57fef104-0807-420e-a924-e21498ac2fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 483704}, \'multiverseid\': 483704}, {\'name\': \'空中対応員\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒、絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'ドワーフには修復の才能があり、組織の仕組みを理解しており、恐れ知らずとの評判も高い。博覧会の緊急対応要員に最適である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d21bce3a-1241-4468-9ce5-1e7604259e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 483955}, \'multiverseid\': 483955}, {\'name\': \'Socorrista Aéreo\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância, vínculo com a vida\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anão Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Os anões são ótimos em reparações, entendem como os sistemas funcionam e possuem a reputação de serem destemidos. São os candidatos perfeitos para a equipe de atendimento de emergência da Feira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9735ac28-8670-49d3-9a9d-4880cddf0e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 484206}, \'multiverseid\': 484206}, {\'name\': \'Воздушный Спасатель\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность, Цепь жизни\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гном Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Гномы обладают природной склонностью к починке, с малых лет понимают, как работают механизмы, и славятся своим бесстрашием. Это идеальные кандидаты в спасательную команду Ярмарки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94251c33-374e-4644-9584-8ddef342c6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 484457}, \'multiverseid\': 484457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet bist."\\n—Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483133&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72ba739c-603f-4071-9fc5-f54e93c8d1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 483133}, \'multiverseid\': 483133}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado".\\n—Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263ffbe7-26c4-4ac1-a3bc-83d70c840c6e\', \'multiverseId\': 483384}, \'multiverseid\': 483384}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. »\\n—Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483635&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53d14d16-8e73-4909-8b91-c4b2f6cbd71a\', \'multiverseId\': 483635}, \'multiverseid\': 483635}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Piedelesto\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanciarsi a testa bassa nella battaglia è segno di grande saggezza... quando si è preparati."\\n—Kenjek, capitano delle Mille Spade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70985c64-0b92-4610-a5d9-a661326d8a26\', \'multiverseId\': 483886}, \'multiverseid\': 483886}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ。ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」\\n――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db89b142-712d-41ef-8818-8afb4333d46c\', \'multiverseId\': 484137}, \'multiverseid\': 484137}, {\'name\': \'Botas Pé-ligeiro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem resistência a magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Há grande sabedoria em entrar de cabeça no combate... desde que você esteja preparado."\\n— Kenjek, capitão das Mil Espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f859873-20f8-4e68-9a4d-f4c206ff0fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 484388}, \'multiverseid\': 484388}, {\'name\': \'Скороходные Сапоги\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Порчеустойчивость и Ускорение.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'«В том, чтобы броситься очертя голову в бой, есть великая мудрость... если ты приготовился».\\n— Кеньек, капитан Тысячи Мечей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a03eb7d-9e01-4184-ac82-6d34d9d1aa2e\', \'multiverseId\': 484639}, \'multiverseid\': 484639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluxkompensator\', \'text\': \'Umwandlung-Fähigkeiten, die du aktivierst, kosten beim Aktivieren bis zu {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Es erzeugt Energie, indem es die Natur der Möglichkeit selbst nutzt."\\n„Aber funktioniert das?"\\n„… Vielleicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483120&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b1a48e-9b03-474e-a30e-8ae0c4e4923e\', \'multiverseId\': 483120}, \'multiverseid\': 483120}, {\'name\': \'Oscilador\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos activar las habilidades de ciclo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Genera poder al aprovechar la naturaleza de las posibilidades en sí mismas".\\n"Pero ¿funcionará?".\\n"... Quizás".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe62dac3-a8c4-4fd7-b3a9-863bf4356041\', \'multiverseId\': 483371}, \'multiverseid\': 483371}, {\'name\': \'Fluctuateur\', \'text\': "Les capacités de recyclage que vous activez coûtent jusqu\'à {2} de moins à activer.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Il génère de l\'énergie en exploitant la nature même du possible. »\\n« Mais cela va-t-il marcher ? »\\n« ... C\'est possible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483622&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9769ad38-228e-40be-b38a-8061fe772fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 483622}, \'multiverseid\': 483622}, {\'name\': \'Alternatore\', \'text\': \'Le abilità ciclo che attivi costano fino a {2} in meno per essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Genera potenza catalizzando la natura stessa della possibilità."\\n"Ma funzionerà?"\\n"... Forse."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e52527-a5f2-4051-8a1b-922bb9616075\', \'multiverseId\': 483873}, \'multiverseid\': 483873}, {\'name\': \'波動機\', \'text\': \'あなたがサイクリング能力を起動するためのコストは最大{2}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「これは可能性そのものの性質を利用して力を生成するんだ。」\\n「でも、ちゃんと動くの？」\\n「……可能性は高い。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9e5299-e909-4d8a-816f-a2798330d498\', \'multiverseId\': 484124}, \'multiverseid\': 484124}, {\'name\': \'Flutuador\', \'text\': \'As habilidades reciclar que você ativa custam até {2} a menos para serem ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele gera força valendo-se da própria natureza das possibilidades."\\n"Mas vai funcionar?"\\n"... É possível."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50725ce5-ea01-4b46-992b-9c5a3082903b\', \'multiverseId\': 484375}, \'multiverseid\': 484375}, {\'name\': \'Флуктуатор\', \'text\': \'Стоимость активации способностей Цикла, которые вы активируете, снижается не более чем на {2}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'— Он генерирует энергию, укрощая саму природу возможного.\\n— Но будет ли он работать?\\n— ... Возможно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55bf9ebd-ade5-4a6c-9e5c-3a774429bec2\', \'multiverseId\': 484626}, \'multiverseid\': 484626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fromme Seelsorgerin\', \'text\': \'{T}, tappe zwei ungetappte Menschen, die du kontrollierst: Schicke ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Nach Avacyns Gebot werden wir diese Relikte von ihrer dämonischen Vergangenheit befreien."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f51936-d771-465b-84d1-355a87f6041e\', \'multiverseId\': 482966}, \'multiverseid\': 482966}, {\'name\': \'Capellana devota\', \'text\': \'{T}, girar dos humanos enderezados que controlas: Exilia el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Por decreto de Avacyn, purificaremos estas reliquias de su pasado demoníaco".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ebbd55-b8f3-4b80-b14b-ee46069d944c\', \'multiverseId\': 483217}, \'multiverseid\': 483217}, {\'name\': \'Aumônière fervente\', \'text\': "{T}, engagez deux humains dégagés que vous contrôlez : Exilez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Par décret d\'Avacyn, nous purifierons ces reliques de leur passé démoniaque. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667d1952-f1a7-47a4-b359-aa6e9fbaec64\', \'multiverseId\': 483468}, \'multiverseid\': 483468}, {\'name\': \'Cappellana Devota\', \'text\': \'{T}, TAPpa due Umani STAPpati che controlli: Esilia un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per volontà di Avacyn, purificheremo queste reliquie dal loro passato demoniaco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81ab8abb-a8be-4bef-beb4-32f9855c79ae\', \'multiverseId\': 483719}, \'multiverseid\': 483719}, {\'name\': \'敬虔な司祭\', \'text\': \'{T}, あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態の人間２体をタップする：アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「アヴァシンの命により、これらの遺物に残る悪魔の痕跡を浄化します。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b036786b-b51e-4c68-a162-4be12b0fa2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 483970}, \'multiverseid\': 483970}, {\'name\': \'Capelão Devotado\', \'text\': \'{T}, vire dois Humanos desvirados que você controle: Exile o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Por decreto de Avacyn, purificaremos estas relíquias e as livraremos de seu passado demoníaco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a7e718-bc30-4ab4-8355-9a5e7858268f\', \'multiverseId\': 484221}, \'multiverseid\': 484221}, {\'name\': \'Благочестивый Капеллан\', \'text\': \'{T}, поверните два неповернутых перманента с подтипом Человек под вашим контролем: изгоните целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Именем Авацины мы очистим эти реликвии от их демонического прошлого».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91c54508-6c7f-4e60-941c-1cf2901b251b\', \'multiverseId\': 484472}, \'multiverseid\': 484472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frontarzt\', \'text\': \'Bataillon — Immer wenn der Frontarzt und mindestens zwei andere Kreaturen angreifen, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nOpfere den Frontarzt: Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl mit {X} in seinen Manakosten, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10df2f9d-1763-46d5-bb78-4a0b8f2a9909\', \'multiverseId\': 482968}, \'multiverseid\': 482968}, {\'name\': \'Médico de primera línea\', \'text\': \'Batallón — Siempre que el Médico de primera línea y al menos otras dos criaturas ataquen, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nSacrificar el Médico de primera línea: Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo con {X} en su coste de maná a menos que su contador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af8b2a15-6b6c-4ddb-9ed4-675965f44d7e\', \'multiverseId\': 483219}, \'multiverseid\': 483219}, {\'name\': \'Carabin du front\', \'text\': "Bataillon — À chaque fois que le Carabin du front et au moins deux autres créatures attaquent, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSacrifiez le Carabin du front : Contrecarrez le sort ciblé avec {X} dans son coût de mana à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94e5cc01-0e75-45e8-8c36-b68c7067c4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 483470}, \'multiverseid\': 483470}, {\'name\': \'Medico in Prima Linea\', \'text\': \'Battaglione — Ogniqualvolta il Medico in Prima Linea e almeno altre due creature attaccano, le creature che controlli hanno indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nSacrifica il Medico in Prima Linea: Neutralizza una magia bersaglio con {X} nel suo costo di mana a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3534570c-e215-47df-92f6-7df4c750b368\', \'multiverseId\': 483721}, \'multiverseid\': 483721}, {\'name\': \'前線の衛生兵\', \'text\': \'大隊 ― 前線の衛生兵と、他の２体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは破壊不能を得る。\\n前線の衛生兵を生け贄に捧げる：マナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ef89e5-6f2d-4e9b-9e55-97b45a1b2eed\', \'multiverseId\': 483972}, \'multiverseid\': 483972}, {\'name\': \'Médico da Linha de Frente\', \'text\': \'Batalhão — Toda vez que Médico da Linha de Frente e pelo menos duas outras criaturas atacam, as criaturas que você controla ganham indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nSacrifique Médico da Linha de Frente: Anule a mágica alvo com {X} no custo de mana, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52730eff-cae3-4d27-ac16-87524187eb46\', \'multiverseId\': 484223}, \'multiverseid\': 484223}, {\'name\': \'Фронтовой Медик\', \'text\': \'Батальон — Каждый раз, когда Фронтовой Медик и как минимум два других существа атакуют, существа под вашим контролем получают Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\nПожертвуйте Фронтового Медика: отмените целевое заклинание, в мана-стоимости которого есть {X}, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f77e62a-e7f1-49a9-b14b-d3195d6903a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484474}, \'multiverseid\': 484474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frost-Nibilis\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBravour (Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält diese Kreatur +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Die Kreatur enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f703d5-452c-4cd0-af83-bbbe7f9cb153\', \'multiverseId\': 482999}, \'multiverseid\': 482999}, {\'name\': \'Niblis de escarcha\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDestreza. (Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea de criatura, esta criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58a9421-d739-4b97-a89a-a7300f22a8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 483250}, \'multiverseid\': 483250}, {\'name\': \'Niblis de gel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nProuesse (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, cette créature gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0d83ff-688b-455f-bcd5-2dfc9007e97c\', \'multiverseId\': 483501}, \'multiverseid\': 483501}, {\'name\': \'Niblis del Gelo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nProdezza (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia non creatura, questa creatura prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a637f3cd-0b69-44b1-a4f9-f5acbecb87e3\', \'multiverseId\': 483752}, \'multiverseid\': 483752}, {\'name\': \'霜のニブリス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n果敢（あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。そのクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7266f05d-e831-4dcd-a9c1-b08696396311\', \'multiverseId\': 484003}, \'multiverseid\': 484003}, {\'name\': \'Niblis da Geada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDestreza (Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica que não seja de criatura, esta criatura recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Aquela criatura não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e5d45d-1c8d-46e0-8f8f-96ae337ab55c\', \'multiverseId\': 484254}, \'multiverseid\': 484254}, {\'name\': \'Ниблис Мороза\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nИскусность (Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете не являющееся существом заклинание, это существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента. То существо не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a518669c-3f52-4c21-8d9e-9391e174461c\', \'multiverseId\': 484505}, \'multiverseid\': 484505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fumiko, die Tiefgeborene\', \'text\': \'Fumiko, die Tiefgeborene, hat Bushido X, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an angreifenden Kreaturen ist. (Immer wenn diese Kreatur blockt oder geblockt wird, erhält sie +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nKreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, greifen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Samurai\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483031&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76099fa9-538b-40b1-90a8-951d0bbb0afb\', \'multiverseId\': 483031}, \'multiverseid\': 483031}, {\'name\': \'Fumiko sangre impura\', \'text\': \'Fumiko sangre impura tiene la habilidad de bushido X, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas atacantes. (Siempre que esta criatura bloquee o sea bloqueada, obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno.)\\nLas criaturas que controlan tus oponentes atacan cada combate si pueden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Samurái humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca332fd-262b-4d7b-b3e2-7c233e9c995a\', \'multiverseId\': 483282}, \'multiverseid\': 483282}, {\'name\': \'Fumiko la manante\', \'text\': "Fumiko la manante a bushido X, X étant le nombre de créatures attaquantes. (À chaque fois que cette créature bloque ou devient bloquée, elle gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nLes créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent attaquent à chaque combat si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et samouraï\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483533&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc4652a9-b299-4033-bcb1-feec24ba0827\', \'multiverseId\': 483533}, \'multiverseid\': 483533}, {\'name\': \'Fumiko Sanguepovero\', \'text\': \'Fumiko Sanguepovero ha bushido X, dove X è il numero di creature attaccanti. (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura blocca o viene bloccata, prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno.)\\nLe creature controllate dai tuoi avversari attaccano in ogni combattimento, se possono farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Samurai Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1bb473a-d874-47a5-932c-896698abe3c5\', \'multiverseId\': 483784}, \'multiverseid\': 483784}, {\'name\': \'卑血の芙巳子\', \'text\': \'卑血の芙巳子は「武士道Ｘ」を持つ。Ｘは攻撃クリーチャーの総数に等しい。（このクリーチャーがブロックするかブロックされた状態になるたび、ターン終了時まで、これは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。）\\n各戦闘で、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーは可能なら攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・侍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824bf5d5-3ec2-45bf-8716-fc2e1a698dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 484035}, \'multiverseid\': 484035}, {\'name\': \'Fumiko, a Sangue Ruim\', \'text\': \'Fumiko, a Sangue Ruim, tem bushido X, sendo X o número de criaturas atacantes. (Toda vez que esta criatura bloqueia ou se torna bloqueada, ela recebe +X/+X até o final do turno.)\\nAs criaturas que seus oponentes controlam atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Samurai\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe98627-8e05-48b8-9353-1ee7d04ae1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 484286}, \'multiverseid\': 484286}, {\'name\': \'Фумико Низкородная\', \'text\': \'Фумико Низкородная имеет Бусидо X, где X — количество атакующих существ. (Каждый раз, когда это существо блокирует или становится заблокированным, оно получает +X/+X до конца хода.)\\nСущества под контролем ваших оппонентов атакуют в каждом бою, если могут.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Самурай\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208b19f3-a9fe-4f30-b017-b7761bb07b5b\', \'multiverseId\': 484537}, \'multiverseid\': 484537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelnder Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72b4857-330e-4049-8b5d-8e6c32e479ce\', \'multiverseId\': 484953}, \'multiverseid\': 484953}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu brillante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, creas una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91968c6b-77bd-47e7-955b-a8d55f8c0512\', \'multiverseId\': 485004}, \'multiverseid\': 485004}, {\'name\': \'Impetus brillant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ca50c44-f03a-41e7-b420-4dcbbf806184\', \'multiverseId\': 485055}, \'multiverseid\': 485055}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Lucente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con: "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6d938e-6014-4193-ad45-f65dbe35492c\', \'multiverseId\': 485106}, \'multiverseid\': 485106}, {\'name\': \'輝光の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは宝物・トークンを１つ生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ff2ecd5-2b52-4242-8029-1ae9cf62a1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 485157}, \'multiverseid\': 485157}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2580e8c1-1e06-4083-bf47-7c730e0b3239\', \'multiverseId\': 485208}, \'multiverseid\': 485208}, {\'name\': \'Сверкающее Побуждение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, вы создаете одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'feaa2c9c-70d8-4271-9a5f-c0ddbe3318f7\', \'multiverseId\': 485259}, \'multiverseid\': 485259}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenraub\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 4 oder mehr ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana wandte sich flüsternd an die Reste von Oketras und Bontus Bewusstsein: „Ihr seid die Götter. Er ist ein Eindringling. Ihr wisst, was zu tun ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483088&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41f70f1a-b55a-4de0-a74a-30b303fa3475\', \'multiverseId\': 483088}, \'multiverseid\': 483088}, {\'name\': \'Extraer la chispa\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana susurró a la poca conciencia de sí mismas que quedaba en Oketra y Bontu:\\n—Ustedes son las diosas. Él es el usurpador. Ya saben qué hacer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1962cc-df20-48da-a778-90e74e21072b\', \'multiverseId\': 483339}, \'multiverseid\': 483339}, {\'name\': "Suppression d\'étincelle", \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent ciblé avec un coût converti de mana supérieur ou égal à 4.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Liliana murmura au peu de conscience qu\'il restait à Oketra et Bontu. « Vous êtes les dieux. C\'est lui l\'imposteur. Vous savez ce que vous avez à faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483590&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab6de127-bf16-406e-9952-bb8f9966e53e\', \'multiverseId\': 483590}, \'multiverseid\': 483590}, {\'name\': \'Descintillazione\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sussurrò al barlume di coscienza che rimaneva in Oketra e Bontu. "Voi siete le dee. Lui è l\\\'usurpatore. Sapete cosa fare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95f4166-72ac-41d4-b1ae-6a4493bb5301\', \'multiverseId\': 483841}, \'multiverseid\': 483841}, {\'name\': \'灯の燼滅\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストが４以上のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オケチラとバントゥにどれほど自意識が残っているか分からないまま、リリアナはこう囁いた。「あなたたちは本当の神でしょ。あれは簒奪者よ。どうするべきか分かるわね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f1d4d8f-98fe-4473-a818-ea111ad454d7\', \'multiverseId\': 484092}, \'multiverseid\': 484092}, {\'name\': \'Descentelhar\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sussurrou ao restante de consciência em Bontu e Oketra. "Vocês são as deusas. Ele é o usurpador. Vocês sabem o que fazer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b33f3f9a-5e97-4d8f-91f4-93b1e299d253\', \'multiverseId\': 484343}, \'multiverseid\': 484343}, {\'name\': \'Лишение Искры\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой перманент с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вы — боги, — шептала Лилиана тем неясным остаткам сознания, что сохранили Бонту и Окетра. — Он — узурпатор. Вы знаете, что делать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'662326ed-cdd9-46d1-bc1e-3be112c7d8e4\', \'multiverseId\': 484594}, \'multiverseid\': 484594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Für immer zusammen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Für immer zusammen ins Spiel kommt, wende Beistand 2 an. (Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.)\\n{1}: Bestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, auf der eine Marke liegt. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, bringe sie auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bfe2468-239e-4343-ae2d-040ee4070b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 482984}, \'multiverseid\': 482984}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para siempre\', \'text\': \'Cuando Juntos para siempre entre al campo de batalla, apoya 2. (Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.)\\n{1}: Elige una criatura objetivo que tenga un contador sobre ella. Cuando la criatura muera este turno, regresa esa carta a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b85ed33-8f11-4b31-8399-9b5549908a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 483235}, \'multiverseid\': 483235}, {\'name\': \'Ensemble pour toujours\', \'text\': "Quand Ensemble pour toujours arrive sur le champ de bataille, soutenez 2. (Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.)\\n{1} : Choisissez une créature ciblée avec un marqueur sur elle. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, renvoyez cette carte dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c97bd8d-5998-4cd0-8997-92865ab4d941\', \'multiverseId\': 483486}, \'multiverseid\': 483486}, {\'name\': \'Per Sempre Insieme\', \'text\': \'Quando Per Sempre Insieme entra nel campo di battaglia, soccorri 2. (Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.)\\n{1}: Scegli una creatura bersaglio con un segnalino. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, fai tornare quella carta in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff30245-1d55-408d-a30e-ecd06efe888a\', \'multiverseId\': 483737}, \'multiverseid\': 483737}, {\'name\': \'いつまでも共に\', \'text\': \'いつまでも共にが戦場に出たとき、支援２を行う。（クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。）\\n{1}：カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、そのカードをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8ce0ecb-f83d-4fe2-9cee-e4391c7ba3ee\', \'multiverseId\': 483988}, \'multiverseid\': 483988}, {\'name\': \'Juntos para Sempre\', \'text\': \'Quando Juntos para Sempre entrar no campo de batalha, suporte 2. (Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.)\\n{1}: Escolha uma criatura alvo com um marcador. Quando aquela criatura morrer neste turno, devolva aquele card para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7f76ad-dec9-4f6b-9075-e557bfbdb068\', \'multiverseId\': 484239}, \'multiverseid\': 484239}, {\'name\': \'Навеки Вместе\', \'text\': \'Когда Навеки Вместе выходит на поле битвы, используйте Содействие 2. (Положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.)\\n{1}: выберите целевое существо с жетоном на нем. Когда то существо умирает в этом ходу, верните ту карту в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be952d8-32d8-46a7-9085-cc19d411225f\', \'multiverseId\': 484490}, \'multiverseid\': 484490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Garna die Blutflamme\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn Garna die Blutflamme ins Spiel kommt, bringe alle Kreaturenkarten, die in diesem Zug von irgendwoher dorthin gelegt wurden, aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483092&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e317406-fae8-499a-8a73-7dfb74567c3e\', \'multiverseId\': 483092}, \'multiverseid\': 483092}, {\'name\': \'Garna, la Llama de Sangre\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando Garna, la Llama de Sangre entre al campo de batalla, regresa a tu mano todas las cartas de criatura en tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde cualquier lugar este turno.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427d9e9f-1b6f-48c2-a572-023193b8f41f\', \'multiverseId\': 483343}, \'multiverseid\': 483343}, {\'name\': \'Garna, la Flamme de sang\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand Garna, la Flamme de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez dans votre main toutes les cartes de créature de votre cimetière qui y ont été mises d\'où qu\'elles viennent ce tour-ci.\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483594&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2280fead-e7ff-46ab-a357-7c46c432680e\', \'multiverseId\': 483594}, \'multiverseid\': 483594}, {\'name\': \'Garna, dal Sangue di Fiamma\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando Garna, dal Sangue di Fiamma entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano tutte le carte creatura che sono state messe nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona in questo turno.\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46200b1b-ab6f-40f3-826a-442f91c64254\', \'multiverseId\': 483845}, \'multiverseid\': 483845}, {\'name\': \'血の炎、ガルナ\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n血の炎、ガルナが戦場に出たとき、このターンにいずれかの領域からあなたの墓地に置かれた、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードをすべてあなたの手札に戻す。\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c25079d-60a4-46bc-b476-06fabce6d018\', \'multiverseId\': 484096}, \'multiverseid\': 484096}, {\'name\': \'Garna, a Chama Sanguínea\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Garna, a Chama Sanguínea, entrar no campo de batalha, devolva para sua mão todos os cards de criatura em seu cemitério que tenham sido colocados lá de qualquer lugar neste turno.\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d6f644c-3e2e-45dc-9bcd-913375270db9\', \'multiverseId\': 484347}, \'multiverseid\': 484347}, {\'name\': \'Гарна, Пламя Крови\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Гарна, Пламя Крови выходит на поле битвы, верните в вашу руку все карты существ на вашем кладбище, которые попали туда откуда угодно в этом ходу.\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем имеют Ускорение.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4858b130-1126-4dc9-8af7-b2ef610be8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 484598}, \'multiverseid\': 484598}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gavi die Nesthüterin\', \'text\': \'Du kannst {0} bezahlen, anstatt die Umwandlungskosten der ersten Karte, die du in jedem Zug umwandelst, zu bezahlen.\\nImmer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten und weißen Dinosaurier-Katze-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Mutterliebe reicht über Spezies hinaus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484734&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674073cc-2a4a-4d15-9e06-f345cc6ea129\', \'multiverseId\': 484734}, \'multiverseid\': 484734}, {\'name\': \'Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'text\': \'Puedes pagar {0} en vez de pagar el coste de ciclo de la primera carta de la que actives la habilidad de ciclo cada turno.\\nSiempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Felino Dinosaurio roja y blanca 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'El amor de una madre trasciende las especies.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a028ef-d8d1-4bd6-afa5-fff0c0b3577f\', \'multiverseId\': 484754}, \'multiverseid\': 484754}, {\'name\': \'Gavi, garde du nid\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez payer {0} à la place du coût de recyclage de la première carte que vous recyclez à chaque tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge et blanche Dinosaure et Chat.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "L\'amour maternel transcende les espèces.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efcc4d7a-326c-4314-b561-bfe5dec7f80c\', \'multiverseId\': 484774}, \'multiverseid\': 484774}, {\'name\': \'Gavi, Guardiana del Nido\', \'text\': \'Puoi pagare {0} invece di pagare il costo di ciclo della prima carta che cicli in ogni turno.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Felino Dinosauro 2/2 rossa e bianca.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': "L\'amore di una madre trascende ogni specie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15571fa9-2393-4563-aea9-310ad07f2765\', \'multiverseId\': 484794}, \'multiverseid\': 484794}, {\'name\': \'巣守り、ガヴィ\', \'text\': \'あなたは、各ターン亡いで初めてあなたがサイクリングするカードのサイクリング・コストを支払うのではなく{0}を支払ってもよい。\\nあなたが各ターンのあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、赤であり白である２/２の恐竜・猫・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'母の愛は種を超える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f61a6e8-5f00-4e84-b487-4e6f4a3a783b\', \'multiverseId\': 484814}, \'multiverseid\': 484814}, {\'name\': \'Gavi, Guardiã do Ninho\', \'text\': \'Você pode pagar {0} em vez de pagar o custo de reciclar do primeiro card que você reciclar a cada turno.\\nToda vez que você comprar seu segundo card a cada turno, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha e branca 2/2 do tipo Dinossauro Felino.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'O amor materno transcende as espécies.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22b2fab-a5b3-4733-bcf5-5eeaf9d5fa66\', \'multiverseId\': 484834}, \'multiverseid\': 484834}, {\'name\': \'Гави, Охранница Гнезда\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заплатить {0} вместо оплаты стоимости Цикла первой карты, Цикл которой вы совершаете в каждом ходу.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете вашу вторую карту в каждом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 красный и белый Динозавр Кошка.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Материнская любовь не смотрит на вид.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee223ed-a5b6-4838-a317-362ac3a27a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 484854}, \'multiverseid\': 484854}]', "[{'name': 'Gedankenquelle', 'text': 'Ziehe X Karten.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Bruchstücke von Gedanken zerfallen weiter und vervielfältigen sich, bis sie zu einem Springquell erstaunlicher Erkenntnis werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482995&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b25f3c26-8a56-48fb-8aa8-93901f9b8d71', 'multiverseId': 482995}, 'multiverseid': 482995}, {'name': 'Manantial mental', 'text': 'Roba X cartas.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Fragmentos del pensamiento se refractan y multiplican, surgiendo en un géiser de inspiración apabullante.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483246&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31a166ca-c561-4076-8997-5d6cd17fdea0', 'multiverseId': 483246}, 'multiverseid': 483246}, {'name': 'Source spirituelle', 'text': 'Piochez X cartes.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les fragments de pensée se réfractent et se multiplient, explosant dans un vertigineux geyser cérébral.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483497&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ee9a1dd-cca9-43d4-bebf-767060f09b6a', 'multiverseId': 483497}, 'multiverseid': 483497}, {'name': 'Molla Mentale', 'text': 'Pesca X carte.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Frammenti di pensiero si riflettono e moltiplicano, travolti in un geyser di stordenti intuizioni.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483748&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7add3931-c498-4e6b-9c00-80ce393c08d6', 'multiverseId': 483748}, 'multiverseid': 483748}, {'name': '思考の泉', 'text': 'カードをＸ枚引く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '思考の欠片は屈折し増加し、目がくらむような洞察へとうねり噴出する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483999&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd860486a-ac55-42f6-beec-b5b1ea253214', 'multiverseId': 483999}, 'multiverseid': 483999}, {'name': 'Esguicho Mental', 'text': 'Compre X cards.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Fragmentos de pensamento refratam-se e multiplicam-se, explodindo como um gêiser de estonteante percepção.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484250&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd91d037-eb16-4774-95c9-0623658d4012', 'multiverseId': 484250}, 'multiverseid': 484250}, {'name': 'Источник Разума', 'text': 'Возьмите Х карт.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Обрывки мыслей преломляются и преумножаются, изливаясь фонтаном опьяняющего прозрения.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484501&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a46d4dc-6370-4f03-bdf1-68eefa5f5f21', 'multiverseId': 484501}, 'multiverseid': 484501}]", "[{'name': 'Gedenkstätte der Torheit', 'text': 'Die Gedenkstätte der Torheit kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, opfere die Gedenkstätte der Torheit: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483167&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30f71583-8b37-4dde-9daf-87473daead21', 'multiverseId': 483167}, 'multiverseid': 483167}, {'name': 'Monumento a la locura', 'text': 'El Monumento a la locura entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, sacrificar el Monumento a la locura: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483418&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48ddabf4-019f-484c-a7e9-0dd57a7240b0', 'multiverseId': 483418}, 'multiverseid': 483418}, {'name': 'Mémorial à la folie', 'text': 'Le Mémorial à la folie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mémorial à la folie : Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483669&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2170c275-a267-4b69-8c1a-287c530684e3', 'multiverseId': 483669}, 'multiverseid': 483669}, {'name': 'Monumento alla Follia', 'text': 'Il Monumento alla Follia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica il Monumento alla Follia: Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483920&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01f0b9ae-78ee-4019-9c04-e2a557f15ee3', 'multiverseId': 483920}, 'multiverseid': 483920}, {'name': '愚蒙の記念像', 'text': '愚蒙の記念像はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\\n{2}{B}, {T}, 愚蒙の記念像を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484171&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2973d6eb-3bf9-47c3-a239-8a2bff766cad', 'multiverseId': 484171}, 'multiverseid': 484171}, {'name': 'Memorial à Loucura', 'text': 'Memorial à Loucura entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, sacrifique Memorial à Loucura: Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484422&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b135f0b-5ff3-4c93-8ebc-3f56d9d7a5b8', 'multiverseId': 484422}, 'multiverseid': 484422}, {'name': 'Памятник Глупости', 'text': 'Памятник Глупости выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Памятник Глупости: верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484673&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99e7a268-b6b0-4552-8af0-549bab04d8d0', 'multiverseId': 484673}, 'multiverseid': 484673}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geliebter Verstorbener\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSolange der Geliebte Verstorbene in deinem Friedhof ist, kommt jede Mensch-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, mit einer zusätzlichen +1/+1-Marke ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'„Vergiss unsere Ahnen nie. Denn sie haben uns auch nicht vergessen."\\n—Lunarch Mikaeus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be1f53cd-baba-45dc-8c75-e7a2c0f1fe22\', \'multiverseId\': 482963}, \'multiverseid\': 482963}, {\'name\': \'Difuntos amados\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nMientras los Difuntos amados estén en tu cementerio, cada criatura Humano que controlas entra al campo de batalla con un contador +1/+1 adicional sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca olvidemos a nuestros ancestros. Ellos no nos han olvidado".\\n—Mikaeus, el Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1b36d16-ead9-4d3b-a1f1-d6829b6a9728\', \'multiverseId\': 483214}, \'multiverseid\': 483214}, {\'name\': \'Chers disparus\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nTant que les Chers disparus sont dans votre cimetière, chaque créature Humain que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur +1/+1 supplémentaire sur elle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': "« N\'oubliez jamais nos ancêtres. Eux ne nous ont jamais oubliés. »\\n—Mikaeus, le lunarque", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db7e02a-9b19-4d1b-bab2-f5b3f0a79144\', \'multiverseId\': 483465}, \'multiverseid\': 483465}, {\'name\': \'Cari Estinti\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nFintanto che i Cari Estinti sono nel tuo cimitero, ogni creatura Umano che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino +1/+1 addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'"Non dimenticare mai i nostri antenati. Loro non ci hanno dimenticati."\\n—Mikaeus, il Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d52927b-ea03-4250-8818-06fa4f401e07\', \'multiverseId\': 483716}, \'multiverseid\': 483716}, {\'name\': \'安らかに旅立つ者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n安らかに旅立つ者があなたの墓地にあるかぎり、あなたがコントロールしている各人間・クリーチャーはそれぞれ、＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの祖先を忘れてはならぬ。彼らは我々を忘れてはおらぬ。」\\n――月皇ミケウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa1e243-161a-4f0d-8374-fbc09847a03b\', \'multiverseId\': 483967}, \'multiverseid\': 483967}, {\'name\': \'Queridos Defuntos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nEnquanto Queridos Defuntos estiver no seu cemitério, cada criatura do tipo Humano que você controla entrará no campo de batalha com um marcador +1/+1 adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais se esqueçam de nossos antepassados. Eles não se esqueceram de nós."\\n— Mikaeus, o Lunarca\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f01d7c-ef47-47a6-818a-6db9d93a72af\', \'multiverseId\': 484218}, \'multiverseid\': 484218}, {\'name\': \'Почившие в Бозе\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nПока Почившие в Бозе находятся на вашем кладбище, каждое существо-Человек под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном +1/+1 на нем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'«Никогда не забывайте наших предков. Они ведь нас не забыли».\\n— Микеас, Лунарх\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b573f00-5186-405c-9e92-e0851041789a\', \'multiverseId\': 484469}, \'multiverseid\': 484469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genesis-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine bleibende Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger, die kein Land ist, ins Spiel bringen. Mische dann den Rest in deine Bibliothek.\\nDie Genesis-Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483051&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9c4ff3-fba6-43a0-a4a3-cc0dbdefbb5d\', \'multiverseId\': 483051}, \'multiverseid\': 483051}, {\'name\': \'Hidra del génesis\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de permanente que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de X o menos que se encuentre entre ellas. Luego baraja el resto en tu biblioteca.\\nLa Hidra del génesis entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra planta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ffd7a5-99f7-4f8e-b099-d8fda204d2b5\', \'multiverseId\': 483302}, \'multiverseid\': 483302}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de genèse\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Parmi elles, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent non-terrain de coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X. Mélangez ensuite le reste dans votre bibliothèque.\\nL\'Hydre de genèse arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : plante et hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483553&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57bf9a48-1a93-4908-9ff7-0f5cde0d2367\', \'multiverseId\': 483553}, \'multiverseid\': 483553}, {\'name\': \'Idra della Genesi\', \'text\': "Quando lanci questa magia, rivela le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X scelta tra esse. Poi rimescola le altre nel tuo grimorio.\\nL\'Idra della Genesi entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra Pianta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94267c2f-1f47-4c4e-b464-df174c845d3a\', \'multiverseId\': 483804}, \'multiverseid\': 483804}, {\'name\': \'起源のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚公開する。あなたはその中から、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下で土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\\n起源のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1eb811e-5b71-4793-8743-ecd7eb63ce30\', \'multiverseId\': 484055}, \'multiverseid\': 484055}, {\'name\': \'Hidra da Gênese\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar esta mágica, revele os X cards do topo do seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de permanente que não seja terreno com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X dentre eles no campo de batalha. Depois, embaralhe o restante em seu grimório.\\nHidra da Gênese entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Planta Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf787412-cd71-4d66-bfee-dafcbe5e421c\', \'multiverseId\': 484306}, \'multiverseid\': 484306}, {\'name\': \'Гидра Порождения\', \'text\': \'Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, покажите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить на поле битвы находящуюся среди них карту не являющегося землей перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более X. Затем втасуйте остальные карты в вашу библиотеку.\\nГидра Порождения выходит на поле битвы с Х жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Растение Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5907007-cd16-42c7-ad21-14b964a19c84\', \'multiverseId\': 484557}, \'multiverseid\': 484557}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geschmolzene Echos\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Geschmolzenen Echos ins Spiel kommen, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur des bestimmten Typs unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie jener Kreatur ist. Der Spielstein erhält Eile. Schicke ihn zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d986be-23fd-48cc-91d6-2ea1b7eb64eb\', \'multiverseId\': 484952}, \'multiverseid\': 484952}, {\'name\': \'Ecos fundidos\', \'text\': \'En cuanto los Ecos fundidos entren al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha del tipo elegido entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2603ce71-cddd-4209-8504-8333868d2957\', \'multiverseId\': 485003}, \'multiverseid\': 485003}, {\'name\': \'Échos en fusion\', \'text\': "Au moment où les Échos en fusion arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton du type choisi arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité. Exilez-le au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d332ccb5-198f-475b-8f3a-a5b0f1cc2967\', \'multiverseId\': 485054}, \'multiverseid\': 485054}, {\'name\': \'Echi Incandescenti\', \'text\': "Mentre gli Echi Incandescenti entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina del tipo scelto entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, crea una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura. Quella pedina ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924764fa-712f-4663-83b1-1edbc51ec38d\', \'multiverseId\': 485105}, \'multiverseid\': 485105}, {\'name\': \'溶鉄の残響\', \'text\': \'溶鉄の残響が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nその選ばれたタイプでありトークンでないクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。そのトークンは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd98d3d0-41d1-41a5-9a71-8f288959bdd2\', \'multiverseId\': 485156}, \'multiverseid\': 485156}, {\'name\': \'Ecos Derretidos\', \'text\': \'Conforme Ecos Derretidos entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nToda vez que uma criatura do tipo escolhido que não seja uma ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto. Exile-a no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c13eeb70-baaf-4781-be4d-bb79d33ce608\', \'multiverseId\': 485207}, \'multiverseid\': 485207}, {\'name\': \'Расплавленное Эхо\', \'text\': \'При выходе Расплавленного Эха на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо выбранного типа выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией того существа. Та фишка получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ca175b-07be-454a-be6d-074bcce9f171\', \'multiverseId\': 485258}, \'multiverseid\': 485258}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geteilte Abneigung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+0 für jede andere angreifende Kreatur, mit der sie einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es liegt in der Natur der Seelen, dass sie zusammen heller brennen als einzeln."\\n—Vessifrus, Flamensippen-Agitator\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483037&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf836dd-f4be-4986-a36d-d8b4c8d5f2c9\', \'multiverseId\': 483037}, \'multiverseid\': 483037}, {\'name\': \'Animosidad compartida\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque, obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno por cada otra criatura atacante que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Es parte de la naturaleza de las almas arder más fuertemente juntas que separadas".\\n—Véssifrus, demagogo llameante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ddc107-293c-4926-b378-37d76e93fca4\', \'multiverseId\': 483288}, \'multiverseid\': 483288}, {\'name\': \'Animosité partagée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque, elle gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque autre créature attaquante qui partage un type de créature avec elle.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Il est dans la nature de l\'âme de brûler plus ardemment accompagnée que seule. »\\n—Vessifrus, démagogue sangpyre", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483539&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a63f8c-5b10-43dc-a803-2db60f121197\', \'multiverseId\': 483539}, \'multiverseid\': 483539}, {\'name\': \'Animosità Condivisa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca, prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno per ogni altra creatura attaccante che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"È nella natura delle anime bruciare più intensamente insieme che isolate."\\n—Vessifrus, demagogo ignifero\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6be457d-5039-4986-91b9-b6f334a726ea\', \'multiverseId\': 483790}, \'multiverseid\': 483790}, {\'name\': \'分かち合う憎しみ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは他の、それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つ攻撃クリーチャー１体につき、＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「魂ってのは、別々に燃えるよりもともに燃えるほうがより明るいもんだ。」\\n――炎族の扇動家、ヴェジフルズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fd07b84-9346-4f30-a168-6ef515beb054\', \'multiverseId\': 484041}, \'multiverseid\': 484041}, {\'name\': \'Animosidade Compartilhada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca, ela recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno para cada outra criatura atacante que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"É a natureza das almas queimar mais ardentemente quando estão juntas do que quando estão separadas."\\n— Vessifrus, demagogo flamíneo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93494e20-f53c-47a5-9447-8cb7e6455628\', \'multiverseId\': 484292}, \'multiverseid\': 484292}, {\'name\': \'Общая Враждебность\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует, оно получает +1/+0 до конца хода за каждое другое атакующее существо, у которого есть такой же тип существа.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Такова природа — вместе души горят намного ярче, чем каждая по отдельности».\\n— Везифрус, агитатор пламенников\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04df4501-e21a-47e3-9038-4d33c9aa47a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484543}, \'multiverseid\': 484543}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gezeitenbarrakuda\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler kann Zaubersprüche wirken, als ob sie Aufblitzen hätten.\\nDeine Gegner können während deines Zuges keine Zaubersprüche wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Fisch\', \'flavor\': \'Er lebt zwischen den Momenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6c2853-354c-478c-ab45-090d5af44f88\', \'multiverseId\': 484937}, \'multiverseid\': 484937}, {\'name\': \'Barracuda de la marea\', \'text\': \'Cualquier jugador puede lanzar hechizos como si tuvieran la habilidad de destello.\\nTus oponentes no pueden lanzar hechizos durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pez\', \'flavor\': \'Merodea por los huecos entre momentos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe7f779f-838b-4e71-8e43-cad737c3c2d8\', \'multiverseId\': 484988}, \'multiverseid\': 484988}, {\'name\': \'Barracuda des marées\', \'text\': "N\'importe quel joueur peut lancer des sorts comme s\'ils avaient le flash.\\nVos adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : poisson\', \'flavor\': \'Il rôde dans les intervalles entre les instants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a23efd-2835-4e30-a93f-8ebe28459a84\', \'multiverseId\': 485039}, \'multiverseid\': 485039}, {\'name\': \'Barracuda delle Maree\', \'text\': \'Qualsiasi giocatore può lanciare magie come se avessero lampo.\\nI tuoi avversari non possono lanciare magie durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pesce\', \'flavor\': "Resta in agguato negli spazi tra un momento e l\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2286cd03-a44c-4378-96ce-cdc31a81be6b\', \'multiverseId\': 485090}, \'multiverseid\': 485090}, {\'name\': \'高潮のバラクーダ\', \'text\': \'どのプレイヤーも、呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。\\nあなたのターンの間、対戦相手は呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 魚\', \'flavor\': \'それは時の狭間に潜んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6435a3dc-e203-4e7d-9380-21ba489d57d5\', \'multiverseId\': 485141}, \'multiverseid\': 485141}, {\'name\': \'Barracuda das Marés\', \'text\': \'Qualquer jogador pode conjurar mágicas como se elas tivessem lampejo.\\nSeus oponentes não podem conjurar mágicas durante seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Peixe\', \'flavor\': \'Ela espreita nos espaços entre um momento e outro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'065e136d-a0fe-4a42-8f45-5e4f5cc15af8\', \'multiverseId\': 485192}, \'multiverseid\': 485192}, {\'name\': \'Приливная Барракуда\', \'text\': \'Любой игрок может разыгрывать заклинания, как будто у них есть Миг.\\nВаши оппоненты не могут разыгрывать заклинания во время вашего хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Рыба\', \'flavor\': \'Она охотится в пространстве между мгновениями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cb684d-0028-4687-ab9b-5bfa2312e294\', \'multiverseId\': 485243}, \'multiverseid\': 485243}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gieriges Gigantotherion\', \'text\': \'Verschlingen 3 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit dreimal so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\\nWenn das Gierige Gigantotherion ins Spiel kommt, fügt es X Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl du bestimmst, wobei X gleich seiner Stärke ist. Jede der Kreaturen fügt dem Gierigen Gigantotherion Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'671cbf68-f3f5-4bd4-afa0-0b7aaa1bad52\', \'multiverseId\': 484961}, \'multiverseid\': 484961}, {\'name\': \'Mamifegante voraz\', \'text\': \'Devorar 3. (En cuanto esta carta entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con el triple de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\\nCuando el Mamifegante voraz entre al campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre hasta X criaturas objetivo, donde X es su fuerza. Cada una de esas criaturas hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza al Mamifegante voraz.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38f1edab-2f11-4352-8d5b-ada30919f6ee\', \'multiverseId\': 485012}, \'multiverseid\': 485012}, {\'name\': \'Gigantothérium vorace\', \'text\': "Dévorement 3 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier n\'importe quel nombre de créatures. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec trois fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)\\nQuand le Gigantothérium vorace arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige X blessures réparties comme vous le désirez entre jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées, X étant sa force. Chacune de ces créatures inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force au Gigantothérium vorace.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58201a2e-eb96-4198-acb0-f3dcae8560e5\', \'multiverseId\': 485063}, \'multiverseid\': 485063}, {\'name\': \'Gigantoterio Famelico\', \'text\': \'Divorare 3 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al triplo delle creature divorate.)\\nQuando il Gigantoterio Famelico entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge X danni divisi a tua scelta tra un massimo di X creature bersaglio, dove X è la sua forza. Ognuna di quelle creature infligge al Gigantoterio Famelico danno pari alla propria forza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6ac5fe-1234-4d1d-8225-4d1a70cda4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 485114}, \'multiverseid\': 485114}, {\'name\': \'貪欲な巨体獣\', \'text\': \'貪食３（これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。このクリーチャーは、その数の３倍に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\\n貪欲な巨体獣が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とする。これはそれらにＸ点のダメージをあなたの望むように分割して与える。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。それらの各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを貪欲な巨体獣に与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6655f62-4e1d-479c-94da-fb7d208fbf56\', \'multiverseId\': 485165}, \'multiverseid\': 485165}, {\'name\': \'Gigantotério Voraz\', \'text\': \'Devorar 3 (Conforme esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um número qualquer de criaturas. Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com o triplo daquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1.)\\nQuando Gigantotério Voraz entra no campo de batalha, ele causa X pontos de dano divididos à sua escolha entre até X criaturas alvo, sendo X o poder de Gigantotério Voraz. Cada uma daquelas criaturas causa dano igual ao próprio poder a Gigantotério Voraz.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249cc12a-a170-4c14-8d4e-278c49b9e46e\', \'multiverseId\': 485216}, \'multiverseid\': 485216}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливый Гигантотерий\', \'text\': \'Пожирание 3 (При выходе этого объекта на поле битвы вы можете пожертвовать любое количество существ. Это существо выходит на поле битвы с количеством жетонов +1/+1 на нем, в три раза превышающим это число.)\\nКогда Прожорливый Гигантотерий выходит на поле битвы, он наносит X повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между не более чем X целевыми существами, где X — значение его силы. Каждое из тех существ наносит Прожорливому Гигантотерию повреждения, равные своей силе.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c6534e-1ea4-482f-aac5-05ee73f87715\', \'multiverseId\': 485267}, \'multiverseid\': 485267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glücksfall\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler wirft alle Karten aus seiner Hand ab und zieht dann so viele Karten, wie der Spieler, der auf diese Weise die meisten Karten abgeworfen hat, abgeworfen hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Reich" ist ein relativer Begriff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a14a0cd-2dd1-4248-a2d5-1fa232b47ed2\', \'multiverseId\': 483007}, \'multiverseid\': 483007}, {\'name\': \'Ganga\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor cantidad de cartas que un jugador descartó de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Riqueza" es un término relativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a99214d6-2631-4167-9534-f29818217526\', \'multiverseId\': 483258}, \'multiverseid\': 483258}, {\'name\': \'Aubaine\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis il pioche un nombre de cartes égal au plus grand nombre de cartes dont un joueur s\'est défaussé de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La « richesse » est toute relative.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483509&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd712d20-8e32-425f-9400-c517d4b35cc6\', \'multiverseId\': 483509}, \'multiverseid\': 483509}, {\'name\': \'Vento Sferzante\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano, poi pesca carte pari al maggior numero di carte che un giocatore ha scartato in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ricchezza" è un termine relativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95af93fd-63f0-4dd9-8249-f6e79f385517\', \'multiverseId\': 483760}, \'multiverseid\': 483760}, {\'name\': \'意外な授かり物\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後これによりプレイヤー１人が捨てたカードの枚数のうち最も多いものに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「富」とは相対的な言葉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf54bdb2-0a00-46bb-a1c6-93cb1fb16fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 484011}, \'multiverseid\': 484011}, {\'name\': \'Sorte Inesperada\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador descarta a própria mão e depois compra uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior número de cards descartados por um jogador dessa maneira.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Rico" é um termo relativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'870d58de-848c-41bd-9d3a-d36fb00a4a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 484262}, \'multiverseid\': 484262}, {\'name\': \'Неожиданная Догадка\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок сбрасывает свою руку, затем берет количество карт, равное наибольшему количеству карт, сброшенному кем-либо из игроков таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Богатый» — понятие относительное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba4503b6-80c6-4deb-85a5-8d028011daa2\', \'multiverseId\': 484513}, \'multiverseid\': 484513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblins der Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn die Goblins der Dunkelheit ins Spiel kommen, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls die Karte in diesem Zug auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a87f804c-c8f7-411c-8a63-d459ff7c0d41\', \'multiverseId\': 483032}, \'multiverseid\': 483032}, {\'name\': \'Trasgos habitasombras\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando los Trasgos habitasombras entren al campo de batalla, puedes lanzar la carta de instantáneo o conjuro objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio sin pagar su coste de maná. Si esa carta fuera a ir a tu cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26eecfbf-001e-4c64-8e85-12f54fcf5755\', \'multiverseId\': 483283}, \'multiverseid\': 483283}, {\'name\': \'Gobelins sciaphiles\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand les Gobelins sciaphiles arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3 depuis votre cimetière sans payer son coût de mana. Si cette carte devait être mise dans votre cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be95c85-86b9-4974-b107-5c6969fd1a68\', \'multiverseId\': 483534}, \'multiverseid\': 483534}, {\'name\': "Goblin Abitanti dell\'Oscurità", \'text\': "Minacciare\\nQuando i Goblin Abitanti dell\'Oscurità entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se quella carta sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero in questo turno, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04c60570-1c93-4039-9892-7d716f4bb8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 483785}, \'multiverseid\': 483785}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの闇住まい\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nゴブリンの闇住まいが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下でインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。このターン、そのカードがあなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f926c718-14d4-4327-b2f3-73dee08c1a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 484036}, \'multiverseid\': 484036}, {\'name\': \'Umbrígeos Goblins\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nQuando Umbrígeos Goblins entra no campo de batalha, você pode conjurar o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se aquele card seria colocado no seu cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac01f64-bb55-445e-be84-6ebf0d90dc82\', \'multiverseId\': 484287}, \'multiverseid\': 484287}, {\'name\': \'Гоблины, Обитатели Тьмы\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nКогда Гоблины, Обитатели Тьмы выходят на поле битвы, вы можете разыграть целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Если та карта должна быть положена на ваше кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните ее вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a90b0f34-36ac-4eee-9dae-28d0e42d0568\', \'multiverseId\': 484538}, \'multiverseid\': 484538}]', "[{'name': 'Golgari-Verrottungsfarm', 'text': 'Die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Golgari-Verrottungsfarm ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483156&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c3d57a1-0917-422f-bdb5-f17f78c71ebe', 'multiverseId': 483156}, 'multiverseid': 483156}, {'name': 'Granja de podredumbre golgari', 'text': 'La Granja de podredumbre golgari entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Granja de podredumbre golgari entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483407&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28870e64-59cd-4dad-ae45-9b6f926e49f8', 'multiverseId': 483407}, 'multiverseid': 483407}, {'name': 'Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari', 'text': 'La Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Ferme à putréfaction des Golgari arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483658&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb949624-6251-4fa4-89bb-22120ff13700', 'multiverseId': 483658}, 'multiverseid': 483658}, {'name': 'Mortificio Golgari', 'text': 'Il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Mortificio Golgari entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483909&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1246fc9c-20ab-4bec-9ab6-ccc46c783ba2', 'multiverseId': 483909}, 'multiverseid': 483909}, {'name': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場', 'text': 'ゴルガリの腐敗農場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nゴルガリの腐敗農場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484160&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a6b447c-0ee0-477f-afb8-5a1e2a2cd716', 'multiverseId': 484160}, 'multiverseid': 484160}, {'name': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari', 'text': 'Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fazenda de Podridão Golgari entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controle para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484411&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d636f16-cacb-41ab-acb7-97d4bd596639', 'multiverseId': 484411}, 'multiverseid': 484411}, {'name': 'Гнилостная Ферма Голгари', 'text': 'Гнилостная Ферма Голгари выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Гнилостная Ферма Голгари выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484662&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '003a740b-bca5-4842-8696-e1c5901876e7', 'multiverseId': 484662}, 'multiverseid': 484662}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gottloser Befehl\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert X Lebenspunkte.\\n• Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl verursachen Furcht bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie können außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c57371f8-9486-4684-94a8-98dd972b6b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 483014}, \'multiverseid\': 483014}, {\'name\': \'Dictado profano\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• El jugador objetivo pierde X vidas.\\n• Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de X o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n• La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno.\\n• Hasta X criaturas objetivo ganan la habilidad de inspirar temor hasta el final del turno. (No pueden ser bloqueadas excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f2cbfd-8c73-486c-a015-f797e397ffeb\', \'multiverseId\': 483265}, \'multiverseid\': 483265}, {\'name\': \'Commandement profane\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Le joueur ciblé perd X points de vie.\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X.\\n• La créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées acquièrent la peur jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elles ne peuvent pas être bloquées excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eb9a5b2-a426-4394-8c94-cde096144275\', \'multiverseId\': 483516}, \'multiverseid\': 483516}, {\'name\': \'Ordine Profano\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio perde X punti vita.\\n• Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X dal tuo cimitero.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Fino a X creature bersaglio hanno paura fino alla fine del turno. (Non possono essere bloccate tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature nere.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9accf96-26c6-467c-ab11-ff545115bc31\', \'multiverseId\': 483767}, \'multiverseid\': 483767}, {\'name\': \'不敬の命令\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはＸ点のライフを失う。\\n• あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。\\n• クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらは畏怖を得る。（それらはアーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55cba92-1c89-4ada-a485-0f03e54beb05\', \'multiverseId\': 484018}, \'multiverseid\': 484018}, {\'name\': \'Comando Profano\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• O jogador alvo perde X pontos de vida.\\n• Devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n• A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno.\\n• Até X criaturas alvo ganham amedrontar até o final do turno. (Elas só podem ser bloqueadas por criaturas pretas e/ou criaturas artefato.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d20d04-c862-4a87-9896-4433f32aa1c2\', \'multiverseId\': 484269}, \'multiverseid\': 484269}, {\'name\': \'Богохульная Команда\', \'text\': \'Выберите два —\\n• Целевой игрок теряет Х жизней.\\n• Верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более X из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\n• Целевое существо получает -Х/-Х до конца хода.\\n• Не более X целевых существ получают Страх до конца хода. (Они могут быть заблокированы только артефактами существами и/или черными существами.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3265e0a3-79ef-4bf9-9644-2d38f18a5307\', \'multiverseId\': 484520}, \'multiverseid\': 484520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Granitblick\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle bleibenden Karten mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder weniger, die keine Länder sind.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Golgari-Wiederverwerter verachten die Gorgos, da ihretwegen so viele gute Nährstoffe zu Stein werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483093&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed555c34-75b5-455e-9f2e-3a419e3d732e\', \'multiverseId\': 483093}, \'multiverseid\': 483093}, {\'name\': \'Mirada de granito\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de X o menos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los recobradores golgari desprecian a las gorgonas, ofendidos por la pérdida de tantos nutrientes encerrados en piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28f5837-d6ca-40a1-8721-2676d42cc94f\', \'multiverseId\': 483344}, \'multiverseid\': 483344}, {\'name\': \'Regard de granit\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les récupérateurs de Golgari n\'ont que mépris pour les gorgones au nom de tous ces précieux nutriments sottement pétrifiés.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483595&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ce5da67-d9ad-4a20-b5b6-37cabb33fe07\', \'multiverseId\': 483595}, \'multiverseid\': 483595}, {\'name\': \'Sguardo di Granito\', \'text\': \'Distruggi ogni permanente non terra con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I recuperatori Golgari non sopportano le gorgoni, infastiditi dalla perdita di tutto quel nutrimento rinchiuso in pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42deab22-a2d7-4205-b85e-192608534577\', \'multiverseId\': 483846}, \'multiverseid\': 483846}, {\'name\': \'花崗岩の凝視\', \'text\': \'点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下で土地でない各パーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ゴルガリの回収者達はゴルゴンのことを不愉快に思っている。大量の良質な栄養分が石にされてしまったことが勿体なく、口惜しいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e8cfe1-0429-4385-bbb4-9b9a1d0deedf\', \'multiverseId\': 484097}, \'multiverseid\': 484097}, {\'name\': \'Olhar de Granito\', \'text\': \'Destrua cada permanente que não seja um terreno com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os recuperadores Golgari detestam as górgonas, lamentando a perda de tantos nutrientes bons encerrados em pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41e29d1-7a9e-437b-8163-c19d38cd3fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 484348}, \'multiverseid\': 484348}, {\'name\': \'Гранитный Взор\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте каждый перманент, не являющийся землей, с конвертированной мана-стоимостью Х или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Утилизаторы из Роя Голгари не любят горгон: им не дает покоя мысль о том, что столько питательных веществ превращается в камень.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a59c5f04-023c-4c9f-af93-052f8362007b\', \'multiverseId\': 484599}, \'multiverseid\': 484599}]', "[{'name': 'Grauenhafte Bergung', 'text': 'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturen- oder Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Für die Golgari ist alles, was vergraben ist, ein Schatz.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483094&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edb005f2-984a-4b6f-a59b-bbf359c2a670', 'multiverseId': 483094}, 'multiverseid': 483094}, {'name': 'Recuperación truculenta', 'text': 'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de criatura o de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Para los golgari, todo lo que está enterrado es un tesoro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483345&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86cd9a38-2396-4088-be8b-4013ec30e2da', 'multiverseId': 483345}, 'multiverseid': 483345}, {'name': 'Horrible récupération', 'text': 'Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ou de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Aux yeux des Golgari, tout ce qui est enterré est un trésor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483596&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2b84237-44e5-486a-813a-b2754fa920d6', 'multiverseId': 483596}, 'multiverseid': 483596}, {'name': 'Recupero Raccapricciante', 'text': 'Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta creatura o terra scelta tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Per i Golgari, tutto ciò che è sepolto è un tesoro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483847&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a397f4c1-dd54-4236-8bbe-4523a0b97bfc', 'multiverseId': 483847}, 'multiverseid': 483847}, {'name': '忌まわしい回収', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。あなたはその中からクリーチャーか土地であるカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ゴルガリにとって、埋められているものはすべて宝である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484098&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5ec082a-d4a2-4252-86fc-f9b548cf8ed1', 'multiverseId': 484098}, 'multiverseid': 484098}, {'name': 'Salvamento Macabro', 'text': 'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de criatura ou terreno dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Para os Golgari, qualquer coisa enterrada é um tesouro.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484349&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f05fc900-fac4-4944-b527-dacc201a9953', 'multiverseId': 484349}, 'multiverseid': 484349}, {'name': 'Страшное Извлечение', 'text': 'Покажите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту существа или земли в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Для Голгари все, что зарыто в земле, — сокровище.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484600&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81bb3f95-c0aa-42ec-bc83-243ad983e308', 'multiverseId': 484600}, 'multiverseid': 484600}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grenzland-Kriegstreiberin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen einen deiner Gegner oder einen Planeswalker, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreifen, erhalten sie Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Sie kümmert sich nicht um Anführer oder Loyalitäten, solange der Kampf weiter tobt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd3f75d-a5a6-4334-a8d2-638ffdf8cc49\', \'multiverseId\': 484950}, \'multiverseid\': 484950}, {\'name\': \'Belicista de la frontera\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas ataquen a uno de tus oponentes o a un planeswalker que controlan, esas criaturas ganan la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras la batalla continúe, a ella le importan bien poco los líderes o las lealtades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b60779d-97fe-4add-82da-cdd5e8013252\', \'multiverseId\': 485001}, \'multiverseid\': 485001}, {\'name\': \'Belliciste des frontières\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature attaque un de vos adversaires ou un planeswalker qu\'il contrôle, ces créatures acquièrent la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Elle n\'a que faire des meneurs et de la loyauté, tant que la bataille fait rage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98392be2-6061-417f-afe1-a06102bddd7c\', \'multiverseId\': 485052}, \'multiverseid\': 485052}, {\'name\': \'Guerrafondaia di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature attaccano uno dei tuoi avversari o un planeswalker controllato da un avversario, quelle creature hanno minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Dimostra scarso interesse per i leader o i vincoli di fedeltà, fintanto che la battaglia infuria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656ad9fb-b628-4d45-a872-03b56c52065d\', \'multiverseId\': 485103}, \'multiverseid\': 485103}, {\'name\': \'開拓地の戦争屋\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体以上、対戦相手１人か対戦相手がコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体に攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーは威迫を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'戦いの勢いが続きさえすれば、指導者とか忠誠心とかは彼女にとってどうでもいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6ca46f-b1e9-4aa5-91f3-569af650142e\', \'multiverseId\': 485154}, \'multiverseid\': 485154}, {\'name\': \'Belicista da Fronteira\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas atacam um de seus oponentes ou um planeswalker que eles controlam, aquelas criaturas ganham ameaçar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se importa pouco com líderes e lealdades, contanto que o fragor da batalha não cesse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad19eb1a-806b-49e4-b6c6-15b65c5f16be\', \'multiverseId\': 485205}, \'multiverseid\': 485205}, {\'name\': \'Приграничная Воительница\', \'text\': "Каждый раз, когда одно или несколько существ атакуют любого из ваших оппонентов или planeswalker\'а под его контролем, те существа получают Угрозу до конца хода.", \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Ей нет дела до вождей и верности, лишь бы продолжалась битва.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33d3f6bf-a184-4533-8414-9dec8d359d36\', \'multiverseId\': 485256}, \'multiverseid\': 485256}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzlandbiwak\', \'text\': \'Das Grenzlandbiwak kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}, {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die mächtigsten Träume kommen zu denen, die Unterschlupf im Schädel eines Drachen finden."\\n—Chianul, Zweifach-Flüsterer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483154&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e61ab46d-66b2-4f7f-8909-1e5b8df7cdf8\', \'multiverseId\': 483154}, \'multiverseid\': 483154}, {\'name\': \'Campamento fronterizo\', \'text\': \'El Campamento fronterizo entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}, {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"A aquellos que se refugian en el cráneo de un dragón los visitan los sueños más poderosos".\\n—Chianul, Doble susurro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50cc66de-41d7-4684-ab95-b1f5a2d984c1\', \'multiverseId\': 483405}, \'multiverseid\': 483405}, {\'name\': \'Bivouac de frontière\', \'text\': \'Le Bivouac de frontière arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}, {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« De puissants rêves apparaissent à ceux qui s\'abritent dans le crâne d\'un dragon. »\\n—Chëanul, le Passeur de murmures", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483656&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8537b1-938a-4732-bad8-ef598526b290\', \'multiverseId\': 483656}, \'multiverseid\': 483656}, {\'name\': \'Bivacco di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Il Bivacco di Frontiera entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}, {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"I sogni più intensi fanno visita a chi cerca riparo nel teschio di un drago."\\n—Chianul, Duplice Sussurro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2625a76-949b-4788-8d8c-7d2a55248b04\', \'multiverseId\': 483907}, \'multiverseid\': 483907}, {\'name\': \'開拓地の野営地\', \'text\': \'開拓地の野営地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「龍の髑髏の中を住処とする者には、最も鮮明な夢が訪れるだろう。」\\n――二度囁く者、チアヌル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429b79e1-29bf-4bf4-b95f-29ab9d12292f\', \'multiverseId\': 484158}, \'multiverseid\': 484158}, {\'name\': \'Bivaque da Fronteira\', \'text\': \'Bivaque da Fronteira entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}, {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Os sonhos mais poderosos visitam aqueles que se abrigam na caveira de um dragão."\\n— Chianul, Sussurrador Duplo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeca07f9-72c1-4685-a90f-b1b84ad892bd\', \'multiverseId\': 484409}, \'multiverseid\': 484409}, {\'name\': \'Пограничный Бивак\', \'text\': \'Пограничный Бивак выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}, {U} или {R}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Самые яркие сны приходят к тем, кто нашел убежище в черепе дракона».\\n— Чианул, Шепчущий Дважды\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc22c5ff-3e81-42b2-bca9-06385986cd8c\', \'multiverseId\': 484660}, \'multiverseid\': 484660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Hinterwald\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich mag, was sie mit dem Ort gemacht haben."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a58d37-e2e2-4599-96df-08524fec689d\', \'multiverseId\': 483157}, \'multiverseid\': 483157}, {\'name\': \'Montes siniestros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrificar una criatura: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Me encanta lo que hicieron con el lugar".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ff5f12-f01e-4019-ba13-31c91593f16f\', \'multiverseId\': 483408}, \'multiverseid\': 483408}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre forêt sauvage\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez une créature : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« J\'adore ! Auriez-vous le nom de leur jardinier ? »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483659&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f86d19e-4501-4936-9d10-61aa726e0157\', \'multiverseId\': 483659}, \'multiverseid\': 483659}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Orrenda\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi piace come hanno sistemato questo posto."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e76e0fe7-d3a8-45bf-a6e9-55413d5048f2\', \'multiverseId\': 483910}, \'multiverseid\': 483910}, {\'name\': \'不気味な辺境林\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「いいね。奴らがこの地にしでかした事は。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d0d21d-3ec1-4efb-8bd8-64c0611ec80a\', \'multiverseId\': 484161}, \'multiverseid\': 484161}, {\'name\': \'Mata Sinistra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Adorei o que fizeram com esse lugar."\\n— Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbd4540-8567-48a7-ba96-b7baa3a1a4e0\', \'multiverseId\': 484412}, \'multiverseid\': 484412}, {\'name\': \'Мрачная Глухомань\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}{B}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте существо: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне нравится, как они здесь все изменили!».\\n— Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3c4873f-9495-435c-839c-99698b192380\', \'multiverseId\': 484663}, \'multiverseid\': 484663}]', "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483158&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2455850-ebb9-459b-9d26-fdc927f9bc32', 'multiverseId': 483158}, 'multiverseid': 483158}, {'name': 'Territorio gruul', 'text': 'El Territorio gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Territorio gruul entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483409&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b1726e7-afb3-4c6a-954f-578fc1270581', 'multiverseId': 483409}, 'multiverseid': 483409}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483660&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55f0529e-7069-4fea-8ab5-aec57d5eeb45', 'multiverseId': 483660}, 'multiverseid': 483660}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483911&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a253d2c-6d9e-49a5-8ea9-2fecff458b63', 'multiverseId': 483911}, 'multiverseid': 483911}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484162&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '463cfb2b-603d-4947-b2eb-11a0d88bbf39', 'multiverseId': 484162}, 'multiverseid': 484162}, {'name': 'Gleba Gruul', 'text': 'Gleba Gruul entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Gleba Gruul entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484413&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b262b2f-906d-4ed3-a81d-d8472fabedc5', 'multiverseId': 484413}, 'multiverseid': 484413}, {'name': 'Территория Груулов', 'text': 'Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484664&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c1718d2-e989-4966-b6b7-2549c46566dc', 'multiverseId': 484664}, 'multiverseid': 484664}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grübelschlängler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Grübelschlängler ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nHerbeirufen {2}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9d45da-3509-4739-a6a8-a8da81ed9a7a\', \'multiverseId\': 482996}, \'multiverseid\': 482996}, {\'name\': \'Errante meditabundo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Errante meditabundo entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas.\\nEvocar {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024e8dcb-b012-458c-95cf-aa6fd5711047\', \'multiverseId\': 483247}, \'multiverseid\': 483247}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des pensées\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Vagabond des pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉvocation {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe8f2f7-e214-4eb4-8253-33287e193dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 483498}, \'multiverseid\': 483498}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo Pensoso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Vagabondo Pensoso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\\nApparire {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2d0841-5bef-4118-a674-3713ed076b86\', \'multiverseId\': 483749}, \'multiverseid\': 483749}, {\'name\': \'熟考漂い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n熟考漂いが戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引く。\\n想起{2}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52a60efa-2118-40f3-b27e-c63e5b5e103a\', \'multiverseId\': 484000}, \'multiverseid\': 484000}, {\'name\': \'Vaga-pensador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Vaga-pensador entrar no campo de batalha, compre dois cards.\\nEvocar {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9e3f4c2-d8be-436f-bd68-8c2581f4f98a\', \'multiverseId\': 484251}, \'multiverseid\': 484251}, {\'name\': \'Плыводум\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Плыводум выходит на поле битвы, возьмите две карты.\\nВызывание {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Вызывания. Если вы это делаете, оно приносится в жертву, когда выходит на поле битвы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd4c8e5-6738-45e4-8949-aab91cc6e757\', \'multiverseId\': 484502}, \'multiverseid\': 484502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Haldan, eifriger Arkanist\', \'text\': \'Partner von Pako, arkaner Retriever (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Pako aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nDu kannst Nichtkreatur-Karten, die eine Apportiermarke auf sich liegen haben, aus dem Exil spielen, falls du sie ins Exil geschickt hast. Um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484729&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0251b883-e59c-42f6-987e-504761fe2663\', \'multiverseId\': 484729}, \'multiverseid\': 484729}, {\'name\': \'Haldan, arcanista entusiasta\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Pako, recobrador arcano (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Pako en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nPuedes jugar cartas que no sean de criatura con contadores de juego sobre ellas desde el exilio si tú las exiliaste, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar esos hechizos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac1ea069-858a-4f2d-9114-8a42d6fa7b46\', \'multiverseId\': 484749}, \'multiverseid\': 484749}, {\'name\': \'Haldan, arcaniste avide\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Pako, retriever ésotérique (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Pako dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nVous pouvez jouer des cartes non-créature avec des marqueurs « rabattage » sur elles depuis l\'exil si vous les avez exilées, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ces sorts.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484769&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'267ee68f-2c66-48c6-978d-c9b4de4f8f14\', \'multiverseId\': 484769}, \'multiverseid\': 484769}, {\'name\': \'Haldan, Avido Arcanista\', \'text\': "Partner di Pako, Segugio da Riporto Arcano (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Pako alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nPuoi giocare carte non creatura con segnalini riporto dall\'esilio, se le hai esiliate tu, e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quelle magie.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b925ea-47b7-4710-969f-eacbe7670fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 484789}, \'multiverseid\': 484789}, {\'name\': \'熱心な秘儀術師、ハルダン\', \'text\': \'秘儀を運ぶもの、パコとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから秘儀を運ぶもの、パコを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたは、あなたが追放した、取得カウンターが置かれていてクリーチャーでないカードを追放領域からプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8863fa00-73cd-4ed3-9757-a9341e56cd18\', \'multiverseId\': 484809}, \'multiverseid\': 484809}, {\'name\': \'Haldan, Arcanista Ávido\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Pako, Buscador Arcano (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Pako na própria mão do próprio cemitério e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nVocê pode jogar cards com marcadores de pegar que não sejam de criatura do exílio se os tiver exilado, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquelas mágicas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56fdf1b9-6e7c-461b-9564-7e5f72c7ef70\', \'multiverseId\': 484829}, \'multiverseid\': 484829}, {\'name\': \'Халдан, Заядлый Арканист\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Пако, Колдовским Добытчиком (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Пако в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nВы можете разыгрывать из изгнания не являющиеся существами карты с жетонами получения на них, если вы их изгнали, и можете тратить ману на разыгрывание тех заклинаний, как будто это мана любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e9c867-0d55-4060-89cc-3f58cb77ee14\', \'multiverseId\': 484849}, \'multiverseid\': 484849}]', '[{\'name\': \'Halimar-Untiefe\', \'text\': \'Die Halimar-Untiefe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Halimar-Untiefe ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483159&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b97c39-40bf-47c9-b9c4-609f935c96eb\', \'multiverseId\': 483159}, \'multiverseid\': 483159}, {\'name\': \'Abismos de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Los Abismos de Halimar entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Abismos de Halimar entren al campo de batalla, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y regrésalas en cualquier orden.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be733314-e0a6-4f6f-8aed-a444f8e7df94\', \'multiverseId\': 483410}, \'multiverseid\': 483410}, {\'name\': \'Profondeurs de Halimar\', \'text\': "Les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483661&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2fd748-1a2d-48b2-a095-e27b43b44222\', \'multiverseId\': 483661}, \'multiverseid\': 483661}, {\'name\': \'Abissi di Halimar\', \'text\': \'Gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d221832-c658-49cd-83b0-d8194717d1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 483912}, \'multiverseid\': 483912}, {\'name\': \'ハリマーの深み\', \'text\': \'ハリマーの深みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nハリマーの深みが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、その後それらを望む順番で戻す。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4639dec5-a1a0-43a7-8b7c-d56b399f8fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 484163}, \'multiverseid\': 484163}, {\'name\': \'Profundezas de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Profundezas de Halimar entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Profundezas de Halimar entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08b47f97-de0f-4e8a-906e-3525cb2514aa\', \'multiverseId\': 484414}, \'multiverseid\': 484414}, {\'name\': \'Халимарские Глубины\', \'text\': \'Халимарские Глубины выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\nКогда Халимарские Глубины выходят на поле битвы, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите их обратно в любом порядке.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e0c23fb-81ce-44ff-88de-e72439866f56\', \'multiverseId\': 484665}, \'multiverseid\': 484665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hastige Suche\', \'text\': \'Ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann zwei Karten ab. Enttappe bis zu drei Länder.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Es bedurfte des Verbots der Zeitmanipulation in Westtolaria, um seinen Schülern den Wert der Zeit zu vermitteln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c2849a1-daad-4fe5-9739-c72381284436\', \'multiverseId\': 482990}, \'multiverseid\': 482990}, {\'name\': \'Búsqueda frenética\', \'text\': \'Roba dos cartas, luego descarta dos cartas. Endereza hasta tres tierras.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Hubo que prohibir la manipulación temporal en Tolaria Oeste para que los estudiantes aprendiesen a valorar el tiempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65645763-7368-45f0-8f1d-5693a35987aa\', \'multiverseId\': 483241}, \'multiverseid\': 483241}, {\'name\': \'Recherche effrénée\', \'text\': "Piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de deux cartes. Dégagez jusqu\'à trois terrains.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "À l\'Ouest de Tolaria, il aura fallu interdire la manipulation temporelle pour inculquer aux élèves la valeur du temps.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745600c9-25eb-487c-8396-d57f84a47e25\', \'multiverseId\': 483492}, \'multiverseid\': 483492}, {\'name\': \'Ricerca Frenetica\', \'text\': \'Pesca due carte, poi scarta due carte. STAPpa fino a tre terre.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Solo il divieto della manipolazione temporale è riuscito a insegnare agli studenti di Tolaria Occidentale il valore del tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a0c57f7-aed5-4fd9-9398-e290104e18c8\', \'multiverseId\': 483743}, \'multiverseid\': 483743}, {\'name\': \'大あわての捜索\', \'text\': \'カードを２枚引き、その後カード２枚を捨てる。土地最大３つをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'トレイリア西部では時間操作が禁止された。学生たちに時間の大切さを教えるためである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727b3cfc-40ac-48c8-a9c9-757e4c7907d4\', \'multiverseId\': 483994}, \'multiverseid\': 483994}, {\'name\': \'Busca Frenética\', \'text\': \'Compre dois cards e depois descarte dois cards. Desvire até três terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Foi necessário banir a manipulação temporal em Tolária Ocidental para ensinar aos estudantes o valor do tempo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9aec91-adfc-4e06-9184-9c221c699ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 484245}, \'multiverseid\': 484245}, {\'name\': \'Лихорадочный Поиск\', \'text\': \'Возьмите две карты, затем сбросьте две карты. Разверните не более трех земель.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы научить студентов Западной Толарии ценности времени, потребовалось запретить манипуляции с ним.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd699bec-99db-46b9-9d79-d99834ae557c\', \'multiverseId\': 484496}, \'multiverseid\': 484496}]', "[{'name': 'Heldenverschlingerin', 'text': 'Die Heldenverschlingerin kommt mit vier +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf die Heldenverschlingerin, wobei X gleich ihrer Stärke ist.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Hydra', 'flavor': 'Reisende berichten, dass Hydras sich die eigenen Köpfe abbeißen, um noch tödlicher zu werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483054&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cab72075-bf0b-4335-85b8-04c6704d86bb', 'multiverseId': 483054}, 'multiverseid': 483054}, {'name': 'Ruina de héroes', 'text': 'La Ruina de héroes entra al campo de batalla con cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la Ruina de héroes, donde X es su fuerza.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hidra', 'flavor': 'Las historias de los viajeros cuentan que las hidras se arrancan sus propias cabezas a mordiscos para ser más letales.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483305&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bbaab63-7a98-47d3-b8e8-14483f691b27', 'multiverseId': 483305}, 'multiverseid': 483305}, {'name': 'Fléau des héros', 'text': 'Le Fléau des héros arrive sur le champ de bataille avec quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{2}{G}{G} : Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Fléau des héros, X étant sa force.', 'type': 'Créature : hydre', 'flavor': 'Selon les contes de voyage, les hydres arrachent leurs propres têtes pour se rendre encore plus dangereuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483556&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcede177-9e4f-4c6c-b4f7-b4cf6fc38179', 'multiverseId': 483556}, 'multiverseid': 483556}, {'name': 'Flagello degli Eroi', 'text': 'Il Flagello degli Eroi entra nel campo di battaglia con quattro segnalini +1/+1.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Metti X segnalini +1/+1 sul Flagello degli Eroi, dove X è la sua forza.', 'type': 'Creatura — Idra', 'flavor': 'I racconti dei viandanti sostengono che le idre si stacchino le teste a morsi per rendersi ancora più letali.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483807&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c54850fe-6050-4804-92cd-f79c08ef2d47', 'multiverseId': 483807}, 'multiverseid': 483807}, {'name': '英雄たちを破滅させるもの', 'text': '英雄たちを破滅させるものは、＋１/＋１カウンターが４個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{G}{G}：英雄たちを破滅させるものの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': '旅人たちのうわさ話によれば、ハイドラはより強くなるために、自らの首を噛み切り落とすらしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484058&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05edd492-0e5c-40cd-b5cf-0cedfc30fb2b', 'multiverseId': 484058}, 'multiverseid': 484058}, {'name': 'Perdição dos Heróis', 'text': 'Perdição dos Heróis entra no campo de batalha com quatro marcadores +1/+1.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em Perdição dos Heróis, sendo X seu poder.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hidra', 'flavor': 'De acordo com as histórias dos viajantes, as hidras arrancam as próprias cabeças para se tornarem mais letais.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484309&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a86bd704-ae2a-44e6-8572-be1f7cce0dae', 'multiverseId': 484309}, 'multiverseid': 484309}, {'name': 'Погибель Героев', 'text': 'Погибель Героев выходит на поле битвы с четырьмя жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\n{2}{G}{G}: положите X жетонов +1/+1 на Погибель Героев, где X — значение ее силы.', 'type': 'Существо — Гидра', 'flavor': 'Бывалые путешественники утверждают, что гидры сами откусывают себе головы, чтобы стать еще опаснее.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484560&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93d6c419-1a11-402b-ad3b-ebeaba7aff64', 'multiverseId': 484560}, 'multiverseid': 484560}]", '[{\'name\': \'Herold der Vergessenen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Herold der Vergessenen ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten deiner Wahl, die eine Umwandlung-Fähigkeit haben, aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9f15185-0edc-4010-acd1-1f3ddaa690cc\', \'multiverseId\': 484925}, \'multiverseid\': 484925}, {\'name\': \'Heraldo de los olvidados\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Heraldo de los olvidados entre al campo de batalla, si lo lanzaste, regresa cualquier cantidad de cartas de permanente objetivo con habilidades de ciclo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9e7824-b805-47d5-80ec-8f1f111a0675\', \'multiverseId\': 484976}, \'multiverseid\': 484976}, {\'name\': \'Héraut des oubliés\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Héraut des oubliés arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de permanent avec des capacités de recyclage ciblées depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5627184-03ad-4c9f-b3e7-cb02fb400cf9\', \'multiverseId\': 485027}, \'multiverseid\': 485027}, {\'name\': \'Araldo dei Dimenticati\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Araldo dei Dimenticati entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, rimetti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte permanente bersaglio con abilità ciclo dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38350e13-2a1c-409d-8479-c2db9bb30550\', \'multiverseId\': 485078}, \'multiverseid\': 485078}, {\'name\': \'忘れられた者たちの伝令\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n忘れられた者たちの伝令が戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、あなたの墓地からサイクリング能力を持つ望む枚数のパーマネント・カードを対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc007650-8ef4-4591-95b0-452d67f1d773\', \'multiverseId\': 485129}, \'multiverseid\': 485129}, {\'name\': \'Arauto dos Esquecidos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Arauto dos Esquecidos entrar no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, devolva qualquer número de cards de permanente alvo com habilidades de reciclar de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7936837e-9a2e-42a8-bfc9-9cf245ced2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 485180}, \'multiverseid\': 485180}, {\'name\': \'Вестник Позабытых\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Вестник Позабытых выходит на поле битвы, если вы разыграли его, то верните любое количество целевых карт перманентов со способностью Цикла из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'958301fd-f332-4ecb-9c14-7e336317372f\', \'multiverseId\': 485231}, \'multiverseid\': 485231}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelswolken-Weite\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Horizont von Otaria glitzert, wenn die Sonne von oben und das Meer von unten zusammentreffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483191&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11011c7f-ccae-430c-9480-c07a8bab1cd0\', \'multiverseId\': 483191}, \'multiverseid\': 483191}, {\'name\': \'Expansión Nubeceleste\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Desde Otaria, el sol se encuentra con el mar en un horizonte fulgurante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f11860d2-e29c-4be4-b060-6d6338096cd2\', \'multiverseId\': 483442}, \'multiverseid\': 483442}, {\'name\': \'Immensité de Cielcouvert\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Depuis Otaria, le soleil rejoint la mer dans l\'horizon scintillant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483693&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81634a8d-feaa-43e5-9cc7-07094142f4aa\', \'multiverseId\': 483693}, \'multiverseid\': 483693}, {\'name\': \'Distesa di Cielonube\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Da Otaria, il sole incontra il mare in un orizzonte abbagliante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b372414-8252-4e73-8fc8-23892a0ab386\', \'multiverseId\': 483944}, \'multiverseid\': 483944}, {\'name\': \'広漠なるスカイクラウド\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアから見渡すと、頭上の太陽とその下の海が光輝く水平線でまじわっているのが見える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53054c8-a628-49a6-938e-763d1f523240\', \'multiverseId\': 484195}, \'multiverseid\': 484195}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão de Skycloud\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Otaria, o sol desce até encontrar o mar em um horizonte fulgurante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa85e761-3058-46cc-ba36-ec0245ac89cc\', \'multiverseId\': 484446}, \'multiverseid\': 484446}, {\'name\': \'Гладь Небесного Облака\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Из Отарии видно, как солнце наверху встречается с морем внизу на сверкающей линии горизонта.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4467c2e-56f2-4376-9dc2-229d40118d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 484697}, \'multiverseid\': 484697}]', "[{'name': 'Hornissenkönigin', 'text': 'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn die Hornissenkönigin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Insekt-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit und Todesberührung.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Insekt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483055&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1c95dca-e0ec-48f8-b652-69b57598dd1e', 'multiverseId': 483055}, 'multiverseid': 483055}, {'name': 'Avispa reina', 'text': 'Vuela, toque mortal.\\nCuando la Avispa reina entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura Insecto verdes 1/1 con las habilidades de volar y toque mortal.', 'type': 'Criatura — Insecto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483306&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d4b3ffb-82b9-4d6a-9c83-5ec287330552', 'multiverseId': 483306}, 'multiverseid': 483306}, {'name': 'Reine des frelons', 'text': 'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand la Reine des frelons arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Insecte avec le vol et le contact mortel.', 'type': 'Créature : insecte', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483557&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0021061e-f664-49ad-918f-dc00eb706d34', 'multiverseId': 483557}, 'multiverseid': 483557}, {'name': 'Regina dei Calabroni', 'text': 'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando la Regina dei Calabroni entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura Insetto 1/1 verdi con volare e tocco letale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Insetto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483808&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '326181cf-b2be-46f5-a801-6b6dc42a2ead', 'multiverseId': 483808}, 'multiverseid': 483808}, {'name': '女王スズメバチ', 'text': '飛行、接死\\n女王スズメバチが戦場に出たとき、飛行と接死を持つ緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークンを４体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 昆虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484059&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3e9b186-3f8a-42fe-ad5b-42b6233b667b', 'multiverseId': 484059}, 'multiverseid': 484059}, {'name': 'Vespa Rainha', 'text': 'Voar, toque mortífero\\nQuando Vespa Rainha entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Inseto com voar e toque mortífero.', 'type': 'Criatura — Inseto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484310&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af599f82-fb41-4d71-8f4e-b4b5082d51de', 'multiverseId': 484310}, 'multiverseid': 484310}, {'name': 'Царица Шершней', 'text': 'Полет, Смертельное касание\\nКогда Царица Шершней выходит на поле битвы, создайте четыре фишки существа 1/1 зеленое Насекомое с Полетом и Смертельным касанием.', 'type': 'Существо — Насекомое', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484561&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2d837dc-d83a-425d-a335-1a6b8d3c7941', 'multiverseId': 484561}, 'multiverseid': 484561}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hufabdruck des Hirsches\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, kannst du eine Hufabdruck-Marke auf den Hufabdruck des Hirsches legen.\\n{2}{W}, entferne vier Hufabdruck-Marken vom Hufabdruck des Hirsches: Erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Stammes-Verzauberung — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'080a2908-7a95-44ff-8834-7dcd3428d8b3\', \'multiverseId\': 482969}, \'multiverseid\': 482969}, {\'name\': \'Huellas del ciervo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes una carta, puedes poner un contador de huella sobre las Huellas del ciervo.\\n{2}{W}, remover cuatro contadores de huellas de las Huellas del ciervo: Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar. Activa esta habilidad solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento tribal — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1396fa8-ceb2-4e61-974e-ba55c8de5649\', \'multiverseId\': 483220}, \'multiverseid\': 483220}, {\'name\': \'Empreintes de sabot du cerf\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur « empreinte de sabot » sur les Empreintes de sabot du cerf.\\n{2}{W}, retirez quatre marqueurs « empreinte de sabot » des Empreintes de sabot du cerf : Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Élémental avec le vol. N\'activez cette capacité que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement tribal : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b25a323b-d598-4990-a3f3-4faa0e4b11f2\', \'multiverseId\': 483471}, \'multiverseid\': 483471}, {\'name\': \'Impronte del Cervo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi una carta, puoi mettere un segnalino impronta sulle Impronte del Cervo.\\n{2}{W}, Rimuovi quattro segnalini impronta dalle Impronte del Cervo: Crea una pedina creatura Elementale 4/4 bianca con volare. Attiva questa abilità solo durante il tuo turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Tribale — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b257b1d-4d6e-400d-8a07-ee3b9e5a3328\', \'multiverseId\': 483722}, \'multiverseid\': 483722}, {\'name\': \'雄鹿の蹄の跡\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードを１枚引くたび、あなたは雄鹿の蹄の跡の上に蹄跡カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\\n{2}{W}, 雄鹿の蹄の跡の上から蹄跡カウンターを４個取り除く：飛行を持つ白の４/４のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。この能力は、あなたのターンの間にのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'部族・エンチャント — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fb35091-d36b-457a-b513-93fe51159ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 483973}, \'multiverseid\': 483973}, {\'name\': \'Pegadas do Cervo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você compra um card, você pode colocar um marcador de pegada em Pegadas do Cervo.\\n{2}{W}, remova quatro marcadores de pegada de Pegadas do Cervo: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Elemental com voar. Ative esta habilidade apenas durante o seu turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Tribal — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8305fed2-b06d-41f9-8c90-eeded9c099a5\', \'multiverseId\': 484224}, \'multiverseid\': 484224}, {\'name\': \'Следы Благородного Оленя\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы берете карту, вы можете положить один жетон следов на Следы Благородного Оленя.\\n{2}{W}, удалите четыре жетона следов со Следов Благородного Оленя: создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белый Элементаль с Полетом. Активируйте эту способность только во время вашего хода.\', \'type\': \'Племенные Чары — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f8c52fa-d177-4893-a4c6-4a510a388fea\', \'multiverseId\': 484475}, \'multiverseid\': 484475}]', "[{'name': 'Hurtigwindhöhen', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Falls du in diesem Zug mit drei oder mehr Kreaturen angegriffen hast, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483200&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38dada9d-89ef-4492-ad48-584451220bca', 'multiverseId': 483200}, 'multiverseid': 483200}, {'name': 'Cumbres viento vigorizante', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si atacaste con tres o más criaturas este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483451&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f42b8e62-f332-4c8c-ab34-d6d022167b04', 'multiverseId': 483451}, 'multiverseid': 483451}, {'name': 'Hauts de Ventabrupt', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{W}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si vous avez attaqué avec au moins trois créatures ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483702&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50b1e3d9-5e60-4ce8-93aa-59cb2c5f35b7', 'multiverseId': 483702}, 'multiverseid': 483702}, {'name': 'Alture di Vento Pungente', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se hai attaccato con tre o più creature in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483953&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa7e1449-41bc-4aac-9636-6efbe9067e5c', 'multiverseId': 483953}, 'multiverseid': 483953}, {'name': '風立ての高地', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\n{W}, {T}：このターンにあなたが３体以上のクリーチャーで攻撃していたなら、あなたはその追放されているカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484204&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0dd3540-ed21-4feb-918f-e87080eaa3bf', 'multiverseId': 484204}, 'multiverseid': 484204}, {'name': 'Cumes dos Ventos Velozes', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se tiver atacado com três ou mais criaturas neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484455&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9daaafab-5c5b-45d4-95b7-f4ade7997734', 'multiverseId': 484455}, 'multiverseid': 484455}, {'name': 'Высоты Свежего Ветра', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\n{W}, {T}: вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если вы атаковали как тремя или более существами в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484706&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cd9efa41-a6f5-40f3-95bb-380a1e6004af', 'multiverseId': 484706}, 'multiverseid': 484706}]", "[{'name': 'Höhlen von Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}. Die Höhlen von Koilos fügen dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483141&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc714a24-69c8-4481-bd74-a096c5f35029', 'multiverseId': 483141}, 'multiverseid': 483141}, {'name': 'Cuevas de Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}. Las Cuevas de Koilos te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483392&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ecbfd34-a544-4531-b177-cf04c07761e8', 'multiverseId': 483392}, 'multiverseid': 483392}, {'name': 'Cavernes de Koïlos', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}. Les Cavernes de Koïlos vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483643&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71eaedf0-8799-453e-a9f9-d5623bf789d0', 'multiverseId': 483643}, 'multiverseid': 483643}, {'name': 'Caverne di Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {B}. Le Caverne di Koilos ti infliggono 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483894&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c359b13-1a53-4e6f-8ddd-6f0e5a61791e', 'multiverseId': 483894}, 'multiverseid': 483894}, {'name': 'コイロスの洞窟', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。コイロスの洞窟はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484145&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3044a1da-ba8c-4689-ba4a-e3077aa6447c', 'multiverseId': 484145}, 'multiverseid': 484145}, {'name': 'Cavernas de Koilos', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {B}. Cavernas de Koilos causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484396&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17e4a893-0757-4d69-9521-96a8603743b5', 'multiverseId': 484396}, 'multiverseid': 484396}, {'name': 'Пещеры Койлоса', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {W} или {B}. Пещеры Койлоса наносят вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484647&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '130448bc-aa9f-42b0-838e-f239644be5f7', 'multiverseId': 484647}, 'multiverseid': 484647}]", '[{\'name\': \'In Einklang bringen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Tiere kommunizieren mit ihrer Umgebung, ohne dafür eine Sprache zu benötigen. Sie sind eine fundamentale Verbindung eingegangen, die spärliche Wörter übersteigt."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483052&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185a5c23-dd45-462a-8e2d-61619bc2f9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 483052}, \'multiverseid\': 483052}, {\'name\': \'Armonizar\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los animales conversan con su entorno sin necesidad del lenguaje. Su conexión fundamental supera las endebles palabras".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8173ea02-c942-4f2a-abe0-556c402ec2ff\', \'multiverseId\': 483303}, \'multiverseid\': 483303}, {\'name\': \'Harmonisation\', \'text\': \'Piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les animaux se passent du langage pour communier avec leur environnement. Leur lien fondamental surpasse la vanité des mots. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f81c79e-0e1a-40e2-90a1-49093ab56ee7\', \'multiverseId\': 483554}, \'multiverseid\': 483554}, {\'name\': \'Armonizzare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli animali comunicano con l\\\'ambiente circostante senza bisogno di parole. La loro è una connessione primordiale che trascende la fragilità di una lingua."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4809264-9c02-4ac6-88fa-ca751dfeab5d\', \'multiverseId\': 483805}, \'multiverseid\': 483805}, {\'name\': \'調和\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「動物は環境との対話に言語を必要としない。浅薄な言葉に勝る根本的な繋がりがあるのよ。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32a0ea4f-e1a3-4a60-891d-f1e0c1cf3278\', \'multiverseId\': 484056}, \'multiverseid\': 484056}, {\'name\': \'Harmonizar\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os animais comungam com o ambiente sem precisar de um idioma. É uma conexão fundamental que transcende meras palavras."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5459820-128f-4113-af6a-2a753410546b\', \'multiverseId\': 484307}, \'multiverseid\': 484307}, {\'name\': \'Гармония\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Животные общаются со своим окружением, не нуждаясь в языке. Их фундаментальная связь намного превосходит жалкие слова».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e42a7c-6fb1-4943-a98e-516c0b6b9c16\', \'multiverseId\': 484558}, \'multiverseid\': 484558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Isperia, Oberste Richterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur dich oder einen Planeswalker, den du kontrollierst, angreift, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich diene nur der Gerechtigkeit. Aber in der Erfüllung meiner Pflichten diene ich Ravnica als Ganzem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483096&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6591485d-51b6-4821-944c-2853ac37b3af\', \'multiverseId\': 483096}, \'multiverseid\': 483096}, {\'name\': \'Isperia, jueza suprema\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una criatura te ataque a ti o a un planeswalker que controlas, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo sirvo a la justicia. Pero mediante ese deber, sirvo a toda Rávnica".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dcef421-cccc-4239-b108-94ea9de1be5d\', \'multiverseId\': 483347}, \'multiverseid\': 483347}, {\'name\': \'Isperia, juge suprême\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature vous attaque ou attaque un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "« Je sers uniquement la justice. Mais ce devoir m\'entraîne à servir tout Ravnica. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483598&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08b0cc2-6f46-44f4-935c-2eb78f8933bd\', \'multiverseId\': 483598}, \'multiverseid\': 483598}, {\'name\': \'Isperia, Giudice Supremo\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura attacca te o un planeswalker che controlli, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'"Servo solo la giustizia. Ma così facendo, servo tutta Ravnica."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581dfe93-0a2e-47b5-b890-ccc4b53df62c\', \'multiverseId\': 483849}, \'multiverseid\': 483849}, {\'name\': \'至高の審判者、イスペリア\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャーが１体、あなたかあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃するたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'「私は正義のために尽くすだけです。しかしそれを通じて、私はラヴニカ全てに尽くしているのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ddf706-1548-4962-a12d-3c95000c1a49\', \'multiverseId\': 484100}, \'multiverseid\': 484100}, {\'name\': \'Isperia, Juíza Suprema\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que uma criatura ataca você ou um planeswalker que você controla, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu sirvo apenas à justiça. Porém, por meio desse dever, sirvo a toda Ravnica."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93ba97c7-5995-49bc-beb8-3d0924dee475\', \'multiverseId\': 484351}, \'multiverseid\': 484351}, {\'name\': \'Исперия, Верховная Судья\', \'text\': "Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда существо атакует вас или planeswalker\'а под вашим контролем, вы можете взять карту.", \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': \'«Я служу лишь правосудию. Но этим я служу всей Равнике».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2519dd-9834-4b0d-ac17-8b5ab2a000d0\', \'multiverseId\': 484602}, \'multiverseid\': 484602}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Dampfwerk\', \'text\': \'Das Izzet-Dampfwerk kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Izzet-Dampfwerk ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abc522b5-4dda-4ce1-b01b-661244973934\', \'multiverseId\': 483162}, \'multiverseid\': 483162}, {\'name\': \'Calderas ízzet\', \'text\': \'Las Calderas ízzet entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Calderas ízzet entren al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'524e1c29-a31b-46e0-9c85-07eacd65c036\', \'multiverseId\': 483413}, \'multiverseid\': 483413}, {\'name\': "Chaufferie d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483664&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50f18f2d-2ecf-4848-a8a3-e6eb86ef8c24\', \'multiverseId\': 483664}, \'multiverseid\': 483664}, {\'name\': \'Ebollitori Izzet\', \'text\': \'Gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Ebollitori Izzet entrano nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd10d5c0-6202-46ba-8d98-bbc53f198079\', \'multiverseId\': 483915}, \'multiverseid\': 483915}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの煮沸場\', \'text\': \'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989082d4-5a5f-4219-b7bf-1f856b348704\', \'multiverseId\': 484166}, \'multiverseid\': 484166}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet\', \'text\': \'Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Fábrica de Caldeira Izzet entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772e2d16-4afc-43ac-9d43-7ff5611cbc1d\', \'multiverseId\': 484417}, \'multiverseid\': 484417}, {\'name\': \'Котельная Иззетов\', \'text\': \'Котельная Иззетов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Котельная Иззетов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a4dc2b-ed84-4cc8-86fd-b98ca5be52ec\', \'multiverseId\': 484668}, \'multiverseid\': 484668}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Petschaft der Izzet erhält immer wieder ein neues Aussehen, und jedes Mal wird es einem schmeichelnden Portrait von Niv-Mizzet ähnlicher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84af53eb-70d4-4ca1-b3fe-6e623cd4fd32\', \'multiverseId\': 483122}, \'multiverseid\': 483122}, {\'name\': \'Sello ízzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Sello ízzet se rediseña a menudo, y cada vez se parece más a un retrato de Niv-Mízzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82be4a34-6e3e-4df5-b76e-dc9698b3bab5\', \'multiverseId\': 483373}, \'multiverseid\': 483373}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Izzet", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cachet d\'Izzet est régulièrement modifié pour ressembler de plus en plus à un portrait miniature de Niv-Mizzet.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483624&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04329d7c-8a6a-4358-bb4a-9bb7c978c9e6\', \'multiverseId\': 483624}, \'multiverseid\': 483624}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il sigillo Izzet viene ridisegnato spesso, ogni volta più simile a un vanesio ritratto di Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f5551e-15fb-4a96-b5db-7270bc5c885f\', \'multiverseId\': 483875}, \'multiverseid\': 483875}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの印鑑はしばしばデザインし直され、そのたびにニヴ＝ミゼットの虚栄に満ちた肖像に近づいていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98a2d7b8-9124-4cbc-bf77-5b775afc728c\', \'multiverseId\': 484126}, \'multiverseid\': 484126}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Izzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O Sinete Izzet é freqüentemente redesenhado, e cada vez se parece mais com Niv-Mizzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4545c2fe-57fb-42d5-b4b7-a4b804a8050f\', \'multiverseId\': 484377}, \'multiverseid\': 484377}, {\'name\': \'Печать Иззетов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Печать Иззетов постоянно переделывают, и с каждым разом она все больше напоминает миниатюрное изображение Нив-Миззета.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655ccc93-3cb4-4ff8-83e1-cf7bc6037265\', \'multiverseId\': 484628}, \'multiverseid\': 484628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jace der Gedankenarchitekt\', \'text\': \'+1: Immer wenn bis zu deinem nächsten Zug eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, angreift, erhält sie -1/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−2: Decke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt jene Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm die Karten des einen Haufens auf deine Hand und lege die anderen in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n−8: Für jeden Spieler durchsuchst du dessen Bibliothek nach einer Nichtland-Karte und schickst sie ins Exil, dann mischt der Spieler seine Bibliothek. Du kannst die Karten wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4d7d84-40a5-4928-b3e6-63b15fc1a639\', \'multiverseId\': 482993}, \'multiverseid\': 482993}, {\'name\': \'Jace, arquitecto del pensamiento\', \'text\': \'+1: Hasta tu próximo turno, siempre que una criatura que controle un oponente ataque, obtiene -1/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\n-2: Muestra las primeras tres cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon uno de los montones en tu mano y el otro en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\n−8: Por cada jugador, busca en la biblioteca de ese jugador una carta que no sea tierra y exíliala, luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca. Puedes lanzar esas cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7dec285-0ea3-4fdf-a4ce-e8d8d14906da\', \'multiverseId\': 483244}, \'multiverseid\': 483244}, {\'name\': \'Jace, architecte des pensées\', \'text\': "+1: Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, à chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle attaque, elle gagne -1/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-2: Révélez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez l\'un d\'eux dans votre main et l\'autre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n-8: Pour chaque joueur, cherchez dans la bibliothèque de ce joueur une carte non-terrain et exilez-la, puis ce joueur mélange sa bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483495&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b0c7cb-e066-4bfb-9ab5-ab1d78625ad0\', \'multiverseId\': 483495}, \'multiverseid\': 483495}, {\'name\': \'Jace, Architetto del Pensiero\', \'text\': "+1: Fino al tuo prossimo turno, ogniqualvolta una creatura controllata da un avversario attacca, prende -1/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n-2: Rivela le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi una pila alla tua mano e metti l\'altra in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\n-8: Per ogni giocatore, passa in rassegna il suo grimorio per una carta non terra ed esiliala, poi quel giocatore rimescola il suo grimorio. Puoi lanciare le carte esiliate in questo modo senza pagare il loro costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8049f1e6-0d67-47d7-a29a-e0bf7274f05f\', \'multiverseId\': 483746}, \'multiverseid\': 483746}, {\'name\': \'思考を築く者、ジェイス\', \'text\': \'+1：あなたの次のターンまで、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\\n-2：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n-8：各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーから土地でないカード１枚を探し、追放し、その後そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。あなたはそれらのカードを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ジェイス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c45c2b6-38fd-46cf-bb69-2629da0c0dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 483997}, \'multiverseid\': 483997}, {\'name\': \'Jace, Arquiteto do Pensamento\', \'text\': \'+1: Até seu próximo turno, toda vez que uma criatura que um oponente controla ataca, ela recebe -1/-0 até o final do turno.\\n-2: Revele os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Um oponente separa aqueles cards em dois montes. Coloque um deles na sua mão e o outro no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\n−8: Para cada jogador, procure um card que não seja um terreno no grimório dele e exile-o. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha o próprio grimório. Você pode conjurar esses cards sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Jace\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eb0e8ec-67a5-484b-b934-72b1647d1b64\', \'multiverseId\': 484248}, \'multiverseid\': 484248}, {\'name\': \'Джейс, Архитектор Мысли\', \'text\': \'+1: до вашего следующего хода каждый раз, когда находящееся под контролем оппонента существо атакует, оно получает -1/-0 до конца хода.\\n−2: покажите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Оппонент делит те карты на две стопки. Положите одну стопку в вашу руку, а другую — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\n−8: для каждого игрока, найдите в библиотеке того игрока не являющуюся землей карту и изгоните ее, затем тот игрок тасует свою библиотеку. Вы можете разыграть те карты без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Джейс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'804a565b-0716-4119-88e0-86735c7c7cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 484499}, \'multiverseid\': 484499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagender Trygon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Jagende Trygon einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die der Spieler kontrolliert, zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Trygonen, die von umgewandelter Magie in der Luft gehalten werden, sind auf dauernder Jagd nach Quellen ihres magischen Antriebs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483111&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2035e2c-f709-4bcb-97c3-003b9767a14c\', \'multiverseId\': 483111}, \'multiverseid\': 483111}, {\'name\': \'Depredador trygon\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Depredador trygon haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes destruir el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenidos por magia metabolizada, los trygons están hambrientos buscando fuentes de su alimento místico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a2fefc-f063-47ba-b8c9-217eabef89de\', \'multiverseId\': 483362}, \'multiverseid\': 483362}, {\'name\': \'Clavelade prédatrice\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Clavelade prédatrice inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez détruire l\'artefact ou l\'enchantement ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Maintenues dans les airs par la magie qu\'elles ont métabolisée, les clavelades sont avides d\'énergie mystique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483613&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4909c8-2a78-41bf-93ab-c7cb52b430eb\', \'multiverseId\': 483613}, \'multiverseid\': 483613}, {\'name\': \'Predatore Trigone\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Predatore Trigone infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi distruggere un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio controllato da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenuti dalla magia metabolizzata, i trigoni sono famelici cacciatori di fonti di energia mistica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a036d4a6-57c5-4852-b10e-b760d6a9775a\', \'multiverseId\': 483864}, \'multiverseid\': 483864}, {\'name\': \'三角エイの捕食者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n三角エイの捕食者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'代謝魔法で浮かんでいる三角エイは、魔力を満たすための源に貪欲だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad3124d-fd86-4009-8451-503bc3d8e9ef\', \'multiverseId\': 484115}, \'multiverseid\': 484115}, {\'name\': \'Arraia Predadora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Arraia Predadora causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode destruir o artefato ou encantamento alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Suspensas no ar por uma mágica metabolizada, as arraias são ávidas por fontes de combustível místico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d056a03-953d-41c9-b3a0-d2673e83e649\', \'multiverseId\': 484366}, \'multiverseid\': 484366}, {\'name\': \'Манта-Хищник\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Манта-Хищник наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете уничтожить целевой артефакт или чары под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Манты держатся в воздухе благодаря поглощенной магии и постоянно алчут нового магического топлива.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cefd819-8452-4121-a638-c7e8b2fe1eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 484617}, \'multiverseid\': 484617}]', "[{'name': 'Jagendes Rudel', 'text': 'Erzeuge einen 4/4 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483058&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb9b0e79-b17e-4014-bb3b-9aa30bfe9bfc', 'multiverseId': 483058}, 'multiverseid': 483058}, {'name': 'Manada cazadora', 'text': 'Crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 4/4.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483309&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5ba3992-36a0-4899-ba35-a9cc99d46ba8', 'multiverseId': 483309}, 'multiverseid': 483309}, {'name': 'Meute chasseresse', 'text': 'Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 verte Bête.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483560&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'beb9da01-693e-488d-90ad-834edb683277', 'multiverseId': 483560}, 'multiverseid': 483560}, {'name': 'Muta da Caccia', 'text': 'Crea una pedina creatura Bestia 4/4 verde.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno.)', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483811&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '193d2543-c5e4-420d-909e-fdd8e7530e4b', 'multiverseId': 483811}, 'multiverseid': 483811}, {'name': '狩り立てる群れ', 'text': '緑の４/４のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484062&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63b6a2a8-782e-43e8-8de1-e6a2fdc015bf', 'multiverseId': 484062}, 'multiverseid': 484062}, {'name': 'Matilha de Caça', 'text': 'Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Besta.\\nRajada (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica conjurada antes dela neste turno.)', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484313&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7a1d4c2-69ea-48c5-8703-15ee275e475f', 'multiverseId': 484313}, 'multiverseid': 484313}, {'name': 'Охотничья Стая', 'text': 'Создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 зеленый Зверь.\\nШторм (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое заклинание, разыгранное в этом ходу до него.)', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484564&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36899eba-5547-4747-9c77-29e41d11e91a', 'multiverseId': 484564}, 'multiverseid': 484564}]", '[{\'name\': \'Jirina Kudro\', \'text\': \'Wenn Jirina Kudro ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge für jedes Mal, dass du in dieser Partie einen Kommandeur aus der Kommandozone gewirkt hast, einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nAndere Menschen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Stärke ist das, was uns am Leben hält. Mitgefühl ist das, was uns menschlich macht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484735&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13da5ccd-abe5-4baf-898a-c213b956dc5c\', \'multiverseId\': 484735}, \'multiverseid\': 484735}, {\'name\': \'Jirina Kudro\', \'text\': \'Cuando Jirina Kudro entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1 por cada vez que lanzaste un comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\\nLos otros Humanos que controlas obtienen +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La fuerza es lo que nos mantiene vivos. La compasión hace que sigamos siendo humanos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe958084-0419-412d-9ef0-33dd26c6280c\', \'multiverseId\': 484755}, \'multiverseid\': 484755}, {\'name\': \'Jirina Koudro\', \'text\': \'Quand Jirina Koudro arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat pour chaque fois que vous avez lancé un commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.\\nLes autres humains que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est par la force que nous restons en vie, et par la compassion que nous restons humains. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484775&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4acc40d8-547d-47b7-a1e7-6f246e74872b\', \'multiverseId\': 484775}, \'multiverseid\': 484775}, {\'name\': \'Jerina Kudro\', \'text\': \'Quando Jerina Kudro entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca per ogni volta che hai lanciato un comandante dalla zona di comando in questa partita.\\nGli altri Umani che controlli prendono +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"La forza ci mantiene in vita, la compassione ci mantiene umani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d91f690-18af-4689-a9e7-4f618e3804ed\', \'multiverseId\': 484795}, \'multiverseid\': 484795}, {\'name\': \'ジリーナ・クードロ\', \'text\': \'ジリーナ・クードロが戦場に出たとき、このゲームであなたが統率領域から統率者を唱えた回数１回につき、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしている人間は＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「強さが我々を生者たらしめ、慈悲が我々を人間たらしめる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5b090c-e928-429d-b983-2984fd7e657f\', \'multiverseId\': 484815}, \'multiverseid\': 484815}, {\'name\': \'Jirrina Kudro\', \'text\': \'Quando Jirrina Kudro entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado para cada vez em que você conjurou um comandante da zona de comando neste jogo.\\nOs outros Humanos que você controla recebem +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"É a força que nos mantém vivos. E a compaixão é o que nos mantém humanos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b316bd5b-77e5-42e9-a035-3d8600257ba6\', \'multiverseId\': 484835}, \'multiverseid\': 484835}, {\'name\': \'Джирина Кудро\', \'text\': \'Когда Джирина Кудро выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат за каждое разыгрывание вами командира из зоны командования в этой партии.\\nДругие перманенты с подтипом Человек под вашим контролем получают +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Сила позволяет нам выжить. Сострадание позволяет остаться людьми».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'657865b8-a206-4eba-8e42-be425df7f7d3\', \'multiverseId\': 484855}, \'multiverseid\': 484855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kalamax der Sturmentfacher\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Spontanzauber wirkst und falls Kalamax der Sturmentfacher getappt ist, kopiere den Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber kopierst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Kalamax.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Seine Stimmung wechselt mit dem Wetter, und umgekehrt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484736&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e345e8-63ea-4ff7-9638-1d3c5359d8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 484736}, \'multiverseid\': 484736}, {\'name\': \'Kálamax, Generatormentas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo de instantáneo cada turno, si Kálamax, Generatormentas está girado, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nSiempre que copies un hechizo de instantáneo, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Kálamax.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Su estado de ánimo cambia con el clima, y viceversa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a96a16-a67f-48b0-b7e4-cda3a6583c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 484756}, \'multiverseid\': 484756}, {\'name\': \'Kalamax, père des tempêtes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère à chaque tour, si Kalamax, père des tempêtes est engagé, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous copiez un sort d\'éphémère, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Kalamax.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'Son humeur change avec le temps, et inversement.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f38bc9a-f176-4944-ab6d-1429e8879c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 484776}, \'multiverseid\': 484776}, {\'name\': \'Kalamax, Progenitore delle Tempeste\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia istantaneo in ogni turno, se Kalamax, Progenitore delle Tempeste è TAPpato, copia quella magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\\nOgniqualvolta copi una magia istantaneo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Kalamax.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Dinosauro Elementale\', \'flavor\': "Il suo stato d\'animo varia col cambiare del tempo e viceversa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1725ef67-b258-40a6-afcb-15ecfd0ea0cd\', \'multiverseId\': 484796}, \'multiverseid\': 484796}, {\'name\': \'嵐呼びのカラマックス\', \'text\': \'各ターン内で初めてあなたがインスタント・呪文を唱えるたび、嵐呼びのカラマックスがタップ状態である場合、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nあなたがインスタント・呪文を１つコピーするたび、嵐呼びのカラマックスの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'その気分は天候によって変化する。逆もまた然り。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eb91238-a237-445e-82a6-623f7ee41478\', \'multiverseId\': 484816}, \'multiverseid\': 484816}, {\'name\': \'Kalamax, Criador de Tempestades\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica instantânea a cada turno, se Kalamax, Criador de Tempestades, estiver virado, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\\nToda vez que você copiar uma mágica instantânea, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Kalamax.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': \'O estado de espírito dele muda com o tempo. E vice-versa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dd2a418-e35b-48f3-aa4e-93af620a9fcc\', \'multiverseId\': 484836}, \'multiverseid\': 484836}, {\'name\': \'Каламакс, Прародитель Бурь\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое мгновенное заклинание в каждом ходу, если Каламакс, Прародитель Бурь повернут, cкопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы копируете мгновенное заклинание, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Каламакса.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль Динозавр\', \'flavor\': \'Его настроение меняется вместе с погодой — и наоборот.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b37c58a-85a2-4d3c-ab6d-be4366752038\', \'multiverseId\': 484856}, \'multiverseid\': 484856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kalemnes Hauptmann\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{5}{W}{W}: Monstrum 3. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nWenn Kalemnes Hauptmann monströs wird, schicke alle Artefakte und Verzauberungen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a00d082-67fc-4a62-96e2-3dffe96bde4f\', \'multiverseId\': 482971}, \'multiverseid\': 482971}, {\'name\': \'Capitán de Kalemne\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{5}{W}{W}: Monstruosidad 3. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nCuando el Capitán de Kalemne se convierte en monstruoso, exilia todos los artefactos y encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe4b303-bc10-45cd-8a10-e492dfca26d6\', \'multiverseId\': 483222}, \'multiverseid\': 483222}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine de Kalemnée\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{5}{W}{W} : Monstruosité 3. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nQuand le Capitaine de Kalemnée devient monstrueux, exilez tous les artefacts et tous les enchantements.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe7e1cb-e452-4ddc-a279-e385729cfa19\', \'multiverseId\': 483473}, \'multiverseid\': 483473}, {\'name\': \'Capitano di Kalemne\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{5}{W}{W}: Mostruosità 3. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nQuando il Capitano di Kalemne diventa mostruoso, esilia tutti gli artefatti e gli incantesimi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d633db-2001-4b24-8f42-a7310812297e\', \'multiverseId\': 483724}, \'multiverseid\': 483724}, {\'name\': \'カレムネの隊長\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{5}{W}{W}：怪物化３を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\nカレムネの隊長が怪物的になったとき、アーティファクトとエンチャントをすべて追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f072cfcf-6634-48b0-8282-6a390a868db9\', \'multiverseId\': 483975}, \'multiverseid\': 483975}, {\'name\': \'Capitão de Kalemne\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{5}{W}{W}: Monstruosidade 3. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nQuando Capitão de Kalemne se tornar monstruoso, exile todos os artefatos e encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7933d2da-836d-48bb-b0b2-807769434f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 484226}, \'multiverseid\': 484226}, {\'name\': \'Капитан Калемны\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\n{5}{W}{W}: Чудовищность 3. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него три жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nКогда Капитан Калемны становится чудовищным, изгоните все артефакты и чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71f6a405-fb22-4643-a86c-42dcafa53eba\', \'multiverseId\': 484477}, \'multiverseid\': 484477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaltäugiger Selkie\', \'text\': \'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nImmer wenn der Kaltäugige Selkie einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Er wandert die alten Nebenflüsse hinauf, die angelegt worden waren, als sich die Merrow noch um die Gezeiten kümmerten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483083&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58a8606-feb3-49c7-b27e-4db4555f236e\', \'multiverseId\': 483083}, \'multiverseid\': 483083}, {\'name\': \'Selkie de ojos fríos\', \'text\': \'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nSiempre que la Selkie de ojos fríos haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Ella sigue las viejas tradiciones de cuando los merrow todavía daban forma a las mareas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d388a8-b338-4d05-a5c5-8938497dc2ba\', \'multiverseId\': 483334}, \'multiverseid\': 483334}, {\'name\': \'Selkie aux yeux glacés\', \'text\': \'Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Selkie aux yeux glacés inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher autant de cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Elle utilise les anciens chenaux construits quand les suires façonnaient encore les marées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483585&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebc2f345-833a-4428-bab6-a5714263d5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 483585}, \'multiverseid\': 483585}, {\'name\': \'Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio\', \'text\': "Passa-Isole (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla un\'Isola.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare altrettante carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Segue i vecchi affluenti creati quando i merrow ancora modellavano le maree.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4056efd8-5434-405e-b01f-75076ff682ef\', \'multiverseId\': 483836}, \'multiverseid\': 483836}, {\'name\': \'冷淡なセルキー\', \'text\': \'島渡り（防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\n冷淡なセルキーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'メロウがまだ潮汐を形作っていた頃、彼女は古き支流に従っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b043a1-12ca-45ab-aed2-d6e69861a1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 484087}, \'multiverseid\': 484087}, {\'name\': \'Selkie Olhos-frios\', \'text\': \'Travessia de ilha (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Ilha.)\\nToda vez que Selkie Olhos-frios causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Ela segue os antigos afluentes construídos quando os sirenídeos ainda moldavam as marés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0650ee-85ac-4c86-93f6-695cf4aa4639\', \'multiverseId\': 484338}, \'multiverseid\': 484338}, {\'name\': \'Хладноокая Селки\', \'text\': \'Знание Островов (Это существо не может быть заблокировано, пока защищающийся игрок контролирует Остров.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Хладноокая Селки наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете взять такое же количество карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Она путешествует по старым притокам, проложенным, когда мерроу еще управляли приливами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cac1503-b289-4701-ae00-8d287e884e10\', \'multiverseId\': 484589}, \'multiverseid\': 484589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karametra, Göttin der Ernte\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Grün und Weiß weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Karametra keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- oder Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483097&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a33fbd-ca1f-45c7-925f-6626eb21c20a\', \'multiverseId\': 483097}, \'multiverseid\': 483097}, {\'name\': \'Karametra, diosa de las cosechas\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al verde y al blanco sea menor que siete, Karametra no es una criatura.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque o de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501fb049-eabc-4f74-87ff-d84b965c07bd\', \'multiverseId\': 483348}, \'multiverseid\': 483348}, {\'name\': \'Karametra, déesse des moissons\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au vert et au blanc est inférieure à sept, Karametra n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt ou de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483599&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47aea752-8c6c-46f0-b460-37784b652ef4\', \'multiverseId\': 483599}, \'multiverseid\': 483599}, {\'name\': \'Karametra, Dea dei Raccolti\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al verde e al bianco è inferiore a sette, Karametra non è una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta o Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf66911-243f-4ec2-9671-cd0019e5d44d\', \'multiverseId\': 483850}, \'multiverseid\': 483850}, {\'name\': \'収穫の神、ケイラメトラ\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの緑と白への信心が７未満であるかぎり、収穫の神、ケイラメトラはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから森か平地であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61bd064-0bfb-495c-b6cb-1484ac9f2105\', \'multiverseId\': 484101}, \'multiverseid\': 484101}, {\'name\': \'Carametra, Deusa da Colheita\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao verde e ao branco for menor que sete, Carametra não será uma criatura.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de criatura, você poderá procurar um card de Floresta ou Planície em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e, depois, embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed19347b-bd7c-4f68-b893-cbc3faf08f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 484352}, \'multiverseid\': 484352}, {\'name\': \'Караметра, Богиня Урожая\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность зеленому и белому меньше семи, Караметра не является существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Леса или Равнины, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f6e68a6-5592-448f-a671-17e3065a8f61\', \'multiverseId\': 484603}, \'multiverseid\': 484603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kathril, Verzerrer der Aspekte\', \'text\': \'Wenn Kathril, Verzerrer der Aspekte, ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Fliegend-Marke auf eine beliebige Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, falls eine Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof Flugfähigkeit hat. Wiederhole diesen Vorgang für Bedrohlichkeit, Doppelschlag, Erstschlag, Fluchsicherheit, Lebensverknüpfung, Reichweite, Todesberührung, Unzerstörbarkeit, Wachsamkeit sowie das Verursachen von Trampelschaden. Lege dann für jede Marke, die auf diese Weise auf eine Kreatur gelegt wurde, eine +1/+1-Marke auf Kathril.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e6e02f-d270-40fc-8471-2b8a4d0457ef\', \'multiverseId\': 484737}, \'multiverseid\': 484737}, {\'name\': \'Kathril, Deformapartes\', \'text\': \'Cuando Kathril, Deformapartes entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador de volar sobre cualquier criatura que controlas si una carta de criatura en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de volar. Repite este proceso con las habilidades de dañar primero, dañar dos veces, toque mortal, antimaleficio, indestructible, vínculo vital, amenaza, alcance, arrollar y vigilancia. Luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Kathril por cada contador puesto sobre una criatura de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Insecto pesadilla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'297e182c-fdde-43b9-96e2-e5f90c58c989\', \'multiverseId\': 484757}, \'multiverseid\': 484757}, {\'name\': "Kathrill, distorseur d\'aspect", \'text\': "Quand Kathrill, distorseur d\'aspect arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur « vol » sur n\'importe quelle créature que vous contrôlez si une carte de créature dans votre cimetière a le vol. Répétez ce processus pour l\'initiative, la double initiative, le contact mortel, la défense talismanique, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la menace, la portée, le piétinement et la vigilance. Puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Kathrill pour chaque marqueur mis sur une créature de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484777&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'579a7f93-3748-4257-bd6a-46f819770ab5\', \'multiverseId\': 484777}, \'multiverseid\': 484777}, {\'name\': "Kathril, Deformatore dell\'Aspetto", \'text\': "Quando Kathril, Deformatore dell\'Aspetto entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino volare su una qualsiasi creatura che controlli se una carta creatura nel tuo cimitero ha volare. Ripeti questo procedimento per attacco improvviso, doppio attacco, tocco letale, anti-malocchio, indistruttibile, legame vitale, minacciare, raggiungere, travolgere e cautela. Poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Kathril per ogni segnalino messo su una creatura in questo modo.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Insetto Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0620d9-95b6-4916-81fb-a6317b4476cb\', \'multiverseId\': 484797}, \'multiverseid\': 484797}, {\'name\': \'様相ねじり、カスリル\', \'text\': \'様相ねじり、カスリルが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードが飛行を持っているなら、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に飛行カウンターを１個置く。先制攻撃、二段攻撃、接死、呪禁、破壊不能、絆魂、威迫、到達、トランプル、警戒について、この手順を繰り返す。その後、これによりクリーチャーの上に置かれたカウンター１個につき、様相ねじり、カスリルの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea345c6-8166-47b5-8124-f892094fa6ec\', \'multiverseId\': 484817}, \'multiverseid\': 484817}, {\'name\': \'Kathril, Deformador de Aspecto\', \'text\': \'Quando Kathril, Deformador de Aspecto, entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador de voar em qualquer criatura que você controla se um card de criatura em seu cemitério tiver voar. Repita este processo para iniciativa, golpe duplo, toque mortífero, resistência a magia, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, ameaçar, alcance, atropelar e vigilância. Em seguida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Kathril para cada marcador colocado em uma criatura dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'443e62db-457a-40e3-88cb-3e69aa2d0dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 484837}, \'multiverseid\': 484837}, {\'name\': \'Кетрил, Исказитель Облика\', \'text\': \'Когда Кетрил, Исказитель Облика выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон Полета на любое существо под вашим контролем, если у карты существа на вашем кладбище есть Полет. Повторите этот процесс для Бдительности, Двойного удара, Захвата, Неразрушимости, Первого удара, Порчеустойчивости, Пробивного удара, Смертельного касания, Угрозы и Цепи жизни. Затем положите один жетон +1/+1 на Кетрила за каждый жетон, положенный на существо таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Насекомое\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650c689f-cfa1-4076-9226-8f76bd1d809c\', \'multiverseId\': 484857}, \'multiverseid\': 484857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kavallerie-Pegasus\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Kavallerie-Pegasus angreift, erhalten angreifende Menschen Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pegasus\', \'flavor\': \'„Sein Huf- und Schwingenschlag ist unser Hoffen."\\n—Kymede, Königin von Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b63a80-223e-4270-a18e-583c1f147f36\', \'multiverseId\': 482960}, \'multiverseid\': 482960}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso de caballería\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Pegaso de caballería ataque, cada Humano atacante gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'"Es la esperanza con pezuñas y alas".\\n—Cymeda, reina de Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45da09e-1cca-48d3-8137-02bd2f8df8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 483211}, \'multiverseid\': 483211}, {\'name\': \'Pégase de cavalerie\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Pégase de cavalerie attaque, chaque humain attaquant acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : pégase\', \'flavor\': "« Les sabots et les ailes de l\'espoir. »\\n—Cymède, reine d\'Akros", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d55eec6c-a3d8-4644-ace4-12a4775f2519\', \'multiverseId\': 483462}, \'multiverseid\': 483462}, {\'name\': \'Pegaso della Cavalleria\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Pegaso della Cavalleria attacca, ogni Umano attaccante ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pegaso\', \'flavor\': \'"È speranza, con zoccoli e ali."\\n—Cimede, regina di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'942b3472-ca27-4e92-b61c-0468e534690c\', \'multiverseId\': 483713}, \'multiverseid\': 483713}, {\'name\': \'乗騎ペガサス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n乗騎ペガサスが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、攻撃している各人間はそれぞれ飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ペガサス\', \'flavor\': \'「それは蹄と翼を有する希望です。」\\n――アクロスの女王、サイミーディ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e906e909-a3ae-4e73-a151-80b55022acc4\', \'multiverseId\': 483964}, \'multiverseid\': 483964}, {\'name\': \'Pégaso de Cavalaria\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Pégaso de Cavalaria ataca, cada Humano atacante ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pégaso\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele é a esperança, com cascos e asas."\\n— Ciméde, rainha de Ácros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52b508e-a161-4a34-b4f9-3162eb6c1ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 484215}, \'multiverseid\': 484215}, {\'name\': \'Кавалерийский Пегас\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Кавалерийский Пегас атакует, каждый атакующий Человек получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пегас\', \'flavor\': \'«Это воплощенная надежда — с копытами и крыльями».\\n— Кимеда, царица Акроса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d20f58-aaa7-4a02-8188-d62a3d369cac\', \'multiverseId\': 484466}, \'multiverseid\': 484466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kelsien der Verseuchte\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, Eile\\nKelsien der Verseuchte erhält +1/+1 für jede Erfahrungsmarke, die du hast.\\n{T}: Kelsien fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Wenn die Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, erhältst du eine Erfahrungsmarke.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Zielt auf die Augen. Es ist besser, wenn sie euch niemals sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484738&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b45daf-671e-4c3a-845d-54ded5387540\', \'multiverseId\': 484738}, \'multiverseid\': 484738}, {\'name\': \'Kelsien, la Plaga\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, prisa.\\nKelsien, la Plaga obtiene +1/+1 por cada contador de experiencia que tengas.\\n{T}: Kelsien hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo que no controlas. Cuando esa criatura muera en este turno, obtienes un contador de experiencia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Apunta a un ojo. Es mejor que nunca te vean".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410515d7-d97c-4de3-a202-f8cbc140cdff\', \'multiverseId\': 484758}, \'multiverseid\': 484758}, {\'name\': \'Kelsien, la Peste\', \'text\': \'Vigilance, célérité\\nKelsien, la Peste gagne +1/+1 pour chaque marqueur « expérience » que vous avez.\\n{T} : Kelsien inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. Quand cette créature meurt ce tour-ci, vous gagnez un marqueur « expérience ».\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': "« Visez les yeux. Mieux vaut qu\'ils ne vous voient jamais. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9978ce68-2cdb-45d0-ad87-65c983d49fae\', \'multiverseId\': 484778}, \'multiverseid\': 484778}, {\'name\': \'Kelsien, la Piaga\', \'text\': \'Cautela, rapidità\\nKelsien, la Piaga prende +1/+1 per ogni segnalino esperienza che possiedi.\\n{T}: Kelsien infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. Quando quella creatura muore in questo turno, ottieni un segnalino esperienza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mira a un occhio. È meglio se non ti vedono."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2180ff-bca7-40b9-bd7e-e536bca1ddcd\', \'multiverseId\': 484798}, \'multiverseid\': 484798}, {\'name\': \'疫病をもたらす者、ケルシン\', \'text\': \'警戒、速攻\\n疫病をもたらす者、ケルシンは、あなたが持っている経験カウンター１個につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。疫病をもたらす者、ケルシンはそれに１点のダメージを与える。このターン、そのクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたは経験カウンターを１個得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「目を狙え。見られない方がいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecdbddd6-db8b-4c78-a7c8-31e8efcb9fca\', \'multiverseId\': 484818}, \'multiverseid\': 484818}, {\'name\': \'Kelsien, a Peste\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, ímpeto\\nKelsien, a Peste, recebe +1/+1 para cada marcador de experiência que você tiver.\\n{T}: Kelsien causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo que você não controla. Quando aquela criatura morre neste turno, você recebe um marcador de experiência.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'"Mira no olho. É melhor que eles não te vejam."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4272946-03b2-4cf3-ac5f-c3bfa3f1d68a\', \'multiverseId\': 484838}, \'multiverseid\': 484838}, {\'name\': \'Келсиен, Моровая Погибель\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Ускорение\\nКелсиен, Моровая Погибель получает +1/+1 за каждый имеющийся у вас жетон опыта.\\n{T}: Келсиен наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу не под вашим контролем. Когда то существо умирает в этом ходу, вы получаете один жетон опыта.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Убийца\', \'flavor\': \'«Целься в глаз. Лучше, чтобы тебя не увидели».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9647eccc-fec1-438c-b931-71d5009c5a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 484858}, \'multiverseid\': 484858}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kleinstadt in Gaven\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Schutzzauber der Kirche sind schwächer geworden, und niemand kann uns sagen, warum. Jetzt müssen wir unseren Schutz in die eigene Hand nehmen."\\n—Gregel, Anführer der Miliz\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483155&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4c38f4-e076-44b5-8f80-59cc6e22af8e\', \'multiverseId\': 483155}, \'multiverseid\': 483155}, {\'name\': \'Municipio de Gavony\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Las guardas de la iglesia se han debilitado, y nadie puede decirnos por qué. Es hora de preparar nuestras propias defensas".\\n—Gregel, líder de la milicia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e9b38d-3036-44e8-a610-49c01f314165\', \'multiverseId\': 483406}, \'multiverseid\': 483406}, {\'name\': \'Comté de Gavonie\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Les protections de l\'église ont faibli, et personne ne sait nous dire pourquoi. Il est temps de nous charger nous-même de notre défense. »\\n—Gregel, chef de la milice", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483657&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926e9632-22ae-445b-aeab-75d6c2235fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 483657}, \'multiverseid\': 483657}, {\'name\': \'Distretto di Gavony\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Le protezioni della chiesa si sono indebolite e nessuno ci sa dire il perché. È arrivato il momento di creare le nostre difese."\\n—Gregel, capo della milizia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e95cb7-be17-4796-8ea9-4c65775752a8\', \'multiverseId\': 483908}, \'multiverseid\': 483908}, {\'name\': \'ガヴォニーの居住区\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に、＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「教会の守護の結界が弱まっていているが、その理由は誰にもわかっていない。自分の力に頼るべきときだ。」\\n――民兵のリーダー、グレゲル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17a05231-40d1-4f25-b006-61375668459d\', \'multiverseId\': 484159}, \'multiverseid\': 484159}, {\'name\': \'Condado de Gavony\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Os amuletos protetores da igreja se enfraqueceram, e ninguém sabe dizer por quê. É hora de cuidarmos de nossa própria defesa."\\n— Gregel, líder de milícia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'440845ad-98bb-4ad0-8488-ed5b320947ac\', \'multiverseId\': 484410}, \'multiverseid\': 484410}, {\'name\': \'Гевонский Городок\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Защитные обереги церкви ослабели, и никто не может сказать нам почему. Пришло время обороняться собственными силами».\\n— Грегель, предводитель ополченцев\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'368e4532-85a1-4ac4-ab0e-b9df1b33827e\', \'multiverseId\': 484661}, \'multiverseid\': 484661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klinge des Zufluchtsorts\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Klinge des Zufluchtsorts an eine Kreatur angelegt wird, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nDie ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und hat Schutz vor der zuletzt bestimmten Farbe.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ce3b08f-b286-4a8a-9539-ad76ed470d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 484967}, \'multiverseid\': 484967}, {\'name\': \'Hoja del santuario\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Hoja del santuario se anexe a una criatura, elige un color.\\nLa criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene protección contra el último color elegido.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28da65db-c179-4500-9040-ad88a189899b\', \'multiverseId\': 485018}, \'multiverseid\': 485018}, {\'name\': \'Lame du sanctuaire\', \'text\': \'Au moment où la Lame du sanctuaire devient attachée à une créature, choisissez une couleur.\\nLa créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et a la protection contre la dernière couleur choisie.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53166323-7d6d-4f8a-bb1e-660269b075f5\', \'multiverseId\': 485069}, \'multiverseid\': 485069}, {\'name\': \'Lama del Santuario\', \'text\': "Mentre la Lama del Santuario viene assegnata a una creatura, scegli un colore.\\nLa creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 e ha protezione dall\'ultimo colore scelto.\\nEquipaggiare {3}", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2a654b-5757-47f9-bcff-86585f8895c0\', \'multiverseId\': 485120}, \'multiverseid\': 485120}, {\'name\': \'聖域の刃\', \'text\': \'聖域の刃がクリーチャーについた状態になるに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋０の修整を受け、プロテクション（その最後に選ばれた色）を持つ。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee98d552-d5d5-493b-b3da-b1e845b4ea6f\', \'multiverseId\': 485171}, \'multiverseid\': 485171}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina do Santuário\', \'text\': \'Conforme Lâmina do Santuário se tornar anexada a uma criatura, escolha uma cor.\\nA criatura equipada recebe +2/+0 e tem proteção contra a última cor escolhida.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aed5dff-8b46-4302-b380-3856383a9f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 485222}, \'multiverseid\': 485222}, {\'name\': \'Клинок Убежища\', \'text\': \'При прикреплении Клинка Убежища к существу выберите цвет.\\nСнаряженное существо получает +2/+0 и имеет Защиту от последнего выбранного цвета.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83906ea-818b-44fa-a185-44f661acd05b\', \'multiverseId\': 485273}, \'multiverseid\': 485273}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knisternder Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Knisternden Sceadas ist gleich der Gesamtanzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexerei-Karten, die du besitzt und die sich im Exil oder in deinem Friedhof befinden.\\nWenn der Knisternde Sceada ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483085&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4632750-bf26-4ae5-b56c-536d134e5de4\', \'multiverseId\': 483085}, \'multiverseid\': 483085}, {\'name\': \'Draco chisporroteante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Draco chisporroteante es igual a la cantidad total de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio y en el exilio de las cuales eres propietario.\\nCuando el Draco chisporroteante entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cf9c57f-b829-4fd5-a9e9-fbc2df1a4247\', \'multiverseId\': 483336}, \'multiverseid\': 483336}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn crépitant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Drakôn crépitant est égale au nombre total de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous possédez en exil et dans votre cimetière.\\nQuand le Drakôn crépitant arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483587&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b6385d-63a2-489f-942c-190cf56e6225\', \'multiverseId\': 483587}, \'multiverseid\': 483587}, {\'name\': \'Draghetto Crepitante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nLa forza del Draghetto Crepitante è pari al numero totale di carte istantaneo e stregoneria che possiedi in esilio e nel tuo cimitero.\\nQuando il Draghetto Crepitante entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c30b06-4abc-438a-86d2-71d115bf4faa\', \'multiverseId\': 483838}, \'multiverseid\': 483838}, {\'name\': \'弾けるドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n弾けるドレイクのパワーは、追放領域かあなたの墓地にあって、あなたがオーナーでありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの総数に等しい。\\n弾けるドレイクが戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'566b6091-f88f-41aa-a68f-5fcba6d1df36\', \'multiverseId\': 484089}, \'multiverseid\': 484089}, {\'name\': \'Dragonete Fagulhante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nO poder de Dragonete Fagulhante é igual ao número de cards de mágica instantânea e feitiço que você possui no exílio e em seu cemitério.\\nQuando Dragonete Fagulhante entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43d692c-c394-42c1-87b1-c36033e3552e\', \'multiverseId\': 484340}, \'multiverseid\': 484340}, {\'name\': \'Трескучий Дрейк\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nСила Трескучего Дрейка равна суммарному количеству принадлежащих вам карт мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства в изгнании и на вашем кладбище.\\nКогда Трескучий Дрейк выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b4f0af-e663-4fe1-ab50-5b08204579c4\', \'multiverseId\': 484591}, \'multiverseid\': 484591}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knisterndes Verderben\', \'text\': \'Das Knisternde Verderben fügt jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur mit der höchsten Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Fürchte nicht die Blitze. Fürchte, wem sie gehorchen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483084&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be3c39a-3d4a-49ad-8681-ec1a79b1be5b\', \'multiverseId\': 483084}, \'multiverseid\': 483084}, {\'name\': \'Fatalidad centelleante\', \'text\': \'La Fatalidad centelleante hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente. Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura con la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No temas al relámpago. Teme a aquel a quien obedece.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a410b6af-8a03-4841-958b-02e9e22ee692\', \'multiverseId\': 483335}, \'multiverseid\': 483335}, {\'name\': \'Fin crépitante\', \'text\': "La Fin crépitante inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire. Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature avec la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures qu\'il contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Ne crains pas la foudre. Crains celui à qui elle obéit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483586&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f628265-766e-42e7-a2bb-032a33797b38\', \'multiverseId\': 483586}, \'multiverseid\': 483586}, {\'name\': \'Destino Crepitante\', \'text\': \'Il Destino Crepitante infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario. Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura con la forza maggiore tra le creature che controlla.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non temere il fulmine. Temi chi lo comanda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3173c75-c9a4-4871-9564-cacfd5379213\', \'multiverseId\': 483837}, \'multiverseid\': 483837}, {\'name\': \'はじける破滅\', \'text\': \'はじける破滅は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしているクリーチャーの中で最大のパワーを持つクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻を恐れる必要はない。それが従う者を恐れよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af70cf3b-1bf4-4260-b438-fd73288dda20\', \'multiverseId\': 484088}, \'multiverseid\': 484088}, {\'name\': \'Fim Crepitante\', \'text\': \'Fim Crepitante causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente. Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura com o maior poder dentre as criaturas que ele controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Não temam os raios. Temam a quem eles obedecem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48dd657d-8311-4332-800a-38b159561ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 484339}, \'multiverseid\': 484339}, {\'name\': \'Гибельный Треск\', \'text\': \'Гибельный Треск наносит 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту. Каждый оппонент жертвует существо с наибольшим значением силы среди существ под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Не бойся молнии. Бойся того, кому она покорилась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2a0f01-431a-4eaf-b558-a2f33ecbf93c\', \'multiverseId\': 484590}, \'multiverseid\': 484590}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochengrund-Mycodrax\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Knochengrund-Mycodrax sind gleich der Anzahl an anderen Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nAusplündern {4}{B} ({4}{B}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Lege so viele +1/+1-Marken, wie die Stärke dieser Karte beträgt, auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Spiele Ausplündern wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pilzwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09df7e31-b0ed-4b65-91a0-99a1384b4121\', \'multiverseId\': 484938}, \'multiverseid\': 484938}, {\'name\': \'Micodrax del osario\', \'text\': \'La fuerza y la resistencia del Micodrax del osario son iguales a la cantidad de otras cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\\nCarroñar {4}{B}. ({4}{B}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Pon una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo igual a la fuerza de esta carta. Activa la habilidad de carroñar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hongo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8dcf84e-ad78-45a7-b926-e7faa4810f64\', \'multiverseId\': 484989}, \'multiverseid\': 484989}, {\'name\': "Mycodraxe d\'ossuaire", \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Mycodraxe d\'ossuaire sont chacune égales au nombre d\'autres cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.\\nRécupération {4}{B} ({4}{B}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Mettez un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à la force de cette carte sur une créature ciblée. Ne récupérez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : fongus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5728cf8d-2660-42e6-aae4-0498ebaaba87\', \'multiverseId\': 485040}, \'multiverseid\': 485040}, {\'name\': "Micoradicante dell\'Ossario", \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione del Micoradicante dell\'Ossario sono pari al numero delle altre carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\\nMangiacarogne {4}{B} ({4}{B}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Metti un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari alla forza di questa carta su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva mangiacarogne solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fungus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c5bd22-0237-4814-b668-281068f48f14\', \'multiverseId\': 485091}, \'multiverseid\': 485091}, {\'name\': \'骨塚の巻きひげ菌\', \'text\': \'骨塚の巻きひげ菌のパワーとタフネスはそれぞれ、他の、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\\n活用{4}{B}（{4}{B}, このカードをあなたの墓地から追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上にこのカードのパワーに等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。活用はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ファンガス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84179cb0-b386-4c47-a910-5254f0352e39\', \'multiverseId\': 485142}, \'multiverseid\': 485142}, {\'name\': \'Micopólipo do Ossário\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Micopólipo do Ossário são ambos iguais ao número de outros cards de criatura no seu cemitério.\\nNecrofagia {4}{B} ({4}{B}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Coloque uma quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao poder deste card na criatura alvo. Use necrofagia somente quando puder conjurar um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fungo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71031788-85da-4db6-bbc8-6300f9b6f6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 485193}, \'multiverseid\': 485193}, {\'name\': \'Микодракс с Могильника\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Микодракса с Могильника равны количеству других карт существ на вашем кладбище.\\nУтилизация {4}{B} ({4}{B}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: положите на целевое существо жетоны +1/+1, количество которых равно силе этой карты. Утилизируйте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Плесень\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f56ed7c2-5999-4e8f-8004-13672cf8c2d9\', \'multiverseId\': 485244}, \'multiverseid\': 485244}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Schicke alle Karten aus allen Friedhöfen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Erst wenn nur noch Knochen übrig sind, endet der Fluch des Umherirrens und der ewige Schlaf beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb58fc14-f64e-4b6d-af55-7390521791b9\', \'multiverseId\': 483185}, \'multiverseid\': 483185}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos de los carroñeros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Exilia todas las cartas de todos los cementerios.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando ya no exista ni un rastro de carne, la maldición de los errantes terminará. Entonces, los muertos podrán descansar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'872f7769-ed44-4a29-b811-698f5d52c8bd\', \'multiverseId\': 483436}, \'multiverseid\': 483436}, {\'name\': \'Terrains des charognards\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Exilez toutes les cartes de tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': "Quand le dernier lambeau de chair se détache, la Malédiction d\'errance est rompue. Le mort peut enfin reposer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'153349df-3a86-49bc-ae97-10bb916c8ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 483687}, \'multiverseid\': 483687}, {\'name\': \'Territorio degli Sciacalli\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica un Deserto: Esilia tutte le carte da tutti i cimiteri.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': "La Maledizione della Peregrinazione cessa quando viene strappato l\'ultimo brandello di carne. Solo allora i morti possono riposare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d54448-ea5b-4a33-b667-c7bceff6c55e\', \'multiverseId\': 483938}, \'multiverseid\': 483938}, {\'name\': \'屍肉あさりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：すべての墓地からカードをすべて追放する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'肉の最後の一片がなくなると放浪の呪いが解け、死者は安眠を許される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c036428-53ef-4234-8fd6-1fd9de688201\', \'multiverseId\': 484189}, \'multiverseid\': 484189}, {\'name\': \'Território dos Necrófagos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique um Deserto: Exile todos os cards de todos os cemitérios.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o último vestígio de carne é removido, a Maldição da Errância termina. Então os mortos podem ter seu sono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfced52-a7b0-47d0-a55f-356c98968f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 484440}, \'multiverseid\': 484440}, {\'name\': \'Земли Падальщиков\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пустыню: изгоните все карты из всех кладбищ.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': \'Когда исчезает последний иссохший клочок плоти, Проклятие Скитальцев перестает действовать. Лишь тогда мертвый может уснуть вечным сном.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d11494d-fc3b-4271-8877-cc39d22c8be9\', \'multiverseId\': 484691}, \'multiverseid\': 484691}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kometenhagel\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {1} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {1} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nBestimme ein beliebiges Ziel; bestimme dann für jedes Mal, dass die Bonuskosten für diesen Zauberspruch bezahlt wurden, ein anderes Ziel. Der Kometenhagel fügt jedem der Ziele X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d24f6c3-2f75-4e85-b56b-2c8426290e05\', \'multiverseId\': 483027}, \'multiverseid\': 483027}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta de meteoritos\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {1}. (Puedes pagar {1} adicional tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nElige cualquier objetivo, luego elige otro objetivo por cada vez que este hechizo fue estimulado. La Tormenta de meteoritos hace X puntos de daño a cada uno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce21046f-d61d-468a-b8d6-12a4f2e25592\', \'multiverseId\': 483278}, \'multiverseid\': 483278}, {\'name\': \'Orage de comètes\', \'text\': "Multikick {1} (Vous pouvez payer {1} supplémentaire autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nChoisissez n\'importe quelle cible, puis choisissez une autre cible pour chaque fois que ce sort a été kické. L\'Orage de comètes inflige X blessures à chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483529&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70bf912b-78fc-4b30-9eec-20007a4c3ecd\', \'multiverseId\': 483529}, \'multiverseid\': 483529}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta di Comete\', \'text\': \'Multipotenziamento {1} (Puoi pagare {1} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nScegli un bersaglio qualsiasi, poi scegli un altro bersaglio per ogni volta che questa magia è stata potenziata. La Tempesta di Comete infligge X danni a ciascuno di essi.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d808615-5bc0-4419-8984-9fab582860a3\', \'multiverseId\': 483780}, \'multiverseid\': 483780}, {\'name\': \'彗星の嵐\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{1}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\nクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人と、この呪文がキッカーされた１回につき、他の、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を、対象とする。彗星の嵐はそれらにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b23b330-0c8b-4091-a81b-5517e8267e15\', \'multiverseId\': 484031}, \'multiverseid\': 484031}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade de Cometas\', \'text\': \'Multireforçar {1} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1} quantas vezes quiser conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nEscolha qualquer alvo. Depois, escolha outro alvo para cada vez que esta mágica foi reforçada. Tempestade de Cometas causa X pontos de dano a cada um deles.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67f7ea19-4734-4efb-9816-87fbd0a67e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 484282}, \'multiverseid\': 484282}, {\'name\': \'Кометная Буря\', \'text\': \'Мультиусилитель {1} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {1} любое количество раз.)\\nВыберите любую цель, затем выберите другую цель за каждый Усилитель, полученный этим заклинанием. Кометная Буря наносит X повреждений каждой из них.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24cd8852-0330-4fdb-bacf-475fe425eb8d\', \'multiverseId\': 484533}, \'multiverseid\': 484533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kopfgeld-Agentin\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{T}, opfere die Kopfgeld-Agentin: Zerstöre eine legendäre bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Einnahmen werden immer besser — und die Namen meiner Klienten immer bedeutender."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a1f6ef0-dd09-4430-83fa-dc565bab7502\', \'multiverseId\': 482957}, \'multiverseid\': 482957}, {\'name\': \'Captora de recompensas\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{T}, sacrificar a la Captora de recompensas: Destruye el permanente legendario objetivo que sea un artefacto, una criatura o un encantamiento.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Últimamente recibí las recompensas más grandes de mi carrera, todas por los más grandes nombres".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37fdafae-60d0-4095-aee2-2a4feacf4ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 483208}, \'multiverseid\': 483208}, {\'name\': \'Agente chasseuse de primes\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{T}, sacrifiez l\'Agente chasseuse de primes : Détruisez un permanent légendaire ciblé qui est un artefact, une créature ou un enchantement.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Ces derniers temps, j\'ai vu passer les plus grosses primes de ma carrière... pour les plus grands noms. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'602941f7-f12d-47ae-933f-eeb64041ec37\', \'multiverseId\': 483459}, \'multiverseid\': 483459}, {\'name\': \'Agente Cacciataglie\', \'text\': "Cautela\\n{T}, Sacrifica l\'Agente Cacciataglie: Distruggi un permanente leggendario bersaglio che è un artefatto, una creatura o un incantesimo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Di recente ho visto le taglie più ricche della mia carriera, tutte sulla testa dei nomi più in vista."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b58d06-f165-40a1-8bb5-ff7433d7e9de\', \'multiverseId\': 483710}, \'multiverseid\': 483710}, {\'name\': \'報奨密偵\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{T}, 報奨密偵を生け贄に捧げる：アーティファクトかクリーチャーかエンチャントである伝説のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「最近、私の経歴でも最大の報奨を見てきたわ。最大の名声もね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e37eb92c-c863-4a2f-b2ee-dad91e6a43e2\', \'multiverseId\': 483961}, \'multiverseid\': 483961}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Recompensas\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{T}, sacrifique Agente de Recompensas: Destrua a permanente lendária alvo que seja um artefato, uma criatura ou um encantamento.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Ultimamente tenho recebido as maiores ofertas de recompensa da minha carreira — pelos maiores nomes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e258a1-75d6-48ad-ab19-b115a753184e\', \'multiverseId\': 484212}, \'multiverseid\': 484212}, {\'name\': \'Охотница за Наградами\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Охотницу за Наградами: уничтожьте целевой легендарный перманент, являющийся артефактом, существом или чарами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«В последнее время мне предлагают самые большие гонорары за всю карьеру — и за самые большие имена».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a96c6c3-5f82-4bbe-bf3b-7ef43779969d\', \'multiverseId\': 484463}, \'multiverseid\': 484463}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischmaul\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\\nWenn das Kreischmaul ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.\\nHerbeirufen {1}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e1dbc7-fd6f-4cbb-98e2-2f8ccb42ac43\', \'multiverseId\': 483015}, \'multiverseid\': 483015}, {\'name\': \'Garganta chillona\', \'text\': \'Inspirar temor. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\\nCuando el Garganta chillona entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra o artefacto.\\nEvocar {1}{B}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4e94170-3d50-4165-a213-569d2392288d\', \'multiverseId\': 483266}, \'multiverseid\': 483266}, {\'name\': \'Hurlegueule\', \'text\': "Peur (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nQuand le Hurlegueule arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez la créature non-artefact, non-noire ciblée.\\nÉvocation {1}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483517&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e560e66-00c0-4acd-b4f9-36abbcc7ec66\', \'multiverseId\': 483517}, \'multiverseid\': 483517}, {\'name\': \'Fauce Urlante\', \'text\': \'Paura (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature nere.)\\nQuando la Fauce Urlante entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura non artefatto, non nera bersaglio.\\nApparire {1}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d28aa7f-47be-4d77-be2d-8637e0a2c938\', \'multiverseId\': 483768}, \'multiverseid\': 483768}, {\'name\': \'叫び大口\', \'text\': \'畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）\\n叫び大口が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n想起{1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eafa35a9-8b26-4009-9106-62cfa4680fd6\', \'multiverseId\': 484019}, \'multiverseid\': 484019}, {\'name\': \'Bocarra Ululante\', \'text\': \'Amedrontar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas pretas e/ou criaturas artefato.)\\nQuando Bocarra Ululante entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a criatura alvo que não seja preta nem artefato.\\nEvocar {1}{B} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d99c226-69cc-4ec3-8a9e-cd082282e8db\', \'multiverseId\': 484270}, \'multiverseid\': 484270}, {\'name\': \'Визгобрюх\', \'text\': \'Страх (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактом существом и/или черным существом.)\\nКогда Визгобрюх выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевое не являющееся артефактом нечерное существо.\\nВызывание {1}{B} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Вызывания. Если вы это делаете, оно приносится в жертву, когда выходит на поле битвы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deee7f0d-1320-40a1-9205-985faef0336c\', \'multiverseId\': 484521}, \'multiverseid\': 484521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegerischer Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erhält jede andere Kreatur, die einen deiner Gegner angreift, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd18e5f-5acb-4d36-ba5f-41c52f6b253e\', \'multiverseId\': 484926}, \'multiverseid\': 484926}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu marcial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, cada otra criatura que esté atacando a uno de tus oponentes obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c6120e-cac1-4613-b69f-005acf7cc9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 484977}, \'multiverseid\': 484977}, {\'name\': \'Impetus martial\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, chaque autre créature qui attaque un de vos adversaires gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3df4ef3d-c998-4129-bf8e-43917dfd3617\', \'multiverseId\': 485028}, \'multiverseid\': 485028}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Marziale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, ogni altra creatura che sta attaccando uno dei tuoi avversari prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'200cbe38-9368-4135-9eee-e98acade6e69\', \'multiverseId\': 485079}, \'multiverseid\': 485079}, {\'name\': \'軍部の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、他の、あなたの対戦相手を攻撃している各クリーチャーはそれぞれ＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2a1dd1-6aca-478f-9972-0cfc0996e911\', \'multiverseId\': 485130}, \'multiverseid\': 485130}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Marcial\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, cada outra criatura que esteja atacando um de seus oponentes recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97a547a-3147-42ff-af22-506a9695354a\', \'multiverseId\': 485181}, \'multiverseid\': 485181}, {\'name\': \'Боевое Побуждение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, все другие существа, атакующие любого из ваших оппонентов, получают по +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc2b6d8-faac-4665-8dcb-8d88ba2b5e34\', \'multiverseId\': 485232}, \'multiverseid\': 485232}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kristalline Resonanz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte umwandelst, kannst du die Kristalline Resonanz bis zu deinem nächsten Zug zu einer Kopie einer anderen bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl werden lassen, außer dass sie diese Fähigkeit hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„So wie ein Felsen das Wasser in einem Fluss teilt, beugen Kristalle das Leben um sie herum."\\n—Rielle die Allwissende\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae2f86d3-5edf-48dd-adfb-01004ea24f90\', \'multiverseId\': 484929}, \'multiverseid\': 484929}, {\'name\': \'Resonancia cristalina\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo de una carta, puedes hacer que la Resonancia cristalina se convierta en una copia de otro permanente objetivo hasta tu próximo turno, excepto que tiene esta habilidad.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Al igual que una roca desvía un arroyo, los cristales cambian la vida que hay a su alrededor".\\n—Rielle, la Versada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f36bb5-db7b-430a-a0e6-7f96389fe874\', \'multiverseId\': 484980}, \'multiverseid\': 484980}, {\'name\': \'Résonance cristalline\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous recyclez une carte, vous pouvez faire que la Résonance cristalline devienne une copie d\'un autre permanent ciblé jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, excepté qu\'elle a cette capacité.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Comme les rochers dévient les ruisseaux, les cristaux détournent la vie autour d\'eux. »\\n—Rielle, l\'éternisciente", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'628fef8f-6c34-4a28-b91a-0d5ed982ae57\', \'multiverseId\': 485031}, \'multiverseid\': 485031}, {\'name\': \'Risonanza Cristallina\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta cicli una carta, puoi far diventare la Risonanza Cristallina una copia di un altro permanente bersaglio fino al tuo prossimo turno, tranne che ha questa abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Come un masso devia il corso di un ruscello, così i cristalli piegano la vita intorno alle proprie sfaccettature."\\n—Rielle, l\\\'Onnisapiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'827b4a73-cd1f-4318-87a6-562cdf018197\', \'multiverseId\': 485082}, \'multiverseid\': 485082}, {\'name\': \'水晶の共鳴\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードをサイクリングするたび、他のパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたは「あなたの次のターンまで、水晶の共鳴は、この能力を持つことを除き、それのコピーになる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「大きな岩が川の流れを変えるように、水晶は周囲の生命を曲げる。」\\n――常智のリエール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff1c948-ff67-4630-9282-b3c85a1aab9b\', \'multiverseId\': 485133}, \'multiverseid\': 485133}, {\'name\': \'Ressonância Cristalina\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você recicla um card, você pode fazer com que Ressonância Cristalina se torne uma cópia de outra permanente alvo até seu próximo turno, com a exceção de ter esta habilidade.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Assim como a rocha desvia o curso d\\\'água, os cristais defletem a vida ao seu redor."\\n— Rielle, a Onissapiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7bc1ba0-448b-4c52-b965-4117cbd61637\', \'multiverseId\': 485184}, \'multiverseid\': 485184}, {\'name\': \'Кристальный Резонанс\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл карты, вы можете заставить Кристальный Резонанс стать копией другого целевого перманента до вашего следующего хода, но при этом у него есть эта способность.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Как валун разделяет поток, кристаллы меняют жизнь вокруг себя».\\n— Риэлль, Вечномудрая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a269ee7-5813-45a5-8b9f-36b903409fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 485235}, \'multiverseid\': 485235}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Eingriff\', \'text\': \'Sekundenbruchteil (Solange dieser Zauberspruch sich auf dem Stapel befindet, können Spieler keine Zaubersprüche wirken oder Fähigkeiten aktivieren, die keine Manafähigkeiten sind.)\\nZerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt diese Spruchrollen beiseite, es sind unnatürliche Waffen. Herz, Köpfchen und zwei Fäuste reichen aus."\\n—Zyd, Kamahlite-Druide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483060&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bbb4836-f600-425f-b3e7-42db3a020465\', \'multiverseId\': 483060}, \'multiverseid\': 483060}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo krosano\', \'text\': \'Fracción de segundo. (Mientras este hechizo esté en la pila, los jugadores no pueden lanzar hechizos o activar habilidades que no sean habilidades de maná.)\\nDestruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Abandona esas armas sobrenaturales, esos pergaminos. El corazón, la mente y el puño son suficientes".\\n—Zyd, druida kamahlita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fed816d-a33c-498d-8dab-b231451770ec\', \'multiverseId\': 483311}, \'multiverseid\': 483311}, {\'name\': \'Poigne krosiane\', \'text\': "Fraction de seconde (Tant que ce sort est sur la pile, les joueurs ne peuvent pas lancer de sorts ou activer de capacités qui ne sont pas des capacités de mana.)\\nDétruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Abandonnez ces armes surnaturelles, ces parchemins. Un cœur, un esprit et des poings suffisent. »\\n—Zyd, druide kamahlite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483562&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5413b5b8-a830-4f8e-b644-48e387b94402\', \'multiverseId\': 483562}, \'multiverseid\': 483562}, {\'name\': \'Stretta di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Battibaleno (Fintanto che questa magia è in pila, i giocatori non possono lanciare magie o attivare abilità che non siano abilità di mana.)\\nDistruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Rinuncia a queste armi innaturali, queste pergamene. Il cuore, la mente e i pugni sono sufficienti."\\n—Zyd, druido di Kamahl\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'393b28fe-0002-4d0b-b6bf-5aaae9b7141c\', \'multiverseId\': 483813}, \'multiverseid\': 483813}, {\'name\': \'クローサの掌握\', \'text\': \'刹那（この呪文がスタック上にあるかぎり、プレイヤーは呪文を唱えられず、マナ能力でない起動型能力を起動できない。）\\nアーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自然に反する武器や巻物など手放しなさい。心臓と心と拳で十分ではありませんか。」\\n――カマール教のドルイド、ジド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bca662b-e413-44b4-9a70-8f7699278972\', \'multiverseId\': 484064}, \'multiverseid\': 484064}, {\'name\': \'Garra Krosana\', \'text\': \'Fração de segundo (Enquanto esta mágica estiver na pilha, os jogadores não poderão conjurar mágicas ou ativar habilidades que não sejam habilidades de mana.)\\nDestrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Desista dessas armas artificiais, desses pergaminhos. O coração, a mente e o punho bastam."\\n— Zyd, druida kamahliano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a638992-e56d-4c9c-adbe-cf30eef7cf98\', \'multiverseId\': 484315}, \'multiverseid\': 484315}, {\'name\': \'Кросанская Хватка\', \'text\': \'Мгновение ока (Пока это заклинание находится в стеке, игроки не могут разыгрывать заклинания или активировать способности, которые не являются мана-способностями.)\\nУничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Откажитесь от этого неестественного оружия, от этих свитков. Вам хватит сердца, разума и кулаков».\\n— Зид, друид Камаля\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40bb0fb4-74c9-41ac-8c83-ec6b0e38412b\', \'multiverseId\': 484566}, \'multiverseid\': 484566}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483164&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c450b0-7043-4385-8563-709b153184fa\', \'multiverseId\': 483164}, \'multiverseid\': 483164}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y una carta de Llanura, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d4151b-3e58-4c5b-afbd-134d28ae8dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 483415}, \'multiverseid\': 483415}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5077b97-54d0-4f58-ab4f-355f35d9f4cb\', \'multiverseId\': 483666}, \'multiverseid\': 483666}, {\'name\': \'Confine di Krosa\', \'text\': \'Il Confine di Krosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Confine di Krosa: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e una carta Pianura, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16246402-f3b4-4a9b-86cc-c1a9bf695f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 483917}, \'multiverseid\': 483917}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab09c05e-4b38-49d5-b5d0-9e104fb11c05\', \'multiverseId\': 484168}, \'multiverseid\': 484168}, {\'name\': \'Orla Krosana\', \'text\': \'Orla Krosana entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Orla Krosana: Procure um card de Floresta e um de Planície em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f4090f-d337-4d6f-abd8-5235081101d8\', \'multiverseId\': 484419}, \'multiverseid\': 484419}, {\'name\': \'Край Кросанского Леса\', \'text\': \'Край Кросанского Леса выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Край Кросанского Леса: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Леса и карту Равнины, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbf48ee0-5523-4c0d-9055-f98574a06042\', \'multiverseId\': 484670}, \'multiverseid\': 484670}]', "[{'name': 'Kryptischer Trilobit', 'text': 'Der Kryptische Trilobit kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nEntferne eine +1/+1-Marke vom Kryptischen Trilobiten: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Fähigkeiten zu aktivieren.\\n{1}, {T}: lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Kryptischen Trilobiten.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Trilobit', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484919&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5aed721-b0a5-4a01-a748-9d4b4291500f', 'multiverseId': 484919}, 'multiverseid': 484919}, {'name': 'Trilobites críptico', 'text': 'El Trilobites críptico entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\\nRemover un contador +1/+1 del Trilobites críptico: Agrega {C}{C}. Usa este maná solo para activar habilidades.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Trilobites críptico.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trilobites', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484970&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9092e12-0192-43f5-b3af-d5a7725c9ff7', 'multiverseId': 484970}, 'multiverseid': 484970}, {'name': 'Trilobite cryptique', 'text': 'Le Trilobite cryptique arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\nRetirez un marqueur +1/+1 du Trilobite cryptique : Ajoutez {C}{C}. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour activer des capacités.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Trilobite cryptique.', 'type': 'Créature : trilobite', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485021&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72499bb0-701d-4a00-a393-985baced37ba', 'multiverseId': 485021}, 'multiverseid': 485021}, {'name': 'Trilobite Criptica', 'text': 'La Trilobite Criptica entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nRimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 dalla Trilobite Criptica: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Spendi questo mana solo per attivare abilità.\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Trilobite Criptica.', 'type': 'Creatura — Trilobite', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485072&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb45b1cb-a99a-4fbe-b85e-e65f73cef532', 'multiverseId': 485072}, 'multiverseid': 485072}, {'name': '謎めいた三葉虫', 'text': '謎めいた三葉虫は、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n謎めいた三葉虫の上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く：{C}{C}を加える。このマナは、能力を起動するためにのみ使用できる。\\n{1}, {T}：謎めいた三葉虫の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 三葉虫', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485123&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5af042e0-4991-44f7-af08-7bc7c96f6599', 'multiverseId': 485123}, 'multiverseid': 485123}, {'name': 'Trilobita Críptica', 'text': 'Trilobita Críptica entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nRemova um marcador +1/+1 de Trilobita Críptica: Adicione {C}{C}. Gaste este mana somente para ativar habilidades.\\n{1}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Trilobita Críptica.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trilobita', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485174&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '81e74625-2d98-4c54-a927-7840c2333b49', 'multiverseId': 485174}, 'multiverseid': 485174}, {'name': 'Загадочный Трилобит', 'text': 'Загадочный Трилобит выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами +1/+1 на нем.\\nУдалите один жетон +1/+1 с Загадочного Трилобита: добавьте {C}{C}. Тратьте эту ману только на активацию способностей.\\n{1}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Загадочного Трилобита.', 'type': 'Существо — Трилобит', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485225&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74fcd720-3429-42c9-a02f-9bde02c15ec1', 'multiverseId': 485225}, 'multiverseid': 485225}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel und nimm die andere auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1053dd2a-e472-42cb-b9bb-ede03610c9ba\', \'multiverseId\': 483049}, \'multiverseid\': 483049}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5edcbbeb-dce8-4cdb-8467-9edc698c3994\', \'multiverseId\': 483300}, \'multiverseid\': 483300}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes et mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée, et l\'autre dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483551&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58753b4c-f866-41bd-9351-f3144508da5b\', \'multiverseId\': 483551}, \'multiverseid\': 483551}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'115a1500-6a61-454f-abe0-c3dd3ef2d513\', \'multiverseId\': 483802}, \'multiverseid\': 483802}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、他をあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ca884f-8c65-4094-bf2d-47e538fc1fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 484053}, \'multiverseid\': 484053}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as sementes possuem um elo em comum que as une através da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07e27f9-46f0-4759-a697-8e1f8081343c\', \'multiverseId\': 484304}, \'multiverseid\': 484304}, {\'name\': \'Культивировать\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, покажите те карты и положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а другую — в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все семена связаны прочными узами, взывая друг к другу через бесконечность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed39375d-c65b-40f6-8c80-d018527c6dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 484555}, \'multiverseid\': 484555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kurator der Mysterien\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine andere Karte umwandelst oder abwirfst, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Sphinx um Rat zu bitten, ist eine Frage der Geduld. Vielleicht ist das auch die einzige Frage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79813907-3a9d-4a64-9b2f-9173ec20d0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 482988}, \'multiverseid\': 482988}, {\'name\': \'Custodio de misterios\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo o descartes otra carta, adivina 1.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Consultar a una esfinge es una prueba de paciencia. Quizás de eso se trata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61e65928-e4b5-41d8-9fb2-c38c71b8d449\', \'multiverseId\': 483239}, \'multiverseid\': 483239}, {\'name\': \'Conservateur de mystères\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous recyclez ou vous défaussez d\'une autre carte, regard 1.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Consulter un sphinx met la patience à l\'épreuve. C\'est peut-être là l\'intérêt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483490&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'349d9fe8-a0aa-498f-95fc-f0a4f4a8e969\', \'multiverseId\': 483490}, \'multiverseid\': 483490}, {\'name\': \'Sovrintendente dei Misteri\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta cicli o scarti un\'altra carta, profetizza 1.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Chiedere consiglio a una sfinge significa mettere alla prova la propria pazienza. Forse è proprio questo il punto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f70698c-ea37-4626-979a-27b07e610f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 483741}, \'multiverseid\': 483741}, {\'name\': \'秘法の管理者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたが他のカードを１枚サイクリングするか捨てるたび、占術１を行う。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'スフィンクスに物事を尋ねるには忍耐がいる。恐らくそれが重要なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0bb541-a52d-4434-97a6-f7c7251113ab\', \'multiverseId\': 483992}, \'multiverseid\': 483992}, {\'name\': \'Curador de Mistérios\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você reciclar ou descartar outro card, use vidência 1.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Consultar uma esfinge é um teste de paciência. Talvez seja essa a ideia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc792e1e-fd16-42a9-bd70-c218c399349b\', \'multiverseId\': 484243}, \'multiverseid\': 484243}, {\'name\': \'Хранитель Загадок\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл другой карты или сбрасываете другую карту, предскажите 1.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': \'Обратиться за советом к сфинксу — настоящее испытание терпения. Может быть, в этом и есть суть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f552f652-2921-4884-8549-6284636f50b3\', \'multiverseId\': 484494}, \'multiverseid\': 484494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lauernde Illusion\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn der Lauernden Illusion Schaden zugefügt wird, ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Illusion\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie labt sich an Gewalt. Füttern auf eigene Gefahr."\\n—Doriel, Mentor der Mistralinsel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96daaf66-a884-4bfc-9f57-20d9bad322b4\', \'multiverseId\': 482992}, \'multiverseid\': 482992}, {\'name\': \'Emboscador ilusorio\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que el Emboscador ilusorio reciba daño, roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Suplica por recibir violencia como alimento. Dásela si te atreves".\\n—Doriel, mentor de la Isla Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa5e2b30-f9c5-4f97-bce3-b7635b865cb7\', \'multiverseId\': 483243}, \'multiverseid\': 483243}, {\'name\': \'Embusqueur illusoire\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Embusqueur illusoire subit des blessures, piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et illusion\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'a d\'appétit que pour la violence. Nourrissez-le si vous osez. »\\n—Doriel, mentor de l\'Île de Mistral", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c5fa441-4a6a-4733-afdd-060080495b4f\', \'multiverseId\': 483494}, \'multiverseid\': 483494}, {\'name\': \'Assalitore Illusorio\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno all\'Assalitore Illusorio, pesca altrettante carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"La violenza è il cibo che brama. Sfamalo a tuo rischio e pericolo."\\n—Doriel, mentore dell\\\'Isola del Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a81a152-4a2f-42cb-97d9-57a057be7e96\', \'multiverseId\': 483745}, \'multiverseid\': 483745}, {\'name\': \'錯覚の伏兵\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n錯覚の伏兵がダメージを受けるたび、その点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': \'「それが求める餌とは暴力である。その覚悟があるのなら、与えてみるがよい。」\\n――北風島の導師、ドリエル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3433ef50-bc04-4deb-bc62-a09e0a418395\', \'multiverseId\': 483996}, \'multiverseid\': 483996}, {\'name\': \'Emboscador Ilusório\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nToda vez que Emboscador Ilusório sofrer dano, compre aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Ilusão\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele tem fome de violência. Alimente-o se tiver coragem."\\n— Doriel, mentor da Ilha Mistral\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ed864a-4599-47cf-9367-1d9aef0e46a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484247}, \'multiverseid\': 484247}, {\'name\': \'Иллюзорный Охотник\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКаждый раз, когда Иллюзорному Охотнику наносятся повреждения, возьмите такое же количество карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Иллюзия\', \'flavor\': \'«Насилие — это пища, которой он жаждет. Накорми его, если посмеешь».\\n— Дориел, наставник с острова Мистраль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a1292d-684c-4726-9756-3506dff49234\', \'multiverseId\': 484498}, \'multiverseid\': 484498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Launenhafter Chemister\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Ziehe zwei Karten.\\n{R}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Der Launenhafte Chemister fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die umgewandelten Manakosten der abgeworfenen Karte betragen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Was manche für Unaufmerksamkeit halten, ist in Wirklichkeit das Ergründen des Unergründlichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483100&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11702d47-78d2-49f2-ba38-7a89b9de7526\', \'multiverseId\': 483100}, \'multiverseid\': 483100}, {\'name\': \'Quimista mercurial\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Roba dos cartas.\\n{R}, {T}, descartar una carta: El Quimista mercurial hace una cantidad de daño a la criatura objetivo igual al coste de maná convertido de la carta descartada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Lo que algunos ven como "distracción" es en realidad "comprensión de lo incomprensible".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b3b12e-67f1-4644-8071-0ef27c31f874\', \'multiverseId\': 483351}, \'multiverseid\': 483351}, {\'name\': \'Chimiste lunatique\', \'text\': "{U}, {T} : Piochez deux cartes.\\n{R}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Le Chimiste lunatique inflige à une créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de la carte défaussée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Certains le jugent distrait, alors qu\'en réalité il est en train de concevoir l\'inconcevable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483602&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f8a923-bc5d-4816-b1de-f1365c6ba879\', \'multiverseId\': 483602}, \'multiverseid\': 483602}, {\'name\': \'Chimimago Incostante\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Pesca due carte.\\n{R}, {T}, Scarta una carta: Il Chimimago Incostante infligge danno pari al costo di mana convertito della carta scartata a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': "Sembra distratto, ma in realtà sta decifrando l\'indecifrabile tra sé e sé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e390fd-4b7c-4eac-bb80-28c2f0c52a33\', \'multiverseId\': 483853}, \'multiverseid\': 483853}, {\'name\': \'気紛れな薬術師\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}：カードを２枚引く。\\n{R}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。気紛れな薬術師はそれに、その捨てたカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ある者には「ぼんやりしている」と見えるだろうが、実は「はかり知れぬ深淵を探っている」のだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa895c73-2a72-4402-b257-3945e6aa9712\', \'multiverseId\': 484104}, \'multiverseid\': 484104}, {\'name\': \'Quimiomante Volátil\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Compre dois cards.\\n{R}, {T}, descarte um card: Quimiomante Volátil causa dano à criatura alvo igual ao custo de mana convertido do card descartado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Ele parece distraído, mas na verdade está sondando o insondável.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'807fde07-2882-4acf-ac1d-29948f7d83aa\', \'multiverseId\': 484355}, \'multiverseid\': 484355}, {\'name\': \'Эксцентричный Химик\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: возьмите две карты.\\n{R}, {T}, сбросьте карту: Эксцентричный Химик наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные конвертированной мана-стоимости сброшенной карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'То, что некоторые считают сумасшествием, на самом деле есть попытка объять необъятное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dddf6b0-847b-4e72-a3b8-d73d019b74c7\', \'multiverseId\': 484606}, \'multiverseid\': 484606}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavagrund-Schleusentor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}{R}.\\nZu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Spielers kann jener Spieler eine Verdammnismarke auf das Lavagrund-Schleusentor legen oder eine von ihm entfernen. Falls dann drei oder mehr Verdammnismarken auf ihm liegen, opfere das Lavagrund-Schleusentor. Wenn du dies tust, fügt es jeder Kreatur 6 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a519b3f-ddba-4cf7-90a5-eaa649fc85ca\', \'multiverseId\': 484951}, \'multiverseid\': 484951}, {\'name\': \'Esclusas de Bordelava\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}{R}.\\nAl comienzo del mantenimiento de cada jugador, ese jugador puede poner un contador de perdición sobre las Esclusas de Bordelava o remover un contador de perdición que tengan. Luego, si tienen tres o más contadores de perdición sobre ellas, sacrifica las Esclusas de Bordelava. Cuando lo hagas, hacen 6 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c971ccd1-bfc3-4069-bdd7-27758ad218a7\', \'multiverseId\': 485002}, \'multiverseid\': 485002}, {\'name\': \'Vannes de Bourg-sur-Lave\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}{R}.\\nAu début de l\'entretien de chaque joueur, ce joueur peut mettre un marqueur « fatalité » sur les Vannes de Bourg-sur-Lave ou leur retirer un marqueur « fatalité ». Ensuite, si elles ont au moins trois marqueurs « fatalité » sur elles, sacrifiez les Vannes de Bourg-sur-Lave. Quand vous faites ainsi, elles infligent 6 blessures à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f6dff0a-2026-4f75-8870-ddf03f5a4e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 485053}, \'multiverseid\': 485053}, {\'name\': \'Chiuse di Lavariva\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {R}{R}.\\nAll\'inizio del mantenimento di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore può mettere un segnalino destino sulle Chiuse di Lavariva o rimuovere un segnalino destino da esse. Poi, se hanno tre o più segnalini destino, sacrifica le Chiuse di Lavariva. Quando lo fai, infliggono 6 danni a ogni creatura.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e259e67b-438d-4e13-92d7-6348b40c6d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 485104}, \'multiverseid\': 485104}, {\'name\': \'ラバブリンクの防潮門\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}{R}を加える。\\n各プレイヤーのアップキープの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはラバブリンクの防潮門の上に破滅カウンターを１個置くか、これの上から破滅カウンターを１個取り除くか、いずれかを行ってもよい。その後、これの上に破滅カウンターが３個以上置かれていたなら、ラバブリンクの防潮門を生け贄に捧げる。そうしたとき、これは各クリーチャーにそれぞれ６点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ebd6309-a9d3-49a6-866c-bab8864d8720\', \'multiverseId\': 485155}, \'multiverseid\': 485155}, {\'name\': \'Comportas de Beiralava\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {R}{R}.\\nNo início da manutenção de cada jogador, aquele jogador pode colocar um marcador de perdição em Comportas de Beiralava ou remover um marcador de perdição dela. Em seguida, se ela tiver três ou mais marcadores de perdição, sacrifique Comportas de Beiralava. Quando você faz isso, ela causa 6 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb90b2ce-cb7b-483b-b9d1-1026e95aa8e6\', \'multiverseId\': 485206}, \'multiverseid\': 485206}, {\'name\': \'Шлюзы Лавобрега\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {R}{R}.\\nВ начале шага поддержки каждого игрока тот игрок может положить один жетон погибели на Шлюзы Лавобрега или удалить с них один жетон погибели. Затем, если на Шлюзах Лавобрега есть три или более жетонов погибели, пожертвуйте Шлюзы Лавобрега. Когда вы это делаете, они наносят 6 повреждений каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2903f9a2-ca95-4b37-b9c0-a8c108d6f25f\', \'multiverseId\': 485257}, \'multiverseid\': 485257}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebenskraft-Jäger\', \'text\': \'Lebensverknüpfung\\n{X}{W}{W}: Monstrum X. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nWenn der Lebenskraft-Jäger monströs wird, lege je eine Lebensverknüpfung-Marke auf bis zu X Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484928&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60307364-20c8-4d62-baae-4607cdeae4c1\', \'multiverseId\': 484928}, \'multiverseid\': 484928}, {\'name\': \'Cazador de vitalidad\', \'text\': \'Vínculo vital.\\n{X}{W}{W}: Monstruosidad X. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nCuando el Cazador de vitalidad se convierte en monstruoso, elige hasta X criaturas objetivo y pon un contador de vínculo vital sobre cada una.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a75e57d6-7592-48bb-8f8d-933e8087431b\', \'multiverseId\': 484979}, \'multiverseid\': 484979}, {\'name\': \'Chasseur de vitalité\', \'text\': "Lien de vie\\n{X}{W}{W} : Monstruosité X. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nQuand le Chasseur de vitalité devient monstrueux, mettez un marqueur « lien de vie » sur jusqu\'à X créatures ciblées.", \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'988b880a-39b6-4568-b7e1-11e5ccd388d7\', \'multiverseId\': 485030}, \'multiverseid\': 485030}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore di Vitalità\', \'text\': \'Legame vitale\\n{X}{W}{W}: Mostruosità X. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nQuando il Cacciatore di Vitalità diventa mostruoso, metti un segnalino legame vitale su ciascuna creatura bersaglio fino a un massimo di X.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d211478-ac45-4eee-819d-ad7bb720a277\', \'multiverseId\': 485081}, \'multiverseid\': 485081}, {\'name\': \'生命力の狩人\', \'text\': \'絆魂\\n{X}{W}{W}：怪物化Ｘを行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n生命力の狩人が怪物的になったとき、クリーチャー最大Ｘ体を対象とし、それらの上に絆魂カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7ddf19-6209-4854-9e17-62b6df27e58d\', \'multiverseId\': 485132}, \'multiverseid\': 485132}, {\'name\': \'Caçador de Vitalidade\', \'text\': \'Vínculo com a vida\\n{X}{W}{W}: Monstruosidade X. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nQuando Caçador de Vitalidade se tornar monstruoso, coloque um marcador de vínculo com a vida em cada uma de até X criaturas alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'149d5e9d-8c4a-4ddb-b19b-7fdf38db9dd4\', \'multiverseId\': 485183}, \'multiverseid\': 485183}, {\'name\': \'Охотник Жизненной Силы\', \'text\': \'Цепь жизни\\n{X}{W}{W}: Чудовищность X. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него X жетонов +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nКогда Охотник Жизненной Силы становится чудовищным, положите один жетон Цепи жизни на каждое из не более X целевых существ.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошмар\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594c318d-cb2c-41e1-803c-f260f6d8b7e8\', \'multiverseId\': 485234}, \'multiverseid\': 485234}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leidenschaftlicher Schutz\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jage irgendwo anders. Das ist deine einzige Warnung."\\n—Gavi die Nesthüterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'296e1ae5-9ff2-4ab7-9e8b-4b147e7c9915\', \'multiverseId\': 484933}, \'multiverseid\': 484933}, {\'name\': \'Custodia feroz\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Caza en otro lugar. Es mi última advertencia".\\n—Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbb03a5-30b1-4b4f-9074-667c5609ce2d\', \'multiverseId\': 484984}, \'multiverseid\': 484984}, {\'name\': \'Tutelle féroce\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nContrecarrez le sort non-créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Allez chasser ailleurs. Ce sera votre seul avertissement. »\\n—Gavi, garde du nid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9c28dfd-88f6-4772-9b49-6c441dcee20c\', \'multiverseId\': 485035}, \'multiverseid\': 485035}, {\'name\': \'Protezione Feroce\', \'text\': \'Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nNeutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Trovati un altro terreno di caccia. Non ci saranno altri avvertimenti."\\n—Gavi, guardiana del nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61089ba0-fe54-474b-81f5-fe4e35710383\', \'multiverseId\': 485086}, \'multiverseid\': 485086}, {\'name\': \'激情の後見\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「狩りは他の場所でやりなさい。警告は一度だけよ。」\\n――巣守り、ガヴィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99d556ed-4724-4605-bebd-3741a574277f\', \'multiverseId\': 485137}, \'multiverseid\': 485137}, {\'name\': \'Tutela Feroz\', \'text\': \'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nAnule a mágica alvo que não seja de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vá caçar em outro lugar. Este será o único aviso."\\n— Gavi, guardiã do ninho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'300dfb7b-8378-41c6-83c4-028136dbeb25\', \'multiverseId\': 485188}, \'multiverseid\': 485188}, {\'name\': \'Яростная Защита\', \'text\': \'Если у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете разыграть это заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\\nОтмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Охоться где-нибудь в другом месте. Это первое и последнее предупреждение».\\n— Гави, охранница гнезда\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e345bdd8-5092-430d-bb3d-74c75c61f6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 485239}, \'multiverseid\': 485239}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lichtungsmuse\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch wirkt und falls es nicht sein Zug ist, zieht der Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'„Wut kann auf der ganzen Welt gehört werden, aber Weisheit kommt still und leise."\\n—Rielle die Allwissende\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a20b6b-d692-4955-b868-8817bb26c9c2\', \'multiverseId\': 484958}, \'multiverseid\': 484958}, {\'name\': \'Musa del claro\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo, si no es su turno, ese jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"La rabia se puede oír por todo el mundo, pero la sabiduría solo con susurros".\\n—Rielle, la Versada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf9312e2-9768-4d39-904b-896f6b187f6e\', \'multiverseId\': 485009}, \'multiverseid\': 485009}, {\'name\': \'Contemplateur des clairières\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort, si ce n\'est pas son tour, ce joueur pioche une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "« La rage résonne jusqu\'aux confins du monde, mais la sagesse n\'est qu\'un murmure. »\\n—Rielle, l\'éternisciente", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e86885-2f36-45b4-a8f1-82e1ac1ab8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 485060}, \'multiverseid\': 485060}, {\'name\': \'Musa della Radura\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia, se non è il suo turno, quel giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'"La rabbia riecheggia in ogni angolo del mondo, ma la saggezza è da ricercare nei sussurri."\\n—Rielle, l\\\'Onnisapiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880de51d-f983-4394-885d-38464772d0ae\', \'multiverseId\': 485111}, \'multiverseid\': 485111}, {\'name\': \'林間の才獣\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーが呪文を唱えるたび、それがそのプレイヤーのターンでない場合、そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'「怒りは世界中に響き渡っているが、智恵は囁きが運んで来る。」\\n――常智のリエール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07aca84a-5f31-4217-a873-c97f8fe4ef30\', \'multiverseId\': 485162}, \'multiverseid\': 485162}, {\'name\': \'Musa da Clareira\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica, se não for no próprio turno, aquele jogador compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'"A fúria se faz ouvir pelo mundo inteiro, mas a sabedoria vem num sussurro."\\n— Rielle, a Onissapiente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf06032-ddef-4c93-8db3-1a2aac1b44fd\', \'multiverseId\': 485213}, \'multiverseid\': 485213}, {\'name\': \'Мудрец Опушек\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает заклинание, если идет не его ход, то тот игрок берет карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'«Голос ярости можно услышать на другом конце света, мудрость же говорит шепотом».\\n— Риэлль, Вечномудрая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec6c91d-051e-461a-bd38-2d0b6480bc12\', \'multiverseId\': 485264}, \'multiverseid\': 485264}]', "[{'name': 'Llanowar-Ödland', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Das Llanowar-Ödland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483165&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8ecff4c-94e0-4a47-a0cc-61e4d60052fc', 'multiverseId': 483165}, 'multiverseid': 483165}, {'name': 'Yermos de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Los Yermos de Llanowar te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483416&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f116480-4cf5-4ef2-86cc-91bc603b4af2', 'multiverseId': 483416}, 'multiverseid': 483416}, {'name': 'Landes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Les Landes de Llanowar vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483667&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aceb4d1e-9c5e-4e97-b710-4b3a05be3ab6', 'multiverseId': 483667}, 'multiverseid': 483667}, {'name': 'Distese di Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}. Le Distese di Llanowar ti infliggono 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483918&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17c3c038-b81b-4caa-bd79-638af32c183e', 'multiverseId': 483918}, 'multiverseid': 483918}, {'name': 'ラノワールの荒原', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。ラノワールの荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484169&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e256fcb-cafb-4968-aef0-3a91671c5bc9', 'multiverseId': 484169}, 'multiverseid': 484169}, {'name': 'Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}. Regiões Agrestes de Llanowar causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484420&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cbb77a2-0a82-4e09-9fd4-8ca5a5d47f15', 'multiverseId': 484420}, 'multiverseid': 484420}, {'name': 'Лановарские Пустоши', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}. Лановарские Пустоши наносят вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484671&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ba26fab-56f6-4aa5-a19c-cb8cbea8b947', 'multiverseId': 484671}, 'multiverseid': 484671}]", '[{\'name\': \'Lockvogel-Gambit\', \'text\': \'Bestimme für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert, und bringe die Kreatur dann auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher lässt dich eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir werden sie ablenken. Der Rest von euch: Raus hier!"\\n—Alux, Himmelstadt-Verteidiger\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e57a7ce-a44d-4a0c-a33f-62da6f1c4901\', \'multiverseId\': 484930}, \'multiverseid\': 484930}, {\'name\': \'Táctica de señuelo\', \'text\': \'Por cada oponente, elige hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador, luego regresa esa criatura a la mano de su propietario a menos que su controlador te haga robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los distraeremos. ¡Los demás deben irse de aquí!"\\n—Álux, defensor de Puertoaéreo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8748a586-e4c0-461d-a7f3-5562518dd4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 484981}, \'multiverseid\': 484981}, {\'name\': \'Pari leurreur\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, choisissez jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle, puis renvoyez cette créature dans la main de son propriétaire à moins que son contrôleur ne vous fasse piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« On va faire diversion. Vous autres, allez-vous-en ! »\\n—Alux, défenseur de Vogueciel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485032&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105f363e-f263-4ac1-b9ce-f57aa583c666\', \'multiverseId\': 485032}, \'multiverseid\': 485032}, {\'name\': \'Stratagemma Diversivo\', \'text\': \'Per ogni avversario, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore, poi fai tornare quella creatura in mano al suo proprietario a meno che il suo controllore non ti faccia pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Penseremo noi a distrarli. Voi andatevene da qui!"\\n—Alux, difensore della Solcanembi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d7dd70-fff8-466f-a662-fe7a20a30b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 485083}, \'multiverseid\': 485083}, {\'name\': \'おとりの計略\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手につき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それのコントローラーが「あなたはカードを１枚引く」を選ばないかぎり、そのクリーチャーをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我々が引きつける。残りは早く逃げろ！」\\n――スカイセイルの防衛者、アルックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbfab88d-c876-4622-90ca-1b19149a55ae\', \'multiverseId\': 485134}, \'multiverseid\': 485134}, {\'name\': \'Estratagema do Chamariz\', \'text\': \'Para cada oponente, escolha até uma criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla. Depois, devolva aquela criatura para a mão de seu dono, a menos que seu controlador faça com que você compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos distraí-los. Vocês, dêem o fora daqui!"\\n— Alux, defensor da Vela Celeste\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098aad27-e216-40f0-b7d5-1add6ba3afc3\', \'multiverseId\': 485185}, \'multiverseid\': 485185}, {\'name\': \'Обманная Уступка\', \'text\': \'За каждого оппонента выберите не более одного целевого существа под контролем того игрока, затем верните то существо в руку его владельца, если только контролирующий его игрок не заставит вас взять карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы их отвлечем. А вы выбирайтесь отсюда».\\n— Алукс, защитник Небесного Паруса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8fd2430-9705-4a64-8892-b0b86d77ade4\', \'multiverseId\': 485236}, \'multiverseid\': 485236}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus der Scheibe\', \'text\': \'Der Magus der Scheibe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{1}, {T}: Zerstöre alle Artefakte, Kreaturen und Verzauberungen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Die Lektüre der Tagebücher des Nekromagiers Nevinyrral hinterlässt in seinen Jüngern den Drang, seine drakonischen Strafmaßnahmen durchzuführen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'240b00fa-8078-408c-9d1e-73c66fcfe22c\', \'multiverseId\': 482973}, \'multiverseid\': 482973}, {\'name\': \'Mago del disco\', \'text\': \'El Mago del disco entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{1}, {T}: Destruye todos los artefactos, criaturas y encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Estudiar el diario del nigromante Nevinyrral deja a los discípulos llenos de la urgencia de ejercitar su juicio draconiano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de6fc617-f893-4b7d-b496-0929bcbd24e8\', \'multiverseId\': 483224}, \'multiverseid\': 483224}, {\'name\': \'Mage du Disque\', \'text\': \'Le Mage du Disque arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{1}, {T} : Détruisez tous les artefacts, toutes les créatures et tous les enchantements.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "L\'étude des journaux du nécromage Nevinyrral laisse les disciples en proie à l\'envie irrésistible d\'exercer son jugement draconien.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3175e13c-6cfb-4100-a6ca-04fa5fa574c4\', \'multiverseId\': 483475}, \'multiverseid\': 483475}, {\'name\': \'Magus del Disco\', \'text\': \'Il Magus del Disco entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{1}, {T}: Distruggi tutti gli artefatti, le creature e gli incantesimi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': "Studiare i diari del necromagio Nevinyrral lascia i discepoli in preda all\'impulso di applicare la sua punizione draconiana.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'572b6953-2bb4-47ca-b265-f33ef70d039a\', \'multiverseId\': 483726}, \'multiverseid\': 483726}, {\'name\': \'円盤の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'円盤の大魔術師はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{1}, {T}：アーティファクトとクリーチャーとエンチャントをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'屍道士ネビニラルの日誌を学ぶことで、信奉者達は彼の過酷な審判の実行に駆り立てられていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'156637e7-0c2e-4def-b350-57493b25ee5c\', \'multiverseId\': 483977}, \'multiverseid\': 483977}, {\'name\': \'Magus do Disco\', \'text\': \'Magus do Disco entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{1}, {T}: Destrua todos os artefatos, criaturas e encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Estudar os diários do necromago Nevinyrral deixa seus discípulos ansiosos por exercitar seu julgamento draconiano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f854621b-345b-41c4-a785-8c95b5152e42\', \'multiverseId\': 484228}, \'multiverseid\': 484228}, {\'name\': \'Волхв Диска\', \'text\': \'Волхв Диска выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{1}, {T}: уничтожьте все артефакты, существа и чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Изучение дневников некромага Невиниррала вызывает у учеников неодолимое желание осуществить его безжалостное правосудие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3dfe404-ca86-4a90-9feb-00c4b0f3b0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 484479}, \'multiverseid\': 484479}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magus des Rads\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, opfere den Magus des Rads: Jeder Spieler wirft alle Karten aus seiner Hand ab und zieht dann sieben Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Schicksal ist nicht so vorherbestimmt, wie man glauben mag."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483035&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5d21329-adb7-4246-bd5d-80fa3cf000e5\', \'multiverseId\': 483035}, \'multiverseid\': 483035}, {\'name\': \'Mago de la rueda\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Mago de la rueda: Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba siete cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El destino no es tan inmutable como te pudieses imaginar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8f55fb-a9fd-4b82-9f57-4988948e992c\', \'multiverseId\': 483286}, \'multiverseid\': 483286}, {\'name\': \'Mage de la Roue\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez le Mage de la Roue : Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis pioche sept cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le destin est moins inflexible que vous ne le pensez. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed2bd20-ef35-4b6e-81f4-b00b1e16ee43\', \'multiverseId\': 483537}, \'multiverseid\': 483537}, {\'name\': \'Magus della Ruota\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica il Magus della Ruota: Ogni giocatore scarta la propria mano, poi pesca sette carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il destino non è immutabile come credi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81fd4b0-9467-4c26-92e1-b59698f757f2\', \'multiverseId\': 483788}, \'multiverseid\': 483788}, {\'name\': \'輪の大魔術師\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, 輪の大魔術師を生け贄に捧げる：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後カードを７枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「運命とは、あなたが考えているほど定まっているものではないのですよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22ea383f-8766-4071-9aa5-223424f537e7\', \'multiverseId\': 484039}, \'multiverseid\': 484039}, {\'name\': \'Magus da Roda\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Magus da Roda: Cada jogador descarta a própria mão e depois compra sete cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O destino não é tão estático quanto você pode imaginar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cce6ff5-fdb3-4d9d-98ff-d4377d62fbab\', \'multiverseId\': 484290}, \'multiverseid\': 484290}, {\'name\': \'Волхв Колеса\', \'text\': \'{1}{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте Волхва Колеса: каждый игрок сбрасывает свою руку, затем берет семь карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Судьба вовсе не так неизменна, как ты мог бы подумать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ee2b9e8-7a2f-41db-9f4a-eee55dfde42c\', \'multiverseId\': 484541}, \'multiverseid\': 484541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Majestätischer Myriarch\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Majestätischen Myriarchen sind gleich der doppelten Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst.\\nZu Beginn jedes Kampfes erhält der Majestätische Myriarch Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du eine Kreatur mit Flugfähigkeit kontrollierst. Das Gleiche gilt für Bedrohlichkeit, Eile, Erstschlag, Doppelschlag, Fluchsicherheit, Lebensverknüpfung, Reichweite, Todesberührung, Unzerstörbarkeit, Wachsamkeit sowie das Verursachen von Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Chimäre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483061&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f91cac-e32d-44c4-9b50-99fd55319eea\', \'multiverseId\': 483061}, \'multiverseid\': 483061}, {\'name\': \'Miriarca majestuoso\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Miriarca majestuoso son iguales al doble de la cantidad de criaturas que controlas.\\nAl comienzo de cada combate, el Miriarca majestuoso gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno si controlas una criatura con la habilidad de volar. Lo mismo sucede con las habilidades de dañar primero, dañar dos veces, toque mortal, prisa, antimaleficio, indestructible, vínculo vital, amenaza, alcance, arrollar y vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e49be98e-1ee8-4429-b59e-78afab53be06\', \'multiverseId\': 483312}, \'multiverseid\': 483312}, {\'name\': \'Myriarque majestueux\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Myriarque majestueux sont chacune égales au double du nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nAu début de chaque combat, le Myriarque majestueux acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour si vous contrôlez une créature avec le vol. C\'est vrai aussi pour l\'initiative, la double initiative, le contact mortel, la célérité, la défense talismanique, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la menace, la portée, le piétinement et la vigilance.", \'type\': \'Créature : chimère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483563&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1545e0c2-b163-4945-b04c-5403eb857276\', \'multiverseId\': 483563}, \'multiverseid\': 483563}, {\'name\': \'Miriarca Maestoso\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione del Miriarca Maestoso sono pari al doppio del numero di creature che controlli.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni combattimento, il Miriarca Maestoso ha volare fino alla fine del turno se controlli una creatura con volare. Lo stesso vale per attacco improvviso, doppio attacco, tocco letale, rapidità, anti-malocchio, indistruttibile, legame vitale, minacciare, raggiungere, travolgere e cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Chimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9b12d6-8dbe-417f-9237-2934930824bf\', \'multiverseId\': 483814}, \'multiverseid\': 483814}, {\'name\': \'威厳ある万卒隊長\', \'text\': \'威厳ある万卒隊長のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの総数の２倍に等しい。\\n各戦闘の開始時に、あなたが、飛行を持つクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、ターン終了時まで、威厳ある万卒隊長は飛行を得る。先制攻撃、二段攻撃、接死、速攻、呪禁、破壊不能、絆魂、威迫、到達、トランプル、警戒についても同様である。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キマイラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bbfaabe-cc35-4c33-9966-e368a15a8423\', \'multiverseId\': 484065}, \'multiverseid\': 484065}, {\'name\': \'Miriarca Majestosa\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Miriarca Majestosa são ambos iguais ao dobro do número de criaturas que você controla.\\nNo início de cada combate, Miriarca Majestosa ganha voar até o final do turno se você controla uma criatura com voar. O mesmo vale para iniciativa, golpe duplo, toque mortífero, ímpeto, resistência a magia, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, ameaçar, alcance, atropelar e vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda5572a-a74b-4039-8de9-387b80a58c46\', \'multiverseId\': 484316}, \'multiverseid\': 484316}, {\'name\': \'Величественный Мириарх\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Величественного Мириарха равны удвоенному количеству существ под вашим контролем.\\nВ начале каждого боя Величественный Мириарх получает Полет до конца хода, если вы контролируете существо с Полетом. То же самое относится к Бдительности, Двойному удару, Захвату, Неразрушимости, Первому удару, Порчеустойчивости, Пробивному удару, Смертельному касанию, Угрозе, Ускорению и Цепи жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Химера\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3110d503-97f7-499c-a6f6-720869d3deb2\', \'multiverseId\': 484567}, \'multiverseid\': 484567}]', '[{\'name\': \'Manarefraktor\', \'text\': \'Der Manarefraktor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nDer Manarefraktor hat alle aktivierten Fähigkeiten aller Länder im Spiel.\\nUm die Aktivierungskosten von Fähigkeiten des Manarefraktors zu bezahlen, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana beliebiger Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb9b0902-3e55-442f-8e32-88e9ad8634b7\', \'multiverseId\': 484966}, \'multiverseid\': 484966}, {\'name\': \'Refractor del manaisaje\', \'text\': \'El Refractor del manaisaje entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEl Refractor del manaisaje tiene todas las habilidades activadas de todas las tierras en el campo de batalla.\\nPuedes usar maná como si fuese maná de cualquier color para pagar los costes de activación de las habilidades del Refractor del manaisaje.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b121f25-1b2d-46be-a8bf-c2acaf230163\', \'multiverseId\': 485017}, \'multiverseid\': 485017}, {\'name\': \'Réfracteur de panoramana\', \'text\': "Le Réfracteur de panoramana arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nLe Réfracteur de panoramana a toutes les capacités activées de tous les terrains sur le champ de bataille.\\nVous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour payer les coûts d\'activation des capacités du Réfracteur de panoramana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485068&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f6265a-eb34-4b35-9a00-8e6ade54ad98\', \'multiverseId\': 485068}, \'multiverseid\': 485068}, {\'name\': \'Rifrattore del Manarama\', \'text\': \'Il Rifrattore del Manarama entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nIl Rifrattore del Manarama ha tutte le abilità attivate di tutte le terre sul campo di battaglia.\\nPuoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per pagare i costi di attivazione delle abilità del Rifrattore del Manarama.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a248b6-11e4-4a94-83ee-510d8e337e38\', \'multiverseId\': 485119}, \'multiverseid\': 485119}, {\'name\': \'魔力景の屈折体\', \'text\': \'魔力景の屈折体はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n魔力景の屈折体は、戦場にある土地すべての起動型能力をすべて持つ。\\nあなたは魔力景の屈折体の能力の起動コストを支払うために、マナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3c3e69-e413-4907-89ce-c55f709bc95a\', \'multiverseId\': 485170}, \'multiverseid\': 485170}, {\'name\': \'Refrator do Manorama\', \'text\': \'Refrator do Manorama entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nRefrator do Manorama tem todas as habilidades ativadas de todos os terrenos no campo de batalha.\\nVocê pode utilizar mana como se fosse mana de qualquer cor para pagar os custos de ativação das habilidades de Refrator do Manorama.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31e3697-de00-4975-bf7d-c6f8d73a9e8c\', \'multiverseId\': 485221}, \'multiverseid\': 485221}, {\'name\': \'Рефрактор Манасвода\', \'text\': \'Рефрактор Манасвода выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nРефрактор Манасвода имеет все активируемые способности всех земель на поле битвы.\\nВы можете тратить ману на оплату стоимости активации способностей Рефрактора Манасвода, как будто это мана любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d187af06-6547-4087-aa7a-4fae8f141154\', \'multiverseId\': 485272}, \'multiverseid\': 485272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mannigfaltige Landschaft\', \'text\': \'Die Mannigfaltige Landschaft kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Mannigfaltige Landschaft: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, die einen Landtyp gemeinsam haben, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483171&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92af8159-c057-4c59-a6d7-7c35b373fe1d\', \'multiverseId\': 483171}, \'multiverseid\': 483171}, {\'name\': \'Paisaje infinito\', \'text\': \'El Paisaje infinito entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Paisaje infinito: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica que compartan un tipo de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1daab1ef-277a-4865-8485-31d3a51d1105\', \'multiverseId\': 483422}, \'multiverseid\': 483422}, {\'name\': \'Paysage myriadaire\', \'text\': "Le Paysage myriadaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Paysage myriadaire : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base qui partagent un type de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483673&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcc08fc-5ebd-4ce6-8501-7962464f069a\', \'multiverseId\': 483673}, \'multiverseid\': 483673}, {\'name\': \'Paesaggio delle Miriadi\', \'text\': \'Il Paesaggio delle Miriadi entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Paesaggio delle Miriadi: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base che condividono un tipo di terra, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f136d107-dd1b-42c5-8655-e220589b28ff\', \'multiverseId\': 483924}, \'multiverseid\': 483924}, {\'name\': \'無限地帯\', \'text\': \'無限地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 無限地帯を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから互いに共通の土地タイプを持つ基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d78b7b48-2f74-4528-8291-b384b85b042a\', \'multiverseId\': 484175}, \'multiverseid\': 484175}, {\'name\': \'Paisagem Infinita\', \'text\': \'Paisagem Infinita entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Paisagem Infinita: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico que compartilhem um tipo de terreno, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de62c0e-e5fb-423d-91d6-5daa8380d29b\', \'multiverseId\': 484426}, \'multiverseid\': 484426}, {\'name\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт\', \'text\': \'Многоликий Ландшафт выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Многоликий Ландшафт: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, у которых есть одинаковый тип земли, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cca19a4f-d4a0-43e0-9162-dd7758dbfff0\', \'multiverseId\': 484677}, \'multiverseid\': 484677}]', '[{\'name\': \'Melek, Paragon der Izzet\', \'text\': \'Die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst Spontanzauber und Hexereien oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei aus deiner Bibliothek wirkst, kopiere ihn bzw. sie. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Seltsamkeit, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483099&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f35644-9ce5-4f35-bf74-40841f324934\', \'multiverseId\': 483099}, \'multiverseid\': 483099}, {\'name\': \'Mélek, ejemplar ízzet\', \'text\': \'Juega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu biblioteca, cópialo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero extraño\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff8e972-4e71-4f85-9063-3c7eac9eb103\', \'multiverseId\': 483350}, \'multiverseid\': 483350}, {\'name\': "Melek, Parangon d\'Izzet", \'text\': "Jouez avec la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque révélée.\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre bibliothèque, copiez-le. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : anomalie et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483601&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc886c5f-18e8-4463-9b6e-6012e6351f46\', \'multiverseId\': 483601}, \'multiverseid\': 483601}, {\'name\': \'Melek, Archetipo Izzet\', \'text\': \'Gioca con la prima carta del tuo grimorio rivelata.\\nPuoi lanciare magie istantaneo e stregoneria dalla cima del tuo grimorio.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo grimorio, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Bizzarria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b8d61d-5447-4dce-971d-ca79a1732d43\', \'multiverseId\': 483852}, \'multiverseid\': 483852}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの模範、メーレク\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上からインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたのライブラリーからインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 奇魔・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84017d2f-f175-465b-b3a0-bc3345503b99\', \'multiverseId\': 484103}, \'multiverseid\': 484103}, {\'name\': \'Melek, Paradigma dos Izzet\', \'text\': \'Jogue com o card do topo de seu grimório revelado.\\nVocê pode conjurar mágicas instantâneas e feitiços do topo de seu grimório.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço de seu grimório, faça uma cópia deste. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Bizarro Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894af7ad-05cd-40c5-97af-57c687b759ec\', \'multiverseId\': 484354}, \'multiverseid\': 484354}, {\'name\': \'Мелек, Эталон Иззетов\', \'text\': \'Играйте с открытой верхней картой вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания и заклинания волшебства с верха вашей библиотеки.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства из вашей библиотеки, скопируйте его. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Диковина Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be256550-b57c-453a-b34b-13b5014e4b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 484605}, \'multiverseid\': 484605}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mondlichtmystiker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber wirkst, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es freut mich zu sehen, dass diese Welt gelernt hat, dass der Mond mehr als nur die Gezeiten beeinflusst."\\n—Tamiyo die Mondweise\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77c3ec5e-6bbe-4afb-9dbf-f5de26113d07\', \'multiverseId\': 482994}, \'multiverseid\': 482994}, {\'name\': \'Místico lunar\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Me agrada que este mundo sepa que la luna no solo afecta a las mareas".\\n—Tamiyo, la Sabia de la Luna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2527235e-d87e-44e1-9ba1-39e307bc4082\', \'multiverseId\': 483245}, \'multiverseid\': 483245}, {\'name\': \'Mystique lunaire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Il me plaît de constater que ce monde connaît de la lune autre chose que son influence sur les marées. »\\n—Tamiyo, le sage de la lune\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c97f0fa6-fb79-4028-a3c9-86b78602e573\', \'multiverseId\': 483496}, \'multiverseid\': 483496}, {\'name\': \'Mistico Lunare\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono lieta che questo mondo abbia imparato che l\\\'influenza della luna si spinge oltre le maree."\\n—Tamiyo, Saggia della Luna\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9f3416-850f-4c1c-b6df-5f70a531d8d2\', \'multiverseId\': 483747}, \'multiverseid\': 483747}, {\'name\': \'月の神秘家\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタント・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「よかった。月の影響が潮汐だけではないとこの世界は学んでくれた。」\\n――月の賢者タミヨウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf49c0f-e0b8-4e89-b3df-04111271f78e\', \'multiverseId\': 483998}, \'multiverseid\': 483998}, {\'name\': \'Místico Lunar\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Agrada-me que este mundo tenha aprendido que a lua afeta muito mais que as marés."\\n— Tamiyo, a Sábia da Lua\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3e223a1-307b-4dcf-9d78-482d5a1f8e21\', \'multiverseId\': 484249}, \'multiverseid\': 484249}, {\'name\': \'Лунный Мистик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание, вы можете уплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Я рада, что в этом мире узнали о том, что Луна влияет не только на приливы».\\n— Тамиё, Знаток Луны\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ade3a712-e627-4624-a387-ea0c153798d8\', \'multiverseId\': 484500}, \'multiverseid\': 484500}]', "[{'name': 'Moosfeuer-Tal', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Üppiges Wachstum breitet sich so rasch aus wie ein heftiges Feuer über die Hügel von Otaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483169&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1f9bf41-d074-4956-9b17-4167d1c8d958', 'multiverseId': 483169}, 'multiverseid': 483169}, {'name': 'Valle Fuegomusgo', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'El crecimiento frondoso se disemina como una llamarada feroz a través de las colinas otarianas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483420&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f7406cf-9496-4694-bd30-6a2726c24257', 'multiverseId': 483420}, 'multiverseid': 483420}, {'name': 'Vallée de Moussefeu', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Comme un feu ravageur, la luxuriance gagne une à une les collines.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483671&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d320e41-5a8f-4b5b-9b9e-ef6f08544186', 'multiverseId': 483671}, 'multiverseid': 483671}, {'name': 'Valle di Piromuschio', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La vegetazione ha ricoperto le colline di Otaria con la velocità di un incendio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483922&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1291cbad-6820-4e68-b5bd-f99bea750ef1', 'multiverseId': 483922}, 'multiverseid': 483922}, {'name': 'モスファイアの谷', 'text': '{1}, {T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'オタリアの丘陵地帯には、青々とした樹木がまるで猛火のような感じで広がっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484173&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98855fc8-97d6-48d3-91ce-c20a63bc6842', 'multiverseId': 484173}, 'multiverseid': 484173}, {'name': 'Vale de Piromusgo', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Uma vegetação luxuriante se alastra como um incêndio pelas encostas Otarianas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484424&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '464ed172-c665-4eb8-90db-acccdd5e544d', 'multiverseId': 484424}, 'multiverseid': 484424}, {'name': 'Долина Огненных Мхов', 'text': '{1}, {T}: добавьте {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Пышная поросль ярким пожаром распространилась по холмам Отарии.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484675&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a96da460-0ea5-4908-adb1-64d6d32d9dd7', 'multiverseId': 484675}, 'multiverseid': 484675}]", "[{'name': 'Mooswurz-Brücke', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Falls die Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, eine Gesamtstärke von 10 oder mehr haben, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483170&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b67b5ac6-6dd6-448c-80c9-e9e57ee0334c', 'multiverseId': 483170}, 'multiverseid': 483170}, {'name': 'Puente de hierba musgo', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza total de 10 o más.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483421&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a6cef93-ba21-4cc8-bc06-0ed3332a3cb1', 'multiverseId': 483421}, 'multiverseid': 483421}, {'name': 'Pont de fangemousse', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force totale supérieure ou égale à 10.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483672&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a7d0f32-c853-4458-89c7-5fed44c6c761', 'multiverseId': 483672}, 'multiverseid': 483672}, {'name': 'Ponte Muscoso', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se le creature che controlli hanno una forza totale pari o superiore a 10.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483923&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8688673-e50f-4dc3-8ab1-fbbc961d2e1f', 'multiverseId': 483923}, 'multiverseid': 483923}, {'name': '苔汁の橋', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーのパワーの合計が10以上であるなら、あなたはその追放されているカードを、そのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484174&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94281d81-219d-48a2-8069-b043b66f01a1', 'multiverseId': 484174}, 'multiverseid': 484174}, {'name': 'Ponte Musgomosto', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se as criaturas que você controla tiverem poder total igual ou superior a 10.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484425&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a54d600-10f6-4a89-a675-6de9cb8428e1', 'multiverseId': 484425}, 'multiverseid': 484425}, {'name': 'Мост Ползучего Мха', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если суммарная сила существ под вашим контролем равна 10 или более.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484676&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab0acbbb-7f05-4571-ab00-7cb6dac27770', 'multiverseId': 484676}, 'multiverseid': 484676}]", "[{'name': 'Morast umgraben', 'text': 'Jeder Gegner bestimmt eine Kreaturenkarte in seinem Friedhof. Bringe die bestimmten Karten unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Glücklicherweise verfehlte der Reanimationszauber knapp die seit langem tote Kolonie der Stinkskorpione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484941&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57dcab4b-e9bc-40cc-8c7d-d34eae6da7b4', 'multiverseId': 484941}, 'multiverseid': 484941}, {'name': 'Dragar la ciénaga', 'text': 'Cada oponente elige una carta de criatura en su cementerio. Pon esas cartas en el campo de batalla bajo tu control.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Afortunadamente, el hechizo de reanimación no llegó a la colonia de escorpiones estercoleros que murieron tiempo ha.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484992&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5fc9c62-d273-4261-8fee-6ccd118a4973', 'multiverseId': 484992}, 'multiverseid': 484992}, {'name': 'Dragage de la fondrière', 'text': 'Chaque adversaire choisit une carte de créature dans son cimetière. Mettez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Par chance, le sort de réanimation manqua de peu la colonie de scorpions bousiers.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485043&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29b6759e-a711-4151-89f8-d7ae976baa44', 'multiverseId': 485043}, 'multiverseid': 485043}, {'name': 'Dragare il Pantano', 'text': 'Ogni avversario sceglie una carta creatura nel proprio cimitero. Metti quelle carte sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Fortunatamente, la magia di rianimazione mancò per un soffio la colonia da tempo estinta di scorpioni stercorari.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485094&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f9eddda-25c2-42ea-a839-4affd1da16c2', 'multiverseId': 485094}, 'multiverseid': 485094}, {'name': 'ぬかるみさらい', 'text': '各対戦相手はそれぞれ、自分の墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を選ぶ。それらのカードをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '幸いにも、再生の魔法は少しの差で、大昔に死に絶えた糞サソリのコロニーを外した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485145&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11e2437b-10ed-4ce8-bc5a-d2b5f70b4216', 'multiverseId': 485145}, 'multiverseid': 485145}, {'name': 'Dragar o Lodaçal', 'text': 'Cada oponente escolhe um card de criatura no próprio cemitério. Coloque aqueles cards no campo de batalha sob seu controle.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Felizmente a mágica de reanimação não afetou a finada colônia de escorpiões rola-bosta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485196&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5fc4ba4-be6a-4679-8358-047617da3afa', 'multiverseId': 485196}, 'multiverseid': 485196}, {'name': 'Разбередить Трясину', 'text': 'Каждый оппонент выбирает карту существа на своем кладбище. Положите те карты на поле битвы под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'К счастью, воскрешающее заклинание не задело давно погибшую колонию навозных скорпионов.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485247&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23f0ac23-0b71-4f58-ab34-30d71ee37f68', 'multiverseId': 485247}, 'multiverseid': 485247}]", '[{\'name\': \'Murmelnder Mystiker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Vogel-Illusion-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Gerüchte flattern wie Krähen durch die Stadt und landen scheinbar zufällig auf den Bürgern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdefb9f5-0b4b-4c8e-acb1-1658022a7a31\', \'multiverseId\': 482997}, \'multiverseid\': 482997}, {\'name\': \'Místico murmurador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Ilusión Ave azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los rumores revolotean por la ciudad como cuervos, posándose sobre algunos ciudadanos al azar... o eso parece.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4cb1bf-3314-4eb1-8e57-5aa6271ad487\', \'multiverseId\': 483248}, \'multiverseid\': 483248}, {\'name\': \'Mystique bruissant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Oiseau et Illusion avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les rumeurs circulent en ville telles des nuées de corbeaux, se posant apparemment au hasard sur les citoyens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c096c1-386e-47fd-b671-28bd0af8aa6c\', \'multiverseId\': 483499}, \'multiverseid\': 483499}, {\'name\': \'Mistico Mormorante\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Illusione Uccello 1/1 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Le dicerie fluttuano attraverso la città come corvi, posandosi sui cittadini in modo apparentemente casuale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c5e0d52-d488-425d-9363-b3bd7dbca2ef\', \'multiverseId\': 483750}, \'multiverseid\': 483750}, {\'name\': \'つぶやく神秘家\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の１/１の鳥・イリュージョン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'噂はカラスのように街中を舞い、見たところ無作為な市民の上に降りた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01587298-d333-4d87-9e27-d8b0723467e0\', \'multiverseId\': 484001}, \'multiverseid\': 484001}, {\'name\': \'Místico dos Murmúrios\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura azul 1/1 do tipo Ave Ilusão com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Os rumores flutuam pela cidade como corvos, aludindo a cidadãos com aparente aleatoriedade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5d6a0b9-83f9-453a-9d23-a34240a11af3\', \'multiverseId\': 484252}, \'multiverseid\': 484252}, {\'name\': \'Шепчущий Мистик\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синяя Птица Иллюзия с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Слухи кружат над городом, словно вороны, и садятся на горожан как будто случайно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3ff52d4-5f50-4aef-b932-c2bd6d654dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 484503}, \'multiverseid\': 484503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mystisches Kloster\', \'text\': \'Das Mystische Kloster kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}, {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Als er gefragt wurde, wie viele Wege zur Erleuchtung führen, trat der Mönch gegen einen Sandhaufen. „Zähl nach", sagte er lächelnd, „und dann finde weitere Körner."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483172&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a2dc9d8-4008-432a-a130-c33b6e63d7c3\', \'multiverseId\': 483172}, \'multiverseid\': 483172}, {\'name\': \'Monasterio místico\', \'text\': \'El Monasterio místico entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}, {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se le preguntó cuántos caminos llevaban a la iluminación, el monje dio una patada a un montón de arena. "Cuenta", dijo con una sonrisa, "y luego busca más granos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'038bafe4-1e7c-4ec7-b6a2-6f0eb2a9d062\', \'multiverseId\': 483423}, \'multiverseid\': 483423}, {\'name\': \'Monastère mystique\', \'text\': \'Le Monastère mystique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}, {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Quand on lui demanda combien de chemins mènent à l\'illumination, le moine frappa dans un tas de sable. « Comptez, dit-il en souriant, et ajoutez d\'autres grains. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2154ab35-b211-42e5-95eb-72a16b899abb\', \'multiverseId\': 483674}, \'multiverseid\': 483674}, {\'name\': \'Monastero Mistico\', \'text\': \'Il Monastero Mistico entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}, {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Quando gli chiesero quante vie conducessero all\\\'illuminazione, il monaco calciò un mucchio di sabbia. "Conta", sorrise, "e poi cerca altri granelli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5f2f44-e9e0-41fc-ba5c-bd8806ab8627\', \'multiverseId\': 483925}, \'multiverseid\': 483925}, {\'name\': \'神秘の僧院\', \'text\': \'神秘の僧院はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'悟りの境地に至る道の数について問われた僧侶は、砂の山を蹴った。「数えてみなさい。」と彼は微笑みながら言った。「それから、さらに多くの砂粒を用意することです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b8eea3e-fa47-4cb0-9584-505c3f54b4ed\', \'multiverseId\': 484176}, \'multiverseid\': 484176}, {\'name\': \'Monastério Místico\', \'text\': \'Monastério Místico entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}, {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando lhe perguntaram quantos caminhos levam à iluminação, o monge chutou um monte de terra. "Conte", disse ele sorrindo, "e depois encontre mais grãos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f94749b0-315c-46a0-84ab-790839332b25\', \'multiverseId\': 484427}, \'multiverseid\': 484427}, {\'name\': \'Монастырь Мистиков\', \'text\': \'Монастырь Мистиков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}, {R} или {W}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Когда монаха спросили, сколько путей ведет к просветлению, он подбросил в воздух горсть песка. «Считайте, — улыбнулся он. — А потом найдите еще песчинки».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da555616-eae9-43dc-bd10-68d5f65f22d2\', \'multiverseId\': 484678}, \'multiverseid\': 484678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mürrischer Dachssaurier\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Kreaturenkarte abwirfst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Mürrischen Dachssaurier.\\nImmer wenn du eine Länderkarte abwirfst, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte, die weder eine Kreatur noch ein Land ist, abwirfst, kämpft der Mürrische Dachssaurier gegen bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dachs, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ef4e73-c6b9-4287-928f-9a35e42453a9\', \'multiverseId\': 484955}, \'multiverseid\': 484955}, {\'name\': \'Tejosaurio malhumorado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que descartes una carta de criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Tejosaurio malhumorado.\\nSiempre que descartes una carta de tierra, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nSiempre que descartes una carta que no sea de criatura o de tierra, el Tejosaurio malhumorado lucha contra hasta una criatura objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dinosaurio tejón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac041152-3726-4e04-85c1-298ca534f2ec\', \'multiverseId\': 485006}, \'multiverseid\': 485006}, {\'name\': \'Blairosaure revêche\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte de créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Blairosaure revêche.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte de terrain, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous vous défaussez d\'une carte non-créature, non-terrain, le Blairosaure revêche se bat contre jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature : blaireau et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3603650-f0a3-44b9-811b-aa4cc815d998\', \'multiverseId\': 485057}, \'multiverseid\': 485057}, {\'name\': \'Tassosauro Scontroso\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta scarti una carta creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Tassosauro Scontroso.\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta terra, crea una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con: "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\\nOgniqualvolta scarti una carta non creatura, non terra, il Tassosauro Scontroso lotta con fino a una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Dinosauro Tasso\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82fc19ee-dfbf-4744-89b1-ce568f43302e\', \'multiverseId\': 485108}, \'multiverseid\': 485108}, {\'name\': \'無愛想なアナグマザウルス\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャー・カードを１枚捨てるたび、無愛想なアナグマザウルスの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nあなたが土地・カードを１枚捨てるたび、宝物・トークンを１つ生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたがクリーチャーでも土地でもないカードを１枚捨てるたび、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。無愛想なアナグマザウルスはそれと格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アナグマ・恐竜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc25a20-6ae3-4ff1-90ba-9b5ddbc98259\', \'multiverseId\': 485159}, \'multiverseid\': 485159}, {\'name\': \'Texugossauro Ranzinza\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você descartar um card de criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Texugossauro Ranzinza.\\nToda vez que você descartar um card de terreno, crie uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.")\\nToda vez que você descarta um card que não seja de criatura nem de terreno, Texugossauro Ranzinza luta com até uma criatura alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Texugo Dinossauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c52a1c-c233-4f9b-89a5-17891a28c503\', \'multiverseId\': 485210}, \'multiverseid\': 485210}, {\'name\': \'Угрюмый Барсукозавр\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту существа, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Угрюмого Барсукозавра.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту земли, создайте одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы сбрасываете карту, не являющуюся ни существом, ни землей, Угрюмый Барсукозавр дерется не более чем с одним целевым существом не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Барсук Динозавр\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba68ec08-0c07-422d-9406-c6f179e2d919\', \'multiverseId\': 485261}, \'multiverseid\': 485261}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nahiri, Vorbotin des Unheils\', \'text\': \'+2: Du kannst eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\n−2: Schicke eine Verzauberung, ein getapptes Artefakt oder eine getappte Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n−8: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefakt- oder Kreaturenkarte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek. Sie erhält Eile. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Nahiri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483102&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01bb6720-b80a-4e2c-9792-d3af11bb664e\', \'multiverseId\': 483102}, \'multiverseid\': 483102}, {\'name\': \'Nahiri, la Adalid\', \'text\': \'+2: Puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\n−2: Exilia el encantamiento, artefacto girado o criatura girada objetivo.\\n−8: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto o de criatura, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Regrésala a tu mano al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Nahiri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13766cf0-8715-451f-b1e4-d6c9ecc3a76b\', \'multiverseId\': 483353}, \'multiverseid\': 483353}, {\'name\': "Nahiri, l\'annonciatrice", \'text\': "+2: Vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\n-2: Exilez l\'enchantement ciblé, l\'artefact engagé ciblé ou la créature engagée ciblée.\\n-8: Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact ou de créature, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque. Elle acquiert la célérité. Renvoyez-la dans votre main au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Nahiri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483604&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94ec233e-bb13-45c4-a8b1-ec7a8766dd13\', \'multiverseId\': 483604}, \'multiverseid\': 483604}, {\'name\': "Nahiri, l\'Araldo", \'text\': "+2: Puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\n-2: Esilia un incantesimo, un artefatto TAPpato o una creatura TAPpata bersaglio.\\n-8: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto o creatura, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio. Ha rapidità. Riprendila in mano all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Nahiri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d98e1b-895a-4693-b3fe-10402a55eaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 483855}, \'multiverseid\': 483855}, {\'name\': \'先駆ける者、ナヒリ\', \'text\': \'+2：あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\\n-2：エンチャント１つかタップ状態のアーティファクト１つかタップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n-8：あなたのライブラリーからアーティファクトかクリーチャーであるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。それは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ナヒリ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874f8028-3e55-40c4-967f-f199a2c00f41\', \'multiverseId\': 484106}, \'multiverseid\': 484106}, {\'name\': \'Nahiri, a Anunciadora\', \'text\': \'+2: Você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\\n−2: Exile o encantamento, artefato virado ou criatura virada alvo.\\n−8: Procure em seu grimório um card de artefato ou de criatura, coloque-o no campo de batalha e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório. Ele ganha ímpeto. Devolva-o para a sua mão no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Nahiri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeef7776-800c-4a6d-b112-79593ace6fce\', \'multiverseId\': 484357}, \'multiverseid\': 484357}, {\'name\': \'Нахири, Предвестница\', \'text\': \'+2: вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\\n−2: изгоните целевые(-ой, -ое) чары, повернутый артефакт или повернутое существо.\\n−8: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту артефакта или существа, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку. То существо или артефакт получает Ускорение. Верните его в вашу руку в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Нахири\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9201ea0f-058b-4f2f-8be0-00a2767ee326\', \'multiverseId\': 484608}, \'multiverseid\': 484608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Naturverbundenheit\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zendikar wird nicht aufgeben und wir genauso wenig."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483063&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da2feae-f36c-467d-8fe3-ccb6e3f7b1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 483063}, \'multiverseid\': 483063}, {\'name\': \'Conexión natural\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar no se rendirá, y nosotros tampoco".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21dd87eb-5779-40ca-b1a6-8b8249afeb37\', \'multiverseId\': 483314}, \'multiverseid\': 483314}, {\'name\': \'Connexion naturelle\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Zendikar ne capitulera pas, et nous non plus. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483565&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb07089-59fb-492f-9101-55a6fa832ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 483565}, \'multiverseid\': 483565}, {\'name\': \'Legame Naturale\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar non si arrenderà e nemmeno noi possiamo farlo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'179f8b0c-340a-4f94-ae99-d2d15653993a\', \'multiverseId\': 483816}, \'multiverseid\': 483816}, {\'name\': \'自然の繋がり\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼンディカーはあきらめないわ。私たちもよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c09c583-2a6c-4cc7-9625-a3167836b58d\', \'multiverseId\': 484067}, \'multiverseid\': 484067}, {\'name\': \'Conexão Natural\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar não se renderá. Também não podemos nos render."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ac9679e-46d5-43cb-9f9a-984cd1b8d089\', \'multiverseId\': 484318}, \'multiverseid\': 484318}, {\'name\': \'Природная Связь\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Зендикар не сдается. Не сдадимся и мы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c6690be-673d-4a91-a579-45bab2a7aff2\', \'multiverseId\': 484569}, \'multiverseid\': 484569}]', "[{'name': 'Neue Perspektiven', 'text': 'Wenn die Neuen Perspektiven ins Spiel kommen, ziehe drei Karten.\\nSolange du sieben oder mehr Karten auf deiner Hand hast, kannst du {0} bezahlen, anstatt Umwandlungskosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Wissen und Unwissen sind oft nur eine Frage der Perspektive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482998&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a808251-e9e6-4139-ba55-9278ec4af980', 'multiverseId': 482998}, 'multiverseid': 482998}, {'name': 'Nuevas perspectivas', 'text': 'Cuando las Nuevas perspectivas entren al campo de batalla, roba tres cartas.\\nMientras tengas siete cartas o más en tu mano, puedes pagar {0} en vez de pagar los costes de ciclo.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'El entendimiento es una cuestión de perspectiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483249&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '731cdb49-833d-4b7a-b78a-407d442f642d', 'multiverseId': 483249}, 'multiverseid': 483249}, {'name': 'Nouvelles perspectives', 'text': 'Quand les Nouvelles perspectives arrivent sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes.\\nTant que vous avez au moins sept cartes en main, vous pouvez payer {0} à la place des coûts de recyclage.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'La compréhension est une question de perspective.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483500&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15b16b0c-3a3e-4945-aa4f-03c8bec05652', 'multiverseId': 483500}, 'multiverseid': 483500}, {'name': 'Nuove Prospettive', 'text': 'Quando le Nuove Prospettive entrano nel campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte.\\nFintanto che hai sette o più carte in mano, puoi pagare {0} invece di pagare i costi di ciclo.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'La comprensione è una questione di prospettiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483751&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8b1653c-6cf3-40e3-8124-f1912dde61f8', 'multiverseId': 483751}, 'multiverseid': 483751}, {'name': '新たな視点', 'text': '新たな視点が戦場に出たとき、カードを３枚引く。\\nあなたの手札にカードが７枚以上あるかぎり、あなたはサイクリング・コストを支払うのではなく{0}を支払ってもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '理解とは視点の問題なのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484002&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b304007a-c8e1-4086-88a3-49042b3daa06', 'multiverseId': 484002}, 'multiverseid': 484002}, {'name': 'Novas Perspectivas', 'text': 'Quando Novas Perspectivas entrar no campo de batalha, compre três cards.\\nEnquanto tiver sete ou mais cards em sua mão, você poderá pagar {0} em vez de pagar custos de reciclar.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'O entendimento é questão de perspectiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484253&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '886db1ec-3824-41b4-ad8b-ac53cefaa8de', 'multiverseId': 484253}, 'multiverseid': 484253}, {'name': 'Новые Перспективы', 'text': 'Когда Новые Перспективы выходят на поле битвы, возьмите три карты.\\nПока у вас в руке не меньше семи карт, вы можете платить {0} вместо оплаты стоимостей Цикла.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Понимание — вопрос перспективы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484504&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f49303c-f0de-44fd-a96c-a4defbbf87cb', 'multiverseId': 484504}, 'multiverseid': 484504}]", '[{\'name\': \'Neugierige Herde\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Gegner deiner Wahl. Erzeuge X 3/3 grüne Bestie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Artefakten ist, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du das Lager bei deinem Aufbruch nicht abbrichst, findest du es bei deiner Rückkehr verwüstet vor."\\n—Jonald der Naturkundler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f7661e-cf7e-4bcc-aa53-f713b8693be2\', \'multiverseId\': 484957}, \'multiverseid\': 484957}, {\'name\': \'Rebaño curioso\', \'text\': \'Elige un oponente objetivo. Creas X fichas de criatura Bestia verdes 3/3, donde X es la cantidad de artefactos que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si no levantas el campamento al irte, cuando vuelvas ya te lo habrán levantado".\\n—Jonald, naturalista de campo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'464c057a-a6c8-4a52-87b6-72d406d4abf9\', \'multiverseId\': 485008}, \'multiverseid\': 485008}, {\'name\': \'Troupeau curieux\', \'text\': "Choisissez un adversaire ciblé. Vous créez X jetons de créature 3/3 verte Bête, X étant le nombre d\'artefacts que ce joueur contrôle.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous ne démontez pas le camp en partant, il sera démonté à votre retour. »\\n—Jonald, naturaliste de la mission\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b1c9ae5-2d51-4d95-867f-2d5410e0c3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 485059}, \'multiverseid\': 485059}, {\'name\': \'Mandria Curiosa\', \'text\': \'Scegli un avversario bersaglio. Crea X pedine creatura Bestia 3/3 verdi, dove X è il numero di artefatti controllati da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se non levi le tende quando te ne vai, al tuo ritorno ti accorgerai che qualcuno l\\\'ha fatto per te."\\n—Jonald, naturalista in missione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5242bae1-5d57-4316-b15c-4d84d06410be\', \'multiverseId\': 485110}, \'multiverseid\': 485110}, {\'name\': \'好奇心の強い群れ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているアーティファクトの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「出るときにはテントをバラしておかないと、戻ってきた頃にはバラバラにされてるぞ。」\\n――踏査自然主義者、ジョナルド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71bb0070-6706-4757-9317-359bfe7f68bd\', \'multiverseId\': 485161}, \'multiverseid\': 485161}, {\'name\': \'Rebanho Curioso\', \'text\': \'Escolha um oponente alvo. Você cria X fichas de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta, sendo X o número de artefatos que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você não desmontar o acampamento, quando voltar ele já vai ter sido desmontado pra você."\\n— Jonald, naturalista da missão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c9b0f98-fdd8-4243-9d95-7a8a61f753f7\', \'multiverseId\': 485212}, \'multiverseid\': 485212}, {\'name\': \'Любопытное Стадо\', \'text\': \'Выберите целевого оппонента. Вы создаете X фишек существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь, где X — количество артефактов под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Если не свернуть лагерь, когда уходишь, то тут за тебя сами все свернут».\\n— Джональд, натуралист экспедиции\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad60946-9ad5-49ea-9788-2569fc4fc200\', \'multiverseId\': 485263}, \'multiverseid\': 485263}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nikara die Höhlenplünderin\', \'text\': \'Partner von Yannik, plündernder Wächter (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Yannik aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nBedrohlich\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt und falls mindestens eine Marke auf ihr lag, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'864d96f3-0053-4aff-b8eb-aa2cb0a8a9f4\', \'multiverseId\': 484730}, \'multiverseid\': 484730}, {\'name\': \'Nikara, saqueadora de guaridas\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Yánnik, centinela saqueadora (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Yánnik en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nAmenaza.\\nSiempre que otra criatura que controlas deje el campo de batalla, si tenía uno o más contadores sobre ella, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac20c98-c66f-455a-a744-13776e88d3ff\', \'multiverseId\': 484750}, \'multiverseid\': 484750}, {\'name\': \'Nikara, charognarde des tanières\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Yannik, sentinelle nécrophage (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Yannik dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nMenace\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille, si elle avait au moins un marqueur sur elle, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484770&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e17064-fe1f-4c07-b71e-c9aeb1e624f9\', \'multiverseId\': 484770}, \'multiverseid\': 484770}, {\'name\': \'Nikara, Predona delle Tane\', \'text\': "Partner di Yannik, Sentinella Predatrice (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Yannik alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nMinacciare\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli lascia il campo di battaglia, se aveva uno o più segnalini, peschi una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'075d921c-2fb4-4f74-b355-50a7c41f3362\', \'multiverseId\': 484790}, \'multiverseid\': 484790}, {\'name\': \'巣穴あさり、ニカーラ\', \'text\': \'物あさりの見張り役、ヤーンニックとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから物あさりの見張り役、ヤーンニックを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n威迫\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体戦場を離れるたび、それの上にカウンターが１個以上置かれていた場合、あなたはカードを１枚引き、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a56b0d-3a0f-4262-aa56-2d490bae0dd7\', \'multiverseId\': 484810}, \'multiverseid\': 484810}, {\'name\': \'Nikara, Necrófaga dos Covis\', \'text\': \'Parceira de Yannik, Sentinela Necrófaga (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Yannik na própria mão do próprio grimório e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nAmeaçar\\nToda vez que outra criatura que você controla deixa o campo de batalha, se ela tinha um ou mais marcadores, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a295b8-1554-4ab6-bfa5-fbe301a9ca04\', \'multiverseId\': 484830}, \'multiverseid\': 484830}, {\'name\': \'Никара, Обирающая Гнезда\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Янником, Сторожевым Грабителем (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Янника в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nУгроза\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем покидает поле битвы, если на нем был один или несколько жетонов, то вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d72df4a8-38e9-4d11-8af2-dc4d3928f807\', \'multiverseId\': 484850}, \'multiverseid\': 484850}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nissa, Hüterin der Elemente\', \'text\': \'+2: Hellsicht 2.\\n0: Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Länderkarte oder eine Kreaturenkarte mit umgewandelten Manakosten kleiner oder gleich der Anzahl an Loyalitätsmarken auf Nissa, Hüterin der Elemente, ist, kannst du sie ins Spiel bringen.\\n−6: Enttappe bis zu zwei Länder deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Sie werden bis zum Ende des Zuges zu 5/5 Elementarwesen-Kreaturen mit Flugfähigkeit und Eile. Sie sind auch immer noch Länder.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Nissa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483103&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf95501c-217d-4127-965f-4434a4a97025\', \'multiverseId\': 483103}, \'multiverseid\': 483103}, {\'name\': \'Nissa, encarnación de los elementos\', \'text\': \'+2: Adivina 2.\\n0: Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra o de criatura con un coste de maná convertido menor o igual a la cantidad de contadores de lealtad sobre Nissa, encarnación de los elementos, puedes poner esa carta en el campo de batalla.\\n−6: Endereza hasta dos tierras objetivo que controlas. Se convierten en criaturas Elementales 5/5 con las habilidades de volar y prisa hasta el final del turno. Siguen siendo tierras.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Nissa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d834361-b14f-469e-a07d-e90ad7d8cace\', \'multiverseId\': 483354}, \'multiverseid\': 483354}, {\'name\': \'Nissa, intendante des éléments\', \'text\': "+2: Regard 2.\\n0: Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain ou de créature avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal au nombre de marqueurs « loyauté » sur Nissa, intendante des éléments, vous pouvez mettre cette carte sur le champ de bataille.\\n-6: Dégagez jusqu\'à deux terrains ciblés que vous contrôlez. Ils deviennent des créatures 5/5 Élémental avec le vol et la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Ce sont toujours des terrains.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Nissa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483605&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'704e8deb-b989-4c77-8336-6c1ed1b33f17\', \'multiverseId\': 483605}, \'multiverseid\': 483605}, {\'name\': \'Nissa, Guardiana degli Elementi\', \'text\': \'+2: Profetizza 2.\\n0: Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra o una carta creatura con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore al numero di segnalini fedeltà su Nissa, Guardiana degli Elementi, puoi mettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia.\\n-6: STAPpa fino a due terre bersaglio che controlli. Diventano creature Elementale 5/5 con volare e rapidità fino alla fine del turno. Sono ancora terre.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Nissa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f699a848-3b8b-470c-8627-48f5a7689955\', \'multiverseId\': 483856}, \'multiverseid\': 483856}, {\'name\': \'自然に仕える者、ニッサ\', \'text\': \'+2：占術２を行う。\\n0：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。それが土地・カードか、点数で見たマナ・コストが自然に仕える者、ニッサの上に置かれている忠誠カウンターの総数以下であるクリーチャー・カードなら、あなたはそのカードを戦場に出してもよい。\\n-6：あなたがコントロールしている土地最大２つを対象とし、それらをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは飛行と速攻を持つ５/５のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。それらは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — ニッサ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb6b509-50c7-4e69-b3f9-1d26b1daa9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 484107}, \'multiverseid\': 484107}, {\'name\': \'Nissa, Guardiã dos Elementos\', \'text\': \'+2: Use vidência 2.\\n0: Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de terreno ou de criatura com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior ao número de marcadores de lealdade em Nissa, Guardiã dos Elementos, você poderá colocar aquele card no campo de batalha.\\n-6: Desvire até dois terrenos alvo que você controla. Eles se tornam criaturas 5/5 do tipo Elemental com voar e ímpeto até o final do turno. Elas ainda são terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Nissa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d2a7ef-1d06-4d7d-8005-5c2137bbc1bc\', \'multiverseId\': 484358}, \'multiverseid\': 484358}, {\'name\': \'Нисса, Проводница Стихий\', \'text\': \'+2: предскажите 2.\\n0: посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта земли или карта существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью, меньшей или равной количеству жетонов верности на Ниссе, Проводнице Стихий, то вы можете положить ту карту на поле битвы.\\n−6: разверните не более двух целевых земель под вашим контролем. Они становятся существами 5/5 Элементаль с Полетом и Ускорением до конца хода. При этом они остаются землями.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Нисса\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3acb9176-a422-4e16-94bb-dec4dbeee70a\', \'multiverseId\': 484609}, \'multiverseid\': 484609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet, das Feuerhirn\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, fügt Niv-Mizzet, das Feuerhirn, einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'So brillant wie ein geschliffener Diamant und mit ebenso scharfen Kanten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483104&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333dd121-f67c-4b81-90d2-0d4a8867a154\', \'multiverseId\': 483104}, \'multiverseid\': 483104}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mízzet, la Mente Ardiente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, Niv-Mízzet, la Mente Ardiente hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Tan brillante como un diamante tallado y tan cruel como su filo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b15fa40-3a8a-4d20-a84f-adbad40f494e\', \'multiverseId\': 483355}, \'multiverseid\': 483355}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet, le Cérébropyre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, Niv-Mizzet, le Cérébropyre inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{T} : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Il a la brillance et le tranchant d\'un diamant taillé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483606&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf9c137-c8b3-4e76-86f7-a5af78154628\', \'multiverseId\': 483606}, \'multiverseid\': 483606}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet, il Mentefiamma\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, Niv-Mizzet, il Mentefiamma infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{T}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Brillante come un diamante tagliato e altrettanto affilato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17be36dc-96e5-4391-9867-535b0b07d1e5\', \'multiverseId\': 483857}, \'multiverseid\': 483857}, {\'name\': \'火想者ニヴ＝ミゼット\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。火想者ニヴ＝ミゼットはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{T}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'ダイヤモンドのように光り輝く頭の切れは、また刃のような残忍な切れを見せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db6bedbc-ee65-41e6-a54e-13edc5b1b720\', \'multiverseId\': 484108}, \'multiverseid\': 484108}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet, o Mente de Fogo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você compra um card, Niv-Mizzet, o Mente de Fogo, causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n{T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Brilhante como um diamante de corte, com um fio igualmente cruel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d8ac9a-9ec6-408f-9e24-33f521cf4dec\', \'multiverseId\': 484359}, \'multiverseid\': 484359}, {\'name\': \'Нив-Миззет, Огненный Разум\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, Нив-Миззет, Огненный Разум наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\\n{T}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Блестящий, словно ограненный бриллиант, разум, с настолько же острыми гранями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02aae06-b806-4e30-929c-8553bd50b838\', \'multiverseId\': 484610}, \'multiverseid\': 484610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nomadenaußenposten\', \'text\': \'Der Nomadenaußenposten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Schwachen mauern sich selbst ein. Wir leben frei unterm Wind und unsere Freiheit macht uns stark."\\n—Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45f71d3a-b812-451e-9040-89ab771ed82c\', \'multiverseId\': 483173}, \'multiverseid\': 483173}, {\'name\': \'Destacamento nómada\', \'text\': \'El Destacamento nómada entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo los débiles se encierran tras los muros. Nosotros vivimos libres como el viento, y nuestra libertad es nuestra fuerza".\\n—Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93f394a5-67bf-4d9b-ada9-008870a77676\', \'multiverseId\': 483424}, \'multiverseid\': 483424}, {\'name\': \'Avant-poste nomade\', \'text\': "L\'Avant-poste nomade arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Seuls les faibles s\'enferment entre quatre murs. Nous vivons au gré du vent, et notre liberté nous renforce. »\\n—Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed969ee-6164-4bcb-9dd5-59bc99b629b4\', \'multiverseId\': 483675}, \'multiverseid\': 483675}, {\'name\': \'Avamposto Nomade\', \'text\': "L\'Avamposto Nomade entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}, {W} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo i deboli si rinchiudono tra mura. Noi viviamo liberi sotto il vento e la nostra libertà ci rende forti."\\n—Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1c3bb9a-79af-472d-a077-95942c811038\', \'multiverseId\': 483926}, \'multiverseid\': 483926}, {\'name\': \'遊牧民の前哨地\', \'text\': \'遊牧民の前哨地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「壁の向こう側に閉じこもっているのは弱者だけだ。我々は風の下で自由に生きる。自由こそが我らを強くする。」\\n――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25443fd4-42ac-44c7-b268-b81a241cfa2e\', \'multiverseId\': 484177}, \'multiverseid\': 484177}, {\'name\': \'Posto Avançado Nômade\', \'text\': \'Posto Avançado Nômade entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}, {W} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Só os fracos se aprisionam atrás de paredes. Nós vivemos livres sob o vento e nossa liberdade nos fortalece."\\n— Zurgo, khan dos Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134d9b6b-0bb1-446a-824d-86abcfa0d17e\', \'multiverseId\': 484428}, \'multiverseid\': 484428}, {\'name\': \'Аванпост Кочевников\', \'text\': \'Аванпост Кочевников выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}, {W} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Лишь слабые заточают себя за стенами. Мы живем под вольным небом, и наша свобода делает нас сильными».\\n— Зурго, хан Марду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f23e549f-552f-4d43-8fdb-4aca0eccd3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 484679}, \'multiverseid\': 484679}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nyx-Weberin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\\n{1}{B}{G}, schicke die Nyx-Weberin ins Exil: Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483105&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d920b9-4fb2-4d3d-ba53-4c681ce243be\', \'multiverseId\': 483105}, \'multiverseid\': 483105}, {\'name\': \'Tejedora de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\\n{1}{B}{G}, exiliar la Tejedora de Nyx: Regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bdd6d02-e480-4a00-ad15-1a0b05265382\', \'multiverseId\': 483356}, \'multiverseid\': 483356}, {\'name\': \'Tisseuse de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\\n{1}{B}{G}, exilez la Tisseuse de Nyx : Renvoyez une carte ciblée de votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : araignée\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483607&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6986a222-cff2-47d3-adcc-f6a34679cdb5\', \'multiverseId\': 483607}, \'multiverseid\': 483607}, {\'name\': \'Tessitrice di Nyx\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Esilia la Tessitrice di Nyx: Riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc40ba95-355b-45cb-89cd-dc7f4d0e24b0\', \'multiverseId\': 483858}, \'multiverseid\': 483858}, {\'name\': \'ニクスの織り手\', \'text\': \'到達\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。\\n{1}{B}{G}, ニクスの織り手を追放する：あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2e581fe-c6e0-4ab0-b214-1fe39763f846\', \'multiverseId\': 484109}, \'multiverseid\': 484109}, {\'name\': \'Tecedora de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\\n{1}{B}{G}, exile Tecedora de Nyx: Devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b908d9cf-b71d-4626-a2e4-7919b328ad5d\', \'multiverseId\': 484360}, \'multiverseid\': 484360}, {\'name\': \'Прядильщик Никса\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\\n{1}{B}{G}, изгоните Прядильщика Никса: верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410752d5-4eee-4c91-a1bc-6304df3247ec\', \'multiverseId\': 484611}, \'multiverseid\': 484611}]', '[{\'name\': \'Odric der Meistertaktiker\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nImmer wenn Odric der Meistertaktiker und mindestens drei andere Kreaturen angreifen, bestimmst du, welche Kreaturen in diesem Kampf blocken und wie sie blocken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Schicksal hat in seiner Kampftaktik keine Furcht vorgesehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc351436-a2ba-443a-9d08-4d798f346b94\', \'multiverseId\': 482975}, \'multiverseid\': 482975}, {\'name\': \'Odric, maestro estratega\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nSiempre que Odric, maestro estratega y al menos otras tres criaturas ataquen, tú eliges qué criaturas bloquean este combate y cómo bloquean esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El miedo no tiene lugar en el plan de batalla de la fe".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e0f20d-1f2f-47fa-bf78-8be43bbcaaf4\', \'multiverseId\': 483226}, \'multiverseid\': 483226}, {\'name\': \'Odric, maître tacticien\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Odric, maître tacticien et au moins trois autres créatures attaquent, vous choisissez quelles créatures bloquent ce combat et comment elles bloquent.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« La peur n\'a pas sa place dans le plan de bataille de la foi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0892b07b-9569-408f-9a42-7d2c0659dc56\', \'multiverseId\': 483477}, \'multiverseid\': 483477}, {\'name\': \'Odric, Grande Stratega\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nOgniqualvolta Odric, Grande Stratega e almeno altre tre creature attaccano, scegli quali creature bloccano in questo combattimento e come bloccano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non c\\\'è posto per la paura nel piano di battaglia della fede."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea39c1a-b791-467b-af3f-8f01f9f69294\', \'multiverseId\': 483728}, \'multiverseid\': 483728}, {\'name\': \'熟練の戦術家、オドリック\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n熟練の戦術家、オドリックと、他の３体以上のクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、この戦闘で、どのクリーチャーがブロックするか、どうブロックするかはあなたが選ぶ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「信仰の下に戦う中では、恐怖など存在しない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53cbd041-b3d0-4e62-ae10-183db2fe46ed\', \'multiverseId\': 483979}, \'multiverseid\': 483979}, {\'name\': \'Odric, Estrategista Mestre\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nToda vez que Odric, Estrategista Mestre, e pelo menos três outras criaturas atacam, você escolhe quais criaturas bloqueiam neste combate e como elas bloqueiam.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Não há lugar para o medo no plano de batalha da fé."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'110df541-dd97-42ca-baec-f8ff3becf1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 484230}, \'multiverseid\': 484230}, {\'name\': \'Одрик, Искусный Тактик\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Одрик, Искусный Тактик и не менее трех других существ атакуют, вы выбираете, какие существа блокируют в этом бою и как они блокируют.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Страху нет места в битве за веру».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4778a45d-a8b1-4d3e-b3ae-cbe45f7e89a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484481}, \'multiverseid\': 484481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Odric, Lunarch-Marschall\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn jedes Kampfes erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls du eine Kreatur kontrollierst, die Erstschlag hat. Das Gleiche gilt für Bedrohlichkeit, Doppelschlag, Eile, Fluchsicherheit, Flugfähigkeit, Lebensverknüpfung, Reichweite, Schleichen, Todesberührung, Unzerstörbarkeit, Wachsamkeit sowie das Verursachen von Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff71012-3686-4fa6-a76b-4081f4ca274c\', \'multiverseId\': 482974}, \'multiverseid\': 482974}, {\'name\': \'Odric, mariscal lunarca\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de cada combate, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno si una criatura que controlas daña primero. Lo mismo vale para las habilidades de volar, toque mortal, dañar dos veces, prisa, antimaleficio, indestructible, vínculo vital, amenaza, alcance, escurridizo, arrollar y vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c500980-8899-4a21-b9fe-408a4bd949e8\', \'multiverseId\': 483225}, \'multiverseid\': 483225}, {\'name\': \'Odric, maréchal lunarque\', \'text\': "Au début de chaque combat, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour si une créature que vous contrôlez a l\'initiative. C\'est vrai aussi pour le vol, le contact mortel, la double initiative, la célérité, la défense talismanique, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la menace, la portée, la furtivité, le piétinement et la vigilance.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2104677d-24a6-43ed-acae-453ba2d200a2\', \'multiverseId\': 483476}, \'multiverseid\': 483476}, {\'name\': \'Odric, Maresciallo del Lunarca\', \'text\': "All\'inizio di ogni combattimento, le creature che controlli hanno attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno se una creatura che controlli ha attacco improvviso. Lo stesso vale per volare, tocco letale, doppio attacco, rapidità, anti-malocchio, indistruttibile, legame vitale, minacciare, raggiungere, furtivo, travolgere e cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31a8a505-3759-4c2c-95dd-e3cddcd94b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 483727}, \'multiverseid\': 483727}, {\'name\': \'月皇の司令官、オドリック\', \'text\': \'各戦闘の開始時に、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが先制攻撃を持っているなら、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは先制攻撃を得る。飛行、接死、二段攻撃、速攻、呪禁、破壊不能、絆魂、威迫、到達、潜伏、トランプル、警戒についても同様である。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbfbe235-5e67-495a-9210-e36738271045\', \'multiverseId\': 483978}, \'multiverseid\': 483978}, {\'name\': \'Odric, Marechal Lunarca\', \'text\': \'No início de cada combate, as criaturas que você controla ganharão iniciativa até o final do turno se uma criatura que você controla tiver iniciativa. O mesmo vale para voar, toque mortífero, golpe duplo, ímpeto, resistência a magia, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, ameaçar, alcance, esquivo, atropelar e vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63023389-05fe-4471-b2ab-f872e324bd57\', \'multiverseId\': 484229}, \'multiverseid\': 484229}, {\'name\': \'Одрик, Маршал-Лунарх\', \'text\': \'В начале каждого боя существа под вашим контролем получают Первый удар до конца хода, если у находящегося под вашим контролем существа есть Первый удар. То же самое относится к Бдительности, Двойному удару, Захвату, Неразрушимости, Полету, Порчеустойчивости, Пробивному удару, Скрытности, Смертельному касанию, Угрозе, Ускорению и Цепи жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c543ac-b225-4c45-b6a9-56720ae4ed17\', \'multiverseId\': 484480}, \'multiverseid\': 484480}]', "[{'name': 'Oran-Rief, das Riesenholz', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, das Riesenholz, kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{T}: Lege auf jede grüne Kreatur, die in diesem Zug ins Spiel gekommen ist, eine +1/+1-Marke.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483175&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f41d3f90-3b2f-4c91-b4bb-0b5815110829', 'multiverseId': 483175}, 'multiverseid': 483175}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, el Bosque Extenso', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, el Bosque Extenso entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura verde que entró al campo de batalla este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483426&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e32fbb9-ee2e-42dc-baac-04dc47c9fddb', 'multiverseId': 483426}, 'multiverseid': 483426}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, le Vastebois', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, le Vastebois arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature verte qui est arrivée sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483677&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d6406c0-5a05-46e5-bb45-845bc984550c', 'multiverseId': 483677}, 'multiverseid': 483677}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, il Boscovasto', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, il Boscovasto entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura verde che è entrata nel campo di battaglia in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483928&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd347896b-da0a-4a0f-81e3-3ce23ae7fda2', 'multiverseId': 483928}, 'multiverseid': 483928}, {'name': '巨森、オラン＝リーフ', 'text': '巨森、オラン＝リーフはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{T}：このターンに戦場に出た緑の各クリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484179&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f56da1b5-0ebb-47ef-99f3-74c0db53702e', 'multiverseId': 484179}, 'multiverseid': 484179}, {'name': 'Oran-Rief, a Matavasta', 'text': 'Oran-Rief, a Matavasta, entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura verde que entrou no campo de batalha neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484430&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '146cb3cf-7feb-45ff-a632-2a904ebb87b9', 'multiverseId': 484430}, 'multiverseid': 484430}, {'name': 'Оран-Риф, Широколесье', 'text': 'Оран-Риф, Широколесье выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\n{T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое зеленое существо, которое вышло на поле битвы в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484681&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '320991cf-b653-4554-bb3b-9d7f2aab668f', 'multiverseId': 484681}, 'multiverseid': 484681}]", '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Basilika\', \'text\': \'Die Orzhov-Basilika kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Orzhov-Basilika ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483176&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a738b008-a13f-4a00-b029-620563a955f6\', \'multiverseId\': 483176}, \'multiverseid\': 483176}, {\'name\': \'Basílica orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basílica orzhov entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Basílica orzhov entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81e59ca6-9772-43df-a6a8-347a29b86984\', \'multiverseId\': 483427}, \'multiverseid\': 483427}, {\'name\': "Basilique d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e8ce734-a555-438d-9d98-e2e71eeb7dee\', \'multiverseId\': 483678}, \'multiverseid\': 483678}, {\'name\': \'Basilica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49fb3fe5-d17a-4556-8fb1-35762f8b1633\', \'multiverseId\': 483929}, \'multiverseid\': 483929}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの聖堂\', \'text\': \'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acd457ca-ef13-45d7-8bc0-49d88abe48df\', \'multiverseId\': 484180}, \'multiverseid\': 484180}, {\'name\': \'Basílica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Basílica Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Basílica Orzhov entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fe4dc0-92ab-4602-93d6-145d9373ebf7\', \'multiverseId\': 484431}, \'multiverseid\': 484431}, {\'name\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов\', \'text\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e9eb2c-dfc4-471b-9ecc-33fe6ebc19f5\', \'multiverseId\': 484682}, \'multiverseid\': 484682}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Form des Siegels ist genauso wichtig wie das Siegel selbst. Wenn es als Anhänger getragen wird, ist sein Träger ein Herr. Wenn es auf den Körper tätowiert ist, ist sein Träger ein Sklave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483126&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab74d2f5-9c8d-4f85-b282-fd7195ab74ce\', \'multiverseId\': 483126}, \'multiverseid\': 483126}, {\'name\': \'Sello orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'La forma del sello es tan importante como el sello mismo. Si se lleva en un medallón, su portador es un amo. Si está tatuado en el cuerpo, su portador es un esclavo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4481f220-08b1-4f0a-b380-017d0fa1618e\', \'multiverseId\': 483377}, \'multiverseid\': 483377}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Orzhov", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La forme du cachet est aussi importante que le cachet en lui-même. S\'il est sur un médaillon, son porteur est un maître. S\'il est tatoué, son porteur est un esclave.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483628&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b77355-2fbf-4eb5-86f6-0dd12501d8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 483628}, \'multiverseid\': 483628}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'La forma del sigillo è importante quanto il sigillo stesso. Se viene portato su un medaglione, chi lo porta è un maestro. Se è tatuato sul corpo, chi lo porta è uno schiavo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2a65c73-8b5d-4ea2-a46f-13285a07cbab\', \'multiverseId\': 483879}, \'multiverseid\': 483879}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'紋章が何にあるかは、紋章自身と同じぐらい重要だ。それが大メダルにあるなら、持ち主は主だ。それが身体の刺青なら、持ち主は奴隷だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4415c5-3b79-43e6-83fa-a86e1374be3a\', \'multiverseId\': 484130}, \'multiverseid\': 484130}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'A forma do símbolo é tão importante quanto o próprio símbolo. Se é carregado em um medalhão, seu portador é um mestre. Se é tatuado no corpo, seu portador é um escravo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70a3df7d-cdd0-4160-969b-f0bceddce34f\', \'multiverseId\': 484381}, \'multiverseid\': 484381}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Орзов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Форма этой печати так же важна, как и сама печать. Если ее носят как медальон, носящий ее — господин. Если это татуировка на теле, носящий ее — раб.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bffced3e-fca8-4c5d-bdb9-837cd781e289\', \'multiverseId\': 484632}, \'multiverseid\': 484632}]', '[{\'name\': \'Otrimi der Immerverspielte\', \'text\': \'Mutation {1}{B}{G}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit Mutation aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484739&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab02eb7-bc0d-4758-a4d8-4946813e88aa\', \'multiverseId\': 484739}, \'multiverseid\': 484739}, {\'name\': \'Otrimi, Siemprefeliz\', \'text\': \'Mutación {1}{B}{G}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nArrolla.\\nSiempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con la habilidad de mutación de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bestia pesadilla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23947d27-7b8e-4ea9-a4c0-dc97a4ee7347\', \'multiverseId\': 484759}, \'multiverseid\': 484759}, {\'name\': "Otrimi, l\'éternel taquin", \'text\': "Mutation {1}{B}{G}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, renvoyez une carte de créature avec la mutation ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc0436c9-5aec-4d4c-8650-dab801ba6874\', \'multiverseId\': 484779}, \'multiverseid\': 484779}, {\'name\': \'Otrimi, Sempre Giocoso\', \'text\': \'Mutazione {1}{B}{G}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nTravolgere\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio con mutazione dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Bestia Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa76710d-ed24-4306-92fc-c61983c28bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 484799}, \'multiverseid\': 484799}, {\'name\': \'永遠の陽気もの、オツリーミ\', \'text\': \'変容{1}{B}{G}{U}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーにその下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\nトランプル\\nこのクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの墓地から変容を持つクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4383e72f-be35-43da-af3f-4c1f27667f50\', \'multiverseId\': 484819}, \'multiverseid\': 484819}, {\'name\': \'Otrimi, Sempre Travesso\', \'text\': \'Mutação {1}{B}{G}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades da criatura de baixo.)\\nAtropelar\\nToda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, devolva o card de criatura alvo com mutação de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7d687a-e515-49c7-b643-50c84c45afe7\', \'multiverseId\': 484839}, \'multiverseid\': 484839}, {\'name\': \'Отрими, Вечный Проказник\', \'text\': \'Мутация {1}{B}{G}{U} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nПробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, верните целевую карту существа с Мутацией из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21469b3a-9ba7-4442-a613-212098cd175f\', \'multiverseId\': 484859}, \'multiverseid\': 484859}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pako, arkaner Retriever\', \'text\': \'Partner von Haldan, eifriger Arkanist\\nEile\\nImmer wenn Pako, arkaner Retriever, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil und lege auf jede von ihnen eine Apportiermarke. Lege für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Nichtkreatur-Karte eine +1/+1-Marke auf Pako.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa79da63-ed19-45dd-bdb7-ec69c962748e\', \'multiverseId\': 484740}, \'multiverseid\': 484740}, {\'name\': \'Pako, recobrador arcano\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Haldan, arcanista entusiasta.\\nPrisa.\\nSiempre que Pako, recobrador arcano ataque, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador y pon un contador de juego sobre cada una de ellas. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Pako por cada carta que no sea de criatura exiliada de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Perro elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb0fea1-b663-4ba0-ab43-f9fa0e01c02c\', \'multiverseId\': 484760}, \'multiverseid\': 484760}, {\'name\': \'Pako, retriever ésotérique\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Haldan, arcaniste avide\\nCélérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Pako, retriever ésotérique attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur et mettez un marqueur « rabattage » sur chacune d\'elles. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Pako pour chaque carte non-créature exilée de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : élémental et chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484780&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c66d908c-bcf6-4e6c-b9c5-01cca9104ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 484780}, \'multiverseid\': 484780}, {\'name\': \'Pako, Segugio da Riporto Arcano\', \'text\': \'Partner di Haldan, Avido Arcanista\\nRapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Pako, Segugio da Riporto Arcano attacca, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore e metti un segnalino riporto su ognuna di esse. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Pako per ogni carta non creatura esiliata in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Segugio Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ea686b9-026b-423c-9c3a-05e02a6c058b\', \'multiverseId\': 484800}, \'multiverseid\': 484800}, {\'name\': \'秘儀を運ぶもの、パコ\', \'text\': \'熱心な秘儀術師、ハルダンとの共闘\\n速攻\\n秘儀を運ぶもの、パコが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放し、それらの上に取得カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。これにより追放されたクリーチャーでないカード１枚につき、秘儀を運ぶもの、パコの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・猟犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f1f8011-09c4-4846-9cdc-2152cba7a115\', \'multiverseId\': 484820}, \'multiverseid\': 484820}, {\'name\': \'Pako, Buscador Arcano\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Haldan, Arcanista Ávido\\nÍmpeto\\nToda vez que Pako, Buscador Arcano, atacar, exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador e coloque um marcador de buscar em cada um deles. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Pako para cada card que não seja de criatura exilado dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elemental Sabujo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3388bc96-cb62-4699-88e2-f6146e00b537\', \'multiverseId\': 484840}, \'multiverseid\': 484840}, {\'name\': \'Пако, Колдовской Добытчик\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Халданом, Заядлым Арканистом\\nУскорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Пако, Колдовской Добытчик атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого игрока и положите один жетон получения на каждую из тех карт. Положите один жетон +1/+1 на Пако за каждую не являющуюся существом карту, изгнанную таким образом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Элементаль Пес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356c6bf5-3e03-46fd-b318-ee1843f5475e\', \'multiverseId\': 484860}, \'multiverseid\': 484860}]', "[{'name': 'Parasitischer Impuls', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, verliert ihr Beherrscher 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484944&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0641017-8ca4-4550-a3eb-b1aadd652762', 'multiverseId': 484944}, 'multiverseid': 484944}, {'name': 'Ímpetu parasitario', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, su controlador pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484995&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55a4f517-91fa-41a4-9ddf-bd33db0d16e4', 'multiverseId': 484995}, 'multiverseid': 484995}, {'name': 'Impetus parasitaire', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, son contrôleur perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485046&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f043cdc7-1e31-4d7c-95b2-25985d2cb854', 'multiverseId': 485046}, 'multiverseid': 485046}, {'name': 'Impeto Parassitario', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, il suo controllore perde 2 punti vita e tu guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485097&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a9d9178-31f0-43c3-a65f-ad9e8913fe51', 'multiverseId': 485097}, 'multiverseid': 485097}, {'name': '寄生の推進力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それのコントローラーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485148&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd47cfdd-5ed9-4022-b331-50f15c168363', 'multiverseId': 485148}, 'multiverseid': 485148}, {'name': 'Ímpeto Parasitário', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, seu controlador perde 2 pontos de vida e você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485199&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1addb2a-2748-4d8c-88e2-9be67d83e6e0', 'multiverseId': 485199}, 'multiverseid': 485199}, {'name': 'Паразитическое Побуждение', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, контролирующий его игрок теряет 2 жизни, а вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485250&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96f49cd9-2f29-4d96-ac67-a68de7eaf312', 'multiverseId': 485250}, 'multiverseid': 485250}]", "[{'name': 'Peitschenfalle', 'text': 'Falls in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Kreaturen unter der Kontrolle desselben Gegners ins Spiel gekommen sind, kannst du {U} bezahlen, anstatt die Manakosten für diesen Zauberspruch zu bezahlen.\\nBringe zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber — Falle', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483006&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c68f95e5-3252-448d-aae0-b48ca41ed810', 'multiverseId': 483006}, 'multiverseid': 483006}, {'name': 'Trampa de latigazo', 'text': 'Si un oponente tuvo dos o más criaturas que entraron al campo de batalla bajo su control este turno, puedes pagar {U} en lugar de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nRegresa dos criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.', 'type': 'Instantáneo — Trampa', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483257&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '229dae79-dbfc-4991-a925-b895d4925573', 'multiverseId': 483257}, 'multiverseid': 483257}, {'name': 'Piège cingleur', 'text': 'Si un adversaire a fait arriver, sous son contrôle, au moins deux créatures sur le champ de bataille ce tour-ci, vous pouvez payer {U} à la place du coût de mana de ce sort.\\nRenvoyez deux créatures ciblées dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.', 'type': 'Éphémère : piège', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483508&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aeebba8f-7424-480d-9d91-7285adc669a5', 'multiverseId': 483508}, 'multiverseid': 483508}, {'name': 'Trappola Sferzante', 'text': 'Se un avversario ha fatto entrare due o più creature nel campo di battaglia sotto il suo controllo in questo turno, puoi pagare {U} invece di pagare il costo di mana di questa magia.\\nFai tornare due creature bersaglio in mano ai loro proprietari.', 'type': 'Istantaneo — Trappola', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483759&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f7c6c69-45e1-467a-b0b4-52bfa2cba87e', 'multiverseId': 483759}, 'multiverseid': 483759}, {'name': '鞭打ちの罠', 'text': 'このターンに対戦相手１人が自分のコントロール下でクリーチャーを２体以上戦場に出していたなら、あなたは、この呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく{U}を支払ってもよい。\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント — 罠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484010&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c79a09c4-f613-41f3-99cb-b4f882928c6d', 'multiverseId': 484010}, 'multiverseid': 484010}, {'name': 'Armadilha de Chicotada', 'text': 'Se um oponente teve duas ou mais criaturas que entraram no campo de batalha sob o controle dele neste turno, você pode pagar {U} em vez de pagar o custo de mana desta mágica.\\nDevolva duas criaturas alvo para as mãos de seus donos.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea — Armadilha', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484261&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ab40c8e-1d30-4a13-bfad-33895bfadfe5', 'multiverseId': 484261}, 'multiverseid': 484261}, {'name': 'Хлестающая Западня', 'text': 'Если два или более существа вышли на поле битвы под контролем оппонента в этом ходу, вы можете заплатить {U} вместо уплаты мана-стоимости этого заклинания.\\nВерните два целевых существа в руки их владельцев.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание — Ловушка', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484512&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3029e4d3-3e35-4439-a2c1-85e933dc6037', 'multiverseId': 484512}, 'multiverseid': 484512}]", '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Wenn dieses Mana verwendet wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Kommandeur gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483177&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30734be4-446d-4146-8c44-ed818f4639f3\', \'multiverseId\': 483177}, \'multiverseid\': 483177}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824238cc-ca70-4a0a-8a97-3c50493b1b28\', \'multiverseId\': 483428}, \'multiverseid\': 483428}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee467dc-c665-4206-8aaf-2bbf3adb0c69\', \'multiverseId\': 483679}, \'multiverseid\': 483679}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c5a3215-7662-46b2-9239-8b7c55c56067\', \'multiverseId\': 483930}, \'multiverseid\': 483930}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナがあなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c06139-012a-47a6-bfa5-4bfb47149679\', \'multiverseId\': 484181}, \'multiverseid\': 484181}, {\'name\': \'Caminho da Ascendência\', \'text\': \'Caminho da Ascendência entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante. Quando aquele mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com seu comandante, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4e68f6e-03c9-41d1-935a-067ff8596a92\', \'multiverseId\': 484432}, \'multiverseid\': 484432}, {\'name\': \'Путь Предков\', \'text\': \'Путь Предков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира. Когда та мана тратится на разыгрывание заклинания существа, у которого есть такой же тип существа, как у вашего командира, предскажите 1.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63397e0-3d0f-458c-b9fc-f06604ef53ef\', \'multiverseId\': 484683}, \'multiverseid\': 484683}]', '[{\'name\': \'Portalmagierin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Portalmagierin während des Angreifer-deklarieren-Segments ins Spiel kommt, kannst du neu bestimmen, welchen Spieler oder Planeswalker eine angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl angreift. (Jene Kreatur kann weder ihren Beherrscher noch einen Planeswalker, den ihr Beherrscher kontrolliert, angreifen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f2f8e7-5313-4dc0-982c-331e02a5342e\', \'multiverseId\': 483001}, \'multiverseid\': 483001}, {\'name\': \'Maga del portal\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Maga del portal entre al campo de batalla durante el paso de declarar atacantes, puedes seleccionar de nuevo a qué jugador o planeswalker ataca la criatura atacante objetivo. (No puede atacar a su controlador ni a los planeswalkers de su controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef8e383-b3fa-4317-bbde-6e71edaea2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 483252}, \'multiverseid\': 483252}, {\'name\': \'Mage du portail\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand le Mage du portail arrive sur le champ de bataille pendant l\'étape de déclaration des attaquants, vous pouvez re-sélectionner quel joueur ou planeswalker une créature attaquante ciblée attaque. (Elle ne peut pas attaquer son contrôleur ou les planeswalkers de son contrôleur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c599457-7cc6-4e38-90ef-c49ccd440f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 483503}, \'multiverseid\': 483503}, {\'name\': \'Maga dei Portali\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Maga dei Portali entra nel campo di battaglia durante la sottofase di dichiarazione delle creature attaccanti, puoi cambiare il giocatore o il planeswalker che una creatura attaccante bersaglio sta attaccando. (Non può attaccare il suo controllore o i planeswalker del suo controllore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea9391e-7751-456d-897c-e93733994725\', \'multiverseId\': 483754}, \'multiverseid\': 483754}, {\'name\': \'門の魔道士\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n門の魔道士が攻撃クリーチャー指定ステップ中に戦場に出たとき、攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれが攻撃するプレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーを選び直してもよい。（それはそれのコントローラーやそれのコントローラーのプレインズウォーカーを攻撃することはできない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9adb911b-bb92-4970-8135-abf0a210d25e\', \'multiverseId\': 484005}, \'multiverseid\': 484005}, {\'name\': \'Maga do Portal\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Maga do Portal entra no campo de batalha durante a etapa de declaração de atacantes, você pode resselecionar qual jogador ou planeswalker a criatura atacante alvo está atacando. (Ela não pode atacar seu controlador nem os planeswalkers de seu controlador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a29e581-9ec5-4ff5-aabd-d406fa6936e0\', \'multiverseId\': 484256}, \'multiverseid\': 484256}, {\'name\': \'Волшебница Порталов\', \'text\': "Миг\\nКогда Волшебница Порталов выходит на поле битвы во время шага объявления атакующих, вы можете изменить то, какого игрока или planeswalker\'а атакует целевое атакующее существо. (Оно не может атаковать контролирующего его игрока или planeswalker\'ов контролирующего его игрока.)", \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87df5f8-db71-4f67-91c0-84a4310bbcf0\', \'multiverseId\': 484507}, \'multiverseid\': 484507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Preis des Ehrgeizes\', \'text\': \'Du ziehst drei Karten und verlierst 3 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Seine erste Welt zu erobern, ist am schwersten, aber Übung macht den Meister."\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c105f2-39aa-4fef-9e09-6814cc9960c4\', \'multiverseId\': 483008}, \'multiverseid\': 483008}, {\'name\': \'El precio de la ambición\', \'text\': \'Robas tres cartas y pierdes 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar tu primer mundo es el paso más difícil, al fin y al cabo. Después, mi poder crecía a medida que sometía plano tras plano, apoderándome de cualquier cosa que facilitase la siguiente invasión".\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'131874d2-cfdd-4a41-91d0-eeb6f4e86022\', \'multiverseId\': 483259}, \'multiverseid\': 483259}, {\'name\': "Le prix de l\'ambition", \'text\': \'Vous piochez trois cartes et vous perdez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est toujours la première conquête qui est la plus difficile. À chaque nouveau monde, mon pouvoir s\'est accru, rendant chaque conquête plus aisée que la précédente. »\\n—Ob Nixilis", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af510bbc-ef39-48db-b2ea-141e620a7505\', \'multiverseId\': 483510}, \'multiverseid\': 483510}, {\'name\': "Costo dell\'Ambizione", \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte e perdi 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La conquista del primo mondo, tutto sommato, è la più difficile. Nei viaggi da un piano all\\\'altro il mio potere si è rafforzato, rendendo ogni vittoria più semplice della precedente."\\n—Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2879aa8f-b93d-4a22-b592-cb144d589cb7\', \'multiverseId\': 483761}, \'multiverseid\': 483761}, {\'name\': \'野望の代償\', \'text\': \'あなたはカードを３枚引き、あなたは３点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「つまるところ最初の世界の征服が最も困難である。他の世界へと移り、次の征服をより容易にするものを手に入れていくことで、我の力は増大していった。」\\n――オブ・ニクシリス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'120000ea-a331-4198-ad8b-fb5bd8868073\', \'multiverseId\': 484012}, \'multiverseid\': 484012}, {\'name\': \'Custo da Ambição\', \'text\': \'Você compra três cards e perde 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Conquistar o primeiro mundo é o mais difícil, afinal. Meu poder crescia conforme eu passava de um mundo a outro, tomando qualquer coisa que facilitasse a conquista seguinte."\\n— Ob Nixilis\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3af838c2-3082-40bc-aac7-548b6ac437c5\', \'multiverseId\': 484263}, \'multiverseid\': 484263}, {\'name\': \'Цена Честолюбия\', \'text\': \'Вы берете три карты и теряете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Сложнее всего — захватить самый первый мир. Потом, когда я путешествовал между мирами, мое могущество только росло — я забирал себе всё, чтобы следующая битва была проще».\\n— Об-Никсилис\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fcd766a-ef23-4dc2-a41c-1496729b8938\', \'multiverseId\': 484514}, \'multiverseid\': 484514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die dich angreift und die er kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Kosten deines Widerstands werden aus deinem Verstand extrahiert."\\n—Nekusar der Gedankenreißer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302e89ed-657c-4ff3-8509-034ee5020369\', \'multiverseId\': 483002}, \'multiverseid\': 483002}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El coste de tu oposición se extraerá de tu cordura".\\n—Nekusar, el arrasamentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'637ce302-f29b-433a-a98f-b39abe695ea3\', \'multiverseId\': 483253}, \'multiverseid\': 483253}, {\'name\': \'Propagande\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le prix de votre opposition sera prélevé sur votre esprit. »\\n—Nekusar, le terrasseur d\'esprit", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fabce81b-e992-480b-acf8-523f672cb73c\', \'multiverseId\': 483504}, \'multiverseid\': 483504}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il costo della vostra opposizione verrà estratto dalle vostre menti."\\n—Nekusar, il Distruttore di Menti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0536bbcc-3b83-49ab-b3b6-9cf5a6fd4de9\', \'multiverseId\': 483755}, \'multiverseid\': 483755}, {\'name\': \'プロパガンダ\', \'text\': \'あなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につきそのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、クリーチャーは攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「敵対したことの対価は、お前の機知から頂くとしよう。」\\n――精神破壊者、ネクサル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c345331c-9b64-4fb0-941b-65810691a588\', \'multiverseId\': 484006}, \'multiverseid\': 484006}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura daquele controlador que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O custo de sua oposição será extraído de seus pensamentos."\\n— Nekusar, o Arrasador de Mentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0908e8-9c79-4f1d-b04a-4c86be2a6996\', \'multiverseId\': 484257}, \'multiverseid\': 484257}, {\'name\': \'Пропаганда\', \'text\': \'Существа не могут атаковать вас, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {2} за каждое из атакующих вас существ под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Цена твоего сопротивления будет взята из твоего разума».\\n— Некузар, Грабитель Мыслей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa618e1c-3b83-47cf-ae7f-0398f1f5ba78\', \'multiverseId\': 484508}, \'multiverseid\': 484508}]', "[{'name': 'Prunkvoller Palast', 'text': 'Der Prunkvolle Palast kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}, {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der dichte Dschungel macht einer üppigen, großzügigen Weite Platz. In ihrer Mitte ragen die Turmspitzen des Qarsi-Palasts empor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483174&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd495d159-6417-407d-b2d5-a0c2421d2079', 'multiverseId': 483174}, 'multiverseid': 483174}, {'name': 'Palacio opulento', 'text': 'El Palacio opulento entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}, {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La densa selva deja paso a un claro exuberante y suntuoso. En el centro se alzan los chapiteles del Palacio de Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483425&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00da3354-a85f-443d-9340-308fafbbbc7e', 'multiverseId': 483425}, 'multiverseid': 483425}, {'name': 'Palais opulent', 'text': 'Le Palais opulent arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}, {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La jungle dense laisse la place à une étendue luxuriante et flamboyante. En son centre se trouvent les tours du Palais de Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483676&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '929bb96a-0079-4a2c-b44d-cbd39c709734', 'multiverseId': 483676}, 'multiverseid': 483676}, {'name': 'Palazzo Opulento', 'text': 'Il Palazzo Opulento entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}, {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La fitta giungla si apre in una distesa lussureggiante e sontuosa, al cui centro si serrano le spire del Palazzo di Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483927&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5eeda733-3d31-40bf-ae71-099fff8f3728', 'multiverseId': 483927}, 'multiverseid': 483927}, {'name': '華やかな宮殿', 'text': '華やかな宮殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '鬱蒼としたジャングルは豊穣で豊かな地へと移り変わる。その中心に伸びているのがカルシ宮殿の尖塔である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484178&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '991db1e1-a983-4f90-ab39-853e00519482', 'multiverseId': 484178}, 'multiverseid': 484178}, {'name': 'Palácio Opulento', 'text': 'Palácio Opulento entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}, {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Uma grande área exuberante expande-se em meio à selva densa. Em seu centro, ficam as torres do Palácio Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484429&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '674d82c2-86b5-441f-b478-82e0ba81e40a', 'multiverseId': 484429}, 'multiverseid': 484429}, {'name': 'Роскошный Дворец', 'text': 'Роскошный Дворец выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}, {G} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Густые джунгли окружают пышную и изобильную долину. В ее центре возвышаются шпили дворца Карси.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484680&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9be7ed4-0e64-4fa1-bc1c-b52033c01cf9', 'multiverseId': 484680}, 'multiverseid': 484680}]", "[{'name': 'Präriefluss', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDer Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Ondu ist ein ausgedehntes Plateau, durchzogen von tiefen Furchen und Mäanderströmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483178&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43ee7ce9-411d-4d41-957c-dca7729b2e1c', 'multiverseId': 483178}, 'multiverseid': 483178}, {'name': 'Manantial de la pradera', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nEl Manantial de la pradera entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': 'El continente de Ondu es una gran meseta atravesada por profundas zanjas y ríos serpenteantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483429&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '79c90e32-1d31-46bf-9d80-785268292197', 'multiverseId': 483429}, 'multiverseid': 483429}, {'name': 'Prairie ruisselante', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLa Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': 'Le continent du Ondou est un vaste plateau traversé de fossés profonds et de rivières sinueuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483680&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61eca96b-2968-4f43-a54f-bfab22bc6194', 'multiverseId': 483680}, 'multiverseid': 483680}, {'name': 'Ruscello nella Prateria', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nIl Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Ondu è un vasto altopiano segnato da profondi fossati e fiumi sinuosi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483931&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d2536eb-440a-4196-98a6-790394a4f368', 'multiverseId': 483931}, 'multiverseid': 483931}, {'name': '大草原の川', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\nあなたが基本土地を２つ以上コントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': 'オンドゥ大陸は広大な平地である。そこを深い溝が縦横に走り、曲がりくねった川が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484182&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '978df2eb-e8f2-4c02-aea2-1451ace118e8', 'multiverseId': 484182}, 'multiverseid': 484182}, {'name': 'Riacho da Pradaria', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.)\\nRiacho da Pradaria entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Ondu é um vasto platô atravessado por desfiladeiros profundos e rios sinuosos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484433&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '810621a4-29fc-4955-92de-ba5b6ee39545', 'multiverseId': 484433}, 'multiverseid': 484433}, {'name': 'Ручей в Прерии', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {W} или {U}.)\\nРучей в Прерии выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Равнина Остров', 'flavor': 'Континент Онду — бескрайнее плато, изрезанное глубокими оврагами и извилистыми реками.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484684&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a32c2088-350f-4a4e-b0e0-28dd3262e28b', 'multiverseId': 484684}, 'multiverseid': 484684}]", "[{'name': 'Psychischer Impuls', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, wendest du Hellsicht 2 an.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484935&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ecd983a-7df1-45a5-8b14-4043a3721443', 'multiverseId': 484935}, 'multiverseid': 484935}, {'name': 'Ímpetu psíquico', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, adivinas 2.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484986&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ee11f37-0db3-487f-8fe5-06422c0a8814', 'multiverseId': 484986}, 'multiverseid': 484986}, {'name': 'Impetus psychique', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous appliquez regard 2.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485037&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db9c925a-fc3e-4472-b615-400b18ad2f49', 'multiverseId': 485037}, 'multiverseid': 485037}, {'name': 'Impeto Psichico', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, profetizzi 2.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485088&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3f1993b4-6d32-4775-b5f9-55bedcf7e522', 'multiverseId': 485088}, 'multiverseid': 485088}, {'name': '心理の推進力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは占術２を行う。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485139&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d219f3f-2e7c-4013-b8b2-b32be4e58642', 'multiverseId': 485139}, 'multiverseid': 485139}, {'name': 'Ímpeto Psíquico', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, você usa vidência 2.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485190&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4a842e-47b7-4189-8459-c20e693af7d4', 'multiverseId': 485190}, 'multiverseid': 485190}, {'name': 'Психическое Побуждение', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, вы предсказываете 2.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485241&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df084af3-3576-417f-a6e4-c62abb682cbf', 'multiverseId': 485241}, 'multiverseid': 485241}]", '[{\'name\': \'Psychosenkrabbler\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft des Psychosenkrabblers sind gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand.\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'„Falls dieses Gehirn nicht das Geheimnis des Serums entschlüsseln kann, dann füge noch mehr Gehirn dazu."\\n—Rhmir, Hand des Augurs\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483127&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42a8a3e3-f8d8-4123-8c24-669442bb5eab\', \'multiverseId\': 483127}, \'multiverseid\': 483127}, {\'name\': \'Rondador de psicosis\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Rondador de psicosis son iguales a la cantidad de cartas que haya en tu mano.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Si ese cerebro no puede descubrir el secreto del suero, entonces agreguen más cerebros".\\n—Rhmir, Mano de los presagios\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f2b7f5-a858-4cf8-829f-39623b1a1aaf\', \'multiverseId\': 483378}, \'multiverseid\': 483378}, {\'name\': \'Rampeur psychotique\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance du Rampeur psychotique sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : horreur\', \'flavor\': "« Si ce cerveau est incapable de découvrir le secret du sérum, ajoutez-en quelques-uns de plus. »\\n—Rhmir, Main de l\'Augure", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483629&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ade6944f-4a1a-45f8-b255-c5d944d2fba5\', \'multiverseId\': 483629}, \'multiverseid\': 483629}, {\'name\': \'Psicosi Strisciante\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione della Psicosi Strisciante sono pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Orrore\', \'flavor\': \'"Se quel cervello non riesce a capire il segreto del siero, allora aggiungi altro cervello."\\n—Rhmir, Mano dell\\\'Augure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7cadbaa-7452-4d4f-b53c-655bc089af82\', \'multiverseId\': 483880}, \'multiverseid\': 483880}, {\'name\': \'精神の病を這うもの\', \'text\': \'精神の病を這うもののパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'「その脳で血清の秘密が探れぬなら、もっと脳を足してやれ。」\\n――卜占の手、ルミーア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a96f8c-c010-4ccf-a171-d1591c08e4ab\', \'multiverseId\': 484131}, \'multiverseid\': 484131}, {\'name\': \'Réptil da Psicose\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Réptil da Psicose são ambos iguais ao número de cards em sua mão.\\nToda vez que você compra um card, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Horror\', \'flavor\': \'"Se aquele cérebro não consegue decifrar o segredo do soro, adicione mais cérebros."\\n— Rhmir, Mão do Áugure\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f688ab39-19c8-4bf5-9b97-e7f0809b9549\', \'multiverseId\': 484382}, \'multiverseid\': 484382}, {\'name\': \'Психозная Тварь\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Психозной Твари равны количеству карт в вашей руке.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': \'«Если этот мозг не может разгадать тайну сыворотки, то добавьте еще мозгов».\\n— Румир, Рука Гадателя\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ec28e6-d046-449a-8c80-3726bcbd66b7\', \'multiverseId\': 484633}, \'multiverseid\': 484633}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtige Jagdbynderin\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag\\nImmer wenn die Rachsüchtige Jagdbynderin angreift, lege eine Doppelschlag-Marke auf eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bringe den Welpen bei, wie man Zweibeiner tötet und warum es das Beste für das Rudel ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c20fdd6b-7277-4de7-b348-237d68fd8326\', \'multiverseId\': 484920}, \'multiverseid\': 484920}, {\'name\': \'Vinculacazas vengadora\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces.\\nSiempre que la Vinculacazas vengadora ataque, pon un contador de dañar dos veces sobre otra criatura atacante objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Enseño a los cachorros a matar rápidamente a los bípedos y el por qué es lo mejor para la manada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8036805-edc5-4e96-b0a7-daf2db94d95c\', \'multiverseId\': 484971}, \'multiverseid\': 484971}, {\'name\': \'Bridechasse vengeresse\', \'text\': \'Double initiative\\nÀ chaque fois que la Bridechasse vengeresse attaque, mettez un marqueur « double initiative » sur une autre créature attaquante ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'apprends aux petits à tuer les deux-pattes rapidement et pourquoi c\'est dans l\'intérêt de la bande. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485022&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80d1119-29d8-44d8-9ca8-c80e2b00973a\', \'multiverseId\': 485022}, \'multiverseid\': 485022}, {\'name\': \'Vincolacaccia Vendicatrice\', \'text\': "Doppio attacco\\nOgniqualvolta la Vincolacaccia Vendicatrice attacca, metti un segnalino doppio attacco su un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Insegno ai cuccioli come uccidere velocemente i bipedi e perché è la soluzione migliore per il branco."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc82ff04-3baf-4b8f-8255-4f009f2e2e06\', \'multiverseId\': 485073}, \'multiverseid\': 485073}, {\'name\': \'復讐する狩猟眷者\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃\\n復讐する狩猟眷者が攻撃するたび、他の攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に二段攻撃カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「幼獣に二本足を素早く殺す方法と、それが群れにとって最良である理由を教えているのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae037cf-92ff-41f3-b188-b3700bfa6b25\', \'multiverseId\': 485124}, \'multiverseid\': 485124}, {\'name\': \'Vinculadora de Caça Vingativa\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo\\nQuando Vinculadora de Caça Vingativa atacar, coloque um marcador de golpe duplo em outra criatura atacante alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu ensino os filhotes a matar os bípedes rápido, e ensino por que isso é melhor para o bando."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cfcd759-b137-4e91-8157-5bc030967deb\', \'multiverseId\': 485175}, \'multiverseid\': 485175}, {\'name\': \'Мстительная Узомантка Охоты\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Мстительная Узомантка Охоты атакует, положите один жетон Двойного удара на другое целевое атакующее существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я обучаю детенышей убивать двуногих быстро и объясняю, почему так лучше для прайда».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'041da38d-6146-4620-a605-536a0cfced88\', \'multiverseId\': 485226}, \'multiverseid\': 485226}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rakdos-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es wird aus Knochen gefertigt und in Blut gesiedet, aber ein Rakdos-Petschaft gilt erst dann als vollkommen, wenn es als Mordwaffe verwendet wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483128&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51755463-a039-4c9d-91a4-61f36bc0484e\', \'multiverseId\': 483128}, \'multiverseid\': 483128}, {\'name\': \'Sello rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Hecho de hueso y hervido en sangre, el sello rakdos no está terminado hasta que no se usa como un arma homicida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ace0e7d-bfba-4b1c-8db1-4dae14fa02a3\', \'multiverseId\': 483379}, \'multiverseid\': 483379}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Fait d\'os bouilli dans le sang, un cachet de Rakdos est considéré comme terminé lorsqu\'il a été utilisé comme arme pour un meurtre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483630&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a357899-bf6f-4889-a05e-4fb1868406dc\', \'multiverseId\': 483630}, \'multiverseid\': 483630}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Costruito con ossa e bollito nel sangue, un sigillo Rakdos non è considerato finito finché non viene usato come arma per un omicidio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd04f435-1af5-4fd9-be3d-b74b94a7f0c2\', \'multiverseId\': 483881}, \'multiverseid\': 483881}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ラクドスの印鑑は骨から作られ血で煮られ、さらに殺しの武器として用いられるまでは完成したとみなされない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c79455f-a02e-4e00-bfae-93cf09f7443d\', \'multiverseId\': 484132}, \'multiverseid\': 484132}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado com ossos e fervido em sangue, um Sinete Rakdos não é considerado finalizado até que tenha sido usado como arma assassina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12f96659-6209-43ca-8381-c1f170e5f775\', \'multiverseId\': 484383}, \'multiverseid\': 484383}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Ракдосов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сделанная из костей, вываренная в крови, печать Ракдосов все еще не считается законченной, пока она не послужит орудием убийства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e77c9e2-a8c3-4a70-b4f2-84b5237f34c4\', \'multiverseId\': 484634}, \'multiverseid\': 484634}]', "[{'name': 'Rakdos-Schlachtstätte', 'text': 'Die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483179&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9b890be-9fca-4fd8-8f51-e8828e096ac4', 'multiverseId': 483179}, 'multiverseid': 483179}, {'name': 'Carnarium rakdos', 'text': 'El Carnarium rakdos entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Carnarium rakdos entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483430&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daebc9d2-5c69-428c-963d-c0724430d751', 'multiverseId': 483430}, 'multiverseid': 483430}, {'name': 'Carnarium de Rakdos', 'text': 'Le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483681&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '530ed703-8a25-43d9-818f-817e767984dd', 'multiverseId': 483681}, 'multiverseid': 483681}, {'name': 'Carnario Rakdos', 'text': 'Il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483932&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b5b51e1-fa1b-4ce5-a9f7-8008cc94cd80', 'multiverseId': 483932}, 'multiverseid': 483932}, {'name': 'ラクドスの肉儀場', 'text': 'ラクドスの肉儀場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nラクドスの肉儀場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484183&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47396562-3c9b-4ce9-ae85-917e72a1e943', 'multiverseId': 484183}, 'multiverseid': 484183}, {'name': 'Carnarium Rakdos', 'text': 'Carnarium Rakdos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Carnarium Rakdos entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484434&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c862048d-d373-4c1a-8a00-856e5342fd0c', 'multiverseId': 484434}, 'multiverseid': 484434}, {'name': 'Карнариум Ракдосов', 'text': 'Карнариум Ракдосов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Карнариум Ракдосов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484685&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eacb5e72-47f7-4332-a33f-e73f43378149', 'multiverseId': 484685}, 'multiverseid': 484685}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rashmi, Schöpferin der Ewigkeiten\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Zauberspruch wirkst, decke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Nichtland-Karte ist, deren umgewandelte Manakosten kleiner sind als die des Zauberspruchs, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du die aufgedeckte Karte nicht wirkst, nimm sie auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483108&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33231926-4295-4eaf-a103-cb8ec78e7d7d\', \'multiverseId\': 483108}, \'multiverseid\': 483108}, {\'name\': \'Rashmi, escultora de eternidades\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo cada turno, muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido menor que el del hechizo, puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lanzas la carta mostrada, ponla en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6cfce7-f975-4e51-a8e6-f653927d3d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 483359}, \'multiverseid\': 483359}, {\'name\': \'Rashmi, façonneuse des Éternités\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort à chaque tour, révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte non-terrain avec un coût converti de mana inférieur à celui de ce sort, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne lancez pas la carte révélée, mettez-la dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483610&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68ce55b4-1529-42ac-b5ee-ba22895f5937\', \'multiverseId\': 483610}, \'multiverseid\': 483610}, {\'name\': \'Rashmi, Plasmatrice di Eternità\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci la tua prima magia in ogni turno, rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta non terra con costo di mana convertito inferiore a quello di quella magia, puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lanci la carta rivelata, aggiungila alla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a39e11-6b93-4989-805c-b07e97de4403\', \'multiverseId\': 483861}, \'multiverseid\': 483861}, {\'name\': \'永遠の造り手、ラシュミ\', \'text\': \'各ターンで初めてあなたが呪文を唱えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。それが、その呪文よりも点数で見たマナ・コストが小さく土地でないカードであるなら、あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その公開したカードを唱えないなら、それをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ffc0f8d-9a4a-410a-9a3e-81bc0f6c8887\', \'multiverseId\': 484112}, \'multiverseid\': 484112}, {\'name\': \'Rashmi, Artesã das Eternidades\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar sua primeira mágica em cada turno, revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card que não seja terreno com custo de mana convertido inferior ao daquela mágica, você poderá conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se não conjurar o card revelado desta forma, coloque-o em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f41c931-e1a2-4fd6-9c6b-5bf9efba56c5\', \'multiverseId\': 484363}, \'multiverseid\': 484363}, {\'name\': \'Рашми, Мастерица Вечности\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое заклинание в каждом ходу, покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это не являющаяся землей карта с конвертированной мана-стоимостью меньше, чем у того заклинания, то вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Если вы не разыгрываете показанную карту, положите ее в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38fa572d-2cc3-4283-af2c-cbf25265a19e\', \'multiverseId\': 484614}, \'multiverseid\': 484614}]', "[{'name': 'Raubtier-Impuls', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3, muss geblockt werden, falls möglich, und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484960&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c196a8fd-1a21-4ca3-b031-b4e0bd5e3213', 'multiverseId': 484960}, 'multiverseid': 484960}, {'name': 'Ímpetu depredador', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3, debe ser bloqueada si se puede y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485011&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ab0a7b8-cddd-43fd-acfc-6bc9ae18cabf', 'multiverseId': 485011}, 'multiverseid': 485011}, {'name': 'Impetus prédatoire', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3, doit être bloquée si possible, et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485062&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1230eaa-ad85-4d35-a493-6a8d01772a85', 'multiverseId': 485062}, 'multiverseid': 485062}, {'name': 'Impeto Predatorio', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3, deve essere bloccata, se possibile, ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485113&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e994261-2008-4a3b-8836-2a6f398a8f73', 'multiverseId': 485113}, 'multiverseid': 485113}, {'name': '捕食の推進力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け、可能ならブロックされなければならず、常に使嗾される。（それは可能なら各戦闘で攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485164&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12013098-fb23-4246-9383-aebe483b3a36', 'multiverseId': 485164}, 'multiverseid': 485164}, {'name': 'Ímpeto Predatório', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3, precisa ser bloqueada se houver bloqueadores aptos e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485215&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8977197b-4938-491b-b1c5-62dc34446854', 'multiverseId': 485215}, 'multiverseid': 485215}, {'name': 'Хищное Побуждение', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3, разъярено и должно быть заблокировано, если это возможно. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485266&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78f77941-e580-4c4a-90ec-9437860b1034', 'multiverseId': 485266}, 'multiverseid': 485266}]", '[{\'name\': \'Reinigende Nova\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre alle Kreaturen.\\n• Zerstöre alle Artefakte und Verzauberungen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Allerletzte, was die Dämonen erblickten, war Gnade in ihrer reinsten Form.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923f3d1b-7526-4050-ac13-b2fee7b9ee3a\', \'multiverseId\': 482962}, \'multiverseid\': 482962}, {\'name\': \'Nova purificadora\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye todas las criaturas.\\n• Destruye todos los artefactos y encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En sus últimos instantes, los demonios presenciaron la gracia en su forma más pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'140b6b29-06dc-4c52-aa52-72f842af6dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 483213}, \'multiverseid\': 483213}, {\'name\': \'Nova purificatrice\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez toutes les créatures.\\n• Détruisez tous les artefacts et tous les enchantements.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Dans leurs derniers instants, les démons contemplèrent la grâce à l\'état pur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3daeddfc-c4ca-467d-94cf-763d2cfd30dc\', \'multiverseId\': 483464}, \'multiverseid\': 483464}, {\'name\': \'Nova Purificatrice\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n● Distruggi tutte le creature.\\n● Distruggi tutti gli artefatti e gli incantesimi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Negli ultimi momenti di vita, i demoni contemplarono la grazia nella sua forma più pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb2b0d2-e9c1-4204-a5da-c659c36f6e60\', \'multiverseId\': 483715}, \'multiverseid\': 483715}, {\'name\': \'浄化の輝き\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\\n• アーティファクトとエンチャントをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最期の瞬間、悪魔たちは恩寵の本来の姿を見上げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dac3a3d-64f7-4424-8faf-7a4d7a8babbd\', \'multiverseId\': 483966}, \'multiverseid\': 483966}, {\'name\': \'Nova Purificadora\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua todas as criaturas.\\n• Destrua todos os artefatos e encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nos momentos finais, os demônios contemplaram a graça em sua forma mais pura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8fb14c-df4e-467b-8bcd-954be9a9a45d\', \'multiverseId\': 484217}, \'multiverseid\': 484217}, {\'name\': \'Очистительная Вспышка\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте все существа.\\n• Уничтожьте все артефакты и чары.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В последние секунды жизни демоны узрели милосердие в его чистейшем виде.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d243f0-96ab-49e7-a12a-2d3bce0b5999\', \'multiverseId\': 484468}, \'multiverseid\': 484468}]', "[{'name': 'Reiter von Gaven', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit\\nSowie die Reiter von Gaven ins Spiel kommen, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nMensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Schutz vor Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482977&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be9d1c8f-aeb0-4ba2-8ed0-4f5b717a1038', 'multiverseId': 482977}, 'multiverseid': 482977}, {'name': 'Jinetes de Gavony', 'text': 'Vigilancia.\\nEn cuanto los Jinetes de Gavony entren al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas Humano que controlas tienen protección contra las criaturas del tipo elegido.', 'type': 'Criatura — Caballero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483228&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33eb3ed7-0ce3-4e7d-80c7-29b6e5997590', 'multiverseId': 483228}, 'multiverseid': 483228}, {'name': 'Cavaliers de Gavonie', 'text': 'Vigilance\\nAu moment où les Cavaliers de Gavonie arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures Humain que vous contrôlez ont la protection contre les créatures du type choisi.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et chevalier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483479&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99a4d368-f162-41d9-a217-dc364b8d31e8', 'multiverseId': 483479}, 'multiverseid': 483479}, {'name': 'Cavalieri di Gavony', 'text': 'Cautela\\nMentre i Cavalieri di Gavony entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature Umano che controlli hanno protezione dalle creature del tipo scelto.', 'type': 'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483730&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '313d9689-1d40-428d-95fd-b0af5127df09', 'multiverseId': 483730}, 'multiverseid': 483730}, {'name': 'ガヴォニーの騎手', 'text': '警戒\\nガヴォニーの騎手が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしている人間・クリーチャーはプロテクション（その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー）を持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483981&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '141d1397-7d34-4a41-b003-5e13d36290c0', 'multiverseId': 483981}, 'multiverseid': 483981}, {'name': 'Cavaleiros de Gavony', 'text': 'Vigilância\\nConforme Cavaleiros de Gavony entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs criaturas do tipo Humano que você controla têm proteção contra criaturas do tipo escolhido.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484232&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6aeb1739-7299-4576-87d3-2e27c3632875', 'multiverseId': 484232}, 'multiverseid': 484232}, {'name': 'Гевонские Всадники', 'text': 'Бдительность\\nПри выходе Гевонских Всадников на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nСущества с типом Человек под вашим контролем имеют Защиту от существ выбранного типа.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Рыцарь', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484483&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbfa4b9f-fade-4da4-b5f7-d3e9a47c02bf', 'multiverseId': 484483}, 'multiverseid': 484483}]", '[{\'name\': \'Riesenholz-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Die Riesenholz-Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Riesenholz-Hydra stirbt, kannst du so viele +1/+1-Marken, wie +1/+1-Marken auf der Riesenholz-Hydra liegen, auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verteilen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483073&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302fc1b9-8bcf-4845-863d-2445dc757a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 483073}, \'multiverseid\': 483073}, {\'name\': \'Hidra del Bosque Extenso\', \'text\': \'La Hidra del Bosque Extenso entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nCuando la Hidra del Bosque Extenso muera, puedes distribuir una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 igual a la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Hidra del Bosque Extenso entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas que controles.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f0a692-836b-47df-a3b0-db853fa7ebd6\', \'multiverseId\': 483324}, \'multiverseid\': 483324}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de Vastebois\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre de Vastebois arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nQuand l\'Hydre de Vastebois meurt, vous pouvez répartir un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Hydre de Vastebois sur n\'importe quel nombre de créatures que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483575&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5cf4b0-8aad-4481-976e-47ebb882e290\', \'multiverseId\': 483575}, \'multiverseid\': 483575}, {\'name\': \'Idra di Boscovasto\', \'text\': "L\'Idra di Boscovasto entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nQuando l\'Idra di Boscovasto muore, puoi distribuire tra un qualsiasi numero di creature che controlli un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al numero di segnalini +1/+1 sull\'Idra di Boscovasto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47175f69-9ef6-49b1-be15-02056e1fe353\', \'multiverseId\': 483826}, \'multiverseid\': 483826}, {\'name\': \'巨森のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'巨森のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n巨森のハイドラが死亡したとき、あなたは、巨森のハイドラの上に置かれていた＋１/＋１カウンターの総数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターを、あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーの上にあなたの望むように割り振って置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171d2c13-3768-41e6-99ca-cce8400b9977\', \'multiverseId\': 484077}, \'multiverseid\': 484077}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Matavasta\', \'text\': \'Hidra de Matavasta entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nQuando Hidra de Matavasta morre, você pode distribuir entre qualquer número de criaturas que você controla uma quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao número de marcadores +1/+1 em Hidra de Matavasta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669c1559-715d-4b03-84b4-78cc05fc11a2\', \'multiverseId\': 484328}, \'multiverseid\': 484328}, {\'name\': \'Гидра Широколесья\', \'text\': \'Гидра Широколесья выходит на поле битвы с Х жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\nКогда Гидра Широколесья умирает, вы можете распределить жетоны +1/+1, количество которых равно количеству жетонов +1/+1 на Гидре Широколесья, между любым количеством существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94f350d-de91-4c0c-9839-a05e74cbd9f7\', \'multiverseId\': 484579}, \'multiverseid\': 484579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritter der weißen Orchidee\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn der Ritter der weißen Orchidee ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9299e97a-8315-451c-9e08-80419dbb84dc\', \'multiverseId\': 482972}, \'multiverseid\': 482972}, {\'name\': \'Caballero de la Orquídea Blanca\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando el Caballero de la Orquídea Blanca entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dacbf56-10bc-4ed9-8e8e-86db3b3e8052\', \'multiverseId\': 483223}, \'multiverseid\': 483223}, {\'name\': "Chevalier de l\'Orchidée blanche", \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand le Chevalier de l\'Orchidée blanche arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, la mettre sur le champ de bataille et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaeb9989-33ec-44f1-83fe-84feb3e8aac1\', \'multiverseId\': 483474}, \'multiverseid\': 483474}, {\'name\': "Cavaliere dell\'Orchidea Bianca", \'text\': "Attacco improvviso\\nQuando il Cavaliere dell\'Orchidea Bianca entra nel campo di battaglia, se un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45fef345-a221-4785-a660-8166f890f2b0\', \'multiverseId\': 483725}, \'multiverseid\': 483725}, {\'name\': \'白蘭の騎士\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n白蘭の騎士が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248dc8fb-f646-425d-8e27-3886a9a57c58\', \'multiverseId\': 483976}, \'multiverseid\': 483976}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro da Orquídea Branca\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nQuando Cavaleiro da Orquídea Branca entra no campo de batalha, se um oponente controlar mais terrenos que você, você poderá procurar em seu grimório um card de Planície, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb921e5d-8126-470c-95c9-8f3e95fc7c7f\', \'multiverseId\': 484227}, \'multiverseid\': 484227}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Белой Орхидеи\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКогда Рыцарь Белой Орхидеи выходит на поле битвы, если под контролем оппонента больше земель, чем под вашим контролем, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, положить ее на поле битвы, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41a19766-ff16-46a7-8437-9a276e8dd248\', \'multiverseId\': 484478}, \'multiverseid\': 484478}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruchloser Reichtum\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen mit umgewandelten Manakosten von jeweils X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Gold kauft Tod. Tod verdient Gold.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483112&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4bf9139-f676-43c7-9409-2e25fb53a7f7\', \'multiverseId\': 483112}, \'multiverseid\': 483112}, {\'name\': \'Riqueza vil\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo exilia las X primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos con coste de maná convertido de X o menos que se encuentren entre ellas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El oro compra la muerte. La muerte hace ganar oro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05db5be1-fcd0-44a2-881d-13a33acbe14c\', \'multiverseId\': 483363}, \'multiverseid\': 483363}, {\'name\': \'Richesse abominable\', \'text\': "L\'adversaire ciblé exile les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X parmi elles sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La mort coûte autant qu\'elle rapporte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483614&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb985965-9956-4409-bca0-ce109661613a\', \'multiverseId\': 483614}, \'multiverseid\': 483614}, {\'name\': \'Ricchezza Scellerata\', \'text\': \'Un avversario bersaglio esilia le prime X carte del suo grimorio. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X scelte tra esse senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'oro compra la morte. La morte porta l\'oro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c5acd6-6002-4426-b949-5ee9afa080ff\', \'multiverseId\': 483865}, \'multiverseid\': 483865}, {\'name\': \'悪逆な富\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚追放する。あなたはその中から、点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下の望む数の呪文を、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'金は死を買う。死は金を稼ぐ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4950b69-1b42-40cc-97d4-fee1c0838272\', \'multiverseId\': 484116}, \'multiverseid\': 484116}, {\'name\': \'Riqueza Abominável\', \'text\': \'O oponente alvo exila X cards do topo do próprio grimório. Você pode conjurar qualquer número de mágicas com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X dentre eles sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O ouro compra a morte. A morte vale ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04dd4f4-093f-4b9c-ad73-d30ceb71ab54\', \'multiverseId\': 484367}, \'multiverseid\': 484367}, {\'name\': \'Богатство Злодея\', \'text\': \'Целевой оппонент изгоняет Х верхних карт своей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть любое количество находящихся среди них заклинаний с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более X без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Золото покупает смерть. Смерть приносит золото.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a26ff92-8e70-4449-b8ce-c64da42734f8\', \'multiverseId\': 484618}, \'multiverseid\': 484618}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruft die Kupferjacken\', \'text\': \'Streben — Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{W} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Gegnern deiner Wahl. Erzeuge X 1/1 weiße Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielsteine, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die jene Gegner kontrollieren.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Alarmkristalle aufleuchten, machen sich die besten Krieger von Drannith auf den Weg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484921&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30262fe8-1221-4f6a-822c-f23bc277c691\', \'multiverseId\': 484921}, \'multiverseid\': 484921}, {\'name\': \'Llamar a las Capas de Cobre\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Te cuesta {1}{W} más lanzar este hechizo por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de oponentes objetivo. Crea X fichas de criatura Soldado Humano blancas 1/1, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que esos oponentes controlan.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando destellan los cristales de alarma, los mejores de Drannith acuden a la llamada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5088cd03-ae15-4ade-8b21-1ab372fc42ca\', \'multiverseId\': 484972}, \'multiverseid\': 484972}, {\'name\': \'Appelez les Capes de cuivre !\', \'text\': "Obstination — Ce sort coûte {1}{W} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre d\'adversaires ciblés. Créez X jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat, X étant le nombre de créatures que ces adversaires contrôlent.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Quand les cristaux d\'alerte s\'illuminent, c\'est l\'élite de Drannith qui répond à l\'appel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485023&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6afa19-0a86-4127-a0c4-4eb846316851\', \'multiverseId\': 485023}, \'multiverseid\': 485023}, {\'name\': \'Convocare le Giubbe Ramate\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Questa magia costa {1}{W} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di avversari bersaglio. Crea X pedine creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianche, dove X è il numero di creature controllate da quegli avversari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Quando i cristalli d\'allarme si illuminano, i migliori soldati di Drannith rispondono alla chiamata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c89c3f8-1e55-4ba9-8741-a180c47f3dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 485074}, \'multiverseid\': 485074}, {\'name\': \'銅纏いの呼集\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{W}多くなる。\\n望む数の対戦相手を対象とする。白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体生成する。Ｘはそれらの対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'警報水晶が光るとき、ドラニスの警官たちがそれに応える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d287bf7-45ac-4fb1-9aaa-a430d5757034\', \'multiverseId\': 485125}, \'multiverseid\': 485125}, {\'name\': \'Convocar os Gibões de Cobre\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Esta mágica custa {1}{W} a mais para ser conjurada para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de oponentes alvo. Crie X fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado, sendo X o número de criaturas que aqueles oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os cristais se acendem em alarme, os melhores de Drannith atendem ao chamado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31864624-ac94-4b95-9e9b-f600abace2a4\', \'multiverseId\': 485176}, \'multiverseid\': 485176}, {\'name\': \'Созыв Медных Кителей\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1}{W} больше.\\nВыберите любое количество целевых оппонентов. Создайте X фишек существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат, где X — количество существ под контролем тех оппонентов.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Когда вспыхивают кристаллы, предупреждающие об опасности, отборные воины Драннита спешат на зов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab689150-92a4-48c4-87c2-4333b7dc386f\', \'multiverseId\': 485227}, \'multiverseid\': 485227}]', "[{'name': 'Rückenfels-Hügelchen', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Falls einem Gegner in diesem Zug bereits 7 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483195&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b5eba30-d242-422a-b775-e91550bbcc2a', 'multiverseId': 483195}, 'multiverseid': 483195}, {'name': 'Loma espina rocosa', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si un oponente recibió 7 o más puntos de daño este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483446&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d963fcb-2d4e-4c35-b8a9-3b887107889c', 'multiverseId': 483446}, 'multiverseid': 483446}, {'name': 'Tertre de Rochépine', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{R}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si un adversaire a subi au moins 7 blessures ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483697&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec2ea0bf-0a7c-4985-9705-876d8be29eca', 'multiverseId': 483697}, 'multiverseid': 483697}, {'name': 'Poggio Spina Rocciosa', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se a un avversario sono stati inflitti 7 o più danni in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483948&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74477b47-01f1-4811-a125-e5a949456119', 'multiverseId': 483948}, 'multiverseid': 483948}, {'name': '背骨岩の小山', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\n{R}, {T}：このターンに対戦相手１人に７点以上のダメージが与えられていたなら、あなたはその追放されているカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484199&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '330f5d26-4ed3-4816-8d31-e16031c1713f', 'multiverseId': 484199}, 'multiverseid': 484199}, {'name': 'Colina da Rocha Espinhosa', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se um oponente sofreu 7 pontos de dano ou mais neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484450&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e93f0db-0335-413d-b426-8390e90389ec', 'multiverseId': 484450}, 'multiverseid': 484450}, {'name': 'Хребтокаменный Холм', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если в этом ходу оппоненту было нанесено не менее 7 повреждений.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484701&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd7a03e38-169b-42e8-9128-af121fd0338c', 'multiverseId': 484701}, 'multiverseid': 484701}]", "[{'name': 'Sandsteppenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Sandsteppenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Was standhaft ist, überlebt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483184&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d47de31-25fe-4f8f-87ac-6412174a54ea', 'multiverseId': 483184}, 'multiverseid': 483184}, {'name': 'Ciudadela esteparenosa', 'text': 'La Ciudadela esteparenosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Aquello que resiste, sobrevive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483435&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '554584a6-352c-4df0-b3dd-62cecb29b125', 'multiverseId': 483435}, 'multiverseid': 483435}, {'name': 'Citadelle de la steppe de sable', 'text': 'La Citadelle de la steppe de sable arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Ce qui perdure survit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483686&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5af8a527-129a-4cd8-a9a2-74baff181e53', 'multiverseId': 483686}, 'multiverseid': 483686}, {'name': 'Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose', 'text': 'La Roccaforte delle Steppe Sabbiose entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Ciò che resiste, sopravvive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483937&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36280ab0-7948-40ca-bbfb-b05157f29fdd', 'multiverseId': 483937}, 'multiverseid': 483937}, {'name': '砂草原の城塞', 'text': '砂草原の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '耐久できるものだけが生き残る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484188&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '523839c9-a296-4e74-b2a3-5105a03b221b', 'multiverseId': 484188}, 'multiverseid': 484188}, {'name': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa', 'text': 'Cidadela da Estepe Arenosa entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}, {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Aquilo que resiste sobrevive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484439&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '420ef3fb-8b3d-431b-a874-61c7e799fbb4', 'multiverseId': 484439}, 'multiverseid': 484439}, {'name': 'Цитадель в Песчаной Степи', 'text': 'Цитадель в Песчаной Степи выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}, {B} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Тот, кто может выстоять, выживает.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484690&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bef6a321-944d-41a1-bc85-d9747b484cef', 'multiverseId': 484690}, 'multiverseid': 484690}]", '[{\'name\': \'Satyr-Pfadfinder\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Satyr-Pfadfinder ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Der erste Satyr, der nach einem rauschenden Fest wieder das Bewusstsein erlangt, muss einen Ort für die nächste Feier ausfindig machen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483067&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b3c3a87-128f-472a-9bf1-4b9424cfb1f4\', \'multiverseId\': 483067}, \'multiverseid\': 483067}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro buscacaminos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sátiro buscacaminos entre al campo de batalla, muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'El sátiro que se despierte primero después de un festín tiene que buscar el lugar del siguiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1853cc07-7ef8-4f01-bd4d-2e339b15c3a4\', \'multiverseId\': 483318}, \'multiverseid\': 483318}, {\'name\': \'Guidevoie satyre\', \'text\': \'Quand le Guidevoie satyre arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : satyre\', \'flavor\': "Le premier satyre qui s\'éveille après une orgie doit trouver le lieu de la suivante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483569&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'481b348e-7989-4277-9554-aa4ca8030a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 483569}, \'multiverseid\': 483569}, {\'name\': \'Satiro Apripista\', \'text\': \'Quando il Satiro Apripista entra nel campo di battaglia, rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano una carta terra scelta tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'Il satiro che si sveglia per primo dopo un baccanale deve cercare il luogo che ospiterà il prossimo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4a0eb3-fcf2-4cd1-b0d1-cbdf65964b55\', \'multiverseId\': 483820}, \'multiverseid\': 483820}, {\'name\': \'サテュロスの道探し\', \'text\': \'サテュロスの道探しが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚公開する。あなたは、その中から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'お祭りの後に目覚めた最初のサテュロスは、次のお祭りの現場を探さなければならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd744d9-18d6-414e-9e61-844ac48c3764\', \'multiverseId\': 484071}, \'multiverseid\': 484071}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro Trilheiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Sátiro Trilheiro entrar no campo de batalha, revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de terreno dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'O primeiro sátiro que acorda depois de uma festança deve procurar um local para a próxima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1915dd9c-c5fa-4580-b23f-d0705822e902\', \'multiverseId\': 484322}, \'multiverseid\': 484322}, {\'name\': \'Сатир-Проводник\', \'text\': \'Когда Сатир-Проводник выходит на поле битвы, покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту земли в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир\', \'flavor\': \'Первый сатир, который просыпается после гулянки, должен найти место для следующей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d56a741-63f5-47a4-a53e-5e05f5da6dc5\', \'multiverseId\': 484573}, \'multiverseid\': 484573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sceada-Brutplatz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du eine Karte umwandelst oder abwirfst, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du deine Überlebenskünste testen willst, dann besuche den Obeliskenpfad, während die Sceadas jagen."\\n—Etha, Geweihte der Rhet-Saat\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aad7332-983f-4048-8d2f-f6e0af35b439\', \'multiverseId\': 482989}, \'multiverseid\': 482989}, {\'name\': \'Refugio de dracos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo o descartes una carta, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Draco azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Si de verdad deseas poner a prueba tus habilidades de supervivencia, pasea por la Senda de los obeliscos cuando los dracos se estén alimentando".\\n—Etha, iniciada de la simiente Rhet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'914810da-ff54-4f5e-956d-19b12b81f2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 483240}, \'multiverseid\': 483240}, {\'name\': \'Havre de drakôns\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous recyclez ou vous défaussez d\'une carte, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous souhaitez vraiment mettre vos techniques de survie à l\'épreuve, allez marcher le long de la Voie des obélisques à l\'heure du repas des drakôns. »\\n—Etha, adepte de la moisson Rhet", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3fde472-d27f-4bc4-8298-d6975ce4f9eb\', \'multiverseId\': 483491}, \'multiverseid\': 483491}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio dei Draghetti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta cicli o scarti una carta, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Draghetto 2/2 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se volete davvero mettere alla prova il vostro istinto di sopravvivenza, percorrete la Via degli obelischi mentre i draghetti consumano il loro pasto!"\\n—Etha, iniziata della messe Rhet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bb5874-3db1-419c-9432-4e9ee4d4d213\', \'multiverseId\': 483742}, \'multiverseid\': 483742}, {\'name\': \'ドレイクの安息地\', \'text\': \'あなたがカードを１枚サイクリングするか捨てるたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「生き残る術を試したいなら、ドレイクが餌をあさる中オベリスクの道を歩いてみるのがいいでしょうね。」\\n――レト一門の修練者、イータ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c790ec52-7e7e-42f2-88e3-c5c731f6e774\', \'multiverseId\': 483993}, \'multiverseid\': 483993}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio dos Dragonetes\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você recicla ou descarta um card, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura azul 2/2 do tipo Dragonete com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você quer mesmo testar suas habilidades de sobrevivência, ande pelo Caminho dos Obeliscos quando os dragonetes estão comendo."\\n— Etha, iniciada da safra Rhet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a59a2be-69c7-4eea-b29c-b7b2d1b945a4\', \'multiverseId\': 484244}, \'multiverseid\': 484244}, {\'name\': \'Убежище Дрейков\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл или сбрасываете карту, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 синий Дрейк с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Если ты и вправду хочешь испытать свое мастерство выживания, пройди Путем Обелисков, когда дрейки вылетают на охоту».\\n— Эта, послушница снопа Рет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1867e1be-6376-41b2-936e-29de0027af98\', \'multiverseId\': 484495}, \'multiverseid\': 484495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenblut-Grat\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der Boden Otarias zeigt immer noch die Spuren von Gemetzeln längst vergangener Konflikte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483188&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e1df8b3-8924-4a90-bf24-29ef8e0a7232\', \'multiverseId\': 483188}, \'multiverseid\': 483188}, {\'name\': \'Cordillera Sangresombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La masacre de conflictos pasados aún mancha la tierra otariana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24da7f1-184b-4a68-8cf5-3b00cad6d2df\', \'multiverseId\': 483439}, \'multiverseid\': 483439}, {\'name\': "Contreforts d\'Ombresang", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Le sang des conflits d\'autrefois souille encore le sol d\'Otaria.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7aa30cb-cf22-447e-b9c7-183de9782553\', \'multiverseId\': 483690}, \'multiverseid\': 483690}, {\'name\': \'Costa di Sangueombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le carneficine dei conflitti di tempi lontani macchiano ancora il terreno di Otaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c51470-7ec2-472b-95bb-eb49b3256429\', \'multiverseId\': 483941}, \'multiverseid\': 483941}, {\'name\': \'シャドーブラッドの尾根\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'長きに渡った昔の闘争の血の痕跡が、いまだにオタリアの土にしみついている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'789a7a86-6251-4f0b-9e5f-fd565c594899\', \'multiverseId\': 484192}, \'multiverseid\': 484192}, {\'name\': \'Serra de Sanguesombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A carnificina dos conflitos há muito encerrados ainda macula o solo otariano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a642af9d-1618-4def-82e0-5a8771cd8077\', \'multiverseId\': 484443}, \'multiverseid\': 484443}, {\'name\': \'Хребет Тенекровья\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Кровь давно позабытых войн все еще пропитывает землю Отарии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f73a5420-5bc6-4142-a328-f1a2aa798dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 484694}, \'multiverseid\': 484694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Dieben verbreiteten sich rasch Gerüchte von einem Labyrinth ohne Mauern und einem Schatz von unermesslichem Wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483182&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15bb486b-9c03-4a87-a8c6-fe6f1fcb39bf\', \'multiverseId\': 483182}, \'multiverseid\': 483182}, {\'name\': \'Pasaje del bribón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los ladrones se extendió enseguida el rumor de un laberinto sin muros y de un premio más allá de todas las expectativas de riqueza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f5459f4-aa6c-4291-a475-4dec060a65ee\', \'multiverseId\': 483433}, \'multiverseid\': 483433}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rumeur d\'un labyrinthe sans parois et d\'un trésor inestimable se répandit rapidement chez les malandrins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483684&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975550c7-464e-4e8b-9afa-0941b9e9f845\', \'multiverseId\': 483684}, \'multiverseid\': 483684}, {\'name\': \'Passaggio dei Farabutti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tra i ladri si diffusero rapidamente voci che parlavano di un labirinto senza muri e di un bottino oltre ogni immaginazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f75a7127-1a26-4cfb-82de-30a5746d8abf\', \'multiverseId\': 483935}, \'multiverseid\': 483935}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠る壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9571381a-332a-43fd-be4d-ede4a4d023a2\', \'multiverseId\': 484186}, \'multiverseid\': 484186}, {\'name\': \'Passagem do Ladino\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: A criatura alvo não pode ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os boatos sobre um labirinto sem paredes com um tesouro de inestimável valor se espalharam rapidamente entre os ladrões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d214b753-638d-45d0-b23d-194d26f2703c\', \'multiverseId\': 484437}, \'multiverseid\': 484437}, {\'name\': \'Разбойничий Проход\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Среди воров быстро распространились слухи о лабиринте без стен, скрывающем сокровище невообразимой ценности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'069f88a8-902a-4342-89bd-8d3d789ba4cf\', \'multiverseId\': 484688}, \'multiverseid\': 484688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlüpfrige Butzbynderin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFluchsicher\\nWenn die Schlüpfrige Butzbynderin ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Fluchsicher-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Bewege dann eine beliebige Anzahl an Marken von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, auf jene Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709e11c7-faec-4742-89d3-be9a5fa8ef88\', \'multiverseId\': 484964}, \'multiverseid\': 484964}, {\'name\': \'Vinculabogles resbaladiza\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nAntimaleficio.\\nCuando la Vinculabogles resbaladiza entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador de antimaleficio sobre la criatura objetivo. Luego mueve cualquier cantidad de contadores de entre las criaturas que controlas a esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64395c5b-a944-4459-9135-5dfe3bcac3aa\', \'multiverseId\': 485015}, \'multiverseid\': 485015}, {\'name\': \'Bridebogle insaisissable\', \'text\': "Flash\\nDéfense talismanique\\nQuand la Bridebogle insaisissable arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur « défense talismanique » sur la créature ciblée. Puis déplacez n\'importe quel nombre de marqueurs de créatures que vous contrôlez sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d33d2d64-1a46-4b3e-ab24-8cb7d86fea28\', \'multiverseId\': 485066}, \'multiverseid\': 485066}, {\'name\': \'Vincolabogle Sfuggente\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nAnti-malocchio\\nQuando la Vincolabogle Sfuggente entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino anti-malocchio su una creatura bersaglio. Poi sposta su quella creatura un qualsiasi numero di segnalini scelti tra le creature che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b39bc26a-d216-4f74-8960-11d3a8aa13db\', \'multiverseId\': 485117}, \'multiverseid\': 485117}, {\'name\': \'ぬめる化け眷者\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n呪禁\\nぬめる化け眷者が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に呪禁カウンターを１個置く。その後、あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーの上から望む数のカウンターをそのクリーチャーの上に移動する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e4a2fb-3d2e-4ee2-81ab-dafdd0c53e06\', \'multiverseId\': 485168}, \'multiverseid\': 485168}, {\'name\': \'Vinculadora de Bogles Escorregadia\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nResistência a magia\\nQuando Vinculadora de Bogles Escorregadia entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador de resistência a magia na criatura alvo. Em seguida, mova qualquer número de marcadores de criaturas que você controla para aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab63c029-0d88-4b15-97c1-8f69ab9803df\', \'multiverseId\': 485219}, \'multiverseid\': 485219}, {\'name\': \'Увертливая Узомантка Боглов\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПорчеустойчивость\\nКогда Увертливая Узомантка Боглов выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон Порчеустойчивости на целевое существо. Затем переместите на то существо любое количество жетонов с существ под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a000c16e-3a2b-49e0-adec-9bf29ebc19bc\', \'multiverseId\': 485270}, \'multiverseid\': 485270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmerzliche Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Eldrazi sich ausbreiteten, scheuten Zendikars Verteidiger auf der Suche nach Geheimnissen, die ihnen einen Vorteil bringen könnten, keine Gefahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1944ab1e-38a0-498c-8c8c-f5ef2fdbf71b\', \'multiverseId\': 483013}, \'multiverseid\': 483013}, {\'name\': \'Verdades que duelen\', \'text\': \'Converger — Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar este hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que los Eldrazi avanzaban, se dejó de pensar en los riesgos de cualquier secreto que otorgara ventaja a los defensores de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685da483-3b7a-4057-ab94-b7964d00ca62\', \'multiverseId\': 483264}, \'multiverseid\': 483264}, {\'name\': \'Vérités douloureuses\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Avec la multiplication des Eldrazi, aucun périple n\'était trop dangereux s\'il permettait de dénicher un secret pouvant avantager les défenseurs de Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccd8507-d068-4c4a-9c78-09fd16c1fdb1\', \'multiverseId\': 483515}, \'multiverseid\': 483515}, {\'name\': \'Verità Dolorose\', \'text\': \'Convergenza — Pesca X carte e perdi X punti vita, dove X è il numero di colori di mana spesi per lanciare questa magia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Con l\'avanzata degli Eldrazi, nessun segreto che potesse offrire un vantaggio ai difensori di Zendikar venne considerato troppo pericoloso da perseguire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4eec9f-a0e8-472f-a013-54aa60817f2c\', \'multiverseId\': 483766}, \'multiverseid\': 483766}, {\'name\': \'苦い真理\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― あなたはカードをＸ枚引き、あなたはＸ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージが増えるにつれ、ゼンディカー防衛隊を有利にする秘密であれば、探すのに命を惜しむ者は少なくなっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b1d2b81-6a1e-4408-b5df-51cefbcd4564\', \'multiverseId\': 484017}, \'multiverseid\': 484017}, {\'name\': \'Verdades Dolorosas\', \'text\': \'Convergir — Você compra X cards e perde X pontos de vida, sendo X o número de cores de mana gasto para conjurar esta mágica.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme os Eldrazi se alastraram, nenhum segredo que pudesse dar alguma vantagem aos defensores de Zendikar foi considerado perigoso demais para ser investigado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5126832-ebea-4d88-a55a-e46e06075fa7\', \'multiverseId\': 484268}, \'multiverseid\': 484268}, {\'name\': \'Болезненная Правда\', \'text\': \'Схождение — Вы берете X карт и теряете X жизней, где Х — число цветов маны, потраченной на разыгрывание этого заклинания.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Эльдрази распространялись по Зендикару, и опасности, подстерегавшие на пути к секретам, дающим преимущества в бою с чудовищами, перестали иметь значение для защитников этого мира.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d637e3-63a9-438c-a650-d1efb3ff17ee\', \'multiverseId\': 484519}, \'multiverseid\': 484519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarmintelligenz\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kannst du ihn bzw. sie kopieren. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kinder der Heuschrecken-Gottheit waren zahllos und fraßen sich unaufhaltsam durch die Verteidigung der Stadt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f55ebc-4fd7-49c8-9f79-4138594002d9\', \'multiverseId\': 483003}, \'multiverseid\': 483003}, {\'name\': \'Inteligencia de enjambre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes copiar ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los incontables hijos del Dios Langosta devoraron sin cesar todo rastro de protección de la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1918ee96-e6e4-4a6c-b245-8f207c1f07c4\', \'multiverseId\': 483254}, \'multiverseid\': 483254}, {\'name\': "Intelligence de l\'essaim", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez copier ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les innombrables enfants du Dieu-Sauterelle dévoraient sans relâche toute trace des protections de la ville.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a04c0b8d-4463-45cd-a6ed-9002b339c405\', \'multiverseId\': 483505}, \'multiverseid\': 483505}, {\'name\': \'Intelligenza dello Sciame\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi copiare quella magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La progenie della locusta divina era innumerevole e divorava senza sosta ogni traccia della protezione della città.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed465700-f7cb-4f12-816b-ba8351b9289d\', \'multiverseId\': 483756}, \'multiverseid\': 483756}, {\'name\': \'大群の諜報\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたはその呪文をコピーしてもよい。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'蝗の神が送り出した無数の仔虫は、街の守りを跡形もなく食らい尽くした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a4ec0d-07c6-48a5-ad94-01814f1a9a50\', \'multiverseId\': 484007}, \'multiverseid\': 484007}, {\'name\': \'Inteligência do Enxame\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, você pode copiar aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os filhos do Deus Gafanhoto eram inumeráveis e devoravam implacavelmente todo vestígio da proteção da cidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c63d4a17-0208-4aec-a031-b5e5d42e960c\', \'multiverseId\': 484258}, \'multiverseid\': 484258}, {\'name\': \'Разум Роя\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, вы можете скопировать то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Бесчисленные дети Бога-Саранчи без устали пожирали последние остатки защиты города.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba3d5b3f-23af-4621-ba39-3d9b38c98d00\', \'multiverseId\': 484509}, \'multiverseid\': 484509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarzseher aus Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nSchicksalsstunde — Solange du 5 Lebenspunkte oder weniger hast, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Massenhaft greifen die Unheiligen Thrabens Tore an. Und du glaubst immer noch nicht, dass das Ende naht?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f7adefb-d8fe-4a36-bf29-b8f62d904b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 482983}, \'multiverseid\': 482983}, {\'name\': \'Condenador de Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Humano blanca 1/1.\\nHora fatídica — Mientras tengas 5 vidas o menos, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Hordas de impíos se lanzan contra las puertas de Thraben! ¿Todavía niegas que el fin se acerca?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4a492b-7ac7-49b3-a483-c0d97cc5d7a6\', \'multiverseId\': 483234}, \'multiverseid\': 483234}, {\'name\': \'Conte-destin de Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain.\\nHeure fatidique — Tant que vous avez 5 points de vie ou moins, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Les maudits grattent aux portes de Thraben ! Niez-vous toujours que la fin approche ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483485&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af5f2aa6-7096-441a-b4b8-7e6b34b8fa54\', \'multiverseId\': 483485}, \'multiverseid\': 483485}, {\'name\': \'Profeta di Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crea una pedina creatura Umano 1/1 bianca.\\nOra fatidica — Fintanto che hai 5 o meno punti vita, le altre creature che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Sciami di sacrileghi graffiano i cancelli di Thraben! Vuoi ancora negare che la fine si avvicina?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557bb0ee-47e3-4e13-b5e9-e8c8284e2bd6\', \'multiverseId\': 483736}, \'multiverseid\': 483736}, {\'name\': \'スレイベンの破滅預言者\', \'text\': \'{T}：白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n窮地 ― あなたのライフが５点以下であるかぎり、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「スレイベンの門に、山ほどの不浄のもの共の爪だ！これでも終末が近いことを否定するのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826fffd7-01b9-41f6-9406-0ec83eb2eac6\', \'multiverseId\': 483987}, \'multiverseid\': 483987}, {\'name\': \'Agoureiro de Thraben\', \'text\': \'{T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano.\\nHora fatal — Enquanto você tiver 5 ou menos pontos de vida, as outras criaturas que você controla receberão +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"Há uma multidão de malditos escalando os portões de Thraben! Vocês ainda negam que o fim está chegando?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895f67c7-4c23-4bfd-b46c-3252a7f182b6\', \'multiverseId\': 484238}, \'multiverseid\': 484238}, {\'name\': \'Трейбенский Предрекатель Беды\', \'text\': \'{T}: создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек.\\nРоковой час — Пока количество ваших жизней меньше или равно 5, другие существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Полчища неосвященных ломятся в ворота Трейбена! И вы продолжаете отрицать, что грядет конец?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15054f64-86fd-4473-96d4-589ae336dec7\', \'multiverseId\': 484489}, \'multiverseid\': 484489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwebende Steilklippe\', \'text\': \'Die Schwebende Steilklippe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Schwebende Steilklippe ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483194&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8185943b-e496-420a-8298-662a65fa9721\', \'multiverseId\': 483194}, \'multiverseid\': 483194}, {\'name\': \'Acantilado elevado\', \'text\': \'El Acantilado elevado entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acantilado elevado entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9739d698-e98d-4475-ac67-274a0e52e0e3\', \'multiverseId\': 483445}, \'multiverseid\': 483445}, {\'name\': \'Falaise aérienne\', \'text\': "La Falaise aérienne arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Falaise aérienne arrive sur le champ de bataille, la créature ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483696&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d04dab-857d-4068-ab77-750e8732149a\', \'multiverseId\': 483696}, \'multiverseid\': 483696}, {\'name\': \'Scogliera a Strapiombo\', \'text\': \'La Scogliera a Strapiombo entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Scogliera a Strapiombo entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'233159be-4541-481d-af09-c87783f7b90b\', \'multiverseId\': 483947}, \'multiverseid\': 483947}, {\'name\': \'飛翔する海崖\', \'text\': \'飛翔する海崖はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n飛翔する海崖が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901636d7-c057-4790-88ec-64db9a140386\', \'multiverseId\': 484198}, \'multiverseid\': 484198}, {\'name\': \'Penhasco Marinho Altivo\', \'text\': \'Penhasco Marinho Altivo entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Penhasco Marinho Altivo entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c44afca2-fb4b-4573-905e-9fb47c2bb7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 484449}, \'multiverseid\': 484449}, {\'name\': \'Парящая Береговая Скала\', \'text\': \'Парящая Береговая Скала выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Парящая Береговая Скала выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает Полет до конца хода.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb3cffe-0932-4608-b6ef-1a839c3d9bad\', \'multiverseId\': 484700}, \'multiverseid\': 484700}]', "[{'name': 'Schwebende Wiesen', 'text': 'Die Schwebenden Wiesen kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483150&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e197d9a-3834-4b5e-9150-9d3c60f9fb4a', 'multiverseId': 483150}, 'multiverseid': 483150}, {'name': 'Pradera a la deriva', 'text': 'La Pradera a la deriva entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483401&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ccfd415-e104-4f06-8cb6-394086bd5e13', 'multiverseId': 483401}, 'multiverseid': 483401}, {'name': 'Prairie dérivante', 'text': 'La Prairie dérivante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483652&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1dcc5f82-1e6c-441f-b69e-e4581ab4e6e2', 'multiverseId': 483652}, 'multiverseid': 483652}, {'name': 'Prateria Sospesa', 'text': 'La Prateria Sospesa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483903&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dee4f6d4-2de8-4810-b8c7-3a46fae2e939', 'multiverseId': 483903}, 'multiverseid': 483903}, {'name': '漂う牧草地', 'text': '漂う牧草地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484154&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ebbe0a7-5af1-44e8-9394-596fdf834f2c', 'multiverseId': 484154}, 'multiverseid': 484154}, {'name': 'Campina Flutuante', 'text': 'Campina Flutuante entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484405&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b68f31a7-ac74-45ac-b88b-3390824545e9', 'multiverseId': 484405}, 'multiverseid': 484405}, {'name': 'Дрейфующий Луг', 'text': 'Дрейфующий Луг выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484656&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ad133fb-c7a8-4696-9f1a-b92ec2a12c3a', 'multiverseId': 484656}, 'multiverseid': 484656}]", "[{'name': 'Schwelendes Marschland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDas Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Guul Draz ist ein geothermisches Sumpfland, in dem die Luft vor Hitze und fauligem Gestank flimmert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483193&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55cdcec4-1d47-4357-b004-335ae3b25a6a', 'multiverseId': 483193}, 'multiverseid': 483193}, {'name': 'Cenagal ardiente', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'El continente de Guul Draz es una ciénaga geotérmica que respira calor y putrefacción.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483444&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '733e0c34-54ad-40a4-85a6-3e5f65097fee', 'multiverseId': 483444}, 'multiverseid': 483444}, {'name': 'Marécage fumant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Le continent de Guul Draz est un marais géothermique, puant de chaleur et de décomposition.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483695&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f04ad382-7354-4b41-802a-71570124ae03', 'multiverseId': 483695}, 'multiverseid': 483695}, {'name': 'Palude Rovente', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.)\\nLa Palude Rovente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Guul Draz è un terreno geotermico paludoso che puzza di afa e putrefazione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483946&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc7722cd-3f90-42cf-b15c-8e9fdd797d6d', 'multiverseId': 483946}, 'multiverseid': 483946}, {'name': '燻る湿地', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nあなたが基本土地を２つ以上コントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': 'グール・ドラズ大陸は温沼地である。地熱による高温と腐敗で燻っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484197&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18f13479-ce04-4de9-b59c-245324beb032', 'multiverseId': 484197}, 'multiverseid': 484197}, {'name': 'Pântano Ardente', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.)\\nPântano Ardente entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Guul Draz é um grande pântano geotérmico abafado e decadente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484448&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be17cdc8-6852-4c8a-8b32-46862ba0ca16', 'multiverseId': 484448}, 'multiverseid': 484448}, {'name': 'Тлеющее Болото', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B} или {R}.)\\nТлеющее Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора', 'flavor': 'Континент Гуул-Драз — разогретое подземным теплом болото, от которого исходят душные гнилостные пары.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484699&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93d6de3e-ef07-43e7-b130-318b99e67608', 'multiverseId': 484699}, 'multiverseid': 484699}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schädelstrammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/-1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Das Gehirn ist ein wunderbarer Schatz, der in einem langweiligen Behältnis aus Knochen versteckt ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483130&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce7632d-20cc-499f-9ca8-15eb53b09839\', \'multiverseId\': 483130}, \'multiverseid\': 483130}, {\'name\': \'Engrampacráneo\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/-1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, roba dos cartas.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'La mente es una recompensa hermosa encerrada en un molesto contenedor óseo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57376aa4-474f-437d-94d8-e128dc24261b\', \'multiverseId\': 483381}, \'multiverseid\': 483381}, {\'name\': \'Pincecrâne\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/-1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "L\'esprit est une belle récompense enveloppée d\'une pellicule chiante en os.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483632&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7cf7ecd-45f3-4ace-8064-6c5e4fa5a1df\', \'multiverseId\': 483632}, \'multiverseid\': 483632}, {\'name\': \'Morsa Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/-1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, pesca due carte.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'La mente è un dono bellissimo racchiuso in un fastidioso contenitore osseo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e734bc-38b9-47b6-bfb7-b4f33c08b2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 483883}, \'multiverseid\': 483883}, {\'name\': \'頭蓋骨絞め\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/－１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、カードを２枚引く。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'精神とは、面倒臭い骨の器に閉じ込められた素晴らしい褒章だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e90bb80-17bf-477c-92cd-29b0db23d48a\', \'multiverseId\': 484134}, \'multiverseid\': 484134}, {\'name\': \'Pinça Craniana\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/-1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morrer, compre dois cards.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'A mente é um dom maravilhoso envolto em um recipiente ósseo incômodo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a3e5d3-c56e-4aca-98e7-ba8bc943fdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 484385}, \'multiverseid\': 484385}, {\'name\': \'Черепной Зажим\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/-1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо умирает, возьмите две карты.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Разум — это чудесная награда, заключенная в совершенно лишний костяной сосуд.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b7f1eb-151b-48b7-972e-d6ed568dd107\', \'multiverseId\': 484636}, \'multiverseid\': 484636}]', "[{'name': 'Schädelwinder', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Schädelwinder ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück und bestimme dann einen Gegner. Der Spieler bringt eine Karte aus seinem Friedhof auf seine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ophis', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483068&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '454ae537-b02c-4df4-ba1e-76e2cd704bfd', 'multiverseId': 483068}, 'multiverseid': 483068}, {'name': 'Crótalo quebrantahuesos', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Crótalo quebrantahuesos entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano y luego elige un oponente. Ese jugador regresa una carta de su cementerio a su mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Víbora', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483319&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2549dcb7-0435-4c25-9818-b9c9a9a3d3b4', 'multiverseId': 483319}, 'multiverseid': 483319}, {'name': 'Crotale golgothien', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nQuand le Crotale golgothien arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main, puis choisissez un adversaire. Ce joueur renvoie dans sa main une carte de son cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : serpent', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483570&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52a80581-8876-4085-a25d-c318676b36ab', 'multiverseId': 483570}, 'multiverseid': 483570}, {'name': 'Crotalo dei Teschi', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\nQuando il Crotalo dei Teschi entra nel campo di battaglia, riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero, poi scegli un avversario. Quel giocatore riprende in mano una carta dal suo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Serpente', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483821&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27cfd83f-445e-4b1b-b56e-97cd220aa1ee', 'multiverseId': 483821}, 'multiverseid': 483821}, {'name': '髑髏蛇', 'text': '接死\\n髑髏蛇が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。その後対戦相手１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地からカード１枚を自分の手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484072&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4323b7a5-d11d-4d99-9fa6-07f502087cb9', 'multiverseId': 484072}, 'multiverseid': 484072}, {'name': 'Serpente da Caveira', 'text': 'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Serpente da Caveira entrar no campo de batalha, devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão e depois escolha um oponente. Aquele jogador devolve um card do próprio cemitério para a própria mão.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cobra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484323&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3cdfa891-b3eb-4dc7-8550-1111c3c28c50', 'multiverseId': 484323}, 'multiverseid': 484323}, {'name': 'Змея Черепа', 'text': 'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Змея Черепа выходит на поле битвы, верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку, затем выберите оппонента. Тот игрок возвращает карту из своего кладбища в свою руку.', 'type': 'Существо — Змея', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484574&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e8dd7b0-78e2-4fae-8d95-0340e96deb51', 'multiverseId': 484574}, 'multiverseid': 484574}]", '[{\'name\': \'Seele von Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\n{3}{B}{B}: Bringe bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\n{3}{B}{B}, schicke die Seele von Innistrad aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Bringe bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f278f551-c3ea-4461-9134-33e3f6faa3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 483016}, \'multiverseid\': 483016}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\n{3}{B}{B}: Regresa hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exiliar el Alma de Innistrad de tu cementerio: Regresa hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415c87e8-b1c5-408c-ab11-fde94b25b32c\', \'multiverseId\': 483267}, \'multiverseid\': 483267}, {\'name\': "Âme d\'Innistrad", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\n{3}{B}{B} : Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exilez l\'Âme d\'Innistrad depuis votre cimetière : Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483518&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683da525-599f-414b-b9b6-6e3a454085ba\', \'multiverseId\': 483518}, \'multiverseid\': 483518}, {\'name\': \'Anima di Innistrad\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\n{3}{B}{B}: Riprendi in mano fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{3}{B}{B}, Esilia l\'Anima di Innistrad dal tuo cimitero: Riprendi in mano fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99399137-f518-4569-be1d-ff374f49150b\', \'multiverseId\': 483769}, \'multiverseid\': 483769}, {\'name\': \'イニストラードの魂\', \'text\': \'接死\\n{3}{B}{B}：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大３枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n{3}{B}{B}, あなたの墓地からイニストラードの魂を追放する：あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード最大３枚を対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'593d3091-2887-478d-8cac-71379e81465e\', \'multiverseId\': 484020}, \'multiverseid\': 484020}, {\'name\': \'Alma de Innistrad\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\n{3}{B}{B}: Devolva até três cards de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\n{3}{B}{B}, exile Alma de Innistrad do seu cemitério: Devolva até três cards de criatura alvo do seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a6d1cf-b597-4c8a-9138-27d3ccf950bf\', \'multiverseId\': 484271}, \'multiverseid\': 484271}, {\'name\': \'Душа Иннистрада\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\n{3}{B}{B}: верните не более трех целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\n{3}{B}{B}, изгоните Душу Иннистрада из вашего кладбища: верните не более трех целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c69f1994-ab1c-4eaa-9e83-acbbb5846289\', \'multiverseId\': 484522}, \'multiverseid\': 484522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelen-Stein\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte abwirft, kannst du {W} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die schönsten Seelen strahlen selbst nach dem Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e3298bb-7d5f-408c-9020-382b465a9c56\', \'multiverseId\': 482979}, \'multiverseid\': 482979}, {\'name\': \'Hito espiritual\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador descarte una carta, puedes pagar {W}. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Las almas más bellas brillan incluso en la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71705b25-55ca-4903-a5d4-74fcdadbfe24\', \'multiverseId\': 483230}, \'multiverseid\': 483230}, {\'name\': \'Cairn des esprits\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur se défausse d\'une carte, vous pouvez payer {W}. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Même dans la mort, les plus belles âmes resplendissent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483481&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23db257-a4c0-446b-abf8-aeb83c5f4b01\', \'multiverseId\': 483481}, \'multiverseid\': 483481}, {\'name\': \'Tumulo Spirituale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore scarta una carta, puoi pagare {W}. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le anime più belle risplendono persino nella morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0030efba-c662-4c05-ae1d-62b29349c02e\', \'multiverseId\': 483732}, \'multiverseid\': 483732}, {\'name\': \'精霊の石塚\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがカードを１枚捨てるたび、あなたは{W}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'絶美な魂は死の際までも輝かしい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6df236-9a2a-4b28-919c-cd413212f15f\', \'multiverseId\': 483983}, \'multiverseid\': 483983}, {\'name\': \'Caerne do Espírito\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador descarta um card, você pode pagar {W}. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'As mais belas almas brilham mesmo na morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4089daa7-179e-4c33-ba48-f46531e8de99\', \'multiverseId\': 484234}, \'multiverseid\': 484234}, {\'name\': \'Курган Духов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок сбрасывает карту, вы можете заплатить {W}. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Самые прекрасные души сияют и после смерти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47662ce8-c0f7-4bc7-b810-0b307665502c\', \'multiverseId\': 484485}, \'multiverseid\': 484485}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenschinder\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nFalls eine Kreaturenkarte mit Flugfähigkeit durch die Wühlen-Fähigkeit des Seelenschinders ins Exil geschickt wurde, hat der Seelenschinder Flugfähigkeit. Das Gleiche gilt für Eile, Erstschlag, Doppelschlag, Fluchsicherheit, Lebensverknüpfung, Reichweite, Todesberührung, Unzerstörbarkeit, Wachsamkeit sowie das Verursachen von Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb4b8f86-96b3-4468-8b7f-0d07cd56f3a8\', \'multiverseId\': 483017}, \'multiverseid\': 483017}, {\'name\': \'Desollador de almas\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nSi una carta de criatura con la habilidad de volar fue exiliada con la habilidad de excavar del Desollador de almas, el Desollador de almas tiene la habilidad de volar. Lo mismo vale para las habilidades de dañar primero, dañar dos veces, toque mortal, prisa, antimaleficio, indestructible, vínculo vital, alcance, arrollar y vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c550e43f-7597-458b-929e-60846225e049\', \'multiverseId\': 483268}, \'multiverseid\': 483268}, {\'name\': "Écorcheur d\'âme", \'text\': "Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nSi une carte de créature avec le vol a été exilée par la capacité de fouille de l\'Écorcheur d\'âme, l\'Écorcheur d\'âme a le vol. C\'est vrai aussi pour l\'initiative, la double initiative, le contact mortel, la célérité, la défense talismanique, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la portée, le piétinement et la vigilance.", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e421e34-f11b-4939-ac6d-88cea5238b16\', \'multiverseId\': 483519}, \'multiverseid\': 483519}, {\'name\': \'Scorticatore di Anime\', \'text\': "Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nSe con l\'abilità esumare dello Scorticatore di Anime è stata esiliata una carta creatura con volare, lo Scorticatore di Anime ha volare. Lo stesso vale per attacco improvviso, doppio attacco, tocco letale, rapidità, anti-malocchio, indistruttibile, legame vitale, raggiungere, travolgere e cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d63343c-2dee-4814-a397-229ed34dc14e\', \'multiverseId\': 483770}, \'multiverseid\': 483770}, {\'name\': \'魂剥ぎ\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\n魂剥ぎの探査能力によって、飛行を持っているクリーチャー・カードが追放されたなら、魂剥ぎは飛行を持つ。先制攻撃、二段攻撃、接死、速攻、呪禁、破壊不能、絆魂、到達、トランプル、警戒についても同様である。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9957f5-3c79-46ec-a42d-ecb1e322fbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 484021}, \'multiverseid\': 484021}, {\'name\': \'Flagelador de Alma\', \'text\': \'Esquadrinhar (Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério quando conjura esta mágica paga por {1}.)\\nSe um card de criatura com voar foi exilado pela habilidade esquadrinhar de Flagelador de Alma, Flagelador de Alma tem voar. O mesmo vale para iniciativa, golpe duplo, toque mortífero, ímpeto, resistência a magia, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, alcance, atropelar e vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df3f870b-e058-444a-840e-82961396bbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 484272}, \'multiverseid\': 484272}, {\'name\': \'Свежеватель Душ\', \'text\': \'Выкапывание (Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nЕсли способностью Выкапывания Свежевателя Душ была изгнана карта существа с Полетом, Свежеватель Душ имеет Полет. То же самое относится к Первому удару, Двойному удару, Смертельному касанию, Ускорению, Порчеустойчивости, Неразрушимости, Цепи жизни, Захвату, Пробивному удару и Бдительности.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e80d3b59-f4fd-4a49-aa62-b68ea9ceb7dc\', \'multiverseId\': 484523}, \'multiverseid\': 484523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selbstjustiz der Bürgerwehr\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt die Selbstjustiz der Bürgerwehr einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Es beginnt mit einem Flüstern und endet mit einem roten Brüllen aus Feuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483043&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'147b58a9-a395-4e7b-a3df-abe8b7764efd\', \'multiverseId\': 483043}, \'multiverseid\': 483043}, {\'name\': \'Veredicto del justiciero\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Humano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el Veredicto del justiciero hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Comienza como un susurro y acaba como el rugido incandescente del fuego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b47252-3e87-45d3-ad28-27be11813b03\', \'multiverseId\': 483294}, \'multiverseid\': 483294}, {\'name\': \'Justice vigilante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la Justice vigilante inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Elle commence par un murmure et se termine par le ronflement d\'une flamme rouge.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e603b96-163d-4c21-b9d1-ab1319e0903b\', \'multiverseId\': 483545}, \'multiverseid\': 483545}, {\'name\': \'Giustizia dei Vigilanti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Umano entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, la Giustizia dei Vigilanti infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Inizia come un sussurro e finisce con il rosso boato del fuoco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7e4ee09-5049-4015-b4b4-7a77a5b504b9\', \'multiverseId\': 483796}, \'multiverseid\': 483796}, {\'name\': \'自警団の正義\', \'text\': \'人間が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。自警団の正義はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'囁きに始まり、火を噴く紅蓮の咆哮に終わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92da305e-8b7c-461d-9349-5f69de90453a\', \'multiverseId\': 484047}, \'multiverseid\': 484047}, {\'name\': \'Justiça dos Justiceiros\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Humano entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Justiça dos Justiceiros causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Começa com um sussurro... e termina com um brado vermelho de fogo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fb472c-dbad-4a68-aee4-85758d987e74\', \'multiverseId\': 484298}, \'multiverseid\': 484298}, {\'name\': \'Правосудие Ополченцев\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Человек выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Правосудие Ополченцев наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Оно начинается с шепота, а заканчивается пламенем костра.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27ba62db-e252-4b1e-a6f5-58ef1fa88bac\', \'multiverseId\': 484549}, \'multiverseid\': 484549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Selektive Anpassung\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Bestimme davon je eine Karte mit Flugfähigkeit, Erstschlag, Doppelschlag, Todesberührung, Eile, Fluchsicherheit, Unzerstörbarkeit, Lebensverknüpfung, Bedrohlichkeit, Reichweite, Wachsamkeit sowie verursacht Trampelschaden. Bringe eine der bestimmten Karten ins Spiel, die anderen bestimmten Karten auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f84bb3b3-c993-430a-bea3-479f518fc1f8\', \'multiverseId\': 484963}, \'multiverseid\': 484963}, {\'name\': \'Adaptación selectiva\', \'text\': \'Muestra las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Elige de entre ellas una carta con la habilidad de volar, una carta con la habilidad de dañar primero, y así sucesivamente con dañar dos veces, toque mortal, prisa, antimaleficio, indestructible, vínculo vital, amenaza, alcance, arrollar y vigilancia. Pon una de las cartas elegidas en el campo de batalla, las otras cartas elegidas en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2268a7d0-a7c2-4ea7-89de-025f25594808\', \'multiverseId\': 485014}, \'multiverseid\': 485014}, {\'name\': \'Adaptation sélective\', \'text\': "Révélez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Parmi elles, choisissez une carte avec le vol, une carte avec l\'initiative et ainsi de suite pour la double initiative, le contact mortel, la célérité, la défense talismanique, l\'indestructible, le lien de vie, la menace, la portée, le piétinement et la vigilance. Mettez une des cartes choisies sur le champ de bataille, les autres cartes choisies dans votre main, et le reste dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a13d66-0b4c-4a2b-bc3a-e06be0d8f90a\', \'multiverseId\': 485065}, \'multiverseid\': 485065}, {\'name\': \'Adattamento Selettivo\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Scegli tra esse una carta con volare, una carta con attacco improvviso e così via per doppio attacco, tocco letale, rapidità, anti-malocchio, indistruttibile, legame vitale, minacciare, raggiungere, travolgere e cautela. Metti sul campo di battaglia una delle carte scelte, aggiungi alla tua mano le altre carte scelte e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f323bf8-0bed-4122-80f9-14d06f6c7878\', \'multiverseId\': 485116}, \'multiverseid\': 485116}, {\'name\': \'選択的順応\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを７枚公開する。あなたはその中から、飛行を持つカード１枚と、先制攻撃を持つカード１枚と、二段攻撃、接死、速攻、呪禁、破壊不能、絆魂、威迫、到達、トランプル、警戒についてもそれぞれそれを持つカード１枚を選ぶ。それらの選ばれたカードのうち１枚を戦場に出し、他の選ばれたカードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99169b4a-f722-49b4-91d2-4dd130dbaaa4\', \'multiverseId\': 485167}, \'multiverseid\': 485167}, {\'name\': \'Adaptação Seletiva\', \'text\': \'Revele os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Escolha dentre eles um card com voar, um card com iniciativa e assim por diante para golpe duplo, toque mortífero, ímpeto, resistência a magia, indestrutível, vínculo com a vida, ameaçar, alcance, atropelar e vigilância. Coloque um dos cards escolhidos no campo de batalha. Coloque os outros cards escolhidos em sua mão e o restante em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3894772a-1933-4c8e-9cee-28d564701dec\', \'multiverseId\': 485218}, \'multiverseid\': 485218}, {\'name\': \'Избирательная Адаптация\', \'text\': \'Покажите семь верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Выберите находящуюся среди них карту с Полетом, карту с Первым ударом и так далее для Бдительности, Двойного удара, Захвата, Неразрушимости, Порчеустойчивости, Пробивного удара, Смертельного касания, Угрозы, Ускорения и Цепи жизни. Положите одну из выбранных карт на поле битвы, остальные выбранные карты — в вашу руку, а оставшиеся — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe0f5ca3-280f-4af2-8a55-06ae4e89cfef\', \'multiverseId\': 485269}, \'multiverseid\': 485269}]', "[{'name': 'Selesnija-Heiligtum', 'text': 'Das Selesnija-Heiligtum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Selesnija-Heiligtum ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483187&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de908a11-41c7-47f4-9bec-32027fcadb7a', 'multiverseId': 483187}, 'multiverseid': 483187}, {'name': 'Santuario selesnya', 'text': 'El Santuario selesnya entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Santuario selesnya entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483438&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b9d074c-375c-4448-b14d-41af9243e108', 'multiverseId': 483438}, 'multiverseid': 483438}, {'name': 'Sanctuaire de Selesnya', 'text': 'Le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Sanctuaire de Selesnya arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483689&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e772cf50-d2b0-458d-92de-136c5657b3ce', 'multiverseId': 483689}, 'multiverseid': 483689}, {'name': 'Santuario di Selesnya', 'text': 'Il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Santuario di Selesnya entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483940&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '132ef21d-5b7f-4be6-b891-0f80defcc35b', 'multiverseId': 483940}, 'multiverseid': 483940}, {'name': 'セレズニアの聖域', 'text': 'セレズニアの聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nセレズニアの聖域が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484191&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a06b6b68-a68f-4c81-afe1-1ed0083c86e9', 'multiverseId': 484191}, 'multiverseid': 484191}, {'name': 'Santuário Selesnya', 'text': 'Santuário Selesnya entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Santuário Selesnya entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484442&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe1804b4-f8c7-436f-a62f-dbc1e297f477', 'multiverseId': 484442}, 'multiverseid': 484442}, {'name': 'Святилище Селезнии', 'text': 'Святилище Селезнии выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Святилище Селезнии выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484693&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dccbcc42-5d57-4fe1-b157-c24a7b4d7727', 'multiverseId': 484693}, 'multiverseid': 484693}]", '[{\'name\': \'Shabraz der Himmelshai\', \'text\': \'Partner von Brallin, Himmelshai-Reiter\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Shabraz den Himmelshai und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{W/U}: Ein Mensch deiner Wahl erhält Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Hai, Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65486c8f-59c4-451f-a846-71f445c66de2\', \'multiverseId\': 484741}, \'multiverseid\': 484741}, {\'name\': \'Shábraz, el Aerotiburón\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Brallin, jinete del Aerotiburón.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Shábraz, el Aerotiburón y ganas 1 vida.\\n{W/U}: El Humano objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ave tiburón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422294de-2507-4993-9c02-205629e9767c\', \'multiverseId\': 484761}, \'multiverseid\': 484761}, {\'name\': \'Shabraz, le squale céleste\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Brallin, chevaucheur de squale céleste\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Shabraz, le squale céleste et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{W/U} : Un humain ciblé acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : requin et oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484781&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79887c5-8b0d-449f-8f16-6d14b3777272\', \'multiverseId\': 484781}, \'multiverseid\': 484781}, {\'name\': "Shabraz, l\'Aerosqualo", \'text\': "Partner di Brallin, Cavalcante dell\'Aerosqualo\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Shabraz, l\'Aerosqualo e guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{W/U}: Un Umano bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Uccello Squalo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c01e5d-12b5-4cb1-803e-e36ca0607f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 484801}, \'multiverseid\': 484801}, {\'name\': \'空鮫、シャーブラズ\', \'text\': \'空鮫の乗り手、ブラーリンとの共闘\\n飛行\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、空鮫、シャーブラズの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{W/U}：人間１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — サメ・鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d84ae44-f782-4e28-a28a-343f0b1f74a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484821}, \'multiverseid\': 484821}, {\'name\': \'Shabraz, o Tubarão-celeste\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Brallin, Ginete de Tubarão-celeste\\nVoar\\nToda vez que você comprar um card, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Shabraz, o Tubarão-celeste, e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{W/U}: O Humano alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tubarão Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9282cb33-6e0b-440f-93cb-eff2c6160a61\', \'multiverseId\': 484841}, \'multiverseid\': 484841}, {\'name\': \'Шабраз, Небесная Акула\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Браллином, Наездником Небесной Акулы\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Шабраз, Небесную Акулу, и вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{W/U}: целевой Человек получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Акула Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20ba136f-f421-4916-b574-30c1fffcee8a\', \'multiverseId\': 484861}, \'multiverseid\': 484861}]', "[{'name': 'Shivanisches Riff', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}. Das Shivanische Riff fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483189&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9530e7d-80cb-496e-96db-0491d2283333', 'multiverseId': 483189}, 'multiverseid': 483189}, {'name': 'Arrecife shivano', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}. El Arrecife shivano te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483440&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '128e44bc-6c90-43c0-bd54-16ca0239c92f', 'multiverseId': 483440}, 'multiverseid': 483440}, {'name': 'Brisants shivâns', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}. Les Brisants shivâns vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483691&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecb30622-9a1b-44bb-9f21-8f4fc0715e75', 'multiverseId': 483691}, 'multiverseid': 483691}, {'name': 'Barriera di Shiv', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R}. La Barriera di Shiv ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483942&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d3c506a-76bf-4162-9b4b-246441f66be9', 'multiverseId': 483942}, 'multiverseid': 483942}, {'name': 'シヴの浅瀬', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。シヴの浅瀬はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484193&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ded4604-6149-4684-b64d-a044fcbe3648', 'multiverseId': 484193}, 'multiverseid': 484193}, {'name': 'Recifes de Shiv', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R}. Recifes de Shiv causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484444&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c21e881-76d4-4acd-a371-9ee2f2205a3f', 'multiverseId': 484444}, 'multiverseid': 484444}, {'name': 'Шиванский Риф', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {R}. Шиванский Риф наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484695&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'feb889e9-628c-429e-85e7-2b50ad72aa94', 'multiverseId': 484695}, 'multiverseid': 484695}]", '[{\'name\': \'Silvar, Verschlinger der Freien\', \'text\': \'Partner von Trynn, Beschützerin des Friedens (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Trynn aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nBedrohlich\\nOpfere einen Menschen: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Silvar, Verschlinger der Freien. Er erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Katze, Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d807802-0ecf-4c8d-af7b-45709131ce36\', \'multiverseId\': 484742}, \'multiverseid\': 484742}, {\'name\': \'Sílvar, Devoralibres\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Trynn, Campeona de la Libertad (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Trynn en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nAmenaza.\\nSacrificar un Humano: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre Sílvar, Devoralibres. Gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pesadilla felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e8af15e-2d66-4504-bf32-714ce3bd24b8\', \'multiverseId\': 484762}, \'multiverseid\': 484762}, {\'name\': \'Silvar, dévoreur des hommes libres\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Trynn, championne de la liberté (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Trynn dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nMenace\\nSacrifiez un humain : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur Silvar, dévoreur des hommes libres. Il acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : chat et cauchemar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ad8155-df52-4d33-bf08-3ddf7e46ba4a\', \'multiverseId\': 484782}, \'multiverseid\': 484782}, {\'name\': \'Silvar, Divoratore dei Liberi\', \'text\': \'Partner di Trynn, Campionessa della Libertà (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Trynn alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nMinacciare\\nSacrifica un Umano: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su Silvar, Divoratore dei Liberi. Ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Incubo Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ca8006-3af8-48d3-9f4a-f7c76ad9c43b\', \'multiverseId\': 484802}, \'multiverseid\': 484802}, {\'name\': \'自由を貪るもの、シルヴァー\', \'text\': \'自由の勇者、トリンとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから自由の勇者、トリンを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n威迫\\n人間１体を生け贄に捧げる：自由を貪るもの、シルヴァーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。ターン終了時まで、これは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 猫・ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c45b20-2313-4da4-b768-389090860b86\', \'multiverseId\': 484822}, \'multiverseid\': 484822}, {\'name\': \'Silvar, Devorador dos Livres\', \'text\': \'Parceiro de Trynn, Campeã da Liberdade (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Trynn na própria mão do próprio grimório e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nAmeaçar\\nSacrifique um Humano: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Silvar, Devorador dos Livres. Ele ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Felino Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eafb2fe-4373-48cd-baf7-4e4259f78550\', \'multiverseId\': 484842}, \'multiverseid\': 484842}, {\'name\': \'Сильвар, Пожиратель Свободных\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Тринн, Воительницей Свободы (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Тринн в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nУгроза\\nПожертвуйте Человека: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Сильвара, Пожирателя Свободных. Он получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошка Кошмар\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed04824-ae01-4b36-95f9-c270c80b0513\', \'multiverseId\': 484862}, \'multiverseid\': 484862}]', "[{'name': 'Simic-Wachstumskammer', 'text': 'Die Simic-Wachstumskammer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Simic-Wachstumskammer ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483190&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68ab91fc-d0a6-4b47-85e1-59f7e8aca114', 'multiverseId': 483190}, 'multiverseid': 483190}, {'name': 'Cámara de crecimiento simic', 'text': 'La Cámara de crecimiento simic entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cámara de crecimiento simic entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483441&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b2200f94-6d06-4423-b1f7-98658aff276f', 'multiverseId': 483441}, 'multiverseid': 483441}, {'name': 'Chambre de croissance des Simic', 'text': 'La Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483692&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4219bc97-897d-41cb-9bab-9c8647a96198', 'multiverseId': 483692}, 'multiverseid': 483692}, {'name': 'Camera di Coltura Simic', 'text': 'La Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483943&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2419f53b-867a-4306-b5de-e9805adeca1a', 'multiverseId': 483943}, 'multiverseid': 483943}, {'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484194&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1c1f659-255a-40a6-9ea2-50b9177565e4', 'multiverseId': 484194}, 'multiverseid': 484194}, {'name': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic', 'text': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Câmara de Crescimento Simic entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484445&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7d9f16f-60de-415d-90c2-c3044e1d2081', 'multiverseId': 484445}, 'multiverseid': 484445}, {'name': 'Инкубатор Симиков', 'text': 'Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484696&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8789fc4-a87a-4eda-944c-c3603681b4e3', 'multiverseId': 484696}, 'multiverseid': 484696}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d4c9a7-4f1c-4bf8-9e94-3469c134381c\', \'multiverseId\': 482980}, \'multiverseid\': 482980}, {\'name\': \'Titán solar\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Titán solar entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes regresar la carta de permanente objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sol ardiente que nunca se pone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce6a6c48-8934-4005-a033-ca5f21af48fc\', \'multiverseId\': 483231}, \'multiverseid\': 483231}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de permanent ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d193bdd3-0e6e-4d09-a5c9-b73db1fee068\', \'multiverseId\': 483482}, \'multiverseid\': 483482}, {\'name\': \'Titano Solare\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Solare entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sole cocente che non tramonta mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a500ab-6c0d-4c23-8646-c2f09d75bcd7\', \'multiverseId\': 483733}, \'multiverseid\': 483733}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb374208-e62a-4b0f-a91f-751bd2e2566f\', \'multiverseId\': 483984}, \'multiverseid\': 483984}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Sol\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Titã de Sol entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode devolver o card de permanente alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério ao campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Um sol flamejante que nunca se põe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4615eecb-0e2d-40da-9cb0-8f8bb65b2570\', \'multiverseId\': 484235}, \'multiverseid\': 484235}, {\'name\': \'Титан Солнца\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда Титан Солнца выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы можете вернуть целевую карту перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Ослепительное солнце, которое никогда не заходит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d1e142-359c-434d-b616-6b32b57c5bff\', \'multiverseId\': 484486}, \'multiverseid\': 484486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenexplosions-Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Sonnenexplosions-Engel ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre alle getappten Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Es könnten Mächte existieren, die noch mächtiger als Phyrexia sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dae01e4-57d2-4842-9e89-a2f9e8862d53\', \'multiverseId\': 482981}, \'multiverseid\': 482981}, {\'name\': \'Ángel ráfaga solar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel ráfaga solar entre al campo de batalla, destruye todas las criaturas giradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que existan poderes aún más grandes que Pirexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2a54d02-fd35-4054-bf22-9bed34413713\', \'multiverseId\': 483232}, \'multiverseid\': 483232}, {\'name\': \'Ange solaire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez toutes les créatures engagées.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Il se pourrait qu\'il existe des puissances encore plus redoutables que Phyrexia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87762504-5a7e-427f-af69-f7b27c164109\', \'multiverseId\': 483483}, \'multiverseid\': 483483}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Esplosione Solare", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Esplosione Solare entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi tutte le creature TAPpate.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Potrebbero esistere poteri ancora più immensi di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56df3d5c-5c5a-4ca8-9f57-60d43bb46729\', \'multiverseId\': 483734}, \'multiverseid\': 483734}, {\'name\': \'太陽破の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n太陽破の天使が戦場に出たとき、タップ状態のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'ファイレクシアより大きな力も存在できる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa5dcf79-9b73-466e-aab5-a2ef3534d690\', \'multiverseId\': 483985}, \'multiverseid\': 483985}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Explosão Solar\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Explosão Solar entrar no campo de batalha, destrua todas as criaturas viradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Podem existir poderes ainda maiores que Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95cea591-c83a-4da2-b806-993c80ca6a01\', \'multiverseId\': 484236}, \'multiverseid\': 484236}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Солнечного Взрыва\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Солнечного Взрыва выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте все повернутые существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Возможно, существует сила помощнее Фирексии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3555a66-9615-4db5-914a-1fbf7aa09425\', \'multiverseId\': 484487}, \'multiverseid\': 484487}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnengras-Prärie\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In Otaria sind Frieden und Harmonie selten. Gegenden, in denen man beides findet, sind hochgeschätzt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f084cfa-2522-4247-a8da-56cc62c82ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 483196}, \'multiverseid\': 483196}, {\'name\': \'Pradera Hierbasol\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Otaria, la paz y la armonía son raras. Los lugares que proveen ambas son apreciados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d050df98-48e8-4bb6-9c88-6851f33775a8\', \'multiverseId\': 483447}, \'multiverseid\': 483447}, {\'name\': \'Prairie de Solherbe\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ils sont bien rares et très secrets, en Otaria, les lieux où règnent encore la paix et l\'harmonie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46e862a8-1fc5-47e5-84de-4cc943f2fe2c\', \'multiverseId\': 483698}, \'multiverseid\': 483698}, {\'name\': \'Prateria di Solerba\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "A Otaria la pace e l\'armonia sono rare. E i luoghi in cui è possibile trovare entrambe sono custoditi scrupolosamente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9faeda01-3636-4cdc-ad53-abc878f5bae8\', \'multiverseId\': 483949}, \'multiverseid\': 483949}, {\'name\': \'サングラスの大草原\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアでは、平和と調和はまれにしかない。その２つがある場所は大切にされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d2ad9f5-fe83-49d4-8cc5-65aa5578344c\', \'multiverseId\': 484200}, \'multiverseid\': 484200}, {\'name\': \'Pradaria de Capim Solar\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Em Otaria, a paz e a harmonia são raras. Locais que oferecem ambas são tratados com muito zelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d508f84d-2fdc-4c10-a971-474e19c50231\', \'multiverseId\': 484451}, \'multiverseid\': 484451}, {\'name\': \'Прерия Солнечной Травы\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'В Отарии покой и гармония встречаются редко. Места, где есть и то и другое, дорого ценятся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eda7ded-d98b-458f-a042-673a5d78090c\', \'multiverseId\': 484702}, \'multiverseid\': 484702}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483131&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ee14e4-1d39-4794-abb1-e414fba77ade\', \'multiverseId\': 483131}, \'multiverseid\': 483131}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5e89006-5b42-48ea-acbf-505de067f30d\', \'multiverseId\': 483382}, \'multiverseid\': 483382}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483633&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0aea78c-f18e-4055-a8f6-16a395061480\', \'multiverseId\': 483633}, \'multiverseid\': 483633}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8bd383-32b3-4ba3-8eda-1f3cf02d8855\', \'multiverseId\': 483884}, \'multiverseid\': 483884}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909164cb-b440-4b90-babc-e0e0359425a3\', \'multiverseId\': 484135}, \'multiverseid\': 484135}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdeu-se no tempo a antiga arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab098ccd-df6a-4b37-ad43-148550e40c93\', \'multiverseId\': 484386}, \'multiverseid\': 484386}, {\'name\': \'Солнечное Кольцо\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Давно забытое искусство механиков позволяло заключить свет далекой звезды в кольцо из чистейшего золота.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce7163ad-75da-4dce-ad12-b80396d5de5d\', \'multiverseId\': 484637}, \'multiverseid\': 484637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Souvenirdieb\', \'text\': \'Mutation {5}{U} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn diese Kreatur mutiert, übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Nichtkreatur-Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'554f7397-2af4-439a-b770-0ee817c9e995\', \'multiverseId\': 484936}, \'multiverseid\': 484936}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de suvenires\', \'text\': \'Mutación {5}{U}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que esta criatura mute, gana el control del artefacto objetivo que no sea criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6029d3c9-a6c4-4bfd-9a40-d4f9866b7393\', \'multiverseId\': 484987}, \'multiverseid\': 484987}, {\'name\': \'Profanateur de souvenirs\', \'text\': "Mutation {5}{U} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature subit une mutation, acquérez le contrôle d\'un artefact non-créature ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55fba78-a5b2-42e0-a135-2dbe79fe18ba\', \'multiverseId\': 485038}, \'multiverseid\': 485038}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiatore di Souvenir\', \'text\': \'Mutazione {5}{U} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura muta, prendi il controllo di un artefatto non creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2b4b44c-db2d-416c-9cad-e24678fa0e99\', \'multiverseId\': 485089}, \'multiverseid\': 485089}, {\'name\': \'記念品奪い\', \'text\': \'変容{5}{U}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーに、その下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\n飛行\\nこのクリーチャーが変容するたび、クリーチャーでないアーティファクト１つを対象とし、それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd21cede-c0cd-43e3-98c0-19dbe401fd39\', \'multiverseId\': 485140}, \'multiverseid\': 485140}, {\'name\': \'Afanador de Souvenires\', \'text\': \'Mutação {5}{U} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades das criaturas de baixo.)\\nVoar\\nToda vez que esta criatura sofrer mutação, ganhe o controle do artefato alvo que não seja uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ba32b1-496f-4d7a-a5df-52f216dd01ff\', \'multiverseId\': 485191}, \'multiverseid\': 485191}, {\'name\': \'Собирательница Сувениров\', \'text\': \'Мутация {5}{U} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз, когда это существо мутирует, получите контроль над целевым артефактом, не являющимся существом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b820f547-1173-42ce-8638-b67037c6ac13\', \'multiverseId\': 485242}, \'multiverseid\': 485242}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spalt der Blitze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte umwandelt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, fügt der Spalt der Blitze einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Eifersüchtig auf Stürme fing Vadrok Blitze vom Himmel und begrub sie tief unter der Erde. Es grummelt noch immer dort, denn sie sehnen sich zu entkommen."\\n—*Geschichten vom Ozolith*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c3539eb-049d-4712-9d58-92a1a415904c\', \'multiverseId\': 483034}, \'multiverseid\': 483034}, {\'name\': \'División del rayo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador active una habilidad de ciclo de una carta, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, la División del rayo hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Envidiando a las tormentas, Vadrok tomó un rayo del cielo y lo enterró en lo más profundo de la tierra. Continúa retumbando ahí, anhelando escapar".\\n—*Cuentos del Ozolito*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722088e8-5e76-4481-bfe3-27bf0a0c6ccc\', \'multiverseId\': 483285}, \'multiverseid\': 483285}, {\'name\': "Ride d\'éclairs", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur recycle une carte, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, la Ride d\'éclairs inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Jalousant les orages, Vadrok s\'empara des éclairs dans le ciel et les enfouit au plus profond de la terre. Ils y grondent encore, avides de liberté. »\\n—*Contes de l\'Ozolithe*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483536&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eda1fb67-3d26-486e-904c-cb76c98da619\', \'multiverseId\': 483536}, \'multiverseid\': 483536}, {\'name\': \'Fenditura di Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore cicla una carta, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, la Fenditura di Fulmini infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Geloso delle tempeste, Vadrok prese il fulmine dal cielo e lo seppellì nelle profondità della terra. È lì che il fulmine rimbomba ancora, bramando di tornare in libertà."\\n—*Racconti dell\\\'Ozolito*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75cd024e-47bd-4c3f-a39b-cf24ef37fc1f\', \'multiverseId\': 483787}, \'multiverseid\': 483787}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の裂け目\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがカードをサイクリングするたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、稲妻の裂け目はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「嵐を妬んだヴァドロックは、空から雷を奪って地下深くに埋めた。それは今も轟き、脱出を望んでいる。」\\n――*オゾリスの物語*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf36fc6-974d-4822-9067-e2d9a9ccbb52\', \'multiverseId\': 484038}, \'multiverseid\': 484038}, {\'name\': \'Fenda de Raios\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador recicla um card, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, Fenda de Raios causará 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Com inveja da tempestade, Vadrok tomou dos céus o relâmpago e o enterrou nas profundezas da terra. E lá ele ainda retumba, na ânsia de escapar."\\n— *Contos do Ozólito*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48536e18-77a9-4541-8094-00b6c33b1524\', \'multiverseId\': 484289}, \'multiverseid\': 484289}, {\'name\': \'Разлом Молний\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок совершает Цикл карты, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, Разлом Молний наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Завидуя грозам, Вадрок похитил молнию с небес и спрятал глубоко под землей. Она до сих пор грохочет там, пытаясь вырваться».\\n— *«Истории Озолита»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6adbc14-01eb-446f-af16-cf62e5af21b8\', \'multiverseId\': 484540}, \'multiverseid\': 484540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spezies-Spezialist\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Spezies-Spezialist ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur des bestimmten Typs stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe nichts gegen Snapdax. Ich mag aber eher Hunde."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f91eaf-66e1-4d24-b8a5-51291b1a8567\', \'multiverseId\': 484945}, \'multiverseid\': 484945}, {\'name\': \'Especialista en especies\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Especialista en especies entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nSiempre que una criatura del tipo elegido muera, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"No tengo nada en contra de Snapdax. Pero soy más de perros".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d76ebfb-5be8-4143-9a3e-6b9189642901\', \'multiverseId\': 484996}, \'multiverseid\': 484996}, {\'name\': \'Spécialiste en espèces\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Spécialiste en espèces arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature du type choisi meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai rien contre Snapdax. C\'est juste que je préfère les chiens. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036aaa6e-c8d5-4e49-9451-91511852f9fd\', \'multiverseId\': 485047}, \'multiverseid\': 485047}, {\'name\': \'Specialista della Specie\', \'text\': \'Mentre lo Specialista della Specie entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura del tipo scelto muore, puoi pescare una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho niente contro Snapdax. Semplicemente... preferisco i cani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b631194-46dc-4061-ba69-6611400c0084\', \'multiverseId\': 485098}, \'multiverseid\': 485098}, {\'name\': \'種の専門家\', \'text\': \'種の専門家が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nその選ばれたタイプのクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたはカードを１枚引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「スナップダックスに不満があるわけじゃない。ただ俺はどちらかというと犬派なだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4d77309-03dd-42bc-a2de-e38ff79949ef\', \'multiverseId\': 485149}, \'multiverseid\': 485149}, {\'name\': \'Especialista em Espécies\', \'text\': \'Conforme Especialista em Espécies entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nToda vez que uma criatura do tipo escolhido morre, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Não tenho nada contra Snapdax. Só prefiro cachorros."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ccf5d5c-1aed-494f-bf5f-656c1c2f71ac\', \'multiverseId\': 485200}, \'multiverseid\': 485200}, {\'name\': \'Эксперт по Видам\', \'text\': \'При выходе Эксперта по Видам на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо выбранного типа умирает, вы можете взять карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Ничего не имею против Снапдакса. Просто собаки мне нравятся больше».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baeb2139-b66a-4e6f-b924-651f28051277\', \'multiverseId\': 485251}, \'multiverseid\': 485251}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sie ist im Einklang mit der Essenz ihres Meisters.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483119&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2a8f43-99a5-4845-a87e-a2859c2149bf\', \'multiverseId\': 483119}, \'multiverseid\': 483119}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Está en armonía con la esencia de su amo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c12ab16-5877-4ed6-8be5-e38da8bad749\', \'multiverseId\': 483370}, \'multiverseid\': 483370}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Elle s\'harmonise avec l\'essence de son maître.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483621&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98950017-df58-4531-b4e0-f5c79ff9f411\', \'multiverseId\': 483621}, \'multiverseid\': 483621}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Si accorda all\'essenza del suo signore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45afec99-cec3-4329-b139-68507ccb09cc\', \'multiverseId\': 483872}, \'multiverseid\': 483872}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'それはその主の本質と調和する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d643d47-bfa4-4ac4-8d11-a7ce9c5cdcfc\', \'multiverseId\': 484123}, \'multiverseid\': 484123}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Ela se harmoniza com a essência de seu mestre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7e11fb-2311-4a79-a60f-40ea9a312ee3\', \'multiverseId\': 484374}, \'multiverseid\': 484374}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Командира\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\\nПожертвуйте Сферу Командира: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Она настраивается на сущность хозяина.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d902c6-bd89-4db2-93f1-897714117c80\', \'multiverseId\': 484625}, \'multiverseid\': 484625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphärenhafter Wolkenschlinger\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn der Sphärenhafte Wolkenschlinger angreift, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte, die vom Sphärenhaften Wolkenschlinger ins Exil geschickt wurde, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Wal\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9df34157-a81f-4b2d-a59f-e5d4815154c2\', \'multiverseId\': 484932}, \'multiverseid\': 484932}, {\'name\': \'Recolector etéreo\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que el Recolector etéreo ataque, puedes regresar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro exiliada con el Recolector etéreo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ballena elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcbec5d7-b9f7-490e-8a1c-1011bd7b5af4\', \'multiverseId\': 484983}, \'multiverseid\': 484983}, {\'name\': \'Filtreuse éthérée\', \'text\': "Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Filtreuse éthérée attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel exilée par la Filtreuse éthérée dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et baleine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6fb85e5-6128-41d0-b2cb-d12271b41f18\', \'multiverseId\': 485034}, \'multiverseid\': 485034}, {\'name\': \'Foraggiere Etereo\', \'text\': \'Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta il Foraggiere Etereo attacca, puoi far tornare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria esiliata con il Foraggiere Etereo in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Balena Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0398b328-3003-48ce-aca6-4cfe1c792e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 485085}, \'multiverseid\': 485085}, {\'name\': \'天上の餌あさり\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\n飛行\\n天上の餌あさりが攻撃するたび、あなたは天上の餌あさりによって追放されていてインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚をオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・鯨\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ce68a2-28c3-4b62-b45d-64414779227c\', \'multiverseId\': 485136}, \'multiverseid\': 485136}, {\'name\': \'Coletor Etéreo\', \'text\': \'Esquadrinhar (Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério quando conjura esta mágica paga por {1}.)\\nVoar\\nToda vez que Coletor Etéreo ataca, você pode devolver um card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço exilado com Coletor Etéreo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Baleia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc44aff-40fc-48fd-aac8-4bfad8e96e60\', \'multiverseId\': 485187}, \'multiverseid\': 485187}, {\'name\': \'Невесомый Обжора\', \'text\': \'Выкапывание (Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз, когда Невесомый Обжора атакует, вы можете вернуть изгнанную Невесомым Обжорой карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Кит\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54bca38-cce6-4392-b915-74fad988bae1\', \'multiverseId\': 485238}, \'multiverseid\': 485238}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spreißelschreck\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Spreißelschrecks sind gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments legst du die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483070&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'081f6f43-c168-46b9-8155-263479156bec\', \'multiverseId\': 483070}, \'multiverseid\': 483070}, {\'name\': \'Espanto astillado\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Espanto astillado son iguales a la cantidad de cartas de criatura que haya en tu cementerio.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd27965-05bb-4ed3-ba71-31d8769938bb\', \'multiverseId\': 483321}, \'multiverseid\': 483321}, {\'name\': \'Craintécharde\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLa force et l\'endurance du Craintécharde sont chacune égales au nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483572&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fd7132b-2145-4ff8-805a-ff5957ccb87c\', \'multiverseId\': 483572}, \'multiverseid\': 483572}, {\'name\': \'Spauracchio delle Schegge\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nLa forza e la costituzione dello Spauracchio delle Schegge sono pari al numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17f1383-a9ef-4cda-9850-674ba8a4e522\', \'multiverseId\': 483823}, \'multiverseid\': 483823}, {\'name\': \'裂け木の恐怖\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n裂け木の恐怖のパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚あなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'828d1733-3214-4079-a166-e16edba0fb32\', \'multiverseId\': 484074}, \'multiverseid\': 484074}, {\'name\': \'Assombro Farpado\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nO poder e a resistência de Assombro Farpado são ambos iguais ao número de cards de criatura no seu cemitério.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'632a89ea-a269-4d39-8b0e-70e1dfa67e80\', \'multiverseId\': 484325}, \'multiverseid\': 484325}, {\'name\': \'Щепострах\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nСила и выносливость Щепостраха равны количеству карт существ на вашем кладбище.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef72fc7-1bee-45f0-9734-4b5d190c3d94\', \'multiverseId\': 484576}, \'multiverseid\': 484576}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stadtweite Razzia\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen mit Widerstandskraft 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Oh, ihr Typen werdet die neuen Zellen lieben. Exzellenter Haferschleim. Sehr niedrige Decken."\\n—Laibus, Boros-Feldwebel\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5129ac75-8611-4c34-ac8b-aa4e8efcf02e\', \'multiverseId\': 482961}, \'multiverseid\': 482961}, {\'name\': \'Redada en la ciudad\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas con resistencia de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Les encantará estar en prisión, amigos. Tenemos unas gachas excelentes. Y eso sí, unos techos muy bajos".\\n—Libuse, sargento boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebef000-bb98-4f0d-8e70-635f84918761\', \'multiverseId\': 483212}, \'multiverseid\': 483212}, {\'name\': \'Coup de filet en ville\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures d\'endurance supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ah, messieurs, vous allez adorer la prison. Son délicieux gruau. Ses plafonds très bas. »\\n—Libuse, sergent de Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b1d57c-9cfb-43eb-bc41-e7b2a921a64f\', \'multiverseId\': 483463}, \'multiverseid\': 483463}, {\'name\': \'Retata in Città\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature con costituzione pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ragazzi, vedrete che stare in gabbia vi piacerà. Offriamo rancio eccellente e soffitti molto bassi."\\n—Libuse, sergente Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f88f14-97ba-4d58-9723-7753b10aa6ac\', \'multiverseId\': 483714}, \'multiverseid\': 483714}, {\'name\': \'一斉検挙\', \'text\': \'タフネスが４以上のクリーチャーをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「お前たち、きっと留置場を気に入るよ。最高にまずい飯。とても低い天井。」\\n――ボロスの軍曹、ライブース\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f43e1380-cea0-4969-8c63-56b60aa9a2a9\', \'multiverseId\': 483965}, \'multiverseid\': 483965}, {\'name\': \'Operação Urbana\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas com resistência igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ah, vocês vão adorar o xadrez, pessoal. O grude é gostosinho. E o teto é bem baixinho."\\n— Libuse, sargento Boros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f85b54-96ef-4b78-adbc-7e94e6dfeef5\', \'multiverseId\': 484216}, \'multiverseid\': 484216}, {\'name\': \'Городская Облава\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа с выносливостью 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Вам понравится в каталажке, парни. Потолки низкие и баланда — первый сорт».\\n— Лайбус, сержант Боросов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0e391a-26fe-45e3-be80-3da7d48e2ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 484467}, \'multiverseid\': 484467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steinhaufenwanderer\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSolange in einem Friedhof eine Kreaturenkarte mit Flugfähigkeit liegt, hat der Steinhaufenwanderer Flugfähigkeit. Das Gleiche gilt für Eile, Erstschlag, Doppelschlag, Landtarnung, Lebensverknüpfung, Reichweite, Schutz, Todesberührung, Verhülltheit, Wachsamkeit sowie das Verursachen von Furcht und von Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b3bd058-3c67-4872-9467-3326564a7026\', \'multiverseId\': 483009}, \'multiverseid\': 483009}, {\'name\': \'Vagabundo del cairn\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nMientras haya una criatura con la habilidad de volar en un cementerio, el Vagabundo del cairn tiene la habilidad de volar. Lo mismo vale para las habilidades de inspirar temor, dañar primero, dañar dos veces, toque mortal, prisa, cruzar tierras, vínculo vital, protección, alcance, arrollar, velo y vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e697822-29f7-4f3c-9768-4264fa6a0c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 483260}, \'multiverseid\': 483260}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des cairns\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nTant qu\'une carte de créature avec le vol est dans un cimetière, le Vagabond des cairns a le vol. C\'est vrai aussi pour la peur, l\'initiative, la double initiative, le contact mortel, la célérité, la traversée de terrain, le lien de vie, la protection, la portée, le piétinement, le linceul et la vigilance.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483511&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f481b7-7b62-4700-b579-625ecc10c5df\', \'multiverseId\': 483511}, \'multiverseid\': 483511}, {\'name\': \'Errante dei Tumuli\', \'text\': "Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nFintanto che una carta creatura con volare è in un cimitero, l\'Errante dei Tumuli ha volare. Lo stesso vale per attacco improvviso, doppio attacco, cautela, legame vitale, passa-terre, paura, protezione, raggiungere, rapidità, tocco letale, travolgere e velo.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6b1cf3-74d3-45b3-900f-8c3c7df89098\', \'multiverseId\': 483762}, \'multiverseid\': 483762}, {\'name\': \'石塚の放浪者\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n墓地に飛行を持つクリーチャー・カードがあるかぎり、石塚の放浪者は飛行を持つ。畏怖、先制攻撃、二段攻撃、接死、速攻、土地渡り、絆魂、プロテクション、到達、トランプル、被覆、警戒についても同様である。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ffb3314-045e-4117-91d3-28726c68daac\', \'multiverseId\': 484013}, \'multiverseid\': 484013}, {\'name\': \'Andarim de Cairn\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nEnquanto um card de criatura com voar estiver em um cemitério, Andarim de Cairn terá voar. O mesmo vale para amedrontar, iniciativa, golpe duplo, toque mortífero, ímpeto, travessia de terreno, vínculo com a vida, proteção, alcance, atropelar, manto e vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8156c3-bb3c-414a-aff1-d5d2326169a8\', \'multiverseId\': 484264}, \'multiverseid\': 484264}, {\'name\': \'Блуждающий по Курганам\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nПока на кладбище есть карта существа с Полетом, Блуждающий по Курганам имеет Полет. То же самое относится к Страху, Первому удару, Двойному удару, Смертельному касанию, Ускорению, Знанию земель, Цепи жизни, Защите, Захвату, Пробивному удару, Пелене и Бдительности.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ded808-6350-4894-9238-dbfe0a29b261\', \'multiverseId\': 484515}, \'multiverseid\': 484515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sternensturm\', \'text\': \'Der Sternensturm fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {3} ({3}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Seit der Katastrophe schauen die Überlebenden nur noch von Furcht erfüllt in den Sternenhimmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483039&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f5ebc47-bbfc-49d7-bec7-fcbbba69c558\', \'multiverseId\': 483039}, \'multiverseid\': 483039}, {\'name\': \'Tormenta de estrellas\', \'text\': \'La Tormenta de estrellas hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura.\\nCiclo {3}. ({3}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Desde el desastre, los supervivientes de la ciudad contemplaban con temor el cielo estrellado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd993c46-050b-4ddc-8408-53ef5a474b18\', \'multiverseId\': 483290}, \'multiverseid\': 483290}, {\'name\': \'Ouragan stellaire\', \'text\': "L\'Ouragan stellaire inflige X blessures à chaque créature.\\nRecyclage {3} ({3}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Depuis le désastre, les survivants de la ville contemplaient les cieux constellés d\'étoiles avec effroi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09fd47d4-6174-4dfd-9360-066cc0f3abb4\', \'multiverseId\': 483541}, \'multiverseid\': 483541}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Stellare\', \'text\': \'La Tempesta Stellare infligge X danni a ogni creatura.\\nCiclo {3} ({3}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo il disastro, i superstiti della città guardarono sempre il cielo cosparso di stelle con terrore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d65d2490-223f-408b-b0dc-dedfd73127fd\', \'multiverseId\': 483792}, \'multiverseid\': 483792}, {\'name\': \'星の嵐\', \'text\': \'星の嵐は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{3}（{3}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'災厄が起こった時から、街の生存者たちは星空を恐怖の目で見上げるようになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f2b10ed-3c48-4a3a-93f1-6c2fe0c6ff0f\', \'multiverseId\': 484043}, \'multiverseid\': 484043}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade de Estrelas\', \'text\': \'Tempestade de Estrelas causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura.\\nReciclar {3} ({3}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Desde o desastre, os sobreviventes da cidade passaram a ver o céu estrelado com pavor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963f2c62-3033-4e61-9b35-cb5cbfaf6fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 484294}, \'multiverseid\': 484294}, {\'name\': \'Звездная Буря\', \'text\': \'Звездная Буря наносит X повреждений каждому существу.\\nЦикл {3} ({3}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'После катастрофы выжившие горожане уже не могли смотреть на усыпанное звездами небо без страха.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b30a533b-3346-48f2-85d6-a646d610edc8\', \'multiverseId\': 484545}, \'multiverseid\': 484545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stiller Schiedsrichter\', \'text\': \'In jedem Kampf kann höchstens eine Kreatur angreifen.\\nIn jedem Kampf kann höchstens eine Kreatur blocken.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Den Lehrmeistern zufolge gibt es auf jeder Welt von unbekannter Hand erschaffene Schiedsrichter, die Gerechtigkeit durchsetzen sollen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483129&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a5b8d6-cc45-419b-86f6-edb296ffe986\', \'multiverseId\': 483129}, \'multiverseid\': 483129}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro silencioso\', \'text\': \'No más de una criatura puede atacar cada combate.\\nNo más de una criatura puede bloquear cada combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Los eruditos dicen que los árbitros, creados por una mano desconocida para dictar justicia, existen en todos los mundos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e43340-3d7a-4c88-9ede-99f0f5545749\', \'multiverseId\': 483380}, \'multiverseid\': 483380}, {\'name\': \'Arbitre silencieux\', \'text\': "Pas plus d\'une créature ne peut attaquer à chaque combat.\\nPas plus d\'une créature ne peut bloquer à chaque combat.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'Les érudits prétendent que chaque monde possède ses arbitres, créés par une puissance invisible pour rendre la justice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483631&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e2eef9-f286-4b53-95f7-bc0d3b17aa1b\', \'multiverseId\': 483631}, \'multiverseid\': 483631}, {\'name\': \'Giudice Silente\', \'text\': \'Non più di una creatura può attaccare in ogni combattimento.\\nNon più di una creatura può bloccare in ogni combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Gli studiosi sostengono che i giudici esistano in ogni mondo, creati da una mano ignota per far rispettare la giustizia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887372d8-9d71-4597-9c12-50d459c7daab\', \'multiverseId\': 483882}, \'multiverseid\': 483882}, {\'name\': \'沈黙の調停者\', \'text\': \'各戦闘で、２体以上のクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。\\n各戦闘で、２体以上のクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'学者によれば、あらゆる世界には、正義をなさしめる何者かの手で生み出された調停者がいるとのことだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eac40a9e-5fe2-4969-bc27-024d7b88a4b0\', \'multiverseId\': 484133}, \'multiverseid\': 484133}, {\'name\': \'Árbitro Silencioso\', \'text\': \'No máximo uma criatura pode atacar a cada combate.\\nNo máximo uma criatura pode bloquear a cada combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Os escolásticos dizem que existem árbitros em todos os mundos, criados por uma mão desconhecida para aplicar a justiça.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c977fd8b-abd1-4dd9-8a24-3887bc7dba92\', \'multiverseId\': 484384}, \'multiverseid\': 484384}, {\'name\': \'Безмолвный Судья\', \'text\': \'Не более одного существа может атаковать в каждом бою.\\nНе более одного существа может блокировать в каждом бою.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Ученые говорят, что в каждом мире существуют судьи, созданные неведомой силой для вершения правосудия.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'527bc2ed-60ab-4cdb-a9f7-db8685895b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 484635}, \'multiverseid\': 484635}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturzflug auf die Sünder\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil.\\nDelirium — Erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, falls dein Friedhof vier oder mehr unterschiedliche Kartentypen enthält.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Ausruf übertönte all die Schreie: „Ihr werdet alle errettet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec28889b-f0af-4163-ae4c-0b3c362d0abd\', \'multiverseId\': 482965}, \'multiverseid\': 482965}, {\'name\': \'Descender sobre los pecadores\', \'text\': \'Exilia todas las criaturas.\\nDelirio — Crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar si entre las cartas de tu cementerio hay cuatro o más tipos de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Por encima de los gritos se escuchó una frase: "La salvación le llegará a todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ab8758-5d89-4d4f-9dba-7bffbd9989b8\', \'multiverseId\': 483216}, \'multiverseid\': 483216}, {\'name\': \'Fondre sur les pécheurs\', \'text\': "Exilez toutes les créatures.\\nDélire — Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol s\'il y a au moins quatre types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une phrase s\'élevait au-dessus des cris : « Vous serez tous sauvés. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483467&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983b175d-f695-499c-b779-1467a20956a5\', \'multiverseId\': 483467}, \'multiverseid\': 483467}, {\'name\': \'Abbattersi sui Peccatori\', \'text\': \'Esilia tutte le creature.\\nDelirio — Crea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare se ci sono quattro o più tipi di carta tra le carte nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Una frase risuonò più forte delle urla: "Sarete tutti salvati".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ef06eea-daf6-4c30-ba7d-e149c3b0e80b\', \'multiverseId\': 483718}, \'multiverseid\': 483718}, {\'name\': \'罪人への急襲\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべて追放する。\\n昂揚 ― あなたの墓地にあるカードにカード・タイプが合計４種類以上含まれるなら、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'悲鳴の上から声が聞こえた。「汝らはみな救われるであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c021d81-968f-4bd4-8e69-c0fb9dba7577\', \'multiverseId\': 483969}, \'multiverseid\': 483969}, {\'name\': \'Cair sobre os Pecadores\', \'text\': \'Exile todas as criaturas.\\nDelírio — Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar se houver quatro ou mais tipos de card entre os cards de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Acima dos gritos, uma frase ecoava: "Todos vocês serão salvos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4f248e-2ca1-4726-ae62-3853f462f717\', \'multiverseId\': 484220}, \'multiverseid\': 484220}, {\'name\': \'Нападение на Грешников\', \'text\': \'Изгоните все существа.\\nБуйство — Создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белый Ангел с Полетом, если среди карт на вашем кладбище есть не менее четырех типов карт.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все крики заглушила одна фраза: «Вы будете спасены».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'750a0fce-a1bc-4171-8e0b-7b67e9bc0b48\', \'multiverseId\': 484471}, \'multiverseid\': 484471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stärke der Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {1} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {1} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nBestimme eine Kreatur deiner Wahl; bestimme dann für jedes Mal, dass die Bonuskosten für diesen Zauberspruch bezahlt wurden, eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. Lege auf jede davon X +1/+1-Marken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483071&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b651340b-0f47-4453-a67a-4618def9d4fb\', \'multiverseId\': 483071}, \'multiverseid\': 483071}, {\'name\': \'Fuerza de los Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {1}. (Puedes pagar {1} adicional tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nElige una criatura objetivo, luego elige otra criatura objetivo por cada vez que este hechizo fue estimulado. Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a531731-84c5-41f2-acd8-124fe1963352\', \'multiverseId\': 483322}, \'multiverseid\': 483322}, {\'name\': \'Force des Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Multikick {1} (Vous pouvez payer {1} supplémentaire autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nChoisissez une créature ciblée, puis choisissez une autre créature ciblée pour chaque fois que ce sort a été kické. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur chacune des créatures.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483573&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bddbd130-a8f1-458f-934d-d004cb94859d\', \'multiverseId\': 483573}, \'multiverseid\': 483573}, {\'name\': \'Forza dei Tajuru\', \'text\': "Multipotenziamento {1} (Puoi pagare {1} addizionale un qualsiasi numero di volte mentre lanci questa magia.)\\nScegli una creatura bersaglio, poi scegli un\'altra creatura bersaglio per ogni volta che questa magia è stata potenziata. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4452a2c3-83b1-404d-a6c0-9c6027cbcbe5\', \'multiverseId\': 483824}, \'multiverseid\': 483824}, {\'name\': \'タジュールの力\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{1}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\nクリーチャー１体と、この呪文がキッカーされた１回につき、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれＸ個置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83515d5c-1f10-4f44-b80f-067f3687ed43\', \'multiverseId\': 484075}, \'multiverseid\': 484075}, {\'name\': \'Força dos Tajuru\', \'text\': \'Multireforçar {1} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {1} quantas vezes quiser conforme conjura esta mágica.)\\nEscolha a criatura alvo, depois escolha outra criatura alvo para cada vez que esta mágica foi reforçada. Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c1e4cb-3011-4cac-991b-d8f4c02d5873\', \'multiverseId\': 484326}, \'multiverseid\': 484326}, {\'name\': \'Сила Таджуру\', \'text\': \'Мультиусилитель {1} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {1} любое количество раз.)\\nВыберите целевое существо, затем выберите другое целевое существо за каждый Усилитель, полученный этим заклинанием. Положите X жетонов +1/+1 на каждое из них.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22b88530-56cf-4420-8b9d-1bd1fe98c8e9\', \'multiverseId\': 484577}, \'multiverseid\': 484577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Surreale Denkschrift\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauberkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nAbprall (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand wirkst, schicke ihn ins Exil, sowie er verrechnet wird. Zu Beginn deines nächsten Versorgungssegments kannst du diese Karte aus dem Exil wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483040&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0694cf6-b23c-4dee-8215-42462ca98412\', \'multiverseId\': 483040}, \'multiverseid\': 483040}, {\'name\': \'Memoria surrealista\', \'text\': \'Regresa una carta de instantáneo al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nRebote. (Si lanzas este hechizo de tu mano, exílialo en cuanto se resuelva. Al comienzo de tu próximo mantenimiento, puedes lanzar esta carta desde el exilio sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c05f1e50-e1d2-47d9-bea4-1f61f1e914cb\', \'multiverseId\': 483291}, \'multiverseid\': 483291}, {\'name\': \'Mémoire surréaliste\', \'text\': "Renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère choisie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nRebond (Si vous lancez ce sort depuis votre main, exilez-le au moment où il se résout. Au début de votre prochain entretien, vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis l\'exil sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4acca7c2-3296-4276-b677-6641e7955cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 483542}, \'multiverseid\': 483542}, {\'name\': \'Memorie Surreali\', \'text\': "Riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo a caso dal tuo cimitero.\\nRipresa (Se lanci questa magia dalla tua mano, esiliala mentre si risolve. All\'inizio del tuo prossimo mantenimento, puoi lanciare questa carta dall\'esilio senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0db3ea-8129-4f38-b6a2-cc3b849aa9f1\', \'multiverseId\': 483793}, \'multiverseid\': 483793}, {\'name\': \'現実離れした回顧\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からインスタント・カード１枚を無作為に選び、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n反復（この呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。次のあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域からこのカードをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb563533-7345-4798-8132-98988ee163d6\', \'multiverseId\': 484044}, \'multiverseid\': 484044}, {\'name\': \'Memórias Surreais\', \'text\': \'Devolva um card de mágica instantânea aleatório de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nRebote (Se você conjurar esta mágica da sua mão, exile-a conforme ela for resolvida. No início de sua próxima manutenção, você poderá conjurar este card do exílio sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c22f2700-c90e-43ff-bf55-5d312ec1553c\', \'multiverseId\': 484295}, \'multiverseid\': 484295}, {\'name\': \'Сюрреалистическое Воспоминание\', \'text\': \'Верните случайно выбранную карту мгновенного заклинания из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nОтскок (Изгоните это заклинание в момент его разрешения, если вы разыгрываете его из вашей руки. В начале вашего следующего шага поддержки вы можете разыграть эту карту из изгнания без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3372c026-17d4-4465-97d5-c6786737ad52\', \'multiverseId\': 484546}, \'multiverseid\': 484546}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sägezahn-Demolierer\', \'text\': \'Mutation {3}{G} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn diese Kreatur mutiert, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die keine Kreatur ist. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3358c9-b9a5-4472-a525-d9b320bd9934\', \'multiverseId\': 484962}, \'multiverseid\': 484962}, {\'name\': \'Demoledora colmillos de sierra\', \'text\': \'Mutación {3}{G}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nArrolla.\\nSiempre que esta criatura mute, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea criatura. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f31e76f-f309-4f7a-8472-9c18cbfb6c8e\', \'multiverseId\': 485013}, \'multiverseid\': 485013}, {\'name\': \'Démolisseur à défenses tranchantes\', \'text\': "Mutation {3}{G} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nPiétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature subit une mutation, détruisez le permanent non-créature ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c915f69-106e-4ef0-8769-f2c75d8f67cc\', \'multiverseId\': 485064}, \'multiverseid\': 485064}, {\'name\': \'Demolitore Zannafalce\', \'text\': \'Mutazione {3}{G} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nTravolgere\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura muta, distruggi un permanente non creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279b8871-ec3b-42d4-81f4-248642376cf4\', \'multiverseId\': 485115}, \'multiverseid\': 485115}, {\'name\': \'鋸牙の破砕獣\', \'text\': \'変容{3}{G}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーに、その下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\nトランプル\\nこのクリーチャーが変容するたび、クリーチャーでないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf9761f-552a-4425-9d76-df7b4023f1b2\', \'multiverseId\': 485166}, \'multiverseid\': 485166}, {\'name\': \'Demolidor Presa-de-serra\', \'text\': \'Mutação {3}{G} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades das criaturas de baixo.)\\nAtropelar\\nToda vez que esta criatura sofrer mutação, destrua a permanente alvo que não seja uma criatura. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3baf2cb-94ec-4992-a0b9-6a83fc3e343a\', \'multiverseId\': 485217}, \'multiverseid\': 485217}, {\'name\': \'Пилозубый Разрушитель\', \'text\': \'Мутация {3}{G} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nПробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда это существо мутирует, уничтожьте целевой не являющийся существом перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19085eea-930b-4980-bd0e-1d16591da7da\', \'multiverseId\': 485268}, \'multiverseid\': 485268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talrand der Himmelsbeschwörer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ozeane sind riesig, doch der Himmel ist noch größer. Warum sollte ich mich mit einem Königreich zufrieden geben, wo ich doch über beide herrschen kann?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d91396-0f30-4ec3-b5d2-d8b058fea1b6\', \'multiverseId\': 483004}, \'multiverseid\': 483004}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocador celeste\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Draco azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Los mares son vastos, pero los cielos lo son más todavía. ¿Por qué contentarse con un reino si puedes dominar ambos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d79605bb-aaf8-410d-a526-6860e6f3634c\', \'multiverseId\': 483255}, \'multiverseid\': 483255}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocateur céleste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« La mer est vaste, mais bien moins que le ciel. Pourquoi se contenter d\'un royaume quand je peux régner sur les deux ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483506&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9ad133-2778-404d-8113-cb10c4cb8b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 483506}, \'multiverseid\': 483506}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, Evocatore Celeste\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, crea una pedina creatura Draghetto 2/2 blu con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"I mari sono immensi, ma i cieli lo sono anche di più. Perché accontentarsi di un regno quando posso governare entrambi?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a3ae6fe-d556-4386-b2cf-ccd7202e2206\', \'multiverseId\': 483757}, \'multiverseid\': 483757}, {\'name\': \'空召喚士ターランド\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「海は広大だが、空はそれ以上に広大だ。その両方を統べることができるなら、なぜ１つの王国に満足しようか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75a31080-54f7-47a1-8813-5c73e477cab2\', \'multiverseId\': 484008}, \'multiverseid\': 484008}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, Invocador Celeste\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, crie uma ficha de criatura azul 2/2 do tipo Dragonete com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Os mares são vastos, mas os céus são ainda mais. Por que me contentar com um reino quando posso governar ambos?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9094ba-c393-4f76-aee4-5790ad98d411\', \'multiverseId\': 484259}, \'multiverseid\': 484259}, {\'name\': \'Талранд, Небесный Вызыватель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 синий Дрейк с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Море широко, но небеса поистине безбрежны. Почему я должен довольствоваться одной стихией, когда могу повелевать обеими?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d58565c-c7ea-40e0-bb46-ac81e8f98f8d\', \'multiverseId\': 484510}, \'multiverseid\': 484510}]', "[{'name': 'Tayam, das leuchtende Rätsel', 'text': 'Jede andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, kommt mit einer zusätzlichen Wachsamkeit-Marke ins Spiel.\\n{3}, entferne drei Marken von Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst: Lege die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof und bringe dann eine bleibende Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484743&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca27ef69-e20b-4698-b90a-0ed5009d1ea1', 'multiverseId': 484743}, 'multiverseid': 484743}, {'name': 'Tayam, enigma resplandeciente', 'text': 'Cada otra criatura que controlas entra al campo de batalla con un contador de vigilancia adicional sobre ella.\\n{3}, remover tres contadores de entre las criaturas que controlas: Pon las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio, luego regresa una carta de permanente con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Bestia pesadilla', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484763&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc875a9b-483f-4219-9d1b-605bf270efe9', 'multiverseId': 484763}, 'multiverseid': 484763}, {'name': 'Tayam, énigme lumineuse', 'text': 'Chaque autre créature que vous contrôlez arrive sur le champ de bataille avec un marqueur « vigilance » supplémentaire sur elle.\\n{3}, retirez trois marqueurs à des créatures que vous contrôlez : Mettez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de permanent ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et bête', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484783&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40c74a08-3cea-4432-8653-0702e6afddb8', 'multiverseId': 484783}, 'multiverseid': 484783}, {'name': 'Tayam, Enigma Luminoso', 'text': 'Ogni altra creatura che controlli entra nel campo di battaglia con un segnalino cautela addizionale.\\n{3}, Rimuovi tre segnalini scelti tra le creature che controlli: Metti nel tuo cimitero le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Bestia Incubo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484803&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48b0e99c-b7d1-431e-b2a7-d724a10d144a', 'multiverseId': 484803}, 'multiverseid': 484803}, {'name': '光明の不可思議、タヤム', 'text': '他の、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーは、それぞれ警戒カウンターが追加で１個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{3}, あなたがコントロールしている望む数のクリーチャーの上からカウンター合計３個を取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚あなたの墓地に置き、その後あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に戻す。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484823&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e885e652-31fe-459e-b77a-a773ce9a5330', 'multiverseId': 484823}, 'multiverseid': 484823}, {'name': 'Tayam, Enigma Luminoso', 'text': 'Cada outra criatura que você controla entra no campo de batalha com um marcador de vigilância adicional.\\n{3}, remova três marcadores de criaturas que você controla: Coloque os três cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério. Depois, devolva um card de permanente com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Besta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484843&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98ca5d04-3849-4af0-9f91-59dcd2253bd5', 'multiverseId': 484843}, 'multiverseid': 484843}, {'name': 'Тайям, Светозарная Загадка', 'text': 'Каждое другое существо под вашим контролем выходит на поле битвы с одним дополнительным жетоном Бдительности на нем.\\n{3}, удалите три жетона с любых существ под вашим контролем: положите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище, затем верните карту перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Зверь', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484863&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '098aa8da-3206-4b92-8d80-786f55e96bb9', 'multiverseId': 484863}, 'multiverseid': 484863}]", "[{'name': 'Tektonische Umgestaltung', 'text': 'Länderkarten auf deiner Hand haben Umwandlung {R}.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Allein in ihrem verkohlten und verwüsteten Königreich bereute sie vieles — vor allem aber, nicht früher gehandelt zu haben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483041&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5333d4bc-87ae-4aec-9619-816c578d3841', 'multiverseId': 483041}, 'multiverseid': 483041}, {'name': 'Reconfiguración tectónica', 'text': 'Cada carta de tierra en tu mano tiene la habilidad de ciclo {R}.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Sola, en la desolación de su reino carbonizado, se arrepintió de muchas cosas, pero sobre todo de no haber actuado antes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483292&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44a2ed2c-5c42-4953-8a12-9043c20995dc', 'multiverseId': 483292}, 'multiverseid': 483292}, {'name': 'Reformation tectonique', 'text': 'Chaque carte de terrain de votre main a recyclage {R}.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Seule au milieu de son royaume désolé, elle regretta tant de choses... Notamment de ne pas avoir agi plus tôt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483543&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '054b8b84-3d78-44ab-ae65-b94a365f3dcc', 'multiverseId': 483543}, 'multiverseid': 483543}, {'name': 'Riforma Tettonica', 'text': 'Ogni carta terra nella tua mano ha ciclo {R}.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Sola nella desolazione del suo regno incenerito, si pentì di molte cose, soprattutto di non aver agito prima.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483794&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7166d534-c426-4693-9d8e-34d7fa0875ff', 'multiverseId': 483794}, 'multiverseid': 483794}, {'name': '地盤改変', 'text': 'あなたの手札にある各土地・カードはそれぞれサイクリング{R}を持つ。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '焼き尽くされ廃虚となった王国に一人残された彼女は悔悟の念に駆られていた。大部分は、早く行動しなかったことに。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484045&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e5e8bb0-dbe2-41a6-a0ef-6413a776811f', 'multiverseId': 484045}, 'multiverseid': 484045}, {'name': 'Reforma Tectônica', 'text': 'Cada card de terreno em sua mão tem reciclar {R}.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Sozinha na calcinada desolação de seu reino, ela se arrependeu de muitas coisas... principalmente de não ter agido antes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484296&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7dbbda2f-dad8-4bd2-a298-ccd749a0195f', 'multiverseId': 484296}, 'multiverseid': 484296}, {'name': 'Тектоническое Преобразование', 'text': 'Каждая карта земли в вашей руке имеет Цикл {R}.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Одна, посреди выжженной пустоши, в которую превратилось ее королевство, она сожалела о многом, — но более всего о том, что промедлила.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484547&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '429ff212-bf57-4659-9eaf-5cf3bb51781c', 'multiverseId': 484547}, 'multiverseid': 484547}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Götter teilnahmslos werden, beginnen die Leute jeden anzubeten, der sie erhört."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12dfba5f-c554-47c4-bc21-d05b35b51e47\', \'multiverseId\': 483198}, \'multiverseid\': 483198}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Activa esta habilidad solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando los dioses caen en la apatía, la gente venera a quienquiera que responda a sus plegarias".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509e7d6e-1e0a-4c1c-9acd-1eb5cde36e13\', \'multiverseId\': 483449}, \'multiverseid\': 483449}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez cette capacité que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand les dieux deviennent indifférents, les gens vénèrent quiconque répond à leurs supplications. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a2d1afc-3fa1-458b-88b6-30165823600f\', \'multiverseId\': 483700}, \'multiverseid\': 483700}, {\'name\': \'Tempio della Dea Fasulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}. Attiva questa abilità solo se controlli cinque o più terre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando gli dei sprofondano nell\\\'apatia, il popolo inizia a venerare chiunque risponda alle sue preghiere."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e30b9fa-af5a-4823-beeb-a143561a3aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 483951}, \'multiverseid\': 483951}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。この能力は、あなたが土地を５つ以上コントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が無関心となった時、人々は自分たちの嘆願を聞き入れてくれる者ならば何でも崇拝するようになるのね。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f0f60f-400e-4983-9fed-96a648d16546\', \'multiverseId\': 484202}, \'multiverseid\': 484202}, {\'name\': \'Templo do Falso Deus\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}. Ative esta habilidade somente se você controlar cinco ou mais terrenos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando os deuses se tornam apáticos, as pessoas adoram qualquer um que responda a suas súplicas."\\n— Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ecf9406-a5de-4218-9fd3-24719075a879\', \'multiverseId\': 484453}, \'multiverseid\': 484453}, {\'name\': \'Храм Ложного Бога\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}. Активируйте эту способность, только если вы контролируете не менее пяти земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда боги становятся безразличными, люди начинают поклоняться тому, кто отвечает на их молитвы».\\n— Киора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aedd4b34-d722-44ef-897e-920774a88c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 484704}, \'multiverseid\': 484704}]', '[{\'name\': \'Temur-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Sie kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\\n• Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, es sei denn, sein Beherrscher bezahlt {3}.\\n• Kreaturen mit Stärke 3 oder weniger können in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483109&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'760666fe-5320-4a77-b501-abecb8be957b\', \'multiverseId\': 483109}, \'multiverseid\': 483109}, {\'name\': \'Sortilegio temur\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno. Esa criatura lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\\n• Las criaturas con fuerza de 3 o menos no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9b7e4a5-9252-4e6f-896d-eadd9ec295bf\', \'multiverseId\': 483360}, \'multiverseid\': 483360}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Temur\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Elle se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\n• Contrecarrez le sort ciblé à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.\\n• Les créatures avec une force inférieure ou égale à 3 ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483611&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e998ab4-542f-4cf8-808b-0c5c1dae7b35\', \'multiverseId\': 483611}, \'multiverseid\': 483611}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Temur\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno. Lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\n• Neutralizza una magia bersaglio a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\\n• Le creature con forza pari o inferiore a 3 non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4238932c-3767-45b5-9f54-6c56c962e516\', \'multiverseId\': 483862}, \'multiverseid\': 483862}, {\'name\': \'ティムールの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、その前者は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\\n• 呪文１つを対象とする。それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、それを打ち消す。\\n• このターン、パワーが３以下のクリーチャーではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5abfdbe-425e-4f47-a6f2-a0a82cd460c1\', \'multiverseId\': 484113}, \'multiverseid\': 484113}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Temur\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno. Ela luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla.\\n• Anule a mágica alvo, a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\\n• As criaturas com poder igual ou inferior a 3 não podem bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6e4c27e-e7c4-4f9d-9709-2135ecea1935\', \'multiverseId\': 484364}, \'multiverseid\': 484364}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Темура\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 до конца хода. Оно дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем.\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\\n• Существа с силой 3 или меньше не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09867629-9e8b-44e2-99cf-30e12d6c8c46\', \'multiverseId\': 484615}, \'multiverseid\': 484615}]', "[{'name': 'Terminieren', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jede Sonne geht irgendwann unter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483110&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f16dc420-ad9c-4d9a-ade0-0b88e71c8f45', 'multiverseId': 483110}, 'multiverseid': 483110}, {'name': 'Terminar', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerada.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Todos los soles tienen su ocaso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483361&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9d0c3f2-5b55-447a-a1d1-0ca364fc695f', 'multiverseId': 483361}, 'multiverseid': 483361}, {'name': 'Terminaison', 'text': 'Détruisez la créature ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Tous les soleils doivent se coucher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483612&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e348bc4-f661-4be1-a164-2b94b001e79e', 'multiverseId': 483612}, 'multiverseid': 483612}, {'name': 'Terminare', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerata.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Tutti i soli devono tramontare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483863&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4d96042-859c-403a-9a99-a1a38402fdb1', 'multiverseId': 483863}, 'multiverseid': 483863}, {'name': '終止', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '沈まない太陽などない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484114&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23ca972f-b9fb-48a3-97c3-9e2264b07bb5', 'multiverseId': 484114}, 'multiverseid': 484114}, {'name': 'Findar', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo. Ela não pode ser regenerada.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Todos os sóis precisam se pôr.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484365&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5aea7f9-b065-412c-bd64-7fdb19df7e00', 'multiverseId': 484365}, 'multiverseid': 484365}, {'name': 'Истребить', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Оно не может быть регенерировано.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Всякое солнце должно закатиться.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484616&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '826535c9-53ff-455b-bcc6-44b026261e7d', 'multiverseId': 484616}, 'multiverseid': 484616}]", '[{\'name\': \'Thalias Leutnant\', \'text\': \'Wenn Thalias Leutnant ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jeden anderen Menschen, den du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn ein anderer Mensch unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf Thalias Leutnant.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3703a69a-3524-4ce0-9e56-f8fe6a5ef122\', \'multiverseId\': 482982}, \'multiverseid\': 482982}, {\'name\': \'Teniente de Thalia\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Teniente de Thalia entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada otro Humano que controlas.\\nSiempre que otro Humano entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Teniente de Thalia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6300acc7-2cd0-49df-b6c8-0f56c37855e1\', \'multiverseId\': 483233}, \'multiverseid\': 483233}, {\'name\': \'Lieutenante de Thalia\', \'text\': "Quand la Lieutenante de Thalia arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque autre humain que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un autre humain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Lieutenante de Thalia.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483484&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc81ea3-22f5-4acb-adec-17fa0422c9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 483484}, \'multiverseid\': 483484}, {\'name\': \'Tenente di Thalia\', \'text\': \'Quando la Tenente di Thalia entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni altro Umano che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta un altro Umano entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Tenente di Thalia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1aa58be-2764-4a8b-a89b-b9b617d66806\', \'multiverseId\': 483735}, \'multiverseid\': 483735}, {\'name\': \'サリアの副官\', \'text\': \'サリアの副官が戦場に出たとき、他の、あなたがコントロールしている各人間の上に、＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\n他の人間が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、サリアの副官の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e7c626c-84de-4e9d-983a-7947cfbffa5a\', \'multiverseId\': 483986}, \'multiverseid\': 483986}, {\'name\': \'Tenente de Thalia\', \'text\': \'Quando Tenente de Thalia entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada outro Humano que você controla.\\nToda vez que outro Humano entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Tenente de Thalia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6202ce53-2e2a-444f-bda8-a7fb7cdcc905\', \'multiverseId\': 484237}, \'multiverseid\': 484237}, {\'name\': \'Лейтенант Талии\', \'text\': \'Когда Лейтенант Талии выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждого другого Человека под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда другой Человек выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Лейтенанта Талии.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90dccee1-5f8d-4102-882b-111078e4e48e\', \'multiverseId\': 484488}, \'multiverseid\': 484488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titan des ewigen Feuers\', \'text\': \'Jede Mensch-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, hat „{R}, {T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Kein Geschenk ist wertvoller oder gefährlicher als das Feuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483042&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e742aaf3-6db3-4bbc-b639-cfda9e9dfae7\', \'multiverseId\': 483042}, \'multiverseid\': 483042}, {\'name\': \'Titán del fuego eterno\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura Humano que controlas tiene "{R}, {T}: Esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'No hay regalo más valioso ni más peligroso que el fuego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456fae49-a763-4ead-8349-0da26094a6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 483293}, \'multiverseid\': 483293}, {\'name\': \'Titan du feu éternel\', \'text\': "Chaque créature Humain que vous contrôlez a « {R}, {T} : Cette créature inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. »", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Le feu est à la fois le don le plus précieux et le plus dangereux qui soit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1e0131e-ce71-4c52-b694-d0bf1428125f\', \'multiverseId\': 483544}, \'multiverseid\': 483544}, {\'name\': \'Titano del Fuoco Eterno\', \'text\': \'Ogni creatura Umano che controlli ha "{R}, {T}: Questa creatura infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': "Non c\'è dono più prezioso o più pericoloso del fuoco.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b36838-6d35-4219-b0a4-cd5e317e67ad\', \'multiverseId\': 483795}, \'multiverseid\': 483795}, {\'name\': \'永遠の炎のタイタン\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている各人間・クリーチャーはそれぞれ「{R}, {T}：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'炎ほど貴重で、そして恐ろしい贈り物はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0612aaa5-3cbd-4eb8-9cd8-e141b7ee5c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 484046}, \'multiverseid\': 484046}, {\'name\': \'Titã do Fogo Eterno\', \'text\': \'Cada criatura do tipo Humano que você controla tem "{R}, {T}: Esta criatura causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Não há dádiva mais preciosa nem mais perigosa que o fogo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2331482b-0797-4123-81f7-206cd3dc0378\', \'multiverseId\': 484297}, \'multiverseid\': 484297}, {\'name\': \'Титан Неугасимого Огня\', \'text\': \'Каждое существо-Человек под вашим контролем имеет способность «{R}, {T}: это существо наносит 1 повреждение любой цели».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Нет дара драгоценнее и опаснее огня.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c94f785-e683-478c-9f90-2f72bf6c2d6b\', \'multiverseId\': 484548}, \'multiverseid\': 484548}]', '[{\'name\': \'Titanenjägerin\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Endsegments jedes Spielers und falls in diesem Zug keine Kreatur gestorben ist, fügt die Titanenjägerin dem Spieler 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Monster oder Mensch, mein Preis ist der gleiche."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8dafffc7-b562-4120-bd2f-9cbedcb3eadb\', \'multiverseId\': 484946}, \'multiverseid\': 484946}, {\'name\': \'Cazadora titánica\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del paso final de cada jugador, si ninguna criatura murió este turno, la Cazadora titánica hace 4 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ya sea monstruo o humano, mi tarifa no cambia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15294f12-0f43-4f14-b425-7cfb783a4502\', \'multiverseId\': 484997}, \'multiverseid\': 484997}, {\'name\': \'Chasseuse de titans\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de fin de chaque joueur, si aucune créature n\'est morte ce tour-ci, la Chasseuse de titans inflige 4 blessures à ce joueur.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Monstre ou humain, mon tarif est le même. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327b8b93-2df0-408e-94b5-15dc706a3f22\', \'multiverseId\': 485048}, \'multiverseid\': 485048}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatrice di Titani\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della sottofase finale di ogni giocatore, se nessuna creatura è morta in questo turno, la Cacciatrice di Titani infligge 4 danni a quel giocatore.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostri o umani, la mia tariffa non cambia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e472214-1e6b-4424-9696-f2144fa31489\', \'multiverseId\': 485099}, \'multiverseid\': 485099}, {\'name\': \'巨獣狩り\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していなかった場合、巨獣狩りはそのプレイヤーに４点のダメージを与える。\\n{1}{B}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物だろうと人間だろうと、料金は同じよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924f514b-1fc3-4438-8ea0-8ba59f5e5fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 485150}, \'multiverseid\': 485150}, {\'name\': \'Caçadora de Titãs\', \'text\': \'No início da etapa final de cada jogador, se nenhuma criatura morreu neste turno, Caçadora de Titãs causa 4 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifique uma criatura: Você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Monstro ou humano, o preço é o mesmo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8252a5-cc83-4a96-a3c1-db36638611c2\', \'multiverseId\': 485201}, \'multiverseid\': 485201}, {\'name\': \'Охотница на Титанов\', \'text\': \'В начале заключительного шага каждого игрока, если в этом ходу не умерло ни одного существа, то Охотница на Титанов наносит 4 повреждения тому игроку.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте существо: вы получаете 4 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Чудовище, человек — цена от этого не меняется».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91be2f49-6425-483d-945f-d41c4ef57f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 485252}, \'multiverseid\': 485252}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todesbrücken-Gesang\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Todesbrücken-Gesang ins Spiel kommt, lege die obersten zehn Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bestimmst du per Zufall eine Karte in deinem Friedhof. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, bringe sie ins Spiel. Nimm sie sonst auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483086&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5fe6a4-70d2-48b4-b7f4-25a053db53ea\', \'multiverseId\': 483086}, \'multiverseid\': 483086}, {\'name\': \'Canto de Puente Muerto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Canto de Puente Muerto entre al campo de batalla, pon las diez primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, elige una carta al azar de tu cementerio. Si es una carta de criatura, ponla en el campo de batalla. De lo contrario, pon esa carta en tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a17b86-659a-4785-bc09-3d9816712727\', \'multiverseId\': 483337}, \'multiverseid\': 483337}, {\'name\': \'Chant de Mortepont\', \'text\': "Quand le Chant de Mortepont arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez les dix cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\\nAu début de votre entretien, choisissez une carte au hasard dans votre cimetière. Si c\'est une carte de créature, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille. Sinon, mettez-la dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483588&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c1f9e0-8863-4403-b574-053333e8ecd5\', \'multiverseId\': 483588}, \'multiverseid\': 483588}, {\'name\': \'Canto di Pontemorto\', \'text\': "Quando il Canto di Pontemorto entra nel campo di battaglia, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime dieci carte del tuo grimorio.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, scegli una carta a caso nel tuo cimitero. Se è una carta creatura, mettila sul campo di battaglia. Altrimenti, aggiungila alla tua mano.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7080eb6-d15e-4c53-ae04-944bcc74976f\', \'multiverseId\': 483839}, \'multiverseid\': 483839}, {\'name\': \'死橋の詠唱\', \'text\': \'死橋の詠唱が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを10枚あなたの墓地に置く。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を無作為に選ぶ。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、それを戦場に出す。そうでないなら、それをあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2189cc24-92a4-4d39-b4c0-9d96c5ac9b09\', \'multiverseId\': 484090}, \'multiverseid\': 484090}, {\'name\': \'Cântico de Ponte Mortífera\', \'text\': \'Quando Cântico de Ponte Mortífera entrar no campo de batalha, coloque os dez cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, escolha um card de seu cemitério aleatoriamente. Se for um card de criatura, coloque-o no campo de batalha. Do contrário, coloque-o em sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0281e06b-fad8-4585-a3e4-a9ba7d9d92de\', \'multiverseId\': 484341}, \'multiverseid\': 484341}, {\'name\': \'Песнь Мертвого Моста\', \'text\': \'Когда Песнь Мертвого Моста выходит на поле битвы, положите десять верхних карт вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки случайным образом выберите карту на вашем кладбище. Если это карта существа, положите ее на поле битвы. В противном случае, положите ее в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89fe92fa-e050-46f2-8f37-caaf9710d161\', \'multiverseId\': 484592}, \'multiverseid\': 484592}]', "[{'name': 'Totenschlamm', 'text': 'Der Totenschlamm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Totenschlamm ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483168&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e6873d2-2e5b-4d7f-95e0-56a5555545c9', 'multiverseId': 483168}, 'multiverseid': 483168}, {'name': 'Ciénaga mortuoria', 'text': 'La Ciénaga mortuoria entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga mortuoria entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483419&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '765196ee-6438-4e54-8f58-78632c77acfe', 'multiverseId': 483419}, 'multiverseid': 483419}, {'name': 'Fondrière mortuaire', 'text': 'La Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483670&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4db83be3-349e-4d92-8b93-bb1dd884a8f9', 'multiverseId': 483670}, 'multiverseid': 483670}, {'name': 'Pantano Mortuario', 'text': 'Il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483921&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3e57a35-4c47-427e-b0cd-b218caf993d5', 'multiverseId': 483921}, 'multiverseid': 483921}, {'name': '亡骸のぬかるみ', 'text': '亡骸のぬかるみはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n亡骸のぬかるみが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484172&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c3ca96e-6b36-44fe-91d0-2eb83763f877', 'multiverseId': 484172}, 'multiverseid': 484172}, {'name': 'Lodaçal Mortuário', 'text': 'Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484423&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6e24fb7-4070-4253-a000-df8525141a55', 'multiverseId': 484423}, 'multiverseid': 484423}, {'name': 'Трупная Трясина', 'text': 'Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484674&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3f68d24-1f6a-4515-a4b8-7a95eb62a453', 'multiverseId': 484674}, 'multiverseid': 484674}]", '[{\'name\': \'Totenspross\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Man sagt, dass nichts ewig währt. Aber ich bin der Meinung, dass alles ewig währt, nur nicht unbedingt in der gewohnten Form."\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483087&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9583dbe-91fb-4e47-9866-8adc01dc6553\', \'multiverseId\': 483087}, \'multiverseid\': 483087}, {\'name\': \'Brotes de muerte\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicen que nada dura para siempre. Yo creo que todo dura para siempre, pero no en la forma a la que estás acostumbrada".\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88e1681a-094f-4901-aef8-189ad559ba1e\', \'multiverseId\': 483338}, \'multiverseid\': 483338}, {\'name\': \'Bourgeonnement de mort\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée. Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« On dit que tout a une fin. Je dis que tout dure pour l\'éternité, mais pas sous la forme à laquelle on est habitué. »\\n—Vraska", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483589&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eaf920b-7bb6-4781-9da5-27f5e5bf8ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 483589}, \'multiverseid\': 483589}, {\'name\': \'Germinazione Mortale\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicono che niente duri per sempre. Io dico che tutto dura per sempre, semplicemente non nella forma a cui si è abituati."\\n—Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'865536b8-e4b6-434b-be34-619e35ae3cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 483840}, \'multiverseid\': 483840}, {\'name\': \'死の芽吹き\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「永遠に続くものなどないと言うが、私ならすべては永遠に続くと言うね。ただその形が、見知ったものではなくなるだけさ。」\\n――ヴラスカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8564bdd3-4b93-4911-a6da-d43d4d1f663f\', \'multiverseId\': 484091}, \'multiverseid\': 484091}, {\'name\': \'Necrobrotamento\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Dizem que nada dura para sempre. Eu digo que tudo dura para sempre, mas não na forma com a qual você pode estar acostumada."\\n— Vraska\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07d788c7-68e8-45a5-9335-29fb16efb48d\', \'multiverseId\': 484342}, \'multiverseid\': 484342}, {\'name\': \'Ростки Смерти\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Говорят, что ничто не остается навечно. Я же утверждаю, что все сущее остается навечно — просто не в том виде, к которому мы привыкли».\\n— Враска\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8f76057-7688-4587-a6ff-432f25e81bca\', \'multiverseId\': 484593}, \'multiverseid\': 484593}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tribut an die Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner opfert ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du magst eintreten, aber lasse diese leblosen Dinge deiner Welt draußen."\\n—Modruni, Maro-Hexer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483072&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1fc52f2-be76-4ef3-a40b-61bdb7df2025\', \'multiverseId\': 483072}, \'multiverseid\': 483072}, {\'name\': \'Tributo a lo salvaje\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente sacrifica un artefacto o encantamiento.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puedes entrar, pero deja esas cosas sin vida de tu mundo detrás".\\n—Modruni, hechicero maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577d19d0-5b32-42ee-acdf-db3c465f5fa3\', \'multiverseId\': 483323}, \'multiverseid\': 483323}, {\'name\': \'Hommage à la forêt\', \'text\': \'Chaque adversaire sacrifie un artefact ou un enchantement.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous pouvez entrer, mais laissez derrière vous ces choses sans vie de votre monde. »\\n—Modruni, maro-sorcier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483574&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7b80e4-e8a6-4487-8cc9-69690849a003\', \'multiverseId\': 483574}, \'multiverseid\': 483574}, {\'name\': \'Tributo al Selvatico\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario sacrifica un artefatto o un incantesimo.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Puoi entrare, ma lasciati alle spalle le cose inanimate del tuo mondo."\\n—Modruni, stregone maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a4eeccc-e4e9-493e-9a9d-1925ccf613da\', \'multiverseId\': 483825}, \'multiverseid\': 483825}, {\'name\': \'野生への貢ぎ物\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれアーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「入るのは構わぬが、お前の世界のその生命無き物は置いてくるがよい。」\\n――マローの魔術師、モドルーニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf1b99b-1abe-4de1-ad00-888e1c6f9d06\', \'multiverseId\': 484076}, \'multiverseid\': 484076}, {\'name\': \'Tributo ao Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente sacrifica um artefato ou encantamento.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Podem entrar, mas deixem essas coisas sem vida de seu mundo para trás."\\n— Modruni, feiticeiro maro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d88ae44d-0747-4c44-852e-81b676266e25\', \'multiverseId\': 484327}, \'multiverseid\': 484327}, {\'name\': \'Дань Диким Землям\', \'text\': \'Каждый оппонент жертвует артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Можешь войти, но эти безжизненные вещи из твоего мира придется оставить».\\n— Модруни, маро-волшебник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8510cbf8-a6c7-4cc5-a0e4-0656bf973b42\', \'multiverseId\': 484578}, \'multiverseid\': 484578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trostloser Leuchtturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein einsamer Posten im Kampf gegen Winde, Orkane und Fluten von mörderischen Geistern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4797ad22-253e-4d95-b042-b038e7333a71\', \'multiverseId\': 483148}, \'multiverseid\': 483148}, {\'name\': \'Faro abandonado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Un centinela solitario que afronta tormentas, huracanes y mareas de espíritus homicidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487c56f6-7373-4318-bdf5-d7f92f701742\', \'multiverseId\': 483399}, \'multiverseid\': 483399}, {\'name\': \'Phare abandonné\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Une vigie solitaire faisant face aux tempêtes, ouragans et déferlantes d\'esprits homicides.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483650&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'597f4726-5e56-444a-b4b1-143b39b7d938\', \'multiverseId\': 483650}, \'multiverseid\': 483650}, {\'name\': \'Faro Diroccato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Baluardo solitario di fronte alle burrasche, agli uragani e alle maree di spiriti assassini.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c40280cf-c7ad-46ba-baf0-207702e2cfea\', \'multiverseId\': 483901}, \'multiverseid\': 483901}, {\'name\': \'僻地の灯台\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}：カードを１枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'突風やハリケーン、人殺しの霊魂の大波を人知れず迎える孤独な歩哨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1955f06a-c338-4c8a-9ba4-d5bab124e8a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484152}, \'multiverseid\': 484152}, {\'name\': \'Farol Desolado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Uma sentinela solitária enfrentando vendavais, furacões e ondas de espíritos assassinos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e8132d-9ed0-4c0d-b8de-fcd5d04112b2\', \'multiverseId\': 484403}, \'multiverseid\': 484403}, {\'name\': \'Заброшенный Маяк\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}{U}{R}, {T}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Одинокий страж, выдерживающий ветры, бури и призрачные приливы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'455bb7f0-5377-4dfd-9a20-96cc68aa9c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 484654}, \'multiverseid\': 484654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trynn, Bewahrerin des Friedens\', \'text\': \'Partner von Silvar, Verschlinger der Freien (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Silvar aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug angegriffen hast, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Mensch-Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484728&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421c2d67-c261-4f83-8bf3-a06154df502f\', \'multiverseId\': 484728}, \'multiverseid\': 484728}, {\'name\': \'Trynn, Campeona de la Libertad\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Sílvar, Devoralibres (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Sílvar en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si atacaste este turno, crea una ficha de criatura Soldado Humano blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0575338c-49b2-4f8e-b32d-cedb2db9a969\', \'multiverseId\': 484748}, \'multiverseid\': 484748}, {\'name\': \'Trynn, championne de la liberté\', \'text\': \'Partenariat avec Silvar, dévoreur des hommes libres (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Silvar dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez attaqué ce tour-ci, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Humain et Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9343b5f-0f2c-4312-a87d-16ffbb708f92\', \'multiverseId\': 484768}, \'multiverseid\': 484768}, {\'name\': \'Trynn, Campionessa della Libertà\', \'text\': "Partner di Silvar, Divoratore dei Liberi (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Silvar alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, se hai attaccato in questo turno, crea una pedina creatura Soldato Umano 1/1 bianca.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bb1021-6f4d-4ffd-9907-bd0667968bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 484788}, \'multiverseid\': 484788}, {\'name\': \'自由の勇者、トリン\', \'text\': \'自由を貪るもの、シルヴァーとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから自由を貪るもの、シルヴァーを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたが攻撃していた場合、白の１/１の人間・兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f264ff-af42-4f65-9f71-0b759ba58eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 484808}, \'multiverseid\': 484808}, {\'name\': \'Trynn, Campeã da Liberdade\', \'text\': \'Parceira de Silvar, Devorador dos Livres (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Silvar na própria mão do próprio grimório e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nNo início de sua etapa final, se você atacou neste turno, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8724eaf1-39e1-4852-bf8c-c340e3f88c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 484828}, \'multiverseid\': 484828}, {\'name\': \'Тринн, Воительница Свободы\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Сильваром, Пожирателем Свободных (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Сильвара в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага, если вы атаковали в этом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Человек Солдат.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d06860d-176a-4847-babd-76e4b9ce4689\', \'multiverseId\': 484848}, \'multiverseid\': 484848}]', "[{'name': 'Turm am Riss', 'text': 'Der Turm am Riss kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Turm am Riss ins Spiel kommt, opfere ihn, es sei denn, du bezahlst {1}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483183&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48ef77ba-91aa-4d34-a863-4809a6d5c43c', 'multiverseId': 483183}, 'multiverseid': 483183}, {'name': 'Torre de la ruptura', 'text': 'La Torre de la ruptura entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Torre de la ruptura entre al campo de batalla, sacrifícala a menos que pagues {1}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483434&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e21f8dd-f564-4ef9-a19c-d7e417d1e367', 'multiverseId': 483434}, 'multiverseid': 483434}, {'name': 'Tour de la Rupture', 'text': 'La Tour de la Rupture arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Tour de la Rupture arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez-la à moins que vous ne payiez {1}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483685&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fad8871e-e4f8-49ff-9c92-567f1a885e92', 'multiverseId': 483685}, 'multiverseid': 483685}, {'name': 'Cuspide Spaccata', 'text': 'La Cuspide Spaccata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cuspide Spaccata entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrificala a meno che non paghi {1}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483936&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98dc8ed1-47a9-4c82-a196-6c6bd4963d88', 'multiverseId': 483936}, 'multiverseid': 483936}, {'name': '断ち割る尖塔', 'text': '断ち割る尖塔はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n断ち割る尖塔が戦場に出たとき、あなたが{1}を支払わないかぎり、これを生け贄に捧げる。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484187&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1883e1ec-4d39-43f2-ba93-02d31b10056d', 'multiverseId': 484187}, 'multiverseid': 484187}, {'name': 'Cone da Ruptura', 'text': 'Cone da Ruptura entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Cone da Ruptura entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique-o, a menos que você pague {1}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484438&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6ddb9de-8f5e-4d4b-a594-e8e3cf24fdd2', 'multiverseId': 484438}, 'multiverseid': 484438}, {'name': 'Проломный Шпиль', 'text': 'Проломный Шпиль выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Проломный Шпиль выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте его, если только вы не заплатите {1}.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484689&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '617ef2e4-270c-445b-9efe-2e745331e238', 'multiverseId': 484689}, 'multiverseid': 484689}]", '[{\'name\': \'Turm des Reliquienschreins\', \'text\': \'Du hast keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Der einst von den Rittern des Reliquienschreins bewachte Turm wird nun nur durch seine entfernte Lage geschützt. Seine staubigen Schätze stehen jedem Plünderer offen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483180&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d501a75-db33-4cba-8663-22057db76d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 483180}, \'multiverseid\': 483180}, {\'name\': \'Torre del relicario\', \'text\': \'Tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Custodiada en otros tiempos por los Caballeros del Relicario, la torre se alza ahora protegida solo por su propia lejanía y con sus polvorientos tesoros expuestos a cualquier saqueador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4206b765-6c37-4a3a-84e5-724fb417d823\', \'multiverseId\': 483431}, \'multiverseid\': 483431}, {\'name\': \'Tour du Reliquaire\', \'text\': "Il n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Autrefois gardée par les Chevaliers du Reliquaire, la tour n\'est plus protégée que par son isolement et ses trésors poussiéreux sont à la merci du premier pillard.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483682&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c190d13-80f0-48d7-88d2-7f686bc5ae42\', \'multiverseId\': 483682}, \'multiverseid\': 483682}, {\'name\': \'Torre del Reliquiario\', \'text\': \'Non hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo difesa dai Cavalieri del Reliquiario, la torre è adesso protetta unicamente dalla propria inaccessibilità; chiunque potrà saccheggiarne i polverosi tesori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744a00af-534c-4b61-b9af-3ed023fca667\', \'multiverseId\': 483933}, \'multiverseid\': 483933}, {\'name\': \'聖遺の塔\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'昔、聖遺の騎士によって守られていたその塔は、外界から隔絶しているおかげで今でも立ち続けている。誰でも埃をかぶった宝物の数々を我が物にできるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f49bfe51-6d70-4232-a81c-33fcee943609\', \'multiverseId\': 484184}, \'multiverseid\': 484184}, {\'name\': \'Torre do Relicário\', \'text\': \'Não há limite para o número máximo de cards em sua mão.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Outrora guardada pelos Cavaleiros do Relicário, hoje a torre é protegida somente por sua posição remota, com seus tesouros empoeirados vulneráveis aos ataques de saqueadores.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'921d8c65-2f39-4539-83b1-ab6482e4faef\', \'multiverseId\': 484435}, \'multiverseid\': 484435}, {\'name\': \'Башня-Реликварий\', \'text\': \'Размер вашей руки неограничен.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Когда-то эту башню охраняли рыцари Реликвария, а теперь она защищена лишь тем, что находится вдали от цивилизации. Ее пыльные сокровища доступны любому.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfb0b0c0-c198-4ebd-afda-eff5d3e86760\', \'multiverseId\': 484686}, \'multiverseid\': 484686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tödlicher Sturmwind\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen. Jeder Spieler verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Anzahl an Kreaturen, die er kontrolliert hat und die auf diese Weise zerstört wurden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn ein Sturm aus der Unterwelt heraufbläst, bringt er nur Tod und Verderben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07fe702-b8e8-41ae-b869-7b5a21fa31d5\', \'multiverseId\': 483010}, \'multiverseid\': 483010}, {\'name\': \'Tempestad mortal\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Cada jugador pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la cantidad de criaturas que controlaba que fueron destruidas de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando el viento sopla desde el abismo, la única cosecha posible es la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8710c45-6c2e-4a48-9325-9567393ff982\', \'multiverseId\': 483261}, \'multiverseid\': 483261}, {\'name\': \'Tempête mortelle\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures. Chaque joueur perd un nombre de points de vie égal au nombre de créatures qu\'il contrôlait qui ont été détruites de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Quand le vent s\'élève des profondeurs abyssales, il ne sème que la mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483512&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452dcf0e-eb21-4dd7-97f4-14ba721dd22e\', \'multiverseId\': 483512}, \'multiverseid\': 483512}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Mortale\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature. Ogni giocatore perde punti vita pari al numero di creature che controllava distrutte in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Quando i venti soffiano dall\'abisso, l\'unico raccolto è la morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a791fbf5-b1b2-4e8a-8d8a-ebecee50d518\', \'multiverseId\': 483763}, \'multiverseid\': 483763}, {\'name\': \'命取りの大嵐\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーをすべて破壊する。各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしていてこれにより破壊されたクリーチャーの総数に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'深淵から風が吹くとき、それが収穫するのは死だけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3755f8-b56e-4198-a75f-18449f73959e\', \'multiverseId\': 484014}, \'multiverseid\': 484014}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade Mortífera\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Cada jogador perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao número de criaturas que ele controlava que foram destruídas dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Quando o vento sopra do abismo, colhe-se apenas a morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'454e5685-d08d-485d-b726-466ca04dbd33\', \'multiverseId\': 484265}, \'multiverseid\': 484265}, {\'name\': \'Смертоносная Буря\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа. Каждый игрок теряет количество жизней, равное количеству уничтоженных таким образом существ под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда ветер дует из бездны, урожаем будет только смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ad0978-b088-4872-91ff-679e9cf3bb63\', \'multiverseId\': 484516}, \'multiverseid\': 484516}]', "[{'name': 'Tödliches Toben', 'text': 'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nSchicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Otrimi war enttäuscht darüber, wie schnell sein neuer Freund ermüdete und aufhörte zu spielen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484940&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00f3dfc3-d15d-4605-ae79-90f9a6093198', 'multiverseId': 484940}, 'multiverseid': 484940}, {'name': 'Jugueteo mortal', 'text': 'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nExilia la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Otrimi se decepcionó de lo rápido que su amiguito nuevo se había cansado de jugar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484991&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5893600-cc97-4089-a1a3-b8ea45bf32b7', 'multiverseId': 484991}, 'multiverseid': 484991}, {'name': 'Ripaille mortelle', 'text': 'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nExilez la créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Otrimi fut déçu de la vitesse à laquelle son nouvel ami se fatigua et arrêta de jouer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485042&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '847d1443-e509-4842-8145-41e991ccba50', 'multiverseId': 485042}, 'multiverseid': 485042}, {'name': 'Passatempo Mortale', 'text': 'Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nEsilia una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Otrimi rimase deluso per la rapidità con cui il suo nuovo amico si stancò e smise di giocare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485093&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4dd2c34-7f61-48b9-8a52-654801074462', 'multiverseId': 485093}, 'multiverseid': 485093}, {'name': '致命的なはしゃぎ回り', 'text': 'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '新しい友達がすぐに疲れて遊ぶのをやめてしまったので、オツリーミはがっかりした。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485144&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36faa512-d96d-4e07-b78b-fc8b70c51fac', 'multiverseId': 485144}, 'multiverseid': 485144}, {'name': 'Brincadeira Mortal', 'text': 'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nExile a criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Otrimi ficou decepcionada, pois seu novo amiguinho logo ficou cansado e parou de brincar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485195&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33ce8ed7-7412-4b68-875e-c30f97f56e68', 'multiverseId': 485195}, 'multiverseid': 485195}, {'name': 'Смертельная Проделка', 'text': 'Если у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете разыграть это заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\\nИзгоните целевое существо.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Отрими расстроился из-за того, как быстро его новый друг устал и перестал играть.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485246&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae8ac4ba-e532-4123-a624-6983f1bab050', 'multiverseId': 485246}, 'multiverseid': 485246}]", "[{'name': 'Ukkima, der schleichende Schatten', 'text': 'Partner von Cazur, skrupelloser Jäger (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Ukkima aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nUkkima, der schleichende Schatten, kann nicht geblockt werden.\\nWenn Ukkima das Spiel verlässt, fügt er einem Spieler deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich seiner Stärke ist.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Wal, Wolf', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484744&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae373660-01f8-436b-88ec-ea10896ebb2e', 'multiverseId': 484744}, 'multiverseid': 484744}, {'name': 'Ukkima, sombra acechadora', 'text': 'Camarada de Cazur, acechador despiadado (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Cazur en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nUkkima, sombra acechadora no puede ser bloqueada.\\nCuando Ukkima deje el campo de batalla, hace X puntos de daño al jugador objetivo y tú ganas X vidas, donde X es su fuerza.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Lobo ballena', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484764&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c3c1a46-9e75-4065-984c-c9e9cc5229ba', 'multiverseId': 484764}, 'multiverseid': 484764}, {'name': 'Ukkima, ombre en chasse', 'text': 'Partenariat avec Cazur, pisteur impitoyable (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, le joueur ciblé peut mettre Cazur dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nUkkima, ombre en chasse ne peut pas être bloquée.\\nQuand Ukkima quitte le champ de bataille, elle inflige X blessures au joueur ciblé et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant sa force.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : baleine et loup', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484784&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6eee2d7f-b085-4bc9-87fd-76d4863f41c5', 'multiverseId': 484784}, 'multiverseid': 484784}, {'name': 'Ukkima, Ombra Cacciatrice', 'text': 'Partner di Casur, Cacciatore Spietato (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, un giocatore bersaglio può aggiungere Casur alla sua mano dal suo grimorio, poi rimescolare.)\\nUkkima, Ombra Cacciatrice non può essere bloccata.\\nQuando Ukkima lascia il campo di battaglia, infligge X danni a un giocatore bersaglio e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è la sua forza.', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Lupo Balena', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484804&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9457657e-a6e9-433e-b3ef-558112c421e9', 'multiverseId': 484804}, 'multiverseid': 484804}, {'name': '追跡する影、ウキーマ', 'text': '無情な追跡者、カズルとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから無情な追跡者、カズルを自分の手札に加え、その後切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n追跡する影、ウキーマはブロックされない。\\n追跡する影、ウキーマが戦場を離れたとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそのプレイヤーにＸ点のダメージを与え、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 鯨・狼', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484824&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a513ff4-43f2-47eb-9a56-314e1ef0d2de', 'multiverseId': 484824}, 'multiverseid': 484824}, {'name': 'Ukkima, Sombra Espreitadora', 'text': 'Parceiro de Cazur, Espreitador Impiedoso (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, o jogador alvo pode colocar Cazur na própria mão do próprio cemitério e, em seguida, embaralhar.)\\nUkkima, Sombra Espreitadora, não pode ser bloqueada.\\nQuando Ukkima deixa o campo de batalha, ela causa X pontos de dano ao jogador alvo e você ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X o poder de Ukkima.', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Baleia Lobo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484844&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c72c173d-715f-43cc-81b8-07dd09720b7c', 'multiverseId': 484844}, 'multiverseid': 484844}, {'name': 'Уккима, Хищная Тень', 'text': 'Партнер с Казуром, Беспощадным Следопытом (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, целевой игрок может положить Казура в свою руку из своей библиотеки, затем перетасовать ее.)\\nУккима, Хищная Тень не может быть заблокирована.\\nКогда Уккима покидает поле битвы, она наносит X повреждений целевому игроку, а вы получаете X жизней, где X — значение ее силы.', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Кит Волк', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484864&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2ca697b-8293-49af-a698-773fb4d5f8e9', 'multiverseId': 484864}, 'multiverseid': 484864}]", "[{'name': 'Unbeanspruchtes Territorium', 'text': 'Sowie das Unbeanspruchte Territorium ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Kreaturenzauber des bestimmten Typs zu wirken.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483199&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9414798a-004f-4e04-a2c3-d663a6b11c0b', 'multiverseId': 483199}, 'multiverseid': 483199}, {'name': 'Territorio virgen', 'text': 'En cuanto el Territorio virgen entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de criatura del tipo elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483450&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31a81e5e-4338-446f-b3af-5e10a958a569', 'multiverseId': 483450}, 'multiverseid': 483450}, {'name': 'Terra nullius', 'text': 'Au moment où la Terra nullius arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de créature du type choisi.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483701&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af49cc10-6864-4088-8d3b-e2876cd9cec3', 'multiverseId': 483701}, 'multiverseid': 483701}, {'name': 'Territorio Non Rivendicato', 'text': 'Mentre il Territorio Non Rivendicato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia creatura del tipo scelto.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483952&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c461a8b-430c-4b36-81fb-b053bcd0c9cb', 'multiverseId': 483952}, 'multiverseid': 483952}, {'name': '手付かずの領土', 'text': '手付かずの領土が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためにしか使用できない。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484203&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f183bcae-d7d4-45db-9bbf-91b27f6e902b', 'multiverseId': 484203}, 'multiverseid': 484203}, {'name': 'Território Não Reivindicado', 'text': 'Conforme Território Não Reivindicado entra no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Gaste este mana apenas para conjurar uma mágica de criatura do tipo escolhido.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484454&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '878010eb-3eda-44c4-a4ef-b4a004fba888', 'multiverseId': 484454}, 'multiverseid': 484454}, {'name': 'Неизведанные Земли', 'text': 'При выходе Неизведанных Земель на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания существа выбранного типа.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484705&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7256f088-fbbd-469d-82af-f0ae2dbda625', 'multiverseId': 484705}, 'multiverseid': 484705}]", "[{'name': 'Unvermittelte Abwesenheit', 'text': 'Lege eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, unter die obersten X Karten der Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Wurdest du einmal vom Strom der Zeit mitgerissen, wirst du niemals mehr deiner eigenen Beständigkeit vertrauen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482985&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22a91711-d7e9-4818-a553-ad6ece9a0684', 'multiverseId': 482985}, 'multiverseid': 482985}, {'name': 'Ausencia inesperada', 'text': 'Pon el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra en la biblioteca de su propietario, justo debajo de las primeras X cartas de esa biblioteca.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Una vez te han arrastrado las corrientes del tiempo, ya no volverás a confiar en tu propia permanencia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483236&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce6fb8da-66ec-4b55-8590-79d22b543690', 'multiverseId': 483236}, 'multiverseid': 483236}, {'name': 'Absence imprévue', 'text': 'Mettez le permanent non-terrain ciblé dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire juste au-dessous des X cartes du dessus de cette bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Une fois que vous aurez été entraîné par les courants du temps, vous ne serez plus jamais sûr de votre propre continuité.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483487&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af2d667f-9534-40ed-9a15-effcc14a2d85', 'multiverseId': 483487}, 'multiverseid': 483487}, {'name': 'Assenza Inaspettata', 'text': 'Metti un permanente non terra bersaglio nel grimorio del suo proprietario subito sotto le prime X carte di quel grimorio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Dopo essere stato trascinato lungo le correnti del tempo, non potrai mai più credere nella tua stessa permanenza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483738&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99cc8e0a-520b-419e-b129-b15fb3103664', 'multiverseId': 483738}, 'multiverseid': 483738}, {'name': '予期せぬ不在', 'text': '土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードの直下に置く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '一度時に流されてしまえば、自己の永続性を信じられなくなるものである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483989&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c88f6dd1-6b57-493a-b9fe-cd5475afd40b', 'multiverseId': 483989}, 'multiverseid': 483989}, {'name': 'Ausência Inesperada', 'text': 'Coloque a permanente alvo que não seja um terreno no grimório de seu dono abaixo dos X cards do topo daquele grimório.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Uma vez arrastado pelas correntes do tempo, você jamais voltará a confiar tanto em sua própria permanência.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484240&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dacd26c9-0c54-45c4-b33b-17ee6cb5cbe2', 'multiverseId': 484240}, 'multiverseid': 484240}, {'name': 'Неожиданное Отсутствие', 'text': 'Положите целевой не являющийся землей перманент в библиотеку его владельца под X верхних карт той библиотеки.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Когда тебя затянуло в потоки времени, ты больше никогда не будешь уверен в своей постоянности.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484491&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ebaddb9-9497-48f7-858d-92a54bf7bb4b', 'multiverseId': 484491}, 'multiverseid': 484491}]", '[{\'name\': \'Vampir-Nachtschwärmer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Während der Kämpfe gegen die Eldrazi lernten viele Vampire, unter Menschen zu leben. Aber nicht alle vermochten, ihre alten Gewohnheiten abzulegen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11bcdaf2-1a0c-41c2-850c-65013b0a0352\', \'multiverseId\': 483019}, \'multiverseid\': 483019}, {\'name\': \'Halcón nocturno vampiro\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal, vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras luchaban contra los Eldrazi, muchos vampiros aprendieron a vivir junto a los humanos. Otros... no terminaron de adaptarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5715a1-2f2d-4068-8f52-845c1d71d272\', \'multiverseId\': 483270}, \'multiverseid\': 483270}, {\'name\': \'Faucon de nuit vampire\', \'text\': \'Vol, contact mortel, lien de vie\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et shamane\', \'flavor\': "En combattant les Eldrazi, beaucoup de vampires apprirent à vivre parmi les humains. D\'autres ne réussirent jamais à s\'adapter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483521&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10c4e5ac-7eb5-4b0d-983b-e8106dab1719\', \'multiverseId\': 483521}, \'multiverseid\': 483521}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro Falco Notturno\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale, legame vitale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre lottavano contro gli Eldrazi, molti vampiri hanno imparato a vivere tra gli umani. Altri, invece, non hanno saputo adattarsi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b83d70-104a-4735-afae-4b76c4384745\', \'multiverseId\': 483772}, \'multiverseid\': 483772}, {\'name\': \'吸血鬼の夜鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死、絆魂\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージと戦い続けるうち、多くの吸血鬼が人間たちと共に生きる術を学んだが、うまく適応できないものもいた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'627a9260-6c83-4c20-91b3-b7c1dc18cea0\', \'multiverseId\': 484023}, \'multiverseid\': 484023}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro Falcão-da-noite\', \'text\': \'Voar, toque mortífero, vínculo com a vida\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme enfrentavam os Eldrazi, muitos vampiros aprenderam a viver entre os humanos. Outros foram incapazes de se adaptar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d939add-46b1-4f99-9c2b-4d33df58f9b8\', \'multiverseId\': 484274}, \'multiverseid\': 484274}, {\'name\': \'Вампир-Полуночник\', \'text\': \'Полет, Смертельное касание, Цепь жизни\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Сражаясь с Эльдрази, многие вампиры научились жить среди людей. Другие так и не смогли приспособиться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcf066ae-4e88-41bc-85d1-d5cfbb768f83\', \'multiverseId\': 484525}, \'multiverseid\': 484525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verbergender Dunstschleier\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nVerhindere allen Schaden, der in diesem Zug von Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ob Jäger oder Gejagter, Kathril entscheidet, wann er gesehen wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3932785b-d04d-463f-931b-ada78112505a\', \'multiverseId\': 484959}, \'multiverseid\': 484959}, {\'name\': \'Neblina oscurecedora\', \'text\': \'Si controlas un comandante, puedes lanzar este hechizo sin pagar su coste de maná.\\nPrevén todo el daño que fueran a hacer este turno las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ya sea cazador o presa, Kathril elige cuándo se lo ve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b50df7-d53d-412e-8ebd-14f8a6ff3c91\', \'multiverseId\': 485010}, \'multiverseid\': 485010}, {\'name\': \'Brume obscurcissante\', \'text\': \'Si vous contrôlez un commandant, vous pouvez lancer ce sort sans payer son coût de mana.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci par des créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'il soit chasseur ou chassé, Kathril décide à quel moment on le voit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a55e686-384f-49f8-8b0a-39be038e02c1\', \'multiverseId\': 485061}, \'multiverseid\': 485061}, {\'name\': \'Foschia Oscurante\', \'text\': \'Se controlli un comandante, puoi lanciare questa magia senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno da creature controllate dai tuoi avversari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Che sia cacciatore o preda, è Kathril a decidere quando farsi vedere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c9f18bd-5788-44c8-8406-fe43ddffeb72\', \'multiverseId\': 485112}, \'multiverseid\': 485112}, {\'name\': \'ぼやかす薄霧\', \'text\': \'あなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたはこの呪文をこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\nこのターン、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーから受けるダメージをすべて軽減する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'狩る側であろうと狩られる側であろうと、いつ姿を見せるかはカスリルが選ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d73221b-97fe-469d-bab6-3ee62336fb09\', \'multiverseId\': 485163}, \'multiverseid\': 485163}, {\'name\': \'Brumas Ofuscantes\', \'text\': \'Se você controla um comandante, você pode conjurar esta mágica sem pagar seu custo de mana.\\nPrevina todo o dano que seria causado neste turno por criaturas que seus oponentes controlam.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Seja caça ou caçador, Kathril sempre escolhe quando será visto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94223f2f-8843-41f3-8a3e-29756e98a7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 485214}, \'multiverseid\': 485214}, {\'name\': \'Скрывающая Дымка\', \'text\': \'Если у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете разыграть это заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\\nПредотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены в этом ходу существами под контролем ваших оппонентов.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Охотится ли он или охотятся на него, но Кетрил сам выбирает, когда его можно увидеть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16dac6ac-576a-4269-b1f1-92a81fa38764\', \'multiverseId\': 485265}, \'multiverseid\': 485265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verdoppelnder Stab\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Zauberspruch ein- oder mehrmals kopieren würdest, kopiere ihn stattdessen so oft plus ein weiteres Mal. Du kannst neue Ziele für die zusätzliche Kopie bestimmen.\\n{7}, {T}: Kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl, den bzw. die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b30e76e-0a4b-460b-b2c9-74247aa2f5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 484968}, \'multiverseid\': 484968}, {\'name\': \'Cetro duplicador\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a copiar un hechizo una o más veces, en vez de eso, cópialo esa cantidad de veces más una vez más. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia adicional.\\n{7}, {T}: Copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91872fc-c435-415d-8ef6-00b7aa5b0d07\', \'multiverseId\': 485019}, \'multiverseid\': 485019}, {\'name\': \'Bâton dédoublant\', \'text\': "Si vous deviez copier un sort au moins une fois, à la place copiez-le autant de fois plus une fois supplémentaire. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour la copie supplémentaire.\\n{7}, {T} : Copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f0384a7-23f6-49b0-9da1-64370cecd1db\', \'multiverseId\': 485070}, \'multiverseid\': 485070}, {\'name\': \'Bastone Sdoppiante\', \'text\': \'Se stai per copiare una magia una o più volte, invece copiala una volta in più. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia addizionale.\\n{7}, {T}: Copia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio che controlli. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76d4f107-5a8b-460b-bb4d-38b1f4601a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 485121}, \'multiverseid\': 485121}, {\'name\': \'双晶の杖\', \'text\': \'あなたが呪文１つを１回以上コピーするなら、代わりに、それをその回数に加えて追加でもう１回コピーする。あなたはその追加のコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\n{7}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしていてインスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とし、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e63cf5-a588-4058-a87b-df34e8b54e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 485172}, \'multiverseid\': 485172}, {\'name\': \'Cajado Gemelar\', \'text\': \'Se você copiaria uma mágica uma ou mais vezes, em vez disso, copie aquela mágica aquela quantidade de vezes mais uma vez adicional. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia adicional.\\n{7}, {T}: Copie a mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo que você controla. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e873218d-57d1-41c4-9716-0939473ed244\', \'multiverseId\': 485223}, \'multiverseid\': 485223}, {\'name\': \'Раздваивающий Посох\', \'text\': \'Если вы должны скопировать заклинание одно или несколько раз, вместо этого скопируйте его столько же раз плюс один дополнительный раз. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той дополнительной копии.\\n{7}, {T}: скопируйте целевое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства под вашим контролем. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03e8d428-7146-4b45-b60e-31415739ba2f\', \'multiverseId\': 485274}, \'multiverseid\': 485274}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verfaulen lassen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Es bzw. sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir alle verfallen und sind stets dem Tode nahe. Ein Augenblick ohne Atem, und schon beginnen wir zu kollabieren."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari-Schamane\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483107&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46fe5923-162c-402c-af16-3185e67832d4\', \'multiverseId\': 483107}, \'multiverseid\': 483107}, {\'name\': \'Pudrir\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos estamos en descomposición, siempre en un estado cercano a la muerte. Un instante sin aliento y comenzamos a venirnos abajo".\\n—Cevraya, chamán golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00debf36-e224-4d48-832e-f4de49a901f0\', \'multiverseId\': 483358}, \'multiverseid\': 483358}, {\'name\': \'Putréfier\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou la créature ciblée. Ils ne peuvent pas être régénérés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous pourrissons tous, dans un état perpétuel de mort imminente. Un instant sans respirer, et la désagrégation commence. »\\n—Cevraya, shamane de Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483609&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79ffca64-e4f3-484d-b90d-4adc2fc6f2b5\', \'multiverseId\': 483609}, \'multiverseid\': 483609}, {\'name\': \'Putrificare\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerato.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Siamo tutti in decadimento, sempre in uno stato vicino alla morte. Pochi istanti senza respirare e iniziamo a guastarci."\\n—Cevraya, sciamana Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4627a2-cedb-49e4-8223-1b60a4e4577a\', \'multiverseId\': 483860}, \'multiverseid\': 483860}, {\'name\': \'化膿\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「みんな衰えていくばかりさ。いつだって死の一歩手前。そうして息が止まった瞬間に崩壊が始まるんだ。」\\n――ゴルガリのシャーマン、セヴリヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e3d6ea3-3115-47c2-9f1a-cacf44bda61a\', \'multiverseId\': 484111}, \'multiverseid\': 484111}, {\'name\': \'Putrificar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou a criatura alvo. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Estamos todos em decadência, sempre em um estado de quase morte. Um momento sem respirar e começamos a sucumbir."\\n— Cevraya, xamã Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b55623a2-0146-4613-bd70-b0f1a31eeb0e\', \'multiverseId\': 484362}, \'multiverseid\': 484362}, {\'name\': \'Гниение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или существо. Он(-о) не может быть регенерирован(-о).\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Все мы дряхлеем, все мы стоим на грани умирания. Стоит пропустить один вдох — и начнем разлагаться».\\n— Севрайя, шаманка Голгари\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1052bc5-f3e8-41ed-94f4-46449bee7429\', \'multiverseId\': 484613}, \'multiverseid\': 484613}]', "[{'name': 'Vergessene Höhle', 'text': 'Die Vergessene Höhle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nUmwandlung {R} ({R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483153&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb032d7b-90d6-4c5e-b783-aad786a959fa', 'multiverseId': 483153}, 'multiverseid': 483153}, {'name': 'Cueva olvidada', 'text': 'La Cueva olvidada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nCiclo {R}. ({R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483404&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1624e9d0-cb8a-447d-b352-47703663369c', 'multiverseId': 483404}, 'multiverseid': 483404}, {'name': 'Caverne oubliée', 'text': 'La Caverne oubliée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nRecyclage {R} ({R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483655&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffbb9fc9-3e6d-4ac5-85b1-ead7c18747d7', 'multiverseId': 483655}, 'multiverseid': 483655}, {'name': 'Caverna Dimenticata', 'text': 'La Caverna Dimenticata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nCiclo {R} ({R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483906&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e346a03f-e6f5-417d-9e47-8f85e569f5f1', 'multiverseId': 483906}, 'multiverseid': 483906}, {'name': '忘れられた洞窟', 'text': '忘れられた洞窟はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{R}（{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484157&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd721ba9a-e44f-44ae-b261-c7bfdf2246ec', 'multiverseId': 484157}, 'multiverseid': 484157}, {'name': 'Caverna Esquecida', 'text': 'Caverna Esquecida entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\nReciclar {R} ({R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484408&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '656932ff-4a61-4e80-88c6-ae8b6cb72b1e', 'multiverseId': 484408}, 'multiverseid': 484408}, {'name': 'Забытая Пещера', 'text': 'Забытая Пещера выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\nЦикл {R} ({R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484659&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '399710a0-adbf-4a2f-acb0-c3bec384cb47', 'multiverseId': 484659}, 'multiverseid': 484659}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verhackstücken\', \'text\': \'Verhackstücken fügt jeder Kreatur 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nUmwandlung {2}{R} ({2}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du Verhackstücken umwandelst, kannst du es jeder Kreatur 1 Schadenspunkt zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483038&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67590381-b0e8-4c91-af33-6666ba60a261\', \'multiverseId\': 483038}, \'multiverseid\': 483038}, {\'name\': \'Despedazar\', \'text\': \'Despedazar hace 4 puntos de daño a cada criatura.\\nCiclo {2}{R}. ({2}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de Despedazar, puedes elegir que haga 1 punto de daño a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64b959fd-1e45-409c-a958-ff5693fd408f\', \'multiverseId\': 483289}, \'multiverseid\': 483289}, {\'name\': \'Une bonne tranche\', \'text\': "Une bonne tranche inflige 4 blessures à chaque créature.\\nRecyclage {2}{R} ({2}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez Une bonne tranche, vous pouvez faire qu\'elle inflige 1 blessure à chaque créature.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0e5bc3-5127-47ba-a719-7c67658dd930\', \'multiverseId\': 483540}, \'multiverseid\': 483540}, {\'name\': \'Fare a Fette\', \'text\': \'Fare a Fette infligge 4 danni a ogni creatura.\\nCiclo {2}{R} ({2}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli Fare a Fette, puoi fargli infliggere 1 danno a ogni creatura.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e88b61-5bea-43c4-ab67-3f1467d14bf3\', \'multiverseId\': 483791}, \'multiverseid\': 483791}, {\'name\': \'めった切り\', \'text\': \'めった切りは各クリーチャーにそれぞれ４点のダメージを与える。\\nサイクリング{2}{R}（{2}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたがめった切りをサイクリングしたとき、あなたは「めった切りは各クリーチャーにそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db55afa9-6e7c-4b72-ae3e-a74f8d16976a\', \'multiverseId\': 484042}, \'multiverseid\': 484042}, {\'name\': \'Despedaçar\', \'text\': \'Despedaçar causa 4 pontos de dano a cada criatura.\\nReciclar {2}{R} ({2}{R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando recicla Despedaçar, você pode fazer com que ele cause 1 ponto de dano a cada criatura.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a97d9b57-545d-4a43-9074-bdb511607c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 484293}, \'multiverseid\': 484293}, {\'name\': \'Нашинковать\', \'text\': \'Нашинковать наносит 4 повреждения каждому существу.\\nЦикл {2}{R} ({2}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл карты Нашинковать, вы можете заставить ее нанести 1 повреждение каждому существу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cff1808-5879-46af-a681-2ec5a90b1ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 484544}, \'multiverseid\': 484544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheerender Mechakoloss\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn der Verheerende Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur, eine Verzauberung und einen Planeswalker unter den bleibenden Karten, die er kontrolliert und die keine Länder sind, und opfert dann den Rest.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471d9595-4d98-428a-abe4-e0e6d847b9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 482959}, \'multiverseid\': 482959}, {\'name\': \'Mecatitán cataclísmico\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando el Mecatitán cataclísmico entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador elige un artefacto, una criatura, un encantamiento y un planeswalker de entre los permanentes que no sean tierra que controla, luego sacrifica el resto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc01c45-0738-4ce5-9c06-7991e2364851\', \'multiverseId\': 483210}, \'multiverseid\': 483210}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse mécanique cataclysmique\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique cataclysmique arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur choisit un artefact, une créature, un enchantement et un planeswalker parmi les permanents non-terrain qu\'il contrôle, puis sacrifie le reste.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821f76aa-bbbc-42c2-a9ae-47a1f31503f0\', \'multiverseId\': 483461}, \'multiverseid\': 483461}, {\'name\': \'Meccatitano del Cataclisma\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando il Meccatitano del Cataclisma entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sceglie un artefatto, una creatura, un incantesimo e un planeswalker tra i permanenti non terra che controlla, poi sacrifica gli altri.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bae90b32-9dfa-4f8d-a611-f828a7b6d5cb\', \'multiverseId\': 483712}, \'multiverseid\': 483712}, {\'name\': \'激変の機械巨人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n激変の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネントの中から、アーティファクト１つとクリーチャー１体とエンチャント１つとプレインズウォーカー１体を選び、その後残りを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7baa9f68-f809-402b-a075-5fea51f03d49\', \'multiverseId\': 483963}, \'multiverseid\': 483963}, {\'name\': \'Mecanotitã Cataclísmico\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nQuando Mecanotitã Cataclísmico entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador escolhe um artefato, uma criatura, um encantamento e um planeswalker dentre as permanentes que não sejam terrenos que este controla e, em seguida, sacrifica as restantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96ffaf61-19a5-4aa5-8664-e8281d512ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 484214}, \'multiverseid\': 484214}, {\'name\': \'Мехагигант Катаклизмов\', \'text\': "Бдительность\\nКогда Мехагигант Катаклизмов выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок выбирает из не являющихся землями перманентов под своим контролем артефакт, существо, чары и planeswalker\'а, затем жертвует остальные.", \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a03f6b4-b223-479b-b079-1ba435ce5287\', \'multiverseId\': 484465}, \'multiverseid\': 484465}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verheertes Waldland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, opfere das Verheerte Waldland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483137&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68d03c6a-8bdb-4d22-9b73-570c8571db90\', \'multiverseId\': 483137}, \'multiverseid\': 483137}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda corrompida\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T},sacrificar la Arboleda corrompida: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1931d2d-6725-454f-b3d8-25ca47b6ea73\', \'multiverseId\': 483388}, \'multiverseid\': 483388}, {\'name\': \'Sylves gangrenées\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez les Sylves gangrenées : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483639&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a21feb-45b9-4f15-87a0-2ea51059d0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 483639}, \'multiverseid\': 483639}, {\'name\': \'Boscaglia Morente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifica la Boscaglia Morente: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099af793-7bba-45c5-922c-7beb54283a46\', \'multiverseId\': 483890}, \'multiverseid\': 483890}, {\'name\': \'荒廃した森林\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}{G}, {T}, 荒廃した森林を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ff0adaa-ac11-4f59-b721-3ce3558bcd68\', \'multiverseId\': 484141}, \'multiverseid\': 484141}, {\'name\': \'Floresta Flagelada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, sacrifique Floresta Flagelada: Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b001cf5-133e-4222-a1ce-0287fd9dfede\', \'multiverseId\': 484392}, \'multiverseid\': 484392}, {\'name\': \'Порченый Лес\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, пожертвуйте Порченый Лес: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a110c836-90c5-4102-a2b2-3cacd19d9edd\', \'multiverseId\': 484643}, \'multiverseid\': 484643}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verlassener Sarkophag\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Zaubersprüche, die eine Umwandlung-Fähigkeit haben, aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\\nFalls eine Karte mit einer Umwandlung-Fähigkeit von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, ohne dass sie umgewandelt wurde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Was einst ruhte, ruht nicht mehr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483115&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b63af2a-2421-4af6-832b-042fd6f08194\', \'multiverseId\': 483115}, \'multiverseid\': 483115}, {\'name\': \'Sarcófago abandonado\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar hechizos que tengan una habilidad de ciclo desde tu cementerio.\\nSi una carta que tiene una habilidad de ciclo fuera a ir tu cementerio desde cualquier parte sin haberse activado su habilidad de ciclo, en vez de eso exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'A pesar de llevar largo tiempo muertos, los disidentes desterrados por fin pudieron vengarse.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dcbd8f8-0fa5-4a6a-97d0-6d10c9bdc492\', \'multiverseId\': 483366}, \'multiverseid\': 483366}, {\'name\': \'Sarcophage abandonné\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez lancer des sorts qui ont une capacité de recyclage depuis votre cimetière.\\nSi une carte qui a une capacité de recyclage devait être mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne et qu\'elle n\'a pas été recyclée, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Même morts depuis longtemps, les dissidents bannis purent enfin assouvir leur vengeance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483617&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d2786e-18ea-4f57-909a-34965f456fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 483617}, \'multiverseid\': 483617}, {\'name\': \'Sarcofago Abbandonato\', \'text\': "Puoi lanciare magie che hanno un\'abilità ciclo dal tuo cimitero.\\nSe una carta che ha un\'abilità ciclo sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona e non è stata ciclata, invece esiliala.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Per quanto fossero morti da tempo, i dissenzienti esiliati finalmente ottennero la loro vendetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d855f0e-49b0-44cd-aeff-9911352399a4\', \'multiverseId\': 483868}, \'multiverseid\': 483868}, {\'name\': \'見捨てられた石棺\', \'text\': \'あなたはあなたの墓地から、サイクリング能力を持つ呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nサイクリング能力を持つカードがサイクリングされずにいずれかの領域からあなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'死後長きを経て、追放された造反者たちはついに復讐を果たした。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be33f4ff-7cb9-45eb-aea9-e45c88d1e391\', \'multiverseId\': 484119}, \'multiverseid\': 484119}, {\'name\': \'Sarcófago Abandonado\', \'text\': \'Você pode conjurar mágicas com a habilidade reciclar do seu cemitério.\\nSe um card com uma habilidade reciclar seria colocado no seu cemitério vindo de qualquer lugar e ele não tiver sido reciclado, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Embora mortos havia muito tempo, os dissidentes banidos finalmente tiveram sua vingança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea1b169-2cf5-4e31-85dc-7b6fdf9dbc70\', \'multiverseId\': 484370}, \'multiverseid\': 484370}, {\'name\': \'Брошенный Саркофаг\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать заклинания со способностью Цикла из вашего кладбища.\\nЕсли карта, у которой есть способность Цикла, должна откуда угодно попасть на ваше кладбище, и ее Цикл не был использован, изгоните ее вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Изгнанные инакомыслящие давно были мертвы, но наконец-то они смогли отомстить за себя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a820ed-8fbc-4c0e-ba94-5fbf69e78bd8\', \'multiverseId\': 484621}, \'multiverseid\': 484621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vermummter Bewunderer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Vermummte Bewunderer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn du einen Kreaturenzauber wirkst, kannst du {G}{G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe den Vermummten Bewunderer aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Schönheit bestimmt den Wert, und wir legen fest, was schön ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483062&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfc07df-7f94-4627-9c34-290d3f861785\', \'multiverseId\': 483062}, \'multiverseid\': 483062}, {\'name\': \'Admiradores enmascarados\', \'text\': \'Cuando los Admiradores enmascarados entren al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de criatura, puedes pagar {G}{G}. Si lo haces, regresa a los Admiradores enmascarados de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La belleza determina el valor y nosotros determinamos qué es bello".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c88feb-fb29-4809-930e-605eb02fa5ab\', \'multiverseId\': 483313}, \'multiverseid\': 483313}, {\'name\': \'Admirateurs masqués\', \'text\': \'Quand les Admirateurs masqués arrivent sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de créature, vous pouvez payer {G}{G}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez les Admirateurs masqués depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« La beauté détermine la valeur, et nous déterminons la beauté. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8889d8e6-dd85-4641-b82a-081cd0345d05\', \'multiverseId\': 483564}, \'multiverseid\': 483564}, {\'name\': \'Ammiratori Mascherati\', \'text\': \'Quando gli Ammiratori Mascherati entrano nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia creatura, puoi pagare {G}{G}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano gli Ammiratori Mascherati dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La bellezza determina il valore e noi determiniamo la bellezza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6630a455-9f66-4b53-ba56-9a8fd82e8edc\', \'multiverseId\': 483815}, \'multiverseid\': 483815}, {\'name\': \'仮面の称賛者\', \'text\': \'仮面の称賛者が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nあなたがクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{G}{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地から仮面の称賛者をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「価値を決めるのは美で、美を決めるのは我々だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a634b0e-5fa2-416c-b9eb-a8bafe04025e\', \'multiverseId\': 484066}, \'multiverseid\': 484066}, {\'name\': \'Admiradores Mascarados\', \'text\': \'Quando Admiradores Mascarados entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica de criatura, você pode pagar {G}{G}. Se fizer isso, devolva Admiradores Mascarados de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"A beleza determina o valor, e nós determinamos a beleza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e043b6c-00af-4133-94fd-85ae48632e64\', \'multiverseId\': 484317}, \'multiverseid\': 484317}, {\'name\': \'Почитатели в Масках\', \'text\': \'Когда Почитатели в Масках выходят на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание существа, вы можете уплатить {G}{G}. Если вы это делаете, верните Почитателей в Масках из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Красота определяет ценность, а красоту определяем мы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'795c6fe0-fa95-435a-9989-0774ea0600fa\', \'multiverseId\': 484568}, \'multiverseid\': 484568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstandabsauger\', \'text\': \'Mutation {4}{B} (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch für seine Mutationskosten wirkst, lege ihn auf oder unter eine Nicht-Mensch-Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du besitzt. Sie mutieren zur oben liegenden Kreatur, die zusätzlich alle Fähigkeiten der darunter liegenden hat.)\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn diese Kreatur mutiert, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Gegners verdeckt ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten anschauen und spielen, solange sie im Exil bleiben.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nachtmahr\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01dbdde1-5934-419d-ab7a-9e7ca8180a2e\', \'multiverseId\': 484942}, \'multiverseid\': 484942}, {\'name\': \'Mentejuela\', \'text\': \'Mutación {4}{B}. (Si lanzas este hechizo pagando su coste de mutación, ponlo sobre o bajo la criatura objetivo que no sea Humano de la cual eres propietario. Estas mutan en la criatura de la parte superior más todas las habilidades de debajo.)\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que esta criatura mute, exilia boca abajo la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada oponente. Puedes mirar y jugar esas cartas mientras permanezcan exiliadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadilla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adee20a9-a8a9-4898-bd0f-671d8201b365\', \'multiverseId\': 484993}, \'multiverseid\': 484993}, {\'name\': \'Sangsucéphale\', \'text\': "Mutation {4}{B} (Si vous lancez ce sort pour son coût de mutation, mettez-le au-dessus ou au-dessous d\'une créature non-Humain ciblée que vous possédez. La créature mutante est la créature du dessus, avec toutes les capacités des cartes au-dessous.)\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que cette créature subit une mutation, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque adversaire face cachée. Vous pouvez regarder et jouer ces cartes tant qu\'elles restent exilées.", \'type\': \'Créature : cauchemar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890ed226-c8a5-4bf7-96ec-4ae81f500c70\', \'multiverseId\': 485044}, \'multiverseid\': 485044}, {\'name\': \'Risucchiamente\', \'text\': \'Mutazione {4}{B} (Se lanci questa magia per il suo costo di mutazione, mettila sopra o sotto una creatura non Umano bersaglio che possiedi. Muta nella creatura sopra, con anche le abilità di quelle sotto.)\\nVolare\\nOgniqualvolta questa creatura muta, esilia a faccia in giù la prima carta del grimorio di ogni avversario. Puoi guardare e giocare quelle carte fintanto che rimangono esiliate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d71393-286a-4726-9686-36977b395cbe\', \'multiverseId\': 485095}, \'multiverseid\': 485095}, {\'name\': \'精神吸い\', \'text\': \'変容{4}{B}（あなたがこの呪文をこれの変容コストで唱えるなら、あなたがオーナーであり人間でないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれの上か下に置く。これらは、一番上のクリーチャーに、その下にある能力すべてを加えたものに変容する。）\\n飛行\\nこのクリーチャーが変容するたび、各対戦相手のライブラリーの一番上のカードをそれぞれ裏向きに追放する。それらのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれらを見てもよいしプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナイトメア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b32be4-eb7f-4856-965d-208123acdfce\', \'multiverseId\': 485146}, \'multiverseid\': 485146}, {\'name\': \'Mentessuga\', \'text\': \'Mutação {4}{B} (Se você conjurar esta mágica pelo custo de mutação, coloque-a sobre ou sob a criatura alvo que você possui que não seja um Humano. Elas sofrem uma mutação que resulta na criatura de cima com todas as habilidades das criaturas de baixo.)\\nVoar\\nToda vez que esta criatura sofrer mutação, exile com a face voltada para baixo o card do topo do grimório de cada oponente. Você pode olhar e jogar aqueles cards enquanto eles permanecerem exilados.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pesadelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbf39d27-dfff-4ecc-b9cd-42d303f2239d\', \'multiverseId\': 485197}, \'multiverseid\': 485197}, {\'name\': \'Пиявка Разума\', \'text\': \'Мутация {4}{B} (Если вы разыграли это заклинание за его стоимость Мутации, положите его сверху или снизу целевого принадлежащего вам существа, не являющегося Человеком. Они мутируют в существо сверху, которому добавляются все способности снизу.)\\nПолет\\nКаждый раз, когда это существо мутирует, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого оппонента рубашкой вверх. Вы можете смотреть и разыгрывать те карты, пока они остаются в изгнании.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошмар\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d17c0271-872d-4914-afbb-2bca5754364f\', \'multiverseId\': 485248}, \'multiverseid\': 485248}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstoßen\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn Verstoßen ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis Verstoßen das Spiel verlässt.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e517c82-6cf2-4e3f-9c07-2ffb36b1a5c3\', \'multiverseId\': 482958}, \'multiverseid\': 482958}, {\'name\': \'Expulsar\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando Expulsar entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que Expulsar deje el campo de batalla.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d744f2c8-0a90-4b5d-a1c0-d92d5717c574\', \'multiverseId\': 483209}, \'multiverseid\': 483209}, {\'name\': \'Proscription\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Proscription arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Proscription quitte le champ de bataille.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483460&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74ff10ea-74fc-4708-bb1a-ced5019563e3\', \'multiverseId\': 483460}, \'multiverseid\': 483460}, {\'name\': \'Espellere\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando Espellere entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché Espellere non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc5be89d-0314-47e7-afb1-aeb0ed32af77\', \'multiverseId\': 483711}, \'multiverseid\': 483711}, {\'name\': \'排斥\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n排斥が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。排斥が戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f81ba9-d63f-4a8a-80e7-d4e68df7cdfc\', \'multiverseId\': 483962}, \'multiverseid\': 483962}, {\'name\': \'Degredar\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Degredar entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno que um oponente controla até que Degredar deixe o campo de batalha.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1405a7b-44e4-48a3-ad9a-b6951bf6aa92\', \'multiverseId\': 484213}, \'multiverseid\': 484213}, {\'name\': \'Изгнание Прочь\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Изгнание Прочь выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Изгнание Прочь не покинет поле битвы.\\nЦикл {W} ({W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa045091-7b16-4359-aaa1-52cf5d6dcfe5\', \'multiverseId\': 484464}, \'multiverseid\': 484464}]', "[{'name': 'Versunkener Talkessel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDer Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': 'Auf dem Kontinent Tazeem stürzen rauschende Ströme enge Schluchten hinab, in nebelverhangene Seen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483197&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ab2a81e-c27f-400d-91d8-54e78a2ab59d', 'multiverseId': 483197}, 'multiverseid': 483197}, {'name': 'Hondonada profunda', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Hondonada profunda entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla pantano', 'flavor': 'En el continente de Tazeem, los ríos se abren paso a través de estrechos cañones y terminan en lagos sumidos en la niebla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483448&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '884ca368-0c00-4c1c-85d8-3e449b455adf', 'multiverseId': 483448}, 'multiverseid': 483448}, {'name': 'Dépression engloutie', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLa Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : île et marais', 'flavor': 'Sur le continent de Tazeem, les eaux tumultueuses passent dans des gorges étroites et se jettent dans des lacs embrumés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483699&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eda0859d-8b4a-40a7-92fa-8d91e5fe4b25', 'multiverseId': 483699}, 'multiverseid': 483699}, {'name': 'Conca Infossata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': 'Sul continente di Tazeem, acque impetuose si tuffano attraverso strette gole in laghi ammantati di nebbia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483950&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30b4e72f-3fac-4662-b9e8-0294391dda73', 'multiverseId': 483950}, 'multiverseid': 483950}, {'name': '窪み渓谷', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\nあなたが基本土地を２つ以上コントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': 'タジーム大陸の急流は、狭い渓谷を抜けると霧に覆われた湖へと流れ込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484201&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '22eb3b8d-92f4-43c8-a56b-8f7d1ca9d7f2', 'multiverseId': 484201}, 'multiverseid': 484201}, {'name': 'Vale Afundado', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.)\\nVale Afundado entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Pântano', 'flavor': 'No continente de Tazeem, corredeiras velozes mergulham por cânions estreitos rumo a lagos ocultos nas brumas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484452&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '117690f3-0ea4-4fba-9691-dc1fb9f056d6', 'multiverseId': 484452}, 'multiverseid': 484452}, {'name': 'Затопленная Лощина', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.)\\nЗатопленная Лощина выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Остров Болото', 'flavor': 'На континенте Тазим бурные реки несутся по узким каньонам, впадая в укрытые туманом озера.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484703&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cdc35e9-011d-465b-b18a-cc3df543418e', 'multiverseId': 484703}, 'multiverseid': 484703}]", "[{'name': 'Vogelzug', 'text': 'Erzeuge vier 1/1 weiße Vogel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nStandardlandumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483101&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef1689eb-bc83-4dc2-81bd-6592bed1afb8', 'multiverseId': 483101}, 'multiverseid': 483101}, {'name': 'Ruta migratoria', 'text': 'Crea cuatro fichas de criatura Ave blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo de tierras básicas {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483352&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55e3c91d-b4ae-4f7e-8c4c-a3477bf875b9', 'multiverseId': 483352}, 'multiverseid': 483352}, {'name': 'Route migratoire', 'text': 'Créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\nRecyclage de terrain de base {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483603&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3d59bb9-cded-4597-99c7-a643657e7ebb', 'multiverseId': 483603}, 'multiverseid': 483603}, {'name': 'Rotta Migratoria', 'text': 'Crea quattro pedine creatura Uccello 1/1 bianche con volare.\\nCicloterra base {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483854&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba0bffaa-fe16-46db-98ce-7e5cd7525c1a', 'multiverseId': 483854}, 'multiverseid': 483854}, {'name': '渡り鳥の経路', 'text': '飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを４体生成する。\\n基本土地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484105&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bdd7e2a7-5085-43fd-8058-c538dbe38214', 'multiverseId': 484105}, 'multiverseid': 484105}, {'name': 'Rota Migratória', 'text': 'Crie quatro fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Ave com voar.\\nReciclar terreno básico {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484356&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d1a052d-29b8-45d4-9f77-a690ff6bdd23', 'multiverseId': 484356}, 'multiverseid': 484356}, {'name': 'Пролетный Путь', 'text': 'Создайте четыре фишки существа 1/1 белая Птица с Полетом.\\nЦикл базовых земель {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484607&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62643ddb-bbc1-4dd3-aabb-185a04b63807', 'multiverseId': 484607}, 'multiverseid': 484607}]", '[{\'name\': \'Voraped\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nUnverwüstlich (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du glaubst, einen getötet zu haben, dann darfst du noch einmal raten."\\n—Thalia, Katharerritterin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483074&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'836229dd-31ec-4d69-9518-42d52402e613\', \'multiverseId\': 483074}, \'multiverseid\': 483074}, {\'name\': \'Vorápodo\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia, arrolla.\\nResiliencia. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Si crees que mataste a uno, mira de nuevo".\\n—Thalia, caballero cátaro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe25975-5531-47f8-b8fc-02bfe37c6d27\', \'multiverseId\': 483325}, \'multiverseid\': 483325}, {\'name\': \'Vorapède\', \'text\': "Vigilance, piétinement\\nSurvivance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous pensez en avoir tué un, vous vous trompez. »\\n—Thalia, chevalière cathare\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a582bac8-5f44-4a6e-8a8d-e6e888b8b445\', \'multiverseId\': 483576}, \'multiverseid\': 483576}, {\'name\': \'Divorapode\', \'text\': \'Cautela, travolgere\\nImmortale (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Se pensi di averne ucciso uno, ti sbagli di grosso."\\n—Thalia, Cavaliera Catara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a78b0ee8-2d08-40cd-8fa0-d7bf868a19ca\', \'multiverseId\': 483827}, \'multiverseid\': 483827}, {\'name\': \'食百足\', \'text\': \'警戒、トランプル\\n不死（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「一体殺したと思うのなら、二度目もあると思いなさい。」\\n――聖戦騎士、サリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2939eea-1cfe-4c22-9977-08711c0156dc\', \'multiverseId\': 484078}, \'multiverseid\': 484078}, {\'name\': \'Devorípede\', \'text\': \'Vigilância, atropelar\\nImortal (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você pensa que matou um, é melhor pensar de novo."\\n— Thalia, Cátara Cavaleira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d0b70a-c173-478d-939b-4e04d22e0677\', \'multiverseId\': 484329}, \'multiverseid\': 484329}, {\'name\': \'Прожороножка\', \'text\': \'Бдительность, Пробивной удар\\nНетленность (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'«Если вы думаете, что убили ее, то не угадали».\\n— Талия, рыцарь-катар\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ef98ac5-d907-467c-af5b-0dc0fd388919\', \'multiverseId\': 484580}, \'multiverseid\': 484580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vormacht der Abzan\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Vormacht der Abzan ins Spiel kommt, lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483077&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af15f7a-6087-465b-9a6d-c6076ad39205\', \'multiverseId\': 483077}, \'multiverseid\': 483077}, {\'name\': \'Supremacía abzana\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Supremacía abzana entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha que controles muera, crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b808379-59fd-4c0c-a042-011f6071370d\', \'multiverseId\': 483328}, \'multiverseid\': 483328}, {\'name\': \'Ascendance abzane\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ascendance abzane arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Esprit avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483579&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54feb01b-bbb0-41a0-a579-77ff990c3672\', \'multiverseId\': 483579}, \'multiverseid\': 483579}, {\'name\': \'Autorità Abzan\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Autorità Abzan entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura non pedina che controlli muore, crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca con volare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae68157-f02a-4c4b-8dfa-9ec27d86290e\', \'multiverseId\': 483830}, \'multiverseid\': 483830}, {\'name\': \'アブザンの隆盛\', \'text\': \'アブザンの隆盛が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上に、＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてトークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、飛行を持つ白の１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55407c7c-ce41-4d1b-833f-86cf55d48e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 484081}, \'multiverseid\': 484081}, {\'name\': \'Ascendência Abzan\', \'text\': \'Quando Ascendência Abzan entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\\nToda vez que uma criatura que não seja ficha que você controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'482686b7-4900-40ba-94b8-d37243b85013\', \'multiverseId\': 484332}, \'multiverseid\': 484332}, {\'name\': \'Возвышение Абзана\', \'text\': \'Когда Возвышение Абзана выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nКаждый раз, когда не являющееся фишкой существо под вашим контролем умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Дух с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dfa9aee-935f-44ad-aeb5-d49a97cccc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 484583}, \'multiverseid\': 484583}]', "[{'name': 'Wachstumsspirale', 'text': 'Ziehe eine Karte. Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Zyklische und spiralförmige Muster sind die Spezialität der Wirbelklade, die sich bemüht, die Zyklen der Natur zu revitalisieren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483095&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12a12135-cea4-4ed4-839d-8db9092eec9d', 'multiverseId': 483095}, 'multiverseid': 483095}, {'name': 'Espiral de crecimiento', 'text': 'Roba una carta. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de tierra de tu mano.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los diseños cíclicos y en espiral son la especialidad del Clado de la Espiral, que busca revitalizar los ciclos de la naturaleza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483346&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53059bc1-658c-42f6-9732-919998cb68c5', 'multiverseId': 483346}, 'multiverseid': 483346}, {'name': 'Spirale de croissance', 'text': 'Piochez une carte. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de terrain de votre main.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les motifs cycliques et spiralés sont la spécialité du Cladus Spirale, qui cherche à revitaliser les cycles de la nature.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483597&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1a5f6b0-283e-4597-8d21-7713660399f4', 'multiverseId': 483597}, 'multiverseid': 483597}, {'name': 'Spirale di Crescita', 'text': 'Pesca una carta. Puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia una carta terra dalla tua mano.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Motivi circolari e a spirale sono la specialità del Clade del Cerchio, che cerca di infondere nuova vita nei cicli naturali.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483848&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7986c71c-1101-4a53-aef3-c92fc0fefc1f', 'multiverseId': 483848}, 'multiverseid': 483848}, {'name': '成長のらせん', 'text': 'カードを１枚引く。あなたは、あなたの手札から土地・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'らせんと循環の模様は、自然循環の再生を試みる円環組の特徴だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484099&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dfc2a57-e25c-497b-8b7c-15487fa79ed0', 'multiverseId': 484099}, 'multiverseid': 484099}, {'name': 'Espiral de Crescimento', 'text': 'Compre um card. Você pode colocar um card de terreno de sua mão no campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os padrões cíclicos e espirais são a especialidade da Cepa da Espiral, que busca revitalizar os ciclos da natureza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484350&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b8ea9fe-2928-4be8-9f76-757d52819f61', 'multiverseId': 484350}, 'multiverseid': 484350}, {'name': 'Спираль Роста', 'text': 'Возьмите карту. Вы можете положить карту земли из вашей руки на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Круговые и спиральные узоры — специальность Клады Круговорота, стремящейся вдохнуть новую жизнь в циклы природы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484601&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3339a79-406c-4514-9225-73733564b308', 'multiverseId': 484601}, 'multiverseid': 484601}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wagemutiger Unholdbynder\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nDer Wagemutige Unholdbynder greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\n{1}{B}, schicke den Wagemutigen Unholdbynder aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Lege eine Unzerstörbar-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27c9db0-7705-4bb7-8ea7-8a763b9f5616\', \'multiverseId\': 484939}, \'multiverseid\': 484939}, {\'name\': \'Vinculademonios temerario\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nEl Vinculademonios temerario ataca cada combate si puede.\\n{1}{B}, exiliar el Vinculademonios temerario de tu cementerio: Pon un contador de indestructible sobre la criatura objetivo. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b68877e7-6662-46a5-9c0d-c51ae049e6e4\', \'multiverseId\': 484990}, \'multiverseid\': 484990}, {\'name\': \'Bridefiel audacieux\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nLe Bridefiel audacieux attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\n{1}{B}, exilez le Bridefiel audacieux de votre cimetière : Mettez un marqueur « indestructible » sur une créature ciblée. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0136096-36c5-4aae-9ffa-6aa92cb7131b\', \'multiverseId\': 485041}, \'multiverseid\': 485041}, {\'name\': \'Vincolademoni Audace\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nIl Vincolademoni Audace attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\n{1}{B}, Esilia il Vincolademoni Audace dal tuo cimitero: Metti un segnalino indistruttibile su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'819632bc-c2cd-4acd-8b50-4373ff127387\', \'multiverseId\': 485092}, \'multiverseid\': 485092}, {\'name\': \'果敢な魔眷者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n各戦闘で、果敢な魔眷者は可能なら攻撃する。\\n{1}{B}, あなたの墓地から果敢な魔眷者を追放する：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に破壊不能カウンターを１個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098a6c7d-2409-4424-be3d-db4044a5e223\', \'multiverseId\': 485143}, \'multiverseid\': 485143}, {\'name\': \'Vinculador de Demônios Ousado\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nVinculador de Demônios Ousado ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\\n{1}{B}, exile Vinculador de Demônios Ousado de seu cemitério: Coloque um marcador de indestrutível na criatura alvo. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f239bf39-0f87-4a14-8516-82e338fbf986\', \'multiverseId\': 485194}, \'multiverseid\': 485194}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкий Узомант Кошмаров\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nДерзкий Узомант Кошмаров атакует в каждом бою, если может.\\n{1}{B}, изгоните Дерзкого Узоманта Кошмаров из вашего кладбища: положите один жетон Неразрушимости на целевое существо. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f38a354-7529-4e77-8718-e31972bd0378\', \'multiverseId\': 485245}, \'multiverseid\': 485245}]', '[{\'name\': \'Waldläufer im Grenzland\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nDu kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nSolange ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, kannst du Länderkarten oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen. (Du kannst auf diese Weise nur dann ein Land spielen, falls du in diesem Zug noch eines spielen darfst.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea585c0-4135-4803-8ea9-3f31f65cdf3c\', \'multiverseId\': 484927}, \'multiverseid\': 484927}, {\'name\': \'Exploradores de los límites\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nPuedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nMientras un oponente controle más tierras que tú, puedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca. (Puedes jugar una tierra de esta manera solo si te queda una jugada de tierra disponible.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d157d2-31b1-43c9-8e39-0c613fd6ce23\', \'multiverseId\': 484978}, \'multiverseid\': 484978}, {\'name\': "Rangers de l\'orée", \'text\': "Initiative\\nVous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nTant qu\'un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Vous ne pouvez jouer un terrain de cette manière que s\'il vous reste une mise en jeu de terrain disponible.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b23130-3840-429f-80ab-b456a10fea7b\', \'multiverseId\': 485029}, \'multiverseid\': 485029}, {\'name\': \'Ranger di Frontiera\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nPuoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nFintanto che un avversario controlla più terre di te, puoi giocare terre dalla cima del tuo grimorio. (Puoi giocare una terra in questo modo solo se potresti giocarne una normalmente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'031616ce-7d3a-4ef2-a943-74c56b2f01b1\', \'multiverseId\': 485080}, \'multiverseid\': 485080}, {\'name\': \'境界のレインジャー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\nあなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見てよい。\\n対戦相手１人が土地をあなたよりも多くコントロールしているかぎり、あなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。（これにより土地をプレイするには、あなたは土地プレイを残している必要がある。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac61ad94-3daa-4799-b083-d96461d1d6c9\', \'multiverseId\': 485131}, \'multiverseid\': 485131}, {\'name\': \'Patrulheiros dos Confins\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nVocê pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nEnquanto um oponente controlar mais terrenos que você, você poderá jogar terrenos do topo de seu grimório. (Você só pode jogar um terreno desta forma se tiver uma jogada de terreno disponível.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89aed91c-1d50-4350-91cd-49dff75b08aa\', \'multiverseId\': 485182}, \'multiverseid\': 485182}, {\'name\': \'Лесничие Пограничья\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nВы в любой момент можете посмотреть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\\nПока оппонент контролирует больше земель, чем вы, вы можете разыгрывать земли с верха вашей библиотеки. (Вы можете разыграть таким образом землю, только если у вас осталась возможность разыгрывания земли в этом ходу.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'426aaada-29ad-422b-b48b-76ce9d6d8a9f\', \'multiverseId\': 485233}, \'multiverseid\': 485233}]', "[{'name': 'Wechselnde Bepflanzung', 'text': 'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Länderkarte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die Elfen von Zendikar haben innovative Methoden entwickelt, die Turbulenzeffekte abzumildern.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483048&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '346557b5-a376-4861-8d12-7c8062b6ad91', 'multiverseId': 483048}, 'multiverseid': 483048}, {'name': 'Rotación de cosechas', 'text': 'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los elfos de Zendikar desarrollaron unos métodos innovadores para mitigar los efectos de la Turbulencia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483299&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '915d0827-2862-4077-b3f6-6d45568d780b', 'multiverseId': 483299}, 'multiverseid': 483299}, {'name': 'Assolement', 'text': 'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les elfes de Zendikar ont mis au point des méthodes innovantes pour atténuer les effets du Roulis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483550&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f753c94-c8d2-40d3-b0c8-6323f91e9461', 'multiverseId': 483550}, 'multiverseid': 483550}, {'name': 'Rotazione del Raccolto', 'text': 'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una terra.\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Gli elfi di Zendikar hanno sviluppato metodi innovativi per mitigare gli effetti del Torbido.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483801&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e032c1c-8e1b-4b95-920c-50d00de4b871', 'multiverseId': 483801}, 'multiverseid': 483801}, {'name': '輪作', 'text': 'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': 'ゼンディカーのエルフは乱動の効果を弱める全く新しい方法を編み出した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484052&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe00f10b-c9df-4a80-84e2-5f082567ba36', 'multiverseId': 484052}, 'multiverseid': 484052}, {'name': 'Rotação de Culturas', 'text': 'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique um terreno.\\nProcure em seu grimório um card de terreno, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os elfos de Zendikar desenvolveram métodos inovadores para mitigar os efeitos do Turbilhão.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484303&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85d30ba4-a515-441e-9f5f-aa04296ba545', 'multiverseId': 484303}, 'multiverseid': 484303}, {'name': 'Севооборот', 'text': 'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте землю.\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке карту земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Эльфы Зендикара разработали инновационные методы смягчения эффектов Великого Вала.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484554&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86411323-c824-4966-a286-64d0a75465fc', 'multiverseId': 484554}, 'multiverseid': 484554}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wecklerche\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Wecklerche das Spiel verlässt, bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl mit Stärke 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nHerbeirufen {5}{W} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a9c92ef-82c0-43e5-bead-49f5525f87e8\', \'multiverseId\': 482976}, \'multiverseid\': 482976}, {\'name\': \'Alondra del despertar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Alondra del despertar deje el campo de batalla, regresa hasta dos cartas de criatura objetivo con fuerza de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nEvocar {5}{W}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73177247-ec66-4383-9586-caea1ee7f5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 483227}, \'multiverseid\': 483227}, {\'name\': \'Sirlidiane\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand la Sirlidiane quitte le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature de force inférieure ou égale à 2 ciblées depuis votre cimetière.\\nÉvocation {5}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b7ac2df-adba-4a94-9d3a-b1e814ea46c6\', \'multiverseId\': 483478}, \'multiverseid\': 483478}, {\'name\': \'Sveglialata\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Sveglialata lascia il campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia fino a due carte creatura bersaglio con forza pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.\\nApparire {5}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c38c309c-66ae-4649-bf5c-9e835f88a0e1\', \'multiverseId\': 483729}, \'multiverseid\': 483729}, {\'name\': \'目覚ましヒバリ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n目覚ましヒバリが戦場を離れたとき、あなたの墓地からパワーが２以下のクリーチャー・カード最大２枚を対象とし、それらを戦場に戻す。\\n想起{5}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d556c7a3-0b2f-47dd-a9a4-1d23ba8e02bb\', \'multiverseId\': 483980}, \'multiverseid\': 483980}, {\'name\': \'Asas da Alvorada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Asas da Alvorada deixar o campo de batalha, devolva até dois cards de criatura alvo com poder igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nEvocar {5}{W} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d25bf1c6-a345-40f5-807b-6b09aa5623ea\', \'multiverseId\': 484231}, \'multiverseid\': 484231}, {\'name\': \'Жизнезов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Жизнезов покидает поле битвы, верните до двух целевых карт существ с силой 2 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\nВызывание {5}{W} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Вызывания. Если вы это делаете, оно приносится в жертву, когда выходит на поле битвы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5437fa-4460-40c5-8fdc-e9d8df8bfb88\', \'multiverseId\': 484482}, \'multiverseid\': 484482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Weise der Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Weise der Renaturierung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Was einst von Steinmetzen errichtet, von Schmieden geformt oder von Magiern ins Leben gerufen wurde, werde ich an die Erde zurückgeben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483065&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9d34459-a1e2-4d3c-a37d-cc5dcf3d41d0\', \'multiverseId\': 483065}, \'multiverseid\': 483065}, {\'name\': \'Sabia de la recuperación\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Sabia de la recuperación entre al campo de batalla, puedes destruir el encantamiento o artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquello que construyeron los canteros, forjaron los herreros o animaron los magos, yo lo regresaré al abrazo de la tierra".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad965aab-0dd1-44b9-b389-50d793a84442\', \'multiverseId\': 483316}, \'multiverseid\': 483316}, {\'name\': \'Sage du reboisement\', \'text\': "Quand la Sage du reboisement arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez détruire l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce qui jadis fut construit par des maçons, forgé par des forgerons ou animé par des magiciens, je le rends à la terre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d77599a-91be-4dfd-a5d0-e5036893607e\', \'multiverseId\': 483567}, \'multiverseid\': 483567}, {\'name\': \'Saggia della Rivendicazione\', \'text\': \'Quando la Saggia della Rivendicazione entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi distruggere un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ciò che un tempo fu modellato dai tagliapietre, plasmato dai fabbri o infuso di vita dai maghi, io restituirò all\\\'abbraccio della terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15026d2c-fed1-47ee-be8a-960364ba92f7\', \'multiverseId\': 483818}, \'multiverseid\': 483818}, {\'name\': \'再利用の賢者\', \'text\': \'再利用の賢者が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「かつて石工によって作り出され、職人によって形が整えられ、そして魔道士によって命を与えられたものは、我によって再び大地の抱擁の中へと戻される。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18c237b5-8322-4223-9863-037374c994bb\', \'multiverseId\': 484069}, \'multiverseid\': 484069}, {\'name\': \'Sábio da Reivindicação\', \'text\': \'Quando Sábio da Reivindicação entra no campo de batalha, você pode destruir o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquilo que um dia foi formado por pedreiros, moldado por ferreiros ou animado por magos, eu devolverei ao abraço da terra."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'427de372-e475-41ac-9ae8-f068f17be631\', \'multiverseId\': 484320}, \'multiverseid\': 484320}, {\'name\': \'Возвращающая к Истокам\', \'text\': \'Когда Возвращающая к Истокам выходит на поле битвы, вы можете уничтожить целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что когда-то возвели строители, выковали кузнецы или оживили маги, я возвращаю в объятья земли».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9362bdda-3305-47a5-8ff6-feae3bac6deb\', \'multiverseId\': 484571}, \'multiverseid\': 484571}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wendige Quertreiberin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nUmwandlung {2}{U} ({2}{U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du die Wendige Quertreiberin umwandelst, neutralisiere eine aktivierte oder ausgelöste Fähigkeit deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32f88ed-7b8e-4a6f-9729-4dc96ac3b316\', \'multiverseId\': 483000}, \'multiverseid\': 483000}, {\'name\': \'Obstruccionista hábil\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCiclo {2}{U}. ({2}{U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de la Obstruccionista hábil, contrarresta la habilidad activada o disparada objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d18ab6-2657-45a5-8335-3bd47c6f72b6\', \'multiverseId\': 483251}, \'multiverseid\': 483251}, {\'name\': \'Obstructionniste agile\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nRecyclage {2}{U} ({2}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez l\'Obstructionniste agile, contrecarrez une capacité activée ou déclenchée ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a0eaab-e55f-4fdb-a570-6d223e7fa05e\', \'multiverseId\': 483502}, \'multiverseid\': 483502}, {\'name\': \'Ostruzionista Agile\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nCiclo {2}{U} ({2}{U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli l\'Ostruzionista Agile, neutralizza un\'abilità attivata o innescata bersaglio che non controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'738e0677-c1fc-4f9f-adf0-f989344a2389\', \'multiverseId\': 483753}, \'multiverseid\': 483753}, {\'name\': \'敏捷な妨害術師\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nサイクリング{2}{U}（{2}{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが敏捷な妨害術師をサイクリングしたとき、あなたがコントロールしておらず起動型か誘発型である能力１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f14ba5-1e71-4aaa-9cb3-ff5dedfafa9c\', \'multiverseId\': 484004}, \'multiverseid\': 484004}, {\'name\': \'Obstrucionista Ágil\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nReciclar {2}{U} ({2}{U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando reciclar Obstrucionista Ágil, anule a habilidade ativada ou desencadeada alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c9a77d1-8a87-4b21-8839-6a09d1293c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 484255}, \'multiverseid\': 484255}, {\'name\': \'Ловкая Ограничительница\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nЦикл {2}{U} ({2}{U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Ловкой Ограничительницы, отмените целевую активируемую или срабатывающую способность не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a33bbdf-b35c-44e1-96ef-1a640f8379a4\', \'multiverseId\': 484506}, \'multiverseid\': 484506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Werdender Körperwandler\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Werdende Körperwandler angreift oder blockt, deckt ein Gegner deiner Wahl Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf, bis er eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckt. Der Werdende Körperwandler wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Kopie jener Karte. Dann legt jener Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise aufgedeckt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23a210a0-7c8b-4eb2-9f3c-beb2d36e50f8\', \'multiverseId\': 484934}, \'multiverseid\': 484934}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo recién nacido\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Metamorfo recién nacido ataque o bloquee, el oponente objetivo muestra cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que muestre una carta de criatura. El Metamorfo recién nacido se convierte en una copia de esa carta hasta el final del turno. Luego, ese jugador pone todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43163433-f886-42a6-bb32-0672f2413f7f\', \'multiverseId\': 484985}, \'multiverseid\': 484985}, {\'name\': \'Métamorphe naissant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Métamorphe naissant attaque ou bloque, l\'adversaire ciblé révèle les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il révèle une carte de créature. Le Métamorphe naissant devient une copie de cette carte jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Ce joueur met ensuite toutes les cartes révélées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aaa822d-283c-44a1-8a5b-68110e0ed4d1\', \'multiverseId\': 485036}, \'multiverseid\': 485036}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo Nascente\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Metamorfo Nascente attacca o blocca, un avversario bersaglio rivela carte dalla cima del suo grimorio finché non rivela una carta creatura. Il Metamorfo Nascente diventa una copia di quella carta fino alla fine del turno. Poi quel giocatore mette tutte le carte rivelate in questo modo in fondo al suo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abd8e85d-783c-4e86-ab4a-84995e84c95b\', \'multiverseId\': 485087}, \'multiverseid\': 485087}, {\'name\': \'初期変化\', \'text\': \'初期変化が攻撃するかブロックするたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、クリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。ターン終了時まで、初期変化はそのカードのコピーになる。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより公開したカードをすべて自分のライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a00f701f-a77c-40a5-9e3c-b965d8cd060f\', \'multiverseId\': 485138}, \'multiverseid\': 485138}, {\'name\': \'Metamorfo Nascente\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Metamorfo Nascente ataca ou bloqueia, o oponente alvo revela cards do topo do próprio grimório até revelar um card de criatura. Metamorfo Nascente torna-se uma cópia daquele card até o final do turno. Em seguida, aquele jogador coloca todos os cards revelados dessa forma no fundo do próprio grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5660948e-bd16-4aae-8d0d-adc413b9562d\', \'multiverseId\': 485189}, \'multiverseid\': 485189}, {\'name\': \'Зарождающийся Метаморф\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Зарождающийся Метаморф атакует или блокирует, целевой оппонент показывает карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажет карту существа. Зарождающийся Метаморф становится копией той карты до конца хода. Затем тот игрок кладет все показанные таким образом карты в низ своей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf28112-4b0d-42cc-82ad-cd59f8f891c8\', \'multiverseId\': 485240}, \'multiverseid\': 485240}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wesir der fallenden Sande\', \'text\': \'{T}: Enttappe eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\\nUmwandlung {1}{U} ({1}{U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Wesir der fallenden Sande umwandelst, enttappe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Zeit ist wie der Luxa: Auch wenn sie nur in eine Richtung fließt, so kann sie doch umgelenkt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b999cc-c562-4e0d-9e18-af48eab23af5\', \'multiverseId\': 483005}, \'multiverseid\': 483005}, {\'name\': \'Visir de las arenas tornadizas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Endereza otro permanente objetivo.\\nCiclo {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Visir de las arenas tornadizas, endereza el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"El tiempo es como el río Luxa: aunque fluye en una dirección, puede desviarse".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c325d4d-fdae-45e0-a3ee-3d9af238359b\', \'multiverseId\': 483256}, \'multiverseid\': 483256}, {\'name\': \'Vizir de la chute du sable\', \'text\': \'{T} : Dégagez un autre permanent ciblé.\\nRecyclage {1}{U} ({1}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Vizir de la chute du sable, dégagez un permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« Le temps est semblable au fleuve Luxa : même s\'il s\'écoule dans une direction, il peut être détourné. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483507&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441dfb1c-02d4-423b-bb17-dd030148b7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 483507}, \'multiverseid\': 483507}, {\'name\': \'Visir delle Sabbie Cadenti\', \'text\': \'{T}: STAPpa un altro permanente bersaglio.\\nCiclo {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Visir delle Sabbie Cadenti, STAPpa un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Il tempo è come il fiume Luxa: sebbene scorra in una direzione, può essere deviato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0034cb80-077f-403a-9fa2-219d35413714\', \'multiverseId\': 483758}, \'multiverseid\': 483758}, {\'name\': \'砂時計の侍臣\', \'text\': \'{T}：他のパーマネント１つを対象とし、それをアンタップする。\\nサイクリング{1}{U}（{1}{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが砂時計の侍臣をサイクリングしたとき、パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「時の流れはルクサ川のようなものだが、川と違い時間は逆転できる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca1b9928-03f4-4600-abdf-e0fc885f218b\', \'multiverseId\': 484009}, \'multiverseid\': 484009}, {\'name\': \'Vizir das Areias Correntes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Desvire outra permanente alvo.\\nReciclar {1}{U} ({1}{U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você reciclar Vizir das Areias Correntes, desvire a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"O tempo é como o rio Luxa — embora corra em uma direção, pode ser desviado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'121a11f0-7033-488d-92d7-452d2b379723\', \'multiverseId\': 484260}, \'multiverseid\': 484260}, {\'name\': \'Визирь Перевернувшихся Часов\', \'text\': \'{T}: разверните другой целевой перманент.\\nЦикл {1}{U} ({1}{U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Визиря Перевернувшихся Часов, разверните целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Время подобно реке Лукса — оно течет в одном направлении, но его можно заставить свернуть в сторону».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6ee6ee5-9000-4427-bbf2-67cf7545e465\', \'multiverseId\': 484511}, \'multiverseid\': 484511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wilde Renaturierung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Endsegments enttappst du alle Länder, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Mauern bersten. Gebäude stürzen ein. Die Wildnis kehrt immer zurück."\\n—Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483075&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d7707c8-fcbc-4038-a2b7-a8eb000d978c\', \'multiverseId\': 483075}, \'multiverseid\': 483075}, {\'name\': \'Recuperación forestal\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu paso final, endereza todas las tierras que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Los muros se resquebrajan. Los edificios se derrumban. Al final, la naturaleza siempre regresa".\\n—Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ce1d98-b7b4-43c1-ab16-07a609fc50ac\', \'multiverseId\': 483326}, \'multiverseid\': 483326}, {\'name\': \'Reboisement des régions reculées\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre étape de fin, dégagez tous les terrains que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Les murs se fendent. Les édifices s\'écroulent. La nature reprend toujours ses droits. »\\n—Domri Rade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483577&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'445893a8-6e35-4da8-b325-672bdb1913ab\', \'multiverseId\': 483577}, \'multiverseid\': 483577}, {\'name\': \'Rivendicazione delle Terre Selvagge\', \'text\': "All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, STAPpa tutte le terre che controlli.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"I muri si spezzano, gli edifici crollano, le terre selvagge riescono sempre a tornare."\\n—Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a05ce4-e4f9-40fc-b952-0b65dff11b41\', \'multiverseId\': 483828}, \'multiverseid\': 483828}, {\'name\': \'荒野の再生\', \'text\': \'あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたがコントロールしている土地をすべてアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「壁は割れ、建物は崩れる。いつでも自然が帰ってくる。」\\n――ドムリ・ラーデ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aab4bd26-17d3-41fb-bf78-e0448a4c1b27\', \'multiverseId\': 484079}, \'multiverseid\': 484079}, {\'name\': \'Reconquista da Natureza\', \'text\': \'No início da sua etapa final, desvire todos os terrenos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Paredes racham. Prédios caem. A natureza sempre volta."\\n— Domri Rade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b44a8cd-bb3e-4d57-8f98-7fd9c30490a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484330}, \'multiverseid\': 484330}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение Диких Земель\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего заключительного шага разверните все земли под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Стены трескаются. Здания падают. Дикие земли всегда возвращаются».\\n— Домри Раде\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbfb4943-975f-4ad8-b18d-e314a9006b28\', \'multiverseId\': 484581}, \'multiverseid\': 484581}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wolfspfad in Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +X/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn ein Werwolf sich zum ersten Mal verwandelt, kann man sein erstes Heulen bis zum Monduntergang durch die Wildnis hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483163&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc84682-babf-480f-97ad-29782c4a8c22\', \'multiverseId\': 483163}, \'multiverseid\': 483163}, {\'name\': \'Coto de lobos de Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: La criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+0 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando un licántropo cambia por primera vez, se dice que el primer aullido se repite por el bosque hasta que cae la luna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ee6b25f-6212-4b85-a51a-6e383da2e6ea\', \'multiverseId\': 483414}, \'multiverseid\': 483414}, {\'name\': \'Garenne au Loup de Kessig\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T} : La créature ciblée gagne +X/+0 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Quand un loup-garou se transforme pour la première fois, on dit que son premier hurlement résonne dans la nature jusqu\'au coucher de la lune.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b782fd4-7f6c-4938-b1e2-ff1a22ac3c2a\', \'multiverseId\': 483665}, \'multiverseid\': 483665}, {\'name\': \'Riserva dei Lupi di Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: Una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+0 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Si narra che, quando un lupo mannaro si trasforma per la prima volta, il suo primo ululato riecheggi nei territori selvaggi fino al tramonto della luna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec6514ec-4b4a-4dbe-a853-7143352d5a47\', \'multiverseId\': 483916}, \'multiverseid\': 483916}, {\'name\': \'ケッシグの狼の地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'狼男が初めて変身した時、最初の遠吠えは月が沈むまで荒野に響き続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8901b711-ba86-4706-95ff-2d58a0672b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 484167}, \'multiverseid\': 484167}, {\'name\': \'Toca do Lobo de Kessig\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: A criatura alvo recebe +X/+0 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando um lobisomem se transforma pela primeira vez, diz-se que seu primeiro uivo ecoa pela floresta até o amanhecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d8614f5-007d-4b73-85a0-3fab3690e048\', \'multiverseId\': 484418}, \'multiverseid\': 484418}, {\'name\': \'Кессигские Волчьи Угодья\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{X}{R}{G}, {T}: целевое существо получает +X/+0 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Говорят, что при первом преображении вервольфа эхо его завывания разносится по пустошам до самого захода луны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c67f21d8-e695-460c-88c7-320a52a14e0f\', \'multiverseId\': 484669}, \'multiverseid\': 484669}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wurz, die Mutter aller Überfälle\', \'text\': \'Wenn Wurz, die Mutter aller Überfälle, ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote und grüne Goblin-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nRote und/oder grüne Spontanzauber oder Hexereien, die du wirkst, haben Verschwören. (Sowie du einen solchen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du zwei ungetappte Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst und die mindestens eine Farbe mit dem Zauberspruch gemeinsam haben, tappen. Wenn du dies tust, kopiere den Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483113&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dc0cb8-6130-445d-9adc-df643f2a77d9\', \'multiverseId\': 483113}, \'multiverseid\': 483113}, {\'name\': \'Mosto, madre incursora\', \'text\': \'Cuando Mosto, madre incursora entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Guerrero Trasgo rojas y verdes 1/1.\\nCada hechizo de instantáneo o conjuro rojo o verde que lances tiene la habilidad de conspirar. (En cuanto lances el hechizo, puedes girar dos criaturas enderezadas que controles que compartan un color con él. Cuando lo hagas, cópialo y puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bbcd89-84e9-4a2c-8b55-755a63c5acf6\', \'multiverseId\': 483364}, \'multiverseid\': 483364}, {\'name\': \'Moût, la Mère-pilleuse\', \'text\': "Quand Moût, la Mère-pilleuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge et verte Gobelin et Guerrier.\\nChaque sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel rouge ou vert que vous lancez a la conspiration. (Au moment où vous lancez le sort, vous pouvez engager deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez qui partagent une couleur avec lui. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez-le et vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483615&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8119be4f-a0a0-4d08-bec9-5c88d2332808\', \'multiverseId\': 483615}, \'multiverseid\': 483615}, {\'name\': \'Larva, la Madre Razziatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando Larva, la Madre Razziatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Guerriero Goblin 1/1 rosse e verdi.\\nOgni magia istantaneo o stregoneria verde o rossa che lanci ha cospirare. (Mentre lanci la magia, puoi TAPpare due creature STAPpate che controlli che condividono un colore con essa. Quando lo fai, copia la magia. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd28b3c6-a9ea-46b5-81d8-20cf9aa9b38b\', \'multiverseId\': 483866}, \'multiverseid\': 483866}, {\'name\': \'略奪の母、汁婆\', \'text\': \'略奪の母、汁婆が戦場に出たとき、赤であり緑である１/１のゴブリン・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nあなたが唱える、インスタントやソーサリーである各呪文はそれぞれ共謀を持つ。（あなたがその呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてその呪文と共通の色を持ちアンタップ状態のクリーチャー２体をタップしてもよい。そうしたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a220d90c-408c-4d42-927c-c367a2153f07\', \'multiverseId\': 484117}, \'multiverseid\': 484117}, {\'name\': \'Mosto, a Mãe-de-Ataque\', \'text\': \'Quando Mosto, a Mãe-de-Ataque, entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura vermelha e verde 1/1 do tipo Goblin Guerreiro.\\nCada mágica instantânea ou feitiço vermelho ou verde que você conjura tem conspirar. (Conforme conjura a mágica, você pode virar duas criaturas desviradas que você controla que compartilhem uma cor com ela. Quando fizer isso, copie a mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a88cfbe-4d5e-4aa9-8175-1aa363d496a6\', \'multiverseId\': 484368}, \'multiverseid\': 484368}, {\'name\': \'Бражка, Мамаша Налетчиков\', \'text\': \'Когда Бражка, Мамаша Налетчиков выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки существа 1/1 красный и зеленый Гоблин Воин.\\nКаждое красное или зеленое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, которое вы разыгрываете, имеет Заговор. (При разыгрывании такого заклинания вы можете повернуть два неповернутых существа под вашим контролем, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте его, и вы можете выбрать новые цели для этой копии.)\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65d0a1a4-37bc-46b6-9851-0fd907e36d81\', \'multiverseId\': 484619}, \'multiverseid\': 484619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wydwen, das harsche Lüftchen\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\n{U}{B}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Bringe Wydwen, das harsche Lüftchen, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'In einer Welt mit hellen, wolkenlosen Himmeln ist sie der dunkle Sturm am Horizont.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483114&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'782a40a6-c1b8-4da7-90a9-c00e56e37d92\', \'multiverseId\': 483114}, \'multiverseid\': 483114}, {\'name\': \'Wydwen, el vendaval mordiente\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\n{U}{B}, pagar 1 vida: Regresa a Wydwen, el vendaval mordiente a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': \'En un mundo de cielos brillantes y sin nubes, ella es la tormenta en el horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7defa567-d2a6-4c36-8933-4a078f7551bc\', \'multiverseId\': 483365}, \'multiverseid\': 483365}, {\'name\': \'Wydwen, la morsure du vent\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nVol\\n{U}{B}, payez 1 point de vie : Renvoyez Wydwen, la morsure du vent dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Dans un monde au ciel clair et sans nuages, elle est l\'orage noir à l\'horizon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483616&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86efc5d5-e21f-4b6c-a6d0-e60c4bfbc8a1\', \'multiverseId\': 483616}, \'multiverseid\': 483616}, {\'name\': \'Wydwen, la Brezza Sferzante\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\n{U}{B}, Paga 1 punto vita: Fai tornare Wydwen, la Brezza Sferzante in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': "In un mondo di cieli limpidi e senza nuvole, lei è la nera tempesta all\'orizzonte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f08796-a7c6-4e45-b0b2-a719727461ad\', \'multiverseId\': 483867}, \'multiverseid\': 483867}, {\'name\': \'噛み付く突風、ウィドウェン\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n{U}{B}, １点のライフを支払う：噛み付く突風、ウィドウェンをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'光り輝き、雲ひとつ無い空のある世界では、彼女は地平線の暗い嵐だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21276f7-c25d-47b6-ad72-0886d77fc21f\', \'multiverseId\': 484118}, \'multiverseid\': 484118}, {\'name\': \'Wydwen, a Ventania Mordaz\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\n{U}{B}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Devolva Wydwen, a Ventania Mordaz, para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fada Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Em um mundo de céus brilhantes e límpidos, ela é a tempestade negra no horizonte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2dd0b4-6ff0-4cbd-8977-6c8bf752071a\', \'multiverseId\': 484369}, \'multiverseid\': 484369}, {\'name\': \'Уидвен, Штормовая Буря\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\n{U}{B}, заплатите 1 жизнь: верните Уидвен, Штормовую Бурю, в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Фея Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'В мире яркого безоблачного неба она — темная буря на горизонте.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06943821-2bb5-44b4-bea2-b9009d72c57b\', \'multiverseId\': 484620}, \'multiverseid\': 484620}]', "[{'name': 'Wüste der Achtsamen', 'text': 'Die Wüste der Achtsamen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {1}{U} ({1}{U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483146&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37cc553f-ecae-4853-b913-86d7a421b46e', 'multiverseId': 483146}, 'multiverseid': 483146}, {'name': 'Desierto del Conocedor', 'text': 'El Desierto del Conocedor entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {1}{U}. ({1}{U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483397&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a24c214f-f779-4a0c-b090-0b8e59e49bcd', 'multiverseId': 483397}, 'multiverseid': 483397}, {'name': 'Désert du Clairvoyant', 'text': 'Le Désert du Clairvoyant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {1}{U} ({1}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483648&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c2d1b9ba-4540-403d-ae03-194f203e0ad5', 'multiverseId': 483648}, 'multiverseid': 483648}, {'name': 'Deserto del Ponderante', 'text': 'Il Deserto del Ponderante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483899&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f18e5ecf-4285-4695-8afc-b9415dfe2f4c', 'multiverseId': 483899}, 'multiverseid': 483899}, {'name': '周到の砂漠', 'text': '周到の砂漠はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{1}{U}（{1}{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484150&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '711b33a8-fcb2-47b4-ac02-d88de03f3aae', 'multiverseId': 484150}, 'multiverseid': 484150}, {'name': 'Deserto do Consciente', 'text': 'Deserto do Consciente entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {1}{U} ({1}{U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484401&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a88f4dd9-d28c-455d-b905-9fd38ea9f1ef', 'multiverseId': 484401}, 'multiverseid': 484401}, {'name': 'Пустыня Всеведущего', 'text': 'Пустыня Всеведущего выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\nЦикл {1}{U} ({1}{U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля — Пустыня', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484652&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd168bd94-e5a2-470e-99f6-da183d4cb74f', 'multiverseId': 484652}, 'multiverseid': 484652}]", "[{'name': 'Wüste der Getreuen', 'text': 'Die Wüste der Getreuen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {1}{W} ({1}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483147&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a27ddca9-9a55-4ac9-aa3e-a68b089dd3c5', 'multiverseId': 483147}, 'multiverseid': 483147}, {'name': 'Desierto de la Leal', 'text': 'El Desierto de la Leal entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {1}{W}. ({1}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483398&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76cffd30-8e10-4337-9eeb-bc544f10d8ed', 'multiverseId': 483398}, 'multiverseid': 483398}, {'name': 'Désert de la Loyale', 'text': 'Le Désert de la Loyale arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {1}{W} ({1}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483649&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '846894fc-83fe-49fd-9e9e-31322b026b39', 'multiverseId': 483649}, 'multiverseid': 483649}, {'name': 'Deserto della Leale', 'text': 'Il Deserto della Leale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483900&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da98a3b4-ba1e-44cc-b4fd-3c44af3765d0', 'multiverseId': 483900}, 'multiverseid': 483900}, {'name': '信義の砂漠', 'text': '信義の砂漠はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{1}{W}（{1}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484151&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b84c561f-beae-459d-98f5-d546e6b353f0', 'multiverseId': 484151}, 'multiverseid': 484151}, {'name': 'Deserto da Verdadeira', 'text': 'Deserto da Verdadeira entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {1}{W} ({1}{W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484402&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f87e4031-1c79-41dd-a35c-56497214332e', 'multiverseId': 484402}, 'multiverseid': 484402}, {'name': 'Пустыня Верной', 'text': 'Пустыня Верной выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\nЦикл {1}{W} ({1}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля — Пустыня', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484653&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '440330e1-355e-481a-94aa-0efa3ea0d0ea', 'multiverseId': 484653}, 'multiverseid': 484653}]", "[{'name': 'Wüste der Inbrünstigen', 'text': 'Die Wüste der Inbrünstigen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\nUmwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483145&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5fb26b8-2ad0-4d0d-aee0-2b1eba81793e', 'multiverseId': 483145}, 'multiverseid': 483145}, {'name': 'Desierto de la Ferviente', 'text': 'El Desierto de la Ferviente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\nCiclo {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483396&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d561dbe-fd0c-46b7-8de1-3c4e9d1c704a', 'multiverseId': 483396}, 'multiverseid': 483396}, {'name': 'Désert de la Fervente', 'text': 'Le Désert de la Fervente arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\nRecyclage {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain : désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483647&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f5561d1-8efa-4a7a-bfe7-b1608cdb2219', 'multiverseId': 483647}, 'multiverseid': 483647}, {'name': 'Deserto della Fervente', 'text': 'Il Deserto della Fervente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\nCiclo {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483898&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be44edd3-df1b-4ce1-94f8-f28aa678be00', 'multiverseId': 483898}, 'multiverseid': 483898}, {'name': '熱烈の砂漠', 'text': '熱烈の砂漠はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\nサイクリング{1}{R}（{1}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484149&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df5edbd9-cf35-450d-8a2a-fe1cd1ace3f7', 'multiverseId': 484149}, 'multiverseid': 484149}, {'name': 'Deserto da Fervorosa', 'text': 'Deserto da Fervorosa entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\nReciclar {1}{R} ({1}{R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno — Deserto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484400&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d4a9f40-670b-4c21-a982-1c6d87424a2e', 'multiverseId': 484400}, 'multiverseid': 484400}, {'name': 'Пустыня Пылкой', 'text': 'Пустыня Пылкой выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\nЦикл {1}{R} ({1}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля — Пустыня', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484651&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc196229-a6c9-45e2-94e2-2260c833f018', 'multiverseId': 484651}, 'multiverseid': 484651}]", '[{\'name\': \'Xathrid-Nekromant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Xathrid-Nekromant oder eine andere Mensch-Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Befehle sollen auf ewig in ihren staubigen Schädeln widerhallen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb7aa3a-22e5-42b0-a666-396b120fd3b8\', \'multiverseId\': 483020}, \'multiverseid\': 483020}, {\'name\': \'Nigromante de Xathrid\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Nigromante de Xathrid u otra criatura Humano que controles muera, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis órdenes resonarán eternamente en sus polvorientas calaveras".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d4d73a-53a3-44af-925f-54edb817bdc1\', \'multiverseId\': 483271}, \'multiverseid\': 483271}, {\'name\': \'Nécromancien de Xathrid\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Nécromancien de Xathrid ou une autre créature Humain que vous contrôlez meurt, créez, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Mes ordres résonneront à jamais dans leurs crânes poussiéreux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75aa476c-a74d-43f7-8866-496495f66cf6\', \'multiverseId\': 483522}, \'multiverseid\': 483522}, {\'name\': \'Necromante di Xathrid\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Necromante di Xathrid o un\'altra creatura Umano che controlli muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I miei comandi riecheggeranno per sempre nei loro crani polverosi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b109e8a8-73ee-4e60-833b-073199c8ef0a\', \'multiverseId\': 483773}, \'multiverseid\': 483773}, {\'name\': \'ザスリッドの屍術師\', \'text\': \'ザスリッドの屍術師や、他の、あなたがコントロールしている人間・クリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体、タップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私の命令は、あやつらの煤けた頭蓋の中で永遠にこだまするだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2d812a-2aba-4130-a831-4290b98f6303\', \'multiverseId\': 484024}, \'multiverseid\': 484024}, {\'name\': \'Necromante de Xathrid\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Necromante de Xathrid ou outra criatura do tipo Humano que você controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi virada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Minhas ordens ecoam para sempre em seus crânios cheios de pó."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b4a80c7-822f-4251-930e-b79233339b47\', \'multiverseId\': 484275}, \'multiverseid\': 484275}, {\'name\': \'Некромант Затрида\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Некромант Затрида или другое существо-Человек под вашим контролем умирает, создайте одну повернутую фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Отголоски моих приказов будут вечно раздаваться в их истлевших черепах».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d9f920-7d01-4d6a-8724-8a5858aca9ba\', \'multiverseId\': 484526}, \'multiverseid\': 484526}]', '[{\'name\': \'Xyris, der schlängelnde Sturm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte zieht, außer der ersten, die er in seinem Ziehsegment zieht, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Ophis-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn Xyris, der schlängelnde Sturm, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehen der Spieler und du jeweils entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ophis, Leviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484745&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb9a4bb0-b3e7-40f7-ad1c-d5d29e5aa23b\', \'multiverseId\': 484745}, \'multiverseid\': 484745}, {\'name\': \'Xyris, la Tormenta Serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un oponente robe una carta excepto la primera que roba en cada uno de sus pasos de robar, crea una ficha de criatura Víbora verde 1/1.\\nSiempre que Xyris, la Tormenta Serpenteante haga daño de combate a un jugador, tú y ese jugador roban esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Leviatán víbora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef45814-5792-4e74-88b0-97e8c5bf3c94\', \'multiverseId\': 484765}, \'multiverseid\': 484765}, {\'name\': \'Xyris, la tempête sinuante\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire pioche une carte, excepté la première qu\'il pioche pendant chacune de ses étapes de pioche, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Serpent.\\nÀ chaque fois que Xyris, la tempête sinuante inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur et vous piochez chacun autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : serpent et léviathan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484785&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34f5bfa-1f5a-42ac-a1b5-a53ffe0421ba\', \'multiverseId\': 484785}, \'multiverseid\': 484785}, {\'name\': \'Xyris, la Tempesta Serpeggiante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario pesca una carta, tranne la prima che pesca in ognuna delle sue sottofasi di acquisizione, crea una pedina creatura Serpente 1/1 verde.\\nOgniqualvolta Xyris, la Tempesta Serpeggiante infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, tu e quel giocatore pescate altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Leviatano Serpente\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60ea6cad-72dd-4fe5-97ba-127153472142\', \'multiverseId\': 484805}, \'multiverseid\': 484805}, {\'name\': \'のたうつ嵐、ザイリス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n対戦相手が自分の各ドロー・ステップ内で初めて引くカード以外のカードを１枚引くたび、あなたは緑の１/１の蛇・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\nのたうつ嵐、ザイリスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたとそのプレイヤーはそれぞれその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 蛇・リバイアサン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93332bbe-bb8d-42a3-aafc-ab05d15b07a9\', \'multiverseId\': 484825}, \'multiverseid\': 484825}, {\'name\': \'Xyris, a Tempestade Serpenteante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um oponente comprar um card que não seja o primeiro da própria etapa de compra, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Cobra.\\nToda vez que Xyris, a Tempestade Serpenteante, causa dano de combate a um jogador, você e aquele jogador compram cada um aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Cobra Leviatã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d64576b3-23b6-4920-b7fa-0b44e5e7d6bc\', \'multiverseId\': 484845}, \'multiverseid\': 484845}, {\'name\': \'Зирис, Извивающийся Шторм\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент берет карту помимо первой карты, которую он берет в каждом своем шаге взятия карты, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленая Змея.\\nКаждый раз, когда Зирис, Извивающийся Шторм наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы и тот игрок берете по такому же количеству карт.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Змея Левиафан\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d3667a9-4049-48a3-aa02-647bf3ea86e4\', \'multiverseId\': 484865}, \'multiverseid\': 484865}]', '[{\'name\': \'Yannik, plündernder Wächter\', \'text\': \'Partner von Nikara der Höhlenplünderin\\nWachsamkeit\\nWenn Yannik, plündernder Wächter, ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis Yannik das Spiel verlässt. Wenn du dies tust, verteile X +1/+1-Marken auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich der Stärke der ins Exil geschickten Kreatur ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Hyäne, Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31947377-2f1c-43c4-a9a2-20e0f531056a\', \'multiverseId\': 484746}, \'multiverseid\': 484746}, {\'name\': \'Yánnik, centinela saqueadora\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Nikara, saqueadora de guaridas.\\nVigilancia.\\nCuando Yánnik, centinela saqueadora entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura que controlas hasta que Yánnik deje el campo de batalla. Cuando lo hagas, distribuye X contadores +1/+1 entre cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo, donde X es la fuerza de la criatura exiliada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bestia hiena\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08fa04d5-18b5-4c6d-bf40-6d1bae3c58f6\', \'multiverseId\': 484766}, \'multiverseid\': 484766}, {\'name\': \'Yannik, sentinelle nécrophage\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Nikara, charognarde des tanières\\nVigilance\\nQuand Yannik, sentinelle nécrophage arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre créature que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à ce que Yannik quitte le champ de bataille. Quand vous faites ainsi, répartissez X marqueurs +1/+1 entre n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées, X étant la force de la créature exilée.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : hyène et bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484786&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb9fe50e-1f97-499f-a95d-fcb3f929425d\', \'multiverseId\': 484786}, \'multiverseid\': 484786}, {\'name\': \'Yannik, Sentinella Predatrice\', \'text\': "Partner di Nikara, Predona delle Tane\\nCautela\\nQuando Yannik, Sentinella Predatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un\'altra creatura che controlli finché Yannik non lascia il campo di battaglia. Quando lo fai, distribuisci X segnalini +1/+1 tra un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio, dove X è la forza della creatura esiliata.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Bestia Iena\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11ff8a8f-f604-43ab-87c7-daa32c5c21a3\', \'multiverseId\': 484806}, \'multiverseid\': 484806}, {\'name\': \'物あさりの見張り役、ヤーンニック\', \'text\': \'巣穴あさり、ニカーラとの共闘\\n警戒\\n物あさりの見張り役、ヤーンニックが戦場に出たとき、物あさりの見張り役、ヤーンニックが戦場を離れるまで、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を追放する。そうしたとき、望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を望むように割り振って置く。Ｘはその追放されたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ハイエナ・ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e42262a8-687d-4034-9362-5e28872fa0d1\', \'multiverseId\': 484826}, \'multiverseid\': 484826}, {\'name\': \'Yannik, Sentinela Necrófaga\', \'text\': \'Parceira de Nikara, Necrófaga dos Covis\\nVigilância\\nQuando Yannik, Sentinela Necrófaga, entrar no campo de batalha, exile outra criatura que você controla até que Yannik deixe o campo de batalha. Quando fizer isso, distribua X marcadores +1/+1 entre qualquer número de criaturas alvo, sendo X o poder da criatura exilada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Hiena Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db387a36-aae3-4974-8c16-8753ce4077a1\', \'multiverseId\': 484846}, \'multiverseid\': 484846}, {\'name\': \'Янник, Сторожевой Грабитель\', \'text\': \'Партнер с Никарой, Обирающей Гнезда\\nБдительность\\nКогда Янник, Сторожевой Грабитель выходит на поле битвы, изгоните другое существо под вашим контролем до тех пор, пока Янник не покинет поле битвы. Когда вы это делаете, распределите X жетонов +1/+1 среди любого количества целевых существ, где X — значение силы изгнанного существа.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гиена Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49790775-99e2-4798-80d2-65fa40cb14e4\', \'multiverseId\': 484866}, \'multiverseid\': 484866}]', "[{'name': 'Yavimayadryade', 'text': 'Waldtarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler einen Wald kontrolliert.)\\nWenn die Yavimayadryade ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte durchsuchen und sie getappt unter der Kontrolle eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Spiel bringen. Falls du dies tust, mische danach deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dryade', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483076&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'becffa81-2481-4da8-8412-30668c2a8b47', 'multiverseId': 483076}, 'multiverseid': 483076}, {'name': 'Dríada de Yavimaya', 'text': 'Cruza bosques. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle un Bosque.)\\nCuando la Dríada de Yavimaya entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y ponerla en el campo de batalla girada bajo el control del jugador objetivo. Si lo haces, baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dríada', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483327&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4348ce8-6910-410e-aa61-3472a16cfb57', 'multiverseId': 483327}, 'multiverseid': 483327}, {'name': 'Dryade de la Yavimaya', 'text': 'Traversée des forêts (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une forêt.)\\nQuand la Dryade de la Yavimaya arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, sous le contrôle du joueur ciblé. Si vous faites ainsi, mélangez votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : dryade', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483578&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80897486-1039-460c-9f37-dba8de5c6054', 'multiverseId': 483578}, 'multiverseid': 483578}, {'name': 'Driade di Yavimaya', 'text': 'Passa-Foreste (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla una Foresta.)\\nQuando la Driade di Yavimaya entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta e metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata sotto il controllo di un giocatore bersaglio. Se lo fai, rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Driade', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483829&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef3bb0a9-3b6f-4f6a-8651-6d28bc2bf666', 'multiverseId': 483829}, 'multiverseid': 483829}, {'name': 'ヤヴィマヤのドライアド', 'text': '森渡り（このクリーチャーは防御プレイヤーが森をコントロールしているかぎりブロックされない。）\\nヤヴィマヤのドライアドが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは、「あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、そのプレイヤーのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に出す。」を選んでもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ドライアド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484080&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '466ca2ba-2c05-4768-a10e-fc793a6cd6a1', 'multiverseId': 484080}, 'multiverseid': 484080}, {'name': 'Dríade de Yavimaya', 'text': 'Travessia de floresta (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Floresta.)\\nQuando Dríade de Yavimaya entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de Floresta em seu grimório e colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado sob o controle do jogador alvo. Se fizer isso, embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura — Dríade', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484331&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04b57acc-5239-476f-bbdb-d6ecdd4fdc2b', 'multiverseId': 484331}, 'multiverseid': 484331}, {'name': 'Явимайская Дриада', 'text': 'Знание Лесов (Это существо не может быть заблокировано, пока защищающийся игрок контролирует Лес.)\\nКогда Явимайская Дриада выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Леса и положить ее на поле битвы повернутой под контролем целевого игрока. Если вы это делаете, перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Существо — Дриада', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484582&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da572def-108e-44a4-99f9-2ff53d1f5973', 'multiverseId': 484582}, 'multiverseid': 484582}]", "[{'name': 'Yavimayaküste', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}. Die Yavimayaküste fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483201&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e1aebec-ea6e-49c3-be0a-3d33a720d861', 'multiverseId': 483201}, 'multiverseid': 483201}, {'name': 'Costa de Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}. La Costa de Yavimaya te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483452&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca3e430d-2065-422b-83dd-c53d4ae0e2a6', 'multiverseId': 483452}, 'multiverseid': 483452}, {'name': 'Côte de la Yavimaya', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}. La Côte de la Yavimaya vous inflige 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483703&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d65cc5a-3fd1-4f7f-9b62-edf7b7774387', 'multiverseId': 483703}, 'multiverseid': 483703}, {'name': 'Costa di Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}. La Costa di Yavimaya ti infligge 1 danno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483954&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb05552d-0c70-44bf-bb6d-d6c93aa3a8e9', 'multiverseId': 483954}, 'multiverseid': 483954}, {'name': 'ヤヴィマヤの沿岸', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。ヤヴィマヤの沿岸はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484205&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ca944cb-5f86-45a6-b45c-80fd18a03674', 'multiverseId': 484205}, 'multiverseid': 484205}, {'name': 'Costa de Yavimaya', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}. Costa de Yavimaya causa 1 ponto de dano a você.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484456&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '774df4a8-cb27-4366-84be-b51349b2309a', 'multiverseId': 484456}, 'multiverseid': 484456}, {'name': 'Явимайское Побережье', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}. Явимайское Побережье наносит вам 1 повреждение.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484707&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2184832-67c3-4225-9b92-b9d930811f7b', 'multiverseId': 484707}, 'multiverseid': 484707}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zauberbrand-Phoenix\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Zauberbrand-Phoenix ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexerei-Karte deiner Wahl mit einer Umwandlung-Fähigkeit aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\\nZu Beginn jedes Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten umgewandelt hast, bringe den Zauberbrand-Phoenix aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Phoenix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2888852d-8d1c-408b-9cb1-e37ad7a98309\', \'multiverseId\': 484954}, \'multiverseid\': 484954}, {\'name\': \'Fénix pirohechizo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Fénix pirohechizo entre al campo de batalla, puedes regresar la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo con una habilidad de ciclo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nAl comienzo de cada paso final, si activaste la habilidad de ciclo de dos o más cartas este turno, regresa el Fénix pirohechizo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb55ffa8-ed54-47bc-9a75-862f09c9bb60\', \'multiverseId\': 485005}, \'multiverseid\': 485005}, {\'name\': \'Phénix sortfeu\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Phénix sortfeu arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez renvoyer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une capacité de recyclage ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nAu début de chaque étape de fin, si vous avez recyclé au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci, renvoyez le Phénix sortfeu depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature : phénix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67952f7e-c38a-4af2-aba8-b49380663bca\', \'multiverseId\': 485056}, \'multiverseid\': 485056}, {\'name\': \'Fenice della Pira Magica\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando la Fenice della Pira Magica entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi riprendere in mano una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio con un\'abilità ciclo dal tuo cimitero.\\nAll\'inizio di ogni sottofase finale, se hai ciclato due o più carte in questo turno, riprendi in mano la Fenice della Pira Magica dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Fenice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74eb5bda-e5f6-4d3e-9c24-8cb91f535310\', \'multiverseId\': 485107}, \'multiverseid\': 485107}, {\'name\': \'呪文焚きのフェニックス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n呪文焚きのフェニックスが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地からサイクリング能力を持ちインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\n各終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがカードを２枚以上サイクリングしていた場合、あなたの墓地から呪文焚きのフェニックスをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェニックス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89ff5fcf-727d-4b17-a13e-528d50cc0502\', \'multiverseId\': 485158}, \'multiverseid\': 485158}, {\'name\': \'Fênix da Pira Mágica\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Fênix da Pira Mágica entra no campo de batalha, você pode devolver o card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço alvo com uma habilidade de reciclar de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nNo início de cada etapa final, se você reciclou dois ou mais cards neste turno, devolva Fênix da Pira Mágica de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fênix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79cc7616-e372-4b1e-8da9-fe8516646839\', \'multiverseId\': 485209}, \'multiverseid\': 485209}, {\'name\': \'Феникс Колдовского Огня\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Феникс Колдовского Огня выходит на поле битвы, вы можете вернуть целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства со способностью Цикла из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nВ начале каждого заключительного шага, если вы совершили Цикл двух или более карт в этом ходу, верните Феникса Колдовского Огня из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Феникс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5eeb90c-c1c7-471c-9915-05e23321d7e9\', \'multiverseId\': 485260}, \'multiverseid\': 485260}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberbrechende Teufel\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments bringst du eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhalten die Zauberbrechenden Teufel +4/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe806b28-5b75-4444-aa22-237ee5ca6fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 483026}, \'multiverseid\': 483026}, {\'name\': \'Diablos rompeamuletos\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro al azar de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, los Diablos rompeamuletos obtienen +4/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c072dc8f-2e46-4cb3-98fa-9361a534ad87\', \'multiverseId\': 483277}, \'multiverseid\': 483277}, {\'name\': \'Diables brisecharme\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, renvoyez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel choisie au hasard depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, les Diables brisecharme gagnent +4/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483528&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13395644-4cbd-49d0-b40c-63ff9965bbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 483528}, \'multiverseid\': 483528}, {\'name\': \'Diavoli Spezzamagie\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, riprendi in mano una carta istantaneo o stregoneria a caso dal tuo cimitero.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, i Diavoli Spezzamagie prendono +4/+0 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7011de7c-9044-42f8-86cc-2947ddc7a03c\', \'multiverseId\': 483779}, \'multiverseid\': 483779}, {\'name\': \'護符破りの小悪魔\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選んであなたの手札に戻す。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、護符破りの小悪魔は＋４/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94507626-d38d-4ddf-8a0e-3bd8548345c4\', \'multiverseId\': 484030}, \'multiverseid\': 484030}, {\'name\': \'Diabos Quebradores de Encanto\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, devolva um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço aleatório de seu cemitério para sua mão.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou feitiço, Diabos Quebradores de Encanto recebe +4/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f566d3-d26b-4e54-a8e9-a01a4ccc1c57\', \'multiverseId\': 484281}, \'multiverseid\': 484281}, {\'name\': \'Дьяволы, Разрушители Заклятий\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки верните случайно выбранную карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, Дьяволы, Разрушители Заклятий получают +4/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d5fecd9-ae26-4c19-92a4-419749ab8d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 484532}, \'multiverseid\': 484532}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberverdopplerin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Zauberverdopplerin ins Spiel kommt, kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Meiner Erfahrung nach kommt ein Unglück selten allein."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483029&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebbe97d-7c22-4e97-b56f-4a5f930b7bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 483029}, \'multiverseid\': 483029}, {\'name\': \'Maga del lanzamiento doble\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Maga del lanzamiento doble entre al campo de batalla, copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Según mi experiencia, las desgracias siempre llegan por parejas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'094dea5a-b47e-41e2-8c51-9fbf9cee9f89\', \'multiverseId\': 483280}, \'multiverseid\': 483280}, {\'name\': \'Mage ambisort\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand le Mage ambisort arrive sur le champ de bataille, copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« L\'expérience m\'a appris que les désastres viennent toujours par deux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483531&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979f3926-93bf-42da-ac76-bb377ce31582\', \'multiverseId\': 483531}, \'multiverseid\': 483531}, {\'name\': \'Maga Duplicatrice\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuando la Maga Duplicatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, copia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Secondo la mia esperienza, i disastri tendono a colpire in coppia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92554459-cdc1-432c-9f3c-5cd9ec878325\', \'multiverseId\': 483782}, \'multiverseid\': 483782}, {\'name\': \'二重詠唱の魔道士\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n二重詠唱の魔道士が戦場に出たとき、インスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とし、それをコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「私のこれまでの経験から分かったことは、災厄は双子として到来することを好むということだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eba75037-4612-471e-80a8-658047642bcf\', \'multiverseId\': 484033}, \'multiverseid\': 484033}, {\'name\': \'Mago da Conjuração Dupla\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Mago da Conjuração Dupla entrar no campo de batalha, copie a mágica instantânea ou o feitiço alvo. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"De acordo com a minha experiência, os desastres gostam de vir aos pares."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bab28dbd-1343-47f2-b751-c9aba2b1ee7b\', \'multiverseId\': 484284}, \'multiverseid\': 484284}, {\'name\': \'Маг Двузаклинаний\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Маг Двузаклинаний выходит на поле битвы, скопируйте целевое мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Мой опыт говорит о том, что катастрофы обычно приходят парами».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d309794-a55a-4f36-8356-1b6c1fed349a\', \'multiverseId\': 484535}, \'multiverseid\': 484535}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zaxara, mahnendes Exemplar\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\n{T}: Erzeuge zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch mit {X} in seinen Manakosten wirkst, erzeuge einen 0/0 grünen Hydra-Kreaturenspielstein und lege dann X +1/+1-Marken auf ihn.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Nachtmahr, Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ce585f1-2af0-48a9-9054-b9101160e359\', \'multiverseId\': 484747}, \'multiverseid\': 484747}, {\'name\': \'Zaxara, Ente Ejemplar\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\n{T}: Agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo con {X} en su coste de maná, crea una ficha de criatura Hidra verde 0/0, luego pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hidra pesadilla\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7949d5-2030-4f04-ab4f-9dee66aa3bf8\', \'multiverseId\': 484767}, \'multiverseid\': 484767}, {\'name\': "Zaxara, l\'Exemplaire", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\n{T} : Ajoutez deux manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort avec {X} dans son coût de mana, créez un jeton de créature 0/0 verte Hydre, puis mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : cauchemar et hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484787&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06ec187-522d-4fb6-840e-85b324bd64d3\', \'multiverseId\': 484787}, \'multiverseid\': 484787}, {\'name\': "Zaxara, l\'Esemplare", \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\n{T}: Aggiungi due mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia con {X} nel suo costo di mana, crea una pedina creatura Idra 0/0 verde, poi metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Idra Incubo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c062814a-10c6-4df4-9f62-35425f199979\', \'multiverseId\': 484807}, \'multiverseid\': 484807}, {\'name\': \'警告となるもの、ザクサラ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。\\nあなたがマナ・コストに{X}を含む呪文を唱えるたび、緑の０/０のハイドラ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成し、その後それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ナイトメア・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7634beaa-9004-4df5-b82a-d5b08bfc0b53\', \'multiverseId\': 484827}, \'multiverseid\': 484827}, {\'name\': \'Zaxara, a Exemplar\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\n{T}: Adicione dois manas de uma cor à sua escolha.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica com {X} no custo de mana, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 0/0 do tipo Hidra, depois coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Pesadelo Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9480f4b0-dd59-4081-9df2-825367ba5b98\', \'multiverseId\': 484847}, \'multiverseid\': 484847}, {\'name\': \'Заксара, Образцовая\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\n{T}: добавьте две маны любого одного цвета.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, в мана-стоимости которого есть {X}, создайте одну фишку существа 0/0 зеленая Гидра, затем положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Кошмар Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b80ccd1-ed66-4c28-839e-c71cb9d8d520\', \'multiverseId\': 484867}, \'multiverseid\': 484867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zerlegende Welle\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre für jeden Gegner bis zu ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\\nUmwandlung {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du die Zerlegende Welle umwandelst, zerstöre alle Artefakte und Verzauberungen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc960f5-5959-4ee0-bfb4-066115426a66\', \'multiverseId\': 484923}, \'multiverseid\': 484923}, {\'name\': \'Ola de desmantelamiento\', \'text\': \'Por cada oponente, destruye hasta un artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\nCiclo {6}{W}{W}. ({6}{W}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo de la Ola de desmantelamiento, destruye todos los artefactos y encantamientos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d4212f-c636-4117-9a20-82703d4ea9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 484974}, \'multiverseid\': 484974}, {\'name\': \'Vague désactivatrice\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, détruisez jusqu\'à un artefact ou un enchantement ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.\\nRecyclage {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez la Vague désactivatrice, détruisez tous les artefacts et tous les enchantements.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485025&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a9b460b-1933-40c5-9b1a-dae558bd2ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 485025}, \'multiverseid\': 485025}, {\'name\': \'Onda Demolitrice\', \'text\': "Per ogni avversario, distruggi fino a un artefatto o incantesimo bersaglio controllati da quel giocatore.\\nCiclo {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli l\'Onda Demolitrice, distruggi tutti gli artefatti e gli incantesimi.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98b334e-7a53-4547-8080-dc38b8629da2\', \'multiverseId\': 485076}, \'multiverseid\': 485076}, {\'name\': \'解体の波\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手につき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしている、アーティファクトかエンチャント、最大１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\\nサイクリング{6}{W}{W}（{6}{W}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが解体の波をサイクリングしたとき、アーティファクトとエンチャントをすべて破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa762486-a08a-4126-a0ae-e70c14eac045\', \'multiverseId\': 485127}, \'multiverseid\': 485127}, {\'name\': \'Onda Desmanteladora\', \'text\': \'Para cada oponente, destrua até um artefato ou encantamento alvo que aquele jogador controla.\\nReciclar {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando reciclar Onda Desmanteladora, destrua todos os artefatos e encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1911d085-c906-461b-bccb-2dffb2667e90\', \'multiverseId\': 485178}, \'multiverseid\': 485178}, {\'name\': \'Разбирающая Волна\', \'text\': \'За каждого оппонента уничтожьте не более одного целевого артефакта или чар под контролем того игрока.\\nЦикл {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Разбирающей Волны, уничтожьте все артефакты и чары.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c750df3-c5cc-4d03-a292-c185874aad67\', \'multiverseId\': 485229}, \'multiverseid\': 485229}]', "[{'name': 'Zetalpa die Ursonne', 'text': 'Fliegend, Doppelschlag, Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden, Unzerstörbar', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier', 'flavor': 'Der Himmel weicht und die Erde erbebt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63fbc21e-1cf5-4513-a014-0a5ffaa38840', 'multiverseId': 482986}, 'multiverseid': 482986}, {'name': 'Zetalpa, la Aurora Primigenia', 'text': 'Vuela, daña dos veces, vigilancia, arrolla, indestructible.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio anciano', 'flavor': 'El cielo se eleva y la tierra tiembla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483237&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5467138-f3d6-4114-b358-2dd46daa3494', 'multiverseId': 483237}, 'multiverseid': 483237}, {'name': 'Zetalpa, Aube primordiale', 'text': 'Vol, double initiative, vigilance, piétinement, indestructible', 'type': 'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dinosaure', 'flavor': 'Le ciel prend son envol et la terre frémit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483488&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7b9edfc-bf88-4f40-a419-bf208824c561', 'multiverseId': 483488}, 'multiverseid': 483488}, {'name': 'Zetalpa, Alba Primordiale', 'text': 'Volare, doppio attacco, cautela, travolgere, indistruttibile', 'type': 'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Dinosauro', 'flavor': 'Il cielo si alza in volo e la terra trema.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483739&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0187ddc0-bfb6-4648-803d-8234b401af26', 'multiverseId': 483739}, 'multiverseid': 483739}, {'name': '原初の夜明け、ゼタルパ', 'text': '飛行、二段攻撃、警戒、トランプル、破壊不能', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜', 'flavor': '空が逃げ出し大地が震える。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483990&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50933100-59d2-461c-865e-c052f589b85c', 'multiverseId': 483990}, 'multiverseid': 483990}, {'name': 'Zetalpa, Aurora Primordial', 'text': 'Voar, golpe duplo, vigilância, atropelar, indestrutível', 'type': 'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro Ancião', 'flavor': 'O céu alça voo e a terra treme.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484241&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3530ec9-b5de-48e2-8a06-b36c38297453', 'multiverseId': 484241}, 'multiverseid': 484241}, {'name': 'Сетальпа, Первозданная Заря', 'text': 'Полет, Двойной удар, Бдительность, Пробивной удар, Неразрушимость', 'type': 'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Динозавр', 'flavor': 'Небо поднимается на крыло, и земля трепещет.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484492&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5b6abea-4cd0-4f67-a8dd-96705d06590e', 'multiverseId': 484492}, 'multiverseid': 484492}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zugriff des Kodamas\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel und nimm die andere auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei — Arkan\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Land wächst nur dort, wo die Kami es lassen."\\n—Dosan, das fallende Blatt\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483059&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c202e36-e884-47c1-a470-2e232500d6e4\', \'multiverseId\': 483059}, \'multiverseid\': 483059}, {\'name\': \'Alcance del kodama\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro — Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra crece solo donde los kami así lo desean".\\n—Dosan la hoja cayendo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1523ad-59bb-4d7b-9229-7343481bc64c\', \'multiverseId\': 483310}, \'multiverseid\': 483310}, {\'name\': \'Portée du kodama\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes et mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée, et l\'autre dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel : arcane\', \'flavor\': \'« La terre se plie uniquement à la volonté des kami. »\\n—Dosan la feuille tombante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483561&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52fe8307-7bf4-4b20-acf6-791500dce5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 483561}, \'multiverseid\': 483561}, {\'name\': \'Confini del Kodama\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria — Arcano\', \'flavor\': \'"La terra cresce solo dove i kami lo vogliono."\\n—Dosan la Foglia Che Cade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'123a5c9b-c9f3-4c1c-b2c6-63b3c852f2ea\', \'multiverseId\': 483812}, \'multiverseid\': 483812}, {\'name\': \'木霊の手の内\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、そのうち１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出し、他をあなたの手札に加える。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー — 秘儀\', \'flavor\': \'「地の育つは、神の望む所のみ。」\\n――落葉の道三\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469291dc-1c55-4269-987e-a98b7fe0b269\', \'multiverseId\': 484063}, \'multiverseid\': 484063}, {\'name\': \'Alcance do Kodama\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço — Arcana\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra só cresce onde os kamis desejarem."\\n— Dosan, a Folha que Cai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83670484-066a-44c6-b854-654e24aa2500\', \'multiverseId\': 484314}, \'multiverseid\': 484314}, {\'name\': \'Хватка Кодамы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, покажите те карты и положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а другую — в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство — Тайные_знания\', \'flavor\': \'«Земля приносит плоды лишь там, где желают этого ками».\\n— Досан, Упавший Лист\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'923b97a6-34d2-4738-8699-92404b983bd2\', \'multiverseId\': 484565}, \'multiverseid\': 484565}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zulaport-Mordgeselle\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Zulaport-Mordgeselle oder eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt, und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber, Verbündeter\', \'flavor\': \'„Eldrazi? Ha! Versuch mal, nachts mit vollen Taschen durch Zulaport zu laufen. *Das* ist gefährlich!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9718ac-2e0e-48a6-aeaa-e82cfd49d2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 483021}, \'multiverseid\': 483021}, {\'name\': \'Degollador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Degollador de Zulaport u otra criatura que controlas muera, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Eldrazi? ¡Ja! Prueba a caminar por Zulaport de noche con los bolsillos llenos. Eso *sí* es peligroso".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a040177-2619-4d86-acc6-2fa2b69a5763\', \'multiverseId\': 483272}, \'multiverseid\': 483272}, {\'name\': \'Surineur de Zulaport\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Surineur de Zulaport ou qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin et allié\', \'flavor\': "« Les Eldrazi ? Quelle blague ! Essayez donc de traverser Zulaport de nuit avec les poches pleines. *Ça* c\'est dangereux. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c9b3e2-798e-4dad-a92e-9b9df8611a80\', \'multiverseId\': 483523}, \'multiverseid\': 483523}, {\'name\': \'Tagliagole di Zulaport\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Tagliagole di Zulaport o un\'altra creatura che controlli muoiono, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alleato Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Ah! Prova a camminare di notte per Zulaport con le tasche piene. Ecco, *quello* è pericoloso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa4a5e8-4181-47e9-8bca-1149ee32addd\', \'multiverseId\': 483774}, \'multiverseid\': 483774}, {\'name\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋\', \'text\': \'ズーラポートの殺し屋や、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者・同盟者\', \'flavor\': \'「エルドラージ？どうってことねぇな。ポケット膨らまして夜中のズーラポートを歩いてみな。それが身の危険さ。」**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d100a9-05e4-4734-a92f-a537b13f75e2\', \'multiverseId\': 484025}, \'multiverseid\': 484025}, {\'name\': \'Degolador de Zulaport\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Degolador de Zulaport ou outra criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino Aliado\', \'flavor\': \'"Eldrazi? Que nada! Tente andar por Zulaport à noite com os bolsos cheios. *Isso sim* é perigoso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421ec493-7820-4857-8873-fe6d32dd9553\', \'multiverseId\': 484276}, \'multiverseid\': 484276}, {\'name\': \'Головорез из Зулапорта\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Головорез из Зулапорта или другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга Союзник\', \'flavor\': \'«Эльдрази? Ха! Попробуй прогуляться вечером по Зулапорту с полными карманами. Вот это — *настоящая опасность*».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d9f4df-c463-4b6b-bc02-1732bfc6e414\', \'multiverseId\': 484527}, \'multiverseid\': 484527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zunderwald-Lichtung\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDie Zunderwald-Lichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Gebirge, Wald\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem vulkanischen Kontinent Akoum ragen bizarre Gewächse, Gasschlote und zerklüftete Berggipfel hoch in die Lüfte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483142&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6bd0e3-7b47-4a29-82f0-78d7aacb04e6\', \'multiverseId\': 483142}, \'multiverseid\': 483142}, {\'name\': \'Claro de ceniza\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.)\\nEl Claro de ceniza entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Montaña bosque\', \'flavor\': \'En el continente volcánico de Akoum hay fumarolas con extrañas parcelas de hierba en torno a ellas, y las cumbres escarpadas de las montañas se alzan muy alto en el cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e1e969-faa3-4973-ab21-03c7237366a5\', \'multiverseId\': 483393}, \'multiverseid\': 483393}, {\'name\': \'Clairière de scories\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Clairière de scories arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : montagne et forêt\', \'flavor\': "Sur le continent volcanique d\'Akoum, d\'étranges végétaux s\'amassent autour des fissures de gaz et les pics irréguliers de la montagne se dressent haut dans le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483644&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'867331ea-5989-439a-a778-62779281ee8d\', \'multiverseId\': 483644}, \'multiverseid\': 483644}, {\'name\': \'Radura delle Braci\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Radura delle Braci entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Montagna Foresta\', \'flavor\': "Nel continente vulcanico di Akoum, la bizzarra vegetazione si ammassa attorno agli sfiatatoi di gas, mentre frastagliati picchi montuosi s\'innalzano verso il cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60cfc15-41a9-45df-a4ce-6193cdc2f990\', \'multiverseId\': 483895}, \'multiverseid\': 483895}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの林間地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nあなたが基本土地を２つ以上コントロールしていないかぎり、燃えがらの林間地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 山・森\', \'flavor\': \'火山の大陸アクームでは、噴気孔の周囲に奇妙な植生が見られる。空高くギザギザの山頂もそびえている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04f0e4e-768a-4cd1-a02b-17264ccafa0e\', \'multiverseId\': 484146}, \'multiverseid\': 484146}, {\'name\': \'Clareira das Cinzas\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.)\\nClareira das Cinzas entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Montanha Floresta\', \'flavor\': \'No continente vulcânico de Akoum, fissuras gasosas são circundadas por uma vegetação bizarra, enquanto os picos escarpados das montanhas flutuam nos céus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd08355d-1485-4a19-b840-f536d788ebc7\', \'multiverseId\': 484397}, \'multiverseid\': 484397}, {\'name\': \'Тлеющая Поляна\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.)\\nТлеющая Поляна выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Гора Лес\', \'flavor\': \'На вулканическом континенте Акум причудливые растения окружают газовые гейзеры, а изломанные горные пики поднимаются высоко в небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'681ba6a8-497c-48ca-8bd1-be5da446a4c4\', \'multiverseId\': 484648}, \'multiverseid\': 484648}]', "[{'name': 'Zunehmende Hingabe', 'text': 'Erzeuge fünf 1/1 weiße Mensch-Kreaturenspielsteine. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, erzeuge stattdessen zehn solcher Spielsteine.\\nRückblende {7}{W}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=482970&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36e781e0-f337-4f5c-aedf-2ba755b279c8', 'multiverseId': 482970}, 'multiverseid': 482970}, {'name': 'Aumentar la devoción', 'text': 'Crea cinco fichas de criatura Humano blancas 1/1. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, en vez de eso, crea diez de esas fichas.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{W}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483221&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40400ac9-8100-4674-9485-aa2e71aec9fd', 'multiverseId': 483221}, 'multiverseid': 483221}, {'name': 'Dévotion grandissante', 'text': 'Créez cinq jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Humain. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, créez dix de ces jetons à la place.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483472&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bb7716d-74e0-4c70-835c-413571b1741d', 'multiverseId': 483472}, 'multiverseid': 483472}, {'name': 'Devozione Crescente', 'text': 'Crea cinque pedine creatura Umano 1/1 bianche. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, crea invece dieci di quelle pedine.\\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483723&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5df04a72-238a-4671-b0b8-839ea610698f', 'multiverseId': 483723}, 'multiverseid': 483723}, {'name': '高まる献身', 'text': '白の１/１の人間・クリーチャー・トークンを５体生成する。この呪文が墓地から唱えられていたなら、代わりに、そのトークンを10体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{W}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483974&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '69d0d3bb-3bce-4529-854f-0d991f23ca10', 'multiverseId': 483974}, 'multiverseid': 483974}, {'name': 'Devoção Crescente', 'text': 'Crie cinco fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Humano. Se esta mágica foi conjurada de um cemitério, em vez disso, crie dez dessas fichas.\\nRecapitular {7}{W}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484225&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca8ccebc-371e-46af-ac8e-6c27519fff92', 'multiverseId': 484225}, 'multiverseid': 484225}, {'name': 'Растущая Преданность', 'text': 'Создайте пять фишек существа 1/1 белый Человек. Если это заклинание было разыграно из кладбища, создайте десять таких фишек вместо этого.\\nВоспоминание {7}{W}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484476&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f7725cf-d673-4e5f-9c12-ad31bbe38531', 'multiverseId': 484476}, 'multiverseid': 484476}]", '[{\'name\': \'Zweischneidiges Erbstück\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, kannst du Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst, die mit ihr einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat. Nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722a9478-3801-4dfd-8637-04c12571baa1\', \'multiverseId\': 483121}, \'multiverseid\': 483121}, {\'name\': \'Espada familiar\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, puedes mostrar cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f970933-a3d4-4476-b77e-ca3993fcf4a7\', \'multiverseId\': 483372}, \'multiverseid\': 483372}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'héritage", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, vous pouvez révéler les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature qui partage un type de créature avec elle. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483623&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b9d3e41-d585-482c-b4c0-6cd5b759fe7c\', \'multiverseId\': 483623}, \'multiverseid\': 483623}, {\'name\': \'Cimelio Affilato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, puoi rivelare carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8ae033-914b-4b31-968f-36c59ef23f9b\', \'multiverseId\': 483874}, \'multiverseid\': 483874}, {\'name\': \'先祖伝来の宝刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは「それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ公開する。そのカードをあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a221ef-4075-41a9-8321-97092269a647\', \'multiverseId\': 484125}, \'multiverseid\': 484125}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Herança\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morre, você pode revelar cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70666f6a-f7e3-4ed9-8237-bcd819ee4e86\', \'multiverseId\': 484376}, \'multiverseid\': 484376}, {\'name\': \'Фамильный Клинок\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо умирает, вы можете показывать карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажете карту существа, у которого есть такой же тип существа, как у него. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a220c3c5-9929-4822-9e74-d01013dd7ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 484627}, \'multiverseid\': 484627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwiesprache mit der Lava\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka eroberte vor langer Zeit das Feuergebirge Qadat, indem sie die dortigen Ifrite mit dem Versprechen lockte, den Ruhm des Feuers in der ganzen Welt zu verbreiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8059ac98-73fb-4430-b9cc-1ed57fbf49fa\', \'multiverseId\': 483028}, \'multiverseid\': 483028}, {\'name\': \'En comunión con la lava\', \'text\': \'Exilia las primeras X cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka conquistó hace tiempo Qadat, el Borde Ígneo, y ganó a los efrit para su causa con la promesa de que expandiría la gloria del fuego por el mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b870bd57-8d78-4334-96b2-0029c64e711e\', \'multiverseId\': 483279}, \'multiverseid\': 483279}, {\'name\': \'Communion avec la lave\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Jadis, Atarka conquit Qadat, la Frange ardente, ralliant les éfrits à sa cause en leur promettant de répandre la gloire du feu dans le monde entier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6e20421-16ea-4af9-bd43-1bb3205682c9\', \'multiverseId\': 483530}, \'multiverseid\': 483530}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con la Lava\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Atarka conquistò Qadat, l\'Orlo Infuocato, molto tempo fa, convincendo i suoi efreet con la promessa di diffondere la gloria della fiamma in tutto il mondo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ea9f161-31d1-4473-9af9-20c1f1033b04\', \'multiverseId\': 483781}, \'multiverseid\': 483781}, {\'name\': \'溶岩との融和\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードをＸ枚追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'アタルカは遠い昔に炎の縁カダットをその支配下に置いた。イフリートたちには炎の栄光を全世界に広めると約束し、彼らの心をつかみ取った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cff80873-da2e-408f-af34-f390f5bd608a\', \'multiverseId\': 484032}, \'multiverseid\': 484032}, {\'name\': \'Comungar com a Lava\', \'text\': \'Exile os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar esses cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka conquistou Qadat, o Círculo de Fogo, há muito tempo, convencendo os efrites com a promessa de espalhar sua glória ígnea por todo o mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ba25fb-b60e-42ac-878c-feae2b5c0454\', \'multiverseId\': 484283}, \'multiverseid\': 484283}, {\'name\': \'Причащение Лавой\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть те карты до конца вашего следующего хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Атарка уже давно захватила Кадат, Огненный Разлом. Она пообещала его ифритам распространить славу огня по всему миру.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae3f97c-595f-4b24-88c3-24cea5272d32\', \'multiverseId\': 484534}, \'multiverseid\': 484534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ältester des Sakura-Stamms\', \'text\': \'Opfere den Ältesten des Sakura-Stamms: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt keine Grabsteine im Gebiet der Orochi. Gefallene Krieger werden mit einem Baumsetzling begraben, damit sie nach dem Tode ein Teil des Waldes werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483066&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c54939aa-8f16-4364-88c8-04d9a5d59336\', \'multiverseId\': 483066}, \'multiverseid\': 483066}, {\'name\': \'Anciano de la tribu Sakura\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Anciano de la tribu Sakura: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán víbora\', \'flavor\': \'No hay tumbas en el territorio orochi. Los guerreros caídos son enterrados junto con un retoño de árbol, para convertirse en parte del bosque después de la muerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6f7935d-8f49-4afe-a70e-035b26e4f029\', \'multiverseId\': 483317}, \'multiverseid\': 483317}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez l\'Ancêtre de la tribu Sakura : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y avait pas de pierres tombales sur les territoires des orochi. Les guerriers étaient enterrés avec un jeune arbre, pour entrer en communion avec la forêt après leur mort.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fad92e73-5bc6-444f-95f9-d38460f5a5a8\', \'multiverseId\': 483568}, \'multiverseid\': 483568}, {\'name\': \'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Anziano della Tribù-Sakura: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Serpente\', \'flavor\': "Non c\'erano lapidi nei territori orochi. I guerrieri uccisi venivano sepolti insieme al virgulto di un albero, affinché potessero divenire parte della foresta dopo la loro morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'435d1486-a173-4241-8069-776d4b17b0ac\', \'multiverseId\': 483819}, \'multiverseid\': 483819}, {\'name\': \'桜族の長老\', \'text\': \'桜族の長老を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'大蛇の領地には墓石が無い。死んだ戦士は木の苗と共に埋められ、死して後に森の一部となるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98073849-7db5-4357-ad2a-31d2c7b83d12\', \'multiverseId\': 484070}, \'multiverseid\': 484070}, {\'name\': \'Ancião da Tribo Sakura\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Ancião da Tribo Sakura: Procure um card de terreno básico no seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Não havia lápides no território dos orochis. Os guerreiros mortos eram enterrados com brotos de árvores, para que depois da morte se tornassem parte da floresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86161790-1693-47ae-972b-6ad6ba7f057a\', \'multiverseId\': 484321}, \'multiverseid\': 484321}, {\'name\': \'Старейшина Племени Сакуры\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Старейшину Племени Сакуры: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змея Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'На землях орочи не было надгробий. На могиле каждого убитого воина сажали дерево, чтобы после смерти он становился частью леса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea33fb3e-b8ac-445f-a10d-73d4d5b12f3f\', \'multiverseId\': 484572}, \'multiverseid\': 484572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Äonentoller\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Äonentoller ins Spiel kommt und falls du ihn gewirkt hast, erhält ein Gegner deiner Wahl nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug. Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug erhalten du und alle Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, Schutz vor jenem Spieler. (Du und alle Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, können von nichts als Ziel bestimmt werden, Schaden zugefügt bekommen oder verzaubert werden, das der Spieler kontrolliert.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Otter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10997df1-e848-4ae6-a936-03a972aa6cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 484931}, \'multiverseid\': 484931}, {\'name\': \'Juguetona de los eones\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Juguetona de los eones entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste, el oponente objetivo juega un turno adicional después de este. Hasta tu próximo turno, tú y los planeswalkers que controlas ganan protección contra ese jugador. (Tú y los planeswalkers que controlas no pueden ser hechos objetivo, recibir daño o estar encantados por nada controlado por ese jugador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Nutria elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'238a9316-e690-4d7d-abc8-6906d028d132\', \'multiverseId\': 484982}, \'multiverseid\': 484982}, {\'name\': \'Batifoleur des éons\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Batifoleur des éons arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancé, l\'adversaire ciblé joue un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci. Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, vous et les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez acquérez la protection contre ce joueur. (Vous et les planeswalkers que vous contrôlez ne pouvez pas être ciblés, blessés ou enchantés par une source contrôlée par ce joueur.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et loutre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3710cb71-d77e-4d2f-a74f-9ecc53ce6370\', \'multiverseId\': 485033}, \'multiverseid\': 485033}, {\'name\': \'Burlone degli Eoni\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Burlone degli Eoni entra nel campo di battaglia, se l\'hai lanciato, un avversario bersaglio gioca un turno extra dopo questo. Fino al tuo prossimo turno, tu e i planeswalker che controlli avete protezione da quel giocatore. (Tu e i planeswalker che controlli non potete essere bersagliati, non può esservi inflitto danno, né potete essere incantati da nulla che sia controllato da quel giocatore.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Lontra Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e4e39b-8821-4d52-bbea-08f554d72d6f\', \'multiverseId\': 485084}, \'multiverseid\': 485084}, {\'name\': \'永劫にはしゃぐもの\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n永劫にはしゃぐものが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、このターンに続いて追加の１ターンを行う。あなたの次のターンまで、あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーは、プロテクション（そのプレイヤー）を得る。（あなたやあなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーは、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているものによっては、対象にならず、ダメージを受けず、エンチャントされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・カワウソ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f7d8d1-4577-480f-995e-f731074520cb\', \'multiverseId\': 485135}, \'multiverseid\': 485135}, {\'name\': \'Brincalhão dos Éons\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Brincalhão dos Éons entra no campo de batalha, se você o conjurou, o oponente alvo joga um turno extra depois deste. Até seu próximo turno, você e os planeswalkers que você controla ganham proteção contra aquele jogador. (Você e os planeswalkers que você controla não podem ser alvo, sofrer dano, nem ser encantados por nada controlado por aquele jogador.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Lontra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2d5173-80e1-4d8d-bbe2-806d10b287f7\', \'multiverseId\': 485186}, \'multiverseid\': 485186}, {\'name\': \'Баловник Вечности\', \'text\': "Полет\\nКогда Баловник Вечности выходит на поле битвы, если вы разыграли его, то целевой оппонент делает дополнительный ход после этого хода. До вашего следующего хода вы и planeswalker\'ы под вашим контролем получаете Защиту от того игрока. (Объекты под контролем того игрока не могут делать вас и planeswalker\'ов под вашим контролем своей целью, наносить вам повреждения или зачаровывать вас.)", \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Выдра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=485237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b530e3d-bdbc-46c4-85c4-6c9ef4ddefbd\', \'multiverseId\': 485237}, \'multiverseid\': 485237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ätzender Schleim\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Ätzende Schleim ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Es fürchtet keine Klinge und lässt nicht einmal Knochen zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c1571e-7015-4f8d-a823-6f36e8acf779\', \'multiverseId\': 483044}, \'multiverseid\': 483044}, {\'name\': \'Fango ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Fango ácido entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cieno\', \'flavor\': \'No teme al acero y no deja ni huesos a su paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359f8c3c-5666-49ba-bea0-69bd8bb3b6a7\', \'multiverseId\': 483295}, \'multiverseid\': 483295}, {\'name\': \'Boue acide\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand la Boue acide arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez l\'artefact ciblé, l\'enchantement ciblé ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : limon\', \'flavor\': \'Elle ne craint aucune épée et ne laisse aucun corps derrière elle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e0efca5-1c55-454e-9070-f574ea4350c8\', \'multiverseId\': 483546}, \'multiverseid\': 483546}, {\'name\': \'Melma Acida\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando la Melma Acida entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Melma\', \'flavor\': \'Non teme la spada e non lascia traccia alcuna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=483797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'746d4a81-0ef0-4798-86f1-3ea1f2e77f95\', \'multiverseId\': 483797}, \'multiverseid\': 483797}, {\'name\': \'酸のスライム\', \'text\': \'接死\\n酸のスライムが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': \'それは如何なる刃も恐れず、如何なる骨も残さない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c51b4ef-e064-4b04-80e7-5e0e368ffca3\', \'multiverseId\': 484048}, \'multiverseid\': 484048}, {\'name\': \'Limo Ácido\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Limo Ácido entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lodo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não teme nenhuma espada, e não deixa nenhum osso para trás.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0a1073-d36b-49e0-86ff-210e6aa168db\', \'multiverseId\': 484299}, \'multiverseid\': 484299}, {\'name\': \'Кислотная Слизь\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Кислотная Слизь выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой артефакт, чары или землю.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тина\', \'flavor\': \'Она не боится мечей и не оставляет после себя даже косточки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=484550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'467ddb0b-57c8-4db8-b6a3-628f413e951e\', \'multiverseId\': 484550}, \'multiverseid\': 484550}]']
